INSERT INTO `produits` VALUES (379,'peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #06 Plum Update: A cool-tone plum pink',NULL,65.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\\\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:03:14','2025-01-17 06:43:46','2025-02-03 11:03:14',0,NULL),(392,'A.H.C - Natural Perfection Double Shield Sun Stick',NULL,107.000,'Keep skin safe and protected with this sunscreen stick fitted with SPF50+ PA++++ and formulated with the brand&rsquo;s UV IR BLOCK&trade; technology to simultaneously block out UV rays and heat from the sun. It contains various skin care ingredients (including bamboo extract, glacier water and cotton seed extract) to soothe, smooth and hydrate skin. Sun stick glides on smoothly and leaves a comfortable and natural finish. Dermatologically tested formula is safe for sensitive skin. \r\nBenefits:\r\nOffers powerful sun protection against UV rays with its SPF50+ PA++++ broad spectrum.\r\nPatented UV IR BLOCK&trade; effectively blocks out UV rays and near-Infrared Ray (sun heat) at the same time.\r\nPhyto Protect Complex (Opuntia Ficus-Indica Stem Extract, Cotton Seed Extract) helps protect and soothe irritated skin agaist external aggressors with comforts.\r\n5 kinds of natural water including deep sea water, glacier water and carbonated water deliver ample refreshing moisture for dewy skin.\r\nSchizandra Chinensis Fruit Extract and Bambusa Vulgaris Extract help control skin hear and condition skin for healthy express.\r\nDermotologically tested, mild formula infused with naturally derived ingredient, suitable for all family members.','1. Open the cap and turn the dial at bottom to release a small amount of product (5mm).\r\n2. Evenly apply to areas that are vulnerable to UV rays.',NULL,NULL,8,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:03:12','2025-01-17 06:43:46','2025-02-03 11:03:12',0,NULL),(452,'Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner',NULL,111.000,'The ANUA Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner is the top ranking toner in Korea that was awarded 1st place in the 2022 Olive Young awards. With a high 77%\r\nconcentration of Heartleaf Extract, the hottest ingredient in Korea, it helps to calm irritations, alleviate acne, balance natural oil and moisture levels, as well as deeply hydrate with Panthenol. The toner also gently exfoliates dead skin cells of the skin with Sugarcane Extract or a smoother complexion and trengthens the skin barrier with\r\nCentella Asiatica. Perfect for healing overall redness, acne, eczema and rosacea.\r\nThis toner has a non-comedogenic formula perfect for acne-prone and sensitive skin types. However, this vegan and paraben-free toner is suitable for all skin types!','After cleansing, apply a moderate amount over the face and pat lightly for better absorption.',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:03:10','2025-01-17 06:43:47','2025-02-03 11:03:10',0,NULL),(453,'Heartleaf 77% Soothing Sheet Mask',NULL,25.000,'Derived from microfiber material, Heartleaf 77% soothing sheet mask moisturizes and soothes skin with mild ingredients like heartleaf extract.\r\n\r\nIt maximizes skin’s moisture retention and prevents damage from external irritation.\r\n\r\nHeartleaf extract (houttuynia cordata) is a mild ingredient that soothes the skin and helps prevent problems like excessive sebum, inflammation, and aging. Anua only use heartleaf ingredients grown and harvested in Korea.\r\nOur microfiber sheets are light and soft while tightly seal to your face, allowing skin to absorb the product in short amount of time.\r\nWithout any irritating substance, skin feels clarified, skin tone appears even, and feels hydrated regardless of skin type.','After cleansing, place the mask sheet on the face avoiding lip and eye areas and leave on for 15-20 minutes.\r\n\r\nOur microfiber mask is light and soft on the skin, which could be used as daily skincare routine.\r\n\r\nYou may apply the excess product in the face mask bag all over your face and skin.',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:03:07','2025-01-17 06:43:47','2025-02-03 11:03:07',0,NULL),(479,'Anua Peach 70 Niacin Serum',NULL,132.000,'Anua Peach 70 Niacin Serum is a brightening and hydrating serum to even out skin tone and deliver glass skin instantly and over time. Packed with 70% Peach Fruit Extract from Jeju Island and 5% Niacinamide to target dullness and hyperpigmentation, while supporting the skin barrier and reducing the look of enlarged pores. This serum also contains powerful hydrators such as Desert Yeast Oil and Triple Hyaluronic Acid to replenish skin\'s moisture for a softer complexion.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 30ml\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: All skin types','Apply a proper amount onto face and pat gently for further absorption.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:03:06','2025-01-17 06:43:47','2025-02-03 11:03:06',0,NULL),(483,'Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner Mini',NULL,45.000,'Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner is a gentle moisturising toner to soothe, tone, hydrate and balance the pH level of skin. Formulated with 77% Houttuynia Cordata Extract that helps soothe sensitive skin and protect skin from external irritations, while also maintaining skin\'s oil-moisture balance. This lightweight toner is made without any irritating substances, so skin feels clarified, skin tone appears even, and feels hydrated regardless of skin type.\r\n\r\nSkin type: All skin types\r\n\r\nVolume: 40ml','After cleansing, apply a moderate amount over the face and pat lightly for better absorption.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:03:04','2025-01-17 06:43:47','2025-02-03 11:03:04',0,NULL),(545,'Heartleaf 70% Soothing Cream',NULL,123.000,'Heartleaf 70% Soothing Cream is a soothing, gel-cream enriched with 70% Heartleaf Extract to effectively calm sensitive skin. Also featuring triple cica care containing Madecassic Acid, Cica Extract and Asiatic Acid that leaves skin soothed and refreshed. This lightweight cream forms a protective shield against irritants, ensuring a more comfortable and healthier complexion.\r\n\r\nSize: 100ml','Apply a moderate amount of content on the skin and gently tap for better absorption.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:03:01','2025-01-17 06:43:47','2025-02-03 11:03:01',0,NULL),(607,'Heartleaf Succinic Moisture Cleansing Foam',NULL,140.000,'Anua Heartleaf Succinic Moisture Cleansing Foam is a gel-type cleanser that gently removes sebum and dead skin cells to keep skin fresh and clear. Formulated with Heartleaf Extract and Protease to soothe breakouts and gently remove dead skin cells for clearer skin. It also contains BHA and Succinic Acid to unclog pores and regulate sebum production. This pH-balanced formula is boosted with Ceramide NP and Panthenol to keep skin moisturised post-cleanse.\r\n\r\nRecommended for sensitive and acne-prone skin.\r\n\r\nVolume: 150ml','Disseminate an appropriate amount on face after lathering up. Massage the whole face gently and off afterwards.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:02:59','2025-01-17 06:43:47','2025-02-03 11:02:59',0,NULL),(613,'Heartleaf Pore Clay Pack',NULL,105.000,'Anua Heartleaf Pore Clay Pack is a gentle pore-care clay mask formulated with Bentonite and Kaolin to unclog pores and exfoliate skin for a smooth finish. Enriched with Houttuynia Cordata Extract and Quercetin to offer anti-oxidising and anti-inflammatory effects, while reducing redness and restoring skin barrier. Further contains Hyaluronic Acid, Soluble Collagen and Protease to facilitate keratin softening while offering plumping and firming effects. This clay mask has a cream-like texture with a refreshing Eucalyptus scent.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nSize: 100ml','1. After washing your face, apply the content to the entire face except eye and mouth areas.\r\n2. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water after 3-5 minutes.\r\n3. Use 1-2 times a week depending on your skin condition.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:02:57','2025-01-17 06:43:48','2025-02-03 11:02:57',0,NULL),(631,'Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum',NULL,140.000,'The Anua Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum is a Korean skincare product designed to address hyperpigmentation and achieve a brighter, more even skin tone. Here\'s a quick breakdown of its key features:\r\n * Key Ingredients: 10% Niacinamide, 4% Tranexamic Acid, 2% Alpha Arbutin\r\n * Benefits: Targets dark spots and hyperpigmentation, brightens skin tone, lightweight texture\r\n * Skin Types: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin','1. Apply a few drops to affected areas and gradually increase the usage period accordingly.\r\n2. Use in the morning and at night before oil and moisturizer.\r\n3. Can be used daily but discontinue if irritation occurs.\r\n4. When used in the morning, be certain to wear sun protection with SPF30 or higher.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:02:55','2025-01-17 06:43:48','2025-02-03 11:02:55',0,NULL),(634,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream',NULL,94.000,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream is a lightweight organic sunscreen that provides soothing and hydrating benefits. Featuring Houttuynia Cordata Extract to calm your skin and provide care for sensitive skin, while Panthenol locks water inside your skin and helps with calming. Also boasting a sebum-controlling effect, the formula sits well under foundation and prolongs makeup wear.','1. Apply it at the last stage of skincare routine 15 minutes before heading out.\r\n2. Apply an approximate size of a finger twice to three times.\r\n3. The soft and moisturizing texture allows you to apply at any time.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:02:53','2025-01-17 06:43:48','2025-02-03 11:02:53',0,NULL),(636,'Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum',NULL,140.000,'The Anua Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum is a Korean skincare product designed to address hyperpigmentation and achieve a brighter, more even skin tone. Here\'s a quick breakdown of its key features:\r\n * Key Ingredients: 10% Niacinamide, 4% Tranexamic Acid, 2% Alpha Arbutin\r\n * Benefits: Targets dark spots and hyperpigmentation, brightens skin tone, lightweight texture\r\n * Skin Types: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin','1. Apply a few drops to affected areas and gradually increase the usage period accordingly.\r\n2. Use in the morning and at night before oil and moisturizer.\r\n3. Can be used daily but discontinue if irritation occurs.\r\n4. When used in the morning, be certain to wear sun protection with SPF30 or higher.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:02:51','2025-01-17 06:43:48','2025-02-03 11:02:51',0,NULL),(700,'Heartleaf 70 Intense Calming Cream',NULL,130.000,'Restore your skin\'s barrier with potent ingredients like Ceramides and Panthenol. Infused with 70% Heartleaf Extract, known for its soothing and calming effects, this daily facial moisturizer is suitable for all skin types, especially sensitive and dry skin. Its lightweight texture ensures immediate hydration and rapid absorption.','Apply a moderate amount evenly over the face and pat lightly for better absorption.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:02:49','2025-01-17 06:43:48','2025-02-03 11:02:49',0,NULL),(711,'Anua Rice 7 Ceramide Hydrating Barrier Serum',NULL,150.000,'Discover the secret to a luminous, hydrated complexion. Anua\'s Rice and Ceramide Serum is a transformative elixir that replenishes your skin\'s natural moisture barrier while illuminating your complexion. Infused with the power of rice extract, renowned for its brightening and soothing properties, this serum gently exfoliates, revealing a smoother, more even skin tone.\r\nCeramides, the skin\'s essential building blocks, work harmoniously to lock in hydration, preventing moisture loss and restoring suppleness. Experience the difference as your skin becomes visibly plumped, reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.','Apply an appropriate amount on face and neck and gently pat to facilitate absorption.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:02:47','2025-01-17 06:43:48','2025-02-03 11:02:47',0,NULL),(714,'Anua Rice Enzyme Brightening Cleansing Powder',NULL,140.000,'Anua Rice Enzyme Brightening Cleansing Powder is a versatile skincare product designed to illuminate and refine your complexion. This gentle powder transforms into a foaming cleanser or a purifying mask, effectively removing impurities while brightening and evening skin tone. Enriched with rice water, arbutin, and papain, it gently exfoliates, reduces dark spots, and hydrates the skin. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive, this powder helps achieve a radiant and smoother appearance.','* Cleansing Powder: Mix a small amount of powder with water to create a foam. Massage gently onto wet face, then rinse thoroughly.\r\n * Wash-Off Mask: Mix a larger amount of powder with water to create a paste. Apply to face, leave on for 5-10 minutes, then rinse off.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,'2025-02-03 11:02:45','2025-01-17 06:43:48','2025-02-03 11:02:45',0,NULL),(715,'Anua Rice 70 Glow Milky Toner',NULL,159.000,'Anua Rice 70 Glow Milky Toner is a lightweight milky toner enriched with Rice Bran Water and Niacinamide to brighten uneven dull skin tone, while balancing sebum production, promo