ogist tested for skin irritation.\n\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily\n\nVolume : 30 ml',NULL,'produits/6jJ1vMFBosgk34P1JYduFHi3HcGieSGiGmQmlJYK.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',2,'[\"produits/keDGJWEGjkt408PDhQ6vqb3B65B6dZNDYkHwOKjz.jpg\", \"produits/yrHabVem2yFXxEzRvQ33FI42C9qYb1sI6bWqGImx.jpg\", \"produits/lqe9zTtBTRe86G7x52jFHSzoW8FH8dxmhFZpQ9b8.jpg\", \"produits/CqYqzwoTm2tB4tPpfd7Pu27XDmYfsoKWq7pFCnlg.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 11:21:52','2025-02-03 11:21:52',1,NULL),(2374,'KSECRET - SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean','000004',132.000,'Discover the Fountain of Youth for Your Eyes\n\nIntroducing SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean, a revolutionary anti-aging and brightening eye cream that rejuvenates your delicate skin. With a potent blend of Retinal Liposome, Bakuchiol, Vitamins C and E, peptides, and soothing herbal extracts, this luxurious formula targets wrinkles, dark circles, and uneven skin tone, revealing a more youthful, radiant complexion. Experience the transformative power of SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean and unlock the secret to timeless beauty.\n\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily\n\nVolume: 30 ml',NULL,'produits/MZHWfJ45TfDYkcpaO8IPCiCczd7FHPUNvCEBopbx.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',2,'[\"produits/c9ecEqVXWXWAmFAl5yhGMk9oW3iPUOrMIICBUOwA.jpg\", \"produits/dFzQQxD2Drb1H2Xob8PKBz9tEXSZHD1a4dOaJo7I.jpg\", \"produits/rnNs8GrUYsuMcMTloYBX96jO7RptXfvbrlsN1iDw.jpg\", \"produits/WHzmFJxZToi8311f2h7qftqaA0vYeiPgsuIDiZVo.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 11:23:35','2025-02-03 11:23:35',1,NULL),(2375,'KSECRET - SEOUL 1988 Cream : Retinal Liposome 1% + Fermented Rice','000005',132.000,'Unleash the Power of Youthful Skin with Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream\n\nExperience a transformative journey to radiant, youthful skin with Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream, a luxurious anti-aging and brightening cream. Formulated with a potent blend of cutting-edge ingredients, this innovative product targets wrinkles, dark circles, and uneven skin tone, revealing a more vibrant, youthful complexion.\nAt the heart of Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream lies Retinal Liposome, a revolutionary retinol delivery system that penetrates deeply into your skin to stimulate collagen production and reduce the appearance of fine lines. Bakuchiol, a gentle yet effective alternative to retinol, works synergistically with Vitamins C and E to brighten dark circles, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone.\nA trio of peptides further enhances collagen synthesis, resulting in firmer, smoother skin and a reduction in wrinkles. To soothe and calm irritated skin, Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream is infused with five soothing herbal root extracts and Lactobacillus/Panax Ginseng Root Ferment Filtrate, providing antioxidant protection and promoting a healthy, balanced complexion. The smooth, creamy texture of Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream absorbs quickly, providing lasting moisture without stickiness and leaving a silky-smooth finish. With regular use, you\'ll experience a visible improvement in your skin\'s texture, tone, and overall appearance.\n\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily\n\nVolume: 50 ml',NULL,'produits/FtYABrqgfUkilUTV3vZn5BOCGiZOyj806NaMdhRM.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',2,'[\"produits/mCBi84tdactiQCsNIdE80EyBQWJR8s1UPkrsuDxH.jpg\", \"produits/azymZH8hHk0708PmHNEyZSZyptBZJmz2HBwl0YnE.jpg\", \"produits/dZQYzN41l2lm8b1gDQpkWWsSu2dABLa6IWh7kKsG.jpg\", \"produits/p02vGGJSXezBZ9GEDbsswue21RZqw0AqAnVwWnzk.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 11:29:56','2025-02-03 11:29:56',1,NULL),(2376,'SEOUL 1988 Sun : Pine Tree + Ceramide','000006',98.000,'*Benefits:\n- A sunscreen offering SPF 50+ PA++++, enriched with pine tree extract and ceramide, soothes irritated skin and strengthens the skin barrier.\n- Contains pine tree extract, the key ingredient of this product, to reduce redness, itchiness, and inflammation.\n- Formulated with 4 types of UV chemical filters for strong, safe, long-lasting, smooth UV-A and UV-B protection wi