8 types of Hyaluronic Acids for powerful hydration, Ceramide to strengthen the skin barrier and prevent dryness and Pearl Extract to provide skin with natural and youthful glow.\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\n\nVolume : 15g',NULL,'produits/xE9mIkSUbb03tLuOBy9urJabrIUkrCWoSwxmEdsa.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',2,'[\"produits/3Cu5vQidwpQcVIIsovc7ApTUhyUOI4gE6rM96QPI.jpg\", \"produits/NxOmmKWkGXdaMlsPrWLTicPli4m3llTWFJnKQL41.jpg\", \"produits/CGEO1pgbNR1Xs9MZQPyiEcHHu4bSH2NxjcXlrXsN.jpg\", \"produits/f2opC0MlR4DQSZBsOayFg2dn7eess4bEyXp1tGfu.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 11:44:51','2025-02-03 11:44:51',1,NULL),(2381,'Calamine 30 Days Secret Toner','000011',107.000,'Total solution for Oily & Combination Skin\n# Tightening enlarged PORES\n# Removing BLACKHEAD\n# Calming reoccurring ACNE\n# Brighten up your DULL SKIN\n\nCalamine Secret Toner which contains real Calamine powder 30,000ppm is effective for tightening enlarged pores, removing blackheads and calming acne. Especially for oily skin type, this toner makes your skin matte and clean.\n\nHave you worried about enlarged pores, reoccurring acne, excess sebum, cakey makeup, and dead skin cells? And strong chemical ingredients aggravate your sensitive skin?\n✔ Calamine 30 days Secret the toner will be suitable for you.\n\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive\n\nVolume : 160 ml',NULL,'produits/o70nd3qqnDTLKyIfmLwj4ze4R0CXCD7Qr0wuDHLD.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',2,'[\"produits/T6ujzjNYgxoci4PJg16F8VhU6a7FQXeqTZhBOCtm.jpg\", \"produits/WwPQ8mlgx5tlwyHX9fwiuKyT1JmkPuYTbLun6kw9.jpg\", \"produits/U7uMCoiENt1rRRhpolhfHW2xNtQBp3cc2HEEYH2Z.jpg\", \"produits/SFw3CrMY2uDW0TOGDiealfxRnw2VpysECEWfBPFs.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 11:46:53','2025-02-03 11:46:53',1,NULL),(2382,'Calamine Secret Sunblock','000012',98.000,'Total solution for SUN care on oily skin.\n# Perfect protection from UV (SPF50+, PA++++)\n# Soothing REDNESS (Calamine Effect)\n# Natural BRIGHTENING\n\nCalamine Secret Sunblock with Pink Tone-up is a Triple functional cosmetic, \"brightening, anti-wrinkle, UV protection\". Besides, this sunblock soothes sunburnt skin with real calamine 15,000ppm. With SPF50+, PA++++, your skin is protected against UV rays and the lightweight texture allows you to reapply it several times for a day. Moreover, natural Tone-up effect makes your skin look brighter! —No white cast, the Natural brightening effect transforms your skin into soft radiant skin\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\n\nVolume : 50 ml',NULL,'produits/rZ6jT3yrtrkXnShqNoDqDZPGTfUEUgphlK1EEXoD.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',2,'[\"produits/8DHxIJ0E36ilhnYDqnhiA9UwdU7JtAYQWSlv2tKH.jpg\", \"produits/04ixD3iGAI30in24FizQ59IMjiK0LVtcE9hDT0me.jpg\", \"produits/tDZwDAyX1cP07P8pwaexUHfUHjQHCorMOfp7gzLm.jpg\", \"produits/OMGg2kcpjUYQ1tpBxRUDUquCZHRD05RtlxSqIABq.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 11:48:47','2025-02-03 11:48:47',1,NULL),(2383,'Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Bar','000013',47.000,'Lighten up your skin with Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Bar! It rejuvenates and clarifies the skin and helps to get glow and radiant skin from the inside out. Besides, it not only brightens up your skin, but also reduces wrinkles and fine lines.\n✔ Contains 10 Vitamins!\nVitamin A, B1, B2, B5, B6, B9, B12, C, E, H these 10 vitamins help to lighten your skin and dark spots. It will boost the radiance of your skin and help to get flawless skin.\n✔ Hydrolyzed collagen for anti-aging.\nIt contains hydrolyzed collagen, which helps reducing sign of aging as it reduces wrinkles and improves skin elasticity and hydration.\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\n\nVolume : 110 g',NULL,'produits/vVcRtgKypTb502aicDSzzJoCNkDzugL45VjmfbLN.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',2,'[\"produits/p4Ca7zuhcVCufDoINLVIHI8FaRGTLGGFckqZGMK2.jpg\", \"produits/V9BcafZpB5hazbEKgy7dGFrHzlQmWZwq2Ofz24EY.jpg\", \"produits/Pwe1dVjUitLZiv33KGUzWzP4ZTZnLUzxwXqsIEwo.jpg\", \"produits/AzfEUheOJU2VOtpUlRomRD1yZfi2MsxJynjWBK7M.jpg\"]',0,NU