AuC.jpg\", \"produits/FpFeacJLr7MNvODf031XbA1JV1EYtqJzVrRESkvx.jpg\", \"produits/wuMIu8LzV4IOU3fTKdj54CeEeERC7oKRqSGuanja.jpg\", \"produits/Sg6SlmIfL5nzVJBPBOs5BOtwg4JhtmH8maO5pLYK.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 12:17:17','2025-02-03 12:17:17',1,NULL),(2393,'Pure Fit Cica Cleanser','000024',110.000,'The Pure Fit Cica Cleanser is formulated with a high concentration of Centella Asiatica extract, also known as cica, which is known for its soothing and healing properties. This makes it a great option for those with irritated or inflamed skin. The cleanser has a creamy texture that lathers into a gentle foam. It effectively removes dirt, oil, and makeup without stripping the skin of its natural moisture. Many users appreciate its mildness and how it leaves their skin feeling clean and refreshed without any tightness or dryness. Some of the key benefits of the Pure Fit Cica Cleanser include: Soothing and calming: The high concentration of cica helps to reduce redness and irritation. Gentle cleansing: The creamy formula is gentle on the skin and does not disrupt the skin natural barrier. Hydrating: The cleanser helps to maintain the skin moisture balance. Non comedogenic: It will not clog pores.',NULL,'produits/L40ZX9eyHAXX9WUHmQ6MhUpIGlHCrUSiQ3XgEvms.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-03 12:19:16','2025-02-03 12:19:16',1,NULL),(2394,'Low pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser','000025',107.000,'This Low-pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser is a mildly acidic cleanser with the ideal balanced pH level of 56. Formulated with botanical skin-purifying ingredients and mild acids, it is gentle on the skin and makes skin supple and clear without stripping skins natural oils, leaving skin hydrated all day long. It makes the perfect morning cleanser for everyone. It is also formulated to remove light makeup and other oil-based residue so it can also be used at night.\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\n\nVolume :150 ml\n\n',NULL,'produits/FxJ4xGzR4fVQ7nXxW4ihsT7jHOpfQEyH31PG65pR.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/YO8FhVUlmVmUtJn9BEAF5H509rJLDsFcS1pcGopT.jpg\", \"produits/7XZzsQpOzmb4TfxwmTDp5dqJz5Rrze9UuNgfBL3h.jpg\", \"produits/dwGwv10pu9UmZlKOImpRTCuXf0BjBcgZJ8jPBZHg.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 12:21:14','2025-02-03 12:21:14',1,NULL),(2395,'AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid','000026',130.000,'AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid is a gentle yet effective exfoliant that contains natural AHA from apple fruit water and glycolic acid, which helps remove whiteheads trapped inside pores and leaves the skin clear and soft. The liquid delivers vitamins, whitening agent and natural moisturising component into cleaned pores and will gradually improve skin healthy and bring acne prone skin back to normal, vibrant skin with a smooth and refined texture.\nGreat for all skin types. Must be used with sunscreen in daylight.\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive',NULL,'produits/dYvis2H3Rk0x5RJ2INqhXPQPSulaMR1LhYWgHvVz.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/yLZjLAhJJqlz72aZr3rZHNXkzadI49TDvI1rIIla.jpg\", \"produits/A9FwmH56DiaerO1eATEs4qIkp0kNJBRtlSLP521P.jpg\", \"produits/7eBzkFwgsOX62BsYoSbzjrPFwNgvOHhNnwC94qLe.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 12:22:48','2025-02-03 12:22:48',1,NULL),(2396,'BHA Blackhead Power Liquid','0000026',130.000,'BHA & Niacinamide exfoliating liquid for gentle exfoliation and oil control. Suggested for mid-level acid users.\n\nBENEFITS\n• Clear clogged pores\n• Prevent breakouts & reduce marks from spots\n• Balance oil production\nTARGETS\n• Clogged, large pores\n• Black dots and blackheads\n• T-zone care\n• Oily skin prone to break outs',NULL,'produits/U27GsjtvoNnHtblB3SIpvYPrIWvoGAWWTOG4272h.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/JDaUMGQSkU1MmfymnLnq2DBD2GFjZ3Kkbor6xtf8.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 12:27:52','2025-02-03 12:29:37',1,NULL),(2397,'Full fit Propolis Light Ampoule','000027',130.000,'Give your skin a radiant boost with the COSRX Full Fit Propolis Light Ampoule. This lightweight, hydrating formula is packed with propolis extract, a natural bee product known for its soothing and nourishing properties. Benefits: * Deep Hydration: Quenches thirsty skin for a plump, dewy complexion. * Soothing Relief: Calms redness and irritation, leaving skin feeling comforted. * Radiant Glow: Promotes a healthy, luminous complexion. * Lightweight Texture: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue.\n\n',NULL,'produits/mxxa0ZcNDxqVGuE5h4uOTEy6DjR7f7GnF4bqb7N5.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-03 14:27:33','2025-02-03 14:27:33',1,NULL),(2398,'The Hyaluronic Acid 3 Serum','000028',125.000,'COSRX\'s The Hyaluronic Acid 3 Serum is a highly concentrated 3% hyaluronic acid serum that hydrates, plumps, soothes and supports the skin\'s moisture barrier.\n\nBenefits\nInfuses hydration\nStrengthens skin barrier\nRetains moisture\nPlumps skin\n\nKey Ingredients\nHyaluronic Acid : Recharges the skin with hydration alleviating dryness and restoring the skin\'s moisture balance\nNMF (Amino acid complex) : Improves skin barrier protecting against dryness and dehydration\nCeramide : Protects the skin from external stressors',NULL,'produits/l98MXJgnrrXa4RTPEtchoTBMaIEv9a42bhOUoXrt.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/3zU69YqSealdWlQOKLxZfeHlU0dfdcXyiQQKGurl.jpg\", \"produits/2iQwuRoeJKMyKeqIk18JCKLKlvvhl9unFcQBYf64.jpg\", \"produits/DIshI3tnntvv0G2hG7fqpxDTtWICDWsoupBOrn4R.jpg\", \"produits/fOwv5sn3QwO8xyswT2A4ieqSImcf3mF0cvU9aKih.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 14:30:53','2025-02-03 14:30:53',1,NULL),(2399,'The Retinol 0.5 Oil','000029',140.000,'Feel the benefits of Retinol without irritation with The Retinol 0.5 Oil by COSRX. This rich and silky night oil provides a healthy glow and hydrated skin. A gentle but concentrated .5% of pure retinol improves the appearance of fine lines, creases, and wrinkles and enhances elasticity.\nThis serum is safe for all skin types, and best for skin accustomed to retinol but still experiencing progressive signs of aging such as loss of elasticity and dryness. It’s an intermediate-level retinol for those looking for a highly concentrated, youth booster.\nVitamin A supports collagen production and skin cell turnover, squalene protects and moisturizes the skin, and vitamin E reduces visible signs of aging and skin damage.\n\n➢ Formulated without fragrance, parabens, sulfates, artificial colors, alcohol, mineral oil, and silicone.',NULL,'produits/nRHPqrYPw7r8XLHQDkg0EiN4k2BLYzwgDOwksjiu.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/6dfmXWIuXnVnQ2DpFKSMoIZttkFI89Jo8K6pY62y.jpg\", \"produits/bkltVXwnZMGSZFjBipVt1drIutcdMZdOcelicTdG.jpg\", \"produits/dMfwckbvta6EdjXN086tqAq6Gnw66oJHpoBABtON.jpg\", \"produits/JHJaOtW9661nDQjaHGJPEyBIj7XPDuacCuLDDGHl.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 14:32:17','2025-02-03 14:32:17',1,NULL),(2400,'The Retinol 0.3 Cream','000030',145.000,'0.3% pure retinol with three times the strength Experience the full power of retinol with a concentration three times higher than that of The Retinol 0.1 Cream. This formula optimally stabilizes the high retinol content. Recommended for those already familiar with retinol products, this mid-strength retinol cream helps achieve smooth skin, improves texture, enhances elasticity, and reduces wrinkles.\n\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily\n\nVolume: 20 ml',NULL,'produits/8JDgoyEvKSuh8M8ZrrTmW0lE9vuOZWixM0dZvSiK.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/RkYXEwz13SuPhYbKAyefsEeBv0g4ngPc7psOyF1V.jpg\", \"produits/cuAi4FJROHWOO7CrpV2QNKg004wajqbEXJYuaKJe.jpg\", \"produits/8UXhOSHPFKN9fW4B8ABkTFZaWo0HNkOb04lwqaIY.jpg\", \"produits/G4H2hLdh1UpJtj5nojnOf0KItC3xlIJoPcRHn3YL.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 14:34:32','2025-02-03 14:34:32',1,NULL),(2401,'Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser','000031',109.000,'Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser is a specially formulated gel cleanser enriched with snail mucin to hydrate and protect the skin. Supercharged with 10,000ppm of snail secretion filtrate to deliver a powerful regenerative and hydrating effect, this ultra-gentle cleanser effectively removes impurities without stripping the skin, protecting its barrier while moisturising, restoring and healing for a smooth complexion. Enjoy the stretchy, elastic texture of snail mucin as it effectively works its way into hard-to-reach areas of your face, lifting away all impurities for an impeccable cleanse while creating the smoothest lather possible to minimise stimulation. A definite must-have for snail mucin lovers! Suitable for all skin types, perfect for those with sensitive skin prone to irritation or redness.',NULL,'produits/DNZRt3QgXmx5HU9QukzhKAcCPXF0BS7PDfmjzDJD.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/8GTgQGmmcGkb1QrXMsasarcYEeOAuokyhNmGw9vb.png\", \"produits/qzvpveNGGKfWZZUY9tIjc0fVwXHOEmSgdSgE4GRp.jpg\", \"produits/3LNmUQD612njggU7tOpiNAbv5SESxwOVrmuCeFLh.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 14:36:51','2025-02-03 14:36:51',1,NULL),(2402,'Advanced Snail Radiance Dual Essence','000032',210.000,'The COSRX Advanced Snail Radiance Dual Essence is a unique essence with a dual formula to boost skin elasticity and radiance at the same time. Enriched with 74.3% Triple Snail Complex to deeply hydrate and increase skin elasticity, while 5% niacinamide brightens the skin. With its dual airless system, the two essences are stored separately to ensure that they come out fresh with every pump. This highly concentrated yet lightweight essence provides a 2-in-1 solution without leaving behind any sticky residue.\n\n',NULL,'produits/H6VPZvjaeluco0x2KNa49i20queYfADAy2iPQmPP.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/Pp9Hq4yEfG2CDD5uPbgnzoExfGPNKJQut1ue5N12.png\", \"produits/SHVTeTZ8TzH16gIat5vz7IxAtaQTS45guKZRvKvv.jpg\", \"produits/inZx3Ai86jH3cLRpqpPG13369fsxiJnHYM0cv5tK.jpg\", \"produits/cW7riiJvmsKoQaqOJWKyIILLMmXsihmHB2HsBCnq.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 14:38:24','2025-02-03 14:38:24',1,NULL),(2403,'Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence','000033',150.000,'Containing as much as 96% snail secretion filtrate, the advanced snail mucin essence from Korean beauty favorite COSRX adds intense moisture to hydrate skin while helping to repair damaged skin, improve skin texture, and reduce redness and pigmentation.\nA popular ingredient in any Korean skin care routine, snail slime is known to benefit aging skin and soften the appearance of fine lines. Its moisturizing and healing properties also make it great to use in combination with retinol or Vitamin C serums. Other key ingredients in this COSRX snail essence include sodium hyaluronate, allantoin, panthenol and arginine, which provide additional hydrating and elasticity-enhancing effects.\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive',NULL,'produits/2w5BigDmvKRSLkzNF4gFf95Pe4uAWEjm8f32sBHx.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/Rs8GryBnIJubiLekgli78AKMoIzb842EAPscyscp.jpg\", \"produits/lcCqZTUf4gcHWEjLJMaD68gqzu9vyt9AYKQjm9sD.jpg\", \"produits/1QIPnmT362hTYtnDuNGwuvwhfdAhdgdoYoQglC5U.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 14:39:50','2025-02-03 14:39:50',1,NULL),(2404,'Basic Snail Skincare','000034',275.000,'✵COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence:\nThis essence protects the skin from moisture loss while keeping skin texture smooth. This contains 96% of Snail Secretion Filtrate which keeps your skin moisturized all day while bringing back skin’s vitality.\n\n✵ COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream:\n94% of Snail Secretion Filtrate makes your skin nourished, hydrated, and healthy. The cream is safe for usage on the skin, consisting of excellent skin-activation components that treat irritated skin and improve uneven skin tone.\n\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive',NULL,'produits/TPQ6iB1o7E6i6vy3yOEAfPM7vewCDuHQWIkW98Lw.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/bMRL6vx0hs7xW5TTbYZwj1zFzLMOF6eBIWv8iT1w.png\", \"produits/FCo40872FnRrjf9f5ONETbudPmByrGKpYzqyirxJ.jpg\", \"produits/sVFsTySDwAqi3VnXacFalV5T28xFKqkHKd7j9GAV.jpg\", \"produits/vG3V7f8egtK9cgKujSbHUiwZS5nhbrDk4qjw8TfA.jpg\", \"produits/cfcERn9ZUUIOFl6u7p6jICZItZJVKNOvBhUz12mQ.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 14:42:30','2025-02-03 14:54:46',1,NULL),(2405,'All About Snail Kit','000035',150.000,'The COSRX All About Snail Kit is a comprehensive four-step skincare regimen designed to rejuvenate and hydrate the skin using the powerful benefits of snail mucin. The kit includes: 1. **COSRX Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser (20ml / 0.67 fl. oz)**: This gentle gel cleanser effectively removes impurities while preserving the skin natural moisture balance, leaving it clean and refreshed. 2. **COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence (30ml / 1.01 fl. oz)**: A lightweight essence that deeply hydrates and repairs the skin, promoting a smooth and radiant complexion. 3. **COSRX Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream (5ml / 0.16 fl. oz)**: Formulated for the delicate eye area, this cream targets fine lines, dark circles, and puffiness, providing a youthful and refreshed appearance. 4. **COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All In One Cream (20g / 0.70 oz)**: A rich moisturizer that provides intense hydration, improves skin texture, and helps repair damage for a healthier complexion. Together, these products create a synergistic skincare routine that addresses multiple skin concerns, including cleansing, hydration, repair, and anti-aging.\n\n',NULL,'produits/5TwpkwHe6tkUGqNTDchpCSrtBC3VJWazG265ryoE.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:37:51','2025-02-03 15:37:51',1,NULL),(2406,'Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence','000036',150.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence is a concentrated hydrating essence that contains 4,000ppm of high purity natural hydrating Sodium Hyaluronate and offers intense hydration to your skin, boosts elasticity and recharges dehydrated skin. It also softens and moisturises bumpy and dry skin to be silky and smooth.\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive',NULL,'produits/XiCFIpiPLUIa0qy4TAp1VSbedD8ALI0zElbbi7SB.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/lcQQ2QhlBrEfi0kkKoYauYJnnSYLnmIo5wkymUjr.jpg\", \"produits/UMtPxDhioGgjiEEfIxwQMVvnKWX2s1PrXOTDWJ7o.jpg\", \"produits/uLuZlYLqQiLpvQWH1DlBBEJy2mCfXbzOpdnIEsYn.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:39:13','2025-02-03 15:39:13',1,NULL),(2407,'Centella Blemish Cream','000037',140.000,'Centella Blemish Cream is a fast-acting spot treatment cream comprised of Zinc Oxide and Centella Asiatica Leaf Water that help normalise the sebum production by calming down problematic areas and clearing the pores, while preventing further breakouts and loss of moisture. It improves the appearance of acne and blemishes and relieves stressed skin. Excellent for sensitive skin and acne prone skin, it can be used for multiple purposes such as a spot treatment, acne scar removal, and alleviating skin after extraction of whiteheads and blackheads.\n\n',NULL,'produits/efL1AZDKGkyYT7USclf5ZNKT7s9xtaoDYAwLwXDE.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/0fjHedYbPnsgrJFZpiqD8ePp0fw6BZGM4i5cZ67S.jpg\", \"produits/udqntjgiYKg1o9WQlbgu2LFduRNgnnkdRvlapZCc.jpg\", \"produits/qT5eBK2J9b9qgSyTgbcEblFy743szG03cLZnGtN1.jpg\", \"produits/yiyXNBgjkTReZVcdMxT1Lt4GyO7nCegmzmtjVEkT.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:40:49','2025-02-03 15:40:49',1,NULL),(2408,'Vitamin E Vitalizing Sunscreen SPF 50+','000038',105.000,'Perfect for all skin colours and all seasons, COSRX’s weightless Vitamin E Vitalizing Sunscreen offers broad-spectrum protection of SPF 50+ PA+++ along with various skin care benefits. It’s enriched with Vitamin E and silica to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and regulate excess sebum production for a matte finish without leaving a white cast.\n\nBenefits:\n√ A clinically-proven sunscreen with SPF50+ that blocks UV rays to the strongest degree formulated with vitamin E, antioxidant protection.\n√ Formulated with antioxidant Vitamin E (Tocopherol) that reduces free radicals and helps reduce visible signs of aging and skin damage.\n√ Lightweight, fast-absorbing, non greasy sunscreen that doesn’t leave a white cast.\n√ Contains Silica which controls oil and sebum for a shine-free look.\n√ Reef-friendly formula.\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive',NULL,'produits/eL7E7af0xFkXhH4NuGsOWDTUYt9fkcK30XqIU9qj.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/Sexl8cB2ToSKmdrQMfdvzjHUoXPeJUeowyDxje3x.jpg\", \"produits/UKRAlMlHSDbwRo6ZzvxaxD6JZkFIVhDxmwhKEeeD.jpg\", \"produits/unb1jCKKIvRf6r3E9nMXjeVE70pUHDIjZVKHflev.jpg\", \"produits/KxqBumnXxno4xLAqGPqDXvbz9nWrdX9xMofDwfCn.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:42:11','2025-02-03 15:42:11',1,NULL),(2409,'Aloe 54.2 Aqua Tone-up Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++','000039',110.000,'Aloe 54.2 Aqua Tone-Up Sunscreen is a lightweight sunscreen that protects skin while providing a very natural, tone-up effect. Features 54.2% Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Water to boost moisture and soothe skin irritation and sunburn. Vitamin B12 (Cyanocobalamin) and Vitamin B3 (Niacinamide) help protect and prevent skin damage and barrier disruption, while helping to prevent pigmentation. This cream has a lightweight and non-greasy texture that absorbs quickly into the skin, providing a soft, non-greasy appearance all day. Its pink colour gives the skin a glowing, tone-up effect and goes well under makeup.\n\n',NULL,'produits/ZGvixI7hIMWC1NK5E5bzSNnVfcM14bSKqVG707EE.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/UOr0M7sPoqpKiruFwduHbubl1wuiGpQek5lmGHqb.jpg\", \"produits/E1KDz2H6atT9pvCpYdaf9bOqlVFAfS7a4KnSvp2N.jpg\", \"produits/2kt3e5ABDJRPVbQfQhOPMfNmK0yqz9yM9UC2hWfk.jpg\", \"produits/mm16w6KPJv7U3DKXwLgIAGt95FDey1I9YMEm4fcK.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:47:23','2025-02-03 15:47:23',1,NULL),(2410,'Aloe Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+/ PA+++','000040',105.000,'Aloe Soothing Sun Cream is a daily soothing skin protector that is so lightweight that it feels more like a moisturiser! Enriched with aloe vera leaf extract to soothe, moisturise and nourish skin, while its fast absorbing texture does not leave a white cast or greasy finish, and will not stain clothing. Designed to be travel friendly, you can easily carry this anywhere and layer on sun protection anytime! Suitable for all skin types. Can be used on the face and/ or body. Size: 50ml\n\n',NULL,'produits/bSrG7twPDyOLz69UVbVFR9K4yida9er4aBh5LRag.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/w013JyfDpUSdLOTEg8hwqowjlhftQKLFpQHc2Dqz.jpg\", \"produits/fGUDEUsim9MwZZW5zMmlTYKlWkUQdCWvzjYI3M8P.jpg\", \"produits/m3wyKbNKPAIfd2r7dyT4QeYCaHcyaPpdmwbJzvOf.jpg\", \"produits/4ZdoyrppCyKYMe2oxdR3AmQ75W3hfHu5APtCrC3A.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:48:57','2025-02-03 15:48:57',1,NULL),(2411,'Ultimate Nourishing Rice Spa Overnight Mask','000041',125.000,'Ultimate Nourishing Rice Spa Overnight Mask is enriched with more than 65% of rice extract, which contains a variety of vitamins and minerals. It is the ultimate sleeping mask that provides intensive nourishment and deep moisture, as well as refining and brightening the skin, all while you are asleep! Wake up in the morning as if you just went to the spa! Suitable for all skin types. Free from: Parabens, Synthetic Dyes, Mineral oils. Size: 60ml\n\n',NULL,'produits/5mRiN7PrYhRcSelETKr39ugSEAGav9e67PcgOAgT.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/8o4NxoPE2cfM096fvzaqtG1YTJWAgiI4AIH3KfKa.jpg\", \"produits/KGJAa8fsVjuqYMnvA4uXumtB1dmFOdXug6BJW95L.jpg\", \"produits/xRo5xPfPr4DZOEspwegGyYBSCVQOOfc438bbadTq.jpg\", \"produits/BsRZ8MM71AiO3coJ0PvidiOvHH00GtvihdSsuyXc.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:50:27','2025-02-03 15:50:27',1,NULL),(2412,'Oil-Free Ultra-Moisturizing Lotion with Birch Sap','000042',130.000,NULL,NULL,'produits/uZsQTeiSvCXZBN4GFAC4MdKiSWsUGPjspgJWmf6W.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/0eiDyg6BTHfjqokivEsn7boelyJo76COZmWrAeae.png\", \"produits/fNf4B8viXUDDw08P8WYGltouK3AvytICzDXlC5ty.jpg\", \"produits/BOJLDQLOqMzl0WfQcUE4NrFHYiuAQHCREhviVnvL.jpg\", \"produits/iha16UXWIkL6LhWP9LvAWCzV9FWfxLhgz5TuAGyY.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:52:21','2025-02-03 15:52:21',1,NULL),(2413,'Clear Fit Master Patch','000043',30.000,'Clear Fit Master Patch is a thin clear hydrocolloid patch for your acne/ pimples. It effectively extracts impurities while creating a protective barrier that guards external irritants. This ultra-thin patch will give you a natural look by covering blemishes during the daytime. Similar to the texture of a hydrogel sheet mask, it adheres to skin well, seals around the acne to protect it from bacteria and dirt (which is what causes them in the first place) while maintaining the moisture level inside.\n',NULL,'produits/q6hGhoxfzgnEnv7MtJZjpKjOLCA9JfDWaPVo6IJu.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',6,'[\"produits/Iq8pZFPDEe8dFIWKO4C2XYeifJ1bJsfrcWsOh2q2.jpg\", \"produits/dJxrnI5eB3B2XP7vP6RN76CIfgU0TvtiOa3Yldcl.jpg\", \"produits/hBzprugYSBMYr1Uy3SaY91gWwqaqlVpR5el1MnWX.jpg\", \"produits/krFGmWq9UT9NF3HvcqybJBD9HolRifGPPITj2y6x.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-03 15:54:41','2025-02-03 15:54:41',1,NULL),(2414,'8 Hyaluronic Acid Hydrating Gentle Foaming Cleanser','000045',135.000,'ANUA Hyaluronic Acid Cleansing Foam Experience the hydrating power of the ANUA Hyaluronic Acid Cleansing Foam. This gentle yet effective cleanser is formulated with 8 types of hyaluronic acid to deeply cleanse pores without stripping the skin. Infused with panthenol and zinc PCA, it helps soothe and hydrate, leaving your skin feeling refreshed and nourished. Ideal for all skin types, especially those seeking a moisture-boosting cleansing experience.',NULL,'produits/HNXnl4hQR4eQPtPGL8hWUJqoW1DJfdTSe23NLmqi.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',18,'[\"produits/hIHdqYPjZpjBOHOJeJAPf7XlMFM6tVKSfvVdRLh7.jpg\", \"produits/12ZdRUhvOzyEra7kiNQTZJ7MtERzCO4sHsf3gOxn.jpg\", \"produits/PSCxAv1EYR8fVH39QafhvINA3qEV5geTddF77Vdi.jpg\", \"produits/J3pQ1b1cxPJn4HYOjw2bC7z55uTSDHgUWqXkZO0e.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-04 11:06:04','2025-02-04 11:06:04',1,NULL),(2415,'Heartleaf Quercetinol Pore Deep Cleansing Foam','000046',140.000,'The Anua Heartleaf Quercetinol Pore Deep Cleansing Foam gently exfoliates skin and unclogs pores for a deep cleanse. Formulated with finely ground Heartleaf Powder to soothe redness and breakouts, together with Quercetinol, extracted from Heartleaf, to calm inflammation and sensitive skin. The grainy formula is also infused with patented Anti-Sebum P to get rid of excess sebum, while Salicylic Acid provides pore care and anti-acne benefits. Recommended for oily to combination skin types, including acne-prone skin.\n\n',NULL,'produits/aVhzvAjfckn92cQ8YEu2GFYw5qCSlAA3eMJXq0fw.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',18,'[\"produits/mm2Fa59E8CILK1yEP0NheJzzAKD9I3kfKLSdKgfM.png\", \"produits/pqNPaZeRNUc14Hwxt20MgfZ4wO7BWnbqKqghJwup.jpg\", \"produits/lhBp1fD9y4GqiOtKi9fUbyQYCldU7mFWdsloNUnY.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-04 11:07:45','2025-02-04 11:07:45',1,NULL),(2416,'Heartleaf 77 Clear Pad','000047',135.000,'Heartleaf 77 Clear Pad are moisturising daily toner pads soaked in the brand best selling Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner to help soothe skin, remove skin impurities and tighten pores. Formulated with star ingredient Heartleaf Extract from Korea to help soothe sensitive and irritated skin, while Anti Sebum P helps control sebum secretion and tighten pores. This toner pad comes with an embossed side to slough away dead skin cells and impurities for softer and smoother skin. Size: 160ml (70 Pads)\n\n',NULL,'produits/XJT8xOj43OdaITOVgJ4Iuid7HmPatmgPDg4erZus.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',18,'[\"produits/oxo2Q5qCUGXS1mtpoFj9YelOOPKpnQzAQ9zQuxW6.jpg\", \"produits/ffQ23EYhOcv8MlFg5drGd6Vqxv7S3d2B6phNlDUj.jpg\", \"produits/14P7MYBTEK0W382EqufF3RsJJqyX7h4ABNrjR60F.jpg\", \"produits/zQ9H2KVuuORd6XlIO2wCrTw4BZqosVKKWqTdaRMC.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-04 11:09:24','2025-02-04 11:09:24',1,NULL),(2417,'Anua Heartleaf 80% Soothing Ampoule','000048',132.000,'Anua Heartleaf 80% Soothing Ampoule is a nourishing, gel like ampoule that helps soothe sensitive skin and protect skin from external irritations. Infused with 80% of Houttuynia Cordata Extract, this ampoule lightweight texture absorbs into skin easily to reduce irritation and impart a healthy glow. Skin appears more smoother and glowing in just 14 days!\n\n',NULL,'produits/lQ90XFvsreMxAGg42ucoWs4qTGh8LEire9moazI3.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',18,'[\"produits/rOXXERGymn96w0ZA9A9QxPowJilZ4HdwoH4MBtBy.jpg\", \"produits/asmyTHKfUJ0IM4d46bJMPyc2deOcqjArKvaTednf.jpg\", \"produits/RSP0kKLyJZdqGIjDeNkp4HPACzv4Nqr8u7NSt0zk.jpg\", \"produits/Q26MIns3KaeEeuhPx3mdl376ClvkbVPLLAlbsru0.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-04 11:10:52','2025-02-04 11:10:52',1,NULL),(2418,'Anua Peach 70 Niacin Serum','000049',132.000,'Anua Peach 70 Niacin Serum is a brightening and hydrating serum to even out skin tone and deliver glass skin instantly and over time. Packed with 70% Peach Fruit Extract from Jeju Island and 5% Niacinamide to target dullness and hyperpigmentation, while supporting the skin barrier and reducing the look of enlarged pores. This serum also contains powerful hydrators such as Desert Yeast Oil and Triple Hyaluronic Acid to replenish skin\'s moisture for a softer complexion.\n\nVolume: 30ml\nSkin type: All skin types',NULL,'produits/tHEXasTNvmZHf9oRPiptFQm0JhCBF0pwbDpoWS1j.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',18,'[\"produits/GgnKFHBkyUBP0Rl4UBNCVVtkeQlfBkY78gQDDLhd.jpg\", \"produits/bZRDPXNVRR32RbxVsGBXvhOaFUr58u45uvxt21B9.jpg\", \"produits/2UtJN5X168fOtKbcul1Tn63t15lxrDBJpth9jYah.jpg\", \"produits/O77Qa05rSBFLbdGLiQ6m7R8zi0zl7YRjuBWfsWPu.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-04 11:12:26','2025-02-04 11:12:26',1,NULL),(2419,'Heartleaf 70% Soothing Cream','000050',145.000,'Heartleaf 70% Soothing Cream is a soothing, gel-cream enriched with 70% Heartleaf Extract to effectively calm sensitive skin. Also featuring triple cica care containing Madecassic Acid, Cica Extract and Asiatic Acid that leaves skin soothed and refreshed. This lightweight cream forms a protective shield against irritants, ensuring a more comfortable and healthier complexion. Size: 100ml\n\n',NULL,'produits/JxCgKBbBa5vCjcbTrL3DDfYTLtXzqeksm2YUhZ7o.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',18,'[\"produits/59msiVNtgnqDyJhq9DpoC9zAnI2DeCx4itD8NFQX.jpg\", \"produits/CksyeMFE1YSF5Tr5dGfRp1LvjLrunfXycNhAEaCA.png\", \"produits/p7yKfPH9byNdY1MXn4hWWxAjLygGBIf7BbN8h5EO.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-04 11:18:10','2025-02-04 11:18:10',1,NULL),(2420,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream','000051',110.000,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream is a lightweight organic sunscreen that provides soothing and hydrating benefits. Featuring Houttuynia Cordata Extract to calm your skin and provide care for sensitive skin, while Panthenol locks water inside your skin and helps with calming. Also boasting a sebum-controlling effect, the formula sits well under foundation and prolongs makeup wear.\n\n',NULL,'produits/QOvbiKllt959MTImoDOkjN4jcHyyvjtkxh4CRanV.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',18,'[\"produits/F3FTG6daKlDrhJ2nUcsH9EfOGcoZeqXlhzT1vkSA.png\", \"produits/9NOnYwAZhJ5sKyqdrMjp6totaxJdTxxQcKtoST2I.jpg\", \"produits/6F6M6lha0RyHZyyJsCsT9bAMkdfHq8ETMbRkDosX.jpg\", \"produits/cDiCy5GZ3z8cY35svzAqtmpt6KMd7wTGt3O4KYEj.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-04 11:19:39','2025-02-04 11:19:39',1,NULL),(2421,'Airy Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA++++','000052',110.000,'Anua Airy Sun Cream is a gentle physical sun cream that protects the skin from UV rays. Formulated with calming ingredients including Centella Asiatica Extract, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Tea Tree Extract and Artemisia Capillaris Extract to help soothe sensitive and irritated skin. The watery cream texture keeps the skin refreshed and moisturised under sunlight without white cast. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\n\n\n',NULL,'produits/jWc92TU6QMhBncD8Xsk52nh2YLBcthfKxY4eTggr.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',18,'[\"produits/BIOrkk99Rwnu1wRH5Fi8arZP7darmINPXzGyBFvW.jpg\", \"produits/WpqG9yMdURfyxRPewpnvhIo0mFjhvtgXE0LJ4I47.jpg\", \"produits/qmBLO5QQWnLpqknwEUBaF26HkkpUvtu3BpfXdBhB.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-04 11:21:14','2025-02-04 11:21:14',1,NULL),(2422,'Lacto Soy Sebum and Blackhead Cleansing Oil','000055',125.000,'Lacto Soy Sebum Blackhead Cleansing Oil is a gentle yet effective cleansing oil that helps remove blackheads and excess sebum. It is formulated with Lacto Soy, a blend of soy milk ferment filtrate and lactobacillus, which helps to detoxify the skin and boost moisture levels. The oil also contains vegetable oils and the brand patented Anti Sebum P, which helps to control oil production and improve pore condition. This cleansing oil is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. It is also vegan and free of 28 potentially irritating ingredients. Benefits: Helps remove blackheads and excess sebum Detoxifies the skin Boosts moisture levels Controls oil production Improves pore condition Gentle and effective Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin Vegan and free of 28 potentially irritating ingredients\n\n',NULL,'produits/VMNvWPzoFx3otRIE7Qleh9QuX4QiJKlEAmQCTbyx.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:30:11','2025-02-06 10:30:11',1,NULL),(2423,'Lacto Soy Mild Peeling Bubble Cleanser','000056',120.000,'The Lacto Soy Mild Peeling Bubble Cleanser by Some By Mi is a gentle and nourishing cleanser that helps to purify the skin and remove impurities. It is formulated with lacto-soy, konjac, and aqualose to provide deep cleansing, mild exfoliation, and hydration. This cleanser is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. It is free of parabens, artificial fragrance, drying alcohols, and essential oils. Benefits: * Deep cleanses the skin to remove impurities and skin waste * Gently exfoliates the skin to remove dead skin cells and smooth the skin texture * Hydrates the skin to prevent dryness * Soothes the skin and reduces irritation * Improves the overall appearance of the skin\n\n',NULL,'produits/rSrgoygCNOCsqtiDYe6kt73PYvFv0blbW4MCO3JT.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:31:02','2025-02-06 10:31:02',1,NULL),(2424,'Lacto Soy Low pH Morning Cleansing B','000057',65.000,'Lacto Soy Low pH Morning Cleansing Bar is a gentle, fragrance-free, non-comedogenic and moisturizing Korean low pH bar soap cleanser for all skin types, including sensitive skin. It is formulated with Lacto Soy, a fermented soybean extract that helps to gently remove impurities and dead skin cells, while also restoring the skin\'s natural pH balance. It is also enriched with Hydrolyzed Soy Protein Extract and 3 types of vegetable oil to moisturize the skin. The bar produces a rich and fine lather that provides a mild yet effective cleansing experience. It is free of 28 harmful ingredients, making it suitable for sensitive skin.\n\n',NULL,'produits/VVK8bvRhv5OIriTLKmLpl4yCf5GFS42taMr02typ.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:32:01','2025-02-06 10:32:01',1,NULL),(2425,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic','000058',135.000,'Restore Your Hair\'s Vitality with Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic Experience a transformative haircare solution designed to combat hair loss and revitalize your scalp. Our innovative formula, enriched with CICA, peptides, Black Complex, and Biotin, nourishes and strengthens your hair follicles, promoting healthy hair growth. Free from harmful ingredients and dermatologically tested, Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic is the gentle yet effective solution for revitalizing your hair.\n\n',NULL,'produits/khPEGzYF4cWt8v4DBPNkJOtc2jRzveDchIEe0vl9.png',NULL,0,53,'indisponible',3,'[\"produits/GQ0oug7d3CGZqBkGzYo2bCY4mF4nmexOEokR1VNL.jpg\", \"produits/akXLwE7OazdWZFZk8BfiQbtFnWuC0nNWDqpnkknF.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:34:11','2025-02-06 10:34:11',1,NULL),(2426,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Shampoo','000059',120.000,'Combat hair loss with this nourishing shampoo formulated with 11 types of peptides to moisturize scalp, cica to soothe irritations as well as menthol for a cooling touch. Also contains PHA to thoroughly remove dead skin cells, impurities and excess sebum from scalp. Benefits: It can help alleviate hair loss symptoms. Formulated with 11 types of peptides, provides moisture and nutrients to scalp. Nourishes scalp with Biotin and proteins from bean, wheat and corn, to help achieve healthy hair. Calms down and offers regenerative effect to irritated scalp with CICA. Contains Menthol to delivers fresh cooling feeling to scalp. Its dense & rich foam minimises scalp irritation. Infused with PHA to absorb dead skin cells, impurities and sebum to create a clean scalp environment.\n\n',NULL,'produits/1Yg0EGbly4ZWmCHJltD5y6riE6g1tWcToh3ZF7xl.png',NULL,0,53,'indisponible',3,'[\"produits/EEMVsrWJZDTynKJ2UxMYn41KwsSePmlCvugs3jqZ.jpg\", \"produits/Buesb7fG1HPLbDQnZFQnFOAFLD2lY1nLljfBHfGn.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:35:37','2025-02-06 11:06:08',1,NULL),(2427,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Treatment','000060',100.000,'Achieve soft, untangled hair in three minutes with this anti-hair-loss scalp treatment! The product contains cica, peptide and black complex to nourish scalp and prevent hair loss. Formulated without silicone and sulfate ingredients to ensure safety. It can help alleviate hair loss symptoms. No silicon nor sulfate are contained, no need to worry about skin-troubles and pore clogging issue. Formulated with Cica, Peptide and Black Complex to nourish hair, strengthen scalp and hair root to prevent hair loss. Provides a rich amount of moisture and nutrients to hair roots and hair to create a shiny-glowing hair without any tangles.\n\n',NULL,'produits/kEXsHXYXIEBCvZcWnLMnBbuhSIpZEgXoCpBw6A0L.png',NULL,0,53,'indisponible',3,'[\"produits/9SHchsspXQGASKkHo0F1Y8cu9SdvCO83924MtdGK.jpg\", \"produits/kibaRvqLkNcVY9hYZXwbgbeq8YcdOLmtEL8LFPYV.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:37:50','2025-02-06 10:37:50',1,NULL),(2428,'Bye Bye Blackhead 30 Days Miracle Green Tea Tox Bubble Cleanser','000061',105.000,'The SOME BY MI Bye Bye Blackhead 30 Days Miracle Green Tea Tox Bubble Cleanser is a cleanser and also quick 5-minutes detox care to clear out blackheads and impurities from your pores. Formulated with 16 kinds of tea extracts and naturally-derived BHA to deeply cleanse, brighten, exfoliate and tighten your pores. It also leaves skin moisturized and with a natural and healthy glow.\n',NULL,'produits/L9aOX6U7g49wX9ViOS0XrhzAinNF4bUmYfJtx7Sh.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,'[\"produits/Weujfcsw2OPT7kDZ2iyP6ZuISTJK8kd5nSv7GW2Y.jpg\", \"produits/evRwIX00GNKHoYJ5cyqdOM0XhAB6M2faz3A5ZtZQ.jpg\", \"produits/EPVb1hFm5xjA1K5NXSBOFPf7v5nAMZ96AY5Jo2l4.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:39:20','2025-02-06 11:05:07',1,NULL),(2429,'Bye Bye Blemish Vita Tox Brightening Bubble Cleanser','000062',105.000,'Some By Mi Vita Tox cleanser contains Vita Oxygen Bubbles to remove impurities, Goheung Yuja Extract, Jeju Green Tangerine Extract and 18 kinds of vitamins (including vitamin C capsules) to brighten the skin, and konjac granules to gently exfoliate and remove dead skin cells.\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive',NULL,'produits/0qvkZHMBm15h1tB7rtwwETM9ACmfSh8Tp6zY7B0C.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,'[\"produits/16YrCLSNXBv9RdDo1hlEvRCO4KW6osvLIcz4SkZ5.jpg\", \"produits/1zj721pUz5jx6a4ys5HUFSMOkE9DfFmfMVmqqBYS.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:40:38','2025-02-06 10:40:38',1,NULL),(2430,'Charcoal BHA Pore Clay Bubble Mask','000063',95.000,'The Some By Mi Charcoal BHA Pore Clay Bubble Mask is a skin-purifying wash off mask that improves skin texture and tone. Formulated with Charcoal Extract and Kaolin, it effectively removes any dead skin cells, sebum and oil in your pores while refining enlarged pores. It is also powered by patented ingredient Truecica to soothe skin and carbonated water to revitalize it\n\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily',NULL,'produits/pIsmjjVSPDz8Tqv91BMsjfOGX76CWVRHLyzfoedG.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,'[\"produits/mWlKdZGR0FLDJdLqn2Al4dmV3Hl8ygfX57SAnSIw.jpg\", \"produits/U7oZYAy4vIKMuFD6ngWnhcTO92VtTvxWe5i3Oxla.jpg\", \"produits/sxjNstEJ0jxzVg917evbSM4Ldd2TzGhvZzqOK17K.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:42:58','2025-02-06 10:42:58',1,NULL),(2431,'Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Toner','000064',120.000,'The Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Toner by SOME BY MI is a popular Korean skincare product that combines the benefits of galactomyces ferment filtrate and vitamin C to brighten, hydrate, and smooth the skin. Key Ingredients and Benefits: * Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate (88%): This fermented ingredient helps to exfoliate dead skin cells, improve skin texture, and brighten the complexion. * Vitamin C (1%): This powerful antioxidant helps to reduce hyperpigmentation, boost collagen production, and protect the skin from environmental damage. * Niacinamide: This ingredient helps to reduce redness, improve skin tone, and strengthen the skin barrier.\n\n',NULL,'produits/i2fopWMEeuOcV92eX34jDpow44Ktv24REEk3Gyhm.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:44:20','2025-02-06 10:44:20',1,NULL),(2432,'V10 Hyal Antioxidant Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++','000065',105.000,'This sensitive skin-friendly sunscreen is packed with ten types of vitamin and hyaluronic acid to nourish and replenish moisture, while offering SPF50+ PA++++ sun protection. The antioxidant-rich sunscreen provides skin brightening and soothing effects.\n\nBenefits:\nA clinical tested effective UV blocking with broad spectrum SPF50+ PA++++.\nWith 10 vitamins and hyaluronic acid that soothes and moisturizes skin.\nWith tone-up effect and high in adhesiveness. Completed eye irritation test, suitable for sensitive skin.',NULL,'produits/BVxhm3riKzJ7UPAyqHlV7MHPpW3JHPkFcWrrwtQa.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,'[\"produits/uckjdtN9BjFqCJj0DpSk8Oll284NxyYNcJmlHvqm.jpg\", \"produits/FuB6X4KrDFK9S6y6XaJBBAefrHNdDzEaK6XgQyF2.jpg\", \"produits/Mtjux5zXLFS7P4mxwJuUrT0dXTvUyqyUgrwd5bex.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-06 10:46:03','2025-02-06 10:46:03',1,NULL),(2433,'V10 Hyal Lip Sun Protector SPF 15','000067',69.000,'Don’t forget your lips when it comes to sun protection! Fitted with SPF15, this sunscreen-enhanced lip balm keeps your lips protected and nourished. Thanks to a mix of vitamins, hyaluronic acid, shea butter and olive oil, the lip balm offers soothing hydration to cracked and irritated lips.\n\n',NULL,'produits/C9MHqYOxwcPgnHfsuzQAasYuAUGLr2sD81hYcJvI.png',NULL,0,52,'indisponible',3,'[\"produits/tyffKvDa8W7a41RA8eglSRjhxOYpw047GgwPdshc.jpg\", \"produits/CL6D0x9cFkUU4FzR1Ts8HFxojTClmkN8DoYE95If.jpg\", \"produits/YdYIe3mVJ3gXqTV2fI9fNYSYt48HzMLnwQfyzX2r.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-06 11:03:38','2025-02-06 11:03:38',1,NULL),(2434,'AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid','',130.000,'AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid is a gentle yet effective exfoliant that contains natural AHA from apple fruit water and glycolic acid, which helps remove whiteheads trapped inside pores and leaves the skin clear and soft. The liquid delivers vitamins, whitening agent and natural moisturising component into cleaned pores and will gradually improve skin healthy and bring acne prone skin back to normal, vibrant skin with a smooth and refined texture. <br>\r\nGreat for all skin types. Must be used with sunscreen in daylight. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing and toning, gently apply the liquid with clean hands or cotton pad by swiping a thin layer over the skin, concentrating on congested areas (such as the T-zone and chin) and over whiteheads and blemishes. Pat gently for full absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nIf the skin feels irritated, wash away after 4-5 minutes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nWhen it is completely absorbed into the skin, proceed with regular skincare steps and don\'t forget to apply sunscreen if used in daylight. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nIt\'s best to use as a serum in the evening due to its highly concentrated formulation. Begin using only once a week and once your skin has adjusted and doesn&rsquo;t show signs of irritation you can increase to two to three times a week to decrease the visibility of pores and treat blemishes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nAvoid using with highly concentrated vitamin C, vitamin A and other BHA/AHA products. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nYou can enhance the result by applying anti-oxidant serum or mask after using the AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n***This product\'s high concentration of AHA (7%) may lead to a strong scent. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-1_53768.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-1_53768.jpg\", \"produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-2_86049.jpg\", \"produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-3_30534.jpg\", \"produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-4_77479.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2435,'Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream','',106.000,'Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream contains 92% snail secretion filtrate, giving it the slick texture of a gel and all the soothing, healing, and calming properties of mucin, that regenerates and repairs the skin. The cream is formulated to prevent breakouts and maintain skin elasticity, as well as leaving skin nourished, hydrated and healthy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Gently spread over the entire face in an upwards and outwards motion. Pat until fully absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-1_77380.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-1_77380.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-2_70087.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-3_18027.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-4_94075.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2436,'Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence','',128.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence is a concentrated hydrating essence that contains 4,000ppm of high purity natural hydrating Sodium Hyaluronate and offers intense hydration to your skin, boosts elasticity and recharges dehydrated skin. It also softens and moisturises bumpy and dry skin to be silky and smooth. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount on your entire face. Gently pat using fingertips to aid absorption, and then go forth with your serums and moisturisers. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-1_48485.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-1_48485.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-2_82846.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-3_57437.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-4_14084.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2437,'Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence','',128.000,'Containing as much as 96% snail secretion filtrate, the advanced snail mucin essence from Korean beauty favorite COSRX adds intense moisture to hydrate skin while helping to repair damaged skin, improve skin texture, and reduce redness and pigmentation. <br>\r\nA popular ingredient in any Korean skin care routine, snail slime is known to benefit aging skin and soften the appearance of fine lines. Its moisturizing and healing properties also make it great to use in combination with retinol or Vitamin C serums. Other key ingredients in this COSRX snail essence include sodium hyaluronate, allantoin, panthenol and arginine, which provide additional hydrating and elasticity-enhancing effects. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount on your entire face, massaging in to problem areas. Gently pat using fingertips to aid absorption, and then go forth with your serums and moisturisers. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-1_34838.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-1_34838.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-2_70029.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-3_98272.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-4_97153.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2438,'Natural BHA Skin Returning Emulsion','',130.000,'COSRX Natural BHA Skin Returning Emulsion is formulated with 79.37% Centella Asiatica Leaf Water and 1% BHA, this lightweight lotion is designed to prevent further breakouts while soothing and hydrating the applied area. As a lightweight hydrating emulsion, this is the ideal moisturizer for those who want to mattify their oily skin surface, while keeping their skin hydrated. Natural BHAs aid in keeping your pores cleared of impurities like dead skin cells and excess sebum, so moisture isn’t simply being piled on top of a debris—your pores are kept clear from debris as your skin is hydrated. Centella Asiatica Extract Water is used as the base for the fomula for even more hydration than just mineral water. Hyaluronic acid also pitches in for optimal hydration while maintaining a light serum-like texture.','COSRX&nbsp;Natural BHA Skin Returning Emulsion&nbsp;is formulated with 79.37% Centella Asiatica Leaf Water and 1% BHA, this lightweight lotion is designed to prevent further breakouts while soothing and hydrating the applied area. As a lightweight hydrating emulsion, this is the ideal moisturizer for those who want to mattify their oily skin surface, while keeping their skin hydrated. Natural BHAs aid in keeping your pores cleared of impurities like dead skin cells and excess sebum, so moisture isn&rsquo;t simply being piled on top of a debris&mdash;your pores are kept clear from debris as your skin is hydrated. Centella Asiatica Extract Water is used as the base for the fomula for even more hydration than just mineral water. Hyaluronic acid also pitches in for optimal hydration while maintaining a light serum-like texture.','produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-1_85739.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-1_85739.jpg\", \"produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-2_93762.jpg\", \"produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-3_30970.jpg\", \"produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-4_30284.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2439,'Low pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser','',91.000,'This Low-pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser is a mildly acidic cleanser with the ideal balanced pH level of 56. Formulated with botanical skin-purifying ingredients and mild acids, it is gentle on the skin and makes skin supple and clear without stripping skins natural oils, leaving skin hydrated all day long. It makes the perfect morning cleanser for everyone. It is also formulated to remove light makeup and other oil-based residue so it can also be used at night. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n Skin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume :150 ml','Gently massage a small amount of this gel cleanser on wet skin and work into a lather. Rinse off with lukewarm water. Pat your face dry, and continue with your next skin care steps. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-1_39615.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-1_39615.jpg\", \"produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-2_65925.jpg\", \"produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-3_43060.jpg\", \"produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-4_89445.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2440,'Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser','',107.000,'This COSRX Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser is the perfect cleanser for acne prone skin. It is formulated with skin purifying botanical ingredients and salicylic acid to help remove dead skin cells, oil, blackheads and whiteheads, while providing moisture to the skin. It helps to reduce breakouts and leaves the skin soft and smooth. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 150 ml','1. Dispense a moderate amount into your hand.\r\n2. Add water and lather. Gently massage onto face and neck, avoiding eye area.\r\n3. Rinse off with lukewarm water. \r\n4. Pat your face dry, and continue with your next skin care steps.','produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-1_69546.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-1_69546.jpg\", \"produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-2_98325.jpg\", \"produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-3_48417.jpg\", \"produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-4_60321.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2441,'Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream','',106.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream is an intensely hydrating cream filled with bountiful hydrating ingredients like sea-buckthorn, known as a vitamin tree, and hyaluronic acid that help boost hydration of the skin without feeling greasy or heavy. It also contains other active ingredients that help protecting the skin from dehydration while balancing the skin’s water and oil content. With sea buckthorn oil providing nourishing vitamins and amino acids, it’s an excellent antioxidant to help repair cells and slow signs of ageing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Sensitive','1. After cleansing, toning and using treatment products, apply a small amount and gently massage over the entire face in an upwards and outwards motion.\r\n2. Pat until fully absorbed.\r\n3.Follow with SPF during the day or use it as your last skincare step at night. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor better results, use the hyaluronic acid essence followed by hyaluronic acid cream.','produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Intensive-Cream-1_29070.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible'