 of the applicator before use &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Apply from the inner lip and spread to the outer lip line to create a gradation &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Apply it on your cheeks for a bright look','produits/Dear-Darling-Water-Gel-Tint-Ice-cream-1_65078.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Dear-Darling-Water-Gel-Tint-Ice-cream-1_65078.jpg\", \"produits/Dear-Darling-Water-Gel-Tint-Ice-cream-2_26919.jpg\", \"produits/Dear-Darling-Water-Gel-Tint-Ice-cream-3_24438.jpg\", \"produits/Dear-Darling-Water-Gel-Tint-Ice-cream-4_29117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_232332_(540_x_720_pixel)_50947.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_232431_(540_x_720_pixel)_94736.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_232625_(540_x_720_pixel)_82942.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_233613_(540_x_720_pixel)_13509.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2444,'Dear Darling Water Gel Tint - RD306 SHARK RED','',52.000,'The Etude House Dear Darling Water Gel Tint (Ice Cream) is a lip tint inspired by the delight of summer and ice cream to give your lips a refreshing burst of hydration and colour <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ Hydrating and long-lasting <br>\r\n✓ Does not dry out easily <br>\r\n✓ Spreads easily and smoothly','1.Adjust the amount of product on the tip of the applicator before use &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2.Apply from the inner lip and spread to the outer lip line to create a gradation &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3.Apply it on your cheeks for a bright look','produits/IMG_20221220_231958_(540_x_720_pixel)_34496.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221220_231958_(540_x_720_pixel)_34496.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_232116_(540_x_720_pixel)_64685.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_232253_(540_x_720_pixel)_16032.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_233513_(540_x_720_pixel)_10249.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2445,'Moistfull Collagen Cream','',135.000,'Moistfull Collagen Deep Cream is a LONG LASTING MOISTURE <br> \r\nThis Deep Cream is a rich and nourishing cream that keeps your skin hydrated, soft and supple for up to 100 hours after application. It contains Super Collagen Water, hyaluronic acid and peptides to hydrate skin, boost its elasticity and enhance skin resilience. <br> \r\nThe formula is free of six harmful ingredients including mineral oils, colorants and PEG surfactants. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','As the last step of your skin care routine, apply an appropriate amount on your skin. Pat until fully absorbed.&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-1_84625.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-1_84625.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-2_47310.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-3_18404.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-4_74392.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2446,'Brow Contour Pro','',177.000,'Define and highlight your brows with Benefit’s new Brow Contour Pro 4-in-1 Defining and Highlighting Brow Pencil! <br>\r\nThis multitasking brow pencil features a lighter and deeper brow shade to give your brows depth and dimension, plus an edge-definer and arch-highlighter to clean and shape your brows. Turn shapeless, flat-looking brows into defined, contoured brows, effortlessly.\r\n\r\nBrow Contour Pro is available in five shades for a wide range of hair colors and skin tones. The easy-to blend formula features up to 24 hours of long wear*, and is waterproof**.\r\n\r\n*Instrumental test on 20 women.\r\n**Instrumental test on 22 women.','A four-in-one defining and highlighting brow pencil to contour and carve out your perfect brow look.','produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder_15746.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder_15746.jpg\", \"produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder-2_80782.jpg\", \"produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder-3_79995.jpg\", \"produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder-4_43066.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2447,'Diamond Ampoule Sheet Mask Pack (10)','',90.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with One 