amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask-Pack-1_44576.jpg',NULL,50,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask-Pack-1_44576.jpg\", \"produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask-Pack-2_20513.jpg\", \"produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask-Pack-3_74695.jpg\", \"produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask-Pack-4_62625.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2448,'Nourishing Moisture Cream','',99.000,'● Dual functions with Anti-wrinkle & Whitening<br>\r\n● Helps manage Freckles (Spots) & Blemishes <br>\r\n● Skin Soothing, Regeneration, Elasticity, Moisturizing, Nutritional, Tone-up, Brightening & Skin Tone Improvement<br>\r\n● Natural Scent & Color (no artificial fragrance & color)<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination,  Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 50 g','KGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;am