mbination, Oily, Sensitive  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVolume : 60 ml\r\n','1. Apply sleeping mask across the face before bed. Gently rolling until vitamin capsules are absorbed completely &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Rinse off in the morning','produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-1_72311.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-1_72311.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-2_25838.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-3_39286.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-4_64787.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2453,'Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Body Lotion','',98.000,'Lighten up your skin with Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Body Lotion! <br>\r\nVita Collagen nourishing body lotion brightens up your skin complexion while rejuvenating. It hydrates your skin without sticky residue. <br>\r\n✔ It contains 12 Vitamins!\r\nVitamin A, B1, B2, B5, B6, B9, B12, C, E, G, H, K these 12 vitamins help to lighten your skin and dark spots. It will boost the radiance of your skin and help to get flawless skin. <br>\r\n✔ Natural Whitening Effect <br>\r\nThis vita collagen whitening body lotion gives you a natural whitening effect goes well with your skin tone. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 200 ml','After shower, take a proper amount of this product and evenly spread it on the skin. Gently