p;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Soak a cotton pad with toner then gently swipe it over your face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3.Apply two or three drops of serum to your face.Then evenly spread and massage it &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n[Cream] &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n1. Put a proper amount of cream into your hands &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Apply cream on your face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Dap your face to make absorb well &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; night, daily.','produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-1_61539.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-1_61539.jpg\", \"produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-2_84030.jpg\", \"produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-3_49801.jpg\", \"produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-4_37511.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2462,'Advanced Regenerating Eye Gel Patches (RETINOL)',NULL,98.000,'Anti-wrinkle with Retinol: Pure vitamin A, Retinol stimulates the metabolism, working to improve skin structure and elasticity, reduce wrinkles.<br>\r\n✧ Big patches to cover more: Larger pieces deliver intensive care to wider skin area than standard eye patches.<br>\r\n✧ Small patches for areas in care-need: Smaller pieces provide intensive care to more specific areas as smile, frown, and neck. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 pcs /102g','1. After washing your face, apply toner to prepare balanced skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Using an enclosed spatula, place the patches on the skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n -Big patches: Place the bigger patches on the skin around the eyes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n  -Larger pieces deliver intensive care to wider skin area than standard eye patches. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n  -Small patches: Place the smaller patches on more specific areas as smile, frown and neck. They penetrate deep and fast to reduce the look of aging signs. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Remove the patches after 20~30 minutes, and gently pat skin for better absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nYou can use it day and/or night- daily','produits/IMG_20221218_003755_(540_x_720_pixel)_78513.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221218_003755_(540_x_720_pixel)_78513.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_004355_(540_x_720_pixel)_15263.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_004216_(540_x_720_pixel)_34771.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_004141_(540_x_720_pixel)_85894.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2463,'Yuja Niacin Brightening Moisture Gel Cream','',111.000,'Containing as much as 90% yuja extract alongside ten kinds of vitamins and glacial water, this gel cream revitalizes, brightens, moisturizes and soothes skin while fading freckles and blemishes.\r\n<br>\r\nThe Some By Mi Yuja Niacin Brightening Moisture Gel Cream, contains 90% of Yuja Extract to nourish and moisturize the skin. Yuja is a type of citrus that is rich in vitamins and effective for brightening. Niacinamide helps to brighten dark spots and dull skin. While 10 kinds of vitamins revitalize the skin and glacial water provides a cooling effect. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily','Apply a proper amount along skin texture evenly and pat gently for better absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-1_34853.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-1_34853.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-2_78934.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-3_96357.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-4_48980.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2464,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Toner','',91.000,'A skin-nourishing toner contains 65% of Propolis that boosts skins moisture level while improving skin texture and restores its balance. It preps the skin after cleansing and maximizes the benefits of the steps that follow. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, dispense a moderate amount of toner on a cotton pad and wipe gently along skin texture &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Propolis-B5-1_64583.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Propolis-B5-1_64583.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-2_24792.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-3_17900.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-4_55028.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2465,'Yuja Niacin 30 Days Miracle Brightening Toner','',107.000,'A dual functional product: Whitening + Anti-wrinkle. A serum containing Yuja extract and niacinamide to diminish the appearance of blemishes in 30 days. <br>\r\n✧ It revitalises dull skin and ease off skin stress with 12 types of Vitamins. <br>\r\n✧ It prevents the forming of melanin with Glutathione and Arbutin. <br>\r\n✧ It contains 5% of Niacinamide to brighten up skin and 82% of Korean Yuja Extract for brightening and moisturising. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily','After cleansing, apply a little to a cotton pad and wipe your face. Or apply toner with patting actions. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n✘ It is recommended to not use it in the morning in sunny and hot days because it contains high concentration of vitamin C (Yuja)','produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-1_91260.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-1_91260.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-2_23593.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-3_15324.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-4_87423.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2466,'Bye Bye Blemish Vita Tox Brightening Bubble Cleanser','',89.000,'Some By Mi Vita Tox cleanser contains Vita Oxygen Bubb