p;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Snail Cream: Apply an adequate amount evenly over the face. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit_65570.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit_65570.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit-01_12488.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit-3_94410.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit-4_39795.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2468,'Yuja Niacin 30 Days Brightening Starter Kit','',150.000,'New Clinical Solution !! <br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✔ Whitening + anti-wrinkle <br>\r\n✔ Lightens the skin with glutathione and arbutin.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n• Toner: Contains 90% citrus extract to nourish and\r\nmoisturize the skin. Restores irritated skin with 12 types of vitamins and lotus flower extract. <br>\r\n• Serum: Contains 82% citrus extract for lightening and moisturizing.  Thanks to its light texture, the skin is easily absorbed and leaves the skin without a sticky feeling. <br>\r\n• Gel cream: Contains 90% citrus extract to nourish and moisturize the skin. Restores skin with 10 types of vitamins and cools the skin with ice water.<br>\r\n• Sleeping Mask: Contains 70% citrus extract to nourish and moisturize the skin. Moisturizes the skin with Aquaxyl and Fructan ™ and revitalizes the skin with 10 types of vitamins. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily','1. Use in the order of toner &rarr; serum &rarr; cream &rarr; sleeping mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Apply a proper amount of the toner, serum and cream on the face evenly.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Before going to sleep, apply a proper amount on the face evenly and leave it until next day morning.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Wash your face with lukewarm water on the next morning. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Yuja-Niaci