_92460.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM-1_92460.jpg\", \"produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM-2_79918.jpg\", \"produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM3_14535.jpg\", \"produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM-4_90621.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2471,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Serum','',104.000,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Serum is a nutritious serum especially designed for tired, unbalanced skin. <br> \r\nStarring propolis, royal jelly, honey, 24K gold, Vitamin B5, patented ingredient Truecica, ceramide and hyaluronic acid, this serum balances skin sebum levels, calms and fortifies skin to prevent breakouts and promote a healthy complexion. <br> \r\nIt helps with skin irritation, dehydration and tiredness to calm the skin and make it glowy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After using toner, apply an appropriate amount and spread gently across the entire face. Pat lightly until absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-1_44009.jpg',NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-1_44009.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-p_33907.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-2_81363.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-4_39761.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2472,'POWmade Brow Pomade Full-pigment brow pomade','',130.000,'36-hour brow pomade to fill, sculpt & define brows <br>\r\nWaterproof, smudge-proof formula won’t dry out! <br>\r\nBuilt in brush wiper for clean, controlled application <br>\r\nAvailable 4.5 - Neutral deep brown and 04 - Warm deep brown <br>','ggggggszss','produits/Benetint-Cheek-3_89368.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Benetint-Cheek-3_89368.jpg\", \"produits/Benetint-Cheek-1_25864.jpg\", \"produits/Benetint-Cheek-2_52155.jpg\", \"produits/Benetint-Cheek-4_60840.jpg\", \"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0000_18153.jpg\", \"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0002_62163.jpg\", \"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0001_88515.jpg\", \"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0002_26008.jpg\", \"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0001_78012.jpg\", \"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0000_26713.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2473,'POWmade Brow Pomade Full-pigment brow pomade 4.5',NULL,130.000,'♡ 36-hour* brow pomade to fill, sculpt & define brows <br>\r\n♡ Waterproof**, smudge-proof** formula won’t dry out***! <br>\r\n♡ Built-in brush wiper for clean, controlled application <br>\r\n<br>\r\nAvailable in <br>\r\n04 - Warm deep brown <br>\r\n4.5 - Neutral deep brown \r\n','Stress-free, mess-free! Dip your Dual-Ended Angled Eyebrow Brush (sold separately) into jar &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; wipe off excess product on built-in brush wiper. Stroke onto brows &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; blend with spoolie. Keep jar tightly closed when not in use. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nBEAUTY TIP: Use a lighter shade of Precisely, My Brow Pencil to add hair-like strokes to the front of your brow for a natural-looking ombre effect.','produits/IMG-20221125-WA0002_50676.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0002_50676.jpg\", \"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0001_42303.jpg\", \"produits/IMG-20221125-WA0000_60777.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09'