ting.','Offering up to 24 hours of strong, flexible hold, this invisible-finish shaping and setting gel tames unruly eyebrow hairs and locks in make up so that brows don&rsquo;t pull a disappearing act. The custom-moulded, dual-sided wand coats hairs from root to tip with the flake-free formula, making application effortless and long-lasting.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2478,'Benefit Rockateur Blush',NULL,156.000,'Pick up the beat with a rush of heat! Benefit Cosmetics rocking rose gold cheek powder gives a famously provocative flush that turns heads on-stage and off.<br>\r\n The crowd will go wild for it is sexy faceted design, accented in luxe gold. For an encore, the custom angled, dimensional brush gives rich, show-stopping payoff every time.<br>','Pick up the beat with a rush of heat! Benefit Cosmetic\'s rockin\' rose gold cheek powder gives a famously provocative flush that turns heads on-stage and off. The crowd will go wild for it\'s sexy faceted design, accented in luxe gold. For an encore, the custom angled, dimensional brush gives rich, show-stopping payoff every time.','produits/IMG_20230119_205215_(540_x_720_pixel)_24630.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_205215_(540_x_720_pixel)_24630.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205232_(540_x_720_pixel)_84790.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205241_(540_x_720_pixel)_43081.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205248_(540_x_720_pixel)_83288.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2479,'Benefit Hoola  Glow Bronzer',NULL,156.000,'An award winning <br> silky soft powder bronzer with a natural looking finish','An award-winning, silky-soft powder bronzer with a natural-looking matte finish','produits/IMG_20230119_210741_(540_x_720_pixel)_65334.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_210741_(540_x_720_pixel)_65334.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_210807_(540_x_720_pixel)_88591.jpg\"