p;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;  \r\n- Rinse with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day or night, once or twice a week','produits/IMG_20230115_013049_(540_x_720_pixel)_73642.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_013049_(540_x_720_pixel)_73642.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_013127_(540_x_720_pixel)_37390.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_013159_(540_x_720_pixel)_27280.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_013223_(540_x_720_pixel)_93231.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2491,'Collagen Boosting Secret Day Cream',NULL,126.000,'Collagen Day Cream not only hydrates the skin but also helps with wrinkle care and UV protection at once <br>\r\n✦ All-in-one product that helps to protect the skin from powerful UV rays with SPF50+ PA++++ while reducing wrinkles and pigmentation. <br>\r\n✦ Formulated with Collagen and Peptide to give firming, moisturizing and brightening effects, regenerate damaged skin and improve skin elasticity <br>\r\n✦ Contains 8 Hyaluronic Acid Complex that helps to prompt skin to make more collagen, hydrating dry skin and reduce wrinkles and fine lines. <br>\r\n✦ Non-sticky, lightweight texture adheres to the face highly without any greasy feeling. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nA new concept of skin care that combines UV PROTECTION and SKINCARE <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 ml','At the last step of skincare, take an appropriate amount. Apply gently onto the face and spread evenly. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it in the morning, daily.','produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-1_48783.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-1_48783.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-02_93624.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-2_83615.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-3_10323.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2492,'Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Sun Lotion',NULL,88.000,'Let your skin glow and moist with whitening UV protection <br>\r\nThis sun lotion contains 11 vitamins, Niacinamide, Hydrolyzed Collagen, and Hyalorunic Acid. It protects the skin barrier, prevents wrinkles and improves skin elasticity. Besides, it is anti inflammatory and antioxidant. It also whitens the skin, soothes, and strengthens it. <Br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 50 ml','At the last step of skincare, take an appropriate amount. Apply gently onto the face and spread evenly &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it in the morning, daily &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nGenerally, sunscreen / sunblock should be reapplied every two hours, especially after swimming or sweating. If you work indoors and sit away from windows, you may not need a second application. Be mindful of how often you step outside, though. Keep a spare bottle of sunscreen at your desk just to be safe.','produits/IMG_20221218_102019_(540_x_720_pixel)_73629.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221218_102019_(540_x_720_pixel)_73629.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_102036_(540_x_720_pixel)_67508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_102052_(540_x_720_pixel)_55552.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_102117_(540_x_720_pixel)_46088.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2493,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow #RD301',NULL,50.000,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow is a lip color that combines the high shine of a gloss and the moisturizing feel of an oil for cherry lips that look plump and juicy. It has an excellent adhesive power that fits lightly without smudging and stickiness. <br>\r\nJust glow like as a star!','Apply a moderate amount from inside to outside lips gently',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2494,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow #OR202',NULL,50.000,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow is a lip color that combines the high shine of a gloss and the moisturizing feel of an oil for cherry lips that look plump and juicy. It has an excellent adhesive power that fits lightly without smudging and stickiness. <br>\r\nJust glow like as a star!','Apply a moderate amount from inside to outside lips gently',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2495,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow #OR201',NULL,50.000,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow is a lip color that combines the high shine of a gloss and the moisturizing feel of an oil for cherry lips that look plump and juicy. It has an excellent adhesive power that fits lightly without smudging and stickiness. <br>\r\nJust glow like as a star!','Apply a moderate amount from inside to outside lips gently',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:09','2025-02-07 02:59:09',0,NULL),(2496,'Watsons Colour changeable lip balm Peach Scented',NULL,49.000,'The sweet peach fragrance is specially designed for gorgeous and healthy-looking lips, with unique colour changes from transparent to a peachy pink. It also moisturises, protects and soothes your lips.','Smoothly evenly on lips 2-3 times whenever required. The colour change effect depends on the individual pH of your lips','produits/IMG_20230122_234458_(540_x_720_pixel)_14071.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230122_234458_(540_x_720_pixel)_14071.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230122_234513_(540_x_720_pixel)_94733.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230122_234528_(540_x_720_pixel)_14698.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230122_234541_(540_x_720_pixel)_79416.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2497,'HOLIKA HOLIKA Heart Crush Glow Tint Air #BUBBLY',NULL,65.000,'Heart Crush Glow Tint Air is formulated with different moisturizing and nourishing ingredients for healthy-looking lips. It is infused with pure color pigments that deliver vibrant and long-lasting colors. The Bullet Tip makes it easier to control the amount used for a light, airy effect.','1. Apply an appropriate amount onto lips with a flat surface\r\n2. Blend the edges with the tip',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2498,'HOLIKA HOLIKA Water Drop Tint Bomb #10 Peach Water',NULL,65.000,'Holika Holika Water Drop Tint Bomb is a moisturizing lip tint that contains 40% refreshing, toning spring water that glides on the lips smoothly with vivid color payoff and watery light consistency.','Apply on the entire lips along the lips line or on the center of the lips in a tapping motion to express gardation',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2499,'HOLIKA HOLIKA Water Drop Tint Bomb #04 Grapefruit',NULL,65.000,'Holika Holika Water Drop Tint Bomb is a moisturizing lip tint that contains 40% refreshing, toning spring water that glides on the lips smoothly with vivid color payoff and watery light consistency.','Holika Holika Water Drop Tint Bomb is a moisturizing lip tint that contains 40% refreshing, toning spring water that glides on the lips smoothly with vivid color payoff and watery light consistency.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2500,'SKINFOOD Rice Mask Wash Off',NULL,108.000,'Brighten and soften with nutrient-rich Rice! This classic mask wash-off featuring Rice Bran Water packed with Vitamin E and antioxidants gently exfoliate the skin while brightening and softening the skin for a clear and hydrated complexion. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, massage gently into damp skin, or mix with water/cosmetic water and apply. Avoid skin around the eyes and lips. After 10-15 minutes, rinse with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it once a week',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2501,'Sebum Soak Blur Pact',NULL,75.000,'Sebum Soak Blur Pact is a multi tone-up pact that perfectly blurs your pores. Lightweight, fine-particle powder in peachy color provides natural tone-up. <br>\r\n✾ Multi tone-up pact <br>\r\n✾ Perfectly blurring your pores <br>\r\n✾ Fresh feeling after sebum absorption <br> \r\n✾ Super-adhesive smooth powder <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Put an appropriate amount on the built-in puff and gently pat onto the face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nIt can be used alone after skin care or at the stage of makeup &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;be&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/IMG_20221224_164128_(540_x_720_pixel)_28346.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221224_164128_(540_x_720_pixel)_28346.png\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_164150_(540_x_720_pixel)_90224.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_164238_(540_x_720_pixel)_25121.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_164355_(540_x_720_pixel)_23134.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2502,'Sebum Soak Pact',NULL,60.000,'Powder made up of sebum-friendly ingredients absorbs sebum quickly to create soft skin. <br>\r\n✾ Smart pact that only absorbs sebum <br>\r\n✾ Non-drying sebum control <br>\r\n✾ Secret to bright glossy skin <br>\r\n✾ Sebum-friendly ingredients <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','Put an appropriate amount on the built-in puff and gently pat onto the face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nIt can be used alone after skin care or at the stage of makeup &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;be&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/IMG_20221224_164459_(540_x_720_pixel)_39203.jpg',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221224_164459_(540_x_720_pixel)_39203.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_190541_(540_x_720_pixel)_48664.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_212315_(540_x_720_pixel)_95806.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_212427_(540_x_720_pixel)_28798.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2503,'Better Lips-Talk #RD313 Wannaba Red',NULL,65.000,'Velvet Lips-Talk gives vivid color and adheres lightly to the lips with matte finish. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ High pigmented lipstick with various vivid, clear color and magnetic case. <br>\r\n✓ Provides smooth application that gently adheres on the lips without any lumps. <br>\r\n✓ Forms moisture-protective barrier to keep the lips moisturized.','Gently apply a moderate amount on the entire lips',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2504,'Face Blur Smoothing',NULL,150.000,'This liquid primer instantly smooths complexion and creates a flawless base for your makeup while also protecting skin from free radicals with fitted SPF. The Smoothing version is fitted with Baby Pixel powder, Cover Powder and Airy Skin powder for a bright, pinkish finish that minimizes pores. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n● A lightweight makeup base that covers skin flaws, smooths and brightens your complexion with UV protection. <br>\r\n● It helps brighten the skin, reduce wrinkles and block UV rays with SPF33 PA++. <br>\r\n● Baby Pixel Powder and Cover Powder helps smooth your skin and minimizes the appearance of pores. <br>\r\n● Airy Skin Powder maintains a radiant and refined skin texture with a shimmery coral base. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','Before face makeup, apply an appropriate amount on face and spread evenly &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230110_021031_(540_x_720_pixel)_19618.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230110_021031_(540_x_720_pixel)_19618.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230110_021057_(540_x_720_pixel)_32694.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230110_021359_(540_x_720_pixel)_60808.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230110_021534_(540_x_720_pixel)_20200.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2505,'Zero Sebum Drying Powder',NULL,52.000,'The Etude House Zero Sebum Drying Powder, a translucent mineral powder, contains 80% mineral that controls sebum production, minimizes pores, and makes skin look clear and matte without clumps. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After applying skin care or makeup, dab the product on areas with excess oil &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\nFOR GREASY HAIR: Apply it on roots and shake off residue for fresher-looking hair &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\nUSE AS EYE PRIMER: Apply this powder on your eyelids for your eye makeup to stay without smudging','produits/IMG_20221224_144321_(540_x_720_pixel)_74749.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221224_144321_(540_x_720_pixel)_74749.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_144609_(540_x_720_pixel)_85748.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_144548_(540_x_720_pixel)_20769.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_144507_(540_x_720_pixel)_48037.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2506,'Fixing Tint #01 Analog Rose',NULL,54.000,'Guaranteed to stay put on your lips all day without rubbing off on face masks, this lip tint comes in a matte yet non-drying formula and boasts a lightweight texture that adheres perfectly to lips <br>\r\nApply and dry for 60 seconds, then you’re good to go!','For a full cover, apply a moderate amount along the edge of lips and then fill in the inner part &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;