amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night','produits/IMG_20221225_230035_(540_x_720_pixel)_47211.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221225_230035_(540_x_720_pixel)_47211.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_230053_(540_x_720_pixel)_59892.png\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_230106_(540_x_720_pixel)_34918.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_230130_(540_x_720_pixel)_59059.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2609,'Super Volcanic Peel Off Mask 2X',NULL,130.000,'Super Volcanic Peel Off Mask 2X is a no-rinse peel off clay mask to remove impurities in the pores and leaves skin clean and smooth. Infused with Jeju Volcanic Cluster Spear ™, which has twice the strength of sebum absorption than the previous Volcanic Cleansing Foam, to remove even the finest dust in the pores. This gel-textured formula tightly coats the skin and gives a cooling effect to the pores, lifting away any excess sebum or impurities for smoother skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily','1. After cleansing, spread evenly on a dry face avoiding the eye and lip area, or on the desired spot &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. When the skin feels tight and the content is dry after 20-30 minutes, peel off slowly from the top &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n* Use after applying lotion for milder peel-off &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse 1-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20221225_232929_(540_x_720_pixel)_73538.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221225_232929_(540_x_720_pixel)_73538.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_232947_(540_x_720_pixel)_54042.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_233002_(540_x_720_pixel)_70456.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_233026_(540_x_720_pixel)_26296.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2610,'Plastikos HIFU Lifting Cushion #21',NULL,220.000,'Plastikos - HIFU Lifting Cushion is the perfect blend of skincare and weightless coverage in one.\r\nNever messy or cakey, Plastikos Cushion is loaded with botanicals that hydrate, protect and brighten the skin for a naturally flawless finish that lasts all day while protecting the skin from UV rays. This unique Korean cushion technology pumps the content only when it’s pressed, keeping the product fresher longer. It provides a lightweight yet excellent coverage for a flawless complexion and Conceals the appearance of pores, blemishes and imperfections while staying put for long. Besides, it is infused with oil-absorbing powder to leave your complexion shine-free with a silky-soft and semi-matte finish. This compact also has a refill. <br>\r\nAvailable in two beautiful shades <br>\r\n#21Whitening <br>\r\n#23Natural <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n➤ Brand new medical beauty products <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Breakthrough technology enhances the V-Lift <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Instant lifting and continuous improvement of contour powder <br>\r\n \r\n➤ Tighten pores, moisturize, lifting, tighten, rejuvenate <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Sunscreen SFP50 <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Strong makeup holding power: color will not leave on the surgical mask <br>\r\n\r\n➤ High concealing power:  Perfectly cover pores, fine lines and other skin imperfections <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','At the end of your skincare routine, press the sponge on the built-in puff to soak up a desired amount of the content and apply over the face using a tapping motion. After each use, be sure to keep the compact closed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nTo insert the refill, flip the product over and push the bottom out with both thumbs. Carefully align and press in the refill.','produits/IMG_20230129_021128_(540_x_720_pixel)_53917.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_021128_(540_x_720_pixel)_53917.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021145_(540_x_720_pixel)_46271.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021201_(540_x_720_pixel)_58409.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021211_(540_x_720_pixel)_25844.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021223_(540_x_720_pixel)_28459.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021240_(540_x_720_pixel)_72707.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2611,'Plastikos Face Lifting Mist Puchu Puchu',NULL,140.000,'Tone and hydrate your skin in one step with our multi-functional Lifting Mist. Formulated with one of nature’s most powerfully hydrating and skin-brightening ingredients, Puchu Puchu Lifting Mist holds incredible water-retention properties that delivers deep moisture to the skin, instantly lifts and tightens, and gives your complexion a healthy, plump appearance. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, spray the mist gently all over your face. Follow with your serum and moisturiser.\r\nCan also be sprayed throughout the day to refresh makeup and hydrate the skin.\r\n*Recommended with Plastikos - HIFU Lifting Cushion \r\n( Perfect Combination )',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2612,'Blush Boss Cheek Palette',NULL,400.000,'Palette includes: <br>\r\n<br>\r\nHoola matte powder bronzer for face (full-size) <br>\r\nDandelion baby-pink brightening face powder (full-size) <br>\r\nDandelion Twinkle nude-pink powder highlighter & luminizer (full-size) <br>\r\nGALifornia sunny golden-pink blush (full-size) <br>','Palette includes: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nHoola matte powder bronzer for face (full-size) &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nDandelion baby-pink brightening face powder (full-size) &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nDandelion Twinkle nude-pink powder highlighter &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; luminizer (full-size) &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nGALifornia sunny golden-pink blush (full-size) &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/palette_bb_28740.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/palette_bb_28740.png\", \"produits/palette_43758.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_211900_(540_x_720_pixel)_55491.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_211913_(540_x_720_pixel)_24834.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2613,'Vanity Flare Nude Eyeshadow Palette',NULL,197.000,'This everyday neutral eyeshadow palette features 12 powder eyeshadows in 3 finishes: soft matte, satin, and shimmer. These rich eyeshadows are easy to blend & build, perfect for pairing together to create custom, natural-looking eyeshadow looks! It’s your NEW go-to palette for day-time neutral eyeshadow looks… plus it’s portable & purse friendly! Includes Benefit’s Signature Tips & Tricks with guided eyeshadow application steps. Palette features built-in mirror for on-the-go application.','For a base, start with a soft matte shade. To add dimension, layer on a deeper shade. To create an eye-opening effect, press any shimmer shade onto the center of the eyelid!\r\nTo make the shadows really POP, apply them wet to intensify pigment!','produits/fanity_flare_18455.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/fanity_flare_18455.jpg\", \"produits/flare_51113.jpg\", \"produits/vanity_flare_98699.jpg\", \"produits/vanity_34328.jpg\", \"produits/van_fla_23263.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2614,'Benefit Dallas Rosy Bronze Blush',NULL,156.000,'Say ‘Howdy’ to a NEW Dallas!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGiddy-up, gorgeous! Benefit’s fan fave Dal