t_29011.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2617,'Goof Proof Brow Pencil 2.75',NULL,130.000,'Presto…everyone’s an expert with this super easy filling & shaping eyebrow pencil. It features a custom, non-sharpen “goof-proof” tip, soft color and a glide-on formula for easy & fast brow filling. <br> \r\n♡ 12-hour* waterproof** formula <br>\r\n♡ 95% said it was easy to fill and shape brows*** <br>\r\n♡94% said it gives beautiful brows on the first try***','Presto&hellip;everyone&rsquo;s an expert with this super easy filling &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; shaping eyebrow pencil. It features a custom, non-sharpen &ldquo;goof-proof&rdquo; tip, soft color and a glide-on formula for easy &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; fast brow filling. Comes complete with built-in blending spoolie-brush and signature Tips &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; Tricks! &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/et_goof_proof_model_now_to_wow_275_33362.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/et_goof_proof_model_now_to_wow_275_33362.jpg\", \"produits/03-goof-proof-brow-pencil-shade-2-75-swatch_10041.jpg\", \"produits/et_goof_proof_model_aspirational_after_shade_2_7_5_69835.jpg\", \"produits/410OaFvt4aL_90542.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2618,'Mini Goof Proof Brow Pencil (5 - Warm black-brown)',NULL,65.000,'Presto…everyone’s an expert with this super easy filling & shaping eyebrow pencil. It features a custom, non-sharpen “goof-proof” tip, soft color and a glide-on formula for easy & fast brow filling. <br>\r\n\r\n♡ 12-hour* waterproof** formula <br>\r\n♡ 95% said it was easy to fill & shape brows*** <br>\r\n♡ 94% said it gives beautiful brows on the first try***','♡ 12-hour* waterproof** formula\r\n♡ 9