00_94330.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2621,'Diorshow Iconic Overcurl Mascara',NULL,150.000,'Diorshow Iconic Overcurl mascara has been reinvented to give eye makeup even more spectacular volume and curl. Designed for all types of lashes, it defines, coats and fans out lashes to the extreme in just one sweep for 24 hours of wear. <br>\r\nCreate glamorously curled lashes day after day. Inspired by professional curling irons, the curved brush styles every lash from bottom to top. High-precision ingredients provide intense definition and hold without clumping or smudging. Creating instant oversized volume and curl, this evolutionary formula nourishes your lashes with a unique lipid complex that strengthens and smooths for long-lasting vitality!!\r\n','Apply the mascara vertically with the concave side of the brush, then boost and set the curl by pressing the brush against the upper lashes for an eyelash-curler effect.','produits/51du31jbIsL_43150.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/51du31jbIsL_43150.jpg\", \"produits/63017131460675bfa8171bd12daf6542_40403.jpg\", \"produits/Diorshow-Iconic-Overcurl_84226.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2622,'Precisely, My Brow Pencil',NULL,130.000,'Oh my WOW…precise & defined eyebrows! This ultra-fine eyebrow pencil draws incredibly natural-looking, hair-like strokes that last 12 budge-proof hours.* A few strokes of the rich yet blendable color will transform brows from shapeless & undefined to filled  & defined eyebrows. <br>\r\nAvailable in <br>\r\n3 - Warm light brown','Oh my WOW&hellip;precise &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; defined eyebrows! This ultra-fine eyebrow pencil draws incredibly natural-looking, hair-like strokes that last 12 budge-proof hours.* A few strokes of the rich yet blendable color will transform brows from shapeless &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; undefined to filled &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; defined eyebrows.','produits/04-precisely-my-brow-shade-3-now-wow_72721.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/04-precisely-my-brow-shade-3-now-wow_72721.jpg\", \"produits/05-precisely-my-brow-shade-3-5-now-wow_89496.jpg\", \"produits/05-precisely-my-brow-shade-5-now-wow_88990.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2623,'Brow Contour Pro',NULL,177.000,'What it is: <br>\r\nA four-in-one defining and highlighting brow pencil to contour and carve out your perfect brow look. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nWhat it does: <br>\r\nDefine and highlight your brows with Benefit’s new Brow Contour Pro 4-in-1 Defining and Highlighting Brow Pencil. This multitasking brow pencil features a lighter and deeper brow shade to give your brows depth and dimension, plus an edge-definer and arch-highlighter to clean and shape your brows. Turn shapeless, flat-looking brows into defined, contoured brows, effortlessly. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nAvailable in <br>\r\nBrown Black Deep','What it is:\r\nA four-in-one defining and highlighting brow pencil to contour and carve out your perfect brow look.\r\n\r\nWhat it does:\r\nDefine and highlight your brows with Benefit&rsquo;s new Brow Contour Pro 4-in-1 Defining and Highlighting Brow Pencil. This multitasking brow pencil features a lighter and deeper brow shade to give your brows depth and dimension, plus an edge-definer and arch-highlighter to clean and shape your brows. Turn shapeless, flat-looking brows into defined, contoured brows, effortlessly.\r\n\r\nBrow Contour Pro is available in five shades for a wide range of hair colors and skin tones. The easy-to blend formula features up to 24 hours of long wear*, and is waterproof**.','produits/41exRj+WwwL_AC_SY780__73014.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/41exRj+WwwL_AC_SY780__73014.jpg\", \"produits/67942d94eb9326b2c161d4d724f632f31