;amp;amp;amp; hairs, creating natural-looking fullness. The custom, tiny, tapered brush provides easy &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; mess-proof application. Poof...like magic, fuller-looking brows will appear!\r\n\r\n94% said brows looked visibly thicker*\r\nvolumizes, tames &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; tints brows\r\nnatural-looking &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; buildable\r\nwater-resistant &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; long-wearing\r\nsame cult-fave Gimme Brow&hellip;updated ingredients','produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-cool-grey-now-wow_62595.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-cool-grey-now-wow_62595.jpg\", \"produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-shade-2-now-wow_69313.jpg\", \"produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-shade-3-75-now-wow_35469.jpg\", \"produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-shade-4-5-now-wow_60364.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2626,'Real Vita C Ampoule',NULL,98.000,'Real Vita C Ampoule is a gentle yet effective serum to help restore skin\'s youthful glow and minimise the appearance of hyperpigmentation and wrinkles. It is Formulated to rejuvenate the skin and reduce the look of acne scars/ pigmentation for a clearer skin tone and firmer, healthier skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVolume : 15 ml','1.Apply 2~3 drops on both cheekbones or other desired areas &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2.Gently spread out from cheeks to forehead and chin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3.Gently massage and pat lightly for better absorption','produits/0007432_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_46371.jpeg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0007432_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_46371.jpeg\", \"produits/0007433_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_92495.jpeg\", \"produits/0007434_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_68635.jpeg\", \"produits/0007435_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_46365.jpeg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2627,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Ampoule',NULL,104.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Ampoule is a highly concentrated serum infused hyaluronic acid to hydrate, plump, soothe and support the skin moisture barrier. This lightweight ampoule absorbs quickly into skin, and is perfect for babes with dry, rough, dehydrated or flaky skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 30 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount on desired skin area. Evenly spread and gently massage for absorption.','produits/0007301_k-secret-hyaluronic-acid-secret-ampoule_76104.jpeg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0007301_k-secret-hyaluronic-acid-secret-ampoule_76104.jpeg\", \"produits/0007302_k-secret-hyaluronic-acid-secret-ampoule_61066.jpeg\", \"produits/0007305_k-secret-hyaluronic-acid-secret-ampoule_80920.jpeg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2628,'Collagen Boosting Secret Ampoule',NULL,119.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Ampoule is an anti-aging booster that rejuvenates your skin by preventing the formation of wrinkles and reducing their appearance. It target wrinkles, hydrates, soothes irritation and redness, brightens and strengthens skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVolume : 30 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount on desired skin area. Evenly spread and gently massage for absorption.','produits/0007306_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_42985.jpeg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0007306_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_42985.jpeg\", \"produits/0007307_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_20874.jpeg\", \"produits/0007308_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_84658.jpeg\", \"produits/0007309_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_38876.jpeg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2629,'The Body Shop - Revitalizing Facial Roller',NULL,125.000,'This Y-Shaped Sculpting Roller is the perfect accompaniment to your Korean skin care routine! This gorgeous roller is designed with two massaging roller balls to help relax facial tension, while lifting and tightening the skin. Intended to mimic the effects of a professional deep-kneading facial massage, this tool will sculpt and firm every curve and contour of your face. Regular use can visibly stimulate, revive and tighten tired skin, and help with the overall improvement of your complexion.','As these products are fragile, please handle with care.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nAfter applying your skin care products, gently roll over your skin in an outward and upwards direction along the contours of your face for 5-10 minutes daily.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nTo clean the roller, simply wipe the surface with a damp towel and dry afterwards or just wash it and let it dry afterwards','produits/51BECfj9kEL_26590.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/51BECfj9kEL_26590.jpg\", \"produits/51QvwS+n6LL_27961.jpg\", \"produits/body_shop_twin_ball_revitalising_facial_massager__face_roller__massage_1548776545_6662bcc5_progressive_78308.jpg\", \"produits/Facial_Massager_32565.jpg\", \"produits/OOL_FACIAL_ROLLER_2019_1_INRSDPS947_42711.jpg\", \"produits/51QvwS+n6LL_58377.jpg\", \"produits/body_shop_twin_ball_revitalising_facial_massager__face_roller__massage_1548776545_6662bcc5_progressive_43957.jpg\", \"produits/Facial_Massager_56692.jpg\", \"produits/OOL_FACIAL_ROLLER_2019_1_INRSDPS947_34395.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2630,'HUDA BEAUTY Empowered Eyeshadow Palette',NULL,360.000,'The ultimate everyday palette! Own your power with this luxurious line-up of buttery-smooth golds, coppers, browns, and neutrals in a variety of textures including intensely pigmented mattes, creamy gel-liner hybrids, foiled chrome metallics, AND a blingy wet-look shimmer. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nEffortlessly easy to apply, build, and blend, this intensely pigmented palette is perfect for creating your everyday beat, a dramatic smoky eye, a rich metallic look, and so much more, your options are LIMITLESS! Simply use a brush or your fingertips to apply; get ready to feel inspired and look confident. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe outer packaging of this palette is FSC certified and recyclable. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nScan the QR code embedded on the front of the palette for exclusive content from Huda!','Simply use a brush or your fingertips to apply; get ready to feel inspired and look confident. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/Empowered-Stylized0364-Palette_92754.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Empowered-Stylized0364-Palette_92754.jpg\", \"produits/huda-kattan-empowered-1024x683_86422.jpg\", \"produits/s2617744-av-9-zoom_70011.jpg\", \"produits/s2617744-av-10-zoom_30685.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2631,'BHA Blackhead Power Liquid',NULL,111.000,'BHA & Niacinamide exfoliating liquid for gentle exfoliation and oil control. Suggested for mid-level acid users. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBENEFITS <br>\r\n\r\n• Clear clogged pores <br>\r\n• Prevent breakouts & reduce marks from spots <br>\r\n• Balance oil production <br>\r\n\r\nTARGETS <br>\r\n• Clogged, large pores <br>\r\n• Black dots and blackheads <br>\r\n• T-zone care <br>\r\n• Oily skin prone to break outs','After cleansing, use in the skin, toner, or essence step. If used as toner, make sure the liquid is fully absorbed before applying next step skincare products. Recommend to use 2-3 times in a week, and gradually build up the usage according to the skin condition.','produits/IMG_54141671140203469_47836.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_54141671140203469_47836.png\", \"produits/IMG_54131671140203469_59026.png\", \"produits/IMG_54121671140203465_53925.png\", \"produits/IMG_52601671140183073_82662.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2632,'Bath and Body Works Pure Wonder Fine Fragrance Mist',NULL,85.000,'❀ What it smells like: a dreamy, warm, joyfully bright delight. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n❀ Fragrance notes: iced rosé, star jasmine and warm white amber.','Spray on the right points',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2633,'Victoria\'s Secret Angel Gold Fine Fragrance Lotion',NULL,65.000,'Back for a limited time only. Wrap yourself in your signature fragrance. Our fast-absorbing, skin-nourishing lotion adds the perfect touch of scent. Steal the spotlight with a runway-worthy mix of sparkling bergamot, lush gardenia and musk.\r\n\r\nTip: For a long-lasting fragrance experience, pair with matching Eau de Parfum or Fine Fragrance Mist.\r\n\r\nFragrance type: Fruity floral\r\nNotes: Sparkling bergamot, lush gardenia, musk\r\nSilky, fragrant softness & scent\r\n250 ml/8.4 oz.\r\nDomestic','Spray on the right points',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2634,'Michael Kors Maple Small Satchel Pink',NULL,450.000,'Effortless elegance meets modern utility in the Michael Kors Mirella Tote Bag. This chic satchel boasts a sleek silhouette crafted from luxurious pebbled leather, exuding understated sophistication. Measuring 12\" x 9\" x 4\", the spacious interior, complete with multiple compartments and pockets, effortlessly organizes your essentials, while the detachable shoulder strap offers versatile carrying options. Adorned with the iconic Michael Kors logo and signature gold hardware, this tote bag is a testament to timeless style and impeccable craftsmanship. Embrace the perfect blend of functionality and fashion with the Michael Kors Mirella Tote Bag.\r\nKey Features:\r\n * Crafted from premium pebbled leather\r\n * Spacious interior with multiple compartments and pockets\r\n * Detachable shoulder strap for versatile carrying\r\n * Iconic Michael Kors logo and signature gold hardware\r\n * Effortless elegance and modern utility\r\n * Dimensions: 12\" x 9\" x 4\"\r\nElevate your everyday style with the Michael Kors Mirella Tote Bag.','Djdjd',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2635,'Bath and Body Works Fiji Sunshine Guava Tini Fine Fragrance Mist',NULL,75.000,'❀ What it smells like: an inspiring flight through sweet, floral spring air. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n❀ Fragrance notes: raspberry nectar, iris petals and airy vanilla.','Spray on the right points',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2636,'Bath and Body Works In The Stars Fine Fragrance Mist',NULL,85.000,'★ What it smells like: a sweet, sparkling wish upon a star in the middle of the forest clearing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n★ Fragrance notes: starflower, sandalwood musk, sugared tangelo, white agarwood and radiant amber.','Spray',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2637,'Bath and Body Works Into The Night Fine Fragrance Mist',NULL,85.000,'* What it smells like: a timeless, feminine, alluring night on the town. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n* Fragrance notes: raspberry noir, amber crystals, velvety rose petals, creamy patchouli and mocha musk.','Spray',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2638,'Perfect 9 Repair Serum EX',NULL,300.000,'A complete anti-aging serum for 9 signs of skin aging. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵Wrinkle care and whitening effect <br>\r\nThis repair serum, containing 9 active ingredients from the Jeju elixir complex™, enhances your skin\'s texture. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵Solution for 9 signs of aging skin <br>\r\nPerfect repair for dryness, wrinkles, flakiness, darkening, blemishes, enlarged pores, and reduced skin elasticity. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount thoroughly onto the face and neck, then gently smooth for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230115_202058_(540_x_720_pixel)_77661.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_202058_(540_x_720_pixel)_77661.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202120_(540_x_720_pixel)_78792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202110_(540_x_720_pixel)_77996.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202206_(540_x_720_pixel)_36529.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2639,'Collagen by Watsons Hydro Balance Refreshing Foam Cleanser',NULL,120.000,'Collagen by Watsons Hydro Balance Cleansing Foam  is a mild deep cleanser with a soft and creamy foam to provide deep cleansing for the removal of dirt and impurities leaving skin supple and refreshed. It brings the glow back to dull and tired looking skin, promotes firmer skin and prevent the visible signs of ageing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Apply an appropriate amount on your palm and form a rich lather with water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Gently massage the foam onto your face and rinse thoroughly with water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2640,'Collagen By Watsons Hydro Balance Active Toner',NULL,120.000,'Collagen by Watsons Hydro Balance features Collume , an award-winning biodesigned Vegan Collagen that is 20x more powerful* than traditional Marine Collagen to help increase skin firmness and elasticity. It deeply rejuvenates your skin with innovative hydrating ingredients and an advanced Smart Water Replenisher that strengthens the skin-barrier to optimise its moisture-sebum balance and lock in moisture, leaving skin feeling energised and revitalised. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, put an appropriate amount on a cotton puff or hands and gently apply to your face. Pat skin with your palms until fully absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2641,'Secret Key Rose Floral Softening Toner',NULL,105.000,'Secret Key Rose Floral Softening Toner is a unique concentrated toner that locks in moisture, soothe and soften skin, while treating uneven skin tone and hyperpigmentation with a natural rose fragrance that helps balance your emotions and relax your senses. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After