phatic drainage for smoother-looking skin. Our Gua Sha Facial Tools are crafted from natural Rose Quartz gemstones, metaphysically known for increasing self-love. <br>\r\nUsing Rose Quartz Gua Sha daily can help to: <br>\r\n+ Improve the appearance of elasticity of the skin <br>\r\n+ Reduce the appearance of puffiness and fine lines <br>\r\n+ Ease facial muscle tension <br>\r\n+ Help facial oils and moisturizers to absorb better into the skin when massaged in with a Gua Sha Tool','Watch a video','produits/IMG_20230103_231127_(540_x_720_pixel)_34827.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230103_231127_(540_x_720_pixel)_34827.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230103_231223_(540_x_720_pixel)_43848.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230103_231422_(540_x_720_pixel)_60883.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230103_232601_(540_x_720_pixel)_93642.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2664,'Too faced peach perfect foundation warm nude',NULL,160.000,'Peach Perfect Foundation is infused with refreshing peach and sweet fig milk. <br>\r\nThis liquid foundation is designed using the exclusive Comfort Matte formula that provides 14-hour wear. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe\'re reinventing mattes with this foundation that delivers a smooth, photogenic finish in a comfortable, velvety, soft-focus texture. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n-Non -oily <br>\r\n-14-hour hold -Controls\r\nexcess sebum <br>\r\n-Photogenic <br>\r\n-Modular coverage <br>\r\n-Anti-transfer <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types.','Apply your foundation with your fingertips or with a sponge. Start at the center of the face and work down and out across the forehead','produits/IMG_20230105_113604_(540_x_720_pixel)_97745.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230105_113604_(540_x_720_pixel)_97745.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_113627_(540_x_720_pixel)_61113.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_113653_(540_x_720_pixel)_26229.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_113841_(540_x_720_pixel)_14284.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2665,'Plump &amp;amp;amp; Prime Face Plumping Primer Serum',NULL,240.000,'This face serum is an express plumping, firming and filling treatment. Prepare, fill and add volume to your skin for a firmer and lifted effect result thanks to this product. The skin is instantly plumped and hydrated and cheekbones and jawline seem lifted after three days.\r\n<br>\r\nA blend of plumping actives and a superstar peptide help reduce the look of fine lines and wrinkles. They improve texture and blur pores for smoother looking skin. The cheekbones appear fuller and the jawline reshaped. <br>\r\n♡ When used regularly, this base provides skin care <br>\r\n✔ Superstar peptide reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. <br>\r\n✔ The blend of actives plumps the skin with a blend of ingredients like St. John\'s Wort, Hydrolyzed Rice Extract and Vitamin C. <br>\r\n♡ The perfect base for applying makeup <br>\r\n✔ The exceptionally smooth texture of the serum makes it easy to apply makeup. <br>\r\n✔ Its light, milky formula instantly absorbs into the skin and gives it a natural glow. ','Apply in the morning before your make-up and in the evening when taking care of your skin. First shake the bottle and then apply the product twice a day for your skin to look more radiant.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nShake before use.\r\nApply two squirts of Plump &amp;amp;amp;amp; Prime to your clean fingertips and sweep the serum over your face and neck, massaging in from the center in an upward motion. Leave on for 2 minutes before applying other facial care products.','produits/IMG_20230105_125515_(540_x_720_pixel)_12001.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230105_125515_(540_x_720_pixel)_12001.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_125548_(540_x_720_pixel)_27341.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_125608_(540_x_720_pixel)_84913.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_113841_(540_x_720_pixel)_73052.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-0