;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20230129_010313_(540_x_720_pixel)_49384.jpg',NULL,16,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_010313_(540_x_720_pixel)_49384.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_010334_(540_x_720_pixel)_57362.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_010350_(540_x_720_pixel)_66098.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_010359_(540_x_720_pixel)_49456.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2668,'Basic Snail Skincare',NULL,220.000,'✵COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence:<br>\r\nThis essence protects the skin from moisture loss while keeping skin texture smooth. This contains 96% of Snail Secretion Filtrate which keeps your skin moisturized all day while bringing back skin’s vitality. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream: <br>\r\n\r\n94% of Snail Secretion Filtrate makes your skin nourished, hydrated, and healthy. The cream is safe for usage on the skin, consisting of excellent skin-activation components that treat irritated skin and improve uneven skin tone.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','❃ COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\r\n\r\nIn the essence stage, take a proper amount of essence and gently pat on your face for absorption.\r\n\r\n❃ COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream\r\n\r\nTake a proper amount of cream on your palm and gently pat on your face for absorption.','produits/0001176_cosrx-snail-moisture-combo-cosrx-yellow-combo_750_76094.jpeg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0001176_cosrx-snail-moisture-combo-cosrx-yellow-combo_750_76094.jpeg\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_224146_(540_x_720_pixel)_15083.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_224203_(540_x_720_pixel)_48573.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_224217_(540_x_720_pixel)_73736.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2669,'My Lash Serum',NULL,36.000,'My Lash Serum promotes strong and healthy lashes by preventing lashes from not falling from the roots. This clear, transparent formula contains Biotin, an essential component that supports hair health, which is also used in shampoo and supplements to strengthen hair. With a mascara brush as an applicator, this screw brush type delivers the serum to the lashes and roots thoroughly.','After your night skincare routine, apply and brush the serum from the lash roots towards the tips of your lashes. Be careful to avoud the content from entering your eyes.','produits/IMG_20230109_074755_(540_x_720_pixel)_31301.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230109_074755_(540_x_720_pixel)_31301.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074811_(540_x_720_pixel)_68045.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074841_(540_x_720_pixel)_84792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_075352_(540_x_720_pixel)_49574.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074755_(540_x_720_pixel)_81793.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074811_(540_x_720_pixel)_56940.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074841_(540_x_720_pixel)_13857.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_075352_(540_x_720_pixel)_48533.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2670,'AHA BHA PHA 30 DAYS MIRACLE ACNE CLEAR FOAM',NULL,107.000,'AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Acne Clear Foam is an acne-clearing cleanser to help refine skin texture and control excessive oil. Formulated with AHA, BHA and PHA to remove dead skin cells and clear the pores, while Truecica™ calms the skin during cleansing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Dispense an appropriate amount of the cleanser, and rub your hands together to make a rich foam. Apply to face and massage gently. Rinse off with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20230116_013447_(540_x_720_pixel)_18333.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230116_013447_(540_x_720_pixel)_18333.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_013528_(540_x_720_pixel)_23638.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_013845_(540_x_720_pixel)_95741.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_013901_(540_x_720_pixel)_29943.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_014049_(540_x_720_pixel)_58781.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2671,'Honey And Milk Lip Oil',NULL,44.000,'The Apieu Honey & Milk Lip Oil is a lip oil infused with nourishing and moisturizing ingredients, including honey and milk to promote 