palette consists of nine dazzling colors in matte and glitter finishes, along with a powdery blush, to create versatile looks. The buildable formula blends naturally onto the eyelids for a watercolor-like effect. <br>\r\n01 Cream Latte - Matte base colour like soft milk and soft cream <br>\r\n02 Summer Cool - Cool toned pink shimmer <br>\r\n03 Brown Pepper - Brown and silver shimmery pearl <br>\r\n04 Watercolour Coral - Matte beige coral with silver pearl <br>\r\n05 Pink Banzzak - Big glitters <br>\r\n06 Sweet Milk Tea - Matte milk tea brown for shading <br> \r\n07 Sparkling Rose - Glitter dazzling with coral, rose, pink, gold and silver pearls <br>\r\n08 Pink Beam - Pink pearl shades <br>\r\n09 Ice Cocoa - Cool toned matte cocoa for shading <br>\r\n10 Summer Greeting - Matte pink with a tinge of cool purple','1. Apply a base shadow all over your eye lid.\r\n\r\n2. Apply the color that you want to stand out on your eye line, outer edges of your eyes, or use it as a gradation shade.\r\n\r\n3. Use sparkling glitter shade to highlight the inner corner of your eyes, water line, brow bone, or other areas that you want to brighten up.','produits/IMG_20230115_144440_(540_x_720_pixel)_19157.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_144440_(540_x_720_pixel)_19157.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_144454_(540_x_720_pixel)_79210.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_144506_(540_x_720_pixel)_45708.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_144700_(540_x_720_pixel)_20800.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2680,'Beauty of Joseon Relief Sun : Rice + Probiotics',NULL,110.000,'Beauty of Joseon Relief Sun : Rice + Probiotics is a lightweight and moisturising skin protector that applies comfortably on skin without pilling or white cast. Even if you apply a large amount several times, it is not sticky and gives a moist finish like that of a light moisturising cream. Containing 30% rice extract and grain fermented extracts, it provides moisture and nourishment to the skin.','At the last step of your skin care routine, evenly spread a generous amount over face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; neck.','produits/IMG_20230711_025111_(540_x_720_pixel)_41490.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230711_025111_(540_x_720_pixel)_41490.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_025147_(540_x_720_pixel)_63741.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_025205_(540_x_720_pixel)_96072.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_025222_(540_x_720_pixel)_59423.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2681,'Beauty of Joseon Glow Serum : Propolis+Niacinamide',NULL,125.000,'This serum is made for troubles with large pores and inflamed skin. <br>\r\nContaining 60% propolis extract and 2% niacinamide, it helps to control sebum secretion and keeps the skin moist. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nKey ingredients <br>\r\n\r\n❁ Propolis extract 60% <br>\r\nThere is a record that women in the Joseon Dynasty used honey and grain powder as a wash-off mask pack to care for their skin. As a skincare ingredient, proplis extract is effective for hydrating the skin improving inflammed skin. <br>\r\n\r\n❁ Niacinamide 2% <br>\r\nAmong the various effects of niacinamide, it is especially helpful in controlling sebum secretion and maintaining the oil and moisture balance of the skin. <br>\r\n\r\n❁ BHA 0.5% <br>\r\nAs a fat-soluble exfoliant, it helps to remove sebum and wastes accumulated in the pores. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','Apply 2-3 drops of the serum to the skin and pat gently to help with absorption','produits/IMG_20230115_124839_(540_x_720_pixel)_66819.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_124839_(540_x_720_pixel)_66819.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_124937_(540_x_720_pixel)_53972.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_125326_(540_x_720_pixel)_46736.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_123823_(540_x_720_pixel)_60778.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2682,'Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint #07 I\'M Pinkest',NULL,53.000,'Add a juicy shine to your lips with this special peripera  CHOIGOSIM lip tint collaboration!<br> This lip tints is hydrating and comfortable to wear<br> and that will instantly brighten up your look<br>','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of the lips and smooth outwards toward the corners of the mouth.','produits/IMG_20230123_002447_(540_x_720_pixel)_20554.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230123_002447_(540_x_720_pixel)_20554.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230123_002528_(540_x_720_pixel)_44210.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230123_002552_(540_x_720_pixel)_28636.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230123_002619_(540_x_720_pixel)_50943.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230123_002656_(540_x_720_pixel)_47742.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2683,'Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint #08 Pink Do It',NULL,53.000,'Add a juicy shine to your lips with this special peripera CHOIGOSIM lip tint collaboration This lip tints is hydrating and comfortable to wear, and that will instantly brighten up your look','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of the lips and smooth outwards toward the corners of the mouth','produits/IMG_20230123_003038_(540_x_720_pixel)_69726.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230123_003038_(540_x_720_pixel)_69726.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230123_003108_(540_x_720_pixel)_14425.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230123_003134_(540_x_720_pixel)_21966.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230123_003156_(540_x_720_pixel)_39853.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230123_002656_(540_x_720_pixel)_54180.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:10','2025-02-07 02:59:10',0,NULL),(2684,'Baking Powder Pore Cleansing Foam',NULL,107.000,'Baking Powder Pore Cleansing Foam is a foam cleanser and daily face formulated with fine baking powder to cleanse deep insi