rface.\r\n<br>\r\nBHA: Exfoliates pores, removing clogged impurities and sebum.\r\n<br>\r\nPHA: Stops losing moisture from skin, dissolving dead skin cell\r\n<br>\r\n- Bye Bye Blackhead Bubble Cleanser: <br>\r\nContains 16 tea ingredients and natural BHA\r\n<br>\r\nBye Bye Blackhead 30Days Miracle Green Tea-Tox Bubble Cleanser of Some By Mi','-Bye Bye Blackhead Bubble Cleanser\r\n\r\n1. Spread it over your face evenly.\r\n\r\n2. when the bubbles appear, rub your face using your hands\r\n\r\n3. Rince your face with warm water\r\n\r\n-AHA BHA PHA  30 Days Miracle Starter Kit\r\n\r\nSTEP 1. Miracle  Soap\r\n\r\n-Roll massage your cheeks.\r\n\r\n-Massage your nose up and down.\r\n\r\n-Roll massage your forehead below the hairline.\r\n\r\n-Carefully massage near your eyes and mouth.\r\nSTEP 2 .Miracle  Toner\r\n\r\n-After cleansing in the morning and evening, take an appropriate amount on a cotton swab, wipe it off along with the texture of the skin, and let it absorb lightly.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3.Miracle serum\r\n\r\n-Apply Toner to prep the skin. Use pipette to release serum on cheek and forehead.  Softly spread for absorption.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4: Miracle Cream\r\n\r\nGently apply and absorb cream on your skin using fingertips.','produits/0003984_some-by-mi-aha-bha-pha-30-days-miracle-starter-kit-bye-bye-blackhead-bubble-cleanser-duo_16990.png',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0003984_some-by-mi-aha-bha-pha-30-days-miracle-starter-kit-bye-bye-blackhead-bubble-cleanser-duo_16990.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_201750_(540_x_720_pixel)_46992.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_201804_(540_x_720_pixel)_11102.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_201812_(540_x_720_pixel)_66818.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_201855_(540_x_720_pixel)_75085.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2729,'SOME BY MI Kit Trio',NULL,360.000,'SOME BY MI Kit Trio Set is an ultimate skincare kit set made by SOME BY MI, the K-Beauty trendsetter making remarkable skincare products from n