d technology of elastic-liposome to deliver active ingredients into the deep skin layer. <br>\r\n- gives a non-sticky and moisturizing finish. <br>\r\n- completed skin irritation testing and passed the vegan test.','Put on face','produits/IMG_20230201_195658_(540_x_720_pixel)_37812.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230201_195658_(540_x_720_pixel)_37812.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_195719_(540_x_720_pixel)_88311.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_195838_(540_x_720_pixel)_60956.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_195856_(540_x_720_pixel)_87670.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_195923_(540_x_720_pixel)_38166.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2732,'Retinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream',NULL,115.000,'Retinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream is an anti-ageing eye cream to help improve dark circles and fine lines, with visible results in just two weeks. The star ingredients, Retinal and Retinol prevent and improve the look of wrinkles, while Niacinamide helps with dark circles while preventing pigmentation and providing brightening care. Panthenol and Hyaluronic acid are also present to keep skin hydrated, while Truecica™, Glacial water and Water Lily gives a soothing and refreshing finish. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCan also be used on other areas such as forehead, lips or neck where you might have any concerns with loose or sagging skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types.','At the last step of your nighttime routine, take an adequate amount and gently pat onto your eye area, or areas where you are concerned about wrinkles. Remember to follow up with sunscreen the next morning. Can be used daily.\r\n\r\nPlease avoid using this product together with any laser treatments or exfoliating product.\r\n\r\nNOTE: You may experience redness or scaly skin when using for the first time. This is a natural process of skin turnover.','produits/IMG_20230201_213746_(540_x_720_pixel)_95605.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',N