tron) extract, which contains 3 times more Vitamin C than a lemon, to recharge and brighten for glowing skin. Niacinamide, arbutin and glutathione helps even out your skin tone, while 10 types of vitamins nourish and soothe your skin while you sleep.','Apply onto face at the last step of your night skincare routine, avoiding the eye and lip areas. Evenly spread all over your face. Wash your face the next morning','produits/IMG_20230201_215550_(540_x_720_pixel)_91247.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230201_215550_(540_x_720_pixel)_91247.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_215606_(540_x_720_pixel)_24036.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_215737_(540_x_720_pixel)_36389.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_215840_(540_x_720_pixel)_86619.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_215902_(540_x_720_pixel)_92494.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2735,'2 Snow White Cream',NULL,179.000,'The Secret Key Snow White Cream is a tone-up cream that helps brighten the skin instantly. The star ingredient, niacinamide, helps improve dull complexion while fighting redness and dark spots. This cream can also be used as a hydrating makeup base that acts as a shield to protect the skin from harmful elements of makeup. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ All in one cream <br>\r\nIt leaves the skin hydrated and radiant from inside to outside. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ All in one base cream <br>\r\nit is enough without the need for BB cream, makeup base, or moisturizer <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ Contains Niacinamide <br>\r\nNiacinamide is a whitening ingredient certified by Koreas Ministry of Food and Drug Safety, that gives the skin REAL whitening care from whithin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nTHOSE WHO <br>\r\n☞ have dark skin and dull complexions <br>\r\n☞ have excessive sebum <br>\r\n☞ have oily skin and constantly need to retouch their makeup <br>\r\n☞ have enlarged pores that can not be covered even by makeup <br>\r\n☞want all in one makeup base <br>\r\nSnow White Cream is the right choice!!!!!!! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Take a moderate amount and apply evenly to your skin\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230208_215217_(540_x_720_pixel)_71626.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230208_215217_(540_x_720_pixel)_71626.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_215311_(540_x_720_pixel)_53179.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_215406_(540_x_720_pixel)_29124.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_215433_(540_x_720_pixel)_15579.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_215457_(540_x_720_pixel)_59102.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2736,'Zero Sebum Duo',NULL,140.000,'This amazing duo controls sebum production, minimizes pores, and makes skin look clear and matte without clumps. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive','T-zone Base:\r\nBefore applying primer, gently apply a moderate amount of product on the excessive sebum areas such as T-zone\r\n\r\nZero Sebum Powder:\r\nAfter applying skin care or makeup, dab the product on areas with excess oil &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\nFOR GREASY HAIR: Apply it on roots and shake off residue for fresher-looking hair &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\nUSE AS EYE PRIMER: Apply this powder on your eyelids for your eye makeup to stay without smudging','produits/IMG_20230208_221308_(540_x_720_pixel)_70848.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230208_221308_(540_x_720_pixel)_70848.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_221322_(540_x_720_pixel)_87546.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_221348_(540_x_720_pixel)_78268.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_221358_(540_x_720_pixel)_71849.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_221410_(540_x_720_pixel)_97999.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2737,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Duo',NULL,244.000,'Starring propolis, royal jelly, honey, 24K gold, Vitamin B5, patented ingredient Truecica, ceramide and hyaluronic acid, this duo balances skin sebum levels, calms and fortifies skin to prevent breakouts and promote a healthy complexion. <br> \r\nIt helps with skin irritation, dehydration and tiredness to calm the skin and make it glowy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Propolis B5 Serum:\r\nAfter using toner, apply an appropriate amount and spread gently across the entire face. Pat lightly until absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily\r\n\r\nPropolis B5 Cream:\r\nTake an appropriate amount and spread evenly onto the skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230208_222428_(540_x_720_pixel)_12442.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230208_222428_(540_x_720_pixel)_12442.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222439_(540_x_720_pixel)_49226.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222449_(540_x_720_pixel)_76780.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222501_(540_x_720_pixel)_23780.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222628_(540_x_720_pixel)_92466.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222727_(540_x_720_pixel)_79195.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2738,'My Real Squeeze Mask [Tea Tree]',NULL,15.000,'Daily sheet mask with Tea Tree Oil helps with the appearance of skin problems while keeping skin moisturized and clean. Eco-friendly Eucalyptus fiber mask has easy on/off tabs and allows the concentrate to more thoroughly absorb on skin. What’s your skin craving? It can change from day to day. That’s why sheet masks have been a Korean skin care go-to for years—the portable packets of goodness can be customized to any shifting daily needs. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 20ml','After cleansing, use toner to help refine skin\'\'s texture. Unfold mask and place on face, avoiding eye and lip areas. Leave on for 10-20 minutes. Discard mask and gently pat excess for full absorption.','produits/IMG_20230422_184734_(540_x_720_pixel)_86062.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_184734_(540_x_720_pixel)_86062.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_184746_(540_x_720_pixel)_19710.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_184758_(540_x_720_pixel)_74746.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_184716_(540_x_720_pixel)_24765.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2739,'2 Diamond Ampoule Sheet Mask Pack (10)',NULL,180.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with One Pack (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br> \r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination,  Oily, Sensitive','1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;am