ut washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20230210_175438_(540_x_720_pixel)_63422.png',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230210_175438_(540_x_720_pixel)_63422.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_175459_(540_x_720_pixel)_89807.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_175527_(540_x_720_pixel)_81930.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_175544_(540_x_720_pixel)_49676.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2740,'2 Face Blur Smoothing',NULL,300.000,'This liquid primer instantly smooths complexion and creates a flawless base for your makeup while also protecting skin from free radicals with fitted SPF. The Smoothing version is fitted with Baby Pixel powder, Cover Powder and Airy Skin powder for a bright, pinkish finish that minimizes pores. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n● A lightweight makeup base that covers skin flaws, smooths and brightens your complexion with UV protection. <br>\r\n● It helps brighten the skin, reduce wrinkles and block UV rays with SPF33 PA++. <br>\r\n● Baby Pixel Powder and Cover Powder helps smooth your skin and minimizes the appearance of pores. <br>\r\n● Airy Skin Powder maintains a radiant and refined skin texture with a shimmery coral base. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Before face makeup, apply an appropriate amount on face and spread evenly &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230210_180139_(540_x_720_pixel)_98576.jpg',NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230210_180139_(540_x_720_pixel)_98576.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_180218_(540_x_720_pixel)_39724.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_180241_(540_x_720_pixel)_27757.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_180405_(540_x_720_pixel)_70332.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2741,'2 Fixing Tint Bar (#03 Milk Caramel + 05 Mauve Pink)',NULL,136.000,'This matte lipstick promises smudge-free results that lasts up to six hours. It offers rich color payoff with a few simple swipes, while its hydrating formula sits comfortably on lips. It is available in different warm, vibrant shades that glides smoothly onto lips without caking or smudging and adheres closely to lips for a comfortable, long-lasting finish.','Apply directly onto lips for your desired lip look','produits/IMG_20230210_200640_(540_x_720_pixel)_65843.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230210_200640_(540_x_720_pixel)_65843.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_200658_(540_x_720_pixel)_48777.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_200721_(540_x_720_pixel)_23916.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_200740_(540_x_720_pixel)_37909.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2742,'Jeju Orchid Trio',NULL,415.000,'Target the first signs of aging with this multitasking moisturizer!\r\nIt quenches skin with hydration and nourishment while supporting a look of firmness elasticity and tone. It’s made with an antioxidant rich orchid from Jeju Island South Korea making it highly effective in diminishing visible signs of aging <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Jeju Orchid Eye Cream:\r\nApply sparingly to entire eye area with fingertips\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night\r\n\r\nJeju Orchid Enriched Cream:\r\nApply all over the face and neck and press to help with absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily\r\n\r\nJeju Orchid Sleeping Mask:\r\nAt the last stage of evening skin care, apply onto the entire face, avoiding the eye and lip area. Gently massage for better absorption. Leave on overnight and rinse with water in the morning. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230210_202644_(540_x_720_pixel)_25160.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230210_202644_(540_x_720_pixel)_25160.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_214156_(540_x_720_pixel)_26365.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_214206_(540_x_720_pixel)_54918.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_214214_(540_x_720_pixel)_91416.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2743,'MISSHA M Perfect Cover BB Cream #31 Golden Beige',NULL,84.000,'Originally developed as a salve for patients after laser treatment, BB Cream’s soothing and regenerative properties were adapted for cosmetics to improve skin while providing coverage. The M Perfect Cover BB Cream is Missha’s most popular product with over 30 million sold worldwide. Combining cosmetics with skincare, this product promotes natural-looking coverage while providing sun protection, treating dark spots, and preventing wrinkles.','Apply on face',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2744,'Truecica Aqua Calming Sun Cream',NULL,105.000,'Effectively fend off UV rays while soothing skin with this lightweight sunscreen fitted with broad-spectrum SPF50+ protection. The reef-friendly formula contains skin-soothers like cica, aloe vera leaf extract and white water lily extract, and it won’t leave a white cast. This dermatologically-tested sunscreen a summer must-have for those with sensitive skin.','Put on face','produits/IMG_20230301_195626_(540_x_720_pixel)_98530.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230301_195626_(540_x_720_pixel)_98530.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230301_195648_(540_x_720_pixel)_93679.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230301_195755_(540_x_720_pixel)_62130.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230301_195817_(540_x_720_pixel)_56525.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2745,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #12 Apple',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color','produits/IMG_20230303_190459_(540_x_720_pixel)_81422.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230303_190459_(540_x_720_pixel)_81422.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_190524_(540_x_720_pixel)_54979.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_190534_(540_x_720_pixel)_10123.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_190603_(540_x_720_pixel)_98789.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2746,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #04 Grapefruit Mousse',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2747,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #02 Strawberry',NULL,55.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color','produits/IMG_20230304_135212_(540_x_720_pixel)_85967.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230304_135212_(540_x_720_pixel)_85967.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_194212_(540_x_720_pixel)_68430.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_194237_(540_x_720_pixel)_79397.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_194254_(540_x_720_pixel)_98099.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2748,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #07 Dark Cherry',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color','produits/IMG_20230304_140528_(540_x_720_pixel)_59897.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230304_140528_(540_x_720_pixel)_59897.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230304_140552_(540_x_720_pixel)_90714.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230304_140613_(540_x_720_pixel)_99607.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230304_140632_(540_x_720_pixel)_82521.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2749,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Gel Cleanser',NULL,86.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Gel Cleanser is a gentle water based face cleanser contains 6 types of hyaluronic acids of different molecular weight/size for effective hydration on various skin layers from deep to surface for gently daily face cleansing. <br>\r\n✓ 6 HYALURONIC ACIDS of different molecular size/weight for effective hydration in all skin layers from deeper to surface. It provides long-lasting and concentrated hydration to the skin.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Allantoin & Various natural plant extracts for instant soothing.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Alcohol-Free / Oil-Free perfect for daily morning & evening use.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Micro bubbles actively work to cleanse skin from impurities in a mild delicate way. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 120 ml\r\n','1. Apply an appropriate amount on hands and gently massage on wet skin.\r\n\r\n2. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n\r\n3. Daily use for both morning and night skincare routine.\r\nTIP: Perfect as 2nd step in double-cleansing','produits/IMG_20230306_150055_(540_x_720_pixel)_41615.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230306_150055_(540_x_720_pixel)_41615.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_150103_(540_x_720_pixel)_79691.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_150118_(540_x_720_pixel)_56036.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_150136_(540_x_720_pixel)_60141.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2750,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Toner',NULL,86.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Toner is an instant Skin Soothing with Water Balance Restore toner that contains 6 types of hyaluronic acids of different molecular weight/size for effective hydration on various skin layers from deep to surface. <br>\r\n✓ 6 HYALURONIC ACIDS of different molecular size/weight for effective hydration in all skin layers from deeper to surface. It provides long-lasting & concentrated hydration to the skin.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Panthenol, Allantoin & Various natural plant extracts for instant soothing and water-oil balancing after cleansing.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Alcohol-Free / Oil-Free perfect for daily morning & evening use.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Light texture quickly and easily absorbs into skin refreshing it and preparing for next skincare step. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 150 ml','1. After cleansing apply an appropriate amount on desired area (face and neck recommended).\r\n\r\n2. Evenly spread and gently massage for absorption.\r\n\r\n3. For convenient appliation may be used with cotton pads.\r\nTIP:\r\n\r\n1. TONER + cotton pad = Hydrating mask pack\r\n2. TONER + mist bottle = daily use mist','produits/IMG_20230306_153132_(540_x_720_pixel)_51454.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230306_153132_(540_x_720_pixel)_51454.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_153140_(540_x_720_pixel)_35098.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_153154_(540_x_720_pixel)_53386.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_153207_(540_x_720_pixel)_87441.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2751,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Soothing Cream',NULL,98.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Soothing Cream is a refreshing soothing cream that offers moisture to your skin with a non-sticky finish. This cream includes 8 kinds of Hyaluronic Acid that can be quickly absorbed to provide intensive moisture to your skin. It strengthens the skin barrier to prevent moisture loss and it is formulated for people with dehydrated yet oily skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 80 ml','At the last step of your skincare routine, dispense a proper amount of the cream and gently massage it into your skin.\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.','produits/IMG_20230307_024451_(540_x_720_pixel)_24572.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230307_024451_(540_x_720_pixel)_24572.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_024516_(540_x_720_pixel)_73330.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_024536_(540_x_720_pixel)_67814.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_024558_(540_x_720_pixel)_80950.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2752,'HANBANG SERUM DISCOVERY KIT',NULL,140.000,'The \"Hanbang discovery kit\" was created for those who want to find out which of the four BOJ serums is best for their skin.\r\n<br>\r\nThis is a 10ml mini size set with 4 types of serums so that you can choose to use or layer them according to your skin type or skin issues. <br>\r\nExperience a wonderful journey to find the right product for you before taking the plunge on a full-size bottle!\r\n<br>\r\nWhat are inside?\r\n<br>\r\nCalming Serum : Green Tea + Panthenol (10ml / 0.33fl.oz.) <br>\r\nGlow Serum : Propolis + Niacinamide (10ml / 0.33fl.oz.) <br>\r\nGlow Deep Serum : Rice + Alpha-Arbutin (10ml / 0.33fl.oz.) <br>\r\nRevive Serum : Ginseng + Snail Mucin (10ml / 0.33fl.oz.)','Apply 2-3 drops of serum onto the skin and pat gently to help absorption','produits/IMG_20230307_023243_(540_x_720_pixel)_12647.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230307_023243_(540_x_720_pixel)_12647.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_023306_(540_x_720_pixel)_10554.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_023423_(540_x_720_pixel)_78672.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_023444_(540_x_720_pixel)_98718.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2753,'SOME BY MI AHA.BHA.PHA 30 DAYS MIRACLE AC SOS KIT',NULL,128.000,'This travel-friendly AHA, BHA, PHA 30 Days AC SOS Kit is suitable for oily and acne-prone skin types and contains: <br>\r\n\r\nMiracle Acne Clear Foam 30ml <br>\r\nMiracle Toner 30ml<br>\r\nMiracle Serum 10ml <br>\r\nMiracle Cream 20g <br>\r\nContaining acids to exfoliate the skin whilst removing excess dead skin cells and prevents sebum build up inside the pores. The non-irritating formulas are formulated with natural-derived ingredients.','Hgh','produits/IMG_20230307_025832_(540_x_720_pixel)_87120.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230307_025832_(540_x_720_pixel)_87120.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_025909_(540_x_720_pixel)_44592.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_025929_(540_x_720_pixel)_12502.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_025948_(540_x_720_pixel)_57893.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2754,'CQMONG Full Intensive Care Routine',NULL,300.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with CQMONG (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br>\r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Intensive Eye Cream:\r\nApply a suitable amount to eye areas and softly pat until absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;BR&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nNourishing Moisture Cream:\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nDiamond Ampoule Sheet Mask:\r\n1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After washing face, apply sheet mask on face. Pull the eye part of sheet up to just below the eyes, that part will be fully covered. (No need to attach additional Eye Patches)\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20231007_183900_(540_x_720_pixel)_87306.jpg',NULL,20,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231007_183900_(540_x_720_pixel)_87306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_183916_(540_x_720_pixel)_13805.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_184314_(540_x_720_pixel)_35791.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_184716_(540_x_720_pixel)_83157.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2755,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Mask',NULL,16.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Mask is a mask sheet enriched with Hyaluronic Acid to intensively moisturize your skin. It forms a moisture barrier to keep your skin hydrated and prevent moisture loss and replenishes moisture in deep skin layers with 7 Hyaluronic Acids Complex.\r\nIt gently soothes your skin for a smooth and soft touch. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 25 g','1. Place the mask sheet on your face and let it rest for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\n2. Gently remove the mask sheet. Lightly pat to absorb the remaining essence.','produits/IMG_20230308_102628_(540_x_720_pixel)_46977.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230308_102628_(540_x_720_pixel)_46977.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230308_102327_(540_x_720_pixel)_10061.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230308_102346_(540_x_720_pixel)_83495.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230308_102403_(540_x_720_pixel)_63701.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2756,'Moistfull Collagen Intense Sheet Mask',NULL,20.000,'Inner moisture mask made of thin soft micro fiber sheet containing small molecular Super Collagen™ water and peptide provides abundant moisture and nourishment through close adherence to skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','Put on face','produits/IMG_20230422_200422_(540_x_720_pixel)_43952.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_200422_(540_x_720_pixel)_43952.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_200501_(540_x_720_pixel)_36057.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_200522_(540_x_720_pixel)_83947.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_200533_(540_x_720_pixel)_58050.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2757,'My Real Squeeze Mask [Rice]',NULL,15.000,'Creamy sheet mask made from 100% biodegradable Eucalyptus fibers is soaked in the nourishing ingredients found in Rice for clearer, more translucent-looking skin.','Hfj','produits/IMG_20230422_182533_(540_x_720_pixel)_45822.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_182533_(540_x_720_pixel)_45822.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_182549_(540_x_720_pixel)_32653.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_182601_(540_x_720_pixel)_43699.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_182626_(540_x_720_pixel)_10101.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2758,'My Real Squeeze Mask EX [Lime]',NULL,15.000,'This refreshing-water type mask is enriched with moisture from fresh limes, leaves the skin bright and transparent. <br>\r\n❃ Jeju green complex X Squeezed lime = Transparency & Brightening! <br>\r\nIt’s filled with Jeju green complex (green tea, tangerine, cactus, camellia leaves & orchid) and squeezed lime make the skin transparent and bright. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n❃ Additional whitening functions! <br>\r\nAdditional whitening function addresses your concerns about skin tone.','1. After cleansing, use toner to refine skin texture.\r\n2. Unfold and place the mask on the face, avoiding eye and lip area.\r\n3. Leave on for 10-20 minutes.\r\n4. Remove the mask and gently pat the remaining content for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20230422_191335_(540_x_720_pixel)_84516.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_191335_(540_x_720_pixel)_84516.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_191358_(540_x_720_pixel)_91696.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_191416_(540_x_720_pixel)_44096.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_191431_(540_x_720_pixel)_57441.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2759,'My Real Squeeze Mask [Green Tea]',NULL,15.000,'This refreshing-water type mask is enriched with fresh moisture from delicately fragrant green tea, keeps dry skin moisturized. It’s filled with Jeju green complex (green tea, tangerine, cactus, camellia leaves & orchid) and squeezed green tea provide the skin with a hydrating and soothing effect. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 20 ml','1. After cleansing, use toner to refine skin texture.\r\n2. Unfold and place the mask on the face, avoiding eye and lip area.\r\n3. Leave on for 10-20 minutes.\r\n4. Remove the mask and gently pat the remaining content for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20230422_194424_(540_x_720_pixel)_56042.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_194424_(540_x_720_pixel)_56042.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_194439_(540_x_720_pixel)_15508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_194756_(540_x_720_pixel)_11888.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_194806_(540_x_720_pixel)_40269.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2760,'Moistfull Collagen Emulsion',NULL,135.000,'Etude House Moistfull Collagen Emulsion is a hydrating lotion that provides deep moisture for hours with moisture-rich Super Collagen™ water. It contains 14% Super collagen water, 6% Baobab water that turns dull and rough skin into dewy and bright skin by leaving skin moisturized. This concentrated and textured facial treatment steeps skin in rich moisture to improve skin health and moisture level. <br>\r\nFortified with baobab tree extract and collagen, skin is treated to advanced moisturization with a dramatic improvement in texture and tone in as little as a few days of use. Best used with the rest of the Moistfull Collagen line. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nRecommended for dry and combination skin types.','After using skin softener, take an appropriate amount into hand, and gently spread over the face.','produits/IMG_20230422_225732_(540_x_720_pixel)_58992.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_225732_(540_x_720_pixel)_58992.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_225743_(540_x_720_pixel)_47893.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_225931_(540_x_720_pixel)_91360.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_230231_(540_x_720_pixel)_54046.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2761,'Snail (Smoothening and Firming) sheet mask',NULL,15.000,'This Snail sheet mask is a water-type essence that absorbs into your skin mildly but brings powerful moisturization. This mask provides abundant moisture to dry, hot skin with its ingredient of abundant aloe that makes skin comfortable and healthy by relieving skin of external stimuli and stress.','1. Apply toner to skin after cleansing.\r\n2. Remove mask from pouch and apply to face, placing mask to fit eye and lip area. \r\n3. Remove mask after 10~15 minutes and lightly massage remaining solution into skin with hands.','produits/IMG_20230422_234750_(540_x_720_pixel)_94403.jpg',NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_234750_(540_x_720_pixel)_94403.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_234815_(540_x_720_pixel)_72295.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_234832_(540_x_720_pixel)_24678.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_234858_(540_x_720_pixel)_18186.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2762,'Tea Tree (Refreshing and Soothing) sheet mask',NULL,15.000,'This mask sheet contains Tea Tree Extract (Melaleuca Alternifolia Leaf Extract) has soothing properties to provide a fresh, clean complexion. The daily low-irritant mask made a breathable 0.2mm air sheet effectively delivers 7-free essence to your skin.','1. Apply toner to skin after cleansing.\r\n2. Remove mask from pouch and apply to face, placing mask to fit eye and lip area.\r\n3. Remove mask after 10~15 minutes and lightly massage remaining solution into skin with hands.','produits/IMG_20230423_002442_(540_x_720_pixel)_28908.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_002442_(540_x_720_pixel)_28908.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_002459_(540_x_720_pixel)_33762.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_002513_(540_x_720_pixel)_67492.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_002522_(540_x_720_pixel)_35721.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2763,'Kill Cover Ampoule Cushion SPF50+ PA+++ 15g + Refill 15g #4 Ginger',NULL,185.000,'Your flawless skin elegantly shines with ampoule-enriched luster. Perfect coverage with excellent staying power and moisturization.\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓High-density moisture\r\n<br>\r\n✓Perfect coverage\r\n<br>\r\n✓excellent staying power and moisturization','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20230423_005304_(540_x_720_pixel)_34825.jpg',NULL,9,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_005304_(540_x_720_pixel)_34825.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_005451_(540_x_720_pixel)_46712.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_005504_(540_x_720_pixel)_61324.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_005522_(540_x_720_pixel)_62343.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2764,'Kill Cover Fixer Cushion SPF50+ PA+++ 15g + Refill 15g #5 Sand',NULL,185.000,'A transfer-proof cushion foundation without smudging even under a mask\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ Fixes makeup strongly & doesn\'t feel stuffy at all\r\n<br>\r\n✓Strong against oil by using oil cutting powder\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Never smudges off & lasts perfectly without rubbing off','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20230423_010114_(540_x_720_pixel)_82634.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_010114_(540_x_720_pixel)_82634.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010128_(540_x_720_pixel)_17054.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010150_(540_x_720_pixel)_22826.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010210_(540_x_720_pixel)_90269.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010225_(540_x_720_pixel)_37099.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010244_(540_x_720_pixel)_18423.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010313_(540_x_720_pixel)_19210.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2765,'Ginseng Essence Water',NULL,102.000,'Ginseng is a vital herbal ingredient that has been used for a long time for our body and skin health in Korean history. <br>\r\nGinseng essence water contains 80% of ginseng water and focuses on the benefits of ginseng itself, giving sufficient moisture and nutrition to the skin. It fills moisture and nutrition firmly to help keep your skin moisturized for a long period of time. <br>\r\nGinseng root water 63% + Ginseng complex <br>\r\nIn Donguibogam, a Korean herbal medicine book, ginseng was used as an important oriental medicine and recorded as Shincho, meaning herb from the gods. Hwang Jini known as the most beautiful woman in the Joseon Dynasty, used a ginseng decoction as a bath water. <br>\r\nThe rich saponin contained in ginseng helps to quickly supply moisture to the skin and maintain it deep inside the skin for a long time to help create healthy skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nNiacinamide 2% <br>\r\nNiacinamide is helpful in controlling sebum secretion and maintaining the oil and moisture balance of the skin.','After cleansing, pour a few drops into your hands and pat gently onto the face','produits/IMG_20230423_153447_(540_x_720_pixel)_71479.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_153447_(540_x_720_pixel)_71479.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_153424_(540_x_720_pixel)_67468.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_153509_(540_x_720_pixel)_35184.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_153525_(540_x_720_pixel)_87834.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2766,'Benetint Liquid Lip Blush and Cheek Tint',NULL,95.000,'This iconic rose-tinted lip stain was created for an exotic dancer in the 1970s and has since soared to cult-fave status. Our doe foot applicator glides right on lips & blends over cheeks for a gorgeous look in seconds. The kiss-proof color lasts for hours, making it loved by celebs, makeup artists and gals around the world.','-Glide onto lips and layer to build intensity.\r\n-For ombre lips, dab on the inner part of lips and blend outward with fingertip. Dot and blend quickly onto cheeks for a long-lasting flush.\r\n-Beauty tip: Layer your two favorite tints to make your own custom color for lips or cheeks. Or wear under your favorite lipstick or gloss.','produits/IMG_20230423_154545_(540_x_720_pixel)_96677.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_154545_(540_x_720_pixel)_96677.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_154556_(540_x_720_pixel)_43459.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_154701_(540_x_720_pixel)_61752.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_154651_(540_x_720_pixel)_99137.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2767,'Lovetint Cheek and Lip Stain',NULL,95.000,'Our fiery-red lip and cheek stain is the most passionate flush you can get from a bottle. Our precise lip applicator glides right on for a gorgeous look in seconds. Apply on lips and cheeks for kiss-proof, long-lasting vibrant color you\'re sure to love!','Glide onto lips, layering to build intensity. Dot and blend quickly onto cheeks.\r\nFor full lips, outline, then fill in. Layer to build intensity.','produits/IMG_20230423_155831_(540_x_720_pixel)_57005.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_155831_(540_x_720_pixel)_57005.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_155849_(540_x_720_pixel)_59288.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_155911_(540_x_720_pixel)_62900.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_155919_(540_x_720_pixel)_66008.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2768,'Chachatint Cheek and Lip Stain',NULL,95.000,'This sheer stain beautifully blushes lips & cheeks with a mango hue. Our precise lip applicator glides right on lips & cheeks for a deliciously vibrant look that lasts for hours.','Complete your colorful spring outfits with a glow of coral on your cheeks and lips!\r\n1. Smile! This is the best solution to bring out your cheekbones and know exactly where to apply three small strokes of chachatint.\r\n2. Dab onto lips and blend with fingertips.\r\n3. Apply an additional layer of the liquid blush on the cheeks and / or lips for an even more intense color.\r\nFor as even color as possible, dab chachatint in small strokes on your foundation brush and blend into each cheek, one at a time.','produits/IMG_20230423_172127_(540_x_720_pixel)_86251.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_172127_(540_x_720_pixel)_86251.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_172141_(540_x_720_pixel)_63901.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_172155_(540_x_720_pixel)_38784.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_172209_(540_x_720_pixel)_75708.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2769,'JAYJUN - Green Tea Eye Gel Patch',NULL,120.000,'It is a hydrogel that soothes irritated skin with green tea powder and it also protects and strengthens delicate skin around the eyes. <br>\r\n❃ Soothing formula invigorating hydrogel eye patch with green tea leaf powder. <br>\r\n❃ Provides a moist and refreshing feeling without stickiness. <br>\r\n❃ It nourishes the delicate skin and rejuvenates the tired skin from the outside environment. <br>\r\n❃ Easily attaches to intensively moisturize skin trouble areas.','After cleansing, refine skin texture with toner.\r\nApply on to under eye area.\r\nLet patch set for 20-30 mins.\r\nPat over.','produits/IMG_20230423_222445_(540_x_720_pixel)_63428.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_222445_(540_x_720_pixel)_63428.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_222523_(540_x_720_pixel)_10344.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_222644_(540_x_720_pixel)_88215.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_222927_(540_x_720_pixel)_82961.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2770,'Tara- Onion Remedy Follicle-Stimulating Concentrate',NULL,185.000,'A powerful concentrate designed to stimulate the scalp for stronger hair growth. It works by boosting microcirculation towards the follicles, increasing their supply of oxygen and nutrients while accelerating the rate at which they produce hair during the growth cycle. Combined with an optimal dose of peptides, it soothes and strengthens the scalp to reduce shedding and helps thinning hair grow back stronger and fuller.','After towel drying, apply one pipette-full of serum along the hairline and the part, finishing with the sides and the back. Massage into the scalp using circular motions as you work through each section. This is a leave-in product, style your hair normally.','produits/IMG_20230423_224828_(540_x_720_pixel)_30043.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_224828_(540_x_720_pixel)_30043.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_224839_(540_x_720_pixel)_78638.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_224902_(540_x_720_pixel)_42393.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_224918_(540_x_720_pixel)_54747.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2771,'Tara - Purify Deep Cleansing Clay Mask',NULL,132.000,'A combination of natural clays and nutrient-rich ingredients that cleanse and rebalance the skin. Our formula gently draws up impurities from deep within the pores while exfoliating the surface to remove cell buildup and excess oil, leaving skin feeling softer, smoother and less prone to breakouts.','Apply a thin and consistent layer onto your freshly cleansed skin and let it sit for 10 minutes until the mask starts to dry. To remove, gently loosen with a warm, wet towel first and then rinse off with warm water. Do not scrub. Use once a week or whenever your skin feels clogged and dull. Follow with our Radiance Vitamin C serum and Glow oil for a natural fresh-faced look.','produits/IMG_20230424_002131_(540_x_720_pixel)_15503.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230424_002131_(540_x_720_pixel)_15503.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230424_002336_(540_x_720_pixel)_48305.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230424_002416_(540_x_720_pixel)_51776.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230424_002443_(540_x_720_pixel)_25014.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2772,'JM SOLUTION Active Pink Snail Brightening Mask',NULL,20.000,'– It’s an intensively brightening Mask that works to moisturize the skin and fight dullness for a clearer, glowing skin tone\r\n\r\n– The soft and lightweight Sheet fits perfectly along your facial lines for effective moisture and nutrients transfer\r\n\r\n– The Snail Secretion Filtrate and Vitamin B12 ingredients seep deep into the skin layers for a revitalized. luscious complexion\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIt helps:\r\n\r\n– Skin dryness\r\n\r\n– Promotes a bright skin tone\r\n\r\n– Uneven skin texture','After cleaning the face, aplly the mask for 10-20 minutes. Take off the mask and gently pat the remaining essence onto the skin.','produits/IMG_20230423_230911_(540_x_720_pixel)_32815.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_230911_(540_x_720_pixel)_32815.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_231004_(540_x_720_pixel)_84645.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_230933_(540_x_720_pixel)_76321.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_230948_(540_x_720_pixel)_97565.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2773,'BLACK TEA YOUTH ENHANCING AMPOULE',NULL,140.000,'The Innisfree Black Tea Youth Enhancing Ampoule provides intensive anti-ageing care to relieve signs of skin fatigue after a long, tiring day and boosts the skin\'s vitality and radiance as if you\'d had a good night\'s sleep! Reset Concentrate™, a powerful antioxidant and anti-ageing compound extracted from 80% fermented Black Tea that has been infused in mineral water for twelve hours at 80 Celsius degrees, helps address the look of fatigued and tired-looking skin. Boost elasticity and radiance with this gentle yet powerful ampoule! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types, recommended for tired and dull skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSizes: 30ml','For daytime:\r\n\r\nApply 3-5 drops of product on the face and pat gently for better absorption.\r\n\r\nFor nighttime:\r\n\r\nSTEP 1: Gently apply 2~3 drops on the entire face starting from the cheeks to the forehead, nose, mouth area, and neck.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2: Apply once more by tapping lightly on dryness-prone areas.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3: Apply 1~2 drops on the entire face then gently press with your palms to finish.','produits/IMG_20230511_145334_(540_x_720_pixel)_13208.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230511_145334_(540_x_720_pixel)_13208.jpg\", \"produit