ffect and even skin tone for a soft and glowing skin.','Hdjdn hi','produits/IMG_20230517_130819_(540_x_720_pixel)_86581.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230517_130819_(540_x_720_pixel)_86581.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_130841_(540_x_720_pixel)_16600.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_130905_(540_x_720_pixel)_16568.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_130922_(540_x_720_pixel)_52103.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2776,'Revive Serum : Ginseng + Snail Mucin',NULL,106.000,'This serum is made for skin that has lost its vitality.\r\nIt contains Ginseng, which has been used as an important herbal ingredient for a long time, and 3%  snail secretion filtrate, which creates the best synergy for skin elasticity.','Jcj','produits/IMG_20230511_225515_(540_x_720_pixel)_90068.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230511_225515_(540_x_720_pixel)_90068.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_225546_(540_x_720_pixel)_84003.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_225558_(540_x_720_pixel)_83927.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_225611_(540_x_720_pixel)_56624.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2777,'Mack Andy Radiant Tone-up Cream',NULL,105.000,'A body cream that gives an instant brightening effect and even skin tone for a soft and glowing skin.\r\n<br>\r\n1.Instant Healthy Bright\r\n<br>\r\nEnriched with Niacinamide and Tranexamic Acid, it helps brighten and even out skin tone. <br>\r\n2.Soft and Smooth Skin\r\n<br>\r\nThe light, non-sticky cream texture leaves skin feeling softer. <br>\r\n3. Floral & Fruity Aroma\r\n<br>\r\nCombination of floral and fruity aroma that gives a fresh sensation to the skin.','Apply it evenly on hands and body in the morning or at night after taking shower','produits/IMG_20230517_134420_(540_x_720_pixel)_68061.jpg',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230517_134420_(540_x_720_pixel)_68061.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_134456_(540_x_720_pixel)_20148.jpg\", \"pr