g\", \"produits/IMG_20230524_111531_(540_x_720_pixel)_48209.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2780,'BEAUTY OF JOSEON - Matte Sun Stick : Mugwort+Camelia (SPF 50+ PA++++)',NULL,109.000,'The Beauty of Joseon Matte Sun Stick : Mugwort + Camelia is a non-greasy sun stick developed with influencer and cosmetic chemist, Ramón @glowbyramon! This matte formula doesn\'t get clumpy and doesn\'t feel sticky or greasy even when reapplied several times over makeup. Sebum-control silica powder regulates sebum to increase adherence and provides a matte and smooth finish without clumping, while mugwort, cica and green tea extracts moisturise, nourish, smoothen and soothe skin.\r\n\r\nSuitable for \r\n\r\nall skin types, especially recommended for oily skin with active sebum secretion.\r\n\r\nSize: 18g','Apply to areas that need sun protection, such as the face and body.\r\nReapply every 2-3 hours.','produits/IMG_20230711_023530_(540_x_720_pixel)_85654.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230711_023530_(540_x_720_pixel)_85654.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_023601_(540_x_720_pixel)_74861.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_023619_(540_x_720_pixel)_29132.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_023637_(540_x_720_pixel)_12960.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2781,'Beta Panthenol Repair Gel Cleanser',NULL,91.000,'Formulated with SOME BY MI’s patented Beta-Panthenol™ (a blend of D-panthenol and beta-sitosterol), this cleanser effectively rids skin of dirt and impurities while leaving a soothed and hydrated finish. Enriched with probiotics, the pH-balanced cleanser further boosts skin resilience. Formula is free of parabens and lauryl sulfate. It’s dermatologically tested to be suitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n- This cleanser helps balance the pH level inside the skin and strengthen skin barriers with its exclusive complex Beta-Panthenol™. <br>\r\n- Free from 20 kinds of harmful ingredients and completed the non-comedogenic test. <br>\r\n- Helps control oil and excess sebum on the skin.\r\nHelps protect and improve skin barriers.','1. Dispense and lather a proper amount onto wet hands to form foam.\r\n\r\n2. Massage the foam onto the skin gently and rinse with lukewarm water afterwards.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2782,'Beta Panthenol Repair Cream',NULL,110.000,'Formulated with SOME BY MI’s patented Beta-Panthenol™ (a blend of D-panthenol and beta-sitosterol), this uber-hydrating cream replenishes moisture levels to produce a soft, supple and plumped-up finish. The non-comedogenic formula is suitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n- This cream helps restore the pH level inside the skin and strengthen skin barriers with its exclusive complex Beta-Panthenol™. <br>\r\n- Free from 20 kinds of harmful ingredients and completed the non-comedogenic test. <br>\r\n- Helps control oil and excess sebum on the skin. <br>\r\n- Helps improve wrinkles and soothes the skin. <br>\r\n- Improves and soothes damaged skin barriers from physical irritations.','Apply a proper amount onto the skin along skin textures at the last stage of skincare.',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2783,'V10 Hyal Lip Sun Protector SPF 15',NULL,59.000,'Don’t forget your lips when it comes to sun protection! Fitted with SPF15, this sunscreen-enhanced lip balm keeps your lips protected and nourished. Thanks to a mix of vitamins, hyaluronic acid, shea butter and olive oil, the lip balm offers soothing hydration to cracked and irritated lips.','Apply whenever your lips feel dry with the applicator or fingers.','produits/IMG_20230611_000528_(540_x_720_pixel)_95529.jpg',NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230611_000528_(540_x_720_pixel)_95529.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_000614_(540_x_720_pixel)_53763.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_000634_(540_x_720_pixel)_97494.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_000643_(540_x_720_pixel)_62998.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2784,'V10 Hyal Antioxidant Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++',NULL,89.000,'This sensitive skin-friendly sunscreen is packed with ten types of vitamin and hyaluronic acid to nourish and replenish moisture, while offering SPF50+ PA++++ sun protection. The antioxidant-rich sunscreen provides skin brightening and soothing effects. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\nA clinical tested effective UV blocking with broad spectrum SPF50+ PA++++. <br>\r\nWith 10 vitamins and hyaluronic acid that soothes and moisturizes skin. <br>\r\nWith tone-up effect and high in adhesiveness.\r\nCompleted eye irritation test, suitable for sensitive skin.','At the last step of skin care routine, evenly spread a proper amount over areas frequently exposed to sun.','produits/IMG_20230611_104549_(540_x_720_pixel)_91557.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230611_104549_(540_x_720_pixel)_91557.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_104902_(540_x_720_pixel)_94461.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_104917_(540_x_720_pixel)_76769.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_104954_(540_x_720_pixel)_48530.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2785,'Victoria\'s Secret Temptation Lotion',NULL,85.000,'Victoria’s Secret Temptation body lotion is a luxurious and alluring soft lotion that will leave you feeling confident and irresistible. Our body splash is infused with a blend of fresh juicy apples with a desert flower touch.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nTop notes: Fruity accord\r\n<br>\r\nHeart notes: Flower (Saguaro), Apple\r\n<br>\r\nBase notes: Vanilla, Musk','Use on body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2786,'Victoria\'s Secret Love Fine Fragrance Lotion',NULL,65.000,'The Victoria\'s Secret Love Fine Fragrance Lotion is a luxurious body care product that combines the moisturizing benefits of a lotion with the captivating scent of the popular Love fragrance. Its blend of blush blooms and boyfriend tees creates a romantic and inviting aroma that lingers on the skin. The lotion is designed to nourish and hydrate the skin, leaving it feeling soft and smooth. It absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, making it ideal for everyday use. To enhance the fragrance experience, it can be layered with the matching Love Eau de Parfum or Fine Fragrance Mist.','Spray on your body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2787,'Fine Fragrance Whipped Body Scrub',NULL,60.000,'Exfoliate your skin in your favorite fragrance. Our gentle exfoliating formula with Sugar and Shea Butter polishes skin so it feels and soft and smooth. Playful and feminine, Tease is a delicious mix of petally florals wrapped in warmth.\r\nTip: For a long-lasting fragrance experience, pair with matching Eau de Parfum or Fine Fragrance Mist.\r\n• Fragrance type: Warm Gourmand\r\n• Notes: white gardenia, Anjou pear, black vanilla\r\n• Fluffy, fragrant whipped texture\r\n• 171.5 ml/5.8 fl oz.\r\n• Domestic','Use on body',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2788,'Victoria\'s Secret Dream Angel Fragrance Lotion',NULL,130.000,'Victoria\'s Secret Dream Angel Fine Fragrance Lotion is a luxurious body care product designed to hydrate and nourish your skin while leaving a captivating scent. This lotion features the iconic Dream Angel fragrance, known for its alluring blend of fruity notes, creamy vanilla, and a touch of woody warmth.\r\nIts formula is crafted to provide deep moisturization without feeling greasy, leaving your skin feeling soft and silky. The Dream Angel scent is long-lasting, ensuring you\'ll enjoy its enchanting aroma throughout the day. Pair it with the matching Dream Angel Eau de Parfum or Fragrance Mist for an even more intense fragrance experience.\r\n','Use on body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2789,'Victoria\'s Secret Water Lily Sea Salt Body Wash',NULL,65.000,'A new kind of daily body ritual. Moisturize as you cleanse with this creamy Shea Butter-infused formula. Skin feels more hydrated after just one wash. Renew with the scent of Water Lily & Sea Salt. Part of the Natural Beauty Body Care Collection, inspired by nature for soft, healthy-feeling skin. Scents plus benefits. Luxurious, efficacious formulas. Botanical inspiration, daily transformation. Fragrance Style: Floral Fresh To maximize your scent benefit','Use on body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2790,'Victoria\'s Secret Lavender And Vanilla Relax Pack',NULL,510.000,'A new beauty ritual for your body. Awaken your senses with our refreshing mist. Spray from head to toe and enjoy a scent that will put a smile on your face.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTreat yourself to a moment of relaxation with Lavender & Vanilla. A pure moment of relaxation.\r\n\r\nPart of the Natural Beauty body care collection inspired by nature for soft, radiant skin. The marriage of flavors and benefits. Sumptuous and highly effective formulas. Plant inspiration, day-to-day transformation.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nFragrance type\r\nFruity Floral\r\n<br>\r\nNotes\r\nLavender & Vanilla. Botanical inspiration. Blissful comfort.','Adgh',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2791,'Beauty of Joseon Revive eye serum : Ginseng + Retinal',NULL,135.000,'When we lack the protein that imparts elasticity to the dermal layer of the skin, collagen and hyaluronic acid decrease, which causes wrinkles. We created an eye serum that helps to improve wrinkles on the sensitive skin around the eyes by combining ginseng extract and retinal. <br>\r\n <br>\r\nFrom the very beginning, we knew we wanted ginseng as the base ingredient for the eye serum because there are multiple studies showing that ginseng is effective in improving wrinkles due to containing abundant amounts of saponins. Ginseng is a well-known herbal ingredient with excellent efficacy.  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVitamin A was, without a doubt, the number one ingredient we wanted to combine with ginseng.\r\nThere are two types of vitamin A used as cosmetic ingredients, retinol and retinal. Our most important task was to achieve ingredient stability and reduce skin irritation at the same time.  <br>\r\n2% (active ingredient 0.02%) of retinal stabilized in the form of liposomes was blended into the formula so that customers can experience retinal for themselves.','Use on eyes','produits/IMG_20230619_001827_(540_x_720_pixel)_67069.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230619_001827_(540_x_720_pixel)_67069.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230619_001554_(540_x_720_pixel)_61899.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230619_001616_(540_x_720_pixel)_28305.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230619_001757_(540_x_720_pixel)_94826.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2792,'Green Tea Routine 4 Steps Care Set',NULL,309.000,'Green tea has been recognized for centuries for its numerous health benefits, and it\'s no surprise that it\'s also a popular ingredient in skincare products. The catechins and antioxidants found in green tea help protect the skin against damage from environmental stressors and reduce inflammation. Green tea also has antimicrobial properties, making it an effective ingredient for combating acne. <br>\r\nThis routine with green tea can provide a range of benefits, from reducing puffiness and dark circles around the eyes to hydrating and soothing the skin. With its natural and gentle properties, green tea is a fantastic addition to any skincare routine.','Gjkl',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2793,'peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #06 Plum Update: A cool-tone plum pink',NULL,65.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.','produits/IMG_20230706_180304_(540_x_720_pixel)_14648.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230706_180304_(540_x_720_pixel)_14648.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_180413_(540_x_720_pixel)_16509.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_180439_(540_x_720_pixel)_80843.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_180500_(540_x_720_pixel)_92118.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2794,'Glow Fixing Tint #1 Pure Coral',NULL,68.000,'A glossy version of ETUDE’s bestselling Fixing Tint, the Glow Fixing Tint comes in a lightweight texture that sits comfortably on lips with a luscious, dewy finish. It’s enriched with over 30% moisturizing ingredients and plant-based oils to keep your pout free of dry flakes and wrinkles. The sheer formula is buildable so you can create both gradated and bold lip looks.','Glides on lips directly to create look.\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards.','produits/IMG_20230704_100924_(540_x_720_pixel)_35449.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230704_100924_(540_x_720_pixel)_35449.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_100939_(540_x_720_pixel)_70470.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_101153_(540_x_720_pixel)_40307.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_101213_(540_x_720_pixel)_66678.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2795,'Glow Fixing Tint #2 Mellow Pi