ightweight texture that sits comfortably on lips with a luscious, dewy finish. It’s enriched with over 30% moisturizing ingredients and plant-based oils to keep your pout free of dry flakes and wrinkles. The sheer formula is buildable so you can create both gradated and bold lip looks.','Glides on lips directly to create look.\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards.','produits/IMG_20230706_021457_(540_x_720_pixel)_28154.jpg',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230706_021457_(540_x_720_pixel)_28154.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_021515_(540_x_720_pixel)_16122.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_021523_(540_x_720_pixel)_74695.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_021533_(540_x_720_pixel)_95818.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2798,'Ginseng Moist Sun Serum (SPF 50+ PA++++)',NULL,111.000,'This nourishing serum features SPF 50+ PA++++ to protect skin against harmful UV rays. Infused with 30% ginseng extract, the anti-aging formula enhances skin elasticity and keeps skin hydrated. Formulated with 2% niacinamide to brighten skin for a glowing appearance. The lightweight texture adheres well onto the skin without a sticky after-feel.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✽ A nourishing serum that protects your skin against UV rays with SPF50+ PA++++. <br>\r\n✽ Infused with 30% Ginseng Extract delivers intensive anti-aging power to boost skin elasticity and keep your skin hydrated and smooth. <br>\r\n✽ Formulated with 2% Niacinamide to maintain the oil-water balance of your skin while removing dead skin cells and impurities, creating a glowing and youthful-looking complexion. <br>\r\n✽ Effectively reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. <br>\r\n✽ Lightweight texture promotes rapid absorption without any sticky feeling.','Pump a generous amount and apply to areas of exposed skin.\r\nReapply every 2-3 hours.\r\n\r\n*Due to the nature of the formula, makeup may be removed if reapplying an excessive amount over makeup.','produits/IMG_20230707_133153_(540_x_720_pixel)_21896.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230707_133153_(540_x_720_pixel)_21896.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230707_133205_(540_x_720_pixel)_90247.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230707_133233_(540_x_720_pixel)_14647.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230707_133254_(540_x_720_pixel)_81262.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2799,'KAHI - Wrinkle Bounce Multi Balm',NULL,210.000,'Looking for the viral Korean stick balm that keeps appearing in Korean dramas? You\'re on the right page! The KAHI Wrinkle Bounce Multi Balm is a multipurpose collagen-infused stick balm that helps reduce wrinkles while giving your skin a beautiful glow with just a single swipe! This balm helps form a moisture barrier for long-lasting hydration, boosting the lasting power of makeup. Can be applied all over your face, as a lip balm or even on your hair! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nInfused with Salmon Complex such as Salmon Collagen and Sodium DNA, which increases the synthesis of collagen to restore skin elasticity effectively. Other than boosting hydration and elasticity, it also helps minimise the look of pores and increases skin radiance. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types.','As a moisturising stick: Apply it evenly on dry areas to keep your skin moisturised\r\nAs a lip balm: Apply it on dry lips to keep your lips moisturised\r\nAs a radiant-boosting balm: Apply it once to instantly make your skin naturally radiant\r\nFor haircare: Apply it on split ends of hair for damage care\r\n\r\nTIP: Temperature changes around the balm can cause &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;sweating&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot; or water droplets to appear on the surface of the balm. The product is still safe to use.','produits/IMG_20230708_203011_(540_x_720_pixel)_79444.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230708_203011_(540_x_720_pixel)_79444.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_203121_(540_x_720_pixel)_32817.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_203139_(540_x_720_pixel)_40322.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_203323_(540_x_720_pixel)_72434.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2800,'AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum',NULL,125.000,'The AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum is a niacinamide-based serum that corrects dark spots and improves uneven skin tone. With the help of plant-derived Squalane, this serum retains moisture to keep your skin glowing and healthy wherever you go.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types, especially acne-prone or sensitive skin.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nsizes: 50ml','Apply a small amount to entire face or problem areas. Pat until completely absorbed.','produits/IMG_20230708_205736_(540_x_720_pixel)_31086.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230708_205736_(540_x_720_pixel)_31086.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_210524_(540_x_720_pixel)_93276.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_210540_(540_x_720_pixel)_14928.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_210555_(540_x_720_pixel)_65455.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2801,'Isntree - Hyaluronic Acid Watery Sun Gel Twin PackSPF50+ PA++++',NULL,176.000,'The Hyaluronic Acid Watery Sun Gel is a moisturising gel-type sunscreen from Korean brand ISNTREE that feels lightweight and refreshing on the skin\r\n\r\nThis SPF 50+ chemical sunscreen is enriched with 8 types of hyaluronic acid, each with a different molecular size to ensure deep and long-lasting hydration. Also infused with a soothing blend of Centella, Anti-oxidant rich Purslane, and heart-leaf extract. \r\n\r\nDesigned for all skin types and concerns, this gel is free from fragrances and leaves no white cast. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDesigned for all skin types and concerns, this gel is free from fragrances and leaves no white cast.','Shake gently before use.\r\nAfter applying your usual morning skincare routine, finish off with a small amount of sunscreen. Smooth over your face ensuring the application is even, and pat to aid absorption. Reapply throughout the day as needed.','produits/IMG_20230709_093301_(540_x_720_pixel)_94710.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230709_093301_(540_x_720_pixel)_94710.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_093320_(540_x_720_pixel)_86964.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_093337_(540_x_720_pixel)_45201.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_093354_(540_x_720_pixel)_86054.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2802,'Skin1004 - Madagascar Centella Air-Fit Suncream Plus',NULL,99.000,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Air-Fit Suncream Plus SPF50+++  is designed for sensitive skin and rosacea skin not only for its Mineral-based UV filters of SPF50+ PA++++ protection, but also its ability to simultaneously brighten the skin and reduces visible rednesss (a comon rosacea skin condition) with niacinamide. This sunscreen can be worn all year long without feeling heavy or leaving a white cast.\r\n\r\nWHAT IT IS:\r\nA non-nano physical sunscreen that blocks UV rays, while simultaneously brightening the skin. This sunscreen can be worn all year long without feeling heavy or leaving a white cast.\r\n\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\r\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Effectively soothes the skin.\r\nNiacinamide: Helps control the appearance of redness.','As the last step of your skincare routine, apply evenly to areas exposed to UV rays.','produits/IMG_20230709_095346_(540_x_720_pixel)_46317.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230709_095346_(540_x_720_pixel)_46317.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_095400_(540_x_720_pixel)_79018.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_095410_(540_x_720_pixel)_54551.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_095428_(540_x_720_pixel)_60454.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2803,'PERIPERA - Double Longwear Cover Concealer',NULL,50.000,'The Peripera Double Longwear Cover is a gentle-on-skin concealer that adheres well on skin and provides a lightweight finish that lasts all day. Contains Double Powder mixed with different particles to conceal dark circles, blemishes, dark spots and other skin imperfections. \r\n\r\nClinically tested for skin irritation, suitable even for sensitive skin.\r\n\r\nAvailable in 2 shades\r\n01 <br>\r\n03','Apply a moderate amount onto areas of concern, then tap with fingers to blend.','produits/IMG_20230709_141206_(540_x_720_pixel)_54606.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230709_141206_(540_x_720_pixel)_54606.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_141349_(540_x_720_pixel)_17336.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_141428_(540_x_720_pixel)_22523.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_141800_(540_x_720_pixel)_60244.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2804,'Minis Kit',NULL,108.000,'Ginseng Essence Water Mini &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\nA refreshing, soothing antioxidant essence boost enriched with Ginseng water (80%) helps nourish, soothe, firm and plump the skin. At the same time, Niacinamide helps to even out the skin\'s complexion and texture. &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\n&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\nHoli Pop Jelly Tint PK03 Beet &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\nTint contains strawberry, apple, rose hip, papaya and grape seed extracts - they make the lips soft and elastic, moisturize and nourish them, gives them an incredibly persistent and vibrant color. &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\n&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\nMISSHA 3D Mascara &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\nThis 3D Mascara glams up lashes while providing a prolonged curl. The lightweight and smudge-proof formula adheres well to lashes without clumping. The thin triangular spoolie coats each lash for a voluminous finish. &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\n&amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\nRelief Sun : Rice + Probiotics (SPF50+ PA++++) mini &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\nRelief Sun is a lightweight and creamy type organic sunscreen that\'s comfortable on skin. Even if you apply a large amount several times, it is not sticky and gives a moist finish like that of a light moisturizing cream. Containing 30% rice extract and grain fermented extracts, it provides moisture and nourishment to the skin.','Apply on face',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2805,'Beauty of Joseon - Relief Sun Mini',NULL,30.000,'Fitted with SPF 50+ PA++++ to fend off UVA and UVB rays, this organic sunscreen comes in a lightweight cream texture that absorbs quickly into skin without leaving a white cast. The chemical sunscreen contains niacinamide to leave your skin glowing. Additional ingredients of rice extract and grain-derived probiotics keep skin supple and hydrated. Formulated without oxybenzone, octinoxate and animal-derived ingredients, the Relief Sun is suitable for sensitive skin. This version is mini-sized','At the last step of skin care routine, evenly spread a proper amount over areas frequently exposed to sun.','produits/IMG_20230711_030135_(540_x_720_pixel)_91420.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230711_030135_(540_x_720_pixel)_91420.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_030031_(540_x_720_pixel)_25835.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_030114_(540_x_720_pixel)_11608.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_025954_(540_x_720_pixel)_11053.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2806,'Watsons - True Colour Pink Cherry Cheek Lip Pink Cherry',NULL,50.000,'Watsons True Colour Pink Cherry Cheek And Lip is specially formulated with a blend of ingredients to moisturise and soften your lips. Added Vitamin E keeps your cheeks and lips soft and smooth.Squeeze a small amount onto fingertips and gently apply to cheeks or lips and blend quickly.','Squeeze a small amount onto fingertips and gently apply to cheeks or lips and blend quickly','produits/IMG_20230711_035256_(540_x_720_pixel)_55194.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230711_035256_(540_x_720_pixel)_55194.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_035343_(540_x_720_pixel)_67901.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_035456_(540_x_720_pixel)_82007.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_035537_(540_x_720_pixel)_97081.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2807,'Watsons - True Colour Lip Balm Rosy Red',NULL,50.000,'Watsons True Colour Lip Balm Rosy Red, is specially formulated with a blend of ingredients like shea butter, vitamin E and Natural Beeswax help to moisturise, Nourishes, and soften your lips.  <br>\r\nJust be glamorous with this True Colour Lip series that brings you colour and shine for an all-round beautiful look.','Apply evenly on lips as required','produits/IMG_20230713_025833_(540_x_720_pixel)_86563.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230713_025833_(540_x_720_pixel)_86563.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_025845_(540_x_720_pixel)_56628.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_025906_(540_x_720_pixel)_22549.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_025918_(540_x_720_pixel)_83428.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2808,'HOLIKA HOLIKA - Holi Pop Jelly Tint PK03 Beet',NULL,45.000,'Tint gives lips a soft, natural finish, without leaving them sticky. Due to the unique plant complex it intensively nourishes and prevents the appearance of peeling of the lips. Eliminates the symptoms of dehydration and dry skin. Thanks to the plant complex, it restores the natural lipid balance of the skin of the lips.','Put on your lips','produits/IMG_20230712_032727_(540_x_720_pixel)_37270.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230712_032727_(540_x_720_pixel)_37270.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_032750_(540_x_720_pixel)_20929.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_032812_(540_x_720_pixel)_84255.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_035452_(540_x_720_pixel)_22805.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_032727_(540_x_720_pixel)_86424.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_032750_(540_x_720_pixel)_59244.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_032812_(540_x_720_pixel)_74819.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_035452_(540_x_720_pixel)_19891.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2809,'Watsons - True Colour Lip Balm Blooming Pink',NULL,50.000,'This lip care helps nourish and provide colour in one step. It is specially formulated with a blend of ingredients to moisturise and soften your lips. Added Shea Butter, Natural Beeswax and Vitamin E. helps moisturise lips and prevent dryness and chapping.For external use only. Keep out of reach of children. To avoid breakage, always turn up the stick 2-3 mm only. Do not stay too long in the sun while using a sunscreen product.','Apply evenly on lips as required\r\nTo avoid breakage, always turn up the stick 2-3 mm only. Do not stay too long in the sun while using a sunscreen product.','produits/prd-back-302340_31927.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/prd-back-302340_31927.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_031059_(540_x_720_pixel)_47370.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_031111_(540_x_720_pixel)_49014.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_031137_(540_x_720_pixel)_82466.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2810,'MISSHA - 3D Mascara',NULL,65.000,'This 3D Mascara glams up lashes while providing a prolonged curl. The lightweight and smudge-proof formula adheres well to lashes without clumping. The thin triangular spoolie coats each lash for a voluminous finish.','After using eye curler, apply it to your eyelashes in zigzags.','produits/IMG_20230712_024656_(540_x_720_pixel)_59922.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230712_024656_(540_x_720_pixel)_59922.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_024857_(540_x_720_pixel)_37279.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_030840_(540_x_720_pixel)_54675.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230712_030906_(540_x_720_pixel)_23775.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2811,'peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #11 Brown Heaven: A warm-tone pink brown',NULL,65.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth outwards toward corners of mouth.','produits/IMG_20230713_033128_(540_x_720_pixel)_30768.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230713_033128_(540_x_720_pixel)_30768.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_033422_(540_x_720_pixel)_95974.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_033207_(540_x_720_pixel)_58487.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230713_033437_(540_x_720_pixel)_65891.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2812,'peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #06 Plum Update: A cool-tone plum pink',NULL,65.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\\\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2813,'peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #03 Rose In Mind: A mute fig-like rose color',NULL,65.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.','produits/IMG_20230715_021148_(540_x_720_pixel)_36901.jpg',NULL,9,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230715_021148_(540_x_720_pixel)_36901.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_021319_(540_x_720_pixel)_30095.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_021251_(540_x_720_pixel)_29227.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_021515_(540_x_720_pixel)_29021.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2814,'SKIN 1004 - Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Water-Fit Sun Serum',NULL,94.000,'Fitted with SPF50+ PA++++, this organic sunscreen is made with a golden ratio of hyaluronic acid and centella asiatica extract to soothe and hydrate skin without leaving a white cast. Additional ingredients of arugula leaf, green tea and broccoli extracts provide antioxidant benefits and help to improve underlying skin conditions. Fast-absorbing formula in a cream-like texture leaves your skin plump and glowing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\r\nHyalu-Cica Formula: Our unique combination of Centella Asiatica Extract and Hyaluronic Acids simultaneously heals and hydrates the skin.','Use at the last step of your morning skin care routine.\r\nTake an appropriate amount and apply evenly onto areas likely to be exposed to sunlight.','produits/IMG_20230715_171409_(540_x_720_pixel)_91188.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230715_171409_(540_x_720_pixel)_91188.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_171438_(540_x_720_pixel)_38353.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_171608_(540_x_720_pixel)_77080.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_171624_(540_x_720_pixel)_18288.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2815,'haruharu wonder - Black Bamboo Mist 80 ml',NULL,65.000,'The HARUHARU WONDER Black Bamboo Mist is a face mist that gives off a cooling sensation, just like a rain shower in mid-summer! This fine spray mist provides deep nourishment and cooling hydration to exhausted skin.\r\n\r\nThis quick absorbing formula is packed with antioxidant-rich and naturally-fermented black bamboo, bamboo shoot extract, and skin-regenerating beta glucan for firmer and smoother looking skin.\r\n\r\nPerfect for all skin types, especially those with dehydrated and easily irritated skin who wants an immediate dose of healing moisture.\r\n\r\n95% naturally derived ingredients, Cruelty Free, Vegan Friendly, Skin irritation test completed.','1. Shake and hold the bottle 15 - 25 cm away from face and mist.\r\n\r\n2. Use anytime throughout the day to freshen up skin.','produits/IMG_20230715_183258_(540_x_720_pixel)_32138.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230715_183258_(540_x_720_pixel)_32138.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_183330_(540_x_720_pixel)_11712.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_183446_(540_x_720_pixel)_24526.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_183515_(540_x_720_pixel)_61735.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2816,'haruharu wonder - Black Bamboo Mist 150 ml',NULL,120.000,'The HARUHARU WONDER Black Bamboo Mist is a face mist that gives off a cooling sensation, just like a rain shower in mid-summer! This fine spray mist provides deep nourishment and cooling hydration to exhausted skin.\r\n\r\nThis quick absorbing formula is packed with antioxidant-rich and naturally-fermented black bamboo, bamboo shoot extract, and skin-regenerating beta glucan for firmer and smoother looking skin.\r\n\r\nPerfect for all skin types, especially those with dehydrated and easily irritated skin who wants an immediate dose of healing moisture.\r\n\r\n95% naturally derived ingredients, Cruelty Free, Vegan Friendly, Skin irritation test completed.','1. Shake and hold the bottle 15 - 25 cm away from face and mist.\r\n\r\n2. Use anytime throughout the day to freshen up skin.','produits/IMG_20230715_183717_(540_x_720_pixel)_53256.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230715_183717_(540_x_720_pixel)_53256.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_183748_(540_x_720_pixel)_44547.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_183805_(540_x_720_pixel)_41311.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_183822_(540_x_720_pixel)_11128.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2817,'TOCOBO - Cotton Soft Sun Stick SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,107.000,'The TOCOBO Cotton Soft Sun Stick is a vegan and cruelty-free sun stick with a soft, non-sticky, matte finish that helps protect skin while reducing the appearance of oily and textured skin. This fresh and lightweight formula contains cotton extract to hydrate and protect skin, while Herb AC Complex™ helps to calm skin. Anti Sebum P complex absorbs excess oil, leaving a matte, soft finish on the skin with no white cast. The micro-powder texture helps with oil absorption and smoothing skin\'s surface like a primer.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, especially babes with oily skin.','Glide the sun stick onto face and areas of body that are exposed to UV rays. Reapply whenever necessary.','produits/IMG_20230715_184927_(540_x_720_pixel)_95074.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230715_184927_(540_x_720_pixel)_95074.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_184947_(540_x_720_pixel)_20252.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_185001_(540_x_720_pixel)_86993.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230715_185021_(540_x_720_pixel)_31797.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2818,'TOCOBO - Bio Watery Sun Cream',NULL,117.000,'This SPF 50+ PA++++ sun cream in a chemical formula leaves a natural, white cast-free finish. It contains 1,000ppm of mung bean extract to soothe irritation and tackle blemishes, along with 1,000ppm of bio-hyaluronic acid to boost skin moisture. Vegan and cruelty-free formula is hypoallergenic. It works well under makeup.','Before applying makeup, spread a proper amount of the sun cream onto your face and body parts that are exposed to UV rays. Reapply whenever necessary.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2819,'VT - Essence Sun Pact SPF50+ PA+++',NULL,104.000,'Multifunctional sun pact is composed of mineral and chemical filters to shield skin from harmful UV rays while leaving a white cast-free natural finish. The non-sticky formula conditions and soothes with peptides and hydrolyzed elastin. Enriched with brightening essence, the sun cushion leaves skin glowing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n* Composed of blue and white essences to provide UV protection and skin care at the same time\r\nBrightens, moisturizes and firms skin that is sagging and fatigued due to summer heat <br>\r\n* Its light texture leaves a natural finish with no white cast. <br>','At the last step of your skin care routine, apply a thin layer onto your entire face with the enclosed puff and pat gently to aid absorption.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2820,'A\'PIEU - Honey and Milk Lip Scrub',NULL,25.000,'Milk protein extracts and Vitamin E acetate in this lip scrub help to firm, moisturize and protect skin as the scrub gently removes dead skin cells, leaving your lips soft and smooth.','A lip scrub that exfoliates, nourishes, and moisturizes lips with honey and milk.\r\nHydrates dry lips, and removes dead skin cells leaving your lips soft and smooth.\r\nHow to use: 1. Apply an appropriate amount onto lips.\r\n2. Gently massage 2-3 minutes and rinse with water.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2821,'Abib Quick Sunstick Protection Bar SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,117.000,'The Abib Quick Sunstick Protection Bar is a convenient sun protection stick that effortlessly glides over the skin without leaving a sticky residue or a white cast. Acacia Peptide and Ceramide strengthens skin barrier against external aggressors. Can be repeatedly applied onto skin post-makeup for continued protection.','As the last step to your daytime skincare routine, apply directly to the face after moisturising.','produits/IMG_20230723_182442_(540_x_720_pixel)_14261.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230723_182442_(540_x_720_pixel)_14261.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230723_182526_(540_x_720_pixel)_14700.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230723_182550_(540_x_720_pixel)_48170.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230723_182615_(540_x_720_pixel)_19823.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2822,'SOON JUNG PH 5.5 RELIEF TONER',NULL,110.000,'The Etude House Soon Jung pH 5.5 Relief Toner is a soothing and hydrating toner that keeps your skin calm and cool throughout the day. Formulated with 97% naturally derived ingredients, this clear, water-like toner uses madecassoside and panthenol to deeply hydrate and heal damaged or heated skin. With its simple, hypoallergenic formula that is free of potential irritants like synthetic fragrance, mineral oil or parabens, this toner is perfect for all skin types, especially babes with sensitive skin.','After cleansing steps, dispense a sufficient amount onto your palms. Gentle pat onto skin for better absorption. Follow up with the rest of your skin care routine','produits/IMG_20230724_003711_(540_x_720_pixel)_70052.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230724_003711_(540_x_720_pixel)_70052.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_003732_(540_x_720_pixel)_35527.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_003805_(540_x_720_pixel)_57054.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_003820_(540_x_720_pixel)_67750.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2823,'Axis-Y Complete No-Stress Physical Sunscreen',NULL,106.000,'The Complete No-Stress Physical Sunscreen is a gentle, 100% mineral-based sunscreen designed to soothe and protect with SPF50+. <br> \r\n<br>\r\nFormulated with 2% Niacinamide and Mugwort extract to control excess sebum and reduce redness - making this ideal for oily and acne-prone skin types. Green Tea and Chamomile also keep skin soothed and balanced thought the day. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nIt has a lotion-type, non-sticky formula that leaves a moist soft-touch finish (not sticky or heavy).','Step 1. Apply an appropriate amount to face and neck\r\n\r\nStep 2. Blend and pat to completely absorb','produits/IMG_20230724_144410_(540_x_720_pixel)_50051.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230724_144410_(540_x_720_pixel)_50051.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_144425_(540_x_720_pixel)_24034.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_144513_(540_x_720_pixel)_49851.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_170145_(540_x_720_pixel)_63552.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_170244_(540_x_720_pixel)_90485.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_170253_(540_x_720_pixel)_20987.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_170436_(540_x_720_pixel)_16324.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2824,'peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #04 Pink Youth',NULL,65.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2825,'A.H.C - Natural Perfection Double Shield Sun Stick',NULL,107.000,'Keep skin safe and protected with this sunscreen stick fitted with SPF50+ PA++++ and formulated with the brand&rsquo;s UV IR BLOCK&trade; technology to simultaneously block out UV rays and heat from the sun. It contains various skin care ingredients (including bamboo extract, glacier water and cotton seed extract) to soothe, smooth and hydrate skin. Sun stick glides on smoothly and leaves a comfortable and natural finish. Dermatologically tested formula is safe for sensitive skin. \r\nBenefits:\r\nOffers powerful sun protection against UV rays with its SPF50+ PA++++ broad spectrum.\r\nPatented UV IR BLOCK&trade; effectively blocks out UV rays and near-Infrared Ray (sun heat) at the same time.\r\nPhyto Protect Complex (Opuntia Ficus-Indica Stem Extract, Cotton Seed Extract) helps protect and soothe irritated skin agaist external aggressors with comforts.\r\n5 kinds of natural water including deep sea water, glacier water and carbonated water deliver ample refreshing moisture for dewy skin.\r\nSchizandra Chinensis Fruit Extract and Bambusa Vulgaris Extract help control skin hear and condition skin for healthy express.\r\nDermotologically tested, mild formula infused with naturally derived ingredient, suitable for all family members.','1. Open the cap and turn the dial at bottom to release a small amount of product (5mm).\r\n2. Evenly apply to areas that are vulnerable to UV rays.',NULL,NULL,8,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2826,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule Kit',NULL,240.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule Kit (Mini 4 Ampoules) contains 4 of the brands best selling ampoules to target your many different skin concerns! This set includes:\r\n\r\nSKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule (30ml): A lightweight soothing ampoule that helps hydrate, calm and restore imbalance in the skin with 100% Centella Asiatica extract.\r\nSKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh Ampoule (30ml): Contains Pink Himalayan Salt enriched with clarifying minerals to clear pores of impurities while minimising enlarged pores.\r\nSKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Capsule Ampoule (30ml): A brightening ampoule with patented ingredient MadeWhite™ and niacinamide to provide you with clear and bright skin.\r\nSKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tea-Trica Relief Ampoule (30ml): The perfect SOS treatment for acne prone skin. Packed with highly soothing ingredients focused on calming the skin, this non-comedogenic formula treats inflammation and irritation.','1. Drop an appropriate amount onto the skin and evenly apply.\r\n2. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20230805_215356_(540_x_720_pixel)_37058.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230805_215356_(540_x_720_pixel)_37058.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230805_220005_(540_x_720_pixel)_72593.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230805_215714_(540_x_720_pixel)_16211.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230805_220054_(540_x_720_pixel)_47119.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2827,'A.H.C - Natural Perfection Double Shield Sun Stick',NULL,107.000,'Keep skin safe and protected with this chemical and mineral sunscreen stick fitted with SPF50+ PA++++ and formulated with the brand’s UV IR BLOCK™ technology to simultaneously block out UV rays and heat from the sun. It contains various skin care ingredients (including bamboo extract, glacier water and cotton seed extract) to soothe, smooth and hydrate skin. Sun stick glides on smoothly and leaves a comfortable and natural finish. Dermatologically tested formula is safe for sensitive skin.','1. Open the cap and turn the dial at bottom to release a small amount of product (5mm).\r\n2. Evenly apply to areas that are vulnerable to UV rays.','produits/IMG_20230807_222253_(540_x_720_pixel)_50259.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230807_222253_(540_x_720_pixel)_50259.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_222342_(540_x_720_pixel)_20270.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_222408_(540_x_720_pixel)_57368.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_222435_(540_x_720_pixel)_29392.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2828,'UNLEASHIA - Shaper Pomade Eyebrow Fixer',NULL,60.000,'The secret to bold and dramatic brows, this eyebrow pomade delivers rich color and sharp definition with just a few simple strokes. Formulated with UNLEASHIA’s patented Hard and Soft Fixing technology, this eyebrow fixer offers a strong hold while allowing you to create a soft, natural-looking finish. This product is additionally infused with rice extract, soybean seed extract and glycerin for steady hydration. To use, apply product onto brows using the spoolie end of the applicator before brushing up. For more precise styling, use the dual-ended brush.','Use the applicator to brush and fix your eyebrows. Use the dual-ended brush to style your brows as desired.','produits/IMG_20230807_233024_(540_x_720_pixel)_22010.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230807_233024_(540_x_720_pixel)_22010.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_233052_(540_x_720_pixel)_68953.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_233137_(540_x_720_pixel)_39717.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_233147_(540_x_720_pixel)_70601.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2829,'Baby Silky Hand Mask Sheet',NULL,25.000,'The key ingredients in this hand mask include shea butter, honey, and milk protein, which work together to deeply hydrate and nourish the skin. Shea butter is rich in fatty acids and vitamins, which help to protect and repair the skin\'s natural barrier. Honey is a natural humectant that helps to retain moisture, while milk protein is rich in amino acids and vitamins, which help to promote healthy skin.\r\n\r\nThe hand mask sheet is enriched with papaya fruit extract, that contains natural enzymes called papain and chymopapain, which help to exfoliate and brighten the skin. These enzymes can help to remove dead skin cells, revealing a brighter and more even skin tone. Papaya extract also contains antioxidants and vitamins, such as vitamin C, which help to protect the skin from damage and promote collagen production, resulting in firmer and smoother skin.\r\n\r\nThe gloves are made of a soft, comfortable material that conforms to your hands for maximum effectiveness.','Wash and dry your hands thoroughly.\r\nOpen the package and remove the gloves.\r\nPut your hands into the gloves and secure them around your wrists using the adhesive strip.\r\nLeave the gloves on for 15-20 minutes to allow the essence to soak into your skin.\r\nRemove the gloves and massage any remaining essence into your skin. Do not rinse your hands after using the hand mask.\r\nUse the hand mask 1-2 times per week or as needed. Disposable mask should not be reused - dispose of the used mask after use.','produits/IMG_20230807_235129_(540_x_720_pixel)_19679.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230807_235129_(540_x_720_pixel)_19679.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_235445_(540_x_720_pixel)_25646.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_235325_(540_x_720_pixel)_54534.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_235352_(540_x_720_pixel)_33135.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2830,'CENTELLA TRAVEL KIT',NULL,185.000,'WHAT IT IS:\r\nThe Ultimate 5 travel-size skincare set that includes all the products in the Madagascar Centella Line.\r\n\r\nSet Includes :\r\n-Centella Ampoule Foam 20ml\r\n-Centella Toning Toner 30ml\r\n-Centella Ampoule 30ml\r\n-Centella Soothing Cream 30ml\r\n-Centella Light Cleansing Oil 30ml\r\n\r\n\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\r\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Soothes and replenishes skin hydration level.','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption','produits/IMG_20230808_000050_(540_x_720_pixel)_38915.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230808_000050_(540_x_720_pixel)_38915.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230808_000059_(540_x_720_pixel)_56345.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230808_000114_(540_x_720_pixel)_36001.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230808_000200_(540_x_720_pixel)_10252.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2831,'BLESSED MOON - Fluffy Lip Tint',NULL,62.000,'Highly moisturizing lip tint boasts a smooth formula that glides effortlessly on lips, delivering a lightweight texture and vivid pigmentation. Formulated with extracts from mango seed, cotton seed, camellia oil, avocado oil, Vitamin E and Shine Essential Oil Complex to nourish and hydrate lips.','Apply the lip tint to bare lips for a sheer wash of color.','produits/IMG_20230809_134441_(540_x_720_pixel)_88727.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230809_134441_(540_x_720_pixel)_88727.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230809_134455_(540_x_720_pixel)_85720.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230809_134558_(540_x_720_pixel)_77449.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230809_134657_(540_x_720_pixel)_99128.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2832,'SKIN 1004 - Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Water-Fit Sun Serum Twin Pack',NULL,187.000,'Fitted with SPF50+ PA++++, this organic sunscreen is made with a golden ratio of hyaluronic acid and centella asiatica extract to soothe and hydrate skin without leaving a white cast. Additional ingredients of arugula leaf, green tea and broccoli extracts provide antioxidant benefits and help to improve underlying skin conditions. Fast-absorbing formula in a cream-like texture leaves your skin plump and glowing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\r\nHyalu-Cica Formula: Our unique combination of Centella Asiatica Extract and Hyaluronic Acids simultaneously heals and hydrates the skin.','Use at the last step of your morning skin care routine.\r\nTake an appropriate amount and apply evenly onto areas likely to be exposed ofto sunlight.','produits/IMG_20230814_100121_(540_x_720_pixel)_56072.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230814_100121_(540_x_720_pixel)_56072.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_100142_(540_x_720_pixel)_96714.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_100215_(540_x_720_pixel)_78057.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_100201_(540_x_720_pixel)_11391.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2833,'Isntree - Hyaluronic Acid Watery Sun Gel SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,110.000,'The Hyaluronic Acid Watery Sun Gel is a moisturising gel-type sunscreen from Korean brand ISNTREE that feels lightweight and refreshing on the skin\r\n\r\nThis SPF 50+ chemical sunscreen is enriched with 8 types of hyaluronic acid, each with a different molecular size to ensure deep and long-lasting hydration. Also infused with a soothing blend of Centella, Anti-oxidant rich Purslane, and heart-leaf extract. \r\n\r\nDesigned for all skin types and concerns, this gel is free from fragrances and leaves no white cast. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDesigned for all skin types and concerns, this gel is free from fragrances and leaves no white cast.','Shake gently before use.\r\nAfter applying your usual morning skincare routine, finish off with a small amount of sunscreen. Smooth over your face ensuring the application is even, and pat to aid absorption. Reapply throughout the day as needed.','produits/IMG_20230814_101008_(540_x_720_pixel)_81649.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230814_101008_(540_x_720_pixel)_81649.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_101043_(540_x_720_pixel)_22557.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_101248_(540_x_720_pixel)_96164.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_101311_(540_x_720_pixel)_39284.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2834,'A\'PIEU - Pure Block Tone-Up Sun Base SPF50+ PA+++ 50ml',NULL,85.000,'A sister brand of MISSHA, A\'PIEU offers high-performance makeup and skin care products created for women. Keep harmful UV rays at bay with this chemical and physical sun block offering SPF50+ PA+++ sun protection. Cream-type formula contains papaya extract and grapefruit extract to prevent sebum build-up and help make makeup last longer. Enriched with brightening agent niacinamide and coming in a slightly pink-tinted color, sun block provides a tone-up effect for radiant results. Non-sticky product spreads easily and leaves no residue on skin.','1. Used at the last step of skincare.\r\n2. Gently spread over your face.\r\n3. Reapply as needed when you spend a lot of time outdoors.','produits/IMG_20230826_230133_(540_x_720_pixel)_15959.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230826_230133_(540_x_720_pixel)_15959.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230826_230231_(540_x_720_pixel)_84639.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230826_230552_(540_x_720_pixel)_68996.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230826_230616_(540_x_720_pixel)_95113.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2835,'HOLIKA HOLIKA - Water Vibe Tint 02 Gulp',NULL,68.000,'Highly pigmented lip tint is enriched with fruit ingredients including blueberry, yuzu and peach extracts to add juiciness and shine to lips. The waterproof and smudge-free formula glides on lips smoothly and stays put all day. ','Glides on lips directly to create look','produits/IMG_20240107_182537_(540_x_720_pixel)_18880.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_182537_(540_x_720_pixel)_18880.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_182600_(540_x_720_pixel)_44336.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_182611_(540_x_720_pixel)_75116.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_182637_(540_x_720_pixel)_55565.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2836,'Collagen Age Defender Set',NULL,625.000,'Collagen Day Cream not only hydrates the skin but also helps with wrinkle care and UV protection at once.  It combines skincare with UV protection. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING. It is formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Vita Secret Multi Balm is infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation.  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Ampoule is an anti-aging booster that rejuvenates your skin by preventing the formation of wrinkles and reducing their appearance. It target wrinkles, hydrates, soothes irritation and redness, brightens and strengthens skin.','First, use the Collagen Ampoule after cleansing and tonning the face and then apply the balm and last but not least the day cream.\r\nat night, use the ampoule and then the balm. Lastly, put on the sleeping mask before going to bed.','produits/IMG_20230905_174643_(540_x_720_pixel)_18589.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230905_174643_(540_x_720_pixel)_18589.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_175053_(540_x_720_pixel)_31360.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_175226_(540_x_720_pixel)_94993.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_175317_(540_x_720_pixel)_25272.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2837,'Daily Collagen Trio',NULL,483.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING. It is formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Vita Secret Multi Balm is infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation.  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Ampoule is an anti-aging booster that rejuvenates your skin by preventing the formation of wrinkles and reducing their appearance. It target wrinkles, hydrates, soothes irritation and redness, brightens and strengthens skin.','Use the ampoule and balm in the morning\r\nUse the sleeping mask at night',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2838,'Collagen Age Defender Trio',NULL,474.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Day Cream not only hydrates the skin but also helps with wrinkle care and UV protection at once.  It combines skincare with UV protection. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING. It is formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Vita Secret Multi Balm is infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation.  <br>','Use the balm and day cream in the morning\r\nUse the sleeping mask at night',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2839,'Collagen Age Defender Duo',NULL,266.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING. It is formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Vita Secret Multi Balm is infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation.  <br>','Use the balm anytime, anywhere.\r\nUse the sleeping mask at night one to three times a week',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2840,'Collagen Age Defender Day and Night Duo',NULL,282.000,'Restore your skin\'s youthful radiance with the Ksecret Collagen Age Defender Duo. This powerful combination of our Collagen Boosting Secret Day Cream and Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask works harmoniously to rejuvenate and revitalize your complexion. <br>\r\nThe Day Cream provides essential hydration and protection, while the Sleeping Mask deeply nourishes and repairs skin as you sleep. Together, they help to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, improve skin elasticity, and promote a healthy, glowing complexion. <br>\r\nExperience the transformative power of collagen as you unveil a younger-looking you. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey Benefits: <br>\r\n<br>\r\n * Reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles <br>\r\n * Improves skin elasticity and firmness <br>\r\n * Deeply hydrates and nourishes the skin <br>\r\n * Promotes a radiant and youthful complexion <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive.','In the morning, at the last step of your skincare routine apply the day cream.\r\nAt night, in the last step of your skincare routine apply the sleeping mask.','produits/IMG_20230905_194415_(540_x_720_pixel)_51580.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230905_194415_(540_x_720_pixel)_51580.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_194445_(540_x_720_pixel)_23005.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_194603_(540_x_720_pixel)_59259.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_195147_(540_x_720_pixel)_62578.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2841,'CQMONG Intensive Care Trio',NULL,296.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with CQMONG (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy.\r\n<br>\r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Intensive Eye Cream:\r\nApply a suitable amount to eye areas and softly pat until absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;BR&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nNourishing Moisture Cream:\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nDiamond Ampoule Sheet Mask:\r\n1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After washing face, apply sheet mask on face. Pull the eye part of sheet up to just below the eyes, that part will be fully covered. (No need to attach additional Eye Patches)\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20231006_182223_(540_x_720_pixel)_67162.jpg',NULL,15,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231006_182223_(540_x_720_pixel)_67162.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_182238_(540_x_720_pixel)_57119.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_182303_(540_x_720_pixel)_62117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_182500_(540_x_720_pixel)_92567.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2842,'V10 Hyal Hydra Capsule Sunscreen',NULL,89.000,'V10 Hyal Hydra Capsule Sunscreen by Some by Mi is your ultimate sun protection and hydration solution\r\n\r\nThis sunscreen is infused with hyaluronic acid capsules that release upon application, delivering deep hydration to your skin. With SPF 50+ PA++++, it offers superior protection against harmful UVA and UVB rays, shielding your skin from sun damage and premature aging. Its lightweight, non-greasy formula absorbs quickly, leaving a smooth and matte finish. Suitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nKeep your skin moisturized and protected with V10 Hyal Hydra Capsule Sunscreen by Some by Mi. Enjoy a nourished and guarded complexion all day long.','At the last step of skin care routine, evenly spread a proper amount over areas frequently exposed to sun.','produits/IMG_20231006_202218_(540_x_720_pixel)_54096.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231006_202218_(540_x_720_pixel)_54096.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_215207_(540_x_720_pixel)_81472.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_215314_(540_x_720_pixel)_30033.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_215357_(540_x_720_pixel)_99804.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2843,'Soon Jung 2x Barrier Intensive Cream',NULL,108.000,'Soon Jung 2x Barrier Intensive Cream is a soothing and moisturising cream that helps strengthen your skin barrier and resistance. Formulated with 93% naturally derived ingredients, this highly moisturising cream uses panthenol, madecassoside, sunflower seed oil and shea butter to restore the oil and water balance of the skin, while repairing damage. With its simple, hypoallergenic formula that is free of potential irritants like synthetic fragrance, mineral oil or parabens, this moisturiser is perfect for all skin types, especially babes with sensitive skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: all skin types\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 ml','Use as the last step of your skin care, dispense a pearl-sized amount onto the back of your hand, and apply the moisturiser on your face. Gently pat to help with absorption.','produits/IMG_20231006_223514_(540_x_720_pixel)_93208.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231006_223514_(540_x_720_pixel)_93208.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_223535_(540_x_720_pixel)_59514.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_223552_(540_x_720_pixel)_28401.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_224005_(540_x_720_pixel)_30145.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2844,'CQMONG Intensive Care Duo',NULL,185.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with CQMONG (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br>\r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n\r\nApply an appropriate amount evenly to the skin. \r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.','Nourishing Moisture Cream:\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions.','produits/IMG_20231007_183826_(540_x_720_pixel)_69774.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indis