r pores. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n* You will see an instant results when you use pore strips. <br>\r\n* With continual use, you can help reduce the appearance of blackheads. <br>\r\n* See a visible reduction in the size of your pores.','1.Thoroughly clean the face with warm water 2.Wet nose area thoroughly with clean-warm water 3.Take out the nose strip with dry hands 4.Apply the strip with the shine side down on the nose 5.Waiting 10-15 minutes 6.Carefully start to peel the strip off from two ends towards the middle.','produits/IMG_20240103_113418_(540_x_720_pixel)_93330.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240103_113418_(540_x_720_pixel)_93330.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240103_113527_(540_x_720_pixel)_21709.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240103_113545_(540_x_720_pixel)_31007.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240103_113604_(540_x_720_pixel)_92070.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2905,'FOCALLURE - Collagen Crystal  24K Gold Pure Luxury Hydra-gel Eye Mask',NULL,15.000,'Pamper yourself with these eye patches infused with collagen and squalane to moisturize skin, reduce puffiness and minimize the appearance of fine lines. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✵ Deeply moisturizes and reduces puffiness, effectively reducing fine lines and dark circle under the eyes.\r\n✵ Quickly infuse moisture into the skin to tighten the skin.\r\n✵ Reduce fine lines and dark circles under the eyes.\r\n✵ Eliminate eye swelling and bring relief to your tired eyes.','Apply eye patches on cleansed skin and leave on for 15- 20 minutes for optimal effects.','produits/IMG_20240103_202624_(540_x_720_pixel)_48869.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240103_202624_(540_x_720_pixel)_48869.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240103_202654_(540_x_720_pixel)_57546.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240103_202707_(540_x_720_pixel)_32719.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240103_202723_(540_x_720_pixel)_48561.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL)