nd dewy for a healthy, even glow!','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use it after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20240106_115039_(540_x_720_pixel)_65303.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240106_115039_(540_x_720_pixel)_65303.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240106_115237_(540_x_720_pixel)_36793.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240106_115319_(540_x_720_pixel)_23103.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240106_115457_(540_x_720_pixel)_62055.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2910,'CLIO - Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion Mini 04 Ginger',NULL,75.000,'The CLIO Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion Mini is the mini-sized version of the brand\'s best-selling cushion foundation that offers the perfect medium to full coverage for any skin type. Using a high quality powder puff to apply, this cushion set offers wrinkle improvement and brightening benefits to even out skin tone. It leaves the skin with a soft finish that is a perfect balance between matte and dewy for a healthy, even glow!','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use it after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20240106_115047_(540_x_720_pixel)_24632.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240106_115047_(540_x_720_pixel)_24632.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240106_115237_(540_x_720_pixel)_10738.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240106_115319_(540_x_720_pixel)_35333.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240106_115457_(540_x_720_pixel)_19055.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2911,'FOCALLURE - Essence Rich Lip Oil - Day And Night Setkit',NULL,32.000,'Get plump and supple lips with this lip oil set that keeps your smacker nourished and hydrated all day long. The Daily Lip Oil is formulated with sunflower seed oil and shea butter to create a hydrating veil over lips to seal in moisture, while the Night Lip Oil contains soybean oil and honey extract to reduce wrinkles and leave lips smooth. Apply the lip oil after lip makeup to add shine and plumpness for a dewy finish.','Spread a proper amount evenly on lips whenever they feel dry.\r\nTo use as a lip mask, apply a thick layer to lips before bed.','produits/IMG_20240107_143703_(540_x_720_pixel)_88708.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_143703_(540_x_720_pixel)_88708.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_143721_(540_x_720_pixel)_20630.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_143859_(540_x_720_pixel)_76894.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_143935_(540_x_720_pixel)_95802.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_144038_(540_x_720_pixel)_84249.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_144142_(540_x_720_pixel)_89952.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2912,'Anua Peach 70 Niacin Serum',NULL,132.000,'Anua Peach 70 Niacin Serum is a brightening and hydrating serum to even out skin tone and deliver glass skin instantly and over time. Packed with 70% Peach Fruit Extract from Jeju Island and 5% Niacinamide to target dullness and hyperpigmentation, while supporting the skin barrier and reducing the look of enlarged pores. This serum also contains powerful hydrators such as Desert Yeast Oil and Triple Hyaluronic Acid to replenish skin\'s moisture for a softer complexion.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 30ml\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: All skin types','Apply a proper amount onto face and pat gently for further absorption.','produits/IMG_20240107_145628_(540_x_720_pixel)_44573.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_145628_(540_x_720_pixel)_44573.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_145708_(540_x_720_pixel)_35805.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_145717_(540_x_720_pixel)_78431.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_145807_(540_x_720_pixel)_88581.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2913,'Yuja Niacin Brightening All-In-One Cleanser',NULL,115.000,'SOME BY MI\'s all-in-one cleanser contains niacinamide and 11% yuja extract to cleanse, brighten and nourish the skin. Succinic acid gently in the mix gently exfoliates dead skin cells while hyaluronic acid regulates oil production, retains moisture and prevents acne breakouts. The gel texture lathers into a dense foam to deeply cleanse the skin, leaving behind smooth, radiant and healthier-looking skin finish. This hypoallergenic formula cleanser is suitable for various skin types including acne-prone and sensitive skin.','Take an appropriate amount and lather with water.\r\n2. Cleanse and rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water','produits/IMG_20240107_151002_(540_x_720_pixel)_42635.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_151002_(540_x_720_pixel)_42635.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_151012_(540_x_720_pixel)_99712.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_151107_(540_x_720_pixel)_12006.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_151203_(540_x_720_pixel)_33654.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2914,'Secret Key Starting Treatment Essential Mask Sheet (Rose Edition)',NULL,17.000,'Secret Key Starting Treatment Essential Mask Sheet (Rose Edition) is a vitalising sheet mask infused with the brand\'s boosting essence to even and smooth out rough texture for brighter and clearer skin. Packed with Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, which is known for improving skin elasticity, reducing the appearance of wrinkles and brightening skin. Provence Rose Water also helps with long-lasting hydration and rejuvenating benefits.','Cleanse face and apply toner to refine the skin texture\r\nCarefully remove mask from packaging, unfold, and place the sheet mask on your face\r\nApply mask evenly across face, gently smooth the mask to ensure good contact with skin\r\nLeave mask on face for 15 ~ 20 minutes\r\nRemove mask and discard. Pat skin lightly to absorb the remaining essence into the skin.','produits/IMG_20240107_153613_(540_x_720_pixel)_99028.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_153613_(540_x_720_pixel)_99028.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_153628_(540_x_720_pixel)_39187.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_153639_(540_x_720_pixel)_94287.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_153739_(540_x_720_pixel)_64892.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2915,'Anua Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil Mini',NULL,45.000,'Anua’s Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil is now available in mini version! Coming in a non-comedogenic formula that effectively rids skin of impurities while leaving a refreshed and hydrated finish. Featuring mild plant-based oils (including Jojoba, Olive Fruit and Grape Seed oils) and Heartleaf extract, this lightweight cleanser safely removes blackheads, makeup and sebum without clogging pores.\r\n\r\nSkin type:  all skin types, even for acne-prone skin.\r\n\r\nVolume: 20ml','Take an appropriate amount of oil onto dry hands.\r\n\r\n2. Gently massage dry face, focusing on areas with clogged pores.\r\n\r\n3. Add a little water to emulsify while massaging.\r\n\r\n4. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240107_155304_(540_x_720_pixel)_89696.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_155304_(540_x_720_pixel)_89696.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_155317_(540_x_720_pixel)_50063.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_155327_(540_x_720_pixel)_10651.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_155449_(540_x_720_pixel)_37272.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2916,'Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner Mini',NULL,45.000,'Anua Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner is a gentle moisturising toner to soothe, tone, hydrate and balance the pH level of skin. Formulated with 77% Houttuynia Cordata Extract that helps soothe sensitive skin and protect skin from external irritations, while also maintaining skin\'s oil-moisture balance. This lightweight toner is made without any irritating substances, so skin feels clarified, skin tone appears even, and feels hydrated regardless of skin type.\r\n\r\nSkin type: All skin types\r\n\r\nVolume: 40ml','After cleansing, apply a moderate amount over the face and pat lightly for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20240107_160614_(540_x_720_pixel)_30801.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_160614_(540_x_720_pixel)_30801.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_160635_(540_x_720_pixel)_70168.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_160353_(540_x_720_pixel)_23729.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_160414_(540_x_720_pixel)_75298.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2917,'FOCALLURE - Plumpmax Lip Gloss#09 Cat\'s Eye',NULL,38.000,'The Plumpmax® Shiny Lip Glosses contain natural ingredients; Coconut extract, Jojoba seed oil, Mint extract, Antioxidants and Vitamin E, and has nourishing and therapeutic effect on the lips, i.e., UVA/UVB defense, long-lasting moisture, repair of damaged cells etc.','Use the built-in brush head for applying evenly on the lips. Apply it overnight before sleeping as an effective lip care alternative. You can also use it as a lip primer by prepping your lips with it before applying any other lip products. For a glossier lips look, apply it on bare lips or overlay as topcoat over your lipstick for an instant fuller, plumper dewy-glossy finish.','produits/IMG_20240109_150539_(540_x_720_pixel)_84035.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240109_150539_(540_x_720_pixel)_84035.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240109_150548_(540_x_720_pixel)_88162.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240109_150640_(540_x_720_pixel)_73915.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240109_094632_(540_x_720_pixel)_41521.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240109_094658_(540_x_720_pixel)_32956.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2918,'FOCALLURE - Plumpmax Lip Gloss #15 Rhodonite',NULL,38.000,'This cruelty-free and versatile lip glow leaves a glossy finish for plump and juicy lips. The non-sticky formula is enriched with jojoba seed oil to keep your lips moisturized all day. Free from parabens and phthalates.','1.Use it as a Lip Primer: Prep lip with it for the best long-stay moist and soft smooth lip primer before to layer on your favorite lip product. 2.Use it as a Lip Gloss: Wear it alone on bare lips or overlay it topcoat after your lip product for the instant fuller dewy glossy lip look. 3.Use the Built-in lip brush head for a more precise application. Nectar-like texture for the most soft-smooth application.','produits/IMG_20240107_191910_(540_x_720_pixel)_84634.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_191910_(540_x_720_pixel)_84634.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_192042_(540_x_720_pixel)_61747.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_191926_(540_x_720_pixel)_46960.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_191936_(540_x_720_pixel)_33930.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240109_100741_(540_x_720_pixel)_11631.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2919,'Beta Panthenol Repair Toner',NULL,115.000,'Some By Mi Beta Panthenol Repair Toner is a soothing essence toner that helps balance skin\'s pH and strengthen skin barrier. Formulated with the brand\'s patented Beta-Panthenol™ (a blend of D-panthenol and beta-sitosterol), this toner is the perfect first step to deeply hydrate and strengthen skin. Also helps control oil and excess sebum on the skin and fights wrinkles.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDermatologically tested to be suitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin.\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 150ml','After cleansing, apply a proper amount onto the skin and gently pat to let absorb.','produits/IMG_20240107_180833_(540_x_720_pixel)_87104.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_180833_(540_x_720_pixel)_87104.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_180753_(540_x_720_pixel)_16474.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_180953_(540_x_720_pixel)_90838.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_181025_(540_x_720_pixel)_86003.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2920,'HOLIKA HOLIKA - Water Vibe Tint 03 Splat',NULL,68.000,'Highly pigmented lip tint is enriched with fruit ingredients including blueberry, yuzu and peach extracts to add juiciness and shine to lips. The waterproof and smudge-free formula glides on lips smoothly and stays put all day.','Glides on lips directly to create look','produits/IMG_20240107_183417_(540_x_720_pixel)_21970.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_183417_(540_x_720_pixel)_21970.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_183454_(540_x_720_pixel)_55623.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_183541_(540_x_720_pixel)_85295.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_183512_(540_x_720_pixel)_26421.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2921,'HOLIKA HOLIKA - Water Vibe Tint 04 Puddle',NULL,68.000,'Highly pigmented lip tint is enriched with fruit ingredients including blueberry, yuzu and peach extracts to add juiciness and shine to lips. The waterproof and smudge-free formula glides on lips smoothly and stays put all day.','Glides on lips directly to create look','produits/IMG_20240107_184052_(540_x_720_pixel)_47881.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_184052_(540_x_720_pixel)_47881.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_184200_(540_x_720_pixel)_26598.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_184123_(540_x_720_pixel)_63998.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_184216_(540_x_720_pixel)_50588.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_183512_(540_x_720_pixel)_94072.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2922,'The Saem Eco Soul Lip Oil #01 Honey',NULL,44.000,'The Saem Eco Soul Lip Oil helps to provide long-lasting hydration to lips to combat dry, chapped lips.  \r\n<br>\r\n● Formulated with 95% naturally derived ingredients to nourish and moisturize lips <br>\r\n● Infused with 7 kinds of natural protector ingredients to strengthen skin barrier and improve moisture retention\r\nResults in plump and healthy lips.','Apply an appropriate amount evenly on lips whenever they feel dry','produits/IMG_20240107_190212_(540_x_720_pixel)_81815.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_190212_(540_x_720_pixel)_81815.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_190328_(540_x_720_pixel)_53714.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_190223_(540_x_720_pixel)_13941.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_190554_(540_x_720_pixel)_79235.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2923,'The Saem Eco Soul Lip Oil #03 Grapefruit',NULL,44.000,'The Saem Eco Soul Lip Oil helps to provide long-lasting hydration to lips to combat dry, chapped lips.  \r\n<br>\r\n● Formulated with 95% naturally derived ingredients to nourish and moisturize lips <br>\r\n● Infused with 7 kinds of natural protector ingredients to strengthen skin barrier and improve moisture retention\r\nResults in plump and healthy lips.','Apply an appropriate amount evenly on lips whenever they feel dry','produits/IMG_20240107_191051_(540_x_720_pixel)_32516.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_191051_(540_x_720_pixel)_32516.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_191041_(540_x_720_pixel)_29953.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_191106_(540_x_720_pixel)_86970.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_190554_(540_x_720_pixel)_50088.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2924,'The Retinol 0.1 Cream',NULL,123.000,'The Retinol 0.1 Cream is an irritation-reduced solution created with the optimal ratio of key ingredients for first-time retinol users just starting to notice the appearance of fine lines caused by dry skin. The perfect choice to prevent and correct early signs of ageing before they set in. This cream helps: <br>\r\n<br>\r\n• Improve the appearance of fine lines, creases, and wrinkles\r\n• Increase skin elasticity\r\n• Smooth skin texture\r\n• Prevent acne & fades scarring\r\n• Moisturise','START SMALL AND SLOW!\r\n\r\n&bull; After using essence or serum, pat a small amount using your ring finger. Apply evenly over the face, neck, and onto parts with wrinkle concerns.\r\n&bull; Limit initial use to three times per week; gradually increase frequency to every other night, use as tolerated.\r\n\r\n* Have an &lsquo;adaption period&rsquo; when using retinol \r\n\r\nWEEK 1~2 \r\n\r\n&bull; Frequency : use every other day at night\r\n&bull; How to Use : After cleansing, at the moisturizer step, apply a small amount to areas of concern.\r\n&bull; e.g. under eyes, mouth, forehead and neck \r\n(Recommended amount : 0.1ml per section / 1 grain of rice) \r\n\r\nWEEK 3~ \r\n\r\n&bull; Frequency : may apply everyday at night\r\n&bull; How to use : After cleansing, at the moisturizer step, may spread over the entire face.\r\n\r\n* The &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;building tolerance&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot; phase can be shortened or extended depending on individual differences. \r\n* Maintain this phase until no discomfort is experienced. \r\n* Gradually increase frequency and areas of application.','produits/IMG_20240108_000933_(540_x_720_pixel)_94137.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240108_000933_(540_x_720_pixel)_94137.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_000956_(540_x_720_pixel)_75349.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_001007_(540_x_720_pixel)_58083.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_001031_(540_x_720_pixel)_18416.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2925,'Pinkflash - Duo Makeup Stick #HS02',NULL,45.000,'PINKFLASH Duo Makeup Stick is one pen for two purposes, light and shadow face sculpting, create flawless three-dimensional makeup. Highly pigmented, just one swipe can increase facial contours and easily create flawless three-dimensional makeup.','Use on face','produits/IMG_20240107_195103_(540_x_720_pixel)_86461.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_195103_(540_x_720_pixel)_86461.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_195239_(540_x_720_pixel)_54151.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_195129_(540_x_720_pixel)_68176.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_200143_(540_x_720_pixel)_67346.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2926,'Yuja Niacin Anti Blemish Cream',NULL,111.000,'Swiftly fade dark spots and hyperpigmentation with the latest addition to SOME BY MI’s iconic Yuja Niacin line: the Anti Blemish Cream. It’s infused with a potent blend of yuja extract, niacinamide and panthenol for brightening and moisturizing effects. The lightweight yet comforting texture makes the cream a must-have for sensitive skin in need of pampering.','At the last step of your skin care routine, take a proper amount of the cream and evenly spread it over your entire face.','produits/IMG_20240107_213138_(540_x_720_pixel)_97520.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_213138_(540_x_720_pixel)_97520.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_213150_(540_x_720_pixel)_89650.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_213237_(540_x_720_pixel)_36356.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_213418_(540_x_720_pixel)_90813.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:11','2025-02-07 02:59:11',0,NULL),(2927,'SKINFOOD - Tomato Jelly Tint Lip #01 Cherry Tomato',NULL,36.000,'Lightweight and refreshing lip tint comes in a long-lasting gel formulation that glides on smoothly, leaving the perfect shade of sheer and rosy color on your lips. Tomato extract and rosewater work to nourish and moisturize, helping lips stay soft and supple with a lovely, dewy glow. Tint can be used on its own or applied on top of lipstick to customize your lip color.','Apply a moderate amount to the center of lips and gently spread outwards.','produits/IMG_20240108_002428_(540_x_720_pixel)_36013.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240108_002428_(540_x_720_pixel)_36013.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_002543_(540_x_720_pixel)_87046.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_002552_(540_x_720_pixel)_29668.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_002603_(540_x_720_pixel)_70798.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2928,'SKINFOOD - Tomato Jelly Tint Lip #02 Berry Tomato',NULL,38.000,'Lightweight and refreshing lip tint comes in a long-lasting gel formulation that glides on smoothly, leaving the perfect shade of sheer and rosy color on your lips. Tomato extract and rosewater work to nourish and moisturize, helping lips stay soft and supple with a lovely, dewy glow. Tint can be used on its own or applied on top of lipstick to customize your lip color.','Apply a moderate amount to the center of lips and gently spread outwards.','produits/IMG_20240108_002438_(540_x_720_pixel)_64194.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240108_002438_(540_x_720_pixel)_64194.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_002543_(540_x_720_pixel)_11560.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_002552_(540_x_720_pixel)_30846.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240108_002603_(540_x_720_pixel)_55866.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2929,'Michael Kors Mirella Tote Bag Pink',NULL,1350.000,'Effortless elegance meets modern utility in the Michael Kors Mirella Tote Bag. This chic satchel boasts a sleek silhouette crafted from luxurious pebbled leather, exuding understated sophistication. The spacious interior, complete with multiple compartments and pockets, effortlessly organizes your essentials, while the detachable shoulder strap offers versatile carrying options. Adorned with the iconic Michael Kors logo and signature gold hardware, this tote bag is a testament to timeless style and impeccable craftsmanship. Embrace the perfect blend of functionality and fashion with the Michael Kors Mirella Tote Bag.\r\nKey Features:\r\n * Crafted from premium pebbled leather\r\n * Spacious interior with multiple compartments and pockets\r\n * Detachable shoulder strap for versatile carrying\r\n * Iconic Michael Kors logo and signature gold hardware\r\n * Effortless elegance and modern utility\r\nElevate your everyday style with the Michael Kors Mirella Tote Bag.','Fhjk',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2930,'Victoria\'s Secret - The Victoria Wallet',NULL,240.000,'A classic essential. This sleek continental wallet features a wrap-around zip and plenty of interior pockets to keep you organized. <br>\r\nFits: 12 cards, full length bills, change, cell phone <br>\r\n12 interior card slots <br>\r\n1 zip compartment <br>\r\n2 full length bill pockets <br>\r\n7\"L x 1\"W 4\"H <br>\r\nImported polyurethane','Yui',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2931,'Michael Kors Mirella Small Pebbled Leather Crossbody Bag Camel',NULL,1350.000,'The Michael Kors Mirella Crossbody Bag is a versatile and stylish accessory perfect for everyday wear. This chic bag features a compact design crafted from luxurious pebbled leather, ensuring durability and a touch of sophistication. The crossbody strap offers hands-free convenience, while the top zip closure keeps your belongings secure. The bag\'s spacious interior is perfect for storing your essentials, and the iconic Michael Kors logo adds a touch of designer flair. Whether you\'re running errands or heading out for a night on the town, the Michael Kors Mirella Crossbody Bag is the perfect way to elevate your look.\r\nKey Features:\r\n * Crafted from premium pebbled leather\r\n * Spacious interior with multiple compartments and pockets\r\n * Detachable crossbody strap for versatile carrying\r\n * Iconic Michael Kors logo and signature gold hardware\r\n * Effortless elegance and modern utility\r\nElevate your everyday style with the Michael Kors Mirella Crossbody Bag.','Gfh',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2932,'Miniso - Disney Series Hydrating Hand Cream Set',NULL,55.000,'Nourish your hands and celebrate your love for Disney princesses with this enchanting hand cream set from Miniso! Featuring delightful fragrances and captivating designs inspired by your favorite Disney princesses, this set offers a touch of magic and deep hydration for your skin.','Jdj',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2933,'Rice Toner',NULL,140.000,'Swipe on Im From Rice Toner for hydrated and radiant skin. It forms a protective barrier Over the skin to prevent water loss, eliminates dead skin cells, and rebalances dry and tired barriers.\r\n\r\n77.78% rice extract helps with collagen production and has high water retention, both effectively plumping skin. Its antioxidants also protect skin from free radicals, helping to slow down the appearance of aging. Rich in vitamin E, this ingredient nourishes and keeps skin soft. And of course, rice extract is well-loved for its brightening properties, helping to lighten pigmentation and even out dull skin.','Shake well to mix the water and emulsion layers before use. After cleansing, dispense on a cotton pad and swipe over skin, or dispense into hands and pat onto dry areas.','produits/IMG_20240504_161657_(540_x_720_pixel)_25258.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240504_161657_(540_x_720_pixel)_25258.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_161713_(540_x_720_pixel)_22714.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_161743_(540_x_720_pixel)_69415.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_161752_(540_x_720_pixel)_68367.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2934,'FOCALLURE - Plumpmax Lip Gloss#03 Rose Quartz',NULL,36.000,'The Plumpmax® Shiny Lip Glosses contain natural ingredients; Coconut extract, Jojoba seed oil, Mint extract, Antioxidants and Vitamin E, and has nourishing and therapeutic effect on the lips, i.e., UVA/UVB defense, long-lasting moisture, repair of damaged cells etc.','Use the built-in brush head for applying evenly on the lips. Apply it overnight before sleeping as an effective lip care alternative. You can also use it as a lip primer by prepping your lips with it before applying any other lip products. For a glossier lips look, apply it on bare lips or overlay as topcoat over your lipstick for an instan