ss #04 Apyrite',NULL,40.000,'The Plumpmax® Shiny Lip Glosses contain natural ingredients; Coconut extract, Jojoba seed oil, Mint extract, Antioxidants and Vitamin E, and has nourishing and therapeutic effect on the lips, i.e., UVA/UVB defense, long-lasting moisture, repair of damaged cells etc.','Use the built-in brush head for applying evenly on the lips. Apply it overnight before sleeping as an effective lip care alternative. You can also use it as a lip primer by prepping your lips with it before applying any other lip products. For a glossier lips look, apply it on bare lips or overlay as topcoat over your lipstick for an instant fuller, plumper dewy-glossy finish.','produits/IMG_20240120_002228_(540_x_720_pixel)_54803.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240120_002228_(540_x_720_pixel)_54803.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240120_002239_(540_x_720_pixel)_84457.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240120_002845_(540_x_720_pixel)_58880.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240120_002905_(540_x_720_pixel)_45470.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2942,'FOCALLURE - Plumpmax Lip Gloss #08 Ruby',NULL,38.000,'The Plumpmax® Shiny Lip Glosses contain natural ingredients; Coconut extract, Jojoba seed oil, Mint extract, Antioxidants and Vitamin E, and has nourishing and therapeutic effect on the lips, i.e., UVA/UVB defense, long-lasting moisture, repair of damaged cells etc.','Use the built-in brush head for applying evenly on the lips. Apply it overnight before sleeping as an effective lip care alternative. You can also use it as a lip primer by prepping your lips with it before applying any other lip products. For a glossier lips look, apply it on bare lips or overlay as topcoat over your lipstick for an instant fuller, plumper dewy-glossy finish.','produits/IMG_20240120_011822_(540_x_720_pixel)_30440.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240120_011822_(540_x_720_pixel)_30440.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240120_011718_(540_x_720_pixel)_24230