lack Charcoal Portable Peel Off Mask',NULL,15.000,'A charcoal peel-off mask that extracts skin impurities and tighten pores for deep clean, polished skin. Charcoal Extract is a supreme ingredient that naturally attracts impurities and excess oil, and effortlessly rids them from skin.','1. After washing your face, apply the mask evenly, keep away from eyes, brows and mouth area. 2. Wait about 20-30 minutes till the mask get totally dry (not sticky when you touch it). 3. Pull the mask off from chin up, then rinse your face with water.',NULL,NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2952,'Scalp Massager Shampoo Brush',NULL,45.000,'It was created as a game changer for shampooing, which perfectly replaces the finger operation and allows you to enjoy the head spa during the hair and scalp cleansing process.\r\n100% Food-grade Silicone Teeth: Really hygienic and safe. Gentle spikes effectively scrub the scalp without scratching, which are flexible enough to move through the hair without tangling or pulling. Tourmaline contained activates cells and increases blood flow.\r\nErgonomic Design: The mouse-like handle fits your palm perfectly, non-slip grooves ensure a stable grip even in the shower. The concave brush surface formed by 25 tips fits the scalp for maximum working area.\r\nSimple Hair &amp; Scalp Care Routine: In daily hair washing, it thoroughly removes the flakes and build-up from the scalp and spreads hair care products deeply, leaving your hair cleaner and fresher. Gentle massage on dry or wet hair to invigorate your scalp. It helps in removing dandruff and promote hair growth.','Use on hair',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2953,'Sparkling Star Series High Elasticity Shampoo Brush',NULL,45.000,'This shampoo brush is suitable for all hair types and can be used with your favorite shampoo or conditioner to thoroughly cleanse and revitalize your scalp while providing a relaxing and enjoyable experience.','On hair',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2954,'Michael Kors Mirella Medium Tote Bag',NULL,1485.000,'Crafted from a luxurious blend of cotton and leather, this spacious tote bag is perfect for carrying your essentials in style. The chic, neutral color palette and eye-catching palm leaf print make it a versatile piece that can be dressed up or down. With multiple compartments and pockets, this bag is both stylish and functional.\r\nProduct Features:\r\n * Made from a blend of cotton and leather\r\n * Spacious interior with multiple compartments and pockets\r\n * Chic, neutral color palette with a palm leaf print\r\n * Removable shoulder strap for versatile carrying options\r\n * Michael Kors logo hardware adds a touch of luxury\r\nDimensions:\r\n * Width: 14.5 inches\r\n * Height: 11 inches\r\n * Depth: 5.5 inches\r\nCare Instructions:\r\n * Wipe clean with a damp cloth\r\n * Spot clean only\r\n * Do not machine wash or dry clean','Care Instructions:\r\n * Wipe clean with a damp cloth\r\n * Spot clean only\r\n * Do not machine wash or dry clean',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2955,'Michael Kors Mirella Medium East West Tote Bag',NULL,1485.000,'Elevate your everyday style with the Michael Kors Mirella Medium East West Tote Bag. This spacious and sophisticated tote is crafted from a luxurious blend of canvas and leather and features a chic, tropical palm leaf print with a contrasting green and white color palette. The iconic MK logo hardware adds a touch of luxury, while the leather trim offers a stylish accent. With multiple compartments and pockets, this bag is both functional and fashionable.\r\nProduct Features:\r\n * Crafted from a blend of canvas and leather\r\n * Spacious interior with multiple compartments and pockets\r\n * Chic, tropical palm leaf print with a contrasting green and white color palette\r\n * Iconic MK logo hardware\r\n * Leather trim for a stylish accent\r\n * Removable shoulder strap for versatile carrying options\r\nDimensions:\r\n * Width: 14.5 inches\r\n * Height: 11 inches\r\n * Depth: 5.5 inches\r\nCare Instructions:\r\n * Wipe clean with a damp cloth\r\n * Spot clean only\r\n * Do not machine wash or dry clean\r\nAdditional Notes:\r\n * The Mirella Medium East West Tote Bag is available in a variety of colors and prints.\r\n * This bag is perfect for carrying your essentials to work, school, or a night out.\r\n * The removable shoulder strap allows you to carry the bag as a tote or a crossbody.','Jgh',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2956,'Eye Pads and Roller Set',NULL,77.000,'The Eye pads hydrates and reduces puffiness. They can also help with dark circles. Rollers, on the other hand, promote lymphatic drainage and circulation, reducing fluid buildup and puffiness. Used together, they can enhance the effectiveness of your skincare routine.','Jgh',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2957,'Hydrating Lip Balm (Strawberry Scent)',NULL,45.000,'This hydrating lip balm with strawberry scent serves to moisturize and nourish your lips, preventing dryness and chapping. The strawberry scent provides a pleasant fragrance.','It go',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2958,'SEOUL 1988 Sun : Pine Tree + Ceramide',NULL,78.000,'*Benefits: <br>\r\n- A sunscreen offering SPF 50+ PA++++, enriched with pine tree extract and ceramide, soothes irritated skin and strengthens the skin barrier. <br>\r\n- Contains pine tree extract, the key ingredient of this product, to reduce redness, itchiness, and inflammation. <br>\r\n- Formulated with 4 types of UV chemical filters for strong, safe, long-lasting, smooth UV-A and UV-B protection with NO white cast. <br>\r\n- An ultra-lightweight sunscreen that is absorbed into the skin quickly, leaving a glowy finish. <br>\r\n- Free of common allergens, harsh alcohols, parabens, sulfates, artificial colors.\r\nDermatologist tested for sensitive skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Sensitive','1. As a last step to your morning skincare routine, apply an appropriate amount to your face and neck.\r\n\r\n2. Gently massage until fully absorbed into the skin.','produits/IMG_20240302_235236_(540_x_720_pixel)_15989.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240302_235236_(540_x_720_pixel)_15989.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240302_235213_(540_x_720_pixel)_52957.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240302_235538_(540_x_720_pixel)_61419.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240302_235527_(540_x_720_pixel)_36642.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2959,'Face Scrub(Watermelon)',NULL,15.000,'Watermelon Facial Scrub is a refreshing skincare essential that will leave your skin feeling rejuvenated, nourished, and irresistibly smooth.\r\nPrepare to embark on a revitalizing journey as you indulge in the delightful aroma of fresh watermelons, perfectly blended with the power of exfoliation.\r\nUnleash your skin\'s natural radiance with this invigorating facial scrub.\r\nFormulated with the finest ingredients, it combines the hydrating properties of watermelon with gentle exfoliants to provide you with a deep cleansing and rejuvenating experience.','Jvhh',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2960,'We Bare Bears Hand Cream SET',NULL,45.000,'Forget about dry hands and keep them always hydrated and healthy, with the We Bare Bears moisturizing hand cream set with 3 pieces. It is a product with three creams of different aromas, strawberry, avocado and lemon, which also provide natural nutrients for your hands to give them a healthier appearance every day.','After cleansing the hands, apply an appropriate amount of this product onto the hands, rub and massage gently to promote absorption.',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2961,'Fresh Fruit Energy 2.0 Hand Cream Set',NULL,45.000,'Introducing our Hand Creams Set of 3 – a trifecta of indulgence for your hands. Enriched with the goodness of natural mango, coconut, and strawberry extracts, each hand cream is a sensorial delight. The light fragrance dances on your skin as these creams work their magic, providing deep hydration and nourishment. Revel in the velvety touch of moisturized and smooth hands with this exquisite set. Elevate your self-care routine with the tropical symphony of mango, coconut, and strawberry, giving your hands the pampering they truly deserve.','After cleansing the hands, apply an appropriate amount of this product onto the hands, rub and massage gently to promote absorption.',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2962,'AHA BHA Vitamin C Daily Toner',NULL,130.000,'COSRX Refresh ABC Daily Toner is a daily revitalising toner that contains BHA, BHA, and vitamin C to mildly exfoliate the skin. Made with only 16 essential ingredients including the patented GOLDEN-RX COMPLEX, AHA, BHA, and vitamin C to improve the texture for a more radiant and refined complexion. This toner has a light watery texture that immediately absorbs into the skin, leaving it soft, smooth, and prepped for the skincare products to follow.','After cleansing, soak a cotton pad with the toner and gently wipe across the face avoiding the eye and mouth area. Gently pat the entire face for better absorption.\r\n\r\n\r\n* If using during the day, please be sure to apply sunscreen','produits/IMG_20240303_223334_(540_x_720_pixel)_53780.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240303_223334_(540_x_720_pixel)_53780.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240303_223343_(540_x_720_pixel)_24943.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240303_223756_(540_x_720_pixel)_65909.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240303_224038_(540_x_720_pixel)_30465.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2963,'Mielle - Rosemary Mint Scalp and Hair Strengthening Oil',NULL,81.000,'Our Rosemary Mint scalp and hair oil is a nutrient-rich, intensive formula meant to help you address your hair concerns. From nourishing hair follicles, smoothing split ends and help with dry scalp, this hair oil uses natural, organic ingredients and essential oils to provide the care your hair deserves. Use it on protective styles, including braids and weaves, and enjoy its fresh, invigorating scent during your next hot oil treatment.\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\n\r\nInfused with Biotin\r\nUse for daily hair care or specialized scalp treatments\r\nFeatures more than 30 essential oils and extracts\r\nHelps improve length retention\r\nConditions dry scalp\r\nSmooths split ends\r\nFormulated without: No Parabens, No Sulfates, No Paraffins, No Mineral Oil, No DEA, No Animal Testing','Scalp Treatment\r\nSection hair into 4 parts exposing scalp. Apply a small amount of oil to scalp, massage oil in with fingers and comb through to ends of hair. Leave in and style as desired.\r\n\r\nDaily Use\r\nApply a small amount to scalp and comb through to ends.\r\n\r\nSplit End Care\r\nApply oil to ends of hair, place a processing cap on head and leave on for 10 minutes. Rinse and proceed with shampooing.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2964,'Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream',NULL,125.000,'Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream contains 92% snail secretion filtrate, giving it the slick texture of a gel and all the soothing, healing, and calming properties of mucin, that regenerates and repairs the skin. The cream is formulated to prevent breakouts and maintain skin elasticity, as well as leaving skin nourished, hydrated and healthy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Gently spread over the entire face in an upwards and outwards motion. Pat until fully absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20240308_175422_(540_x_720_pixel)_69938.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240308_175422_(540_x_720_pixel)_69938.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_175559_(540_x_720_pixel)_96478.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_175450_(540_x_720_pixel)_36006.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_175516_(540_x_720_pixel)_68230.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_175553_(540_x_720_pixel)_53024.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2965,'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Cleansing Oil',NULL,130.000,'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Cleansing Oil is a deep cleansing oil that uses lightweight soybean oil to gently dissolve dirt, waste and makeup residues that accumulate on the skin. Micellar cleansing technology attracts and absorbs impurities and makeup residues like a magnet, while supplying moisture deep inside the skin. Ginseng seed oil helps to protect the skin from external stimuli. In addition, its unique scent gives you a comfortable cleansing experience.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nSize: 210ml','After pumping cleansing oil 1-2 times, gently massage onto dry face. Gently rinse with lukewarm water and cleanse with a foam cleanser once again.','produits/IMG_20240308_180453_(540_x_720_pixel)_25670.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240308_180453_(540_x_720_pixel)_25670.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_180508_(540_x_720_pixel)_59525.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_180518_(540_x_720_pixel)_76200.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_180530_(540_x_720_pixel)_35440.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_180545_(540_x_720_pixel)_55926.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2966,'Anua Heartleaf 80% Soothing Ampoule',NULL,112.000,'Anua Heartleaf 80% Soothing Ampoule is a nourishing, gel like ampoule that helps soothe sensitive skin and protect skin from external irritations. Infused with 80% of Houttuynia Cordata Extract, this ampoule lightweight texture absorbs into skin easily to reduce irritation and impart a healthy glow. Skin appears more smoother and glowing in just 14 days!','Apply a moderate amount over the face and pat lightly for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20240308_185850_(540_x_720_pixel)_34139.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240308_185850_(540_x_720_pixel)_34139.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_185905_(540_x_720_pixel)_16017.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_185915_(540_x_720_pixel)_26894.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_190142_(540_x_720_pixel)_30011.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2967,'Sunprise Mild Airy Finish',NULL,68.000,'Sunprise Mild Airy Finish is a gentle formula that protects skin, controls oil production and brightens skin tone all at once with its mineral based mild ingredients for sensitive skin. This ultra gentle sunscreen keeps skin protected and soothed with centella asiatica extract and aloe vera, while its milky texture provides a soft and smooth satin finish, leaving your skin bright and feeling fresh.\r\n\r\nSize: 55ml','Shake 3-5 times before use. Apply appropriate amount onto face as last step of basic skin care. Pat lightly until fully absorbed. Reapply as needed for long-term sun exposure.','produits/IMG_20240308_191652_(540_x_720_pixel)_68014.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240308_191652_(540_x_720_pixel)_68014.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_191702_(540_x_720_pixel)_69760.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_191719_(540_x_720_pixel)_76733.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240308_191838_(540_x_720_pixel)_58052.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2968,'Hydrating Facial Sheet Mask (Rice)',NULL,15.000,'This rice sheet mask helps to brighten the skin, even out skin tone, and provide hydration. Rice extract is rich in antioxidants, which can contribute to a more youthful appearance. Additionally, it may assist in soothing and calming irritated skin, making it a popular choice for those with sensitive skin. Regular use of rice sheet masks can be a refreshing addition to a skincare routine.','Apply on face',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2969,'Glow Up Set',NULL,400.000,'Introducing our Luminous Skin Care Set; a curated collection designed to unveil your skin\'s natural radiance and luminosity. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nStarting with our rejuvenating essence, formulated with the nourishing properties of snail mucin and rice extract, this lightweight yet powerful formula deeply hydrates and revitalizes the skin, leaving it feeling soft, supple, and visibly brighter.\r\n<br>\r\nNext, our advanced serum combines a potent blend of collagen, peptides, hyaluronic acid, cica, and glutathione to target multiple signs of aging, improve skin elasticity, and promote a smoother, more youthful complexion. With regular use, you\'ll notice a reduction in fine lines and wrinkles, as well as a noticeable boost in hydration and firmness.\r\n<br>\r\nShield your skin from harmful UV rays with our sunblock enriched with soothing calamine. This gentle yet effective formula provides broad-spectrum protection while calming and soothing the skin, making it perfect for daily use.\r\n<br>\r\nComplete your look with our natural lip and cheek tint, formulated with nourishing ingredients to add a hint of color and glow to your complexion. Whether you\'re going for a subtle flush or a bolder pop of color, this versatile tint delivers a radiant, healthy-looking finish that lasts all day.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nExperience the transformative power of our Luminous Skin Care Set and unlock the secret to radiant, glowing skin that truly shines from within.','Fnnfj','produits/IMG_20240318_180444_(540_x_720_pixel)_66742.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240318_180444_(540_x_720_pixel)_66742.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240318_180459_(540_x_720_pixel)_10884.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240318_180518_(540_x_720_pixel)_10792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240318_180529_(540_x_720_pixel)_67190.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2970,'Centella Blemish Cream',NULL,119.000,'Centella Blemish Cream is a fast-acting spot treatment cream comprised of Zinc Oxide and Centella Asiatica Leaf Water that help normalise the sebum production by calming down problematic areas and clearing the pores, while preventing further breakouts and loss of moisture. It improves the appearance of acne and blemishes and relieves stressed skin. \r\n\r\nExcellent for sensitive skin and acne prone skin, it can be used for multiple purposes such as a spot treatment, acne scar removal, and alleviating skin after extraction of whiteheads and blackheads.','Centella Blemish Cream is a fast-acting spot treatment cream comprised of Zinc Oxide and Centella Asiatica Leaf Water that help normalise the sebum production by calming down problematic areas and clearing the pores, while preventing further breakouts and loss of moisture. It improves the appearance of acne and blemishes and relieves stressed skin. \r\n\r\nExcellent for sensitive skin and acne prone skin, it can be used for multiple purposes such as a spot treatment, acne scar removal, and alleviating skin after extraction of whiteheads and blackheads.','produits/IMG_20240319_001848_(540_x_720_pixel)_59461.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_001848_(540_x_720_pixel)_59461.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_001900_(540_x_720_pixel)_42326.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_001914_(540_x_720_pixel)_44629.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_001924_(540_x_720_pixel)_45114.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2971,'Aloe Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+/ PA+++',NULL,89.000,'Aloe Soothing Sun Cream is a daily soothing skin protector that is so lightweight that it feels more like a moisturiser! Enriched with aloe vera leaf extract to soothe, moisturise and nourish skin, while its fast absorbing texture does not leave a white cast or greasy finish, and will not stain clothing. Designed to be travel friendly, you can easily carry this anywhere and layer on sun protection anytime!\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types. Can be used on the face and/ or body.\r\n\r\nSize: 50ml','Apply a generous amount on over face 30 minutes before sun exposure. Reapply throughout the day as needed, especially during prolonged sun exposure.','produits/IMG_20240319_002913_(540_x_720_pixel)_60055.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_002913_(540_x_720_pixel)_60055.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_002919_(540_x_720_pixel)_58062.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_002929_(540_x_720_pixel)_72419.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_002945_(540_x_720_pixel)_85796.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2972,'Ultimate Nourishing Rice Spa Overnight Mask',NULL,106.000,'Ultimate Nourishing Rice Spa Overnight Mask is enriched with more than 65% of rice extract, which contains a variety of vitamins and minerals. It is the ultimate sleeping mask that provides intensive nourishment and deep moisture, as well as refining and brightening the skin, all while you are asleep! Wake up in the morning as if you just went to the spa!\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types. \r\n\r\nFree from: Parabens, Synthetic Dyes, Mineral oils.\r\n\r\nSize: 60ml','As a sleeping mask: apply mask over the face avoiding the eye and mouth area, gently massage it in as the last step in your skincare routine before going to bed. Rinse with water in the morning. Keep it in the fridge if you want a cooling effect.\r\nAs a wash-off mask: apply a thick layer over the face, leave on for 15 minutes before washing it off with lukewarm water. Continue with your next skin care steps.\r\nAs a cream: After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount and gently spread over the entire face in an upwards and outwards motion. Pat until fully absorbed.','produits/IMG_20240319_004104_(540_x_720_pixel)_42869.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_004104_(540_x_720_pixel)_42869.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_004115_(540_x_720_pixel)_15990.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_004301_(540_x_720_pixel)_65781.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_004311_(540_x_720_pixel)_84049.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2973,'Rice Cream',NULL,145.000,'I’M FROM Rice Cream is a simple moisturiser that effectively controls excess sebum, locks in moisture and strengthens skin. Containing 41% rice bran extract, which is rich in ceramide that has been distilled and specially treated by their in-house technology to help improve your skin tone and strengthen its barrier. This silky cream is also rich in beauty minerals and vitamins B and E to effectively control excessive sebum production. Use this together with the Rice Serum to maximise the benefits!\r\n\r\nSize: 50 g','Hbh','produits/IMG_20240319_011117_(540_x_720_pixel)_40516.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_011117_(540_x_720_pixel)_40516.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_011125_(540_x_720_pixel)_63818.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_011141_(540_x_720_pixel)_99423.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_011153_(540_x_720_pixel)_16984.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2974,'Heartleaf 77 Clear Pad',NULL,115.000,'Heartleaf 77 Clear Pad are moisturising daily toner pads soaked in the brand best selling Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner to help soothe skin, remove skin impurities and tighten pores. Formulated with star ingredient Heartleaf Extract from Korea to help soothe sensitive and irritated skin, while Anti Sebum P helps control sebum secretion and tighten pores. This toner pad comes with an embossed side to slough away dead skin cells and impurities for softer and smoother skin.\r\n\r\nSize: 160ml (70 Pads)','1. After cleansing, use the embossed side of the pad to cleanse the face along the skin texture, avoiding the lip and eye areas.\r\n2. Wipe the face once again gently with the opposite side of the pad to prep the skin.\r\n\r\nTIP: These pads can also be used as a soothing sheet mask by placing them on irritated areas.','produits/IMG_20240319_011815_(540_x_720_pixel)_10209.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_011815_(540_x_720_pixel)_10209.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_011723_(540_x_720_pixel)_78040.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_011730_(540_x_720_pixel)_74472.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_011743_(540_x_720_pixel)_58417.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_011759_(540_x_720_pixel)_76203.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_011820_(540_x_720_pixel)_79829.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2975,'AHA BHA PHA 14 Days Super Miracle Spot All Kill Cream is a spot treatment',NULL,111.000,'AHA BHA PHA 14 Days Super Miracle Spot All Kill Cream is a spot treatment that helps treat acne by removing dead skin cells and strengthening the skin barrier. Formulated with Truecica™ to soothe skin and reinforce skin barrier, while D-Panthenol helps moisturise and maintain the optimal oil-water balance. With a lightweight and clear gel-like texture, the Super Miracle Sport All Kill Cream allows for smooth application and a fresh, non-greasy finish.\r\n\r\nSize: 30ml','As the last step of your skin care routine, apply the Some By Mi AHA BHA PHA 14 Days Super Miracle Spot All Kill Cream on troubled areas. Pat gently to help with absorption','produits/IMG_20240319_005908_(540_x_720_pixel)_64678.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_005908_(540_x_720_pixel)_64678.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_005921_(540_x_720_pixel)_88025.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_005951_(540_x_720_pixel)_47239.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_005938_(540_x_720_pixel)_30474.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2976,'Red Bean Water Gel',NULL,111.000,'For those with oily skin, we have created Red Bean Water Gel. With its light gel consistency, it delivers abundant moisture without the greasy feel. The cream key components, red bean extract and a blend of three peptides, synergize to boost hydration and skin health.\r\n\r\nLight moisture-gel formula\r\nDynasty Cream is ideal for dry/combination skin, and Red Bean Water Gel was developed for oily skin with active sebum secretion.\r\n\r\nPowerful moisture delivery and pore care\r\nIt minimizes the feeling of oiliness and focuses on providing moisture. It contains red bean, known to help absorb sebum due to its abundance of saponins, and peptides, known to help improve wrinkles.\r\nAs a light gel formula, it absorbs into the skin with a delicately fresh feeling.','Apply proper amount of this cream on your face at the last stage of your skincare routine. Pat with your fingers to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240319_013042_(540_x_720_pixel)_34796.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_013042_(540_x_720_pixel)_34796.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_013057_(540_x_720_pixel)_70349.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_013144_(540_x_720_pixel)_92505.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_013128_(540_x_720_pixel)_52672.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2977,'Dos Lunas Magic Pink Tinted Cheeks, Lips, and Sensitive',NULL,84.000,'Contains natural plant extracts, Leaves skin nourished, fresh supple Improves cheeks, lips, and sensitive areas, giving them an attractive pink color','Hyh','produits/IMG_20240319_013716_(540_x_720_pixel)_14054.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_013716_(540_x_720_pixel)_14054.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_013727_(540_x_720_pixel)_77369.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_013733_(540_x_720_pixel)_32717.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_013749_(540_x_720_pixel)_55235.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2978,'Heartleaf 70% Soothing Cream',NULL,123.000,'Heartleaf 70% Soothing Cream is a soothing, gel-cream enriched with 70% Heartleaf Extract to effectively calm sensitive skin. Also featuring triple cica care containing Madecassic Acid, Cica Extract and Asiatic Acid that leaves skin soothed and refreshed. This lightweight cream forms a protective shield against irritants, ensuring a more comfortable and healthier complexion.\r\n\r\nSize: 100ml','Apply a moderate amount of content on the skin and gently tap for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20240319_015111_(540_x_720_pixel)_50470.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_015111_(540_x_720_pixel)_50470.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_015116_(540_x_720_pixel)_60761.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_015133_(540_x_720_pixel)_74786.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_015401_(540_x_720_pixel)_38481.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2979,'Mielle - Rosemary Mint Strengthening Hair Mask',NULL,105.000,'Does your hair deserve a little extra love? Add Mielle\'s Rosemary Mint Strengthening Hair Masque to your routine! This nutrient-rich formula is made to offer deep moisture and healthy strength. With natural and organic ingredients such as rosemary, sesame seed oil, honey, and coconut oil, this hair masque offers the hydration and nourishment your hair has been craving. Massage into your hair after using our rosemary mint hair strengthening shampoo, let sit for 15 to 20 minutes, and then rinse.\r\n\r\nKey Benefits:\r\n\r\nDeveloped to meet your hair’s greatest needs\r\nMade with certified organic ingredients\r\nInfused with biotin','After shampooing with Rosemary Mint Strengthening Shampoo, smooth evenly through damp hair from roots to ends. Leave in 15&ndash;20 minutes. Rinse thoroughly.','produits/IMG_20240319_110821_(540_x_720_pixel)_42973.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240319_110821_(540_x_720_pixel)_42973.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_110840_(540_x_720_pixel)_85685.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_111432_(540_x_720_pixel)_42412.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240319_110901_(540_x_720_pixel)_49247.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2980,'Seoul 1988 Trio',NULL,302.000,'The Ksecret Seoul skincare set includes: <br>\r\n * A hydrating and brightening essence infused with snail mucin and rice extract.<br>\r\n * A revitalizing serum containing 2% retinol and ginseng extract to promote skin renewal. <br>\r\n * A broad-spectrum SPF 50+ sunscreen enriched with pine tree extract and ceramide for sun protection and skin nourishment.\r\n','Ndnd',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2981,'CLIO - Kill Cover High Glow Cushion Set (+Refill) 02 lingerie',NULL,166.000,'Introducing the newest addition to CLIO’s renowned Kill Cover series – the lightweight cushion foundation designed to effortlessly achieve an ultra-dewy finish, revealing your skin’s innate radiance. This glowy version of the best-selling Kill Cover Cushion line offers three exquisite shades, ensuring a flawless complexion with a translucent skin effect.\r\nCrafted with a weightless formula, this cushion foundation seamlessly adheres to the skin, avoiding any cakey appearance. Experience a dewy, elastic skin finish with a natural glow that lasts up to 72 hours without losing its vibrancy. The buildable formula allows for versatile coverage, easily blendable or layerable according to your preferences.','1. Take a moderate amount of product using the included puff.\r\n2. Using gentle tapping motions, apply an even layer to the entire face.','produits/IMG_20240401_003604_(540_x_720_pixel)_86820.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240401_003604_(540_x_720_pixel)_86820.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240401_003618_(540_x_720_pixel)_54289.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240401_003630_(540_x_720_pixel)_13949.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240401_003644_(540_x_720_pixel)_66318.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2982,'Oil-Free Ultra-Moisturizing Lotion with Birch Sap',NULL,98.000,'Oil Free Ultra Moisturizing Lotion is a lightweight lotion formulated with 70.8% birch sap (betula platyphylla japonica juice) to hydrate and calm skin effectively. Birch Sap is a powerhouse ingredient for calming and treating sensitive, irritated, or freshly exfoliated skin. Designed for all skin types, including oily skin, acne prone skin, sensitive skin, dry skin and cracked skin. If you have ever experienced dryness due to acne medication, winter weather, or natural sensitivity, this is the cream for you. It quenches dry skin with zero greasy residue and calms acne prone skin without causing breakouts.','*After cleansing and toning and chemical exfoliates, use Oil Free Ultra Moisturizing Lotion before your cream step or sunscreen.\r\n\r\n\r\nGently apply a proper amount of the cream to face. Tap the area where the cream was applied gently, in order for it to be absorbed along the skin texture.','produits/IMG_20240404_173317_(540_x_720_pixel)_26364.png',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240404_173317_(540_x_720_pixel)_26364.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_173330_(540_x_720_pixel)_59145.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_173340_(540_x_720_pixel)_55802.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_173459_(540_x_720_pixel)_44237.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2983,'Calming Serum : Green tea + Panthenol',NULL,106.000,'This serum is formulated to alleviate skin discomfort caused by UV exposure and other external stressors. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nOur chosen base ingredients are green tea, a renowned antioxidant, and mugwort, a herb acclaimed for its skin-soothing properties. We Have incorporated panthenol to complement and enhance the protective qualities of these elements. Together, green tea and mugwort hydrate and calm the skin, while panthenol creates a moisture shield, preventing further irritation.','Apply 2-3 drops of serum onto the skin and pat gently to help absorption.','produits/IMG_20240404_180927_(540_x_720_pixel)_81750.png',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240404_180927_(540_x_720_pixel)_81750.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_180940_(540_x_720_pixel)_90373.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_181018_(540_x_720_pixel)_83159.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_181007_(540_x_720_pixel)_94328.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2984,'Radiance Cleansing Balm',NULL,111.000,'It is a balm-type cleansing oil that gently melts eye, lip, base makeup and sebum. It contains rice bran and various grain extracts, so the skin does not get dry and remains moist.\r\n\r\nSolid balm texture\r\nA very soft, balm type cleansing balm that gently melts away makeup, excess sebum and skin impurities.\r\n\r\nOil base makeup remover\r\nIt gently dissolves mascara and eyeliner makeup, so there is no need to use a separate remover. In addition, it is comfortable to use because it does not blur or irritate the eyes.','Scoop a generous amount onto dry skin and gently massage in circular motions. Rinse off with lukewarm water, then wash your face with a foam cleanser.','produits/IMG_20240404_182059_(540_x_720_pixel)_88976.png',NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240404_182059_(540_x_720_pixel)_88976.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_182407_(540_x_720_pixel)_19669.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_182835_(540_x_720_pixel)_95019.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_183005_(540_x_720_pixel)_21341.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2985,'Mielle - Rosemary Mint Strengthening Conditioner',NULL,105.000,'Our Rosemary Mint Strengthening Conditioner provides the perfect balance of strength and moisture to improve the overall condition of the hair and scalp. Instantly softens and detangles for increased manageability. Supports longer, healthier hair.\r\n\r\nKey Benefits:\r\n\r\nFrom the #1 Selling Scalp & Hair Strengthening Oil\r\nProvides the Perfect Balance of Strength and Moisture\r\nInfused with Biotin and Delivers Amazing Shine\r\nInstantly Softens and Detangles\r\nSupports Longer, Healthier Hair\r\nNO NO’s: Parabens, Sulfates, Paraffins, Mineral Oil, DEA, Animal Testing\r\nFormulated For All Hair Types','After shampooing with Rosemary Mint Shampoo, apply Rosemary Mint Strengthening Conditioner to damp hair. Gently detangle with wide tooth comb from ends to root for even distribution. Leave on hair for 5 - 10 minutes. Rinse thoroughly. Follow with Rosemary Mint Strengthening Leave-In Conditioner.','produits/IMG_20240404_234658_(540_x_720_pixel)_19572.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240404_234658_(540_x_720_pixel)_19572.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_234708_(540_x_720_pixel)_87431.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_234727_(540_x_720_pixel)_16539.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240404_234742_(540_x_720_pixel)_83663.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2986,'Barbie Collection Hand Cream Set',NULL,45.000,'Introducing the MINISO Barbie Collection Hand Cream Set – where glamour meets self-care. This hand cream set is not just a skincare essential; it\'s a delightful fusion of Barbie\'s iconic style and nourishing ingredients to keep your hands soft, smooth, and beautifully scented.','Kf',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2987,'CLIO - Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion Mini 03 Linen',NULL,75.000,'What it is-\r\nthin and light application Non-heavy NEW 