ested for 54-hour lasting radiance\r\n\r\n✓Hypo-allergenic tested for sensitive skin\r\n\r\n✓Customized Curve shape puff','With the puff, take the content and use it thinly in a light sweeping motion. You may take too much content when tapping strongly with the puff.','produits/IMG_20240405_101706_(540_x_720_pixel)_55798.jpg',NULL,8,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240405_101706_(540_x_720_pixel)_55798.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_101310_(540_x_720_pixel)_73994.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_101320_(540_x_720_pixel)_23646.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_101330_(540_x_720_pixel)_65741.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_101338_(540_x_720_pixel)_70207.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2990,'CLIO - Kill Cover Mesh Glow Cushion Mini 04 Ginger',NULL,75.000,'The dense mesh texture effectively covers blemishes and provides a sophisticated cover glow with thin, long-lasting adherence.\r\n\r\nBenifits\r\n✓Clinically tested for 54-hour lasting radiance\r\n\r\n✓Hypo-allergenic tested for sensitive skin\r\n\r\n✓Customized Curve shape puff','With the puff, take the content and use it thinly in a light sweeping motion. You may take too much content when tapping strongly with the puff.','produits/IMG_20240405_101724_(540_x_720_pixel)_31677.jpg',NULL,8,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240405_101724_(540_x_720_pixel)_31677.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_101310_(540_x_720_pixel)_23104.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_101320_(540_x_720_pixel)_91528.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_101330_(540_x_720_pixel)_60369.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_101338_(540_x_720_pixel)_67840.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2991,'AXIS-Y - Artichoke Intensive Skin Barrier Ampoule',NULL,111.000,'Artichoke Intensive Skin Barrier Ampoule delivers rich antioxidants, nutrients, and hydration to heal damaged, irritated skin barriers. Phytonutrients defend against bacteria and pollutants to prevent future breakouts and irritation.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, especially for those who suffer from sensitive, irritated skin.','After cleansing and toning, apply ampoule directly onto skin.  Gently pat until completely absorbed','produits/IMG_20240405_162229_(540_x_720_pixel)_35634.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240405_162229_(540_x_720_pixel)_35634.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_162309_(540_x_720_pixel)_46776.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_162411_(540_x_720_pixel)_77173.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_162423_(540_x_720_pixel)_55889.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2992,'MISSHA M Perfect Cover BB Cream 27 SPF 42 PA+++',NULL,105.000,'Combine skincare and makeup in one easy step for flawless skin with M Perfect Cover BB Cream SPF 42 PA+++. M Perfect is a BB cream that offers medium to high coverage, all while keeping makeup light and providing UV protection with lasting moisture.\r\n\r\nThe lightweight BB cream brightens, evens, soothes, and covers discoloration and imperfections of the skin. Recommended for all skin types.\r\n\r\nNo.27 Honey beige for medium/tan skin','Prepare your skin using M BB Boomer primer. Pump an appropriate amount of product onto fingertips or a makeup sponge. Gently blend on to skin and layer depending on desired coverage.','produits/IMG_20240406_100412_(540_x_720_pixel)_46391.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240406_100412_(540_x_720_pixel)_46391.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240406_100541_(540_x_720_pixel)_80225.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240406_100558_(540_x_720_pixel)_64200.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240406_100714_(540_x_720_pixel)_96334.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2993,'SKINFOOD - Tomato Jelly Tint Lip #04 Milk Tomato',NULL,38.000,'Lightweight and refreshing lip tint comes in a long-lasting gel formulation that glides on smoothly, leaving the perfect shade of sheer and rosy color on your lips. Tomato extract and rosewater work to nourish and moisturize, helping lips stay soft and supple with a lovely, dewy glow. Tint can be used on its own or applied on top of lipstick to customize your lip color.','Apply a moderate amount to the center of lips and gently spread outwards.','produits/IMG_20240408_100006_(540_x_720_pixel)_98375.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240408_100006_(540_x_720_pixel)_98375.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240408_100031_(540_x_720_pixel)_19927.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240408_100051_(540_x_720_pixel)_70468.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240408_100116_(540_x_720_pixel)_86406.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2994,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #01 Redmango Mousse',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips. Infused with honey extract and hyaluronic acid to moisturize lips, and fresh fruit fragrance to indulge the senses.','Apply a proper amount from the center of lips and evenly spread outwards using the included applicator.','produits/IMG_20240409_145139_(540_x_720_pixel)_17914.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240409_145139_(540_x_720_pixel)_17914.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240409_145154_(540_x_720_pixel)_10927.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240409_145209_(540_x_720_pixel)_50075.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240409_145221_(540_x_720_pixel)_56413.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2995,'PINKFLASH - Care Plus Lip Oil',NULL,25.000,'CARE PLUS LIP OIL - Our clear lip oil offers SPF 21 protection to help protect against cold sore triggers, such as sun exposure while revitalizing hydration to chapped lips for fast relief\r\nHERBAL NUTRIENT CARE - This revitalizing balm combines honey, echinacea, and vitamins to make the perfect salve for restoring healthy, satiny lips dried from fever blisters, harsh weather, and/or dehydration.\r\nCAREFULLY FORMULATED - Hydrating oils, including safflower, castor seed, jojoba, and vitamin E, make the healing difference, along with calendula, which calms irritation, and lysine that suppresses the activity of arginine.','Dip an appropriate amount of lip oil with the brush head and gently apply it on the lips.','produits/IMG_20240409_150409_(540_x_720_pixel)_31397.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240409_150409_(540_x_720_pixel)_31397.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240409_150615_(540_x_720_pixel)_21240.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240409_150732_(540_x_720_pixel)_42497.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240409_150903_(540_x_720_pixel)_99899.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240409_150933_(540_x_720_pixel)_80491.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2996,'Glamour Beauty Collection',NULL,192.000,'Introducing our ultimate beauty bundle, curated to elevate your skincare and makeup routine to new heights! Dive into a world of rejuvenation with The Saem Healing Tea Garden Cleanser, enriched with the soothing essence of green tea. Pamper your skin with the Cqmong Sheet Mask, infused with a powerhouse blend of collagen, hyaluronic acid, ceramide, peptide, glutathione, cica, centella, and niacinamide for unparalleled hydration and nourishment.\r\n\r\nFor luscious lips that demand attention, indulge in the Pinkflash Care Plus Lip Oil, designed to deeply hydrate while delivering a glossy, irresistible finish. Define your eyes with precision using the Pinkflash Eyeliner, and achieve captivating volume with The Saem Perfect Volume Mascara. And let your creativity shine with the Pinkflash Palette Eyeshadow, boasting 12 mesmerizing shades to create endless stunning looks.\r\n\r\nThis all-inclusive set is your passport to radiant skin and glamorous makeup, providing everything you need to unleash your inner beauty maven. Treat yourself or spoil a loved one with this luxurious collection – because you deserve nothing but the best.','Jk bb',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2997,'V10 Hyal Air Fit Sunscreen',NULL,110.000,'This chemical sunscreen provides broad-spectrum sun protection of SPF 50 without leaving a white cast. It\'s formulated with soothing and moisturizing ingredients like centella asiatica, tea tree leaf and honeysuckle extracts. Other active ingredients like niacinamide boost skin radiance. Hypoallergenic formula is vegan and reef-friendly.','After basic skincare, apply a thin layer of the sunscreen to your entire face.','produits/IMG_20240421_172021_(540_x_720_pixel)_22968.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240421_172021_(540_x_720_pixel)_22968.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240421_171402_(540_x_720_pixel)_67870.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240421_172452_(540_x_720_pixel)_41813.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240421_171421_(540_x_720_pixel)_14577.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2998,'Torriden - Cellmazing Firming Cream',NULL,125.000,'Torriden CELLMAZING Firming Cream is a rich nourishing cream that cares for skin elasticity and enlarged pores. Featuring Torriden\'s unique 5D Complex Low Molecular Collagen that gives you tighter and smoother skin, while Peptide, Amino Acids, and 10D Hyaluronic Acid ingredients offer effective elasticity care. The firm texture provides moisturising benefits without stickiness. \r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, even sensitive skin, doesn\'t cause irritation or breakouts.\r\n\r\nVolume: 60ml','Apply a generous amount of cream to the areas that need firming including the face and neck.\r\n\r\nTIP: Put a thick layer of the content on your face as sleeping pack or use together with a gel mask for better results of firming care.','produits/IMG_20240422_081812_(540_x_720_pixel)_12557.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240422_081812_(540_x_720_pixel)_12557.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240422_081820_(540_x_720_pixel)_80792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240422_081849_(540_x_720_pixel)_76312.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240422_082007_(540_x_720_pixel)_69949.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(2999,'Torriden - DIVE-IN Low Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum',NULL,106.000,'Torriden DIVE-IN Low molecule Hyaluronic acid Serum is a serum that deeply moisturizes the skin using low moleculair hyaluronic acid. D-panthenol, allantoin and madecosside further soothe and calm sensitive and stressed skin. The light texture of this serum offers a light, refreshing and non-sticky finish. It’s clinically proven to be a suitable product for all skin types, including sensitive skin.','Use the dropper to take 3-5 drops of the serum and spread evenly over your entire face.\r\nApply multiple layers to your face for a better moisturizing effect.','produits/IMG_20240428_152747_(540_x_720_pixel)_42672.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240428_152747_(540_x_720_pixel)_42672.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_152823_(540_x_720_pixel)_47093.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_153024_(540_x_720_pixel)_45915.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_153418_(540_x_720_pixel)_68042.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3000,'Isntree Hyaluronic Acid Airy Sun Stick SPF 50+ PA++++',NULL,107.000,'The Hyaluronic Acid Airy Sun Stick, enriched with natural extracts, offers effective UV protection. It supplies oily and combination skin types with needed moisture and does not impart a sticky feel. It is enriched with hyaluronic acid that restores the moisture balance which in turn revives the skin. The stick format is easy to use.','Twist the dial at the base of the sunscreen.\r\nGently apply the product to areas that are exposed to the sun.\r\nUse as needed.','produits/IMG_20240428_173521_(540_x_720_pixel)_83492.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240428_173521_(540_x_720_pixel)_83492.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_173527_(540_x_720_pixel)_33519.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_173548_(540_x_720_pixel)_53042.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_173604_(540_x_720_pixel)_70005.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3001,'Yuja Niacin Blemish Care Serum Mask',NULL,20.000,'Yuja Niacin 30 Days Blemish Care Serum Mask is a highly concentrated brightening sheet mask to help reduce blemishes and dark spots. Packed with vitamin C-rich yuja (citron) extract to recharge, brighten and hydrate. Niacinamide, Platolwhite-C, arbutin and glutathione help even out your skin tone, while 4 types of vitamins revitalise and soothe your skin for a fresh and dewy complexion. This sheet mask is also vegan-certified.','1. After cleansing, place the mask on the face correctly, avoiding eye and lip area.\r\n2. Leave on for 10-20 minutes then remove it. Pat gently until the remaining essence is fully absorbed','produits/IMG_20240428_202119_(540_x_720_pixel)_97269.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240428_202119_(540_x_720_pixel)_97269.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_202133_(540_x_720_pixel)_46570.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_202149_(540_x_720_pixel)_92840.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_202207_(540_x_720_pixel)_41847.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3002,'PERIPERA Ink Mood Glowy Tint #02 Coral Influencer',NULL,54.000,'Get ready to flaunt a long-lasting, watercolor lip tint that adds a dazzling shine to your lips all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint is perfect for creating a glassy lip look while providing a moisturizing effect. You can enjoy a superb color payoff without any sticky after-feel. This multitasking formula is infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, which helps to smooth the texture and relieve dry, chapped lips while adding a stunning hint of color to your lips.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.','produits/IMG_20240428_203746_(540_x_720_pixel)_51544.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240428_203746_(540_x_720_pixel)_51544.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_203801_(540_x_720_pixel)_79641.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_203814_(540_x_720_pixel)_53226.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_203825_(540_x_720_pixel)_58461.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3003,'FOCALLURE - Plumpmax Lip Gloss #13 Garnet',NULL,40.000,'The Plumpmax® Shiny Lip Glosses contain natural ingredients; Coconut extract, Jojoba seed oil, Mint extract, Antioxidants and Vitamin E, and has nourishing and therapeutic effect on the lips, i.e., UVA/UVB defense, long-lasting moisture, repair of damaged cells etc.','To do','produits/IMG_20240428_212141_(540_x_720_pixel)_74887.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240428_212141_(540_x_720_pixel)_74887.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_212226_(540_x_720_pixel)_62092.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_212237_(540_x_720_pixel)_70803.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_212539_(540_x_720_pixel)_39251.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3004,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Shampoo',NULL,102.000,'Combat hair loss with this nourishing shampoo formulated with 11 types of peptides to moisturize scalp, cica to soothe irritations as well as menthol for a cooling touch. Also contains PHA to thoroughly remove dead skin cells, impurities and excess sebum from scalp.\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\nIt can help alleviate hair loss symptoms.\r\nFormulated with 11 types of peptides, provides moisture and nutrients to scalp.\r\nNourishes scalp with Biotin and proteins from bean, wheat and corn, to help achieve healthy hair.\r\nCalms down and offers regenerative effect to irritated scalp with CICA.\r\nContains Menthol to delivers fresh cooling feeling to scalp.\r\nIts dense & rich foam minimises scalp irritation.\r\nInfused with PHA to absorb dead skin cells, impurities and sebum to create a clean scalp environment.','Wet the hair and scalp completely with lukewarm water.\r\n2. Lather up proper amount of shampoo and apply it to hair &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; scalp, massage for a while.\r\n3. Rinse off with lukewarm water thoroughly.','produits/IMG_20240430_135410_(540_x_720_pixel)_56405.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240430_135410_(540_x_720_pixel)_56405.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_135446_(540_x_720_pixel)_54229.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_135521_(540_x_720_pixel)_20242.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_135539_(540_x_720_pixel)_43098.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3005,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Treatment',NULL,85.000,'Achieve soft, untangled hair in three minutes with this anti-hair-loss scalp treatment! The product contains cica, peptide and black complex to nourish scalp and prevent hair loss. Formulated without silicone and sulfate ingredients to ensure safety.\r\n\r\nIt can help alleviate hair loss symptoms.\r\nNo silicon nor sulfate are contained, no need to worry about skin-troubles and pore clogging issue.\r\nFormulated with Cica, Peptide and Black Complex to nourish hair, strengthen scalp and hair root to prevent hair loss.\r\nProvides a rich amount of moisture and nutrients to hair roots and hair to create a shiny-glowing hair without any tangles.','1. Wet the hair and scalp with lukewarm water.\r\n2. Apply a proper amount and massage all over the scalp and hair.\r\n3. Rinse off with lukewarm water after 2-3 minutes.','produits/IMG_20240430_151857_(540_x_720_pixel)_16154.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240430_151857_(540_x_720_pixel)_16154.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_151907_(540_x_720_pixel)_93229.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_151928_(540_x_720_pixel)_75460.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_152024_(540_x_720_pixel)_28670.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3006,'Green Plum Refreshing Cleanser',NULL,91.000,'Green Plum Refreshing Cleanser is a low-pH gel-type cleanser containing oriental herbal ingredients to protect your skin natural skin barrier while cleansing. Green plum water helps keep the skin moist and gently exfoliates dead skin cells, while mungbean strengthens the skin barrier to help maintain healthy skin. Rice bran is also present to help brighten dull skin, while soothing any sensitivities.','Apply an appropriate amount of water to your wet hands and gently massage your face. Wash it off with lukewarm water','produits/IMG_20240503_115037_(540_x_720_pixel)_46971.jpg',NULL,107,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_115037_(540_x_720_pixel)_46971.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_115103_(540_x_720_pixel)_72606.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_115121_(540_x_720_pixel)_47173.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_115505_(540_x_720_pixel)_84680.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3007,'The Vitamin C 13 Serum',NULL,125.000,'Use everyday like a daily vitamin for your skin! \r\n\r\nA gentle vitamin C serum that is suitable on sensitive skin to use daily! Regular use will fade blemishes, dark spots and freckles and improve overall tone.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS\r\n\r\n\r\n• Daily brightening care\r\n• Fades blemishies, dark spots and freckles\r\n• Improves overall tone\r\n• Refines skin texture\r\n• Reduces size of pores\r\n\r\n\r\nTARGETS\r\n\r\n\r\n• those that want to use vitamin c everyday\r\n• uneven skin tone  \r\n• Dark spots, pigmentation and freckles\r\n• Fine lines and wrinkles\r\n• Rough skin texture','Cleanse your skin and put a toner. Then apply few drops of serum to the skin. User fingertips to gently massage and absorb the serum, starting from the inside of the face working towards the edges','produits/IMG_20240503_152103_(540_x_720_pixel)_29725.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_152103_(540_x_720_pixel)_29725.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152119_(540_x_720_pixel)_74846.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152137_(540_x_720_pixel)_56433.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152153_(540_x_720_pixel)_95339.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152146_(540_x_720_pixel)_35700.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3008,'Dynasty Cream',NULL,119.000,'Dynasty Cream is a brightening and anti-ageing cream made with natural hanbang (traditional Korean herbal medicine) ingredients for a healthier complexion. This newly reformulated formula contains revitalising ginseng and brightening rice water to help firm, smooth and moisturise the skin, while honey extract, squalane and ceramide strengthen and protect the skin barrier.','Apply proper amount of this cream on your face at the last stage of your skincare routine. Pat with your fingers to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240503_152816_(540_x_720_pixel)_20555.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_152816_(540_x_720_pixel)_20555.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152822_(540_x_720_pixel)_44301.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152837_(540_x_720_pixel)_36474.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152856_(540_x_720_pixel)_56558.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3009,'Light On Serum : Centella + Vita C',NULL,130.000,'Light On Serum Centella + Vita C is a gentle brightening serum to help with uneven skin tone and reduce the appearance of dark spots, blemishes and pigmentation. Enriched with 10% 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, a Vitamin C derivative with high stability and low irritation, to deliver brightening benefits and even skin tone, while 68% Centella Asiatica Extract soothe skin from daily irritation and external aggressors while providing intensive moisture to keep skin hydrated. This cream has a lightweight and refreshing texture that absorbs into skin without any greasiness or stickiness. Comes in an airless pump container to maintain the efficacy of the product and increase its stability.','Pump an appropriate amount of serum and apply it evenly over the entire treatment area after smoothing out the skin texture with toner.','produits/IMG_20240503_154144_(540_x_720_pixel)_44571.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_154144_(540_x_720_pixel)_44571.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_154150_(540_x_720_pixel)_35032.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_154255_(540_x_720_pixel)_76168.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_154309_(540_x_720_pixel)_14312.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3010,'Centella Ampoule',NULL,102.000,'Centella Ampoule is a lightweight soothing ampoule that helps hydrate, calm and restore imbalance in the skin. Infused with 100% Centella Asiatica extract from Madagascar to repair damaged skin while regulating its water-oil balance.\r\n\r\nVolume: 55 ml','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20240503_155614_(540_x_720_pixel)_17060.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_155614_(540_x_720_pixel)_17060.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_155702_(540_x_720_pixel)_32420.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_155626_(540_x_720_pixel)_37925.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_155719_(540_x_720_pixel)_20202.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3011,'AXIS-Y - Cera Heart My Type Duo Cream',NULL,111.000,'Use the blue gel-cream on the oily T-zone and apply the white cream to the rest of the face and neck. The blue, light moisturizing cream can also be used in the morning and the white, nourishing cream in the evening.','The Axis-y Cera-Heart My Type Duo Cream is a face cream specially designed for the changing moisture needs of the skin and gives it a healthy, well-groomed glow. Ideal for combination skin: Use the blue gel-like cream on the oily T-zone and the white cream on the rest of the face. The lighter gel cream can also be used in the morning and the nourishing cream in the evening. Blue provides a noticeable hydration boost with glycerin, hyaluronic acid, centella asiatica and postbiotics. White, on the other hand, provides nourishing care and strengthens the skin barrier with ceramides, shea butter and macadamia oil. Never have to decide again - with the Duo Creme your skin has everything it needs!','produits/IMG_20240503_160207_(540_x_720_pixel)_59961.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_160207_(540_x_720_pixel)_59961.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_160213_(540_x_720_pixel)_17789.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_160227_(540_x_720_pixel)_51995.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_160319_(540_x_720_pixel)_47329.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3012,'AXIS-Y - Mugwort Pore Clarifying Wash Off Pack',NULL,102.000,'The AXIS-Y Mugwort Pore Clarifying Wash Off Pack has a base of 61% Mugwort extract to clear impurities in the pores, soothe inflamed and irritated skin, and gently exfoliate dead skin to reveal a bright and healthy complexion.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types. Perfect for calming \"maskne\" or acne caused by wearing masks!\r\n\r\nsize: 100ml','Use the provided spatula to scoop an adequate amount onto a clean, dry face.\r\n2. Apply an even layer to face, avoiding the immediate eye area and mouth.\r\n3. Allow to dry and harden for approximately 15 minutes and rinse off with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240503_161728_(540_x_720_pixel)_67231.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_161728_(540_x_720_pixel)_67231.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_161746_(540_x_720_pixel)_22091.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_161841_(540_x_720_pixel)_21410.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_161852_(540_x_720_pixel)_56295.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3013,'AXIS-Y - PHA Resurfacing Glow Peel',NULL,130.000,'The PHA Resurfacing Glow Peel by AXIS-Y cleanses deep into the pores and gently exfoliates the skin to restore radiance. With extracts from five different fruits and vegetables, the peel clears the skin right from the first application. Extracts obtained from cucumber, papaya and Centella asiatica provide valuable nutrients to make tired or dull skin glow again. The peel has the advantage that further care products can be absorbed more easily.\r\n\r\nThe peel can be used as accompanying care for acne.','After cleansing, apply a thick, even layer to dry skin.\r\nLeave it on for 10 - 15 minutes.\r\nThen rinse with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240503_162826_(540_x_720_pixel)_85904.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_162826_(540_x_720_pixel)_85904.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_162618_(540_x_720_pixel)_27696.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_162604_(540_x_720_pixel)_19293.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_162935_(540_x_720_pixel)_30172.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3014,'AXIS-Y - Daily Purifying Treatment Toner',NULL,105.000,'Refreshing facial toner with exfoliating properties.\r\n\r\nThe Daily Purifying Treatment Toner by AXIS-Y ensures the thorough removal of dirt and impurities that have settled deep in the pores. The skin remains balanced and is even gently exfoliated thanks AHA and PHA. Dead skin cells and layers of sebum dissolve, making your complexion look visibly clearer and more even. Centella asiatica, which has moisturising and regenerating properties, is also included. The toner is perfect for oily and blemish-prone skin and can be used as an accompanying treatment for acne.','After cleansing, sprinkle the toner on a cotton pad.\r\nThen gently rub the soaked cotton pad over the face, avoiding the eye area and areas affected by skin irritation.','produits/IMG_20240503_163453_(540_x_720_pixel)_26585.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_163453_(540_x_720_pixel)_26585.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_163501_(540_x_720_pixel)_29516.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_163511_(540_x_720_pixel)_20532.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_163613_(540_x_720_pixel)_16699.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3015,'ma:nyo - Pure Cleansing Oil',NULL,132.000,'Are you looking for a way to give your skin a gentle yet thorough cleanse? The ma:nyo Pure Cleansing Oil deep cleansing oil has an amazing texture which makes makeup and impurities melt away while restoring the natural moisture levels and pH balance of your skin. It also removes blackheads and whiteheads without clogging your pores. \r\n\r\nCharacteristics:\r\n\r\nmakes blackheads melt away and unclogs pores\r\neliminates makeup and impurities\r\nremoves 99.74% of pollution and dust from the surface of the skin \r\nrebalances the pH level\r\nnourishes the skin\r\nsuitable for all skin types, including acne-prone skin','Use circular motions to massage the ma:nyo Pure cleansing oil gently into the skin until all makeup and impurities are removed. Continue with circular motions around your nose and other areas where blackheads are visible. Add water and massage until the oil turns milky, then rinse with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240503_165040_(540_x_720_pixel)_88607.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_165040_(540_x_720_pixel)_88607.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_165020_(540_x_720_pixel)_79840.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_165048_(540_x_720_pixel)_12256.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_165154_(540_x_720_pixel)_20608.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3016,'Kojie San Skin Lightening Kojic Acid Soap',NULL,30.000,'Kojie San original kojic acid lightening soap is a blend of effective whitening ingredients, nourishing coconut oil, and a fresh orange fragrance. Kojic acid was discovered during the processing of rice for Japanese wines. The naturally derived ingredients in this soap have been proven to safely and quickly reveal even skin by reducing the appearance of dark spots, discolouration, and other imperfections.','Lather soap and apply to treatment areas. Leave the soap on for up to 30 seconds. Apply once per day and increase to twice a day if well tolerated. If dryness occurs follow with a moisturizing cream.','produits/IMG_20240503_172725_(540_x_720_pixel)_23185.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_172725_(540_x_720_pixel)_23185.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_173001_(540_x_720_pixel)_93109.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_173033_(540_x_720_pixel)_92017.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_173604_(540_x_720_pixel)_92591.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3017,'Dos Lunas - Whitening, Moisturizing, and Nourishing Spray',NULL,84.000,'Moisturizing and whitening skin tone (waterproof), can be sprayed onto the skin surface, used for sensitive areas, it gives you bright skin and soft and smooth skin.','Shake well before use Apply an appropriate amount of mist on the face and body at a distance of 20 cm from the face, please avoid contact with eyes','produits/IMG_20240503_174519_(540_x_720_pixel)_35263.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_174519_(540_x_720_pixel)_35263.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_174532_(540_x_720_pixel)_67440.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_174640_(540_x_720_pixel)_94692.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_174659_(540_x_720_pixel)_53733.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3018,'Victoria&rsquo;s Secret Croc Textured Bag Black',NULL,620.000,'New Olive Leather Purse with Matching Coin/Card Wallet 15&quot; long 10&quot; tall 5&quot; wide\r\n\r\n3 inside pockets 1 with zipper\r\n1 outside pocket with zipper','Hbn',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3019,'Victoria\'s Bag AM/PM Beauty Bag Duo',NULL,176.000,'Double the glam. This signature stripe duo fits everything you could ever need. Together or separate, the clear exterior to helps you quickly find what you’re looking for.\r\n\r\nExterior bag fits: Shower and hair essentials\r\nInterior pouch fits: Makeup and more\r\nZip closures on both bags\r\nMeasures: 9.8\"L x 3.3\"D x 6.3\"H\r\nImported nylon & PVC','Hjh',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3020,'VICTORIA\'S SECRET  Velvet Wristlet',NULL,113.000,'The gift of chic. This pouch is the perfect size for all your glam essentials and also wears as a wristlet. In a luxe red velvet finish.\r\n\r\nFits: Eau de Parfum, full-size body care and beauty essentials\r\n9.6”L x 3.3”D x 6.7”H\r\nImported velvet and polyurethane','Hdj',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3021,'VICTORIA\'S SECRET Large Wallet with Zip Orchid Blush',NULL,198.000,'A classic essential. In our signature V-Quilt finish with V-Monogram Hardware, this sleek continental wallet features a wrap-around zip and plenty of interior pockets to keep you organized. \r\n\r\nFits: 12 cards, full length bills, change, cell phone\r\n12 interior card slots\r\n1 zip compartment\r\n2 full length bill pockets\r\n7L x 1W 4H\r\nImported polyurethane','Jfj',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3022,'Victoria Secret ID Wallet Burgundy',NULL,100.000,'Burgundy Woven Front with Gold &amp; Black &quot;V&quot; Logo!\r\nBack has ID Window framed in Burgundy Color.\r\nSnap Opening has Two Credit Card Pockets on Each Side, with a Goldtone Curb Chain &amp; Thick Key Ring! Beautiful!','Hxhe',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3023,'Japanese Cherry Blossom gift set',NULL,250.000,'What it smells like: the fragrance equivalent of your little black dress—beautiful, timeless and beloved.\r\n\r\nFragrance notes: Japanese cherry blossom, Asian pear, fresh mimosa petals, white jasmine and blushing sandalwood.','Xjj',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3024,'Airy Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA++++',NULL,94.000,'Anua Airy Sun Cream is a gentle physical sun cream that protects the skin from UV rays. Formulated with calming ingredients including Centella Asiatica Extract, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Tea Tree Extract and Artemisia Capillaris Extract to help soothe sensitive and irritated skin. The watery cream texture keeps the skin refreshed and moisturised under sunlight without white cast.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.','Take a moderate amount and apply evenly over the face.','produits/IMG_20240504_145742_(540_x_720_pixel)_18267.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240504_145742_(540_x_720_pixel)_18267.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_145659_(540_x_720_pixel)_54901.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_145823_(540_x_720_pixel)_14144.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_145903_(540_x_720_pixel)_45237.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3025,'Madagascar Centella Tea-Trica Spot Cover Patch',NULL,32.000,'Madagascar Centella Tea-Trica Spot Cover Patch are acne spot patches that improve the healing of pimples to minimizing picking and popping blemishes, which may cause inflammation and scarring. The slim and clear patches are barely noticeable while adhering tightly to the skin, making it suitable for everyday use. Hydrocolloid sheets trap moisture, absorb exudates, and dry out pimples to promote healing without scarring. They also act as barriers to prevent infection and contamination, promoting natural healing without irritation.','Apply to patch over the pimple and press for 2-3 seconds to secure. \r\nRecommended to reapply daily.','produits/IMG_20240504_150506_(540_x_720_pixel)_83904.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240504_150506_(540_x_720_pixel)_83904.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_150528_(540_x_720_pixel)_56909.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_150547_(540_x_720_pixel)_29536.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_150807_(540_x_720_pixel)_47384.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3026,'FOCALLURE - Plumpmax Lip Gloss #04 Apyrite',NULL,38.000,'The Plumpmax® Shiny Lip Glosses contain natural ingredients; Coconut extract, Jojoba seed oil, Mint extract, Antioxidants and Vitamin E, and has nourishing and therapeutic effect on the lips, i.e., UVA/UVB defense, long-lasting moisture, repair of damaged cells etc.','Use the built-in brush head for applying evenly on the lips. Apply it overnight before sleeping as an effective lip care alternative. You can also use it as a lip primer by prepping your lips with it before applying any other lip products. For a glossier lips look, apply it on bare lips or overlay as topcoat over your lipstick for an instant fuller, plumper dewy-glossy finish.','produits/IMG_20240504_163054_(540_x_720_pixel)_36106.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240504_163054_(540_x_720_pixel)_36106.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_163126_(540_x_720_pixel)_44566.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240120_002845_(540_x_720_pixel)_21134_90956.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240120_002905_(540_x_720_pixel)_21013_79376.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3027,'I\'M FROM MUGWORT ESSENCE mini',NULL,45.000,'Mugwort Essence is made with 100% concentrated extract of top quality mugwort from Ganghwa County in Korea to calm and soothe irritated, red or troubled skin. Rich in minerals and vitamins, Korean mugwort is known for its ability to restore youthful skin, and its amazing calming and detoxifying properties. The result is soothed skin that feels more refreshed and renewed.\r\n\r\nVolume : 30 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply an adequate amount to the entire face, evenly distributing. For days when your skin is feeling extra dry, soak about 3 cotton pads with the Mugwort Essence and leave the pad on your skin for about 5 minutes.','produits/IMG_20240506_145221_(540_x_720_pixel)_50193.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240506_145221_(540_x_720_pixel)_50193.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240506_145237_(540_x_720_pixel)_77093.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240506_145309_(540_x_720_pixel)_88248.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240506_150547_(540_x_720_pixel)_33462.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3028,'BY WISHTREND - Green Tea &amp;amp; Enzyme Powder Wash',NULL,150.000,'Green Tea &amp;amp; Enzyme Powder Wash is a low-pH cleanser and gentle scrub packed with Green Tea Powder to effectively cleanse, exfoliate and soothe skin. Papain Enzyme, Coconut-derived Surfactant and Baking Soda gently melt away blackheads, impurities and dead skin cells for brighter and smoother skin.\r\n\r\nSuitable for anyone struggling with oiliness or uneven skin texture.','1) Dispense an appropriate amount on wet hands and work into a lather using warm water.\r\n2) Place the foam over the face, cleanse in a gentle massaging motion and rinse off with water.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3029,'Klairs Supple Preparation Facial Toner',NULL,45.000,'This miniature toner is perfect for travel! This facial toner gives immediate relief to severely dry skin. Its gel-like consistency seeps into skin to hydrate the skin. Consistent use results in more smooth and plump skin. Amino acids help to refresh the skin from any excess dirt and sebum as well as helping to restore the pH of your skin post cleansing.','1) After cleansing, gently pat the toner on dry face using the heat of the palm to promote full absorption.\r\n2) We recommend multiple applications on dry areas.','produits/IMG_20240507_182851_(540_x_720_pixel)_18547.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240507_182851_(540_x_720_pixel)_18547.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240507_182907_(540_x_720_pixel)_69139.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240507_182917_(540_x_720_pixel)_63495.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240507_182929_(540_x_720_pixel)_21755.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3030,'Kara Beauty - ROMANCE- LIQUID ROUGE Matte Lipstick',NULL,45.000,'Our matte liquid lipsticks are absolute must-haves. This buildable formula goes a long way and sits comfortably on the lips without creasing or cracking! Now available in a range of both nude and bold shades to suit any skin tone.\r\n\r\nShade bright red','apply this lipstick to your lips','produits/IMG_20240728_125953_(540_x_720_pixel)_60517.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240728_125953_(540_x_720_pixel)_60517.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240728_130023_(540_x_720_pixel)_43576.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240728_130103_(540_x_720_pixel)_68108.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240728_130110_(540_x_720_pixel)_11526.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3031,'TIRTIR - Mask Fit Red Cushion #21N Ivory',NULL,148.000,'The TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is a high-performance Korean beauty product designed to provide long-lasting coverage and a natural, semi-matte finish. It features a formula that offers up to 72 hours of flawless coverage, effectively concealing blemishes, redness, and dark spots. Enriched with hydrating ingredients like Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract and Propolis Extract, it nourishes and moisturizes the skin while providing SPF40 PA++ protection against UV rays. Its buildable coverage ensures a lightweight feel on the skin, making it suitable for all-day wear and ideal for sensitive skin types. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 18g','Apply a moderate amount of the product using the included puff, tapping it evenly across the entire face.','produits/IMG_20240607_004612_(540_x_720_pixel)_19342.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240607_004612_(540_x_720_pixel)_19342.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_004629_(540_x_720_pixel)_84281.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_004719_(540_x_720_pixel)_24261.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_005302_(540_x_720_pixel)_26931.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3032,'TIRTIR - Mask Fit Red Cushion #23N Sand',NULL,148.000,'The TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is a high-performance Korean beauty product designed to provide long-lasting coverage and a natural, semi-matte finish. It features a formula that offers up to 72 hours of flawless coverage, effectively concealing blemishes, redness, and dark spots. Enriched with hydrating ingredients like Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract and Propolis Extract, it nourishes and moisturizes the skin while providing SPF40 PA++ protection against UV rays. Its buildable coverage ensures a lightweight feel on the skin, making it suitable for all-day wear and ideal for sensitive skin types. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 18g','Apply a moderate amount of the product using the included puff, tapping it evenly across the entire face.','produits/IMG_20240607_004612_(540_x_720_pixel)_63969.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240607_004612_(540_x_720_pixel)_63969.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_004629_(540_x_720_pixel)_97664.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_004719_(540_x_720_pixel)_92173.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_005302_(540_x_720_pixel)_66943.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3033,'The 6 Peptide Skin Booster Serum',NULL,136.000,'Cosrx Peptide 6 Serum is a rejuvenating skincare product formulated to target signs of aging and promote a youthful complexion. Enriched with a potent blend of six different peptides, this serum helps to stimulate collagen production, improve skin elasticity, and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing texture makes it suitable for all skin types, providing deep hydration without feeling greasy. Regular use of Cosrx Peptide 6 Serum results in firmer, smoother, and more radiant skin.','After cleansing you may use this serum as the first step of skin care. Spread the serum on the entire face and you may apply several times to amplify the effect of the next serum or ampoule.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3034,'All About Snail Kit',NULL,128.000,'The COSRX All About Snail Kit is a comprehensive four-step skincare regimen designed to rejuvenate and hydrate the skin using the powerful benefits of snail mucin. The kit includes:\r\n\r\n1. **COSRX Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser (20ml / 0.67 fl. oz)**: This gentle gel cleanser effectively removes impurities while preserving the skin natural moisture balance, leaving it clean and refreshed.\r\n2. **COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence (30ml / 1.01 fl. oz)**: A lightweight essence that deeply hydrates and repairs the skin, promoting a smooth and radiant complexion.\r\n3. **COSRX Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream (5ml / 0.16 fl. oz)**: Formulated for the delicate eye area, this cream targets fine lines, dark circles, and puffiness, providing a youthful and refreshed appearance.\r\n4. **COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All In One Cream (20g / 0.70 oz)**: A rich moisturizer that provides intense hydration, improves skin texture, and helps repair damage for a healthier complexion.\r\n\r\nTogether, these products create a synergistic skincare routine that addresses multiple skin concerns, including cleansing, hydration, repair, and anti-aging.','/STEP 1. Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser/\r\nGently massage the cleanser on wet skin. Rinse thoroughly with tepid water.\r\n\r\n\r\n/STEP 2. Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence/\r\nApply a proper amount evenly, avoiding the eye area.\r\n\r\n\r\n/STEP 3. Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream/\r\nApply a proper amount around the eye area. Gently pat with fingertips for fast absorption.\r\n\r\n\r\n/STEP 4. Advanced Snail 92 All In One Cream/\r\nApply a proper amount evenly, avoiding the eye area.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3035,'Ultra-Light Invisible Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,89.000,'A moisturising sunscreen with SPF50+ PA++++ with an ultra-thin consistency, and a transparent formula that is absorbed quickly without leaving white spots. This weightless, transparent formula is quickly absorbed into the skin, providing a natural finish that complements all skin types and skin tones. Thanks to its unique composition, Ultra-Light Invisible Sunscreen can be effortlessly incorporated into any lifestyle and daily routine, and never feels sticky on the skin. This makes it easy to apply sunscreen as part of your daily skincare routine without discomfort. The combination of the key ingredient of aloe and witch hazel provides effective light and heat therapy. Adds rich moisture to irritated skin and has a mild soothing effect on sensitive skin. Contains the specially formulated ingredient vitamin E and replenishes moisture with Hyaluronic acid to quench the thirst of dehydrated skin.\r\nSmooths wrinkles, provides sun protection and soothes irritated skin with Allantoin to keep your skin healthy.','Use as the final step in your skincare routine every morning. Apply a generous amount to the face 30 minutes before sun exposure for optimal results. Massage well and lightly pat the skin until everything is absorbed. Avoid the eye and mouth area. Reapply throughout the day as needed, especially during prolonged sun exposure.','produits/IMG_20240608_163845_(540_x_720_pixel)_77511.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240608_163845_(540_x_720_pixel)_77511.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_164316_(540_x_720_pixel)_13449.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_164325_(540_x_720_pixel)_82967.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_164412_(540_x_720_pixel)_38295.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3036,'Aloe 54.2 Aqua Tone-up Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++',NULL,94.000,'Aloe 54.2 Aqua Tone-Up Sunscreen is a lightweight sunscreen that protects skin while providing a very natural, tone-up effect. Features 54.2% Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Water to boost moisture and soothe skin irritation and sunburn. Vitamin B12 (Cyanocobalamin) and Vitamin B3 (Niacinamide) help protect and prevent skin damage and barrier disruption, while helping to prevent pigmentation. This cream has a lightweight and non-greasy texture that absorbs quickly into the skin, providing a soft, non-greasy appearance all day. Its pink colour gives the skin a glowing, tone-up effect and goes well under makeup.','Apply generously at least 15 minutes before sun exposure.\r\nReapply at least every 2 hours.\r\n*Can be used alone or under makeup.','produits/IMG_20240608_165050_(540_x_720_pixel)_65769.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240608_165050_(540_x_720_pixel)_65769.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_165102_(540_x_720_pixel)_35002.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_165142_(540_x_720_pixel)_67086.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_165211_(540_x_720_pixel)_81204.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_165218_(540_x_720_pixel)_93888.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3037,'Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Serum',NULL,112.000,'Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Serum is a rejuvenating serum that contains a powerful cocktail of brightening ingredients. Formulated with Galactomyces, Vitamin C and niacinamide, this brightening serum helps fight dullness, hyperpigmentation and uneven skin tone.','After cleansing and toning, apply the serum all over your skin and tap to help with absorption.','produits/IMG_20240608_170519_(540_x_720_pixel)_25047.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240608_170519_(540_x_720_pixel)_25047.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_170607_(540_x_720_pixel)_72529.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_170911_(540_x_720_pixel)_13289.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_171114_(540_x_720_pixel)_81952.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3038,'Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule',NULL,150.000,'Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule is a hydrating ampoule that quickly boosts moisture and preps the skin to absorb the next steps of your skincare routine. Formulated with Hyalu-Cica (a unique complex made from Hyaluronic Acid and Centella Asiatica) that calms skin irritation and deeply hydrates skin. Various plant-based ingredients including Damask Rose Water, Pear Extract and Birch Juice provide additional soothing and moisturising benefits. Can be used right after cleansing for optimal results.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types\r\n\r\nVolume : 100ml','Use immediately after cleansing as the first step of your routine. Apply 1-2 drops to the skin and pat to absorb.','produits/IMG_20240610_090142_(540_x_720_pixel)_63623.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240610_090142_(540_x_720_pixel)_63623.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_090202_(540_x_720_pixel)_37397.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_090221_(540_x_720_pixel)_85050.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_090238_(540_x_720_pixel)_82799.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3039,'Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Silky-Fit Sun Stick',NULL,91.000,'Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Silky-Fit Sun Stick is a sun stick that harnesses the moisturising and healing powers of Cica Extract and Hyaluronic Acid to keep skin hydration levels high while providing broad-spectrum sun protection. Also enriched with antioxidant-rich plant-based ingredients to help promote healthy skin. This organic sunscreen stick glides on smoothly for a natural, silky soft finish without a white cast.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nVolume: 20g','As the last step of your skincare routine, apply evenly to areas exposed to UV rays. Reapply every 2-3 hours for more protection.','produits/IMG_20240610_091255_(540_x_720_pixel)_37552.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240610_091255_(540_x_720_pixel)_37552.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_091309_(540_x_720_pixel)_26887.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_091341_(540_x_720_pixel)_33771.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_091352_(540_x_720_pixel)_14649.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3040,'Heartleaf Succinic Moisture Cleansing Foam',NULL,140.000,'Anua Heartleaf Succinic Moisture Cleansing Foam is a gel-type cleanser that gently removes sebum and dead skin cells to keep skin fresh and clear. Formulated with Heartleaf Extract and Protease to soothe breakouts and gently remove dead skin cells for clearer skin. It also contains BHA and Succinic Acid to unclog pores and regulate sebum production. This pH-balanced formula is boosted with Ceramide NP and Panthenol to keep skin moisturised post-cleanse.\r\n\r\nRecommended for sensitive and acne-prone skin.\r\n\r\nVolume: 150ml','Disseminate an appropriate amount on face after lathering up. Massage the whole face gently and off afterwards.','produits/IMG_20240610_093507_(540_x_720_pixel)_48898.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240610_093507_(540_x_720_pixel)_48898.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_093607_(540_x_720_pixel)_91550.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_093641_(540_x_720_pixel)_75358.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_093651_(540_x_720_pixel)_47365.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3041,'Teresia - Marine Collagen Brightening Tone-up Cream',NULL,105.000,'Get ready to achieve that bright and youthful glow with Tone Up Cream! Say goodbye to dull and tired-looking skin with this soft cream-type tone-up cream that\'s perfect for creating a natural, healthy-looking complexion.\r\nFormulated with a powerful blend of brightening ingredients like Broussonetia Kazinoki Root Extract, Morus Alba Bark Extract, and Camellia Japonica Leaf Extract, this Korean skincare staple will help you achieve that radiant glow you\'ve been dreaming of. Whether you\'re heading out for a long day of outdoor activities or simply want to keep your skin looking its best, Tone Up Cream has got you covered.\r\nOur collagen-rich formula works to keep your skin looking healthy and youthful, while the added benefits of Niacinamide and Acetyl Glucosamine help to even out your skin tone and reduce the appearance of dark spots.\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Add Tone Up Cream to your daily skincare routine and get ready to say hello to brighter, more toned-up skin!','At the last stage of skin care, take an appropriate amount on your hand, apply it gently to the desired area such as the face and neck, and pat it lightly.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3042,'CLIO - Kill Cover High Glow Cushion Set (+Refill) 03 linen',NULL,156.000,'Introducing the newest addition to CLIO’s renowned Kill Cover series – the lightweight cushion foundation designed to effortlessly achieve an ultra-dewy finish, revealing your skin’s innate radiance. This glowy version of the best-selling Kill Cover Cushion line offers three exquisite shades, ensuring a flawless complexion with a translucent skin effect.\r\nCrafted with a weightless formula, this cushion foundation seamlessly adheres to the skin, avoiding any cakey appearance. Experience a dewy, elastic skin finish with a natural glow that lasts up to 72 hours without losing its vibrancy. The buildable formula allows for versatile coverage, easily blendable or layerable according to your preferences.','1. Take a moderate amount of product using the included puff.\r\n2. Using gentle tapping motions, apply an even layer to the entire face.','produits/IMG_20240616_181312_(540_x_720_pixel)_39587.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240616_181312_(540_x_720_pixel)_39587.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240616_181326_(540_x_720_pixel)_89872.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_182737_(540_x_720_pixel)_66951.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_182940_(540_x_720_pixel)_33590.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_183113_(540_x_720_pixel)_88575.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3043,'CLIO - Kill Cover High Glow Cushion Set (+Refill) 04 Ginger',NULL,156.000,'Introducing the newest addition to CLIO’s renowned Kill Cover series – the lightweight cushion foundation designed to effortlessly achieve an ultra-dewy finish, revealing your skin’s innate radiance. This glowy version of the best-selling Kill Cover Cushion line offers three exquisite shades, ensuring a flawless complexion with a translucent skin effect.\r\nCrafted with a weightless formula, this cushion foundation seamlessly adheres to the skin, avoiding any cakey appearance. Experience a dewy, elastic skin finish with a natural glow that lasts up to 72 hours without losing its vibrancy. The buildable formula allows for versatile coverage, easily blendable or layerable according to your preferences.','1. Take a moderate amount of product using the included puff.\r\n2. Using gentle tapping motions, apply an even layer to the entire face.','produits/IMG_20240618_184854_(540_x_720_pixel)_58199.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_184854_(540_x_720_pixel)_58199.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_182737_(540_x_720_pixel)_78100.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_182940_(540_x_720_pixel)_76056.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_183113_(540_x_720_pixel)_28016.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3044,'CLIO - Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion SPF50+ PA+++ (Padding Case) 02',NULL,189.000,'CLIO’s cult-favorite Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion now comes in a special edition padding case! The cushion foundation effectively blurs enlarged pores and blemishes for a smooth and even-toned finish. The lightweight yet long-wearing formula adheres well to skin without caking. Comes with a curved puff designed for application on hard-to-reach areas.','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use it after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20240618_205339_(540_x_720_pixel)_10871.jpg',NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_205339_(540_x_720_pixel)_10871.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205520_(540_x_720_pixel)_19240.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205531_(540_x_720_pixel)_98369.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205431_(540_x_720_pixel)_70411.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205654_(540_x_720_pixel)_92961.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205713_(540_x_720_pixel)_93087.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205722_(540_x_720_pixel)_14632.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3045,'TIRTIR - Milk Skin Toner',NULL,130.000,'The TIRTIR Milk Skin Toner is a highly-concentrated milky toner that provides deep, long-lasting hydration for glowing, healthy and radiant skin. Infused with complexion-brightening ingredients such as Rice Bran Extracts and Niacinamide, as well as Cica and Witch Hazel to soothe and hydrate skin.\r\n\r\nDermatologically tested and suitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nSize: 150ml','After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to the skin and pat in to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240618_221620_(540_x_720_pixel)_43775.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_221620_(540_x_720_pixel)_43775.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_221656_(540_x_720_pixel)_56819.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_221808_(540_x_720_pixel)_82490.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_222037_(540_x_720_pixel)_86098.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3046,'Heartleaf Pore Clay Pack',NULL,105.000,'Anua Heartleaf Pore Clay Pack is a gentle pore-care clay mask formulated with Bentonite and Kaolin to unclog pores and exfoliate skin for a smooth finish. Enriched with Houttuynia Cordata Extract and Quercetin to offer anti-oxidising and anti-inflammatory effects, while reducing redness and restoring skin barrier. Further contains Hyaluronic Acid, Soluble Collagen and Protease to facilitate keratin softening while offering plumping and firming effects. This clay mask has a cream-like texture with a refreshing Eucalyptus scent.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nSize: 100ml','1. After washing your face, apply the content to the entire face except eye and mouth areas.\r\n2. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water after 3-5 minutes.\r\n3. Use 1-2 times a week depending on your skin condition.','produits/IMG_20240618_223929_(540_x_720_pixel)_27146.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_223929_(540_x_720_pixel)_27146.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_223804_(540_x_720_pixel)_54865.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_224006_(540_x_720_pixel)_46431.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_224030_(540_x_720_pixel)_26248.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3047,'Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint #09 Nude to Heart',NULL,68.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth outwards toward corners of mouth.','produits/IMG_20240618_224825_(540_x_720_pixel)_26314.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_224825_(540_x_720_pixel)_26314.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_225002_(540_x_720_pixel)_57326.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_224946_(540_x_720_pixel)_57399.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_225017_(540_x_720_pixel)_70867.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_225013_(540_x_720_pixel)_40042.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3048,'MEDI-PEEL - Peptide 9 Volume All In One Essence Pro',NULL,179.000,'The Pro is a more extensive version than its previous, with more concentrated and effective ingredients to combats signs of aging and reding the appearance of fine lines Easily absorbed by skin with its fine bubble, leaving skin hydrated and firm. Skin irritation test completed, suitable for sensitive skin. make it shorter like before\r\n\r\nAn anti-aging essence with 9 peptides, 4 Hyaluronic Acids, and Lactobacillus Ferment.\r\nCombats signs of aging, reducing fine lines with concentrated and effective ingredients.\r\nQuickly absorbed with fine bubbles, leaving skin hydrated and firm.\r\nSkin irritation tested, suitable for sensitive skin.','After toner, apply 1-2 pumps of the content on your face and pat lightly to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240618_231352_(540_x_720_pixel)_53089.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_231352_(540_x_720_pixel)_53089.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_232524_(540_x_720_pixel)_83063.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_231405_(540_x_720_pixel)_34814.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_231358_(540_x_720_pixel)_37856.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3049,'MIXSOON - Bean Essence',NULL,130.000,'This multi-award-winning Bean Essence is MIXSOON\'s best-seller and star product. It helps improve skin texture and refine pores by gently exfoliating dead skin cells away from the surface, revealing brighter and glowing skin.   \r\n\r\nIt is packed with high-quality nutrients such as Soybean Extract and Pomegranate Extract to hydrate and nourish the skin. The antioxidants also strengthen the skin, while maintaining the skin\'s natural moisture and oil levels, helping to reduce excess sebum production. With additional anti-ageing benefits, this essence will leave your complexion dewy and moisturised! <br>\r\n\r\nThe texture is viscous, similar to snail mucin or \"natto\". This is a fantastic alternative to the Cosrx Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Essence.','1. Use after cleansing and toning\r\n\r\n2. Either apply on your palm and pat gently and spread for absorption to use an essence\r\n\r\n3. To use as an exfoliator 2-3 times a week, apply a generous amount and massage in to see dead skin cells come off. Remove with a wet cotton pad','produits/IMG_20240618_233248_(540_x_720_pixel)_94612.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_233248_(540_x_720_pixel)_94612.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_233312_(540_x_720_pixel)_59327.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_233342_(540_x_720_pixel)_44004.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_233406_(540_x_720_pixel)_70087.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_233417_(540_x_720_pixel)_58016.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3050,'Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion Set (+Refill) Peach Edition',NULL,151.000,'Weightless Coverage, All-Day Wear\r\nIntroducing the NEW KILL COVER Founwear Cushion, a revolutionary foundation that delivers flawless, weightless coverage that lasts all day. This innovative formula provides:\r\n * Up to 24 hours of wear without caking or fading.\r\n * Buildable, natural-looking coverage for a radiant complexion.\r\n * Lightweight, water-based formula that feels comfortable on your skin.\r\n * SPF 50+ PA+++ for broad-spectrum sun protection.\r\n * Triple-action benefits:  Sunscreen, whitening, and wrinkle improvement.\r\n * Customized curved puff for a smooth, even application.\r\nAvailable in shade 4 Ginger','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use it after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20240625_170817_(540_x_720_pixel)_93443.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240625_170817_(540_x_720_pixel)_93443.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240625_170913_(540_x_720_pixel)_94692.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240625_171223_(540_x_720_pixel)_88548.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240625_171216_(540_x_720_pixel)_13207.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240625_171522_(540_x_720_pixel)_22409.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3051,'BIODANCE Bio-Collagen Real Deep Mask Sheet 1P',NULL,35.000,'With over 1 million sales, this is BIODANCE’s best-selling product that is sold at a rate of one every 2 seconds. BIODANCE Bio-Collagen Real Deep Mask is a bottle of highly concentrated ampoule that allows the skin to absorb every last drop of the ampoule.\r\n\r\nThe highly concentrated ampoule 34g is not soaked into the sheet, but hardened as a hydrogel mask pack, and as the skin absorbs the active ingredients, it becomes more transparent.\r\n\r\nA skin portal care solution product that improves moisture, pores, and elasticity with just one sheet of mask.\r\n\r\nThis product received the EWG Green grade, 19 controversial ingredients FREE, Hwahae 20 harmful ingredients FREE, MFDS announced 25 allergy-inducing ingredients FREE, and skin irritation tested.','1. After cleansing, soothe the skin texture with a hydrating toner.\r\n2. Take out the mask and place it along the face shape.\r\n3. Once the mask turns transparent, remove it. (up to 3-4 hours)\r\n4. Finish with a moisturizer, as needed.\r\n\r\n[Sleeping Mask]\r\n1. After cleansing, apply the ampoule or cream that enhances the content absorption.\r\n2. Take out the mask and place it along the face shape.\r\n3. Keep the mask overnight and remove on the next day.','produits/IMG_20240711_170604_(540_x_720_pixel)_65244.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240711_170604_(540_x_720_pixel)_65244.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170736_(540_x_720_pixel)_50481.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170813_(540_x_720_pixel)_29117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170829_(540_x_720_pixel)_52433.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3052,'BIODANCE Bio-Collagen Real Deep Mask Sheet Box',NULL,126.000,'With over 1 million sales, this is BIODANCE’s best-selling product that is sold at a rate of one every 2 seconds. BIODANCE Bio-Collagen Real Deep Mask is a bottle of highly concentrated ampoule that allows the skin to absorb every last drop of the ampoule.\r\n\r\nThe highly concentrated ampoule 34g is not soaked into the sheet, but hardened as a hydrogel mask pack, and as the skin absorbs the active ingredients, it becomes more transparent.\r\n\r\nA skin portal care solution product that improves moisture, pores, and elasticity with just one sheet of mask.\r\n\r\nThis product received the EWG Green grade, 19 controversial ingredients FREE, Hwahae 20 harmful ingredients FREE, MFDS announced 25 allergy-inducing ingredients FREE, and skin irritation tested.','1. After cleansing, soothe the skin texture with a hydrating toner.\r\n2. Take out the mask and place it along the face shape.\r\n3. Once the mask turns transparent, remove it. (up to 3-4 hours)\r\n4. Finish with a moisturizer, as needed.\r\n\r\n[Sleeping Mask]\r\n1. After cleansing, apply the ampoule or cream that enhances the content absorption.\r\n2. Take out the mask and place it along the face shape.\r\n3. Keep the mask overnight and remove on the next day.','produits/IMG_20240711_170604_(540_x_720_pixel)_27216.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240711_170604_(540_x_720_pixel)_27216.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_171232_(540_x_720_pixel)_80942.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170736_(540_x_720_pixel)_94746.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170813_(540_x_720_pixel)_66282.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170829_(540_x_720_pixel)_23220.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3053,'Round Lab - Birch Moisturizing Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++',NULL,117.000,'The Round Lab Birch Moisturizing Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ is a popular and award-winning Korean sunscreen known for its hydrating and lightweight formula. Packed with birch sap and hyaluronic acid, it offers broad-spectrum UVA/UVB protection and is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.','* Apply liberally to your face and neck as the last step of your skincare routine at least 15 minutes before sun exposure.\r\n * Don\'t forget to apply sunscreen to other exposed areas like your arms, legs, and ears.\r\n * Reapply every two hours, especially after swimming or sweating.','produits/IMG_20240712_184419_(540_x_720_pixel)_63189.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240712_184419_(540_x_720_pixel)_63189.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_184537_(540_x_720_pixel)_50652.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_184653_(540_x_720_pixel)_35046.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_184733_(540_x_720_pixel)_87821.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3054,'Round Lab - Birch Juice Moisturizing Sun Stick',NULL,117.000,'This moisturizing chemical sun stick offers broad spectrum SPF 50+ PA++++ protection for comprehensive sun defense. Enriched with birch tree sap, aloe, kelp, and other botanical extracts, it hydrates, soothes, and cools the skin. Niacinamide, adenosine, and 12 types of peptides provide additional brightening and anti-aging benefits. The easy-to-reapply stick glides on smoothly, adheres well, and leaves no greasy residue.','Twist the bottom part of the product to elevate content. Swipe across skin to apply.','produits/IMG_20240712_223753_(540_x_720_pixel)_66853.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240712_223753_(540_x_720_pixel)_66853.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_223834_(540_x_720_pixel)_44085.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_223851_(540_x_720_pixel)_66092.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_225024_(540_x_720_pixel)_96694.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3055,'Karseell Argan Oil Hair Treatment Shampoo',NULL,130.000,'Transform your hair from dry and damaged to luxuriously smooth and radiant with Karseell Argan Oil Shampoo. This nourishing formula, infused with precious Moroccan argan oil, gently cleanses and deeply conditions your hair in one luxurious step. Rich in vitamin E and fatty acids, argan oil helps repair split ends, tame frizz, and boost shine. Karseell Argan Oil Shampoo is perfect for all hair types, leaving your hair feeling soft, manageable, and irresistibly healthy.','* Wet your hair thoroughly with warm water. This helps prepare your hair for cleansing and ensures the shampoo lathers well.\r\n * Apply a generous amount of shampoo to your scalp and hair. The amount you\'ll need will depend on your hair length and thickness. Start with a coin-sized amount for medium-length hair and adjust as needed.\r\n * Gently massage the shampoo into your scalp using your fingertips. Create a lather as you massage, focusing on cleansing your scalp.\r\n * Work the lather down to the ends of your hair. This helps distribute the shampoo\'s conditioning benefits throughout your hair.\r\n * Rinse the shampoo out completely with clean water. Ensure all the shampoo is rinsed away to avoid any residue buildup.\r\n * Follow with conditioner if desired. Conditioner helps replenish moisture and detangle your hair, leaving it soft and manageable.','produits/IMG_20240713_102708_(540_x_720_pixel)_33523.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_102708_(540_x_720_pixel)_33523.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_102755_(540_x_720_pixel)_15293.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_104016_(540_x_720_pixel)_49933.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_104032_(540_x_720_pixel)_95058.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_104104_(540_x_720_pixel)_66527.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3056,'Karseell Conditioner Argan Oil Organic Herbal Essence Deep Repair Treatment',NULL,130.000,'Karseell Conditioner Argan Oil Organic Herbal Essence Deep Repair Treatment is a hair conditioner that is formulated to repair and nourish dry, damaged hair. It contains argan oil, which is rich in vitamin E and helps to repair split ends, moisturize hair, and protect it from UV damage. The conditioner also contains other natural ingredients, such as macadamia oil, tea tree oil, chamomile oil, aloe vera, and algae extracts, which work together to nourish and strengthen hair.\r\nThis conditioner is ideal for all hair types, including straight, curly, and color-treated hair. It can help to reduce frizz and flyaways, and it can also help to enhance curls and add bounce to voluminous hair.','* Wash your hair with shampoo and rinse thoroughly.\r\n * Apply the deep conditioner to your hair, focusing on the ends.\r\n * Comb through your hair to distribute the conditioner evenly.\r\n * Leave the conditioner on your hair for 20-30 minutes, or as directed by the product label.\r\n * Rinse the conditioner out of your hair with warm water.','produits/IMG_20240713_145408_(540_x_720_pixel)_98288.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_145408_(540_x_720_pixel)_98288.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_145503_(540_x_720_pixel)_81095.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_145711_(540_x_720_pixel)_36356.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_145739_(540_x_720_pixel)_15008.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3057,'Karseell Collagen Hair Treatment Deep Repair Conditioning Argan Oil Collagen Hair Mask Essence',NULL,180.000,'Infuse your hair with deep hydration and luxurious shine with Karseell hair mask! This potent formula is more than just your average conditioner – it\'s a transformative treatment for dry, damaged hair. Here\'s why you\'ll love it:\r\n * Intense Moisture: Packed with collagen, argan oil, and maca essence, this mask deeply hydrates and nourishes your hair, leaving it feeling silky smooth and touchably soft.\r\n * Say Goodbye to Frizz: Tame unruly strands and flyaways with the powerful conditioning properties of Karseell mask. Experience manageable, frizz-free hair that\'s easier to style and detangle.\r\n * Visible Shine Boost: Breathe new life into dull, lackluster hair. Karseell mask helps restore your hair\'s natural shine and vibrancy, giving you healthy-looking locks that radiate confidence.\r\n * Suitable for All Hair Types: Whether you have straight, curly, color-treated, or chemically processed hair, Karseell mask is formulated to work wonders on your unique hair type.','* Wash your hair with shampoo and skip the conditioner.\r\n * Towel-dry your hair to remove excess water.\r\n * Apply a generous amount of the mask to your hair, focusing on the mid-lengths and ends.\r\n * Leave the mask on for 10-20 minutes. You can use a shower cap to trap heat and enhance absorption.\r\n * Rinse the mask out thoroughly with clean water.','produits/IMG_20240713_184631_(540_x_720_pixel)_71577.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_184631_(540_x_720_pixel)_71577.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_185125_(540_x_720_pixel)_75513.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_185256_(540_x_720_pixel)_10079.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_185012_(540_x_720_pixel)_40385.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_184912_(540_x_720_pixel)_99419.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3058,'Karseell Moroccan Argan Oil',NULL,120.000,'Karseell hair oil is a Moroccan argan oil treatment designed to nourish and repair dry, damaged hair. It\'s rich in vitamin E, which helps to strengthen hair and make it shinier and healthier. The oil is also lightweight and easily absorbed, so it won\'t weigh your hair down. Karseell hair oil can also be used on skin and nails for a touch of hydration and rejuvenation.','* Deep conditioning: Apply a few drops to your hair before shampooing, focusing on the ends. Leave it on for 20-30 minutes for a nourishing treatment.\r\n * Daily shine booster: Apply a small amount to damp or dry hair, concentrating on the mid-lengths and ends. This will tame frizz and add shine without weighing your hair down.\r\n * Hair mask: Mix a few drops of argan oil with your favorite hair mask for an extra boost of hydration.','produits/IMG_20240713_190849_(540_x_720_pixel)_91650.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_190849_(540_x_720_pixel)_91650.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_190928_(540_x_720_pixel)_85037.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_191016_(540_x_720_pixel)_62242.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_191411_(540_x_720_pixel)_41419.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_191525_(540_x_720_pixel)_21564.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3059,'TOCOBO - Vita Tone Up Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,117.000,'The TOCOBO Vita Tone Up Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++ is a sunscreen that offers sun protection while evening skin tone and texture. It contains ingredients like niacinamide and vitamin B12 to brighten skin, hyaluronic acid for hydration, and Hippophae Rhamnoides Water for skin soothing. This all-in-one formula protects your skin from sun damage while leaving it looking radiant. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 50 ml','Apply adequate amount at the last step of basic skin care\r\nApply 30 minutes before going out in the sun.\r\nReapply every two hours for the perfect sun protection during the outdoor activity.','produits/IMG_20240713_234252_(540_x_720_pixel)_50088.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_234252_(540_x_720_pixel)_50088.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_234408_(540_x_720_pixel)_38991.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_234522_(540_x_720_pixel)_63594.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_234556_(540_x_720_pixel)_45159.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_234659_(540_x_720_pixel)_29075.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3060,'Ground Rice and Honey Glow Mask',NULL,140.000,'This all-in-one wash-off mask combines the benefits of Korean rice wine extract, rice hull powder, and honey to deliver a radiant complexion. Upcycled makgeolli lees, a byproduct of traditional Korean rice wine, brightens and hydrates, while rice hull powder gently exfoliates. Honey soothes inflammation and provides deep moisture, making this mask suitable for all skin types, including those with acne. Kaolin clay absorbs excess oil to purify pores, leaving your skin feeling refreshed and balanced.\r\n\r\nSkin type: Dry, normal, combination, oily, sensitive\r\n\r\nVolume: 150 ml','* Cleanse your face and pat it dry.\r\n * Apply a generous amount of the mask evenly to your face, avoiding the eye and mouth area.\r\n * Leave the mask on for 15-20 minutes.\r\n * Gently massage the mask into your skin with lukewarm water to rinse it off completely.\r\n * Pat your face dry and follow up with your usual moisturizer.','produits/IMG_20240714_145507_(540_x_720_pixel)_30801.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_145507_(540_x_720_pixel)_30801.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_145638_(540_x_720_pixel)_88201.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_145858_(540_x_720_pixel)_70805.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_150224_(540_x_720_pixel)_58004.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_150420_(540_x_720_pixel)_59077.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_150530_(540_x_720_pixel)_46114.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3061,'A\'PIEU - Honey and Milk Lip Oil Mint',NULL,55.000,'A\'pieu\'s Honey and Milk Mint Lip Oil combines natural ingredients to nourish and protect your lips. Honey, a natural humectant, locks in moisture, while milk protein extract provides a nourishing layer to soften and smooth lips. The mint adds a refreshing tingle and scent, and the blend of oils ensures a lightweight, non-sticky application that leaves a healthy gloss.','1. Gently apply a layer on lips with the curved applicator.\r\n2. Reapply on troubled areas by tapping with the tip of the applicator.\r\n3. Alternatively, apply after lip tint.','produits/IMG_20240714_191032_(540_x_720_pixel)_50923.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_191032_(540_x_720_pixel)_50923.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_191102_(540_x_720_pixel)_86019.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_191118_(540_x_720_pixel)_45306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_191149_(540_x_720_pixel)_52108.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3062,'A\'PIEU - Honey and Milk Lip Oil Peach',NULL,55.000,'The A\'pieu honey and milk lip oil locks in the moisture and protects the lips from drying out. Honey forms a moisture barrier while milk protein extract smoothes the lips. The lightweight texture glides onto the lips, leaving a healthy shine.','Apply onto lips as necessary.','produits/IMG_20240714_201357_(540_x_720_pixel)_28260.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_201357_(540_x_720_pixel)_28260.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_200624_(540_x_720_pixel)_31088.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_200716_(540_x_720_pixel)_41439.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_200819_(540_x_720_pixel)_69325.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3063,'Glow Replenishing Rice Milk',NULL,130.000,'✓ Refreshing, Non-Greasy Finish\r\n\r\n✓ All Skin Types, All Seasons\r\n\r\n✓ Creates a Moisture Barrier\r\n‎\r\n\r\nThis rice toner modernizes the traditional rice bran water used in the Joseon Dynasty. Packed with nutrients, rice extract, and rice amino acids, it deeply hydrates and smooths dry, rough skin. Its dual-layer formula provides a refreshing, non-greasy finish while controlling sebum and soothing sensitive skin.','Skin Prep for Glass Skin: Soak cotton pads with Rice Milk and place them on your face for 5 minutes. Remove the pads and gently pat to aid absorption.\r\nSebum Control: Pour a generous amount of Rice Milk onto a cotton pad and gently swipe across your face from the center outward. Finish with another layer and move onto your next skincare routine.','produits/IMG_20240714_203014_(540_x_720_pixel)_16337.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_203014_(540_x_720_pixel)_16337.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_203119_(540_x_720_pixel)_68659.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_203134_(540_x_720_pixel)_21780.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_203146_(540_x_720_pixel)_93890.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_203227_(540_x_720_pixel)_73352.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3064,'Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum',NULL,140.000,'The Anua Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum is a Korean skincare product designed to address hyperpigmentation and achieve a brighter, more even skin tone. Here\'s a quick breakdown of its key features:\r\n * Key Ingredients: 10% Niacinamide, 4% Tranexamic Acid, 2% Alpha Arbutin\r\n * Benefits: Targets dark spots and hyperpigmentation, brightens skin tone, lightweight texture\r\n * Skin Types: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin','1. Apply a few drops to affected areas and gradually increase the usage period accordingly.\r\n2. Use in the morning and at night before oil and moisturizer.\r\n3. Can be used daily but discontinue if irritation occurs.\r\n4. When used in the morning, be certain to wear sun protection with SPF30 or higher.','produits/IMG_20240714_203927_(540_x_720_pixel)_47242.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_203927_(540_x_720_pixel)_47242.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204012_(540_x_720_pixel)_32088.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204129_(540_x_720_pixel)_65692.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204138_(540_x_720_pixel)_73181.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222431_(540_x_720_pixel)_26211.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222531_(540_x_720_pixel)_49532.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222734_(540_x_720_pixel)_90221.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222949_(540_x_720_pixel)_90772.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222838_(540_x_720_pixel)_20865.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3065,'JUMISO - Snail Mucin 95% + Peptide Essence',NULL,150.000,'Jumiso\'s Snail Mucin 95% + Peptide Essence is a Korean skincare powerhouse that combines the best of both worlds: hydration and anti-aging. The star ingredient, snail mucin, delivers deep hydration to quench your skin\'s thirst, leaving it feeling refreshed and plump. But that\'s not all! This essence also boasts five types of peptides, which work together to stimulate collagen production. This translates to firmer, smoother skin with less noticeable fine lines and wrinkles. The lightweight, fragrance-free formula is gentle enough for even sensitive and acne-prone skin, making it a great choice for all skin types.','After cleansing and toner, apply it evenly in the face, in the morning and evening','produits/IMG_20240715_003011_(540_x_720_pixel)_34422.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240715_003011_(540_x_720_pixel)_34422.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_003233_(540_x_720_pixel)_61220.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_003256_(540_x_720_pixel)_12019.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_003348_(540_x_720_pixel)_65219.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3066,'TIRTIR - Mask Fit Red Cushion #21W Natural Ivory',NULL,148.000,'The TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is a high-performance Korean beauty product designed to provide long-lasting coverage and a natural, semi-matte finish. It features a formula that offers up to 72 hours of flawless coverage, effectively concealing blemishes, redness, and dark spots. Enriched with hydrating ingredients like Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract and Propolis Extract, it nourishes and moisturizes the skin while providing SPF40 PA++ protection against UV rays. Its buildable coverage ensures a lightweight feel on the skin, making it suitable for all-day wear and ideal for sensitive skin types.','After your skincare routine, apply the appropriate amount of foundation to the sponge/puff and gently pat all over your face.\r\nBuild up with several thin layers instead of one thick layer for a more even and natural tone.\r\nClose the packaging after use to prevent the product from drying out.','produits/IMG_20240715_092001_(540_x_720_pixel)_47539.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240715_092001_(540_x_720_pixel)_47539.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_092011_(540_x_720_pixel)_37560.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_092103_(540_x_720_pixel)_56380.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_092228_(540_x_720_pixel)_53056.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3067,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream',NULL,94.000,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream is a lightweight organic sunscreen that provides soothing and hydrating benefits. Featuring Houttuynia Cordata Extract to calm your skin and provide care for sensitive skin, while Panthenol locks water inside your skin and helps with calming. Also boasting a sebum-controlling effect, the formula sits well under foundation and prolongs makeup wear.','1. Apply it at the last stage of skincare routine 15 minutes before heading out.\r\n2. Apply an approximate size of a finger twice to three times.\r\n3. The soft and moisturizing texture allows you to apply at any time.','produits/IMG_20240715_194914_(540_x_720_pixel)_40051.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240715_194914_(540_x_720_pixel)_40051.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_194941_(540_x_720_pixel)_63652.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_194953_(540_x_720_pixel)_71142.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_195026_(540_x_720_pixel)_35538.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3068,'mixsoon - Ice Glacier Hyaluronic Acid Serum',NULL,155.000,'Infused with glacier water and three types of hyaluronic acid, this serum offers a powerful hydration boost for supple and plump skin. It forms a moisture film over skin to help strengthen the skin barrier. The lightweight texture absorbs readily into skin without leaving a sticky after-feel.','Apply a moderate amount and gently massage for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20240715_222431_(540_x_720_pixel)_62242.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240715_222431_(540_x_720_pixel)_62242.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222531_(540_x_720_pixel)_59431.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222734_(540_x_720_pixel)_81349.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222949_(540_x_720_pixel)_11305.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222838_(540_x_720_pixel)_52412.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3069,'Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum',NULL,140.000,'The Anua Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum is a Korean skincare product designed to address hyperpigmentation and achieve a brighter, more even skin tone. Here\'s a quick breakdown of its key features:\r\n * Key Ingredients: 10% Niacinamide, 4% Tranexamic Acid, 2% Alpha Arbutin\r\n * Benefits: Targets dark spots and hyperpigmentation, brightens skin tone, lightweight texture\r\n * Skin Types: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin','1. Apply a few drops to affected areas and gradually increase the usage period accordingly.\r\n2. Use in the morning and at night before oil and moisturizer.\r\n3. Can be used daily but discontinue if irritation occurs.\r\n4. When used in the morning, be certain to wear sun protection with SPF30 or higher.','produits/IMG_20240714_203927_(540_x_720_pixel)_47242_16741.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_203927_(540_x_720_pixel)_47242_16741.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204012_(540_x_720_pixel)_32088_56631.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204129_(540_x_720_pixel)_65692_63524.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204138_(540_x_720_pixel)_73181_86018.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3070,'TIRTIR - Mask Fit Red Cushion #24W Soft Beige',NULL,148.000,'The TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is a high-performance Korean beauty product designed to provide long-lasting coverage and a natural, semi-matte finish. It features a formula that offers up to 72 hours of flawless coverage, effectively concealing blemishes, redness, and dark spots. Enriched with hydrating ingredients like Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract and Propolis Extract, it nourishes and moisturizes the skin while providing SPF40 PA++ protection against UV rays. Its buildable coverage ensures a lightweight feel on the skin, making it suitable for all-day wear and ideal for sensitive skin types.','After your skincare routine, apply the appropriate amount of foundation to the sponge/puff and gently pat all over your face.\r\nBuild up with several thin layers instead of one thick layer for a more even and natural tone.\r\nClose the packaging after use to prevent the product from drying out.','produits/IMG_20240716_084213_(540_x_720_pixel)_76693.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240716_084213_(540_x_720_pixel)_76693.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_084246_(540_x_720_pixel)_24076.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_084326_(540_x_720_pixel)_93271.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_084343_(540_x_720_pixel)_83338.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3071,'TIRTIR - Mask Fit Red Cushion #29N Natural Beige',NULL,157.000,'The TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is a high-performance Korean beauty product designed to provide long-lasting coverage and a natural, semi-matte finish. It features a formula that offers up to 72 hours of flawless coverage, effectively concealing blemishes, redness, and dark spots. Enriched with hydrating ingredients like Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract and Propolis Extract, it nourishes and moisturizes the skin while providing SPF40 PA++ protection against UV rays. Its buildable coverage ensures a lightweight feel on the skin, making it suitable for all-day wear and ideal for sensitive skin types.','After your skincare routine, apply the appropriate amount of foundation to the sponge/puff and gently pat all over your face.\r\nBuild up with several thin layers instead of one thick layer for a more even and natural tone.\r\nClose the packaging after use to prevent the product from drying out.','produits/IMG_20240716_085558_(540_x_720_pixel)_68287.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240716_085558_(540_x_720_pixel)_68287.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_085609_(540_x_720_pixel)_85191.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_085702_(540_x_720_pixel)_26811.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_085746_(540_x_720_pixel)_61570.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_085911_(540_x_720_pixel)_10358.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_085819_(540_x_720_pixel)_40651.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240716_090003_(540_x_720_pixel)_84890.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3072,'mixsoon - Galactomyces Ferment Essence',NULL,135.000,'* Galactomyces Ferment Essence is formulated with 100% Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate. This lightweight essence is designed to combat skin discoloration, pigmentation, and ac