'mixsoon - Soondy Centella Asiatica Essence',NULL,135.000,'Soondy Centella Asiatica Essence is a concentrated soothing essence that contains only centella asiatica to quickly and effectively calm irritated and troubled skin. Containing zero unnecessary ingredients and only 100% Centella Asiatica extract known for its anti-inflammatory and high antioxidant properties that fortifies skin and effectively calm inflamed skin, redness and acne.\r\n\r\nFeaturing \'Soondy\' on the bottle, a polar bear cartoon, purchases of this product contribute towards a Korean environmental group, that combats global warming.','After cleansing and toning, apply a few drops to the entire face with your hands or using a cotton pad. Pat in until fully absorbed.','produits/IMG_20240717_101455_(540_x_720_pixel)_92579.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240717_101455_(540_x_720_pixel)_92579.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240717_101505_(540_x_720_pixel)_21320.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240717_101511_(540_x_720_pixel)_38709.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240717_101616_(540_x_720_pixel)_35125.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3075,'Madagascar Centella Glow 1004 Duo Set',NULL,208.000,'This Madagascar Centella Glow 1004 Duo Set contains:\r\n* Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Water-Fit Sun Serum 50ml <br>\r\n* Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule 50ml <br>\r\n<br>\r\nMadagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Water-Fit Sun Serum: <br>\r\nFitted with SPF 50+ PA++++, this serum-like sunscreen containing Hyaluronic Acid and Centella Asiatica Extract soothes and hydrates skin while providing sun protection. <br>\r\nAdditional ingredients like Seven Sprout Extracts (such as Arugula Leaf, Green Tea and Broccoli Extracts) provide antioxidant benefits and improve skin health. <br>\r\nFast-absorbing formula will not leave a sticky after feel. <br>\r\nHypoallergenic and reef safe formula is suitable for sensitive skin <br>\r\n<br>\r\nMadagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule: <br>\r\nThe intensive ampoule fills the skin with moisture to keep it hydrated without harming the skin and provides a smooth and silky finish without any greasiness. <br>\r\nContains Centella Asiatica Extract, an ingredient that effectively soothes the skin, and vegan ProBio-Cica (Centella fermented with TECA), providing care for weak and sensitive skin barrier. <br>\r\nRepairs damaged skin barrier to prevent the evaporation of moisture and provides care for dry and sensitive skin. <br>\r\nImproves the skin smoothness on the forehead, chin, nose, and cheeks as well as the skin around the eyebrows, eyes, and mouth as validated by professional skin clinicians. <br>\r\nDoes not contain any artificial fragrances or colors and is safe to use on all skin types including sensitive skin.','Apply a proper amount onto face and pat for absorption.','produits/IMG_20240717_194346_(540_x_720_pixel)_48034.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240717_194346_(540_x_720_pixel)_48034.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240717_194446_(540_x_720_pixel)_86397.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240717_194618_(540_x_720_pixel)_13261.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240717_194646_(540_x_720_pixel)_63195.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3076,'Tone Up No Sebum Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,125.000,'1. No-Sebum sunscreen with a matte finish\r\nProvides no-sebum solution to control excessive sebum for a soft and matte skin.\r\n\r\n2. Tone-up Effect\r\nIt soothes, hydrates and brightens your complexion with centella and green tea extract.\r\n\r\n3. UV ray-reflecting Physical Sunscreen\r\nProtects and deflects damaging UV rays away from your skin.\r\n\r\nTip! It can be used as a makeup base alternative.','At the final step of your day skincare routine, apply evenly on your face and neck.','produits/IMG_20240717_205655_(540_x_720_pixel)_23091.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240717_205655_(540_x_720_pixel)_23091.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240