8210.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232524_(540_x_720_pixel)_28767.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232536_(540_x_720_pixel)_36382.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232548_(540_x_720_pixel)_48279.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232554_(540_x_720_pixel)_64439.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232600_(540_x_720_pixel)_66011.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3111,'Shiseido - Fino Premium Touch Hair Mask',NULL,150.000,'A hair mask designed to repair dry and damaged hair due to coloring, perming, sun and environmental factors, Shiseido\'s Fino Premium Touch Hair Mask is formulated with royal jelly EX, PCA (para-chloroamphetamine) and Lipidure EX to moisturize, strengthen, nourish and transform hair into a healthier state from roots to tips. Seven essences help boost moisture penetration and control, plus add gloss, body and lasting color. Apply on shampooed, towel-dried hair and leave on for several minutes. Rinse thoroughly.','After shampoo, lightly drain off.\r\nRinse well after letting the appropriate amount (about 2 teaspoons for semi-long) around the damaged part of the hair.\r\nEven if it is immediately rinsed, it has enough effect.\r\nIt demonstrates high effect, recommend using 1 or 2 times a week.\r\nRemarks: Manufacturing date is marked on product.','produits/IMG_20240721_233522_(540_x_720_pixel)_39556.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240721_233522_(540_x_720_pixel)_39556.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_233547_(540_x_720_pixel)_46508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_233620_(540_x_720_pixel)_23661.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_233657_(540_x_720_pixel)_60358.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3112,'Shiseido Fino Premium Touch Hair Oil',NULL,130.000,'Shiseido Fino Premium Touch Hair Oil is a hair treatment oil that intensively repairs damaged hair. If you\'ve tried the famous Shiseido Fino Premium Touch Hair mask, then this hair oil is a great follow up treatment to keep your hair feeling even healthier and shiner.\r\n\r\nIf your hair is dry or prone to damage from harsh weather conditions, UV rays, or treatments such as coloring, highlights, or perms, the Fino Premium Touch Hair Oil by Shiseido can help to repair your hair and smoothen its texture.\r\n\r\nThe Fino hair oil intensively repairs even the slightest damage, helping your hair to become more healthy and feel smooth.\r\n\r\nThe hair oil itself has a light finish that is not too sticky, and will not leave your hair feeling greasy in the slightest. It also has a refreshing floral scent.','Apply to semi-dry or dry hair.\r\n\r\nStart with a small amount, and apply the hair oil to the ends of your semi-dry or dry hair. For long hair, it is recommended to use one full pump of product.\r\n\r\nYou can use Fino hair oil at anytime during the morning, day, or night.','produits/IMG_20240721_234200_(540_x_720_pixel)_10309.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240721_234200_(540_x_720_pixel)_10309.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_234231_(540_x_720_pixel)_84386.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_234300_(540_x_720_pixel)_75285.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_234331_(540_x_720_pixel)_63340.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3113,'KAINE - Green Fit Pro Sun',NULL,117.000,'This vegan sunscreen uses chemical and mineral filters to provide SPF 50+ PA++++ sun protection. The formula is infused with panthenol, hyaluronic acid and bambusa vulgaris water to hydrate and soothe irritated skin. Enriched with thymus vulgaris extract and chlorella vulgaris extract, sunscreen in a lotion texture provides a slight cooling effect.','Evenly spread a proper amount over areas frequently exposed to sun.','produits/IMG_20240721_235013_(540_x_720_pixel)_77310.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240721_235013_(540_x_720_pixel)_77310.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_235007_(540_x_720_pixel)_89841.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_235046_(540_x_720_pixel)_95530.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_235157_(540_x_720_pixel)_75621.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3114,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #11 Tomato',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color','produits/IMG_20240722_000156_(540_x_720_pixel)_95494.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_000156_(540_x_720_pixel)_95494.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_000228_(540_x_720_pixel)_96385.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_000248_(540_x_720_pixel)_67679.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_000329_(540_x_720_pixel)_32634.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3115,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #09 Peanut',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color','produits/IMG_20240722_001120_(540_x_720_pixel)_41408.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_001120_(540_x_720_pixel)_41408.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_001155_(540_x_720_pixel)_95741.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_001222_(540_x_720_pixel)_66040.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_001250_(540_x_720_pixel)_98715.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3116,'Peripera Peripera Ink Airy Velvet Lip Stain #14 Rosy Pink',NULL,54.000,'Make a lasting impression with the Peripera Ink Airy Velvet Lip Stain. This lightweight lip stain glides on smoothly. Its long-lasting formula leaves a soft and velvety finish that lasts for hours. Also, Peripera lip stain has an airy formula for a weightless feel on the lips. Also, it is a transfer-proof lip stain that gives a confiden