nd moving outwards for even coverage.','produits/IMG_20240722_005423_(540_x_720_pixel)_66269.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_005423_(540_x_720_pixel)_66269.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_005437_(540_x_720_pixel)_24434.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_005518_(540_x_720_pixel)_97418.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_005603_(540_x_720_pixel)_94709.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3119,'Peripera Ink Airy Velvet Lip Stain #26 Apricot Peach',NULL,68.000,'Make a lasting impression with the Peripera Ink Airy Velvet Lip Stain. This lightweight lip stain glides on smoothly. Its long-lasting formula leaves a soft and velvety finish that lasts for hours. Also, Peripera lip stain has an airy formula for a weightless feel on the lips. Also, it is a transfer-proof lip stain that gives a confident smile all day long.','Apply Peripera Ink Airy Velvet Lip Stain to lips, starting from center and moving outwards for even coverage.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3120,'PINKFLASH Multi Face Palette #02 Strawberry Ice',NULL,60.000,'Discover endless possibilities with our multi-purpose face palette. Designed for effortless beauty, this compact contains everything you need to create stunning eye looks, sculpt your cheekbones, and add a radiant glow. The velvety-soft, lightweight powder glides on seamlessly, leaving a flawless finish without irritating your skin. Infused with rich pigments, each shade delivers bold color in a single stroke.\r\nWith ten versatile colors to choose from, you can mix and match to achieve any look you desire. From subtle daytime makeup to dramatic evening glam, the possibilities are endless. Embrace the convenience and creativity of this zero-waste formula and enjoy a different makeup masterpiece every day.','Apply on face','produits/IMG_20240722_012034_(540_x_720_pixel)_40951.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_012034_(540_x_720_pixel)_40951.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_012201_(540_x_720_pixel)_97803.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_012251_(540_x_720_pixel)_16186.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_012329_(540_x_720_pixel)_45909.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3121,'PINKFLASH Multi Face Palette #03 Caramel Toffee',NULL,60.000,'Discover endless possibilities with our multi-purpose face palette. Designed for effortless beauty, this compact contains everything you need to create stunning eye looks, sculpt your cheekbones, and add a radiant glow. The velvety-soft, lightweight powder glides on seamlessly, leaving a flawless finish without irritating your skin. Infused with rich pigments, each shade delivers bold color in a single stroke.\r\nWith ten versatile colors to choose from, you can mix and match to achieve any look you desire. From subtle daytime makeup to dramatic evening glam, the possibilities are endless. Embrace the convenience and creativity of this zero-waste formula and enjoy a different makeup masterpiece every day.','Apply on face','produits/IMG_20240722_013055_(540_x_720_pixel)_54456.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_013055_(540_x_720_pixel)_54456.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_013112_(540_x_720_pixel)_98309.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_013236_(540_x_720_pixel)_80585.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_012201_(540_x_720_pixel)_69983.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3122,'PINKFLASH - Pro Touch Eyeshadow Palette- #03 Strawberry Donuts',NULL,60.000,'Indulge your sweet tooth with the Pinkflash Pro Touch Eyeshadow Palette in Strawberry Donuts. This palette features a delicious mix of warm pinks, soft browns, and shimmering accents, perfect for creating endless eye looks. The highly pigmented, blendable formula ensures smooth application and long-lasting wear. Whether you prefer a soft, romantic look or a bold, glamorous statement, this cruelty-free palette has everything you need.','Apply on eyes','produits/IMG_20240722_014410_(540_x_720_pixel)_44306.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_014410_(540_x_720_pixel)_44306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_014444_(540_x_720_pixel)_73722.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_014541_(540_x_720_pixel)_36771.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_014517_(540_x_720_pixel)_33769.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3123,'Over Glowy Tint #02 Peach Forest OF HEALING',NULL,54.000,'Experience the ultimate lip look with the Over Glowy Tint. This innovative formula combines the best of a lip gloss and a lip tint, providing a long-lasting, high-shine finish. The lightweight, non-sticky texture feels comfortable on the lips, while the vibrant colors add a touch of glamour to any look.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth out-wards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000001172_67388.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001172_67388.jpg\", \"produits/1000001173_27663.jpg\", \"produits/1000001174_81494.jpg\", \"produits/1000001175_71806.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3124,'Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser',NULL,93.000,'Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser is a specially formulated gel cleanser enriched with snail mucin to hydrate and protect the skin. Supercharged with 10,000ppm of snail secretion filtrate to deliver a powerful regenerative and hydrating effect, this ultra-gentle cleanser effectively removes impurities without stripping the skin, protecting its barrier while moisturising, restoring and healing for a smooth complexion.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the stretchy, elastic texture of snail mucin as it effectively works its way into hard-to-reach areas of your face, lifting away all impurities for an impeccable cleanse while creating the smoothest lather possible to minimise stimulation. A definite must-have for snail mucin lovers!\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, perfect for those with sensitive skin prone to irritation or redness.','Wet your face and lather a pea sized amount of cleanser between your palms. Massage the foam into your skin from forehead to jaw. Rinse thoroughly with warm water.','produits/IMG_20240722_020610_(540_x_720_pixel)_78997.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_020610_(540_x_720_pixel)_78997.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_020637_(540_x_720_pixel)_27374.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_020706_(540_x_720_pixel)_88566.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_020719_(540_x_720_pixel)_79620.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3125,'Advanced Snail Hydrogel Eye Patch',NULL,130.000,'Advanced Snail Hydrogel Eye Patch is a depuffing and tone up patch infused with the brand best selling snail essence to visibly hydrate, plump and brighten the delicate eye area. Immersed in COSRX all time best selling Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence and skin brightening ingredient niacinamide, leaving your skin plumper and brighter with every application.\r\n\r\nThis hydrogel patch is made with a honeycomb pattern sheet to perfectly hug your skin, infusing it with a rich essence that penetrates deeply without moving or falling off. Whether it is to brighten up fragile skin around dull, tired looking eyes, diminish fine lines around the lips or neglected foreheads, this patch works anywhere!\r\n\r\nHighly recommended for those who have been looking for a high concentration snail essence for intensive care. Suitable for all skin types.','Simply place the Snail Hydrogel Eye Patch on any areas of concern and leave it on for 5-20 minutes a day. Whether it\'s while drying your hair, or just before doing your makeup, you can work this product into your everyday routine easily. \r\n\r\nTIP: Leave in the refrigerator before applying it around your eyes, mouth, and forehead to combat morning puffiness and dryness in one easy step!','produits/IMG_20240723_005757_(540_x_720_pixel)_40830.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240723_005757_(540_x_720_pixel)_40830.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240723_005624_(540_x_720_pixel)_38147.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240723_005653_(540_x_720_pixel)_88366.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240723_005721_(540_x_720_pixel)_70638.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3126,'Mary and May Tranexamic Acid + Glutathione Eye Cream',NULL,135.000,'Mary and May Tranexamic Acid + Glutathione Eye Cream is an intensive care cream for dark circles, blemishes and dark spots. Enriched with 1,000ppm Tranexamic Acid and Glutathione to improve the look of under-eye dark circles and freckles for a more refined, brighter-looking eye area. This functional eye cream supresses the formation of melanin, which leads to dark circles and blemishes, and removes free radicals to intensively brighten dull skin tone around the eyes, and care for areas where blemishes are troubles. Experience brighter, spot-free skin in just 2 weeks!\r\n\r\nFormulated with EWG verified green grade ingredients only.','Take an appropriate amount of this product and apply evenly to the skin around the eyes and areas where blemishes or dark spots are a concern.','produits/IMG_20240726_145041_(540_x_720_pixel)_58049.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240726_145041_(540_x_720_pixel)_58049.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240726_145107_(540_x_720_pixel)_86752.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240726_145157_(540_x_720_pixel)_72945.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_162854_(540_x_720_pixel)_96705.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3127,'Torriden DIVE-IN Watery Moisture Sun',NULL,111.000,'Torriden DIVE-IN Watery Moisture Sun Cream is an organic sun cream to protect skin while leaving a hydrating finish. Infused with Hyaluronic Acid, Jojoba Seed Oil and Aloe Barbadensis Flower Extract, this sun cream not only protects your skin, but also soothes and moisturises it. The combination of Panthenol and Allantoin further enhances the moisturising effects, leaving your skin feeling soft and supple. The lightweight texture gently adheres to skin without leaving a sticky after-feel.','In the final step of your skin care routine, apply an appropriate amount evenly to your face.','produits/IMG_20240727_192701_(540_x_720_pixel)_95401.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_192701_(540_x_720_pixel)_95401.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_193032_(540_x_720_pixel)_94075.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_192952_(540_x_720_pixel)_68873.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_193230_(540_x_720_pixel)_61913.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3128,'Mary and May Vegan Peptide Bakuchiol Sun Stick',NULL,109.000,'Mary and May Vegan Peptide Bakuchiol Sun Stick is a convenient stick-type sunscreen packed with powerful anti-ageing benefits for the skin. Bakuchiol, a plant-based alternative to retinol, fights inflammation, Peptides promote collagen synthesis, while Tocopherol softens fine lines. Boasting a soft, silky texture and infused with sebum-absorbing powder, this sun stick keeps skin cool and dry through multiple touch-ups.','Apply on face and neck at the last stage of your skincare routine. Reapply whenever needed.','produits/IMG_20240727_194010_(540_x_720_pixel)_85238.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_194010_(540_x_720_pixel)_85238.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_194052_(540_x_720_pixel)_61390.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_194123_(540_x_720_pixel)_90583.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_194245_(540_x_720_pixel)_89681.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3129,'medicube - Collagen Lifting Mask',NULL,20.000,'This anti-aging sheet mask is formulated with Triple Collagen Complex containing hydrolyzed collagen, soluble collagen and atelo collagen to replenish dehydrated skin with moisture and restore skin’s elasticity. Allantoin in the formula plumps up skin for a radiant and youthful-looking finish. Suitable for sensitive skin.','1. After cleansing, place the mask sheet on face.\r\n2. Leave it on for at least 10 minutes and remove it.\r\n4. Gently pat the remaining essence on face to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240727_214225_(540_x_720_pixel)_55779.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_214225_(540_x_720_pixel)_55779.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_214250_(540_x_720_pixel)_94853.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_214257_(540_x_720_pixel)_26843.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_214325_(540_x_720_pixel)_59168.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3130,'Rosemary Mint Hair Strengthening Edge Gel',NULL,38.000,'Your edges can be delicate. Shape and smooth them how you like while infusing them with strength and important nutrients with Mielle Organics’ Rosemary Mint Strengthening Edge Gel! With biotin and natural ingredients such as coconut and babassu seed oil, this edge gel offers you the hold you need along with the nourishment your hair has been craving. You’ll love how it feels – and the great rosemary mint scent – and your hair will love you back for using an edge gel with healthy hold in mind.\r\n\r\nKey Benefits:\r\n\r\nProvides intense shine and hydration\r\nSupports healthy edges \r\nInfused with biotin','Apply gel to edges and smooth with fingertips or brush for desired hold.','produits/IMG_20240727_221612_(540_x_720_pixel)_63670.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_221612_(540_x_720_pixel)_63670.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_221728_(540_x_720_pixel)_36563.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_221901_(540_x_720_pixel)_33634.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_221927_(540_x_720_pixel)_38373.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3131,'Bija Trouble Cleansing Foam',NULL,107.000,'Innisfree\'s Bija Trouble Cleansing Foam is a targeted skincare solution designed to combat acne-prone and oily skin. Its star ingredient, bija seed oil, renowned for its anti-inflammatory properties, works in harmony with salicylic acid to unclog pores and exfoliate dead skin cells. This dynamic duo effectively reduces excess sebum, preventing future breakouts while soothing irritated skin. The addition of rose crysta provides a cooling sensation, enhancing the overall calming effect. This gentle yet powerful cleanser creates a rich lather that thoroughly removes impurities without stripping the skin, leaving it refreshed, purified, and balanced.','Squeeze a pea-sized amount from the tube and lather with water, gently massaging on the face in circular motions, before rinsing off thoroughly.','produits/IMG_20240727_223836_(540_x_720_pixel)_10612.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_223836_(540_x_720_pixel)_10612.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_223931_(540_x_720_pixel)_89935.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_224000_(540_x_720_pixel)_47321.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_224032_(540_x_720_pixel)_32509.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3132,'Intensive Long-lasting Sunscreen EX SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,125.000,'Innisfree\'s Intensive Long-Lasting Sunscreen EX offers broad-spectrum protection with an impressive SPF 50+ PA++++ rating. Designed for combination to oily skin, this lightweight, water-resistant formula provides long-lasting defense against harmful UVA and UVB rays. Enriched with soothing ingredients like witch hazel, sunflower seed oil, and green tea extract, it hydrates and protects without leaving a greasy residue. Perfect for outdoor activities, this vegan and reef-friendly sunscreen ensures your skin stays shielded and comfortable all day long.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 ml','Use at the last step of your skincare routine before makeup. Take a dime sized amount and spread evenly onto face, gently patting for absorption.','produits/IMG_20240727_231440_(540_x_720_pixel)_67651.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_231440_(540_x_720_pixel)_67651.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_231517_(540_x_720_pixel)_80279.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_231539_(540_x_720_pixel)_98508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_231707_(540_x_720_pixel)_16124.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3133,'Heartleaf 70 Intense Calming Cream',NULL,130.000,'Restore your skin\'s barrier with potent ingredients like Ceramides and Panthenol. Infused with 70% Heartleaf Extract, known for its soothing and calming effects, this daily facial moisturizer is suitable for all skin types, especially sensitive and dry skin. Its lightweight texture ensures immediate hydration and rapid absorption.','Apply a moderate amount evenly over the face and pat lightly for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20240727_234119_(540_x_720_pixel)_23099.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_234119_(540_x_720_pixel)_23099.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_234127_(540_x_720_pixel)_76021.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_234136_(540_x_720_pixel)_74279.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_234251_(540_x_720_pixel)_17733.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3134,'Michael Kors Reed Large Tote Bag',NULL,1350.000,'Elevate your everyday style with the Michael Kors Reed Large Tote Bag. This spacious and sophisticated tote is crafted from a luxurious blend of leather and features a chic, neutral color palette with a contrasting snake-embossed trim. The iconic MK logo hardware adds a touch of luxury, while the belted detail offers a stylish accent. With multiple compartments and pockets, this bag is both functional and fashionable.\r\nProduct Features:\r\n * Crafted from a blend of leather\r\n * Spacious interior with multiple compartments and pockets\r\n * Chic, neutral color palette with a contrasting snake-embossed trim\r\n * Iconic MK logo hardware\r\n * Removable shoulder strap for versatile carrying options\r\n * Belted detail for a stylish accent\r\nDimensions:\r\n * Width: 16.5 inches\r\n * Height: 12 inches\r\n * Depth: 5.5 inches\r\nCare Instructions:\r\n * Wipe clean with a damp cloth\r\n * Spot clean only\r\n * Do not machine wash or dry clean\r\nAdditional Notes:\r\n * The Reed Large Tote Bag is available in a variety of colors and materials.\r\n * This bag is perfect for carrying your essentials to work, school, or a night out.\r\n * The removable shoulder strap allows you to carry the bag as a tote or a crossbody.','Care Instructions:\r\n * Wipe clean with a damp cloth\r\n * Spot clean only\r\n * Do not machine wash or dry clean',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3135,'Karseell Professional Keratin Treatment',NULL,298.000,'Experience the transformative power of Karseell Professional Keratin Treatment, a luxurious blend of keratin, collagen, and biotin that will leave your hair smoother, straighter, and healthier than ever before.\r\nBenefits:\r\n * Deeply repairs damaged hair: Infused with keratin, the building block of hair, this treatment penetrates deep into the hair shaft to mend split ends and restore strength.\r\n * Reduces frizz and flyaways: Say goodbye to unruly hair! Collagen and biotin work together to smooth the hair cuticle, leaving it incredibly soft and manageable.\r\n * Provides long-lasting results: Enjoy up to 3 months of salon-quality straightness and shine with this powerful formula.\r\n * Adds incredible shine: Your hair will radiate with a healthy, lustrous glow after just one use.','* Shampoo hair twice with a clarifying shampoo to remove any product buildup.\r\n * Towel-dry hair to about 80% dryness.\r\n * Apply the Karseell Professional Keratin Treatment evenly from roots to ends.\r\n * Blow-dry hair completely.\r\n * Flat iron hair in thin sections using a high heat setting (400-450&deg;F).\r\n * Wait 48 hours before washing or styling your hair.','produits/IMG_20240730_192346_(540_x_720_pixel)_16498.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_192346_(540_x_720_pixel)_16498.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_192420_(540_x_720_pixel)_82622.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_200646_(540_x_720_pixel)_95517.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_200723_(540_x_720_pixel)_50117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_200615_(540_x_720_pixel)_71081.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3136,'Karseell BNC Collagen Treatment with Argan',NULL,195.000,'Restore your hair\'s vitality with Karseell BNC Collagen Treatment. This luxurious formula is enriched with collagen and argan oil to deeply nourish and repair even the most damaged hair. <br>\r\nExperience the transformative power as it revives your hair, leaving it irresistibly soft, smooth, and radiant. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n ‎‧₊˚✧Intense hydration✧˚₊ <br>\r\nQuenches thirsty hair, restoring its natural moisture balance. <br>\r\n₊˚✧Damage Repair✧˚₊\r\n<br>\r\nMends split ends, reduces breakage, and strengthens hair fibers. <br>\r\n ₊˚✧Vibrant Shine✧˚₊ <br>\r\nUnveils a healthy, lustrous glow, enhancing your hair\'s natural beauty. <br>\r\n₊˚✧ Suppleness and Smoothness‎✧˚₊ <br>\r\nTames frizz and flyaways, leaving hair effortlessly manageable.','Apply a generous amount to damp hair, focusing on the ends. Leave in for a few minutes, then rinse thoroughly. For optimal results, use regularly.','produits/IMG_20240730_201658_(540_x_720_pixel)_68384.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_201658_(540_x_720_pixel)_68384.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_201732_(540_x_720_pixel)_70639.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_201751_(540_x_720_pixel)_66495.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_201828_(540_x_720_pixel)_95230.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3137,'NUMBUZIN - No.5 Vitamin Concentrated Serum',NULL,130.000,'NUMBUZIN No.5 Vitamin Concentrated Serum is an intensive brightening ampoule that reduces the appearance of hyperpigmentation or dark spots. A collection of powerful brightening ingredients, including Glutathione, Alpha Lipoic Acid, Vitamin C, Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, Alpha-Arbutin and Bisabolol help fade away dark spots and leave the skin clear and bright, while Panthenol soothes and keeps skin hydrated.','After cleansing and toning, take 3-5 drops of the serum and gently spread it over your entire face.','produits/IMG_20240730_220607_(540_x_720_pixel)_88892.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_220607_(540_x_720_pixel)_88892.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_221100_(540_x_720_pixel)_63477.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_221151_(540_x_720_pixel)_66936.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_221229_(540_x_720_pixel)_27933.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3138,'lilybyred - Luv Beam Cheek Balm Smash It!',NULL,45.000,'Part of lilybyred’s new tennis-inspired Smash It! Collection, this special edition of the brand’s Luv Beam Cheek Balm gives the brand’s iconic cream blush a spring-ready makeover. Reworking the signature balm-like formula in a dusty rose shade, the cheek product can be blended out for a natural-looking flush or built up for bolder effects.','Take a moderate amount of blush with your fingertip or makeup puff, and gently apply and blend onto cheeks.','produits/IMG_20240730_223350_(540_x_720_pixel)_33080.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_223350_(540_x_720_pixel)_33080.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_223416_(540_x_720_pixel)_86743.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_223443_(540_x_720_pixel)_94721.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_223510_(540_x_720_pixel)_45287.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3139,'AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Travel Kit',NULL,106.000,'Take the guesswork out of treating your acne with this 30-Days Miracle Travel Kit! This power-packed trio includes Some By Mi’s best-selling toner, serum, and cream that utilizes the exfoliating powers of chemical exfoliants and calming effects of tea tree and Centella to soothe inflammation and redness while keeping your skin smooth and radiant! Whether you’re a newcomer to skincare or need a routine that does the work, this is something to try!','Cl no in','produits/IMG_20240730_223941_(540_x_720_pixel)_65547.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_223941_(540_x_720_pixel)_65547.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_224049_(540_x_720_pixel)_67181.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_224126_(540_x_720_pixel)_45036.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_224158_(540_x_720_pixel)_83660.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3140,'TOCOBO - Cica Cooling Sun Stick SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,109.000,'Containing Low-Molecular-Weight Fermented Cica Complex, 10-Layer Hyaluronic Acid, and Cornmint Powder: This non-sticky, moisturizing multi-balm type cooling soothing sun stick helps soothe and moisturize the skin.\r\n\r\n Key Benefits:\r\n\r\nRapid Skin Soothing and Moisture Replenishment: Low-molecular Fermented Cica, Multi-Hyaluronic Acid, and Aloe Extract rapidly soothe the skin and replenish moisture.\r\n3 Seconds Heat Soothing: Quickly reduces skin temperature and soothes irritated skin with a cooling sensation.\r\nNon-Comedogenic Multi-Skincare Sunscreen: Soothes moisture, manages sebum, and oil simultaneously.\r\nHypoallergenic Formulation: Safe for use on sensitive and acne-prone skin that is difficult to choose sun care.\r\nSay NO to the Prejudice That Sun Sticks Are Matte!: Moisturizing and refreshing multi-balm type sun stick.','At the last stage of skin care, apply lightly on area exposed to sun. Carry it around and apply frequently that need sun protection.','produits/IMG_20240731_090129_(540_x_720_pixel)_36306.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240731_090129_(540_x_720_pixel)_36306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090207_(540_x_720_pixel)_14368.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090327_(540_x_720_pixel)_68080.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090239_(540_x_720_pixel)_88200.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3141,'Ksecret Seoul 1988 Cleansing Oil',NULL,99.000,'Discover the magic of Ksecret Seoul 1988 Cleansing Oil! Melt away a day worth of makeup, sunscreen, and impurities with this luxurious oil cleanser. Infused with soothing Pine Cica and skin-balancing Probiotics, it transforms your skincare routine into a pampering ritual. Experience a deep, pore-purifying cleanse that leaves your skin soft, refreshed, and ready to glow. Say goodbye to clogged pores and hello to a clearer, more radiant complexion. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nIndulge your skin with Ksecret Seoul 1988 Cleansing Oil - your passport to flawless skin starts here! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: All skin types, specially recommended for Sensitive & Acne-prone skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 200 ml','Apply an appropriate amount on dry skin and gently massage.\r\nAdd water and massage skin to emulsify.\r\nRinse with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240818_183318_(540_x_720_pixel)_71460.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240818_183318_(540_x_720_pixel)_71460.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_183634_(540_x_720_pixel)_31002.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_191912_(540_x_720_pixel)_48406.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_192159_(540_x_720_pixel)_23884.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3142,'Seoul 1988 Cleansing Foam',NULL,109.000,'Ksecret Seoul 1988 Cleansing Foam is a purifying formula enriched with pine cica complex and probiotics to gently yet effectively cleanse the skin. Pine cica complex soothes irritation and promotes skin repair, while probiotics balance the skin microbiome. This cleansing foam also includes salicylic acid to unclog pores and prevent breakouts, leaving skin refreshed, purified, and ready for subsequent skincare steps. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: all skin types including sensitive skin\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 150 ml <br>','* Lather: Gently massage the foam into wet skin using circular motions to create a rich lather.\r\n * Cleanse: Focus on areas with makeup or impurities.\r\n * Rinse: Thoroughly rinse your face with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240818_223701_(540_x_720_pixel)_37948.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240818_223701_(540_x_720_pixel)_37948.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_223932_(540_x_720_pixel)_19147.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_223942_(540_x_720_pixel)_28978.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_224153_(540_x_720_pixel)_28876.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_224226_(540_x_720_pixel)_46613.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3143,'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Set: A Revitalizing Trio',NULL,342.000,'Revitalize your skin with the Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Set. Harnessing ginseng\'s power, this trio hydrates, firms, and brightens for a youthful glow. &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\n1. Ginseng Essence:\r\n * Hydration and nourishment: This essence is packed with ginseng extract to deeply hydrate and nourish the skin.\r\n * Improved skin texture: Regular use can help refine pores and enhance skin\'s overall texture.\r\n * Brightening effect: Ginseng is known for its brightening properties, helping to give your skin a radiant glow.\r\n2. Ginseng Eye Cream:\r\n * Targets under-eye concerns: This delicate formula addresses puffiness, dark circles, and fine lines around the eye area.\r\n * Antioxidant protection: Ginseng\'s antioxidants help shield the sensitive eye area from environmental damage.\r\n * Hydration boost: Provides essential moisture to keep the under-eye area hydrated and plump.\r\n3. Ginseng Serum:\r\n * Concentrated ginseng goodness: This serum delivers a potent dose of ginseng extract for maximum benefits.\r\n * Anti-aging effects: Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n * Skin firming: Improves skin elasticity and firmness for a more youthful complexion.','Typically, you would apply the products in the following order:\r\n * Ginseng Essence: After cleansing and toning, gently pat the essence into your skin.\r\n * Ginseng Eye Cream: Gently dab the eye cream around the orbital bone.\r\n * Ginseng Serum: Apply a few drops to your face and neck, massaging gently until absorbed.','produits/IMG_20240819_000148_(540_x_720_pixel)_57283.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_000148_(540_x_720_pixel)_57283.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_000127_(540_x_720_pixel)_75686.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_000213_(540_x_720_pixel)_31416.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3144,'Anua Rice 7 Ceramide Hydrating Barrier Serum',NULL,150.000,'Discover the secret to a luminous, hydrated complexion. Anua\'s Rice and Ceramide Serum is a transformative elixir that replenishes your skin\'s natural moisture barrier while illuminating your complexion. Infused with the power of rice extract, renowned for its brightening and soothing properties, this serum gently exfoliates, revealing a smoother, more even skin tone.\r\nCeramides, the skin\'s essential building blocks, work harmoniously to lock in hydration, preventing moisture loss and restoring suppleness. Experience the difference as your skin becomes visibly plumped, reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.','Apply an appropriate amount on face and neck and gently pat to facilitate absorption.','produits/IMG_20240819_003846_(540_x_720_pixel)_63595.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_003846_(540_x_720_pixel)_63595.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_003923_(540_x_720_pixel)_52303.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_004342_(540_x_720_pixel)_28152.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_004416_(540_x_720_pixel)_25189.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_004425_(540_x_720_pixel)_34762.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3145,'Torriden\'s Dive-In Low Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Skin Booster',NULL,150.000,'Torriden\'s Dive-In Low Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Skin Booster is a hydrating powerhouse that deeply replenishes moisture into the skin. Formulated 