ncare product designed to illuminate and refine your complexion. This gentle powder transforms into a foaming cleanser or a purifying mask, effectively removing impurities while brightening and evening skin tone. Enriched with rice water, arbutin, and papain, it gently exfoliates, reduces dark spots, and hydrates the skin. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive, this powder helps achieve a radiant and smoother appearance.','* Cleansing Powder: Mix a small amount of powder with water to create a foam. Massage gently onto wet face, then rinse thoroughly.\r\n * Wash-Off Mask: Mix a larger amount of powder with water to create a paste. Apply to face, leave on for 5-10 minutes, then rinse off.','produits/IMG_20240819_171328_(540_x_720_pixel)_17830.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_171328_(540_x_720_pixel)_17830.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_171357_(540_x_720_pixel)_26085.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_172525_(540_x_720_pixel)_68717.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_171424_(540_x_720_pixel)_43050.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_172726_(540_x_720_pixel)_17043.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3148,'Anua Rice 70 Glow Milky Toner',NULL,159.000,'Anua Rice 70 Glow Milky Toner is a lightweight milky toner enriched with Rice Bran Water and Niacinamide to brighten uneven dull skin tone, while balancing sebum production, promoting a clear and radiant complexion. It is formulated with Ceramide AP and NP to soothe irritated skin, while preventing moisture loss and reinforcing skin barrier. This toner contains Sodium Hyaluronate and Betaine to further amplify soothing and moisturizing effects for sensitive skin, while reducing inflammation. This toner has a milky texture that delivers deep hydration to skin with a non-sticky and refreshing finish. It is fragrance-free and suitable for all skin types.','Dispense a moderate amount on a cotton pad or simply pat with your fingertips all over face.','produits/IMG_20240819_173044_(540_x_720_pixel)_67739.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_173044_(540_x_720_pixel)_67739.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_173121_(540_x_720_pixel)_95468.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_173155_(540_x_720_pixel)_25529.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_173205_(540_x_720_pixel)_33934.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3149,'Round Lab - Birch Juice Moisturizing Tone Up Sunscreen',NULL,117.000,'Round Lab\'s Birch Juice Moisturizing Tone Up Sunscreen is a must-have for those seeking a radiant, sun-protected complexion. Its lightweight, watery formula absorbs effortlessly, leaving a soft, natural glow. With SPF 50+ PA++++ and a hint of pink tint, it offers both broad-spectrum protection and a subtle brightening effect. Enriched with nourishing ingredients like birch juice, hyaluronic acid, and panthenol, this sunscreen not only shields your skin from harmful UV rays but also hydrates and soothes. Perfect for all skin types, it\'s the ideal choice for a healthy, glowing complexion.','Apply a moderate amount on skin at the last stage of basic skincare.','produits/IMG_20240826_210038_(540_x_720_pixel)_13090.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_210038_(540_x_720_pixel)_13090.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_205435_(540_x_720_pixel)_78346.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_210148_(540_x_720_pixel)_23054.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_210230_(540_x_720_pixel)_70617.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3150,'thank you farmer - sun project water sun cream',NULL,110.000,'Thank You Farmer\'s Sun Project Water Sun Cream is a refreshing and hydrating sunscreen that provides broad-spectrum protection against harmful UV rays. Its lightweight, water-based formula absorbs quickly, leaving no greasy residue, while the gentle ingredients soothe and nourish your skin. Enriched with soothing aloe vera and hyaluronic acid, this sun cream not only shields your skin from the sun but also helps to maintain its hydration and elasticity. Enjoy a dewy, radiant complexion and worry-free sun protection with Thank You Farmer\'s Sun Project Water Sun Cream.','Apply as last step in AM routine to dry skin. Smooth across face &amp;amp;amp; neck, allow to dry down onto skin before applying make-up or additional steps. Top up throughout the day as needed.','produits/IMG_20240826_213011_(540_x_720_pixel)_37207.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_213011_(540_x_720_pixel)_37207.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_213215_(540_x_720_pixel)_83792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_213609_(540_x_720_pixel)_80399.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_213652_(540_x_720_pixel)_83297.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3151,'VT Reedle Shot 700 Essence',NULL,250.000,'Experience the transformative power of microneedling, without the needles. VT Reedle Shot 700 Essence is a groundbreaking skincare innovation that delivers a potent blend of active ingredients deep into your skin, revealing a more youthful, radiant complexion. Its potent blend of hyaluronic acid and centella asiatica delivers intense hydration and soothing relief, while promoting a smoother, more radiant complexion.','* Cleanse: Start with a clean, dry face.\r\n * Apply: Dispense a few drops onto your fingertips.\r\n * Massage: Gently massage the essence into your skin, focusing on areas that need improvement.\r\n * Absorb: Allow the essence to fully absorb before applying any other skincare products.\r\nNote: For optimal results, use VT Reedle Shot 700 Essence consistently as part of your daily skincare routine.','produits/IMG_20240824_114558_(540_x_720_pixel)_35156.png',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240824_114558_(540_x_720_pixel)_35156.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240824_114622_(540_x_720_pixel)_31644.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240824_114636_(540_x_720_pixel)_82297.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240824_114944_(540_x_720_pixel)_39157.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240824_115034_(540_x_720_pixel)_19827.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3152,'Thank You Farmer Sun Project Silky Calming Sun Stick SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,105.000,'Thank You Farmer Sun Project Silky Calming Sun Stick SPF50+ PA++++ is a lightweight and portable sun protection stick that provides broad-spectrum protection against UVA and UVB rays. Its creamy texture glides smoothly onto the skin, leaving a non-greasy, matte finish. Formulated with natural ingredients, this sun stick offers high-level sun protection while soothing and hydrating the skin.','Turn the dial at the bottom of the container to raise the content to a suitable amount. Apply the product evenly to areas that require sun protection (face or body).','produits/IMG_20240826_221703_(540_x_720_pixel)_94125.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_221703_(540_x_720_pixel)_94125.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_221719_(540_x_720_pixel)_11073.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_221802_(540_x_720_pixel)_82789.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_221841_(540_x_720_pixel)_85549.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3153,'Sun Project Shimmer Sun Essence SPF30 PA++',NULL,125.000,'The Sun Project Shimmer Sun Essence is a multi-functional sunscreen that combines protection, radiance, and hydration. With its SPF30 PA++ formula, shimmering finish, and lightweight texture, it\'s ideal for those seeking a suncare product that not only protects but also enhances their natural beauty.','1. Used at the last step of skincare.\r\n2. Gently spread over the vulnerable areas to sun rays which are face, neck, arms, and legs.\r\n3. Reapply as needed when you spend a lot of time outdoors.','produits/IMG_20240826_222827_(540_x_720_pixel)_81013.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_222827_(540_x_720_pixel)_81013.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_222905_(540_x_720_pixel)_64182.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_222937_(540_x_720_pixel)_13778.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_223020_(540_x_720_pixel)_19027.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3154,'Thank You Farmer Sun Project Skin Relief Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,110.000,'A non-mineral sun cream with a fresh moisturizing texture that goes on easy, does not feel greasy and leaves no pilling or white cast effect. The non-comedogenic formula contains soothing ingredients like Eggplant Extract, Centella Asiatica and Japanese Goldthread and is suitable for all skin types including sensitive and acne prone skin. \r\n\r\nRated SPF 50+ PA+++, the Sun Project Skin Relief Sun Cream helps calm and hydrate your skin and soothes photosensitive skin as it delivers maximum protection against the damaging effects of UV exposure.','Apply as last step in AM routine to dry skin. Smooth across face &amp;amp;amp; neck, allow to dry down onto skin before applying make-up or additional steps. Top up throughout the day as needed.','produits/IMG_20240826_223423_(540_x_720_pixel)_64508.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_223423_(540_x_720_pixel)_64508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_223510_(540_x_720_pixel)_49328.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_223500_(540_x_720_pixel)_59471.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_223637_(540_x_720_pixel)_61040.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3155,'Beta Panthenol Repair Starter Kit',NULL,128.000,'Discover the transformative power of the SOME BY MI Beta Panthenol Repair Starter Kit. This hydrating set, enriched with the exclusive Beta-Panthenol™ complex, is designed to soothe and revitalize your skin. Experience the gentle cleansing of the Gel Cleanser, the nourishing Toner, the deeply moisturizing Serum, and the hydrating Repair Cream. Perfect for those seeking to repair damaged skin and restore a healthy, glowing complexion.','* Cleansing: Gently massage a small amount of the Beta Panthenol Repair Gel Cleanser onto damp skin. Rinse thoroughly with warm water.\r\n * Toning: Apply a few drops of the Beta Panthenol Repair Toner to your face using a cotton pad or your fingertips. Gently pat into the skin.\r\n * Seruming: Dispense a few drops of the Beta Panthenol Repair Serum onto your fingertips. Apply evenly to your face and neck.\r\n * Moisturizing: Finish by applying a generous amount of the Beta Panthenol Repair Cream to your face and neck. Massage gently until fully absorbed.\r\nNote: For optimal results, use the kit consistently as part of your daily skincare routine. Patch test on a small area of skin before full application to ensure you have no allergies or sensitivities.','produits/IMG_20240908_212412_(540_x_720_pixel)_77245.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_212412_(540_x_720_pixel)_77245.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_212529_(540_x_720_pixel)_43749.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_212606_(540_x_720_pixel)_26694.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_212656_(540_x_720_pixel)_23098.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:12','2025-02-07 02:59:12',0,NULL),(3156,'Centella Air Fit Light Sunscreen',NULL,89.000,'Experience the lightweight and refreshing sensation of the Skin1004 Air Fit Light Sunscreen. This non-greasy formula provides broad-spectrum SPF30/PA++++ protection against harmful UV rays, while soothing and brightening your skin. Enriched with Centella Asiatica extract, known for its healing and anti inflammatory properties, this sunscreen helps calm irritation and promote skin regeneration. Its lightweight texture absorbs quickly, leaving a matte finish that will not clog pores. Perfect for daily use and ideal for sensitive skin.','Spread enough cream to cover the face, neck and d&eacute;collet&eacute;, and massage until absorbed, about thirty minutes before exposure to the sun. Reapply the cream regularly throughout the day.','produits/IMG_20240908_215327_(540_x_720_pixel)_91719.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_215327_(540_x_720_pixel)_91719.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_215403_(540_x_720_pixel)_31411.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_215455_(540_x_720_pixel)_93900.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_215525_(540_x_720_pixel)_90270.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3157,'Madagascar Centella Ampoule Foam',NULL,110.000,'Madagascar Centella Ampoule Foam is a rich, foaming cleanser with the ideal pH level of 5 effectively remove makeup and impurities without stripping the skin. Packed with Centella Asiatica Extract to soothe and replenish skin hydration levels, while 4 naturally-sourced surfactants provide a deep cleanse and soft, easily-lathered foam.','Apply an appropriate amount onto wet palms and rub together to create foam. Gently massage the face and rinse with lukewarm water','produits/IMG_20240908_224738_(540_x_720_pixel)_24907.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_224738_(540_x_720_pixel)_24907.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_224844_(540_x_720_pixel)_81359.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_221926_(540_x_720_pixel)_74271.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_222007_(540_x_720_pixel)_54238.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3158,'Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule',NULL,102.000,'Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule is a nourishing all-in-one ampoule that replenishes, soothes, softens and rejuvenates the skin. Centella Asiatica extract effectively soothes the skin, while vegan ProBio-Cica (Centella fermented with TECA) provides care for weak and sensitive skin barriers. Panthenol, Betaine and Allantoin in the formula provide plumping touches for smooth and hydrated skin. This highly-concentrated ampoule seeps deep into the skin, leaving it supple all day long.','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20240908_232223_(540_x_720_pixel)_82733.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_232223_(540_x_720_pixel)_82733.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_232559_(540_x_720_pixel)_37394.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_232311_(540_x_720_pixel)_23001.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_232345_(540_x_720_pixel)_38542.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3159,'8 Hyaluronic Acid Hydrating Gentle Foaming Cleanser',NULL,115.000,'ANUA Hyaluronic Acid Cleansing Foam\r\nExperience the hydrating power of the ANUA Hyaluronic Acid Cleansing Foam. This gentle yet effective cleanser is formulated with 8 types of hyaluronic acid to deeply cleanse pores without stripping the skin. Infused with panthenol and zinc PCA, it helps soothe and hydrate, leaving your skin feeling refreshed and nourished. Ideal for all skin types, especially those seeking a moisture-boosting cleansing experience.','1. Lathers the content into rich foam and gently massage your face with your palm.\r\n2. Rinse it off thoroughly with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240908_233950_(540_x_720_pixel)_58897.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_233950_(540_x_720_pixel)_58897.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_234204_(540_x_720_pixel)_44178.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_234057_(540_x_720_pixel)_12546.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_234133_(540_x_720_pixel)_82174.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3160,'VT Reedle Shot 300',NULL,240.000,'VT Reedle Shot 300 is a popular skincare product that utilizes microneedle technology to deliver potent ingredients deep into the skin. Its unique formulation, featuring hyaluronic acid and centella asiatica, helps to improve skin texture, enhance ingredient absorption, and hydrate and soothe the skin. This innovative product is known for its ability to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, improve skin elasticity, and brighten the complexion.','During night skincare routine, after washing your face, spread proper amount evenly and massage until absorbed.\r\nReedle shot 300 can be used every 3 days, but do not use with reedle shot 100 and 700 at the same time.\r\nDo not use with a device and after receiving cosmetic procedures, stop use when irritation occurs.','produits/IMG_20240909_000636_(540_x_720_pixel)_10083.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240909_000636_(540_x_720_pixel)_10083.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_000652_(540_x_720_pixel)_48716.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_000725_(540_x_720_pixel)_60076.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_000823_(540_x_720_pixel)_41288.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3161,'Fino Shampoo',NULL,130.000,'Fino Premium Touch Shampoo is a luxurious hair care product designed to revitalize damaged hair. With its blend of nourishing ingredients like royal jelly extract and PCA, it provides deep hydration, strengthens strands, and repairs cuticles. Ideal for dry, brittle, or color-treated hair, this shampoo offers a gentle cleanse while delivering exceptional results, leaving locks silky, smooth, and healthy.','Fully wet hair and scalp. Create a lather and massage well into the scalp to deep cleanse. Apply as needed. Rinse well.\r\n\r\nRecommended to be used 1-2 times a week. Gentle enough for everyday use.','produits/IMG_20240909_002028_(540_x_720_pixel)_55949.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240909_002028_(540_x_720_pixel)_55949.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_001956_(540_x_720_pixel)_47308.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_002200_(540_x_720_pixel)_89996.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_002106_(540_x_720_pixel)_81773.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3162,'A\'pieu Pure Block Daily Sun Cream',NULL,85.000,'A\'pieu Pure Block Daily Sun Cream is a lightweight, non-greasy sunscreen that provides broad-spectrum protection against harmful UV rays. It\'s formulated with a blend of physical and chemical filters to shield your skin from sun damage and premature aging. The lightweight texture absorbs quickly without leaving a white cast, making it ideal for everyday use. Enriched with soothing ingredients like aloe vera and watermelon extract, this sunscreen helps hydrate and soothe the skin while protecting it from the sun.','Use as last step of your skin care routine. Take an appropriate amount and gently spread over face. Pat to absorb.\r\nGently spread over areas vulnerable to sun exposure, including the neck, arms and legs.\r\nReapply as needed if you\'re spending a long time under the sun.','produits/IMG_20240909_003648_(540_x_720_pixel)_81209.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240909_003648_(540_x_720_pixel)_81209.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_004101_(540_x_720_pixel)_46921.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_004127_(540_x_720_pixel)_87983.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_003751_(540_x_720_pixel)_43963.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3163,'AHA BHA PHA Miracle Truecica Clear Pad',NULL,111.000,'AHA BHA PHA Miracle Truecica Clear Pad is a dual-sided pad that is infused with a blend of naturally-derived exfoliating acids, including AHAs, BHAs, and PHAs. These acids help to exfoliate the skin, remove dead skin cells, and reduce sebum production. The pads also contain Truecica, a plant extract that has soothing and anti-inflammatory properties.\r\nOverall, the AHA BHA PHA Miracle Truecica Clear Pad is a well-reviewed product that is said to be effective at exfoliating the skin and reducing breakouts. It is also gentle enough for sensitive skin.','After cleansing, leave the pad on the skin for 5 to 10 minutes. Gently pat in the remaining essence.','produits/IMG_20240914_210032_(540_x_720_pixel)_40118.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240914_210032_(540_x_720_pixel)_40118.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_210059_(540_x_720_pixel)_93520.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_210110_(540_x_720_pixel)_19155.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_210240_(540_x_720_pixel)_59536.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3164,'Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask',NULL,119.000,'Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask: A Natural Solution for Clear Skin\r\nThe Beauty of Joseon Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask is a popular skincare product that utilizes the natural exfoliating properties of red bean extract to purify and refine pores. This gentle mask is designed to help reduce the appearance of large pores, clear away acne-causing debris, and improve overall skin texture.\r\nKey Benefits:\r\n * Gentle Exfoliation: Red bean extract acts as a natural exfoliant, removing dead skin cells and unclogging pores.\r\n * Pore Minimization: Helps reduce the appearance of large pores, leaving skin looking smoother and more refined.\r\n * Sebum Control: Absorbs excess sebum, preventing clogged pores and breakouts.\r\n * Refreshing Sensation: Provides a cooling and soothing effect on the skin.\r\n * Natural Ingredients: Formulated with natural ingredients, making it suitable for sensitive skin.','After cleansing, apply evenly on a dry face. After 5-10 minutes, gently massage with lukewarm water and rinse off.','produits/IMG_20240914_212923_(540_x_720_pixel)_48452.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240914_212923_(540_x_720_pixel)_48452.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_212950_(540_x_720_pixel)_32436.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_213044_(540_x_720_pixel)_98712.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_213124_(540_x_720_pixel)_47106.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3165,'Mielle Pomegranate and Honey Detangling Shampoo',NULL,130.000,'Tackle wash day with a Type 4 hair product made just for you. Mielle’s Pomegranate & Honey Moisturizing and Detangling Shampoo uses fresh ingredients like honey and babassu oil to lift dirt and oil from your hair while preserving much needed moisture. This shampoo works into a luxurious lather and has an amazing scent. Nothing works better at loosening tangles and adding slip. Follow up with our Detangling Conditioner, moisturize with our Leave-In Conditioner, and get creative with your choice of Pomegranate & Honey hair styling products. This sulfate-free shampoo is an absolute must for your healthy hair collection.','Apply a generous amount onto hands and massage into wet hair and scalp until it lathers. Gently finger-comb to pre-detangle. Rinse with warm water. Repeat as necessary. Follow with our Pomegranate &amp;amp;amp;amp; Honey Moisturizing and Detangling Conditioner.','produits/IMG_20240914_223220_(540_x_720_pixel)_12574.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240914_223220_(540_x_720_pixel)_12574.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_223233_(540_x_720_pixel)_24257.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_223317_(540_x_720_pixel)_61648.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_223356_(540_x_720_pixel)_77872.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3166,'Pomegranate and Honey Detangling Conditioner',NULL,130.000,'A Prime + Define™ styling system formulated for thick, curly hair resulting in intense hydration and silkiness. Mielle Organics Pomegranate & Honey Moisturizing and Detangling Conditioner provides this and more. This conditioner locks in moisture, strengthens thick curly hair, prevents breakage and split ends, and gives your hair an overall smooth, silky texture. Pair it with Mielle’s other thoughtfully made Type 4 hair products for a perfect hair care routine from start to finish. Add our Pomegranate & Honey Leave-In Conditioner to your order to prime wet hair for styling and create a defined finish. Your hair will thank you over and over again!','Apply the conditioner to wet hair, distributing along the length, from root to tip. Gently detangle the hair with a detangling brush or wide-toothed comb. Leave for 10-15 minutes, then rinse.','produits/IMG_20240914_225907_(540_x_720_pixel)_66729.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240914_225907_(540_x_720_pixel)_66729.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_225944_(540_x_720_pixel)_62536.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_230022_(540_x_720_pixel)_31138.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_223233_(540_x_720_pixel)_45650.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3167,'Snow White Spot Gel',NULL,130.000,'Snow White Spot Gel is a radiant remedy for dark spots, a skincare elixir that transforms dull skin into a luminous canvas. Its potent blend of brightening ingredients, such as niacinamide and arbutin, gently fades away blemishes, revealing a complexion that glows with youthful vitality. With consistent use, this luxurious gel unveils a more even, radiant skin tone, leaving you feeling confident and refreshed.','After your skin is clean and dry, apply a small amount of the gel directly to the dark spots or areas you want to lighten.','produits/IMG_20240915_001606_(540_x_720_pixel)_63812.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_001606_(540_x_720_pixel)_63812.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_001633_(540_x_720_pixel)_26172.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_001710_(540_x_720_pixel)_68633.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_001721_(540_x_720_pixel)_71994.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_001812_(540_x_720_pixel)_47271.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3168,'Dos Lunas Whitening, Moisturizing, and Nourishing Spray Blue',NULL,84.000,'Introducing our revolutionary Hydrating and Brightening Skin Mist. This innovative formula is designed to revitalize and enhance your complexion, leaving it radiant, soft, and smooth. Infused with a blend of nourishing ingredients, this lightweight, waterproof mist provides deep hydration while instantly brightening your skin tone.\r\nIdeal for sensitive areas, our gentle formula is free from harsh chemicals and irritants, making it suitable for even the most delicate skin. With just a few sprays, you can experience the transformative power of this exceptional product.','Shake well before use, Apply an appropriate amount Spray on the face and body 20 cm away from the face, please avoid contact with eyes.','produits/IMG_20240915_002259_(540_x_720_pixel)_99026.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_002259_(540_x_720_pixel)_99026.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_003527_(540_x_720_pixel)_53411.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_002359_(540_x_720_pixel)_56738.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_002413_(540_x_720_pixel)_53351.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3169,'Saemmul Perfect Curling Mascara',NULL,75.000,'The Saemmul Perfect Curling Mascara is a popular choice among beauty enthusiasts due to its impressive curling capabilities and affordable price. Known for its ability to lift and define lashes without smudging or fading, this mascara offers a great balance of volume and definition. While the formula can be a bit thick, it\'s generally considered a reliable and budget-friendly option for those seeking to enhance their lashes.','After using an eyelash primer, apply the mascara to your eyelashes from the roots in a zigzag motion.','produits/IMG_20240915_010430_(540_x_720_pixel)_33674.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_010430_(540_x_720_pixel)_33674.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_010747_(540_x_720_pixel)_78585.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_010804_(540_x_720_pixel)_56347.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_010809_(540_x_720_pixel)_81980.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3170,'Mixsoon Bean Cream',NULL,130.000,'Mixsoon Bean Cream is an intensively hydrating cream formulated with highly concentrated fermented soybean extract to nourish skin and maintain skin\'s oil-moisture levels. Also contains fermented pomegranate to smooth out bumpy skin texture for a more even, soft complexion, fermented barley to rejuvenate skin and fermented pear that is rich in vitamins C and E. With a dense and firm texture to keep skin moisturised for a long time.','After cleansing and toning, apply cream all over your face.','produits/IMG_20240915_152350_(540_x_720_pixel)_66564.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_152350_(540_x_720_pixel)_66564.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_152453_(540_x_720_pixel)_15557.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_152825_(540_x_720_pixel)_11131.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_153058_(540_x_720_pixel)_11179.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3171,'CICA Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,110.000,'The Vegan Cica Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++ is designed to provide comprehensive sun protection while soothing and hydrating irritated skin. Enriched with 10,000 ppm of Cica Complex, derived from seven key ingredients obtained through fermentation, this sun cream quickly calms skin damaged by UV rays. It also features hyaluronic acid and inositol, which deeply hydrate the skin, ensuring it stays moisturized and healthy.\r\n\r\nThis sun cream absorbs lightly like a moisturizing cream, leaving the skin smooth and hydrated without a sticky residue or white cast. Offering powerful sun protection with SPF50+ PA++++, it effectively shields the skin from harmful UV rays. Additionally, it boasts triple functionality, including UV protection, wrinkle improvement, and skin whitening, thanks to the inclusion of niacinamide and adenosine.\r\n\r\nCertified vegan and cruelty-free, the Vegan Cica Soothing Sun Cream is formulated without animal-derived ingredients and has not been tested on animals. It has undergone skin irritation testing to ensure it is safe for sensitive skin and is free from ingredients harmful to marine ecosystems. This makes it an excellent choice for those seeking effective, multi-functional sun protection that is gentle on the skin and the environment.','1. In the last step of skin care, take an appropriate amount of this product and spread evenly on the skin.\r\n2. It is recommended to apply thickly on areas highly exposed to UV rays.','produits/IMG_20240915_164021_(540_x_720_pixel)_82915.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_164021_(540_x_720_pixel)_82915.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_164033_(540_x_720_pixel)_95007.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_164239_(540_x_720_pixel)_89077.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_164351_(540_x_720_pixel)_29413.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3172,'MARY and MAY Hyaluronics Serum',NULL,130.000,'The MARY and MAY Hyaluronics Serum is a serum formulated with small molecular structure of hyaluronic acid that penetrates the skin between skin cells and moisturize from within. Effectively replenishes hydration with hyaluronic acid that holds 1000 times of its weight in water, leaving plump and supple skin. The hyaluronic acid helps to hold moisture to the skin\'s surface by preventing evaporation, retaining hydrated skin.','Take a proper amount using the dropper.\r\nGently massage on skin following the skin\'s texture.\r\nReapply on the dry eye area.','produits/IMG_20240915_170206_(540_x_720_pixel)_61105.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_170206_(540_x_720_pixel)_61105.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_170247_(540_x_720_pixel)_89989.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_170327_(540_x_720_pixel)_11617.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_170403_(540_x_720_pixel)_73083.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3173,'MARY and MAY Niacinamide + Chaenomeles Sinensis Serum',NULL,130.000,'MARY & MAY Niacinamide + Chaenomeles Sinensis Serum is face serum formulated with Niacinamide and Chaenomeles Sinensis Extract to brighten up dull and unbalanced skin. Contains 2% Niacinamide to lighten skin by inhibiting the transfer of melanosomes and regulate sebum production for balanced skin and enriched with 93% Chaenomeles Sinensis Fruit Extract that is rich in Vitamin C and Flavonoids for smooth and radiant skin appearance.','Take a proper amount using the dropper.\r\nGently massage on skin following the skin\'s texture.','produits/IMG_20240915_171310_(540_x_720_pixel)_77731.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_171310_(540_x_720_pixel)_77731.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_171321_(540_x_720_pixel)_95590.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_171420_(540_x_720_pixel)_68609.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_171545_(540_x_720_pixel)_87573.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3174,'MARY and MAY Marine Collagen Serum',NULL,130.000,'MARY and MAY Marine Collagen Serum is filled with 95% low-molecular marine collagen to reduce wrinkles without leaving a greasy feel. It adheres to the brand’s clean beauty concept by keeping ingredients to a minimum and refraining from animal testing. Delivers a boost of collagen to the skin to restore firm skin and refine visible wrinkles without feeling greasy. Addressing the symptoms of aging skin and hydrates parched skin. Formulated with EWG verified green grade ingredients.','Take a proper amount using the dropper.\r\nGently massage on skin following the skin\'s texture.','produits/IMG_20240915_172614_(540_x_720_pixel)_62826.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_172614_(540_x_720_pixel)_62826.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_172939_(540_x_720_pixel)_66215.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_173008_(540_x_720_pixel)_29859.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_173111_(540_x_720_pixel)_85735.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3175,'Jadayel - Anti Hair Loss oil',NULL,128.000,'Discover with it the secret of shiny, healthy hair strands and forget about hair loss. It is a mixture of the most exceptional natural oils and nourishing and effective materials. It works to strengthen the foundation of your hair, nourishes the roots, removes the specter of hair loss, and solves various problems such as breakage and dryness. It is a promise of softness, strength and shine.','Discover with it the secret of shiny, healthy hair strands and forget about hair loss. It is a mixture of the most exceptional natural oils and nourishing and effective materials. It works to strengthen the foundation of your hair, nourishes the roots, removes the specter of hair loss, and solves various problems such as breakage and dryness. It is a promise of softness, strength and shine.','produits/IMG_20240915_182127_(540_x_720_pixel)_34175.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_182127_(540_x_720_pixel)_34175.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_184457_(540_x_720_pixel)_47234.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_184535_(540_x_720_pixel)_83025.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_184608_(540_x_720_pixel)_56970.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3176,'Jadayel - Hair Tonic oil',NULL,128.000,'This unique blend is produced with the special active oils like olive, patchouli, coconut, almonds, mustard and bay leaves, and more than 30 natural herbs that will nourish the roots and the ends of your hair giving it a healthy shine and vivacity.','Jadayel - Hair Tonic','produits/IMG_20240915_192138_(540_x_720_pixel)_76837.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_192138_(540_x_720_pixel)_76837.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_192206_(540_x_720_pixel)_24117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_192251_(540_x_720_pixel)_94860.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_192302_(540_x_720_pixel)_17870.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3177,'Jadayel Anti Dandruff &amp;amp;amp;amp; Conditioner',NULL,128.000,'This unique blend from Abdul Samad Al Qurashi effectively conquers dandruff with its powerful ingredient, selenium sulfide. Combined with sesame oil, coconut oil, olive oil, ginger oil, and over 30 natural herbs, it adds softness and enriches your hair with active nutrients.','Apply the oil on hair and massage the scalp by hand for two minutes to allow the oil reaching the roots of the hair. Leave it for one hour before washing it. Use twice a week','produits/IMG_20240915_195929_(540_x_720_pixel)_73633.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_195929_(540_x_720_pixel)_73633.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_195954_(540_x_720_pixel)_47337.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_200019_(540_x_720_pixel)_58340.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_200047_(540_x_720_pixel)_73388.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3178,'Mary and May Vegan Calendula Peptide Ageless Sleeping Mask',NULL,130.000,'Revitalize your skin overnight with the MARY & MAY Calendula Peptide Ageless Sleeping Mask. This vegan, clinically tested gel mask is infused with 2,200ppm of calendula extract, 25 types of peptides, and cica extract to soothe inflammation, repair damage, and calm irritation while you sleep. \r\n\r\nEnhanced with hyaluronic acid for deep hydration and Guaiazulene from chamomile to reduce redness, it leaves your skin plump, radiant, and nourished by morning. Perfect for sensitive skin, this lightweight, EWG-verified formula adheres smoothly, delivering powerful active ingredients to rejuvenate your complexion as you rest.','At the last step of skin care in the evening, take an appropriate amount and apply on the face, avoiding the eye and mouth areas. \r\nGently rinse your face the next morning with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240916_122731_(540_x_720_pixel)_99123.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240916_122731_(540_x_720_pixel)_99123.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240916_122804_(540_x_720_pixel)_14220.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240916_122859_(540_x_720_pixel)_89401.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240916_123322_(540_x_720_pixel)_69985.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240916_123328_(540_x_720_pixel)_81029.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3179,'Luminous Duo',NULL,130.000,'Introducing the K-SECRET Whitening and Brightening Duo: Your Path to Radiant Skin <br>\r\n<br>\r\nOur powerful duo, featuring the K-SECRET Real Vita C Ampoule and Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Bar, is designed to revitalize your skin. Packed with essential vitamins and hydrolyzed collagen, these products work together to reduce dark spots, minimize wrinkles, and promote a radiant, youthful complexion. Experience the transformative power of K-SECRET and unlock your skin\'s natural beauty.','* Cleanse your face with the K-SECRET Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Bar.\r\n * Pat your face dry.\r\n * Apply a few drops of the K-SECRET Real Vita C Ampoule to your face and neck.\r\n * Massage gently until absorbed.\r\n * Use daily for best results.',NULL,NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3180,'KSECRET - SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean',NULL,106.000,'Discover the Fountain of Youth for Your Eyes <br>\r\n<br>\r\nIntroducing SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean, a revolutionary anti-aging and brightening eye cream that rejuvenates your delicate skin. With a potent blend of Retinal Liposome, Bakuchiol, Vitamins C and E, peptides, and soothing herbal extracts, this luxurious formula targets wrinkles, dark circles, and uneven skin tone, revealing a more youthful, radiant complexion. Experience the transformative power of SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean and unlock the secret to timeless beauty. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 30 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply a moderate amount to the skin evenly and gently pat it for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20241010_005317_(540_x_720_pixel)_82259.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_005317_(540_x_720_pixel)_82259.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_005350_(540_x_720_pixel)_98777.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_005418_(540_x_720_pixel)_26758.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_005454_(540_x_720_pixel)_26760.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_010540_(540_x_720_pixel)_99208.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_010630_(540_x_720_pixel)_59189.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011417_(540_x_720_pixel)_39658.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011427_(540_x_720_pixel)_47059.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011434_(540_x_720_pixel)_45855.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011442_(540_x_720_pixel)_57305.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3181,'KSECRET - SEOUL 1988 Cream : Retinal Liposome 1% + Fermented Rice',NULL,132.000,'Unleash the Power of Youthful Skin with Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream <br>\r\n<br>\r\nExperience a transformative journey to radiant, youthful skin with Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream, a luxurious anti-aging and brightening cream. Formulated with a potent blend of cutting-edge ingredients, this innovative product targets wrinkles, dark circles, and uneven skin tone, revealing a more vibrant, youthful complexion. <br>\r\nAt the heart of Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream lies Retinal Liposome, a revolutionary retinol delivery system that penetrates deeply into your skin to stimulate collagen production and reduce the appearance of fine lines. Bakuchiol, a gentle yet effective alternative to retinol, works synergistically with Vitamins C and E to brighten dark circles, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone. <br>\r\nA trio of peptides further enhances collagen synthesis, resulting in firmer, smoother skin and a reduction in wrinkles. To soothe and calm irritated skin, Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream is infused with five soothing herbal root extracts and Lactobacillus/Panax Ginseng Root Ferment Filtrate, providing antioxidant protection and promoting a healthy, balanced complexion.\r\nThe smooth, creamy texture of Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream absorbs quickly, providing lasting moisture without stickiness and leaving a silky-smooth finish. With regular use, you\'ll experience a visible improvement in your skin\'s texture, tone, and overall appearance.  <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 50 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply a moderate amount to the skin evenly and gently pat it for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20241010_011417_(540_x_720_pixel)_82306.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_011417_(540_x_720_pixel)_82306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011427_(540_x_720_pixel)_87923.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011434_(540_x_720_pixel)_20236.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011442_(540_x_720_pixel)_82014.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3182,'The Retinol 0.3 Cream',NULL,123.000,'0.3% pure retinol with three times the strength\r\n\r\nExperience the full power of retinol with a concentration three times higher than that of The Retinol 0.1 Cream. This formula optimally stabilizes the high retinol content. Recommended for those already familiar with retinol products, this mid-strength retinol cream helps achieve smooth skin, improves texture, enhances elasticity, and reduces wrinkles. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 20 ml','WEEK 1~2 \r\n\r\n\r\n&bull; Frequency : use 3 times a week at night\r\n&bull; How to Use : start with 0.3 of cream to concerned areas. Gradually increase frequency and areas of application.\r\n\r\n\r\nWEEK 3~ \r\n\r\n\r\n&bull; Frequency : may apply every other day at night\r\n&bull; How to use : apply pea-sized amount and may spread over entire face\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* To maintain the freshness of retinol ingredients, avoid storing in high temperatures and direct sunlight.\r\n* Since this product can increase sensitivity to sunlight, use sunscreen while using the product.\r\n* Do not pair with any scrub, peeling or exfoliating product as it can irritate the skin.','produits/IMG_20241010_013530_(540_x_720_pixel)_93133.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_013530_(540_x_720_pixel)_93133.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013627_(540_x_720_pixel)_28912.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013654_(540_x_720_pixel)_10390.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013724_(540_x_720_pixel)_63000.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013753_(540_x_720_pixel)_68190.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013817_(540_x_720_pixel)_70530.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3183,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic',NULL,135.000,'Restore Your Hair\'s Vitality with Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic\r\nExperience a transformative haircare solution designed to combat hair loss and revitalize your scalp. Our innovative formula, enriched with CICA, peptides, Black Complex, and Biotin, nourishes and strengthens your hair follicles, promoting healthy hair growth. Free from harmful ingredients and dermatologically tested, Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic is the gentle yet effective solution for revitalizing your hair.','1. Shake well before using. Divide the sections with fingers and spray the tonic onto scalp.\r\n2. Massage the scalp afterwards for a better absorption.','produits/IMG_20241010_015014_(540_x_720_pixel)_98916.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_015014_(540_x_720_pixel)_98916.png\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_015057_(540_x_720_pixel)_11442.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_015121_(540_x_720_pixel)_94867.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_015153_(540_x_720_pixel)_89153.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3184,'Tone Brightening Capsule Ampoule',NULL,150.000,'Discover the transformative power of Skin 1004 Tone Brightening Capsule Ampoule, a concentrated serum designed to illuminate your skin. Packed with potent ingredients, including Centella Asiatica Extract, Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, and Madecassoside, this ampoule effectively targets dullness, uneven skin tone, and hyperpigmentation, revealing a brighter, more radiant complexion while calming the skin.\r\nExperience the power of concentrated skincare and unlock the secret to a luminous glow. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 100 ml','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20241010_020938_(540_x_720_pixel)_21302.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_020938_(540_x_720_pixel)_21302.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_020607_(540_x_720_pixel)_41061.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_020848_(540_x_720_pixel)_53975.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_020924_(540_x_720_pixel)_88900.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3185,'Smart Scalp Massager',NULL,75.000,'Smart Scalp Massager\r\nIndulge in a luxurious scalp massage at home with our innovative Smart Scalp Massager.\r\nDesigned to mimic the soothing touch of human fingers, this advanced device provides a deep, relaxing massage that promotes hair health and relieves stress.\r\nKey Features:\r\n * Deep Tissue Massage: Our unique massage heads penetrate deep into the scalp, stimulating blood flow and promoting hair growth.\r\n * Relieves Tension: Experience instant relaxation as the massager eases away tension and stress.\r\n * Improves Hair Health: Increased blood circulation nourishes hair follicles, promoting thicker, healthier hair.\r\n * Wireless and Portable: Enjoy a massage anytime, anywhere with its cordless design.\r\n * Adjustable Intensity: Customize your massage experience with multiple intensity settings.','To use the Smart Scalp Massager, simply turn it on, adjust the intensity, and gently move it in circular motions across your scalp. Enjoy a relaxing and rejuvenating massage!','produits/IMG_20241010_194112_(540_x_720_pixel)_97920.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_194112_(540_x_720_pixel)_97920.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_194136_(540_x_720_pixel)_65470.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_194222_(540_x_720_pixel)_11715.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_194320_(540_x_720_pixel)_95902.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3186,'Perfect Hanbang Sun Trio',NULL,298.000,'Embrace comprehensive sun protection with the Perfect Hanbang Sun Trio, a curated set featuring three of Beauty of Joseon\'s signature sun care products. Each formula is designed to protect your skin from damaging UV rays while offering a variety of skincare benefits rooted in the Hanbang tradition (traditional Korean herbal medicine).\r\n\r\nWhat is inside?\r\n1. Relief Sun : Rice + Probiotics (SPF50+ PA++++)\r\n   - Relief Sun is an organic sunscreen with a lightweight, creamy texture. It leaves a non-sticky, moist finish even with repeated applications. Infused with 30% rice extract and grain-fermented extracts, it hydrates and nourishes the skin.\r\n\r\n2. Matte Sun Stick : Mugwort+Camelia (SPF 50+ PA++++)\r\n   - Matte Sun Stick provides seamless, non-sticky protection. Even with multiple applications over makeup, it remains smooth, regulating sebum for a matte finish. Infused with artemisia capillaris and green tea, it ensures skin stays moisturized and smooth.\r\n3. Ginseng Moist Sun Serum (SPF 50+ PA++++)\r\n   - UV rays can age and damage our skin. Sunscreen use is crucial, but many skip it due to its typical drawbacks like oily texture and white cast. With our Ginseng Moist Sun Serum, enriched with ginseng, its unique, non-greasy formula nourishes the skin, fights aging, and provides comprehensive UV protection.','Use on face','produits/IMG_20241010_203057_(540_x_720_pixel)_19747.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_203057_(540_x_720_pixel)_19747.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_203143_(540_x_720_pixel)_43190.png\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_203231_(540_x_720_pixel)_53748.png\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_203356_(540_x_720_pixel)_25898.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3187,'SHISEIDO - Fino Premium Touch Conditioner',NULL,130.000,'Fino Premium Touch Conditioner is a deep-conditioning treatment designed to revitalize damaged hair. Infused with royal jelly extract, PCA, and Lipidure EX, it moisturizes, strengthens, and repairs hair from within. Ideal for dry, brittle, or chemically treated hair, this conditioner penetrates deep into the hair shaft to restore its natural shine, softness, and manageability. With its rich formula and pleasant fragrance, Fino Premium Touch leaves hair feeling healthy, hydrated, and effortlessly beautiful. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 550 ml','After washing your hair with shampoo, please take an appropriate amount of conditioner.\r\nApply evenly to the middle and ends of hair and massage gently.\r\nRinse thoroughly with warm water.','produits/IMG_20241011_095630_(540_x_720_pixel)_49849.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241011_095630_(540_x_720_pixel)_49849.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_095642_(540_x_720_pixel)_83461.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_095652_(540_x_720_pixel)_95081.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_095700_(540_x_720_pixel)_70647.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3188,'Secret Key - Snow White Milky Lotion',NULL,130.000,'The Snow White Milky Pack is a luxurious skincare treatment designed to brighten, even out, and hydrate your skin. Infused with a potent blend of natural ingredients, this creamy lotion works to reduce the appearance of dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and dullness, leaving you with a glowing, luminous complexion.','After cleansing, apply at the initial stages of your skin care routine. Gently pat to absorb.\r\nTip: Snow White Milky Lotion can be used on your arms, legs and body - anywhere that requires a whitening effect.','produits/IMG_20241011_194352_(540_x_720_pixel)_35142.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241011_194352_(540_x_720_pixel)_35142.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_194457_(540_x_720_pixel)_36378.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_194552_(540_x_720_pixel)_71642.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_194618_(540_x_720_pixel)_46521.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3189,'MARY AND MAY - Vegan Primer Glow Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,110.000,'Transform your skin with the powerful fusion of natural ingredients in the Vegan Primer Glow Sun Cream. This multi-tasking cream delivers deep hydration, brightens the complexion, and provides essential sun protection, making it the ultimate skincare solution for a radiant, healthy glow. Enriched with fermented kombucha and pomegranate extract, this lightweight, vegan-friendly cream works wonders on all skin types to visibly enhance skin texture and tone.','1. In the last step of skin care, take an appropriate amount of this product and spread evenly on the skin.\r\n\r\n2. It is recommended to apply thickly on areas highly exposed to UV rays.','produits/IMG_20241011_221227_(540_x_720_pixel)_53959.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241011_221227_(540_x_720_pixel)_53959.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_221316_(540_x_720_pixel)_80325.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_221351_(540_x_720_pixel)_55482.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_221934_(540_x_720_pixel)_47022.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_221424_(540_x_720_pixel)_79968.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3190,'I\'M FROM  Rice Sunscreen',NULL,117.000,'I’M FROM Rice Sunscreen is a mineral sunscreen that contains 41% Goami Rice Extracts from Yeoju, South Korea which can help remove skin impurities for a softer and smoother skin texture and brighter complexion.\r\n\r\nRice Sunscreen has completed the SPF testing on human skin with the result of SPF 50+ PA++++. Contains Non-nano Zinc Oxide that can block both UVA and UVB and is less likely to penetrate human skin, and does not contain Oxybenzone and Octinoxate which is harmful to the coral and marine ecosystem. A sunscreen that not only protects skin from UV rays but at the same time also has excellent effects in soothing and calming the skin irritated by UV radiation.\r\n\r\nAs a 100% mineral base sunscreen, it has a moist and silky texture that lightly coats and quickly blends into the skin without leaving any stickiness. This product also has a pleasant scent, recommended for those who prefer fragrant skincare products.\r\n\r\nVolume: 50 ml','After your daytime moisturizer, use a sufficient amount and spread gently on the face, and body parts easily exposed to sunlight. Add another coat to areas more vulnerable to UV rays such as the forehead and nose. For outdoor activities, reapply every 4 hours to block UV rays more effectively.','produits/IMG_20241011_223254_(540_x_720_pixel)_13477.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241011_223254_(540_x_720_pixel)_13477.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_223417_(540_x_720_pixel)_67694.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_223455_(540_x_720_pixel)_54060.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_223540_(540_x_720_pixel)_32414.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_223605_(540_x_720_pixel)_49534.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3191,'Lacto Soy Mild Peeling Bubble Cleanser',NULL,102.000,'The Lacto Soy Mild Peeling Bubble Cleanser by Some By Mi is a gentle and nourishing cleanser that helps to purify the skin and remove impurities. It is formulated with lacto-soy, konjac, and aqualose to provide deep cleansing, mild exfoliation, and hydration.\r\nThis cleanser is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. It is free of parabens, artificial fragrance, drying alcohols, and essential oils.\r\nBenefits:\r\n * Deep cleanses the skin to remove impurities and skin waste\r\n * Gently exfoliates the skin to remove dead skin cells and smooth the skin texture\r\n * Hydrates the skin to prevent dryness\r\n * Soothes the skin and reduces irritation\r\n * Improves the overall appearance of the skin','1. Dispense a proper amount on wet hands and lather up until bubble is formed.\r\n2. Gently massage over the face and rinse off with lukewarm water','produits/1000000658_29122.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000658_29122.jpg\", \"produits/1000000661_22425.jpg\", \"produits/1000000659_16418.jpg\", \"produits/1000000660_18073.jpg\", \"produits/1000000662_95788.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3192,'Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil Mild',NULL,115.000,'Anua Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil Mild is a gentle and effective cleanser designed for sensitive skin. It is formulated with heartleaf extract, rosemary leaf oil, and sunflower seed oil to soothe, cleanse, and hydrate the skin.\r\nBenefits:\r\n  Gentle cleansing: Effectively removes makeup, sunscreen, and impurities without irritating the skin.\r\n  Soothes and calms: Heartleaf extract helps to reduce redness and inflammation.\r\n   Controls sebum: Rosemary leaf oil helps to regulate oil production.\r\n   Hydrates: Sunflower seed oil provides moisture to the skin.\r\n   Non comedogenic: Will not clog pores.\r\n  Fragrance free: Suitable for sensitive skin.','* Dry skin: Apply a few pumps of the cleansing oil to dry skin and massage gently in circular motions.\r\n * Emulsify: Add a small amount of water to emulsify the oil into a milky texture.\r\n * Rinse: Rinse thoroughly with warm water.','produits/1000000670_77951.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000670_77951.jpg\", \"produits/1000000671_27219.png\", \"produits/1000000673_90379.jpg\", \"produits/1000000672_33615.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3193,'MEDI-PEEL - Premium Peptide Naite 1000 Neck Stick',NULL,130.000,'The Premium Peptide Naite 1000 Neck Stick is a skincare product designed to address the specific needs of the delicate neck area. It is formulated with a combination of ingredients, including peptides and hyaluronic acid, to help improve skin elasticity, reduce the appearance of wrinkles, and hydrate the skin.\r\nHere are some of the key features and benefits of the Premium Peptide Naite 1000 Neck Stick:\r\nFeatures:\r\n * Peptide Complex: Contains 9 different peptides to target various signs of aging, including wrinkles, loss of firmness, and uneven skin tone.\r\n * Hyaluronic Acid: Provides deep hydration to plump the skin and reduce the appearance of fine lines.\r\n * Needle-shaped Spicules: Help to deliver the active ingredients deeper into the skin for enhanced absorption.\r\n * Convenient Stick Format: Easy to apply and carry on-the-go.\r\nBenefits:\r\n * Reduces the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines\r\n * Improves skin elasticity and firmness\r\n * Hydrates and plumps the skin\r\n * Evens out skin tone\r\n * Protects against environmental damage','* Cleanse and tone the neck area.\r\n * Apply the neck stick directly to the desired areas, massaging gently in upward motions.\r\n * Use daily, morning and night, for optimal results.','produits/1000000682_91666.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000682_91666.png\", \"produits/1000000683_29146.jpg\", \"produits/1000000684_90879.jpg\", \"produits/1000000685_13058.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3194,'VT - Mild Reedle Shot 50',NULL,200.000,'VT Mild Reedle Shot 50 is a skincare product that contains tiny CICA reedle particles that assist with skin absorption and revitalize the skin\'s condition, promoting a healthy and balanced complexion. It is infused with Aquaporin, Astaxanthin, and Aloe Extract to moisturize, soothe skin, and add vitality and energy to the skin.\r\nHere are some of the key benefits of VT Mild Reedle Shot 50:\r\n * Helps to improve skin texture and tone\r\n * Minimizes the appearance of pores\r\n * Hydrates and soothes the skin\r\n * Promotes skin regeneration\r\n * Suitable for sensitive skin\r\nVT Mild Reedle Shot 50 is a good choice for those who are looking for a gentle and effective way to improve their skin health. It is also a good option for those who have sensitive skin.','1. After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount of Reads Shot to a clean face.\r\n2. Massage and roll it in to absorb, then press firmly with your palms at the finishing stage.\r\n3. Adjust the amount and frequency of use according to personal preference, and be sure to moisturize after use and apply sun care when going out.','produits/1000000694_23425.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000694_23425.jpg\", \"produits/1000000695_44266.jpg\", \"produits/1000000696_28270.jpg\", \"produits/1000000697_13455.png\", \"produits/1000000698_26894.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3195,'VT - Reedle Shot 100',NULL,240.000,'VT Reedle Shot 100 is a popular Korean skincare product that uses a unique microneedle technology to deliver powerful active ingredients deep into the skin. It is designed to improve skin texture, reduce the appearance of wrinkles, and brighten the complexion.\r\nHere are some of the key benefits of VT Reedle Shot 100:\r\n * Improves skin texture and tone\r\n * Reduces the appearance of wrinkles and fine lines\r\n * Brightens the complexion\r\n * Hydrates and soothes the skin\r\n * Promotes skin regeneration\r\nVT Reedle Shot 100 is a good choice for those who are looking for a powerful and effective way to improve their skin health. It is also a good option for those who have sensitive skin, as it is gentle and non-irritating.\r\nHere are some additional things to keep in mind about VT Reedle Shot 100:\r\n * It is a serum, so it should be applied after cleansing and toning, but before moisturizing.\r\n * It is best to use it at night, as the microneedles can make your skin more sensitive to sunlight.\r\n * You may experience a slight tingling sensation when you first apply the product. This is normal and should go away after a few minutes.\r\n * It is important to follow the instructions on the product label carefully.','During night skincare routine, after washing your face, spread proper amount evenly and massage until absorbed.\r\nReedle shot 100 can be used daily, but do not use with reedle shot 300 and 700 at the same time.\r\nDo not use with a device and after receiving cosmetic procedures, stop use when irritation occurs.','produits/1000000711_26083.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000711_26083.jpg\", \"produits/1000000712_73934.jpg\", \"produits/1000000713_44781.png\", \"produits/1000000714_47510.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3196,'TIRTIR - SOS Serum',NULL,136.000,'TIRTIR SOS Serum is a hydrating and anti-aging face serum that is enriched with Polyglutamic acid, witch hazel, chamomile, and Acetyl Hexapeptide-8 to deliver deep hydration, soothe the skin, and boost collagen production.\r\nHere are some of the key benefits of TIRTIR SOS Serum:\r\n * Deep hydration: Polyglutamic acid (PGA) is a powerful humectant that can hold up to 10 times more water than hyaluronic acid. This helps to hydrate your skin deeply and keep it plump and supple.\r\n * Soothing and calming: Witch hazel and chamomile have anti-inflammatory properties that can help to soothe irritated skin and reduce redness.\r\n * Boost collagen production: Acetyl Hexapeptide-8 is a peptide that helps to stimulate collagen production, which can help to improve skin elasticity and reduce the appearance of wrinkles.','Apply an appropriate amount evenly onto face and pat gently for better absorption.\r\nNotice: Please note that the expiry','produits/1000000723_70534.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000723_70534.jpg\", \"produits/1000000724_53000.jpg\", \"produits/1000000725_75313.jpg\", \"produits/1000000726_92409.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3197,'MEDI-PEEL - Red Lacto Collagen Wrapping Mask',NULL,150.000,'MEDI-PEEL Red Lacto Collagen Wrapping Mask is a popular Korean skincare product designed to address various skin concerns, particularly those related to aging and pore visibility. It\'s known for its ability to:\r\n * Lift and minimize pores: The collagen wrapping helps to tighten and reduce the appearance of enlarged pores.\r\n * Enhance skin elasticity: The collagen content promotes skin firmness and reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n * Hydrate the skin: The mask provides deep hydration, leaving the skin feeling soft and supple.\r\n * Brighten the complexion: It helps to improve skin radiance and a youthful glow.','1. After washing your face, apply an appropriate amount to the entire face, excluding the eyes and mouth, as the final step in skin care.\r\n2. After drying sufficiently to form a transparent film, remove from the edge or thoroughly rinse with warm water.','produits/1000000738_84527.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000738_84527.png\", \"produits/1000000739_47888.png\", \"produits/1000000740_78416.png\", \"produits/1000000741_70427.jpg\", \"produits/1000000742_96497.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3198,'Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Toner',NULL,102.000,'The Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Toner by SOME BY MI is a popular Korean skincare product that combines the benefits of galactomyces ferment filtrate and vitamin C to brighten, hydrate, and smooth the skin.\r\nKey Ingredients and Benefits:\r\n * Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate (88%): This fermented ingredient helps to exfoliate dead skin cells, improve skin texture, and brighten the complexion.\r\n * Vitamin C (1%): This powerful antioxidant helps to reduce hyperpigmentation, boost collagen production, and protect the skin from environmental damage.\r\n * Niacinamide: This ingredient helps to reduce redness, improve skin tone, and strengthen the skin barrier.','After cleansing, apply all over face and gently tap for absorption.','produits/1000000751_44753.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000751_44753.jpg\", \"produits/1000000750_89348.jpg\", \"produits/1000000752_29224.jpg\", \"produits/1000000753_20586.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3199,'Lacto Soy Low pH Morning Cleansing B',NULL,65.000,'Lacto Soy Low pH Morning Cleansing Bar is a gentle, fragrance-free, non-comedogenic and moisturizing Korean low pH bar soap cleanser for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\r\nIt is formulated with Lacto Soy, a fermented soybean extract that helps to gently remove impurities and dead skin cells, while also restoring the skin\'s natural pH balance. It is also enriched with Hydrolyzed Soy Protein Extract and 3 types of vegetable oil to moisturize the skin.\r\nThe bar produces a rich and fine lather that provides a mild yet effective cleansing experience. It is free of 28 harmful ingredients, making it suitable for sensitive skin.','1. Soften the skin by adding water.\r\n2. Lather up with the cleansing bar and gently cleanse the face.\r\n3. Wash away with lukewarm water.','produits/1000000763_15302.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000763_15302.jpg\", \"produits/1000000764_73746.jpg\", \"produits/1000000766_41377.jpg\", \"produits/1000000767_32095.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3200,'Dear Darling Marker Tint #05 Pink Tangerine',NULL,54.000,'Dear Darling Marker Tint is a long-lasting, hydrating, and pigmented lip tint from Etude House. The tint has a unique marker-like applicator that allows for precise application. It is also infused with hyaluronic acid to keep the lips hydrated.','Apply on lips','produits/1000000775_23951.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000775_23951.jpg\", \"produits/1000000776_21385.jpg\", \"produits/1000000777_12507.jpg\", \"produits/1000000778_73980.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3201,'Dear Darling Marker Tint #06 Grape Soda',NULL,54.000,'Dear Darling Marker Tint is a long-lasting, hydrating, and pigmented lip tint from Etude House. The tint has a unique marker-like applicator that allows for precise application. It is also infused with hyaluronic acid to keep the lips hydrated.','To create full lips, apply the product by spreading it across your entire lips.','produits/1000000785_99505.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000785_99505.jpg\", \"produits/1000000786_68269.jpg\", \"produits/1000000787_61659.jpg\", \"produits/1000000788_39102.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL);
INSERT INTO `produits` VALUES (3202,'Peripera - Ink The Velvet Lip Tint - #21 Vitality Coral Red',NULL,68.000,'Peripera\'s Ink The Velvet Lip Tint is a known for its long-lasting formula, vibrant colors, and velvety matte finish. It comes in a wide range of shades to suit different preferences.\r\nHere are some of its key features:\r\n * Long-lasting: The tint can last for hours without smudging or fading.\r\n * High-pigmented: It provides a bold, vibrant color payoff with just one swipe.\r\n * Velvety matte finish: The tint dries down to a comfortable, velvety matte finish.\r\n * Hydrating: It contains hydrating ingredients to keep the lips moisturized.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the centre of lips and smooth outwards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000000798_72756.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000798_72756.jpg\", \"produits/1000000799_70486.jpg\", \"produits/1000000800_84434.jpg\", \"produits/1000000801_15847.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3203,'Peripera - Ink The Velvet Lip Tint - # 22 BOUQUET NUDE',NULL,68.000,'Pack your pout with vibrant, highly pigmented color and enjoy a velvety, ink-like formula that\'s perfect for both gradient and full-on lip looks with peripera\'s Ink The Velvet. This long-lasting lip tint feels like whipped cream for your lips! Its creamy texture glides on effortlessly, smoothing out those fine lines for a flawless finish.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the centre of lips and smooth outwards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000000809_61116.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000809_61116.jpg\", \"produits/1000000812_20737.png\", \"produits/1000000813_27587.jpg\", \"produits/1000000814_63844.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3204,'Over Glowy Tint #07 Coco Plum',NULL,54.000,'Experience the ultimate lip look with the Over Glowy Tint. This innovative formula combines the best of a lip gloss and a lip tint, providing a long-lasting, high-shine finish. The lightweight, non-sticky texture feels comfortable on the lips, while the vibrant colors add a touch of glamour to any look.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth out-wards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000000825_12425.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000825_12425.jpg\", \"produits/1000000826_48447.jpg\", \"produits/1000000827_19499.jpg\", \"produits/1000000828_54076.jpg\", \"produits/1000000829_83113.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3205,'Dear Darling Marker Tint #02 Mono Plum',NULL,54.000,'Discover the magic of Darling Marker Tint, the revolutionary lip and cheek tint that effortlessly enhances your natural beauty. Our innovative formula glides on smoothly, delivering a long-lasting, vibrant color payoff. With a wide range of shades to suit every complexion, you can create stunning looks for any occasion. Experience the convenience of a versatile product that simplifies your makeup routine and leaves you feeling confident and radiant.','1. For a bold look, outline the lips and fill up the inner part of the lips.\r\n2. For a gradation look, tap the tint in the center part of the lips and blend outwards.','produits/1000001109_64549.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001109_64549.jpg\", \"produits/1000001111_76067.jpg\", \"produits/1000001110_57246.jpg\", \"produits/1000001112_49258.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3206,'Dear Darling Marker Tint #03 Apple Candy',NULL,54.000,'Discover the magic of Darling Marker Tint, the revolutionary lip and cheek tint that effortlessly enhances your natural beauty. Our innovative formula glides on smoothly, delivering a long-lasting, vibrant color payoff. With a wide range of shades to suit every complexion, you can create stunning looks for any occasion. Experience the convenience of a versatile product that simplifies your makeup routine and leaves you feeling confident and radiant.','1. For a bold look, outline the lips and fill up the inner part of the lips.\r\n2. For a gradation look, tap the tint in the center part of the lips and blend outwards.','produits/1000001120_31498.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001120_31498.jpg\", \"produits/1000001121_43437.jpg\", \"produits/1000001123_36305.jpg\", \"produits/1000001124_82320.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3207,'Dear Darling Marker Tint #04 Milk Strawberry',NULL,54.000,'Discover the magic of Darling Marker Tint, the revolutionary lip and cheek tint that effortlessly enhances your natural beauty. Our innovative formula glides on smoothly, delivering a long-lasting, vibrant color payoff. With a wide range of shades to suit every complexion, you can create stunning looks for any occasion. Experience the convenience of a versatile product that simplifies your makeup routine and leaves you feeling confident and radiant.','1. For a bold look, outline the lips and fill up the inner part of the lips.\r\n2. For a gradation look, tap the tint in the center part of the lips and blend outwards.','produits/1000001134_62689.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001134_62689.jpg\", \"produits/1000001135_47561.jpg\", \"produits/1000001136_70404.jpg\", \"produits/1000001137_87889.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3208,'Dear Darling Oil Tint #4 Sweet Apple',NULL,68.000,'Indulge your lips with Etude Dear Darling Oil Tint. This isn\'t just a lip color; it\'s a juicy burst of hydration and shine. Infused with nourishing oils, this non-sticky tint leaves your lips feeling soft and looking luscious. Choose from a vibrant range of shades for a playful pop of color that lasts.','Glides directly on lips','produits/1000001146_58747.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001146_58747.jpg\", \"produits/1000001147_29148.jpg\", \"produits/1000001149_38449.jpg\", \"produits/1000001150_36962.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3209,'Over Glowy Tint #03 DDORI Apple Red',NULL,54.000,'Experience the ultimate lip look with the Over Glowy Tint. This innovative formula combines the best of a lip gloss and a lip tint, providing a long-lasting, high-shine finish. The lightweight, non-sticky texture feels comfortable on the lips, while the vibrant colors add a touch of glamour to any look.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth out-wards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000001183_33618.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001183_33618.jpg\", \"produits/1000001184_21762.jpg\", \"produits/1000001185_90114.jpg\", \"produits/1000001186_65453.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3210,'Over Glowy Tint #04 Baby OTTER Brown',NULL,54.000,'Experience the ultimate lip look with the Over Glowy Tint. This innovative formula combines the best of a lip gloss and a lip tint, providing a long-lasting, high-shine finish. The lightweight, non-sticky texture feels comfortable on the lips, while the vibrant colors add a touch of glamour to any look.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth out-wards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000001193_74394.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001193_74394.jpg\", \"produits/1000001194_14762.jpg\", \"produits/1000001195_94556.jpg\", \"produits/1000001196_75511.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3211,'Macqueen - Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint #01 Bare Mauve',NULL,54.000,'Achieve the ultimate in lip hydration and luminous color with Macqueen Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint. This luxurious lip tint is designed to provide a fresh, dewy finish while delivering intense moisture and vibrant color for a perfectly polished look.\r\n\r\nKey Features of the Macqueen Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint:\r\n\r\nDewy Finish: The innovative formula imparts a beautiful, dewy glow to your lips, giving them a fresh, radiant appearance. Enjoy a hydrated, plump look that enhances your natural beauty.\r\nHydrating Formula: Enriched with moisturizing ingredients, the Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint keeps your lips nourished and hydrated throughout the day. Say goodbye to dryness and hello to soft, supple lips.\r\nLightweight Texture: The lightweight, water-based formula glides on effortlessly, providing a smooth, comfortable feel without any stickiness. It offers a natural-looking sheen that enhances your lip color without overwhelming it.\r\nVibrant Color: Available in a range of stunning shades, this lip tint delivers rich, vibrant color with a single application. The buildable formula allows you to customize the intensity to suit your desired look.\r\nLong-Lasting Wear: Despite its dewy finish, the tint offers long-lasting color that stays vibrant throughout the day. Enjoy a fresh look from morning to night with minimal touch-ups.','Apply a moderate amount on the lips with the applicator included.','produits/1000001214_41647.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001214_41647.jpg\", \"produits/1000001215_12799.jpg\", \"produits/1000001216_41004.jpg\", \"produits/1000001217_38492.jpg\", \"produits/1000001218_33898.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3212,'Macqueen - Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint #03 Peach Dew',NULL,58.000,'Achieve the ultimate in lip hydration and luminous color with Macqueen Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint. This luxurious lip tint is designed to provide a fresh, dewy finish while delivering intense moisture and vibrant color for a perfectly polished look.\r\n\r\nKey Features of the Macqueen Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint:\r\n\r\nDewy Finish: The innovative formula imparts a beautiful, dewy glow to your lips, giving them a fresh, radiant appearance. Enjoy a hydrated, plump look that enhances your natural beauty.\r\nHydrating Formula: Enriched with moisturizing ingredients, the Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint keeps your lips nourished and hydrated throughout the day. Say goodbye to dryness and hello to soft, supple lips.\r\nLightweight Texture: The lightweight, water-based formula glides on effortlessly, providing a smooth, comfortable feel without any stickiness. It offers a natural-looking sheen that enhances your lip color without overwhelming it.\r\nVibrant Color: Available in a range of stunning shades, this lip tint delivers rich, vibrant color with a single application. The buildable formula allows you to customize the intensity to suit your desired look.\r\nLong-Lasting Wear: Despite its dewy finish, the tint offers long-lasting color that stays vibrant throughout the day. Enjoy a fresh look from morning to night with minimal touch-ups.','Apply a moderate amount on the lips with the applicator included.','produits/1000001223_89164.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001223_89164.jpg\", \"produits/1000001224_77365.jpg\", \"produits/1000001215_82329.jpg\", \"produits/1000001211_56640.jpg\", \"produits/1000001218_82014.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3213,'Macqueen - Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint #04 Rose Bonbon',NULL,68.000,'Achieve the ultimate in lip hydration and luminous color with Macqueen Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint. This luxurious lip tint is designed to provide a fresh, dewy finish while delivering intense moisture and vibrant color for a perfectly polished look.\r\n\r\nKey Features of the Macqueen Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint:\r\n\r\nDewy Finish: The innovative formula imparts a beautiful, dewy glow to your lips, giving them a fresh, radiant appearance. Enjoy a hydrated, plump look that enhances your natural beauty.\r\nHydrating Formula: Enriched with moisturizing ingredients, the Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint keeps your lips nourished and hydrated throughout the day. Say goodbye to dryness and hello to soft, supple lips.\r\nLightweight Texture: The lightweight, water-based formula glides on effortlessly, providing a smooth, comfortable feel without any stickiness. It offers a natural-looking sheen that enhances your lip color without overwhelming it.\r\nVibrant Color: Available in a range of stunning shades, this lip tint delivers rich, vibrant color with a single application. The buildable formula allows you to customize the intensity to suit your desired look.\r\nLong-Lasting Wear: Despite its dewy finish, the tint offers long-lasting color that stays vibrant throughout the day. Enjoy a fresh look from morning to night with minimal touch-ups.','Apply a moderate amount on the lips with the applicator included.','produits/1000001229_85192.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001229_85192.jpg\", \"produits/1000001230_27006.jpg\", \"produits/1000001224_11579.jpg\", \"produits/1000001217_25394.jpg\", \"produits/1000001218_38545.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3214,'peripera ink velvet lip tint #01 good brick',NULL,54.000,'Fall in love with your lips all over again. Peripera Ink the Velvet Lip Tint is the perfect way to add a touch of glamour to your everyday look.\r\n * Long-lasting: The formula is designed to stay on your lips for hours without fading or smudging.\r\n * High-pigmented: The intense color payoff allows for a bold lip look with just one swipe.\r\n * Velvety matte finish: The unique texture creates a soft, blurred effect on the lips, minimizing the appearance of fine lines.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth out-wards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000001240_81022.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001240_81022.jpg\", \"produits/1000001241_42198.png\", \"produits/1000001242_44074.jpg\", \"produits/1000001243_13428.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3215,'Lacto Soy Sebum &amp;amp;amp;amp; Blackhead Cleansing Oil',NULL,125.000,'Lacto Soy Sebum Blackhead Cleansing Oil is a gentle yet effective cleansing oil that helps remove blackheads and excess sebum. It is formulated with Lacto Soy, a blend of soy milk ferment filtrate and lactobacillus, which helps to detoxify the skin and boost moisture levels. The oil also contains vegetable oils and the brand patented Anti Sebum P, which helps to control oil production and improve pore condition.\r\nThis cleansing oil is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. It is also vegan and free of 28 potentially irritating ingredients.\r\nBenefits:\r\n Helps remove blackheads and excess sebum\r\n Detoxifies the skin\r\n Boosts moisture levels\r\n Controls oil production\r\n Improves pore condition\r\n Gentle and effective\r\n Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin\r\n Vegan and free of 28 potentially irritating ingredients','1. Shake for 4-5 times before use.\r\n2. Dispense an appropriate amount on hands and massage all over the face.\r\n3. After thorougly cleansing, rinse off with lukewarm water.','produits/1000001251_60682.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001251_60682.jpg\", \"produits/1000001253_89080.jpg\", \"produits/1000001254_26253.jpg\", \"produits/1000001255_30427.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3216,'VT - Reedle Shot 100 2 Step Mask',NULL,35.000,'VT\'s Reedle Shot 100 2 Step Mask is a two-step skincare routine designed to hydrate and soothe the skin. The first step contains CICA Reedle, a technology that mimics microneedling to deliver low-molecular active ingredients deep into the skin. The second step is a mask that locks in moisture and enhances the effectiveness of the first step.\r\nHere are some of the benefits of the VT Reedle Shot 100 2 Step Mask:\r\n * Hydrates and soothes the skin\r\n * Improves skin texture\r\n * Minimizes the appearance of pores\r\n * Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin','1. After washing your face in the evening, apply an appropriate amount of STEP 1 Reddle Shot to your face and spread it over your face.\r\n2. After STEP 1 Reedle Shot is absorbed, STEP 2 Open the Reedle Shot Mask and attach it to the skin.\r\n3. After resting for about 10 to 20 minutes, remove the mask sheet and lightly tap the remaining essence on the skin to absorb it.','produits/1000001266_30512.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001266_30512.jpg\", \"produits/1000001267_44490.jpg\", \"produits/1000001268_31349.jpg\", \"produits/1000001269_31396.png\", \"produits/1000001272_44115.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3217,'VT - Reedle Shot All In One 3 Step Mask',NULL,35.000,'The VT Reedle Shot All-In-One 3 Step Mask is a popular Korean skincare product that promises to hydrate and revitalize your skin. It consists of three steps:\r\nStep 1: Reedle Shot 300\r\nThis essence is formulated with hyaluronic acid and amino acids to hydrate and plump the skin. It also contains VT\'s patented CICA REEDLE&trade; technology, which uses micro-needles to help ingredients penetrate deeper into the skin.\r\nStep 2: Reedle Shot Mask\r\nThis sheet mask is infused with peptides, panthenol, and hyaluronic acid to further hydrate and soothe the skin. It also helps to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\nStep 3: Reedle Shot Cream\r\nThis cream locks in moisture and helps to repair the skin barrier. It also contains CICA REEDLE&trade; technology to help ingredients penetrate deeper into the skin.\r\nOverall, the VT Reedle Shot All-In-One 3 Step Mask is a great option for those looking to hydrate and revitalize their skin. It is gentle enough for daily use and can be used on all skin types.\r\nHere are some additional things to keep in mind:\r\n * The mask may cause a slight tingling sensation due to the CICA REEDLE&trade; technology. This is normal and should go away after a few minutes.\r\n * It is important to follow the instructions on the packaging carefully.\r\n * Be sure to use sunscreen during the day, as the mask may make your skin more sensitive to the sun.','1. Apply an appropriate amount of Reedle Shot 300 to the face after washing. Massage the formula across the face.\r\n2. After Reedle Shot 300 is fully absorbed, fix the sheet mask onto the face. Remove the mask after 10-20 minutes, lightly tapping the remaining essence into the skin.\r\n3. Apply an appropriate amount of the Reedle Shot Lifting Cream on the skin.','produits/1000001279_82884.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001279_82884.jpg\", \"produits/1000001280_37983.jpg\", \"produits/1000001281_32066.jpg\", \"produits/1000001282_36117.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3218,'Abib Hydration Gel Water Tube',NULL,140.000,'Quench your skin\'s thirst with Abib\'s Hydration Gel Water Tube. This lightweight, oil-free gel moisturizer delivers intense hydration without leaving a greasy residue. Perfect for oily and combination skin, it locks in moisture, leaving your skin soft, supple, and dewy.\r\nKey Benefits:\r\n * Lightweight and non-greasy\r\n * Intense hydration\r\n * Oil-free\r\n * Suitable for oily and combination skin\r\n * Dewy finish','1. Take a moderate amount and apply to the entire face.\r\n2. Gently pat for better absorption.','produits/1000001289_11227.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001289_11227.jpg\", \"produits/1000001290_66325.jpg\", \"produits/1000001291_19139.jpg\", \"produits/1000001292_26381.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3219,'haruharu wonder - Black Rice Moisture 5.5 Soft Cleansing Gel',NULL,120.000,'Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Moisture 5.5 Soft Cleansing Gel\r\nA gentle, hydrating cleanse for radiant skin.\r\nThis pH-balanced gel cleanser, infused with fermented black rice extract, gently removes impurities without stripping your skin\'s natural moisture barrier. Its soft, foamy texture leaves your skin feeling refreshed, hydrated, and nourished.\r\nKey benefits:\r\n * Gentle cleansing: Removes impurities without irritation\r\n * Hydrating formula: Keeps skin moisturized\r\n * Soothes and calms: Reduces redness and inflammation\r\n * Brightens skin: Promotes a radiant complexion\r\nPerfect for:\r\n * All skin types, especially sensitive and dry skin\r\nExperience the transformative power of fermented black rice with Haruharu Wonder\'s gentle and effective cleanser.','1. Take a moderate amount and lather up.\r\n2. Massage the face gently with rich foam and rinse off thoroughly with lukewarm water.','produits/1000001302_35993.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001302_35993.jpg\", \"produits/1000001305_19890.png\", \"produits/1000001304_80337.jpg\", \"produits/1000001303_97231.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3220,'Full fit Propolis Light Ampoule',NULL,111.000,'Give your skin a radiant boost with the COSRX Full Fit Propolis Light Ampoule. This lightweight, hydrating formula is packed with propolis extract, a natural bee product known for its soothing and nourishing properties.\r\nBenefits:\r\n * Deep Hydration: Quenches thirsty skin for a plump, dewy complexion.\r\n * Soothing Relief: Calms redness and irritation, leaving skin feeling comforted.\r\n * Radiant Glow: Promotes a healthy, luminous complexion.\r\n * Lightweight Texture: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue.','Apply evenly after cleansing and toning step. Gently massage and pat over entire face for quick absorption and proceed to moisturizer step','produits/1000001316_57730.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001316_57730.jpg\", \"produits/1000001317_96598.jpg\", \"produits/1000001318_10084.jpg\", \"produits/1000001319_28713.jpg\", \"produits/1000001320_27656.jpg\", \"produits/1000001321_76077.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3221,'Pure Fit Cica Cleanser',NULL,110.000,'The Pure Fit Cica Cleanser is formulated with a high concentration of Centella Asiatica extract, also known as cica, which is known for its soothing and healing properties. This makes it a great option for those with irritated or inflamed skin.\r\nThe cleanser has a creamy texture that lathers into a gentle foam. It effectively removes dirt, oil, and makeup without stripping the skin of its natural moisture. Many users appreciate its mildness and how it leaves their skin feeling clean and refreshed without any tightness or dryness.\r\nSome of the key benefits of the Pure Fit Cica Cleanser include:\r\n  Soothing and calming: The high concentration of cica helps to reduce redness and irritation.\r\n  Gentle cleansing: The creamy formula is gentle on the skin and does not disrupt the skin natural barrier.\r\n  Hydrating: The cleanser helps to maintain the skin moisture balance.\r\n Non comedogenic: It will not clog pores.','Gently massage the cleanser onto damp skin.\r\nRinse thoroughly with warm water.','produits/1000001331_20785.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001331_20785.jpg\", \"produits/1000001332_22893.jpg\", \"produits/1000001333_32745.jpg\", \"produits/1000001334_75729.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3222,'Glow Getter Essentials',NULL,500.000,'Elevate your beauty routine with this curated collection of must-have products. From nourishing your skin to enhancing your features, this bundle has it all.\r\nThis set includes: \r\n* K-secret Collagen Vita Secret Multi Balm\r\n* Cqmong Diamond Ampoule Mask\r\n* A\'pieu Pure Block Daily Sun Cream\r\n* Pinkflash Face Palette\r\n* Etude dear darling Oil Tint 06','CLSC hh','produits/IMG_20241129_133919_(540_x_720_pixel)_71772.jpg',NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241129_133919_(540_x_720_pixel)_71772.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3223,'Seoul 1988 Full skincare Routine',NULL,445.000,'K-Secret Seoul 1988 Bundle: Elevate Your Skincare Routine\r\nIndulge in the luxurious and transformative power of K-Secret Seoul 1988\'s skincare essentials with this curated bundle. Experience the perfect synergy of natural ingredients and innovative technology, meticulously crafted to address a spectrum of skin concerns and unveil a radiant complexion.\r\nBundle Includes:\r\n * SEOUL 1988 Essence: Infused with snail mucin and rice ferment filtrate, this essence provides deep hydration, soothes irritation, and preps your skin for optimal absorption of the following products.\r\n * SEOUL 1988 Serum: Enriched with retinal liposome and black ginseng extract, this serum targets wrinkles, pigmentation, and uneven skin tone, promoting a visibly firmer and brighter complexion.\r\n * SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream: This lightweight yet potent eye cream combats puffiness, dark circles, and fine lines around the delicate eye area, leaving you with a refreshed and rejuvenated look.\r\n * SEOUL 1988 Sleeping Mask: Deliver a surge of hydration and nourishment while you sleep, replenishing moisture and promoting a plump, radiant complexion upon waking.\r\nBenefits:\r\n * Hydration: Deeply moisturizes and replenishes skin for a supple and plump appearance.\r\n * Wrinkle Reduction: Minimizes the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles for a youthful complexion.\r\n * Brightening: Fades pigmentation and uneven skin tone for a more radiant complexion.\r\n * Protection: Protects against environmental stressors and harmful UV rays.\r\n * Renewal: Promotes cell turnover for a smoother, more refined skin texture.\r\nWhy Choose K-Secret Seoul 1988 Bundle:\r\n * Natural Ingredients: Formulated with a blend of natural extracts, botanicals, and peptides that work in harmony with your skin.\r\n * Clinically Proven: Backed by scientific research to ensure efficacy and safety.\r\n * Cruelty-Free: Committed to ethical practices and does not test on animals.\r\nElevate your skincare routine with the K-Secret Seoul 1988 Bundle and unlock the secret to a flawless, radiant complexion.','Vjb','produits/IMG_20241129_144357_(540_x_720_pixel)_67576.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241129_144357_(540_x_720_pixel)_67576.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-02-07 02:59:13','2025-02-07 02:59:13',0,NULL),(3224,'AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid','',130.000,'AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid is a gentle yet effective exfoliant that contains natural AHA from apple fruit water and glycolic acid, which helps remove whiteheads trapped inside pores and leaves the skin clear and soft. The liquid delivers vitamins, whitening agent and natural moisturising component into cleaned pores and will gradually improve skin healthy and bring acne prone skin back to normal, vibrant skin with a smooth and refined texture. <br>\r\nGreat for all skin types. Must be used with sunscreen in daylight. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing and toning, gently apply the liquid with clean hands or cotton pad by swiping a thin layer over the skin, concentrating on congested areas (such as the T-zone and chin) and over whiteheads and blemishes. Pat gently for full absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nIf the skin feels irritated, wash away after 4-5 minutes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nWhen it is completely absorbed into the skin, proceed with regular skincare steps and don\'t forget to apply sunscreen if used in daylight. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nIt\'s best to use as a serum in the evening due to its highly concentrated formulation. Begin using only once a week and once your skin has adjusted and doesn&rsquo;t show signs of irritation you can increase to two to three times a week to decrease the visibility of pores and treat blemishes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nAvoid using with highly concentrated vitamin C, vitamin A and other BHA/AHA products. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nYou can enhance the result by applying anti-oxidant serum or mask after using the AHA 7 Whitehead Power Liquid. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n***This product\'s high concentration of AHA (7%) may lead to a strong scent. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-1_53768.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-1_53768.jpg\", \"produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-2_86049.jpg\", \"produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-3_30534.jpg\", \"produits/AHA-7-Whitehead-Power-Liquid-4_77479.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3225,'Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream','',106.000,'Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream contains 92% snail secretion filtrate, giving it the slick texture of a gel and all the soothing, healing, and calming properties of mucin, that regenerates and repairs the skin. The cream is formulated to prevent breakouts and maintain skin elasticity, as well as leaving skin nourished, hydrated and healthy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Gently spread over the entire face in an upwards and outwards motion. Pat until fully absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-1_77380.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-1_77380.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-2_70087.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-3_18027.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-92-All-in-one-Cream-4_94075.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3226,'Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence','',128.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence is a concentrated hydrating essence that contains 4,000ppm of high purity natural hydrating Sodium Hyaluronate and offers intense hydration to your skin, boosts elasticity and recharges dehydrated skin. It also softens and moisturises bumpy and dry skin to be silky and smooth. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount on your entire face. Gently pat using fingertips to aid absorption, and then go forth with your serums and moisturisers. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-1_48485.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-1_48485.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-2_82846.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-3_57437.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Hydra-Power-Essence-4_14084.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3227,'Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence','',128.000,'Containing as much as 96% snail secretion filtrate, the advanced snail mucin essence from Korean beauty favorite COSRX adds intense moisture to hydrate skin while helping to repair damaged skin, improve skin texture, and reduce redness and pigmentation. <br>\r\nA popular ingredient in any Korean skin care routine, snail slime is known to benefit aging skin and soften the appearance of fine lines. Its moisturizing and healing properties also make it great to use in combination with retinol or Vitamin C serums. Other key ingredients in this COSRX snail essence include sodium hyaluronate, allantoin, panthenol and arginine, which provide additional hydrating and elasticity-enhancing effects. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount on your entire face, massaging in to problem areas. Gently pat using fingertips to aid absorption, and then go forth with your serums and moisturisers. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-1_34838.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-1_34838.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-2_70029.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-3_98272.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-96-Mucin-Power-Essence-4_97153.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3228,'Natural BHA Skin Returning Emulsion','',130.000,'COSRX Natural BHA Skin Returning Emulsion is formulated with 79.37% Centella Asiatica Leaf Water and 1% BHA, this lightweight lotion is designed to prevent further breakouts while soothing and hydrating the applied area. As a lightweight hydrating emulsion, this is the ideal moisturizer for those who want to mattify their oily skin surface, while keeping their skin hydrated. Natural BHAs aid in keeping your pores cleared of impurities like dead skin cells and excess sebum, so moisture isn’t simply being piled on top of a debris—your pores are kept clear from debris as your skin is hydrated. Centella Asiatica Extract Water is used as the base for the fomula for even more hydration than just mineral water. Hyaluronic acid also pitches in for optimal hydration while maintaining a light serum-like texture.','COSRX&nbsp;Natural BHA Skin Returning Emulsion&nbsp;is formulated with 79.37% Centella Asiatica Leaf Water and 1% BHA, this lightweight lotion is designed to prevent further breakouts while soothing and hydrating the applied area. As a lightweight hydrating emulsion, this is the ideal moisturizer for those who want to mattify their oily skin surface, while keeping their skin hydrated. Natural BHAs aid in keeping your pores cleared of impurities like dead skin cells and excess sebum, so moisture isn&rsquo;t simply being piled on top of a debris&mdash;your pores are kept clear from debris as your skin is hydrated. Centella Asiatica Extract Water is used as the base for the fomula for even more hydration than just mineral water. Hyaluronic acid also pitches in for optimal hydration while maintaining a light serum-like texture.','produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-1_85739.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-1_85739.jpg\", \"produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-2_93762.jpg\", \"produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-3_30970.jpg\", \"produits/cosrx-natural-bha-skin-returning-emulsion-4_30284.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3229,'Low pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser','',91.000,'This Low-pH Good Morning Gel Cleanser is a mildly acidic cleanser with the ideal balanced pH level of 56. Formulated with botanical skin-purifying ingredients and mild acids, it is gentle on the skin and makes skin supple and clear without stripping skins natural oils, leaving skin hydrated all day long. It makes the perfect morning cleanser for everyone. It is also formulated to remove light makeup and other oil-based residue so it can also be used at night. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n Skin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume :150 ml','Gently massage a small amount of this gel cleanser on wet skin and work into a lather. Rinse off with lukewarm water. Pat your face dry, and continue with your next skin care steps. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-1_39615.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-1_39615.jpg\", \"produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-2_65925.jpg\", \"produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-3_43060.jpg\", \"produits/Low-pH-Good-Morning-Gel-Cleanser-4_89445.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3230,'Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser','',107.000,'This COSRX Salicylic Acid Daily Gentle Cleanser is the perfect cleanser for acne prone skin. It is formulated with skin purifying botanical ingredients and salicylic acid to help remove dead skin cells, oil, blackheads and whiteheads, while providing moisture to the skin. It helps to reduce breakouts and leaves the skin soft and smooth. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 150 ml','1. Dispense a moderate amount into your hand.\r\n2. Add water and lather. Gently massage onto face and neck, avoiding eye area.\r\n3. Rinse off with lukewarm water. \r\n4. Pat your face dry, and continue with your next skin care steps.','produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-1_69546.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-1_69546.jpg\", \"produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-2_98325.jpg\", \"produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-3_48417.jpg\", \"produits/Salicylic-Acid-Daily-Gentle-Cleanser-4_60321.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3231,'Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream','',106.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream is an intensely hydrating cream filled with bountiful hydrating ingredients like sea-buckthorn, known as a vitamin tree, and hyaluronic acid that help boost hydration of the skin without feeling greasy or heavy. It also contains other active ingredients that help protecting the skin from dehydration while balancing the skin’s water and oil content. With sea buckthorn oil providing nourishing vitamins and amino acids, it’s an excellent antioxidant to help repair cells and slow signs of ageing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Sensitive','1. After cleansing, toning and using treatment products, apply a small amount and gently massage over the entire face in an upwards and outwards motion.\r\n2. Pat until fully absorbed.\r\n3.Follow with SPF during the day or use it as your last skincare step at night. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor better results, use the hyaluronic acid essence followed by hyaluronic acid cream.','produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Intensive-Cream-1_29070.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Intensive-Cream-1_29070.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Intensive-Cream-2_71622.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Intensive-Cream-3_30780.jpg\", \"produits/Hyaluronic-Acid-Intensive-Cream-4_72437.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3232,'Baking Powder BB Deep Cleansing Foam','',86.000,'ETUDE HOUSE Baking Powder BB Deep Cleansing Foam is a deep cleansing foam that removes dead skin cells and impurities from pores. This cleanser and exfoliator in one is formulated with fine baking powder and rice bran powder to remove any excess oil, even stubborn BB cream for a thorough cleanse. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Squeeze out an adequate amount and rub it to lather. Gently roll it over your face. Rinse it off thoroughly with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/aking-Powder-BB-Deep-Cleansing-Foam-1_60056.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/aking-Powder-BB-Deep-Cleansing-Foam-1_60056.jpg\", \"produits/aking-Powder-BB-Deep-Cleansing-Foam-2_64191.jpg\", \"produits/aking-Powder-BB-Deep-Cleansing-Foam-3_37219.jpg\", \"produits/aking-Powder-BB-Deep-Cleansing-Foam-4_48414.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3233,'Dear Darling Water Gel Tint - RD307 WATERMELON RED','',52.000,'The Etude House Dear Darling Water Gel Tint (Ice Cream) is a lip tint inspired by the delight of summer and ice cream to give your lips a refreshing burst of hydration and colour <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ Hydrating and long-lasting <br>\r\n✓ Does not dry out easily <br>\r\n✓ Spreads easily and smoothly','1. Adjust the amount of product on the tip of the applicator before use &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;a