mp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-1_84625.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-1_84625.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-2_47310.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-3_18404.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Cream-4_74392.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3236,'Brow Contour Pro','',177.000,'Define and highlight your brows with Benefit’s new Brow Contour Pro 4-in-1 Defining and Highlighting Brow Pencil! <br>\r\nThis multitasking brow pencil features a lighter and deeper brow shade to give your brows depth and dimension, plus an edge-definer and arch-highlighter to clean and shape your brows. Turn shapeless, flat-looking brows into defined, contoured brows, effortlessly.\r\n\r\nBrow Contour Pro is available in five shades for a wide range of hair colors and skin tones. The easy-to blend formula features up to 24 hours of long wear*, and is waterproof**.\r\n\r\n*Instrumental test on 20 women.\r\n**Instrumental test on 22 women.','A four-in-one defining and highlighting brow pencil to contour and carve out your perfect brow look.','produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder_15746.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder_15746.jpg\", \"produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder-2_80782.jpg\", \"produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder-3_79995.jpg\", \"produits/Brow-Pencil-&-Powder-4_43066.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3237,'Diamond Ampoule Sheet Mask Pack (10)','',90.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with One Pack (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br> \r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination,  Oily, Sensitive','1. Wash 