03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3241,'Secret Body Peeling Gel','',107.000,'Get Softer & Cleaner skin by peeling off the dead skin cells with natural ingredients! <br>\r\nSecret Body Peeling Gel makes your skin shines by peeling off the dead skin cells. White flower complex from eight different white flower extracts leaves your skin extra smooth with a natural glow. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✔ Easy exfoliating with light rolling! <br>\r\nEasy & Fast exfoliate; all you have to do is gently rolling it on your dry skin! Natural extracts leave your skin extra smooth with a natural glow <br>\r\n✔ Non-Chemical, Natural Exfoliator! <br>\r\nHave you experienced redness, dryness, irritation after exfoliate? <br>\r\nNatural extracts gently remove dead skin cells and dirt on your body <br>\r\n✔ Brighten up your skin! <br>\r\nBy removing dead skin cells, Brighten up your face, knee, heel wherever you want! Feel the difference after shower! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVolume : 200 ml','1.Before or after shower, apply a proper amount to dry skin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2.Gently massage it about 1 minute &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3.Rinse with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; night, daily','produits/K-Secret-Secret-Body-Peeling-Gel-1_77485.jpg',NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/K-Secret-Secret-Body-Peeling-Gel-1_77485.jpg\", \"produits/K-Secret-Secret-Body-Peeling-Gel-2_75891.jpg\", \"produits/K-Secret-Secret-Body-Peeling-Gel-3_34448.jpg\", \"produits/K-Secret-Secret-Body-Peeling-Gel-4_30799.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3242,'Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask','',169.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING <br>\r\n✵ Anti Aging and Brightening solution <br>\r\n✵ Highly concentrated collagen provides nutrition and elasticity to the skin while you are asleep <br>\r\n✵ Brightening effect of Vitamin Complex and skin regeneration <br>\r\n✵ Vitamin A, B7, C, E and B3 help to rejuvenate your tired skin, fade dark spots and discoloration while it is hydrating the skin deeply <br>\r\n✵ Glow Up <br>\r\n<br>\r\n☞ Formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type : Dry ,Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVolume : 60 ml\r\n','1. Apply sleeping mask across the face before bed. Gently rolling until vitamin capsules are absorbed completely &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Rinse off in the morning','produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-1_72311.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-1_72311.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-2_25838.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-3_39286.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Sleeping-Mask-4_64787.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3243,'Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Body Lotion','',98.000,'Lighten up your skin with Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Body Lotion! <br>\r\nVita Collagen nourishing body lotion brightens up your skin complexion while rejuvenating. It hydrates your skin without sticky residue. <br>\r\n✔ It contains 12 Vitamins!\r\nVitamin A, B1, B2, B5, B6, B9, B12, C, E, G, H, K these 12 vitamins help to lighten your skin and dark spots. It will boost the radiance of your skin and help to get flawless skin. <br>\r\n✔ Natural Whitening Effect <br>\r\nThis vita collagen whitening body lotion gives you a natural whitening effect goes well with your skin tone. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 200 ml','After shower, take a proper amount of this product and evenly spread it on the skin. Gently massage for better absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; night, daily','produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Body-Lotion-1_24933.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Body-Lotion-1_24933.jpg\", \"produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Body-Lotion-2_75494.jpg\", \"produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Body-Lotion-3_12505.jpg\", \"produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Body-Lotion-4_54737.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3244,'Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Bar','',38.000,'Lighten up your skin with Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Bar! It rejuvenates and clarifies the skin and helps to get glow and radiant skin from the inside out. Besides, it not only brightens up your skin, but also reduces wrinkles and fine lines. <br>\r\n✔ Contains 10 Vitamins! <br>\r\nVitamin A, B1, B2, B5, B6, B9, B12, C, E, H these 10 vitamins help to lighten your skin and dark spots. It will boost the radiance of your skin and help to get flawless skin. <br>\r\n✔ Hydrolyzed collagen for anti-aging. <br>  \r\nIt contains hydrolyzed collagen, which helps reducing sign of aging as it reduces wrinkles and improves skin elasticity and hydration. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 110 g','1. Lather the soap using a wet hand or the foamer &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;Br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Apply generously to the face and rinse well with lukewarm water. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;Br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nTips &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;Br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;Br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nIf there are extra dull spots on the skin, gently rub and massage using wet soap directly on the skin and rinse well with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; night, daily.','produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Bar-1_83944.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Bar-1_83944.jpg\", \"produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Bar-2_69465.jpg\", \"produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Bar-3_71746.jpg\", \"produits/Vita-Collagen-Secret-Whitening-Bar-4_74632.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3245,'Calamine 30 Days Secret Toner','',86.000,'Total solution for Oily & Combination Skin <br>\r\n# Tightening enlarged PORES <br>\r\n# Removing BLACKHEAD <br>\r\n# Calming reoccurring ACNE <br>\r\n# Brighten up your DULL SKIN <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCalamine Secret Toner which contains real Calamine powder 30,000ppm is effective for tightening enlarged pores, removing blackheads and calming acne. Especially for oily skin type, this toner makes your skin matte and clean. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nHave you worried about enlarged pores, reoccurring acne, excess sebum, cakey makeup, and dead skin cells? And strong chemical ingredients aggravate your sensitive skin? <br>\r\n✔ Calamine 30 days Secret the toner will be suitable for you. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 160 ml','1. Shake it gently before use to disperse the deposited calamine powder &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2.wipe it according to the texture of the skin by putting on a cotton swab. Or take on suitable amount to your hands and absorb it gently on your skin.\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/CALAMINE-30-DAYS-SECRET-TONER-1_16120.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/CALAMINE-30-DAYS-SECRET-TONER-1_16120.jpg\", \"produits/CALAMINE-30-DAYS-SECRET-TONER-2_47805.jpg\", \"produits/CALAMINE-30-DAYS-SECRET-TONER-3_82021.jpg\", \"produits/CALAMINE-30-DAYS-SECRET-TONER-4_78546.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3246,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Hydra Gel Mask',NULL,120.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Hydra Gel Mask has a gentle and gel-based texture with Triple Hyaluronic Acid and Platinum to provide instant hydration to the skin, and strengthen the skin barrier to retain moisture for a long-lasting effect, leaving you with soft and luminous skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Use after facial cleansing. Apply an adequate amount onto face (avoid eye and lip areas) using the inwards to outwards motion, gently massaging until fully absorbed. It can also be used as a sleeping mask. Recommended use: twice a week. Use daily for optimal results. No need to rinse off &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day or night &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nRecommended twice to three times a week',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3247,'Calamine Secret Sunblock','',78.000,'Total solution for SUN care on oily skin. <br>\r\n# Perfect protection from UV (SPF50+, PA++++) <br>\r\n# Soothing REDNESS (Calamine Effect) <br>\r\n# Natural BRIGHTENING <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCalamine Secret Sunblock with Pink Tone-up is a Triple functional cosmetic, \"brightening, anti-wrinkle, UV protection\". Besides, this sunblock soothes sunburnt skin with real calamine 15,000ppm. With SPF50+, PA++++, your skin is protected against UV rays and the lightweight texture allows you to reapply it several times for a day. Moreover, natural Tone-up effect makes your skin look brighter! —No white cast, the Natural brightening effect transforms your skin into soft radiant skin <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 50 ml','1. Put a proper amount of sunblock into your hands &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Apply sunblock on your face or body &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Feel bright and lightweight skin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt