;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Dap your face to make absorb well &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; night, daily.','produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-1_61539.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-1_61539.jpg\", \"produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-2_84030.jpg\", \"produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-3_49801.jpg\", \"produits/K-SECRET-CALAMINE-SECRET-SET-4_37511.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3252,'Advanced Regenerating Eye Gel Patches (RETINOL)',NULL,98.000,'Anti-wrinkle with Retinol: Pure vitamin A, Retinol stimulates the metabolism, working to improve skin structure and elasticity, reduce wrinkles.<br>\r\n✧ Big patches to cover more: Larger pieces deliver intensive care to wider skin area than standard eye patches.<br>\r\n✧ Small patches for areas in care-need: Smaller pieces provide intensive care to more specific areas as smile, frown, and neck. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 pcs /102g','1. After washing your face, apply toner to prepare balanced skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Using an enclosed spatula, place the patches on the skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n -Big patches: Place the bigger patches on the skin around the eyes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n  -Larger pieces deliver intensive care to wider skin area than standard eye patches. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n  -Small patches: Place the smaller patches on more specific areas as smile, frown and neck. They penetrate deep and fast to reduce the look of aging signs. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Remove the patches after 20~30 minutes, and gently pat skin for better absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nYou can use it day and/or night- daily','produits/IMG_20221218_003755_(540_x_720_pixel)_78513.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221218_003755_(540_x_720_pixel)_78513.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_004355_(540_x_720_pixel)_15263.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_004216_(540_x_720_pixel)_34771.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_004141_(540_x_720_pixel)_85894.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3253,'Yuja Niacin Brightening Moisture Gel Cream','',111.000,'Containing as much as 90% yuja extract alongside ten kinds of vitamins and glacial water, this gel cream revitalizes, brightens, moisturizes and soothes skin while fading freckles and blemishes.\r\n<br>\r\nThe Some By Mi Yuja Niacin Brightening Moisture Gel Cream, contains 90% of Yuja Extract to nourish and moisturize the skin. Yuja is a type of citrus that is rich in vitamins and effective for brightening. Niacinamide helps to brighten dark spots and dull skin. While 10 kinds of vitamins revitalize the skin and glacial water provides a cooling effect. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily','Apply a proper amount along skin texture evenly and pat gently for better absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-1_34853.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-1_34853.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-2_78934.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-3_96357.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-brightening-moisture-gel-cream-4_48980.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3254,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Toner','',91.000,'A skin-nourishing toner contains 65% of Propolis that boosts skins moisture level while improving skin texture and restores its balance. It preps the skin after cleansing and maximizes the benefits of the steps that follow. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, dispense a moderate amount of toner on a cotton pad and wipe gently along skin texture &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Propolis-B5-1_64583.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Propolis-B5-1_64583.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-2_24792.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-3_17900.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-4_55028.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3255,'Yuja Niacin 30 Days Miracle Brightening Toner','',107.000,'A dual functional product: Whitening + Anti-wrinkle. A serum containing Yuja extract and niacinamide to diminish the appearance of blemishes in 30 days. <br>\r\n✧ It revitalises dull skin and ease off skin stress with 12 types of Vitamins. <br>\r\n✧ It prevents the forming of melanin with Glutathione and Arbutin. <br>\r\n✧ It contains 5% of Niacinamide to brighten up skin and 82% of Korean Yuja Extract for brightening and moisturising. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily','After cleansing, apply a little to a cotton pad and wipe your face. Or apply toner with patting actions. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n✘ It is recommended to not use it in the morning in sunny and hot days because it contains high concentration of vitamin C (Yuja)','produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-1_91260.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-1_91260.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-2_23593.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-3_15324.jpg\", \"produits/yuja-niacin-30-days-miracle-brightening-toner-4_87423.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3256,'Bye Bye Blemish Vita Tox Brightening Bubble Cleanser','',89.000,'Some By Mi Vita Tox cleanser contains Vita Oxygen Bubbles to remove impurities, Goheung Yuja Extract, Jeju Green Tangerine Extract and 18 kinds of vitamins (including vitamin C capsules) to brighten the skin, and konjac granules to gently exfoliate and remove dead skin cells. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Apply a thin layer on a dry face as if applying a pack &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After sufficient bubbles appear, enjoy the bubble pack for 3~5 minutes and massage the face smoothly with a small amount of water to cleanse out the impurities &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Rinse it with warm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nRecommended at night, 2-3 times a week','produits/BYE-BYE-BLEMISH-VITA-TOX-1_70262.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/BYE-BYE-BLEMISH-VITA-TOX-1_70262.jpg\", \"produits/BYE-BYE-BLEMISH-VITA-TOX-2_18858.jpg\", \"produits/BYE-BYE-BLEMISH-VITA-TOX-3_86770.jpg\", \"produits/BYE-BYE-BLEMISH-VITA-TOX-4_42894.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3257,'Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Starter Kit','',128.000,'This four-step starter kit is infused with black snail extract and Truecica for a revitalizing, nourishing, regenerating and soothing finish <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✺ Snail Truecica Low pH Gel Cleanser: <br>\r\nA gentle cleanser to heal damaged skin and strengthen the skin barrier <br>\r\n✺ Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Toner: <br>\r\nProvides an instant boost of hydration and protects the skin from further damage <br> \r\n✺ Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Serum: <br>\r\nSoothes skin and reinforces skin barrier with Truecica™ as well as removes blemishes and scar with a non-sticky finish <br>\r\n✺ Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Cream: <br>\r\nSoothes, nourishes and helps strengthen the skin barrier and leaves your skin feeling soft and smooth. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Snail Gel Cleanser: Take a moderate amount on wet palms and lather. Massage gently onto the entire face and rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Miracle Toner: Smooth out along the skin texture with your fingertips, and cover your face with palms to help with absorption.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Snail Serum: Smooth out along the skin texture with your fingertips, and cover your face with palms to help with absorption.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Snail Cream: Apply an adequate amount evenly over the face. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit_65570.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit_65570.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit-01_12488.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit-3_94410.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Kit-4_39795.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3258,'Yuja Niacin 30 Days Brightening Starter Kit','',150.000,'New Clinical Solution !! <br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✔ Whitening + anti-wrinkle <br>\r\n✔ Lightens the skin with glutathione and arbutin.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n• Toner: Contains 90% citrus extract to nourish and\r\nmoisturize the skin. Restores irritated skin with 12 types of vitamins and lotus flower extract. <br>\r\n• Serum: Contains 82% citrus extract for lightening and moisturizing.  Thanks to its light texture, the skin is easily absorbed and leaves the skin without a sticky feeling. <br>\r\n• Gel cream: Contains 90% citrus extract to nourish and moisturize the skin. Restores skin with 10 types of vitamins and cools the skin with ice water.<br>\r\n• Sleeping Mask: Contains 70% citrus extract to nourish and moisturize the skin. Moisturizes the skin with Aquaxyl and Fructan ™ and revitalizes the skin with 10 types of vitamins. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily','1. Use in the order of toner &rarr; serum &rarr; cream &rarr; sleeping mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Apply a proper amount of the toner, serum and cream on the face evenly.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Before going to sleep, apply a proper amount on the face evenly and leave it until next day morning.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Wash your face with lukewarm water on the next morning. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Yuja-Niacin-30-Days-Brightening-Starter-Kit-4-items-1_82198.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Yuja-Niacin-30-Days-Brightening-Starter-Kit-4-items-1_82198.jpg\", \"produits/Yuja-Niacin-30-Days-Brightening-Starter-Kit-4-items-2_37378.jpg\", \"produits/Yuja-Niacin-30-Days-Brightening-Starter-Kit-4-items-3_56347.jpg\", \"produits/Yuja-Niacin-30-Days-Brightening-Starter-Kit-4-items-4_65013.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3259,'SOME BY MI - SUPER MATCHA PORE CARE STARTER KIT','',128.000,'The ideal skin routine for pore tightening is here! Set includes Super Matcha Pore Clean Cleansing Gel, Tightening Toner, Tightening Serum and Clean Clay Mask all enriched with matcha water, natural BHA from white willow bark and glacier water to target various pore concerns such as excess sebum, dead skin cells, blackheads and pore elasticity. This skin routine is designed to leave skin purified, clear and refreshed. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n❧ Super Matcha Cleansing Foam:  <br>\r\nRemoves buildups in pores with micellar particles and smoothes out skin texture <br>\r\n❧ Pore Tightening Toner: <br>\r\nAbsorbs excess sebum and effectively controls sebum production with Sebum Controlling Powder™ <br>\r\n❧ Pore Tightening Serum: <br>\r\nSoothes, moisturizes and helps improve pore elasticity leaving a smooth and baby-like complexion <br>\r\n❧ Pore Clean Clay Mask: <br>\r\nAbsorbs impurities and unclogs pores while offering moisture and soothing care to skin <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Super Matcha Pore Clean Cleansing Gel: Lather up a proper amount and gently massage over face. Rinse off with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Super Matcha Pore Clean Clay Mask: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n⋆ Apply a proper amount evenly to dry face avoiding eye and lip areas &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n⋆ Rinse off thoroughly with lukewarm water after 10-20 minutes when the mask becomes dry &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day or night, once or twice a week &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Super Matcha Pore Tightening Toner: Shake well, soak cotton pads with a proper amount of toner and gently wipe over skin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Super Matcha Pore Tightening Serum: Apply a proper amount to toned skin and pat gently for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/SOME-BY-MI---SUPER-MATCHA-PORE-CARE-1_51564.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/SOME-BY-MI---SUPER-MATCHA-PORE-CARE-1_51564.jpg\", \"produits/SOME-BY-MI---SUPER-MATCHA-PORE-CARE-2_59651.jpg\", \"produits/SOME-BY-MI---SUPER-MATCHA-PORE-CARE-3_95555.jpg\", \"produits/SOME-BY-MI---SUPER-MATCHA-PORE-CARE-4_44298.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3260,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Cream','',122.000,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Cream is a skin-nourishig moisturiser targeting troubled skin, irritated skin, dehydrated as well as oily skin. Packed with propolis, Vitamin B5, Manuka honey, Royal jelly, Ceramide, Hyaluronic acid and SOME BY MI\'s Truecica™, this moisturizer offers anti-inflammatory effect, calms acne, smooths wrinkles and creates glowing skin by strengthening the skin\'s immune system to solve multi-problems of the skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Take an appropriate amount and spread evenly onto the skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM-1_92460.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM-1_92460.jpg\", \"produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM-2_79918.jpg\", \"produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM3_14535.jpg\", \"produits/PROPOLIS-B5-GLOW-BARRIER-CALMING-CREAM-4_90621.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3261,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Serum','',104.000,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Serum is a nutritious serum especially designed for tired, unbalanced skin. <br> \r\nStarring propolis, royal jelly, honey, 24K gold, Vitamin B5, patented ingredient Truecica, ceramide and hyaluronic acid, this serum balances skin sebum levels, calms and fortifies skin to prevent breakouts and promote a healthy complexion. <br> \r\nIt helps with skin irritation, dehydration and tiredness to calm the skin and make it glowy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After using toner, apply an appropriate amount and spread gently across the entire face. Pat lightly until absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-1_44009.jpg',NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-1_44009.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-p_33907.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-2_81363.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Serum-4_39761.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3262,'POWmade Brow Pomade Full-pigment brow pomade','',130.000,'36-hour brow pomade to fill, sculpt & define brows <br>\r\nWaterproof, smudge-proof formula won’t dry out! <br>\r\nBuilt in brush wiper for clean, controlled application <br>\r\nAvailable 4.5 - Neutral deep brown and 04 - Warm deep brown <br>','ggggggszss','produits/Benetint-Cheek-3_89368.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Benetint-Cheek-3_89368.jpg\