ing down lashes.','produits/IMG_20230119_212126_(540_x_720_pixel)_93862.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_212126_(540_x_720_pixel)_93862.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_212143_(540_x_720_pixel)_55788.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_212150_(540_x_720_pixel)_34744.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_212223_(540_x_720_pixel)_42170.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3265,'Roller Liner Matte Liquid Eyeliner','',120.000,'jjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjj','hhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3266,'Brow Microfilling Pen','',135.000,'A pen for the microbladed look made easy that creates the illusion of natural brow hair with three ultrafine lines in a single stroke.','A pen for the microbladed look made easy that creates the illusion of natural brow hair with three ultrafine lines in a single stroke.','produits/IMG_20230119_204650_(540_x_720_pixel)_31262.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_204650_(540_x_720_pixel)_31262.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_204702_(540_x_720_pixel)_52514.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_204742_(540_x_720_pixel)_90897.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_204753_(540_x_720_pixel)_30704.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3267,'24-HR Brow Setter Clear Brow Gel','',78.000,'Offering up to 24 hours of strong, flexible hold, this invisible-finish shaping and setting gel tames unruly eyebrow hairs and locks in make up so that brows don’t pull a disappearing act. The custom-moulded, dual-sided wand coats hairs from root to tip with the flake-free formula, making application effortless and long-lasting.','Offering up to 24 hours of strong, flexible hold, this invisible-finish shaping and setting gel tames unruly eyebrow hairs and locks in make up so that brows don&rsquo;t pull a disappearing act. The custom-moulded, dual-sided wand coats hairs from root to tip with the flake-free formula, making application effortless and long-lasting.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3268,'Benefit Rockateur Blush',NULL,156.000,'Pick up the beat with a rush of heat! Benefit Cosmetics rocking rose gold cheek powder gives a famously provocative flush that turns heads on-stage and off.<br>\r\n The crowd will go wild for it is sexy faceted design, accented in luxe gold. For an encore, the custom angled, dimensional brush gives rich, show-stopping payoff every time.<br>','Pick up the beat with a rush of heat! Benefit Cosmetic\'s rockin\' rose gold cheek powder gives a famously provocative flush that turns heads on-stage and off. The crowd will go wild for it\'s sexy faceted design, accented in luxe gold. For an encore, the custom angled, dimensional brush gives rich, show-stopping payoff every time.','produits/IMG_20230119_205215_(540_x_720_pixel)_24630.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_205215_(540_x_720_pixel)_24630.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205232_(540_x_720_pixel)_84790.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205241_(540_x_720_pixel)_43081.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205248_(540_x_720_pixel)_83288.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3269,'Benefit Hoola  Glow Bronzer',NULL,156.000,'An award winning <br> silky soft powder bronzer with a natural looking finish','An award-winning, silky-soft powder bronzer with a natural-looking matte finish','produits/IMG_20230119_210741_(540_x_720_pixel)_65334.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_210741_(540_x_720_pixel)_65334.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_210807_(540_x_720_pixel)_88591.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_210912_(540_x_720_pixel)_39461.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_210940_(540_x_720_pixel)_47626.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3270,'Benefit Hoola Matte Bronzer',NULL,156.000,'Bronze you skin in areas that you need a darker contour in the new hoola bronzer in toatsted <br>Perfect for sculting contouring <br> and best of all it comes with a mini brush on the bottom of the compact','Bronze you skin in areas that you need a darker contour in the new hoola bronzer in toatsted. Perfect for sculting, contouring and best of all it comes with a mini brush on the bottom of the compact.','produits/IMG_20230119_210225_(540_x_720_pixel)_30665.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_210225_(540_x_720_pixel)_30665.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_210240_(540_x_720_pixel)_51633.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_210332_(540_x_720_pixel)_75425.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_210407_(540_x_720_pixel)_59584.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3271,'Benefit Georgia Golden Peach Blush',NULL,156.000,'Benefits cult favorite golden peach blush is back and sweeter than ever! The NEW Georgia is a warm, vibrant peach shade with a soft, golden shimmer for a fresh-picked flush.<br> Peachy cheeks are always in season!','Benefit&rsquo;s cult-favorite golden peach blush is back and sweeter than ever! The NEW Georgia is a warm, vibrant peach shade with a soft, golden shimmer for a fresh-picked flush. Peachy cheeks are always in season!','produits/IMG_20230119_205625_(540_x_720_pixel)_25393.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_205625_(540_x_720_pixel)_25393.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205638_(540_x_720_pixel)_72393.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205655_(540_x_720_pixel)_49851.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_205707_(540_x_720_pixel)_99893.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3272,'Brightening Pore Serum',NULL,165.000,'It is a lightweight, high-performance brightening serum with a Jeju Tangerine and vitamin-infused formula that delivers an instantly more radiant, hydrated glow—without the stickiness. \r\n<br>\r\n❃ Jeju Tangerine Peel Extract: helps reveal clearer, more radiant complexion with improved look of firmness around the pores. <br>\r\n❃ Triple Vitamin Complex: a well-balanced cocktail of Vitamin C Derivative, B3, and B5 provides a powerful brightening effect for complexion. <br>\r\n❃A lightweight, high-performance brightening serum with a Jeju Tangerine and vitamin-infused formula that delivers an instantly more radiant, hydrated glow—without the stickiness. <br>\r\n❃ Niacinamide (Vitamin B3): helps visibly brighten. <br>\r\n❃ Vitamin C Derivative (EAE): helps with dull, uneven tone & antioxidant protection. <br>\r\n❃ Panthenol (Vitamin B5): soothes + helps protect skin’s moisture barrier. <br>\r\n❃ Hyaluronic Acid: fast-absorbing, instant hydration. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. After cleansing and toning, pump the product one to two times into your palm &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Gently smooth onto the face and neck &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Apply an additional layer onto areas of concern, such as dark spots &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20221225_184511_(540_x_720_pixel)_87233.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221225_184511_(540_x_720_pixel)_87233.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_184531_(540_x_720_pixel)_53389.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_185503_(540_x_720_pixel)_80589.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_185721_(540_x_720_pixel)_93705.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3273,'Green Tea Seed Serum Special Set',NULL,189.000,'The Green Tea Seed Serum Special Set for moisture barrier strengthening solution helps to care skin surfaces environment balance. <br>\r\nGreen Tea Seed Serum Special Set contains:<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGreen Tea Foam Cleanser: <br>\r\nRefreshing and hydrating cleansing foam with Jeju green tea extract while it whisks away dirt and impurities <br>\r\n<br>\r\nGreen Tea Seed Serum <br>\r\nA daily serum with organic Jeju green tea and green tea seeds that hydrate while creating a strong moisture barrier for your skin. Rich in amino acids and minerals, this nourishing serum strengthen and brighten your skin tone, while preventing moisture loss..<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGreen Tea Seed Cream: <br>\r\nFormulated with organic Jeju green tea extract and green tea seed oil, this soft cream delivers refreshing hydration while keeping its moisture level and giving a healthy-looking glow.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Green Tea Foam Cleanser &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nSqueeze an appropriate amount and lather up. Smoothly massage over your face and thoroughly rinse with lukewarm water.\r\n2. Green Tea Seed Serum &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nApply an appropriate amount onto thoroughly cleansed face and neck then gently smooth for better absorption.\r\n\r\n3. Green Tea Seed Cream &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nApply an appropriate amount over face and neck then gently smooth for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20230115_201129_(540_x_720_pixel)_27728.png',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_201129_(540_x_720_pixel)_27728.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_201202_(540_x_720_pixel)_39265.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_201224_(540_x_720_pixel)_38930.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3274,'Brightening Pore Serum Set',NULL,220.000,'A Brightening Pore Serum Set formulated with Hallabong peel extract and vitamin derivatives helps with hydration, brightening care and pores for a softer feeling skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBrightening Pore Serum Set contains: <br>a\r\nBrightening Pore Serum (30ml) + Brightening Pore Priming Cream (20ml) + Brightening Pore Spot Treatment (7ml) <br>\r\n<br>\r\n1.Brightening Pore Serum Set formulated with Jeju Hallabong for hydrating+brightening+firming around pores <br>\r\nSkin’s moisture level increases right after use and skin looks brighter and healthier with smoother skin around the pores and clear and even complexion after using the product for 6 weeks. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n2.Synergy of 10% triple vitamin derivative and hyaluronic acid <br>\r\nContains vitamin B3 derivative for intensive melanin care, vitamin C derivative and B5 derivate helps skin to look healthy and hyaluronic acid moisturizes skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','[Brightening Pore Serum] Turn per to use/apply product. This helps to achieve better results by applying the same amount every time. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\n[Brightening Pore Priming Cream] Apply desired amount on face at the last step of skincare. Apply on areas with visible pores for a softer, smoother skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\n[Brightening Pore Spot Treatment] Apply on areas with all over skin or richly apply on concerned spots. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_44381669396631529_38312.png',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_44381669396631529_38312.png\", \"produits/IMG_44371669396631528_78981.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3275,'Brightening Pore Facial Cleanser',NULL,105.000,'A daily facial cleanser, formulated with triple vitamin derivatives and Jeju Hallabong peel extract, removes impurities effectively while leaving the skin hydrated for a long time, even after cleansing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✴ A powerful synergy of triple vitamin derivatives <br>\r\nA well-balanced combination of triple vitamin derivatives (B3, C, and B5) provides powerful, brightening benefits. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✴ Jeju Hallabong peel extract for a firmer and clearer skin <br>\r\nFormulated with Jeju Hallabong peel extract obtained through an ultrasonic extraction method contains bioflavonoids and active ingredients that help improve skin\'s firmness and help reveal a clear, healthy complexion. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✴ Soft, moisture-filled cleansing foam that leaves the skin feeling hydrated <br>\r\nThis creamy and soft foaming cleanser removes impurities effectively, while leaving the skin hydrated for a long time even after cleansing <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Pour desired amount on hand to lather. Gently massage on face and wash with lukewarm water.'