;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230115_195909_(540_x_720_pixel)_41385.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_195909_(540_x_720_pixel)_41385.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_195931_(540_x_720_pixel)_95389.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_195945_(540_x_720_pixel)_38135.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_195953_(540_x_720_pixel)_53998.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_200008_(540_x_720_pixel)_63388.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3280,'Pore Clearing Clay Mask 2X with Super Volcanic Clusters',NULL,130.000,'It is a deep-cleansing, non-drying creamy clay mask—formulated with absorbent Jeju Super Volcanic Clusters™ and AHA—that helps clear pores while it exfoliates. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis global best-selling clay mask helps: <br> \r\n☘ Minimize the look of pores <br>\r\n☘ Absorb sebum <br> \r\n☘ Gently exfoliate <br> \r\n☘ Deeply cleanse <br> \r\n☘ Even skin tone <br> \r\n☘ Cleanse pollution particles <br> \r\n<br> \r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Smooth onto clean, dry skin, avoiding the eye and lip areas &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n- Leave on for 15 to 20 minutes, until dry &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;  \r\n- Rinse with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day or night, once or twice a week','produits/IMG_20230115_013049_(540_x_720_pixel)_73642.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_013049_(540_x_720_pixel)_73642.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_013127_(540_x_720_pixel)_37390.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_013159_(540_x_720_pixel)_27280.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_013223_(540_x_720_pixel)_93231.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3281,'Collagen Boosting Secret Day Cream',NULL,126.000,'Collagen Day Cream not only hydrates the skin but also helps with wrinkle care and UV protection at once <br>\r\n✦ All-in-one product that helps to protect the skin from powerful UV rays with SPF50+ PA++++ while reducing wrinkles and pigmentation. <br>\r\n✦ Formulated with Collagen and Peptide to give firming, moisturizing and brightening effects, regenerate damaged skin and improve skin elasticity <br>\r\n✦ Contains 8 Hyaluronic Acid Complex that helps to prompt skin to make more collagen, hydrating dry skin and reduce wrinkles and fine lines. <br>\r\n✦ Non-sticky, lightweight texture adheres to the face highly without any greasy feeling. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nA new concept of skin care that combines UV PROTECTION and SKINCARE <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 ml','At the last step of skincare, take an appropriate amount. Apply gently onto the face and spread evenly. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it in the morning, daily.','produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-1_48783.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-1_48783.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-02_93624.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-2_83615.jpg\", \"produits/Collagen-Boosting-Secret-Day-Cream-3_10323.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3282,'Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Sun Lotion',NULL,88.000,'Let your skin glow and moist with whitening UV protection <br>\r\nThis sun lotion contains 11 vitamins, Niacinamide, Hydrolyzed Collagen, and Hyalorunic Acid. It protects the skin barrier, prevents wrinkles and improves skin elasticity. Besides, it is anti inflammatory and antioxidant. It also whitens the skin, soothes, and strengthens it. <Br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 50 ml','At the last step of skincare, take an appropriate amount. Apply gently onto the face and spread evenly &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it in the morning, daily &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nGenerally, sunscreen / sunblock should be reapplied every two hours, especially after swimming or sweating. If you work indoors and sit away from windows, you may not need a second application. Be mindful of how often you step outside, though. Keep a spare bottle of sunscreen at your desk just to be safe.','produits/IMG_20221218_102019_(540_x_720_pixel)_73629.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221218_102019_(540_x_720_pixel)_73629.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_102036_(540_x_720_pixel)_67508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_102052_(540_x_720_pixel)_55552.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_102117_(540_x_720_pixel)_46088.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3283,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow #RD301',NULL,50.000,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow is a lip color that combines the high shine of a gloss and the moisturizing feel of an oil for cherry lips that look plump and juicy. It has an excellent adhesive power that fits lightly without smudging and stickiness. <br>\r\nJust glow like as a star!','Apply a moderate amount from inside to outside lips gently',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3284,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow #OR202',NULL,50.000,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow is a lip color that combines the high shine of a gloss and the moisturizing feel of an oil for cherry lips that look plump and juicy. It has an excellent adhesive power that fits lightly without smudging and stickiness. <br>\r\nJust glow like as a star!','Apply a moderate amount from inside to outside lips gently',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3285,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow #OR201',NULL,50.000,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow is a lip color that combines the high shine of a gloss and the moisturizing feel of an oil for cherry lips that look plump and juicy. It has an excellent adhesive power that fits lightly without smudging and stickiness. <br>\r\nJust glow like as a star!','Apply a moderate amount from inside to outside lips gently',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3286,'Watsons Colour changeable lip balm Peach Scented',NULL,49.000,'The sweet peach fragrance is specially designed for gorgeous and healthy-looking lips, with unique colour changes from transparent to a peachy pink. It also moisturises, protects and soothes your lips.','Smoothly evenly on lips 2-3 times whenever required. The colour change effect depends on the individual pH of your lips','produits/IMG_20230122_234458_(540_x_720_pixel)_14071.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230122_234458_(540_x_720_pixel)_14071.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230122_234513_(540_x_720_pixel)_94733.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230122_234528_(540_x_720_pixel)_14698.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230122_234541_(540_x_720_pixel)_79416.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3287,'HOLIKA HOLIKA Heart Crush Glow Tint Air #BUBBLY',NULL,65.000,'Heart Crush Glow Tint Air is formulated with different moisturizing and nourishing ingredients for healthy-looking lips. It is infused with pure color pigments that deliver vibrant and long-lasting colors. The Bullet Tip makes it easier to control the amount used for a light, airy effect.','1. Apply an appropriate amount onto lips with a flat surface\r\n2. Blend the edges with the tip',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3288,'HOLIKA HOLIKA Water Drop Tint Bomb #10 Peach Water',NULL,65.000,'Holika Holika Water Drop Tint Bomb is a moisturizing lip tint that contains 40% refreshing, toning spring water that glides on the lips smoothly with vivid color payoff and watery light consistency.','Apply on the entire lips along the lips line or on the center of the lips in a tapping motion to express gardation',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3289,'HOLIKA HOLIKA Water Drop Tint Bomb #04 Grapefruit',NULL,65.000,'Holika Holik