ponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221224_164128_(540_x_720_pixel)_28346.png\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_164150_(540_x_720_pixel)_90224.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_164238_(540_x_720_pixel)_25121.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_164355_(540_x_720_pixel)_23134.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3292,'Sebum Soak Pact',NULL,60.000,'Powder made up of sebum-friendly ingredients absorbs sebum quickly to create soft skin. <br>\r\n✾ Smart pact that only absorbs sebum <br>\r\n✾ Non-drying sebum control <br>\r\n✾ Secret to bright glossy skin <br>\r\n✾ Sebum-friendly ingredients <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','Put an appropriate amount on the built-in puff and gently pat onto the face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nIt can be used alone after skin care or at the stage of makeup &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;be&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/IMG_20221224_164459_(540_x_720_pixel)_39203.jpg',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221224_164459_(540_x_720_pixel)_39203.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_190541_(540_x_720_pixel)_48664.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_212315_(540_x_720_pixel)_95806.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_212427_(540_x_720_pixel)_28798.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3293,'Better Lips-Talk #RD313 Wannaba Red',NULL,65.000,'Velvet Lips-Talk gives vivid color and adheres lightly to the lips with matte finish. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ High pigmented lipstick with various vivid, clear color and magnetic case. <br>\r\n✓ Provides smooth application that gently adheres on the lips without any lumps. <br>\r\n✓ Forms moisture-protective barrier to keep the lips moisturized.','Gently apply a moderate amount on the entire lips',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3294,'Face Blur Smoothing',NULL,150.000,'This liquid primer instantly smooths complexion and creates a flawless base for your makeup while also protecting skin from free radicals with fitted SPF. The Smoothing version is fitted with Baby Pixel powder, Cover Powder and Airy Skin powder for a bright, pinkish finish that minimizes pores. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n● A lightweight makeup base that covers skin flaws, smooths and brightens your complexion with UV protection. <br>\r\n● It helps brighten the skin, reduce wrinkles and block UV rays with SPF33 PA++. <br>\r\n● Baby Pixel Powder and Cover Powder helps smooth your skin and minimizes the appearance of pores. <br>\r\n● Airy Skin Powder maintains a radiant and refined skin texture with a shimmery coral base. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','Before face makeup, apply an appropriate amount on face and spread evenly &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230110_021031_(540_x_720_pixel)_19618.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230110_021031_(540_x_720_pixel)_19618.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230110_021057_(540_x_720_pixel)_32694.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230110_021359_(540_x_720_pixel)_60808.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230110_021534_(540_x_720_pixel)_20200.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3295,'Zero Sebum Drying Powder',NULL,52.000,'The Etude House Zero Sebum Drying Powder, a translucent mineral powder, contains 80% mineral that controls sebum production, minimizes pores, and makes skin look clear and matte without clumps. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After applying skin care or makeup, dab the product on areas with excess oil &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\nFOR GREASY HAIR: Apply it on roots and shake off residue for fresher-looking hair &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\nUSE AS EYE PRIMER: Apply this powder on your eyelids for your eye makeup to stay without smudging','produits/IMG_20221224_144321_(540_x_720_pixel)_74749.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221224_144321_(540_x_720_pixel)_74749.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_144609_(540_x_720_pixel)_85748.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_144548_(540_x_720_pixel)_20769.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_144507_(540_x_720_pixel)_48037.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3296,'Fixing Tint #01 Analog Rose',NULL,54.000,'Guaranteed to stay put on your lips all day without rubbing off on face masks, this lip tint comes in a matte yet non-drying formula and boasts a lightweight texture that adheres perfectly to lips <br>\r\nApply and dry for 60 seconds, then you’re good to go!','For a full cover, apply a moderate amount along the edge of lips and then fill in the inner part &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards','produits/IMG_20221221_210239_(540_x_720_pixel)_64866.jpg',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_