Fit Concealer PRO #Light Vanilla',NULL,60.000,'Liquid concealer comes in different shades to fit a range of skin tones from warm to neutral and cool. Formula adheres well to skin to create an even skin tone for the rest of your makeup. It adheres well to create even skin tone and long-lasting clean finish.','Apply on desired areas after applying makeup base, foundation or BB cream. Gently blend and tap with fingers to set in','produits/IMG_20221222_013021_(540_x_720_pixel)_49704.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221222_013021_(540_x_720_pixel)_49704.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221222_013635_(540_x_720_pixel)_43081.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221222_013708_(540_x_720_pixel)_91080.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221222_014005_(540_x_720_pixel)_69775.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3301,'Fixing Tint #05 Midnight Mauve',NULL,54.000,'Guaranteed to stay put on your lips all day without rubbing off on face masks, this lip tint comes in a matte yet non-drying formula and boasts a lightweight texture that adheres perfectly to lips <br>\r\nApply and dry for 60 seconds, then you’re good to go!','For a full cover, apply a moderate amount along the edge of lips and then fill in the inner part &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards','produits/IMG_20221221_211200_(540_x_720_pixel)_50659.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221221_211200_(540_x_720_pixel)_50659.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221221_211223_(540_x_720_pixel)_51312.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221221_211249_(540_x_720_pixel)_90356.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221221_211304_(540_x_720_pixel)_84992.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3302,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Mask',NULL,94.000,'This nourishing wash-off mask contains 570,000ppm of Pro-Panthenol™ (made of propolis and panthenol) to strengthen the skin barrier, and 100,000ppm of honey extract and Truecica™ to calm and glow up skin. Additional ingredients of manuka honey, chestnut honey and canola honey further nourish skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. After washing the face, apply the product to a dry face. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Gently rinse it off with lukewarm water after 5~10 minutes &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Mask-1_20349.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Mask-1_20349.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Mask-2_28347.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Mask-3_12271.jpg\", \"produits/Propolis-B5-Glow-Barrier-Calming-Mask-4_16982.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3303,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Starter Kit',NULL,136.000,'Get glowy and healthy skin with SOME BY MI’s Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Starter Kit containing the line’s Oil To Foam cleanser, Toner, Serum and Cream. <br>\r\n❋ The two-in-one cleanser features honey oil, Vitamin B5, propolis and Truecica™ to remove makeup, dirt and impurities in pores. <br>\r\n❋ The gentle toner containing 65% propolis restores skin balance and leaves skin soft and hydrated. <br>\r\n❋ The serum features Royal Gold Honey Rx™ and Truecica™ to calm and nourish skin. <br>\r\n❋ The cream is packed with Pro-panthenol™, manuka honey and royal jelly to offer anti-inflammatory effects while providing barrier care. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Dispense appropriate amount of Oil To Foam Cleanser onto a dry face and gently massage to remove makeup. Apply a small amount of water for oil to transform into a rich foam, and massage on the face to thoroughly cleanse pore impurities. Rinse with lukewarm water. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Take an appropriate amount of the toner and spread evenly onto the skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. After using the toner, take an appropriate amount of the cream, apply it gently all over the face, and pat lightly for absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Massage the cream into the face as the last step of your basic skincare routine. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230117_010212_(540_x_720_pixel)_94980.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230117_010212_(540_x_720_pixel)_94980.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230117_010232_(540_x_720_pixel)_38006.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230117_010246_(540_x_720_pixel)_17055.jpg\", \"produits/some-by-mi-propolis-b5-glow-barrier-calming-starter-kit-boniik-kbeauty-australia-2_800x_62612.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230117_010815_(540_x_720_pixel)_69090.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3304,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Starter Kit',NULL,176.000,'Get glowy and healthy skin with SOME BY MI’s Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Starter Kit containing the line’s Oil To Foam cleanser, Toner, Serum and Cream. The two-in-one cleanser features honey oil, Vitamin B5, propolis and Truecica™ to remove makeup, dirt and impurities in pores. The gentle toner containing 65% propolis restores skin balance and leaves skin soft and hydrated. The serum features Royal Gold Honey Rx™ and Truecica™ to calm and nourish skin. The cream is packed with Pro-panthenol™, manuka honey and royal jelly to offer anti-inflammatory effects while providing barrier care. All products are suitable for sensitive skin.','Get glowy and healthy skin with SOME BY MI&rsquo;s Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Starter Kit containing the line&rsquo;s Oil To Foam cleanser, Toner, Serum and Cream. The two-in-one cleanser features honey oil, Vitamin B5, propolis and Truecica&trade; to remove makeup, dirt and impurities in pores. The gentle toner containing 65% propolis restores skin balance and leaves skin soft and hydrated. The serum features Royal Gold Honey Rx&trade; and Truecica&trade; to calm and nourish skin. The cream is packed with Pro-panthenol&trade;, manuka honey and royal jelly to offer anti-inflammatory effects while providing barrier care. All products are suitable for sensitive skin.','produits/IMG_20230117_010212_(540_x_720_pixel)_13361.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230117_010212_(540_x_720_pixel)_13361.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230117_010232_(540_x_720_pixel)_53467.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230117_010246_(540_x_720_pixel)_55770.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230117_010357_(540_x_720_pixel)_65686.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3305,'Extra Illuminating Eye Gel Patches (VITAMIN C)',NULL,98.000,'Anti-dark circle with Vitamin C: The antioxidant powerhouse, Vitamin C helps to brighten skin tone and reduce uneven pigmentation by preventing melanin production that leads to discoloration. <br>\r\nVitamin C enriched formula improves skin complexion and texture simultaneously providing instant hydration.<br>\r\n✧ Big patches to cover more: Larger pieces deliver intensive care to wider skin area than standard eye patches.<br>\r\n✧ Small patches for areas in care-need: Smaller pieces provide intensive care to more specific areas as smile, frown, and neck. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 pcs /102g','1. After washing your face, apply toner to prepare balanced skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Using an enclosed spatula, place the patches on the skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n ✧ Big patches: Place the bigger patches on the skin around the eyes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n Larger pieces deliver intensive care to wider skin area than standard eye patches. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n ✧ Small patches: Place the smaller patches on more specific areas as smile, frown and neck. They penetrate deep and fast to reduce the look of aging signs. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Remove the patches after 20~30 minutes, and gently pat skin for better absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nYou can use it morning and/or night- daily.','produits/Eye-Gel-Patches-1_61945.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Eye-Gel-Patches-1_61945.jpg\", \"produits/Eye-Gel-Patches--2_86936.jpg\", \"produits/Eye-Gel-Patches-3_20137.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_005447_(540_x_720_pixel)_31562.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3306,'Diamond Ampoule Sheet Mask  (1)',NULL,11.000,'Make your tired skin Feeling Fresh. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nA total of 65 ingredients in one sheet: Diamond Powder (20 ppm), Ampoule concentrate supply (Hyaluronic Acid, Collagen, Peptide, Adenosine, Niacinamide, etc.), Extracts of Plants & Grains, etc. <br>\r\nDiamond Ampoule Sheet Mask makes your Skin elastic, vital,  moistured, brilliant, soothed, and clear. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination,  Oily, Sensitive','1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After washing face, apply sheet mask on face. Pull the eye part of sheet up to just below the eyes, that part will be fully covered. (No need to attach additional Eye Patches)\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask1_43963.jpg',NULL,50,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask1_43963.jpg\", \"produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask-2_99787.jpg\", \"produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask-Pack-3_91765.jpg\", \"produits/Diamond-Ampoule-Sheet-Mask-Pack-4_18463.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3307,'Vitamin E Vitalizing Sunscreen SPF 50+',NULL,89.000,'Perfect for all skin colours and all seasons, COSRX’s weightless Vitamin E Vitalizing Sunscreen offers broad-spectrum protection of SPF 50+ PA+++ along with various skin care benefits. It’s enriched with Vitamin E and silica to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and regulate excess sebum production for a matte finish without leaving a white cast. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n√ A clinically-proven sunscreen with SPF50+ that blocks UV rays to the strongest degree formulated with vitamin E, antioxidant protection. <br>\r\n√ Formulated with antioxidant Vitamin E (Tocopherol) that reduces free radicals and helps reduce visible signs of aging and skin damage. <br>\r\n√ Lightweight, fast-absorbing, non greasy sunscreen that doesn’t leave a white cast. <br>\r\n√ Contains Silica which controls oil and sebum for a shine-free look. <br>\r\n√ Reef-friendly formula. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Apply liberally 15 minutes before sun exposure\r\n2. Reapply at least every 2 hours &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230115_235406_(540_x_720_pixel)_11263.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_235406_(540_x_720_pixel)_11263.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_235505_(540_x_720_pixel)_91947.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_235520_(540_x_720_pixel)_97467.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_235545_(540_x_720_pixel)_71025.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3308,'AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner',NULL,130.000,'AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner is formulated with natural ingredients: 10% of Apple Fruit Water (AHA) & 10% of Willow Bark Water (BHA) and a mineral water base. The formula gently exfoliates dull skin, removes dead skin cells, prevents the early development of whiteheads and blackheads, and helps the skin become clearer, brighter and smoother over time. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 150 ml','After cleansing, wet cotton pad with toner and sweep upwards and outwards all over face. Alternatively, dispense directly into palms of hands and gently pat into skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230115_234738_(540_x_720_pixel)_59085.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_234738_(540_x_720_pixel)_59085.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_234757_(540_x_720_pixel)_77574.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_234810_(540_x_720_pixel)_59200.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_234820_(540_x_720_pixel)_17584.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_234835_(540_x_720_pixel)_27007.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_234850_(540_x_720_pixel)_44137.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3309,'Moistfull Collagen Intense Serum',NULL,120.000,'Moistfull Collagen Intense Serum is a moisturizing and nourishing serum that contains low-molecular Super Collagen™ Water ingredients and Peptide. It quickly delivers rich moisture and nutrients to skin as welll as hydrates the skin with 3 effective hydrating ingredients by layers. <br>\r\nHyaluronic Acid hydrates the outside layer of your skin.<br>\r\nPeptides strengthen skin self-sustaining ability which means it helps improve your skin’s normal function. <br>\r\nSuper Collagen™ Water moisturizes the bottom layer of the skin which makes our skin has a stronger foundation. <br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Gently spread from the center of the face outward &amp;amp;amp;lt;br\r\n&amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Massage face for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Intense-Serum-1_23473.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Intense-Serum-1_23473.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Intense-Serum-2_84355.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Intense-Serum-3_46986.jpg\", \"produits/Moistfull-Collagen-Intense-Serum-4_90856.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3310,'Sebum Soak T zone Base',NULL,75.000,'Sebum Soak T-zone Base is a spot base that creates a long-lasting soft skin by forming a thin film on the skin while absorbing sebum, full of fresh powder skin specialized for sebum absorption. The light and refreshing powder skin quickly adsorbs excess sebum on the skin and forms an anti-oil film to create a matte finishing skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','Before applying primer, gently apply a moderate amount of product on the excessive sebum areas such as T-zone','produits/IMG_20221223_010000_(540_x_720_pixel)_49906.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221223_010000_(540_x_720_pixel)_49906.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221223_010018_(540_x_720_pixel)_56546.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221223_011110_(540_x_720_pixel)_58595.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221223_010620_52619.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3311,'Dear Darling Water Gel Tint - PK004 RED BEAN RED','',52.000,'The Etude House Dear Darling Water Gel Tint (Ice Cream) is a lip tint inspired by the delight of summer and ice cream to give your lips a refreshing burst of hydration and colour <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ Hydrating and long-lasting <br>\r\n✓ Does not dry out easily <br>\r\n✓ Spreads easily and smoothly','1. Adjust the amount of product on the tip of the applicator before use &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Apply from the inner lip and spread to the outer lip line to create a gradation &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Apply it on your cheeks for a bright look','produits/IMG_20221220_225846_(540_x_720_pixel)_36754.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221220_225846_(540_x_720_pixel)_36754.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_231424_(540_x_720_pixel)_38187.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_231456_(540_x_720_pixel)_86089.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221220_231918_(540_x_720_pixel)_14130.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3312,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Nude Look Cream',NULL,120.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Nude Look Cream has a smooth, water-based texture with a multi-function formulation that nourishes and brighten skins and helps create a flawless, hydrated and natural-looking complexion. <br>\r\nAlso, it contains Hyaluronic Acid and Citrus Peel Extract that help to intensify hydration and brighten the skin tone and CITYSTEM Active Ingredient that purifies skin and minimises fine lines to create a moisturised and illuminated appearance, leaving you with radiant and supple skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount of cream onto face and neck, massage until fully absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3313,'Skin Advanced Platinum Skin Advanced Watery Luminous Cleansing Gel',NULL,105.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Cleansing Gel, enriched with Moringa Seed Oil, helps clean and remove dirt, impurities, and dust stuck in your pores, together with CITYSTEM active ingredient to purify skin to reduce blackheads and minimize fine lines, leaving you with clean, radiant and supple skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Put an appropriate amount of cleansing gel onto palm and work into a lather with water &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Gently massage onto wet face for 2-3 minutes &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Rinse thoroughly with water &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3314,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Brightening Sheet Mask',NULL,15.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Brightening Mask made with silky soft and natural fiber sheet material from Japan as well as infused with rich moisturising essence of Vitamin C, Wild Thyme extract and Platinum to help brighten & instantly replenish and retain skin moisture for a long-lasting hydration, leaving you with soft, supple and luminous skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Use after facial cleansing. Place the mask sheet on your face. Smooth out mask to ensure a perfect fit. Leave mask on for 15 -20 minutes before removal. Gently massage the remaining essence into skin until fully absorbed. No need to rinse off &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nRecommended to use 2-3 times weekly',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3315,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Moisturising Sheet Mask',NULL,15.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Moisturising Mask made with silky soft and natural fiber sheet material from Japan as well as infused with rich moisturising essence of Camellia Seed Oil and Platinum to help instantly replenish and retain skin moisture for a long-lasting hydration, leaving you with soft, supple and luminous skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Use after facial cleansing. Place the mask sheet on your face. Smooth out mask to ensure a perfect fit. Leave mask on for 15 -20 minutes before removal. Gently massage the remaining essence into skin until fully absorbed. No need to rinse off &amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nRecommended to use 2-3 times weekly',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3316,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Emulsion',NULL,120.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Emulsion has a lightweight texture and is enriched with Marvel-of-Peru extract and Squalane to smooth skin and provide long-lasting hydration to the skin. It also contains Antarcticine Marine Ingredient C which helps protect skin against dryness, minimize the appearance of fine lines, restore skin firmness and boost its elasticity, giving you a youthful and energetic appearance. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount of emulsion onto face and massage until fully absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3317,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Serum',NULL,120.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Serum has a light and easy-to-absorb texture which is also enriched with a brightening complex, that helps skin regain its radiance and luminosity. It also contains Antarcticine® Marine Ingredient C which helps protect skin against dryness, minimize the appearance of fine lines, restore skin firmness and boost its elasticity, giving you a youthful and energetic appearance. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount of serum onto face and massage until fully absorbed &amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3318,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Toning Essence Treatment Toner',NULL,105.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Emulsion has a lightweight texture that\'s enriched with Trehalose and Antarcticine Marine Ingredient C, which helps protect skin against dryness, minimize the appearance of fine lines, restore skin firmness and boost its elasticity, giving you a youthful and energetic appearance. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Use after facial cleansing. Apply an appropriate amount of toner onto face and massage until fully absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3319,'Secret Key Snow White Milky Pack',NULL,115.000,'The Secret Key to Snow White’s fair skin? Perhaps it’s this Snow White Milky Pack! The pearl and vitamin contents help brighten up the complexion for enviable skin. Besides, the star ingredient, niacinamide, helps improve dull complexion while fighting redness and dark spots. Over time, continuous use of this wash-off mask will leave you with brighter and a more even skin tone. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, dispense a liberal amount of the pack and apply evenly all over dry skin. Gently massage in circular motions. Leave on for 2 to 3 minutes before rinsing it off with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day or night, daily',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3320,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Hydra Gel Mask',NULL,120.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Hydra Gel Mask has a gentle and gel-based texture with Triple Hyaluronic Acid and Platinum to provide instant hydration to skin, and strengthen the skin barrier to retain moisture for a long-lasting effect, leaving you with soft and luminous skin','Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Hydra Gel Mask has a gentle and gel-based texture with Triple Hyaluronic Acid and Platinum to provide instant hydration to skin, and strengthen the skin barrier to retain moisture for a long-lasting effect, leaving you with soft and luminous skin',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3321,'Laneige Lip Sleeping Mask EX Berry',NULL,25.000,'Laneige\'s best-selling Lip Sleeping Mask EX (Berry) returns with an upgraded formulation that helps dissolve dead skin cells, moisturise, smooth and plump your lips overnight. The sweet and fruity scent of this berry mask is relaxing, and will remind you of real berries. Laneige\'s Moisture Wrap™ technology features a hyaluronic acid network that forms a moisturising film to lock in active ingredients and retain moisture through the night. Berry Mix Complex™, which is rich in antioxidants and Vitamin C also helps exfoliate dead skin cells for smoother lips. The nourishing combination of Coconut Oil, Shea Butter and Murumuru Seed Butter work together to deliver lasting hydration and moisture while you sleep!','apply hydrating lip mask generously to the lips and leave on overnight &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it daily preferably at night','produits/IMG_20230118_015914_(540_x_720_pixel)_74679.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230118_015914_(540_x_720_pixel)_74679.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_015938_(540_x_720_pixel)_20100.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_015959_(540_x_720_pixel)_87651.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_020014_(540_x_720_pixel)_19814.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_020115_(540_x_720_pixel)_90475.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3322,'Collagen Vita Secret Multi Balm',NULL,128.000,'TIME ERASER OF AGING: Start perfect wrinkle care & brightening solution with Collagen Vita Secret Multi Balm. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nInfused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation,  this skin-nourishing balm stick boasts potent anti-aging benefits for sagging skin. Rich in 5 peptides and panthenol, the balm is also formulated to promote strong skin barrier, reduce wrinkles and fine lines, and improve skin elasticity and hydration to achieve supple, radiant skin. <Br>\r\n<Br>\r\nAnytime, Anywhere!\r\nFill in wrinkles and lighten the pigmentation with one multi balm! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVolume : 11 ml','Use it in the last step of skincare routine and apply it on areas of concern, especially areas with wrinkles. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it anytime, daily.','produits/collagen-vita-secret-multi-balm-1_79514.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/collagen-vita-secret-multi-balm-1_79514.jpg\", \"produits/collagen-vita-secret-multi-balm-2_36646.jpg\", \"produits/collagen-vita-secret-multi-balm-3_87783.jpg\", \"produits/collagen-vita-secret-multi-balm-4_11625.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3323,'Calamine Derma Secret Pack',NULL,104.000,'Calamine Derma Secret Mask which contained natural ingredients help to make your skin glow and give perfect calming effect on your sensitive skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n➲ When you need to hydrate your skin quickly & easy. <br>\r\n➲ When you need a perfect skin for next day. <br>\r\n➲ When you need to soothe irritated skin by external irritation. <br>\r\nCalamine, This pink powder will give you the perfect calming effect without irritation and effective treatment for acne! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. After cleansing, soak a cotton pad with toner then swipe it over your face. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Place the sheet mask over eyes, Nose and mouth area first, then gently spread over the face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. After 10 &ndash; 20 minutes, remove the mask sheet from your face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Gently pat you face to absorbing the remained essence &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\nUse it morning &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; night, daily.','produits/Calamine Derma Secret-Mask-pack-1_36619.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Calamine Derma Secret-Mask-pack-1_36619.jpg\", \"produits/Calamine Derma Secret-Mask-pack-2_99034.jpg\", \"produits/Calamine Derma Secret-Mask-pack3_81429.jpg\", \"produits/Calamine Derma Secret-Mask-pack-4_22367.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:39','2025-03-01 21:03:39',0,NULL),(3324,'Calamine Derma Secret Mask',NULL,14.000,'Calamine Derma Secret Mask which contained natural ingredients help to make your skin glow and give perfect calming effect on your sensitive skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n➲ When you need to hydrate your skin quickly & easy. <br>\r\n➲ When you need a perfect skin for next day. <br>\r\n➲ When you need to soothe irritated skin by external irritation. <br>\r\nCalamine, This pink powder will give you the perfect calming effect without irritation and effective treatment for acne! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 25g','1. After cleansing, soak a cotton pad with toner then swipe it over your face. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Place the sheet mask over eyes, Nose and mouth area first, then gently spread over the face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. After 10 &ndash; 20 minutes, remove the mask sheet from your face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Gently pat you face to absorbing the remained essence &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\nUse it morning &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; night, daily.','produits/Calamine-Derma-Secret-Mask-1_48600.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Calamine-Derma-Secret-Mask-1_48600.jpg\", \"produits/Calamine-Derma-Secret-Mask-2_78380.jpg\", \"produits/Calamine-Derma-Secret-Mask-3_71969.jpg\", \"produits/Calamine-Derma-Secret-Mask-4_69917.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3325,'Instant Relief Eye Gel Patches (CAFFEINE)',NULL,122.000,'Anti-puffiness with Caffeine: Antioxidant and anti-inflammatory, Caffeine helps to reduce dark circles and puffiness around eyes by soothing sensitized skin and reducing breakouts for healthy skin look. <br>\r\nCaffeine enriched formula helps to reduce under-eye puffiness and wake up skin simultaneously providing instant hydration. <br>\r\n✧ Big patches to cover more: Larger pieces deliver intensive care to wider skin area than standard eye patches. <br>\r\n✧ Small patches for areas in care-need: Smaller pieces provide intensive care to more specific areas as smile, frown, and neck. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination,  Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 pcs /102g','1. After washing your face, apply toner to prepare balanced skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Using an enclosed spatula, place the patches on the skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n -Big patches: Place the bigger patches on the skin around the eyes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n -Larger pieces deliver intensive care to wider skin area than standard eye patches. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n -Small patches: Place the smaller patches on more specific areas as smile, frown and neck. They penetrate deep and fast to reduce the look of aging signs. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Remove the patches after 20~30 minutes, and gently pat skin for better absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nYou can use it morning and/or night- daily.','produits/Instant-Relief-Eye-Gel-Patches-1_81404.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Instant-Relief-Eye-Gel-Patches-1_81404.jpg\", \"produits/Instant-Relief-Eye-Gel-Patches-2_19075.jpg\", \"produits/Instant-Relief-Eye-Gel-Patches-3_27276.jpg\", \"produits/Instant-Relief-Eye-Gel-Patches-4_60658.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3326,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow #PK001',NULL,50.000,'Cherry Moisture Lip Glow is a lip color that combines the high shine of a gloss and the moisturizing feel of an oil for cherry lips that look plump and juicy. It has an excellent adhesive power that fits lightly without smudging and stickiness. <br>\r\nJust glow like as a star!','Apply a moderate amount from inside to outside lips gently',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3327,'Baking Powder Pore Cleansing Cream',NULL,45.000,'Baking Powder Pore Cleansing Cream is a refreshing cleansing cream gently melts out makeup and impurities and cleanses fine pores with fine baking powder cream with excellent cleansing power. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n Skin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply cream to dry facial surface and massage until makeup is dissolved. Wipe off face with facial pad/tissues then wash off with cleansing foam and water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20221225_180902_(540_x_720_pixel)_35876.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221225_180902_(540_x_720_pixel)_35876.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_180926_(540_x_720_pixel)_56619.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_180941_(540_x_720_pixel)_82613.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_180951_(540_x_720_pixel)_47590.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3328,'Fixing Tint #06 Soft Walnut',NULL,54.000,'Guaranteed to stay put on your lips all day without rubbing off on face masks, this lip tint comes in a matte yet non-drying formula and boasts a lightweight texture that adheres perfectly to lips <br>\r\nApply and dry for 60 seconds, then you’re good to go!\r\n','For a full cover, apply a moderate amount along the edge of lips and then fill in the inner part &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards','produits/IMG_20221221_211507_(540_x_720_pixel)_33786.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221221_211507_(540_x_720_pixel)_33786.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221221_211417_(540_x_720_pixel)_88686.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221221_211520_(540_x_720_pixel)_58354.png\", \"produits/IMG_20221221_211556_(540_x_720_pixel)_97014.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3329,'Fixing Tint #07 Cranberry Plum',NULL,54.000,'Guaranteed to stay put on