ightly to the lips with matte finish. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ High pigmented lipstick with various vivid, clear color and magnetic case. <br>\r\n✓ Provides smooth application that gently adheres on the lips without any lumps. <br>\r\n✓ Forms moisture-protective barrier to keep the lips moisturized.','Gently apply a moderate amount on the entire lips',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3340,'Better Lips-Talk #BE105 Dusty Peach',NULL,65.000,'Velvet Lips-Talk gives vivid color and adheres lightly to the lips with matte finish. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ High pigmented lipstick with various vivid, clear color and magnetic case. <br>\r\n✓ Provides smooth application that gently adheres on the lips without any lumps. <br>\r\n✓ Forms moisture-protective barrier to keep the lips moisturized.','Gently apply a moderate amount on the entire lips',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3341,'Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream',NULL,115.000,'The COSRX Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream is a non- heavy, double-functioning eye cream that visibly brightens the eye area by helping diminish the appearance of dark circles and puffiness with 72% of snail secretion filtrate, 5 types of peptides and niacinamide. Snail secretion filtrate and sodium hyaluronate moisturizes, refreshes and rejuvenates the skin and 5 types of peptides help strengthening the elasticity of skin around your eyes. Also niacinamide brighten the dark circles of the eyes. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, toning and applying treatment steps, apply the cream by massaging it around your eyes. Tap the area gently for better absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Advanced-Snail-Peptide-Eye-Cream-1_79799.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Advanced-Snail-Peptide-Eye-Cream-1_79799.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-Peptide-Eye-Cream-2_20775.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-Peptide-Eye-Cream-3_31879.jpg\", \"produits/Advanced-Snail-Peptide-Eye-Cream-4_31759.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3342,'Acne Pimple Master Patch',NULL,32.000,'Hailed by Korean skin care fans as a holy grail product for acne treatment, COSRX Acne Pimple Master Patches protect pimples from secondary infections and further swelling. Available in various sizes, the hydrocolloid acne patch covers the affected area and absorbs excess sebum for easy and effective blemish control. This spot treatment speeds up the healing process of the pimple and helps prevent acne scars. <br>\r\nIt can even stay on through showering and can be applied under makeup! <br>\r\nWith three differently sized patches in a pack, you can choose which one will cover your bases. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Wash and dry the targeted area you want to treat. Don\'t apply any skin treatments or moisturisers between the patch and your skin.\r\n\r\nChoose a patch in the appropriate size to do the job and stick it on the treatment area. Leave it on overnight.\r\n\r\nRemove the patch in the morning and you\'ll find that it may have turned white as it absorbs the impurities from the area.','produits/Acne-Pimple-Master-Patch-1_52456.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Acne-Pimple-Master-Patch-1_52456.jpg\", \"produits/Acne-Pimple-Master-Patch-4_43764.jpg\", \"produits/Acne-Pimple-Master-Patch-2_27214.jpg\", \"produits/Acne-Pimple-Master-Patch-3_56156.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3343,'Jeju Volcanic Pore Cleansing Foam',NULL,86.000,'This daily cleansing foam with Jeju Volcanic Cluster capsule deeply cleanses clogged pores, absorbs and controls excessive sebum on the skin while melting away any impurities like dirt and makeup residue. The result is clearer skin with tighter pores and a smoother skin texture. <br> \r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 150 g','Apply an appropriate amount onto wet hands and work into rich lather. After massaging, rinse off with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Jeju-Volcanic-Pore-Cleansing-Foam-1_54463.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Jeju-Volcanic-Pore-Cleansing-Foam-1_54463.jpg\", \"produits/Jeju-Volcanic-Pore-Cleansing-Foam-2_31733.jpg\", \"produits/Jeju-Volcanic-Pore-Cleansing-Foam-3_55226.jpg\", \"produits/Jeju-Volcanic-Pore-Cleansing-Foam-4_13320.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3344,'Pore Clearing Clay Mousse Mask 2X with Super Volcanic Clusters',NULL,105.000,'Smooth on this unique volcanic clay mask to instantly feel a cooling sensation as naturally absorbent Super Volcanic Clusters™ from Jeju Island, Korea help draw out excess oil—minimizing the look of pores. The airy mousse glides on cleanly and smoothly to help clear impurities from your pores. With twice the excess sebum absorbing ability of the original, this light-as-air mousse mask glides on seamlessly and provides skin with instant cooling benefits. Innovative micro clay particles in the mask help deeply cleanse impurities and pollutants from the skin to deeply cleanse pores. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','1. Pump to dispense and smooth onto clean, dry skin, avoiding the eye and lip areas &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Leave on for 10 to 15 minutes, until dry &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Rinse with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day or night, once or twice a week','produits/Pore-Clearing-Clay-Mousse-Mask-2X-with-Super-Volcanic-Clusters-1_83869.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Pore-Clearing-Clay-Mousse-Mask-2X-with-Super-Volcanic-Clusters-1_83869.jpg\", \"produits/Pore-Clearing-Clay-Mousse-Mask-2X-with-Super-Volcanic-Clusters-2_56779.jpg\", \"produits/Pore-Clearing-Clay-Mousse-Mask-2X-with-Super-Volcanic-Clusters-3_36385.jpg\", \"produits/Pore-Clearing-Clay-Mousse-Mask-2X-with-Super-Volcanic-Clusters-4_34107.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3345,'Green Tea Foam Cleanser',NULL,105.000,'This creamy cleansing foam infused with hydrating green tea hydrates skin while whisking away dirt and impurities, leaving skin feeling refreshed, clean, soft, and hydrated without leaving any dryness.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Take a small amount onto palms and create a lather &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Massage over wet face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Rinse &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/green-tea-foam-cleanser-1_69082.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/green-tea-foam-cleanser-1_69082.jpg\", \"produits/green-tea-foam-cleanser-2_31741.jpg\", \"produits/green-tea-foam-cleanser-3_57830.jpg\", \"produits/green-tea-foam-cleanser-4_18956.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3346,'Green Tea Seed Skin',NULL,105.000,'Green Tea Seed Skin is a refreshing toner that delivers intense hydration and antioxidants from a blend of Jeju green tea extract and green tea seed oil to help soften skin and strengthen its natural moisture barrier. With its lightweight, watery texture, this toner can be layered multiple times to hydrate the skin, while panthenol protects the skin barrier and relieve skin dryness or irritation leaving it supple, elastic and clear. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount over face and neck then gently smooth for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Skin-1_58786.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Skin-1_58786.jpg\", \"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Skin-1_40617.jpg\", \"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Skin-2_44138.jpg\", \"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Skin-3_49187.jpg\", \"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Skin-4_87685.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3347,'Green Tea Seed Deep Cream',NULL,150.000,'Green Tea Seed Deep Cream is a rich moisturiser formulated with organic Jeju green tea and green tea seeds to replenish moisture and nourishment deep into your skin. Formulated to create a powerful protective barrier on your skin, this moisturiser will prevent moisture loss caused by cool or dry weather conditions, while leaving your skin healthy and glowing.It provides your skin with long-lasting hydration by enveloping your skin with moisture which is retained within your skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Sensitive','As a final skincare step, apply and massage an adequate amount evenly onto face and neck until fully absorbed. Lightly tap to help absorption. &amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Deep-Cream-1_68770.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Deep-Cream-1_68770.jpg\", \"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Deep-Cream-2_68969.jpg\", \"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Deep-Cream-3_34058.jpg\", \"produits/Green-Tea-Seed-Deep-Cream-4_91606.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3348,'Jeju Orchid Enriched Cream',NULL,140.000,'Target the first signs of aging with this multitasking moisturizer! <br> \r\nIt quenches skin with hydration and nourishment while supporting a look of firmness elasticity and tone. It’s made with an antioxidant rich orchid from Jeju Island South Korea making it highly effective in diminishing visible signs of aging <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply all over the face and neck and press to help with absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/Jeju-Orchid-Enriched-Cream-1_24669.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Jeju-Orchid-Enriched-Cream-1_24669.jpg\", \"produits/Jeju-Orchid-Enriched-Cream-2_29163.jpg\", \"produits/Jeju-Orchid-Enriched-Cream3_66323.jpg\", \"produits/Jeju-Orchid-Enriched-Cream-4_39482.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3349,'Bija Cica Balm EX',NULL,85.000,'This gel-balm, formulated with bija seed oil and centella asiatica extract, helps strengthen skin\'s moisture barrier while helping to soften skin! <br>\r\n<br>\r\n1. Centella asiatica 4X* for intensive skin concern care! <br>\r\nFormula with centella asiatica 4X, a high-purity substance that concentrates 30 times more centella leaves, provides powerful cica care. Highly-purity refined powder, not a liquid extract diluting centella, distinctly benefits skin. <br>\r\nProduct Details <br>\r\n<br>\r\n2. Bija oil and D-panthenol for healthy-looking, firm skin! <br>\r\nBija oil for protecting skin and D-panthenol effective in reinforcing skin barrier make your skin healthy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n3. \"Mild cica care\" with 90% naturally-derived ingredients <br>\r\nFormulation with a higher content of naturally-derived ingredients and no problematic ingredients provides mild cica care effect. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','-To use Cica Balm as a moisturizer, apply an even layer to the entire face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n-This product can also be applied over an acne spot treatment (sold separately), once it is dried down.&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\n-To use Cica Balm as a spot treatment, apply the product onto areas of concern and follow up with your favorite moisturizer.','produits/Bija-Cica-Balm-EX-1_56492.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Bija-Cica-Balm-EX-1_56492.jpg\", \"produits/Bija-Cica-Balm-EX-2_43501.jpg\", \"produits/Bija-Cica-Balm-EX-3_50025.jpg\", \"produits/Bija-Cica-Balm-EX-4_34301.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3350,'Bija Cica Gel EX',NULL,85.000,'This cica gel is formulated with bija seed oil and centella asiatica 4X to help soothe and provide gentle skincare! <br>\r\n<br>\r\n1. Centella Asiatica 4X* for intensive skin concern care! <br>\r\nFormulated with Centella Asiatica 4X, a high-purity substance that concentrates 30 times more centella leaves to provide powerful cica care. Highly-purified refined powder, not a liquid extract diluting centella, distinctly benefits skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n2. Bija oil and D-panthenol, the reinforcements for skin protection!\r\nBija oil with outstanding skin protection power and D-Panthenol that is effective in strengthening the skin barrier, work together to boost the skin’s protective ability to make it healthier. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n3. This cica care item comes in a non-heavy transparent gel-type texture which is mild enough even for oily skin during the day and night, without leaving any residue. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','-Apply evenly over the entire face before using the cream. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor spots : Apply thickly on the affected area.','produits/Bija-Cica-Gel-EX-1_24925.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Bija-Cica-Gel-EX-1_24925.jpg\", \"produits/Bija-Cica-Gel-EX-2_58277.jpg\", \"produits/Bija-Cica-Gel-EX-3_55995.jpg\", \"produits/Bija-Cica-Gel-EX-4_33458.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3351,'Yuja Niacin 30 Days Blemish Care Serum',NULL,111.000,'This serum brightens dull and uneven skin tone by targeting blemishes, freckles and pigmentation to create a fresh and dewy complexion. Formulated with yuja extract and niacinamide for brightening and moisturizing effects, glutathione and arbutin to lighten dark spots and prevent melanin pigment production, as well as 12 types of vitamins to revitalize and relieve dull and stressed skin. Made free of artificial ingredients and fragrances, this lightweight, non-sticky serum contains 100% natural oil and organic yuja peel oil fragrance. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily','Apply a proper amount on the face evenly and pat gently for further absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230118_011019_(540_x_720_pixel)_92598.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230118_011019_(540_x_720_pixel)_92598.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_011031_(540_x_720_pixel)_67120.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_011045_(540_x_720_pixel)_94139.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_011106_(540_x_720_pixel)_67464.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_011244_(540_x_720_pixel)_22732.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_011323_(540_x_720_pixel)_41366.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3352,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Oil To Foam',NULL,120.000,'A honey oil based cleanser removes all traces of makeup and pore waste in one go. It is packed with naturally derived ingredients such as Oat Meal, Coconut and Apple for a thorough, deep cleansing experience. Also it is enriched with SOME BY MI signature ingredient Truecica to promote skin soothing benefit<br> It leaves the skin protected and nourished thanks to the infusion of Propolis and B5. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Sensitive','1. Take a moderate amount and massage the entire face area to remove makeup.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Lather up by adding water and gently massage the skin.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Rinse with lukewarm water. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230116_014807_(540_x_720_pixel)_59753.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230116_014807_(540_x_720_pixel)_59753.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_014817_(540_x_720_pixel)_71645.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_014827_(540_x_720_pixel)_44179.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_014835_(540_x_720_pixel)_25586.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_014911_(540_x_720_pixel)_35542.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_014928_(540_x_720_pixel)_77388.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3353,'Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Slightly Acid Gel Cleanser',NULL,91.000,'It is a mild and gentle gel cleanser with low pH value of 5.5 forms rich, creamy bubbles that cleanse skin without leaving it dry or irritated. It is formulated with black snail extract to heal damaged skin and enriched with 17 types of amino acids, ceramide and panthenol to strengthen the skins moisture barrier, maintaining a plumper and firmer complexion. It also contains the Truecica that soothes skin and strengthen skin barrier. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','1. Squeeze a proper amount onto wet palms and lather it up. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\n2. Massage over the face in a circular motion for a while then rinse off with lukewarm water clearly. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Slightly-Acid-Gel-Cleanser-1_46701.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Slightly-Acid-Gel-Cleanser-1_46701.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Slightly-Acid-Gel-Cleanser-2_16912.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Slightly-Acid-Gel-Cleanser-4_14840.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Slightly-Acid-Gel-Cleanser-3_51305.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3354,'Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Toner',NULL,105.000,'Formulated with black snail extract, snail truecica and a patented combination of plant extracts, this refreshing and moisturizing toner boasts whitening and anti-wrinkle effects. It makes use of snail’s powerful regenerative power to strengthen the skin barrier, heal damaged skin and soothe sensitive skin, while its special acne spot care solution stops melanin production, protects skin from ultraviolet rays, and effectively reduces acne scars and hyperpigmentation. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply a small amount on the face along skin texture and pat gently for further absorption. &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Toner-1_45080.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Toner-1_45080.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Toner-2_91588.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Toner-4_38316.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Toner-3_73082.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3355,'Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Cream',NULL,104.000,'Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Cream is formulated with highly concentrated 420,000ppm of snail Truecica consisting of tea tree, cica and mugwort to soothe irritated and sensitive skin quickly, as well as black snail mucin to repair scars and damaged skin barrier. For long-lasting effects, this repair cream is also infused with marine collagen, 5 kinds of ceramide and peptide to strengthen skin barrier. It boasts a lightweight, fast-absorbing formula that does not leave a sticky feeling, making it suitable for all skin types. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply a proper amount on entire face along skin texture and pat gently for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Cream-1_29314.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Cream-1_29314.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Cream-2_58567.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Cream-3_89136.jpg\", \"produits/Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Cream-4_22798.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3356,'&nbsp;Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Serum',NULL,106.000,'The SOME BY MI Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Serum is a multifunctional serum that soothes, repairs and strengthens the skin. Formulated with 89% Snail Truecica™ (consisting of Black Snail Extract and Truecica™),  this serum removes dark blemishes, scars and visible marks while calming down skin sensitivities. Its lightweight texture absorbs quickly into the skin without leaving any stickiness behind <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing and toning, apply serum all over your face and let it absorb &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/ Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Serum-1_96760.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/ Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Serum-1_96760.jpg\", \"produits/ Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Serum-2_56439.jpg\", \"produits/ Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Serum-3_14154.jpg\", \"produits/ Snail-Truecica-Miracle-Repair-Serum-4_17543.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3357,'Super Matcha Pore Tightening Toner',NULL,91.000,'Super Matcha Pore Tightening Toner is an all-in-one toner to purify, tighten and hydrate your pores. Naturally sourced BHA removes dead skin cells, blackheads and whiteheads without irritation, while 83% Matcha water helps purify and tighten pores. A patented ingredient, Sebum Controller Powder™ absorbs the excess sebum and effectively control the production of sebum. <br>\r\n <br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Close the lid and shake well until the powder is fully mixed. Apply a proper amount of toner onto the cotton pad and gently wipe along the skin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/IMG_20230119_194939_(540_x_720_pixel)_23830.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_194939_(540_x_720_pixel)_23830.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_194956_(540_x_720_pixel)_78983.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_195054_(540_x_720_pixel)_81392.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_195209_(540_x_720_pixel)_10669.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3358,'Super Matcha Pore Clean Clay Mask',NULL,83.000,'Super Matcha Pore Clean Clay Mask is an all-in-one mask to help solve your blackheads, whiteheads, oiliness and enlarged pores troubles. Naturally sourced BHA dissolves dead skin cells to unclog pores without irritation, while Clay and Matcha powder absorb excessive sebum, leaving pores clean, clear and tightened. Centella Asiatica Extract, Glacier water and Sparkling water are also present to make sure your skin stays hydrated, moisturised and calm. This clay mask has a soft, creamy texture that leaves your skin feeling fresh without any residue. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. After cleansing, dry your face and apply clay mask, avoiding the eye and lip areas &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After 10-20 minutes when the mask is dry, rinse it off with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning or night, once or twice a week','produits/IMG_20230119_200701_(540_x_720_pixel)_80195.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_200701_(540_x_720_pixel)_80195.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_200716_(540_x_720_pixel)_70032.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_200804_(540_x_720_pixel)_82965.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_200839_(540_x_720_pixel)_81726.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_200949_(540_x_720_pixel)_56266.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_201050_(540_x_720_pixel)_17382.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3359,'Super Matcha Pore Tightening Serum',NULL,104.000,'Super Matcha Pore Tightening Serum is a lightweight serum to tighten and firm pores. Naturally sourced BHA and PHA removes dead skin cells to unclog pores without irritation, while 93% Matcha water helps purify and tighten pores. This refreshing serum also contains Anti Sebum P to maintain water-oil balance and improve pore elasticity, and Centella Asiatica Extract, Glacier water and NMF to make sure your skin stays hydrated and calm. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','apply a proper amount over the entire face, and gently pat until absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/IMG_20230119_195830_(540_x_720_pixel)_87997.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_195830_(540_x_720_pixel)_87997.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_195853_(540_x_720_pixel)_99626.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_195920_(540_x_720_pixel)_92008.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_195947_(540_x_720_pixel)_70595.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_200008_(540_x_720_pixel)_64393.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_200031_(540_x_720_pixel)_91031.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_200148_(540_x_720_pixel)_46305.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_200213_(540_x_720_pixel)_62130.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3360,'Bye Bye Blackhead 30 Days Miracle Green Tea Tox Bubble Cleanser',NULL,89.000,'The SOME BY MI Bye Bye Blackhead 30 Days Miracle Green Tea Tox Bubble Cleanser is a cleanser and also quick 5-minutes detox care to clear out blackheads and impurities from your pores. Formulated with 16 kinds of tea extracts and naturally-derived BHA to deeply cleanse, brighten, exfoliate and tighten your pores. It also leaves skin moisturized and with a natural and healthy glow. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Apply a thin layer evenly on targeted areas of the skin, leave on 3-5 minutes and let the bubbles form.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Rub slightly with a small amount of water in circular motion to cleanse the skin impurities.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Rinse off with lukewarm water thoroughly.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nRecommended 3 to 4 times a week, day or night','produits/IMG_20230118_214911_(540_x_720_pixel)_87961.png',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230118_214911_(540_x_720_pixel)_87961.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_215052_(540_x_720_pixel)_46482.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_215216_(540_x_720_pixel)_62810.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_012643_(540_x_720_pixel)_89439.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_012705_(540_x_720_pixel)_68782.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3361,'AHA, BHA, PHA 30 Days Miracle Toner',NULL,95.000,'The SOME BY MI AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Toner is an exfoliating toner that hydrates and balances your skin pH while targeting breakouts and pore problems.<br> Formulated with 10,000ppm real tea tree extracts and three different types of acids (AHA, BHA and PHA), this toner gently exfoliates dead skin cells, treats acne and clear out impurities from your pores without irritating the skin.<br>Niacinamide and adenosine is also present to help brighten the skin and provide extra anti Aging benefits. <br>With a skin-friendly pH of 5.5, this toner also helps prevent future breakouts and retain healthy skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily','pour an appropriate amount on a cotton pad, and gently sweep along your skin. Let it absorb, and then follow up with the rest of your skin care routine. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/IMG_20230118_013158_(540_x_720_pixel)_23262.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230118_013158_(540_x_720_pixel)_23262.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_013212_(540_x_720_pixel)_62961.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_013239_(540_x_720_pixel)_38816.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_013255_(540_x_720_pixel)_11135.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_013423_(540_x_720_pixel)_47372.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_013504_(540_x_720_pixel)_42524.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3362,'AHA, BHA, PHA 30 Days Miracle Serum',NULL,102.000,'The highly concentrated tea tree serum changes the condition of your skin in just 30 days! <br>\r\nIt is an exfoliating serum that soothes the skin while boosting cell turnover for smoother, clearer skin. Formulated with 14.5% centella asiatica extract, 10,000ppm tea tree leaf water and three different types of acids (AHA, BHA and PHA), this serum sloughs off dead cells, impurities and sebum, prevents moisture loss and helps treat acne. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Dispense proper amount from the dropper onto your skin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Gently pat for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/IMG_20230119_190445_(540_x_720_pixel)_80494.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_190445_(540_x_720_pixel)_80494.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_190453_(540_x_720_pixel)_66505.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_190517_(540_x_720_pixel)_95668.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_190542_(540_x_720_pixel)_44077.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3363,'AHA, BHA, PHA 30 Days Miracle Cream',NULL,104.000,'Packed with tea tree, AHA, BHA and PHA, this miracle cream works wonders to your skin in 30 days! <br> \r\nThe SOME BY MI AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Cream is a non-greasy and fast-absorbing soothing cream that helps strengthen the skin barrier for smoother, acne-free and clearer skin. Formulated with 70.78% calming centella asiatica extract, 10,000ppm tea tree leaf extract, madecassoside and 4 herbs of lavender, rosemary, oregano and thyme extracted using a low-temperature method, this cream moisturises the skin while treating acne inflamed skin, removing dead skin cells and sebum inside pores as well as preventing further loss of moisture all in one go. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily','1. Apply at the last stage of your skin care routine. Spread a generous amount of cream on the face, neck and upper chest area \r\n2. Massage gently into the skin for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/c8fcb4a0c33cfda7fc69df146c50a160_52455.jpeg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/c8fcb4a0c33cfda7fc69df146c50a160_52455.jpeg\", \"produits/0499174351d2fecc5b944c46049b87a9_17295.jpeg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_190932_(540_x_720_pixel)_15567.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_190946_(540_x_720_pixel)_80305.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_191006_(540_x_720_pixel)_16076.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_191038_(540_x_720_pixel)_30914.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3364,'AHA, BHA, PHA 30 Days Miracle Starter Kit',NULL,128.000,'Start your AHA, BHA, PHA 30 Days Miracle trial with this essential and travel-friendly kit! <br>\r\nThe Miracle Starter Kit is everything you need to soothe, calm and hydrate acne-prone and sensitive skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✧ AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Cleansing Bar:<BR>\r\nthis bar deeply cleanse skin and helps treat acne, brighten, exfoliate and clear away impurities from the pores.\r\n✧ AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Toner: <br>\r\nthis serum gently exfoliates dead skin cells, brightens, helps treat acne and clear out impurities from your pores.\r\n✧ AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Serum: <br>\r\nthis serum soothes irritated skin, helps treat acne and removes impurities from your skin.\r\n✧ AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Cream: <br>\r\nthis cream moisturises the skin while treating acne and inflamed skin and strengthen skin barrier. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily','1. Lather up with water, apply on the face or body parts and massage for a while before rinse off with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Pour a proper amount on a cotton pad and wipe along skin texture then pat gently for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Apply a proper amount on the face evenly and pat gently for a better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Gently apply the Cream with your fingertips to the entire face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/IMG_20230119_191539_(540_x_720_pixel)_31182.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_191539_(540_x_720_pixel)_31182.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_191605_(540_x_720_pixel)_50171.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_191625_(540_x_720_pixel)_26418.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_191650_(540_x_720_pixel)_17791.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_191832_(540_x_720_pixel)_35098.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3365,'Red Tea Tree Cicassoside Derma Solution Cream',NULL,120.000,'Envelop your skin with this soothing face cream rich in potent red tea tree and cicassocide extracts to refine texture and to calm reddened complexions. Its sub-acidic formula is gentle, fast-absorbing and quick-acting, leaving complexion clearer and more supple within two weeks. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCharacteristics: <br>\r\n❃ Hydrates and soothes irritated skin. <br>\r\n❃ Lowered pH to maintain a healthy skin balance. <br>\r\n❃ Immediately provides moisture to cool down skin irritated by uv rays. <br>\r\n❃ Gently exfoliates dead skin cells and give and smooth skin texture. <br>\r\n❃ Clears and softens the skin. <br>\r\n❃ Treats acnes. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply a proper amount on the face along skin texture and pat gently for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/cream_1_60097.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/cream_1_60097.jpg\", \"produits/cream_2_99464.jpg\", \"produits/cream_1_90718.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_202833_(540_x_720_pixel)_66496.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_202843_(540_x_720_pixel)_25554.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_202948_(540_x_720_pixel)_59861.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_203017_(540_x_720_pixel)_52055.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3366,'Red Tea Tree Cicassoside Derma Solution Toner',NULL,105.000,'Red Teatree Cicassoside Derma Solution Toner is a low-pH exfoliating toner that targets hypersensitive and acne-prone skin. PHA helps gently eradicate dead skin cells while causing zero irritation. Infusions of red tea tree extract and Cicassocide™ further calm skin. It eradicates redness, soothes the skin and promotes a brighter, more even-toned skin! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, apply a proper amount on the face and pat gently for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/toner_2_53803.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/toner_2_53803.jpg\", \"produits/toner_3_65657.jpg\", \"produits/toner_4_23521.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_201728_(540_x_720_pixel)_85088.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_201818_(540_x_720_pixel)_26468.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3367,'AHA 10% Amino Peeling Ampoule',NULL,120.000,'AHA 10% Amino Peeling Ampoule is a multi-tasking intensive ampoule that gently remove dead skin cells and improve skin tone for clearer, smoother and brighter skin. It contains AHA, BHA, PHA and LHA in a perfect ratio and Truecica™ that improve skin texture, clean pores, remove dead skin cells, and minimize acne, leaving your skin smooth and soothed. Hyaluronic Acid and Ceramide are also present to help replenish hydration while fortifying skin\'s moisture barrier <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily','1. After toner, take a proper amount on your hand and apply evenly to your face &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. do not forget to apply moisturiser as the last step &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nRecommended to use 1-3 times a week according to your skin type\r\n*Please pay attention not to use it together with retinol, vitamin c, or any high concentrated vitamin skincare','produits/IMG_20230119_204122_(540_x_720_pixel)_41801.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_204122_(540_x_720_pixel)_41801.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_204132_(540_x_720_pixel)_11187.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_204201_(540_x_720_pixel)_85054.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_204209_(540_x_720_pixel)_34775.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_204302_(540_x_720_pixel)_13908.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3368,'Super Matcha Pore Clean Cleansing Gel',NULL,89.000,'This low-pH gel cleanser purifies and tightens pores with 62% Matcha Water, a high-class Macha from Bosung, South Korea. Packed with 3 types of powder from Konjac Granules, this cleanser acts like a gentle scrub to remove skin impurities and soften skin texture. It also forms micro micellar bubbles to deeply cleanse accumulated impurities layered inside the pores, while BHA, PHA ingredients and white willow bark extract dissolves dead skin cells without irritation. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Lather up a moderate amount on wet hand, massage on the entire face evenly &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Rinse off with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and night, daily','produits/IMG_20230119_192340_(540_x_720_pixel)_61157.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_192340_(540_x_720_pixel)_61157.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_192412_(540_x_720_pixel)_38571.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_192433_(540_x_720_pixel)_36206.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_192500_(540_x_720_pixel)_29468.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_192524_(540_x_720_pixel)_53511.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_192535_(540_x_720_pixel)_76006.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3369,'Red Tea Tree Cicassoside Derma Solution Serum',NULL,120.000,'Red Teatree Cicassoside Derma Solution Serum is a hydrating low-pH serum that quickly calms down your skin while fighting redness, acne, acne spots, excess sebum and rough skin texture. PHA helps gently eradicate dead skin cells while causing zero irritation. Infusions of red tea tree extract and Cicassocide™ (Madecassoside) further calm sensitive skin from irritants. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply a proper amount on the face and pat gently for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and night, daily','produits/serum_1_86320.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/serum_1_86320.jpg\", \"produits/serum_2_79134.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_202301_(540_x_720_pixel)_60600.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_202324_(540_x_720_pixel)_64938.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_202412_(540_x_720_pixel)_43352.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_202444_(540_x_720_pixel)_65078.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3370,'Charcoal BHA Pore Clay Bubble Mask',NULL,81.000,'The Some By Mi Charcoal BHA Pore Clay Bubble Mask is a skin-purifying wash off mask that improves skin texture and tone. Formulated with Charcoal Extract and Kaolin, it effectively removes any dead skin cells, sebum and oil in your pores while refining enlarged pores. It is also powered by patented ingredient Truecica to soothe skin and carbonated water to revitalize it <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily','For intensive blackhead cleansing: Spread a small amount of the product over your dry face, avoiding the eye area. Spread the product thinly and evenly, like when applying a facial mask. Leave the bubble pack on for 3-5 minutes after the foam has appeared. Then gently rub your face using small, circular motions and a small amount of water to remove impurities. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20230118_214217_(540_x_720_pixel)_12134.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230118_214217_(540_x_720_pixel)_12134.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_214228_(540_x_720_pixel)_79008.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_214251_(540_x_720_pixel)_73053.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_214313_(540_x_720_pixel)_45843.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230118_214324_(540_x_720_pixel)_71474.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3371,'Secret Key Snow White Cream',NULL,105.000,'The Secret Key Snow White Cream is a tone-up cream that helps brighten the skin instantly. The star ingredient, niacinamide, helps improve dull complexion while fighting redness and dark spots. This cream can also be used as a hydrating makeup base that acts as a shield to protect the skin from harmful elements of makeup. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ All in one cream <br>\r\nIt leaves the skin hydrated and radiant from inside to outside. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ All in one base cream <br>\r\nit is enough without the need for BB cream, makeup base, or moisturizer <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ Contains Niacinamide <br>\r\nNiacinamide is a whitening ingredient certified by Koreas Ministry of Food and Drug Safety, that gives the skin REAL whitening care from whithin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nTHOSE WHO <br>\r\n☞ have dark skin and dull complexions <br>\r\n☞ have excessive sebum <br>\r\n☞ have oily skin and constantly need to retouch their makeup <br>\r\n☞ have enlarged pores that can not be covered even by makeup <br>\r\n☞want all in one makeup base <br>\r\nSnow White Cream is the right choice!!!!!!! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Take a moderate amount and apply evenly to your skin\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3372,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Sun Cushion',NULL,135.000,'This sun cushion is designed for your comfort: multi-functional, easy-to-carry, and easy-to-use. <br>\r\nSPF 50+ PA++++ hyaluronic sun cushion perfectly protects skin from numerous sun damages providing an immediate soothing effect for sun-irritated skin ending up with a natural glow and whitening effect. It contains 8 types of Hyaluronic Acids for powerful hydration, Ceramide to strengthen the skin barrier and prevent dryness and Pearl Extract to provide skin with natural and youthful glow. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 15g','1. Take a appropriate amount on the puff &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Spread it thinly on desired skin area and pat gently to finish &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it the morning, daily','produits/IMG_20221218_103305_(540_x_720_pixel)_16955.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221218_103305_(540_x_720_pixel)_16955.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_103321_(540_x_720_pixel)_64726.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_103337_(540_x_720_pixel)_49178.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_103406_(540_x_720_pixel)_89609.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3373,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Sun Balm',NULL,129.000,'2-in-1 multi stick sunblock with moisture replenishment <br>\r\n# 5 Hyaluronic Acids <br>\r\n# Airy matte finish <br>\r\n# Moisturizing <br>\r\n# SPF50+ PA++++ <br>\r\n<br>\r\nHyaluronic Acid Secret Sun Balm is formulated with 5 types of peptides that provides intense hydration. It aslo contains panthenol for long lasting moisture and 5 peptides that stimulate collagen and improve skin elasticity. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSun protection with a single swipe <br>\r\nANYTIME, ANYWHERE <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 12g','At the last step of skincare, apply gently onto the face &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; night, daily','produits/IMG_20221218_163629_(540_x_720_pixel)_28052.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221218_163629_(540_x_720_pixel)_28052.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_163645_(540_x_720_pixel)_83128.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_163706_(540_x_720_pixel)_12613.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_163752_(540_x_720_pixel)_64284.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3374,'Vita C Talk Serum',NULL,120.000,'Containing 10% of Vitamin B3, B5 derivatives and Vitamin C, brightening agents niacinamide and ethyl ascoryl ether alongside antioxidants such as lemon extract and carbonated spring water, this serum brightens dull skin for a naturally clear, luminous complexion. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✧ Daily vitamin serum with whitening effect that makes the skin bright and clear. <br>\r\n✧ Niacinamide and Ethyl Ascorbyl Ether with whitening effect helps brighten the skin. <br>\r\n✧ Contains 10% vitamin B3, C, B5 derivatives such as panthenol for bright, clear and moisturized skin. <br>\r\n✧ Contains antioxidant such as lemon extract, carbonated spring water and Ethyl Ascorbyl Ethe. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, 