720_pixel)_59714.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_142202_(540_x_720_pixel)_37397.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3379,'Powder Veil Lips-Talk Veil Breeze #Slow Mauve',NULL,65.000,'The Airy Powder Veil Lips Talk has a creamy texture with airy powder particles that creates soft and dewy lip makeup look. It leaves a soft finish, perfect for those who want a natural makeup look and it is suitable for all occasions.','To create full cover lips, carefully apply it over the entire lip line &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor gradation lips, gently tap it in the center and spread the color','produits/IMG_20221224_140910_(540_x_720_pixel)_29038.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221224_140910_(540_x_720_pixel)_29038.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_140756_(540_x_720_pixel)_49987.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_140808_(540_x_720_pixel)_55533.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221224_140718_(540_x_720_pixel)_29758.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3380,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Foam Cleanser',NULL,105.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Cleanser has a silky soft rich foam that is enriched with Amino Acid to help clean and remove dirt, impurities and dust stuck in your pores, giving you fresh and clean skin after use. Mild & gentle formula is suitable for normal to sensitive skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Sensitive','1. Wet your face and apply an appropriate amount of cleanser onto your palm &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;  \r\n2. Work into a lather and gently massage onto your face using circular motions &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\n3. Rinse thoroughly with water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3381,'They\'re Real! Magnet Extreme Lengthening Mascara',NULL,130.000,'They are Real Magnet is a 36 hour lengthening mascara with a MAGNETIC FORCE <br>\r\nIt is flexible lightweight and builds easily drawing out lashes to EXTREME LENGTHS and making them look 40 percents longer','They\'re Real! Magnet is a 36-hour lengthening mascara with a MAGNETIC FORCE. It is flexible, lightweight &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; builds easily drawing out lashes to EXTREME LENGTHS and making them look 40% longer.','produits/WhatsApp_Image_2022-11-16_at_32002_PM_64744.jpeg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/WhatsApp_Image_2022-11-16_at_32002_PM_64744.jpeg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_212434_(540_x_720_pixel)_99785.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_212444_(540_x_720_pixel)_88795.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_212817_(540_x_720_pixel)_44928.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_212457_(540_x_720_pixel)_89740.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3382,'SKINFOOD Honey Sugar Food Mask',NULL,110.000,'SKINFOOD Honey Sugar Food Mask features Manuka Honey and Acacia Honey with Black Sugar to gently exfoliate and moisturize for soft, nourished and healthy skin. <BR>\r\n● 9.29% Manuka Honey + Acacia Honey moisturizes and calms irritated skin <BR>\r\n● 24% Black Sugar to exfoliate and remove dead skin cells for a smooth skin texture <BR>\r\n● Meadowfoam Seed Oil rich in fatty acids to soothe and soften skin texture <BR>\r\n● Propolis Extract to protect and strengthen the skin barrier <BR>\r\n<BR>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, mix the upper and lower layers of the mask. Gently apply all over your face avoiding the eye and mouth area. To exfoliate, gently massage in circular motions concentrating on areas with dead skin cells. Leave on for 5-10 min and rinse off with lukewarm water. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;BR&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nShower-proof texture makes it easy to use for a quick in-shower masking treatment. Apply before hopping into the shower and rinse off in shower after 5-10 min. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;BR&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it once a week',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3383,'Truecica Mineral Calming Tone-Up Suncream',NULL,105.000,'Truecica Mineral Calming Tone-Up Suncream guards against damaging UV rays with SOME BY MI’s mineral sunscreen, which comes packed with the brand’s patented ingredient Truecica™, as well as aloe vera leaf extract to soothe and protect skin while leaving zero white cast. The reef-friendly formula ensures minimal damage to the environment. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Take appropriate amount on skin and apply. Pat in to absorb.','produits/IMG_20230119_203315_(540_x_720_pixel)_12308.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_203315_(540_x_720_pixel)_12308.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_203334_(540_x_720_pixel)_75399.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_203444_(540_x_720_pixel)_44464.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_203614_(540_x_720_pixel)_61069.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_203828_(540_x_720_pixel)_11605.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3384,'Moistfull Collagen Eye Cream',NULL,125.000,'This formula has been enhanced to improve skin nutrition and elasticity around the eye area. It contains an allergen free fragrance and a higher concentration of hydrolyzed collagen, increased from 63.65% to 65.14%. Enr