t hydrating essence that keeps your skin moist and plump. The small particles of the Super Collagen™ Water and White Lupin extract provides deep moisture resulting in a youthful and glowing complexion. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing and applying toner, put the essence onto the face and pat to absorb &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20221219_001052_(540_x_720_pixel)_12058.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221219_001052_(540_x_720_pixel)_12058.png\", \"produits/IMG_20221219_001340_(540_x_720_pixel)_84681.png\", \"produits/IMG_20221219_001517_(540_x_720_pixel)_15320.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221219_000740_(540_x_720_pixel)_72352.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3387,'Moistfull Collagen Intense Cleansing Foam',NULL,105.000,'The ETUDE HOUSE Moistfull Collagen Cleansing Foam is a hydrating cleansing foam that keeps your skin moist and balanced after cleansing. The fine particles of the Super Collagen™ Water allows for this foam cleanser to thoroughly cleanse accumulated dead skin cells and impurities from pores and moisturise the skin, leaving it feeling bouncy and dewy after each use. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount to wet hands and lather, then thoroughly rub the entire face and rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20221218_232352_(540_x_720_pixel)_13340.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221218_232352_(540_x_720_pixel)_13340.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_232332_(540_x_720_pixel)_46408.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_232427_(540_x_720_pixel)_45705.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221218_232450_(540_x_720_pixel)_64225.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3388,'Green Tea Seed Serum Holiday Edition',NULL,250.000,'1. A must-have jumbo-size edition, a perfect gift for everyone <br>\r\nThis jumbo-size limited edition of our best-selling Green Tea Seed Serum is twice the size of the original product. It is a great year-end gift for your loved ones.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n2. Hydrating serum that makes your skin dewy and glowing <br>\r\nGreen Tea Seed Serum, innisfree’s signature product for intensive hydration care, opens up the moisture path to sufficiently hydrate dry skin, making it clear, moist and glowing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n3. Limited-edition Steven Harrington design <br>\r\nThis year, innisfree collaborates with Steven Harrington, a L.A-based artist and designer known for his cheerful and contemporary, psychedelic pop-aesthetics, to produce a limited edition innisfree 2020 Green Holidays gift collection. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount onto thoroughly cleansed face and neck then gently smooth for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3389,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Brightening Sheet Mask Box',NULL,65.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Brightening Mask made with silky soft and natural fiber sheet material from Japan as well as infused with rich moisturising essence of Vitamin C, Wild Thyme extract and Platinum to help brighten & instantly replenish and retain skin moisture for a long-lasting hydration, leaving you with soft, supple and luminous skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Use after facial cleansing. Place the mask sheet on your face. Smooth out mask to ensure a perfect fit. Leave mask on for 15 -20 minutes before removal. Gently massage the remaining essence into skin until fully absorbed. No need to rinse off &amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;gt;\r\nRecommended to use 2-3 times weekly for best results',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3390,'HOLIKA HOLIKA Hard Cover Glow Cushion EX #03 Sand Ivory',NULL,150.000,'This Hard Cover Glow Cushion EX Set includes: <br>\r\nHard Cover Glow Cushion 14g + Refill 14g <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n❊ A cushion with powerful broad spectrum SPF50+ PA+++ to blur imperfection, leaving a hydrated glow. <br>\r\n❊ The formula is infused with ampoule extracted from plant-based ingredients to moisturize your skin for a radiant, dewy complexion. <br>\r\n❊ Features a patented Blue Barrier™ formula to protect the skin against external pollutants. <br>\r\n❊ Helps brighten skin tone while diminishing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. After taking the proper amount, apply gently over the face along the skin texture. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Apply on the edges of the puff and apply it to the curved areas such as the nose and eyes. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3391,'Pure Beauty Urban Shield Antioxidant Radiant Day Cream SPF20',NULL,65.000,'PURE BEAUTY Antioxidant Radiant Day Lotion provides SPF20 protection to shield your skin from harmful rays while reviving tired skin, helping to smooth fine lines and wrinkles and giving you a fresh glow. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','Use in the morning following Serum, apply on perfectly cleansed and toned face, neck and decollate. Gently massage into skin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it in the morning, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3392,'Jeju Orchid Sleeping Mask',NULL,150.000,'Early-action, multi-tasking sleeping mask with Orchidelixir 2.0™ and lavender oil helps strengthen, firm, smooth, nourish and brighten the look of skin while you sleep! <br>\r\n<br>\r\n1. For well-rested healthy skin <br>\r\nIt provides deep hydration and firmness to the skin while lavender oil smoothly coats the skin to help relieve skin stress overnight. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n2. Highly blendable texture <br>\r\nNourishing rich texture blends thoroughly in with the skin to keep the skin moisturized and smooth overnight. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','At the last stage of evening skin care, apply onto the entire face, avoiding the eye and lip area. Gently massage for better absorption. Leave on overnight and rinse with water in the morning. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230115_202618_(540_x_720_pixel)_87116.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_202618_(540_x_720_pixel)_87116.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202635_(540_x_720_pixel)_21525.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202653_(540_x_720_pixel)_27640.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202711_(540_x_720_pixel)_86705.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202805_(540_x_720_pixel)_73773.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3393,'Green Tea Seed Eye and Face Ball',NULL,125.000,'● An eye serum infused with Jeju green tea and green tea seed oil that delivers intense hydration with a cooling roll-on massage-tip applicator.<br>\r\n● Beauty Green Tea ingredient, highly enriched with amino acids, opens up the water way for clear and hydrated skin. <br>\r\n● Dual-Moisture-Rising Technology™ applied Fresh Green Tea Water locks in moisture to keep water way and Seed Oil forms a moisture protective layer.<br>\r\n● Cool texture and roller ball massager helps care fatigue eye area for a more vitalized-looking complexion.<br>\r\nInnisfree No. 1, \"Beauty Green Tea\" <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Pump once and gently massage along the wrinkles over your eyes and face for penetration &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_4204_85975.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_4204_85975.png\", \"produits/IMG_4204_62378.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_195257_(540_x_720_pixel)_23682.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_195315_(540_x_720_pixel)_65327.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_195327_(540_x_720_pixel)_63963.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3394,'SKINFOOD Strawberry Sugar Food Mask',NULL,95.000,'Cleanse Pores and Exfoliate with Strawberry Sugar Food Mask! Rich in antioxidants, Strawberry Fruit Extract and 36% Black Sugar gently exfoliates and purifies pores for a smooth and hydrated complexion. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','After cleansing, apply the mask on the entire face, and rinse off after 5~10 minutes &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it once a week',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3395,'Bath and Body Works Japanese Cherry Blossom Fine Fragrance Mist',NULL,75.000,'❀ What it smells like: the fragrance equivalent of your little black dress—beautiful, timeless and undeniably feminine. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n❀ Fragrance notes: Japanese cherry blossom, Asian pear, fresh mimosa petals, white jasmine and blushing sandalwood.','Scent your skin with a light-as-air-mist that\'s super layerable',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3396,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Eye Emulsion',NULL,75.000,'Skin Advanced Platinum Watery Luminous Eye Emulsion has an oil-free formulation that contains Hyaluronic Acid which can be easily absorbed to effectively hydrate and smooth skin around eye areas. <br>\r\nContains Billygoat Plum Fruit extract and Antarcticine Marine Ingredient C which help protect skin against dryness, minimise the appearance of fine lines, restore skin firmness and boost its elasticity, leaving you with rejuvenated and brighter-looking eyes. <br>\r\nFree from Silicone Oil, Triglyceride and Mineral Oil <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount of eye emulsion on fingers and apply around the eye contour area using an inwards to outwards motion until fully absorbed.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3397,'Cheek Stars  Tour Palette',NULL,440.000,'Relive the greatest hits with a star-studded palette of Benefit blushes, bronzers & highlighters from past & present! The NEW Cheek Stars Reunion Tour cheek palette features bestselling Hoola matte bronzer, Cookie golden pearl highlighter, and newly updated cult-favorite shades of Georgia, Dallas and Sugarbomb. This sensational palette comes complete with a super-soft cheek brush and our Signature Tips & Tricks to help you hit all the high notes! <br>\r\n5 full-size powders <br>\r\n♡ Dallas rosy bronze blush <br> \r\n♡ Georgia golden peach blush <br> \r\n♡ Sugarbomb rosy pink blush <br>','5 full-size powders &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n♡ Dallas rosy bronze blush &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\n♡ Georgia golden peach blush &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt; \r\n♡ Sugarbomb rosy pink blush &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/cheek_stars_palette_2_82726.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/cheek_stars_palette_2_82726.png\", \"produits/paleete_73529.jpeg\", \"produits/palette_57139.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3398,'Jeju Orchid Eye Cream',NULL,125.000,'Innisfree Jeju Orchid Eye Cream is an anti-aging eye cream that helps reduce wrinkles, increase elasticity and improve skin tone. Formulated with Orchid Elixir 2.0™ from Jeju orchids, which are full of antioxidants, and leave your skin healthy, radiant and glowing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply sparingly to entire eye area with fingertips\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night','produits/IMG_20221225_230035_(540_x_720_pixel)_47211.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221225_230035_(540_x_720_pixel)_47211.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_230053_(540_x_720_pixel)_59892.png\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_230106_(540_x_720_pixel)_34918.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_230130_(540_x_720_pixel)_59059.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3399,'Super Volcanic Peel Off Mask 2X',NULL,130.000,'Super Volcanic Peel Off Mask 2X is a no-rinse peel off clay mask to remove impurities in the pores and leaves skin clean and smooth. Infused with Jeju Volcanic Cluster Spear ™, which has twice the strength of sebum absorption than the previous Volcanic Cleansing Foam, to remove even the finest dust in the pores. This gel-textured formula tightly coats the skin and gives a cooling effect to the pores, lifting away any excess sebum or impurities for smoother skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily','1. After cleansing, spread evenly on a dry face avoiding the eye and lip area, or on the desired spot &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. When the skin feels tight and the content is dry after 20-30 minutes, peel off slowly from the top &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n* Use after applying lotion for milder peel-off &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse 1-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20221225_232929_(540_x_720_pixel)_73538.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221225_232929_(540_x_720_pixel)_73538.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_232947_(540_x_720_pixel)_54042.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_233002_(540_x_720_pixel)_70456.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221225_233026_(540_x_720_pixel)_26296.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3400,'Plastikos HIFU Lifting Cushion #21',NULL,220.000,'Plastikos - HIFU Lifting Cushion is the perfect blend of skincare and weightless coverage in one.\r\nNever messy or cakey, Plastikos Cushion is loaded with botanicals that hydrate, protect and brighten the skin for a naturally flawless finish that lasts all day while protecting the skin from UV rays. This unique Korean cushion technology pumps the content only when it’s pressed, keeping the product fresher longer. It provides a lightweight yet excellent coverage for a flawless complexion and Conceals the appearance of pores, blemishes and imperfections while staying put for long. Besides, it is infused with oil-absorbing powder to leave your complexion shine-free with a silky-soft and semi-matte finish. This compact also has a refill. <br>\r\nAvailable in two beautiful shades <br>\r\n#21Whitening <br>\r\n#23Natural <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n➤ Brand new medical beauty products <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Breakthrough technology enhances the V-Lift <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Instant lifting and continuous improvement of contour powder <br>\r\n \r\n➤ Tighten pores, moisturize, lifting, tighten, rejuvenate <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Sunscreen SFP50 <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Strong makeup holding power: color will not leave on the surgical mask <br>\r\n\r\n➤ High concealing power:  Perfectly cover pores, fine lines and other skin imperfections <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','At the end of your skincare routine, press the sponge on the built-in puff to soak up a desired amount of the content and apply over the face using a tapping motion. After each use, be sure to keep the compact closed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nTo insert the refill, flip the product over and push the bottom out with both thumbs. Carefully align and press in the refill.','produits/IMG_20230129_021128_(540_x_720_pixel)_53917.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_021128_(540_x_720_pixel)_53917.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021145_(540_x_720_pixel)_46271.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021201_(540_x_720_pixel)_58409.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021211_(540_x_720_pixel)_25844.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021223_(540_x_720_pixel)_28459.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021240_(540_x_720_pixel)_72707.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3401,'Plastikos Face Lifting Mist Puchu Puchu',NULL,140.000,'Tone and hydrate your skin in one step with our multi-functional Lifting Mist. Formulated with one of nature’s most powerfully hydrating and skin-brightening ingredients, Puchu Puchu Lifting Mist holds incredible water-retention properties that delivers deep moisture to the skin, instantly lifts and tightens, and gives your complexion a healthy, plump appearance. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, spray the mist gently all over your face. Follow with your serum and moisturiser.\r\nCan also be sprayed throughout the day to refresh makeup and hydrate the skin.\r\n*Recommended with Plastikos - HIFU Lifting Cushion \r\n( Perfect Combination )',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3402,'Blush Boss Cheek Palette',NULL,400.000,'Palette includes: <br>\r\n<br>\r\nHoola matte powder bronzer for face (full-size) <br>\r\nDandelion baby-pink brightening face powder (full-size) <br>\r\nDandelion Twinkle nude-pink powder highlighter & luminizer (full-size) <br>\r\nGALifornia sunny golden-pink blush (full-size) <br>','Palette includes: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nHoola matte powder bronzer for face (full-size) &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nDandelion baby-pink brightening face powder (full-size) &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nDandelion Twinkle nude-pink powder highlighter &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; luminizer (full-size) &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nGALifornia sunny golden-pink blush (full-size) &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/palette_bb_28740.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/palette_bb_28740.png\", \"produits/palette_43758.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_211900_(540_x_720_pixel)_55491.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_211913_(540_x_720_pixel)_24834.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3403,'Vanity Flare Nude Eyeshadow Palette',NULL,197.000,'This everyday neutral eyeshadow palette features 12 powder eyeshadows in 3 finishes: soft matte, satin, and shimmer. These rich eyeshadows are easy to blend & build, perfect for pairing together to create custom, natural-looking eyeshadow looks! It’s your NEW go-to palette for day-time neutral eyeshadow looks… plus it’s portable & purse friendly! Includes Benefit’s Signature Tips & Tricks with guided eyeshadow application steps. Palette features built-in mirror for on-the-go application.','For a base, start with a soft matte shade. To add dimension, layer on a deeper shade. To create an eye-opening effect, press any shimmer shade onto the center of the eyelid!\r\nTo make the shadows really POP, apply them wet to intensify pigment!','produits/fanity_flare_18455.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/fanity_flare_18455.jpg\", \"produits/flare_51113.jpg\", \"produits/vanity_flare_98699.jpg\", \"produits/vanity_34328.jpg\", \"produits/van_fla_23263.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3404,'Benefit Dallas Rosy Bronze Blush',NULL,156.000,'Say ‘Howdy’ to a NEW Dallas!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nGiddy-up, gorgeous! Benefit’s fan fave Dallas blush has gotten a rosy makeover! The NEW Dallas features a slightly pinker shade with a soft shimmer that’s perfect for cheeks. Available in fullsize & a travel-size mini to pop in your purse, kick up your heels and get glowing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nDETAILS:<br> \r\n♡ NEW! rosy bronze shade<br>\r\n♡ Hint of shimmer<br>\r\n♡ Includes mirror & soft, natural-bristle brush <br>','Say &lsquo;Howdy&rsquo; to a NEW Dallas!\r\n\r\nGiddy-up, gorgeous! Benefit&rsquo;s fan fave Dallas blush has gotten a rosy makeover! The NEW Dallas features a slightly pinker shade with a soft shimmer that&rsquo;s perfect for cheeks. Available in fullsize &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; a travel-size mini to pop in your purse, kick up your heels and get glowing.\r\n\r\nDETAILS:\r\n\r\nNEW! rosy bronze shade\r\nHint of shimmer\r\nAvailable in full-size &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; mini\r\nIncludes mirror &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; soft, natural-bristle brush','produits/3_50019.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/3_50019.jpg\", \"produits/dallas_49665.jpg\", \"produits/03-dallas-mini-swatch_23958.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3405,'Benefit Hoola Toasted Bronzer',NULL,156.000,'The bronzer that started it all... <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefit’s bestselling powder bronzer instantly warms up your complexion & gives a classic matte finish. All 4 shades feature the same soft, blendable formula that made the original Hoola a cultfave. Hoola-la!','The bronzer that started it all... \r\n\r\nBenefit&rsquo;s bestselling powder bronzer instantly warms up your complexion &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; gives a classic matte finish. All 4 shades feature the same soft, blendable formula that made the original Hoola a cultfave. Hoola-la!','produits/holla_to_85685.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/holla_to_85685.jpg\", \"produits/toasted_91953.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_211205_(540_x_720_pixel)_62017.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_211225_(540_x_720_pixel)_91524.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_211241_(540_x_720_pixel)_86625.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3406,'Benefit Dandelion Baby-Pink Brightening Blush',N