ula for easy & fast brow filling. <br> \r\n♡ 12-hour* waterproof** formula <br>\r\n♡ 95% said it was easy to fill and shape brows*** <br>\r\n♡94% said it gives beautiful brows on the first try***','Presto&hellip;everyone&rsquo;s an expert with this super easy filling &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; shaping eyebrow pencil. It features a custom, non-sharpen &ldquo;goof-proof&rdquo; tip, soft color and a glide-on formula for easy &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; fast brow filling. Comes complete with built-in blending spoolie-brush and signature Tips &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; Tricks! &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;','produits/et_goof_proof_model_now_to_wow_275_33362.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/et_goof_proof_model_now_to_wow_275_33362.jpg\", \"produits/03-goof-proof-brow-pencil-shade-2-75-swatch_10041.jpg\", \"produits/et_goof_proof_model_aspirational_after_shade_2_7_5_69835.jpg\", \"produits/410OaFvt4aL_90542.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3408,'Mini Goof Proof Brow Pencil (5 - Warm black-brown)',NULL,65.000,'Presto…everyone’s an expert with this super easy filling & shaping eyebrow pencil. It features a custom, non-sharpen “goof-proof” tip, soft color and a glide-on formula for easy & fast brow filling. <br>\r\n\r\n♡ 12-hour* waterproof** formula <br>\r\n♡ 95% said it was easy to fill & shape brows*** <br>\r\n♡ 94% said it gives beautiful brows on the first try***','♡ 12-hour* waterproof** formula\r\n♡ 95% said it was easy to fill &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; shape brows***\r\n♡ 94% said it gives beautiful brows on the first try***','produits/01-goof-proof-brow-pencil-shade-5-model_61392.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/01-goof-proof-brow-pencil-shade-5-model_61392.jpg\", \"produits/03-goof-proof-brow-pencil-shade-5-swatch_94584.jpg\", \"produits/05-goof-proof-brow-pencil-shade-5-now-wow_55458.jpg\", \"produits/410OaFvt4aL_81382.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3409,'3D BROWtones Eyebrow Enhancer (02 - light / medium)',NULL,130.000,'3D BROWtones is now available! Get easy, instant and temporary colourful brows. These sheer, buildable brow gels softly highlight brows and make your eye colour POP. Wear alone or, for best results, over brow pencil. <br>\r\n\r\n♡ 7 sheer, buildable shades <br>\r\n♡ Easy to remove <br>\r\n♡ Water-resistant* <br>\r\n♡ Custom brush with comb tip <br>','apply','produits/01_3d_browtones_swatch_shade-2_15063.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/01_3d_browtones_swatch_shade-2_15063.png\", \"produits/c2429ecb-6bb8-42a1-80a1-501e9089827aa0f1a287cf0a355ef2aae3b0966a46aa_17930.jpeg\", \"produits/medium_1479671082_26328.jpeg\", \"produits/rZXTKA84A3tbJTsGKhAoTlrxrDcuZGOmECROlcmk_16289.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3410,'Brow Styler (4 WARM DEEP BROWN)',NULL,177.000,'This dual ended brow powder & wax pencil is all you need to get 3 brow looks in minutes! The waterproof*, 18-hour wear* wax-pencil sculpts and shapes brows for a clean & shaped look while the loose filling powder builds easily for soft & full brows. Wear them together for bold & defined brows! <br>\r\n<br>\r\n♡ 2-in-1 brow powder & wax pencil <br>\r\n♡ mess-free application <br>\r\n♡ signature Tips & Tricks included <br>\r\n♡ 100% said pencil created a sculpted look** <br>\r\n♡ 98% said powder made brows look fuller** <br>\r\n♡ 99% said Brow Styler is versatile enough to create different brow looks**','This dual ended brow powder &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; wax pencil is all you need to get 3 brow looks in minutes! The waterproof*, 18-hour wear* wax-pencil sculpts and shapes brows for a clean &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; shaped look while the loose filling powder builds easily for soft &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; full brows. Wear them together for bold &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; defined brows! &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n♡ 2-in-1 brow powder &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; wax pencil &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n♡ mess-free application &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n♡ signature Tips &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; Tricks included &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n♡ 100% said pencil created a sculpted look** &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n♡ 98% said powder made brows look fuller** &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n♡ 99% said Brow Styler is versatile enough to create different brow looks**','produits/01_3d_browtones_swatch_shade-2_76725.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/01_3d_browtones_swatch_shade-2_76725.png\", \"produits/2552642_87486.png\", \"produits/maxresdefault_27994.jpg\", \"produits/s-l1600_94330.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3411,'Diorshow Iconic Overcurl Mascara',NULL,150.000,'Diorshow Iconic Overcurl mascara has been reinvented to give eye makeup even more spectacular volume and curl. Designed for all types of lashes, it defines, coats and fans out lashes to the extreme in just one sweep for 24 hours of wear. <br>\r\nCreate glamorously curled lashes day after day. Inspired by professional curling irons, the curved brush styles every lash from bottom to top. High-precision ingredients provide intense definition and hold without clumping or smudging. Creating instant oversized volume and curl, this evolutionary formula nourishes your lashes with a unique lipid complex that strengthens and smooths for long-lasting vitality!!\r\n','Apply the mascara vertically with the concave side of the brush, then boost and set the curl by pressing the brush against the upper lashes for an eyelash-curler effect.','produits/51du31jbIsL_43150.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/51du31jbIsL_43150.jpg\", \"produits/63017131460675bfa8171bd12daf6542_40403.jpg\", \"produits/Diorshow-Iconic-Overcurl_84226.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3412,'Precisely, My Brow Pencil',NULL,130.000,'Oh my WOW…precise & defined eyebrows! This ultra-fine eyebrow pencil draws incredibly natural-looking, hair-like strokes that last 12 budge-proof hours.* A few strokes of the rich yet blendable color will transform brows from shapeless & undefined to filled  & defined eyebrows. <br>\r\nAvailable in <br>\r\n3 - Warm light brown','Oh my WOW&hellip;precise &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; defined eyebrows! This ultra-fine eyebrow pencil draws incredibly natural-looking, hair-like strokes that last 12 budge-proof hours.* A few strokes of the rich yet blendable color will transform brows from shapeless &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; undefined to filled &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; defined eyebrows.','produits/04-precisely-my-brow-shade-3-now-wow_72721.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/04-precisely-my-brow-shade-3-now-wow_72721.jpg\", \"produits/05-precisely-my-brow-shade-3-5-now-wow_89496.jpg\", \"produits/05-precisely-my-brow-shade-5-now-wow_88990.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3413,'Brow Contour Pro',NULL,177.000,'What it is: <br>\r\nA four-in-one defining and highlighting brow pencil to contour and carve out your perfect brow look. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nWhat it does: <br>\r\nDefine and highlight your brows with Benefit’s new Brow Contour Pro 4-in-1 Defining and Highlighting Brow Pencil. This multitasking brow pencil features a lighter and deeper brow shade to give your brows depth and dimension, plus an edge-definer and arch-highlighter to clean and shape your brows. Turn shapeless, flat-looking brows into defined, contoured brows, effortlessly. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nAvailable in <br>\r\nBrown Black Deep','What it is:\r\nA four-in-one defining and highlighting brow pencil to contour and carve out your perfect brow look.\r\n\r\nWhat it does:\r\nDefine and highlight your brows with Benefit&rsquo;s new Brow Contour Pro 4-in-1 Defining and Highlighting Brow Pencil. This multitasking brow pencil features a lighter and deeper brow shade to give your brows depth and dimension, plus an edge-definer and arch-highlighter to clean and shape your brows. Turn shapeless, flat-looking brows into defined, contoured brows, effortlessly.\r\n\r\nBrow Contour Pro is available in five shades for a wide range of hair colors and skin tones. The easy-to blend formula features up to 24 hours of long wear*, and is waterproof**.','produits/41exRj+WwwL_AC_SY780__73014.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/41exRj+WwwL_AC_SY780__73014.jpg\", \"produits/67942d94eb9326b2c161d4d724f632f31aa84451_602004093417_2_97904.jpg\", \"produits/benefit-brow-contour-in-hand_98495.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3414,'BROWVO! Conditioning Eyebrow Primer Mini',NULL,65.000,'It\'s a brow RE-appearing act with this nutrient-rich eyebrow primer! Worn alone BROWVO! conditions & smooths brows. Worn as a primer it enhances extends the wear of other brow products. This conditioning formula contains keratin soy proteins known to help brows look THICKER, HEALTHIER & FULLER. Signature Tips & Tricks included!','It\'s a brow RE-appearing act with this nutrient-rich eyebrow primer! Worn alone BROWVO! conditions &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; smooths brows. Worn as a primer it enhances extends the wear of other brow products. This conditioning formula contains keratin soy proteins known to help brows look THICKER, HEALTHIER &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; FULLER. Signature Tips &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; Tricks included!','produits/01-browvo-model_35316.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/01-browvo-model_35316.jpg\", \"produits/03-browvo-swatch_99258.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3415,'Gimme Brow+ Volumizing Eyebrow Gel',NULL,130.000,'Gimme Brow+ tinted eyebrow gel contains tiny microfibers that adhere to skin & hairs, creating natural-looking fullness. The custom, tiny, tapered brush provides easy & mess-proof application. Poof...like magic, fuller-looking brows will appear!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n♡ 94% said brows looked visibly thicker <br>\r\n♡ volumizes, tames & tints brows <br>\r\n♡ natural-looking & buildable <br>\r\n♡ water-resistant & long-wearing <br>\r\n♡ same cult-fave Gimme Brow…updated ingredients <br>\r\n<br>\r\nAvailable in <br>\r\nCool Gray','Gimme Brow+ tinted eyebrow gel contains tiny microfibers that adhere to skin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; hairs, creating natural-looking fullness. The custom, tiny, tapered brush provides easy &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; mess-proof application. Poof...like magic, fuller-looking brows will appear!\r\n\r\n94% said brows looked visibly thicker*\r\nvolumizes, tames &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; tints brows\r\nnatural-looking &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; buildable\r\nwater-resistant &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; long-wearing\r\nsame cult-fave Gimme Brow&hellip;updated ingredients','produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-cool-grey-now-wow_62595.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-cool-grey-now-wow_62595.jpg\", \"produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-shade-2-now-wow_69313.jpg\", \"produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-shade-3-75-now-wow_35469.jpg\", \"produits/05-gimme-brow-plus-shade-4-5-now-wow_60364.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3416,'Real Vita C Ampoule',NULL,98.000,'Real Vita C Ampoule is a gentle yet effective serum to help restore skin\'s youthful glow and minimise the appearance of hyperpigmentation and wrinkles. It is Formulated to rejuvenate the skin and reduce the look of acne scars/ pigmentation for a clearer skin tone and firmer, healthier skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVolume : 15 ml','1.Apply 2~3 drops on both cheekbones or other desired areas &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2.Gently spread out from cheeks to forehead and chin &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3.Gently massage and pat lightly for better absorption','produits/0007432_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_46371.jpeg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0007432_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_46371.jpeg\", \"produits/0007433_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_92495.jpeg\", \"produits/0007434_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_68635.jpeg\", \"produits/0007435_k-secret-real-vita-c-ampoule_46365.jpeg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3417,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Ampoule',NULL,104.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Ampoule is a highly concentrated serum infused hyaluronic acid to hydrate, plump, soothe and support the skin moisture barrier. This lightweight ampoule absorbs quickly into skin, and is perfect for babes with dry, rough, dehydrated or flaky skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 30 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount on desired skin area. Evenly spread and gently massage for absorption.','produits/0007301_k-secret-hyaluronic-acid-secret-ampoule_76104.jpeg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0007301_k-secret-hyaluronic-acid-secret-ampoule_76104.jpeg\", \"produits/0007302_k-secret-hyaluronic-acid-secret-ampoule_61066.jpeg\", \"produits/0007305_k-secret-hyaluronic-acid-secret-ampoule_80920.jpeg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3418,'Collagen Boosting Secret Ampoule',NULL,119.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Ampoule is an anti-aging booster that rejuvenates your skin by preventing the formation of wrinkles and reducing their appearance. It target wrinkles, hydrates, soothes irritation and redness, brightens and strengthens skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVolume : 30 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply an appropriate amount on desired skin area. Evenly spread and gently massage for absorption.','produits/0007306_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_42985.jpeg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0007306_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_42985.jpeg\", \"produits/0007307_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_20874.jpeg\", \"produits/0007308_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_84658.jpeg\", \"produits/0007309_k-secret-collagen-boosting-secret-ampoule_38876.jpeg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3419,'The Body Shop - Revitalizing Facial Roller',NULL,125.000,'This Y-Shaped Sculpting Roller is the perfect accompaniment to your Korean skin care routine! This gorgeous roller is designed with two massaging roller balls to help relax facial tension, while lifting and tightening the skin. Intended to mimic the effects of a professional deep-kneading facial massage, this tool will sculpt and firm every curve and contour of your face. Regular use can visibly stimulate, revive and tighten tired skin, and help with the overall improvement of your complexion.','As these products are fragile, please handle with care.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nAfter applying your skin care products, gently roll over your skin in an outward and upwards direction along the contours of your face for 5-10 minutes daily.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nTo clean the roller, simply wipe the surface with a damp towel and dry afterwards or just wash it and let it dry afterwards','produits/51BECfj9kEL_26590.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/51BECfj9kEL_26590.jpg\", \"produits/51QvwS+n6LL_27961.jpg\", \"produits/body_shop_twin_ball_revitalising_facial_massager__face_roller__massage_1548776545_6662bcc5_progressive_78308.jpg\", \"produits/Facial_Massager_32565.jpg\", \"produi