agrance Mist',NULL,85.000,'* What it smells like: a timeless, feminine, alluring night on the town. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n* Fragrance notes: raspberry noir, amber crystals, velvety rose petals, creamy patchouli and mocha musk.','Spray',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3428,'Perfect 9 Repair Serum EX',NULL,300.000,'A complete anti-aging serum for 9 signs of skin aging. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵Wrinkle care and whitening effect <br>\r\nThis repair serum, containing 9 active ingredients from the Jeju elixir complex™, enhances your skin\'s texture. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵Solution for 9 signs of aging skin <br>\r\nPerfect repair for dryness, wrinkles, flakiness, darkening, blemishes, enlarged pores, and reduced skin elasticity. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount thoroughly onto the face and neck, then gently smooth for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230115_202058_(540_x_720_pixel)_77661.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_202058_(540_x_720_pixel)_77661.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202120_(540_x_720_pixel)_78792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202110_(540_x_720_pixel)_77996.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_202206_(540_x_720_pixel)_36529.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3429,'Collagen by Watsons Hydro Balance Refreshing Foam Cleanser',NULL,120.000,'Collagen by Watsons Hydro Balance Cleansing Foam  is a mild deep cleanser with a soft and creamy foam to provide deep cleansing for the removal of dirt and impurities leaving skin supple and refreshed. It brings the glow back to dull and tired looking skin, promotes firmer skin and prevent the visible signs of ageing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Apply an appropriate amount on your palm and form a rich lather with water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Gently massage the foam onto your face and rinse thoroughly with water &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3430,'Collagen By Watsons Hydro Balance Active Toner',NULL,120.000,'Collagen by Watsons Hydro Balance features Collume , an award-winning biodesigned Vegan Collagen that is 20x more powerful* than traditional Marine Collagen to help increase skin firmness and elasticity. It deeply rejuvenates your skin with innovative hydrating ingredients and an advanced Smart Water Replenisher that strengthens the skin-barrier to optimise its moisture-sebum balance and lock in moisture, leaving skin feeling energised and revitalised. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, put an appropriate amount on a cotton puff or hands and gently apply to your face. Pat skin with your palms until fully absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3431,'Secret Key Rose Floral Softening Toner',NULL,105.000,'Secret Key Rose Floral Softening Toner is a unique concentrated toner that locks in moisture, soothe and soften skin, while treating uneven skin tone and hyperpigmentation with a natural rose fragrance that helps balance your emotions and relax your senses. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','After cleansing, use on a cotton pad or directly on your palms. Pat into your skin until fully absorbed and continue with the rest of your routine &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3432,'Bath and Body Works Hibiscus Paradise Fine Fragrance Mist',NULL,75.000,'❀ What it smells like: Let pink hibiscus, juicy guava and coconut take you to your personal tropical oasis. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n❀ Fragrance notes: Coconut, Hibiscus and Guava','Spray on desired points',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3433,'Bath and Body Works Strawberry Pound Cake Fine Fragrance Mist',NULL,75.000,'What it smells like: the sweet, airy treat you love. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nFragrance notes: fresh strawberries, golden shortcake and whipped cream.','Spray on desired points',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3434,'Bath and Body Works A Thousand Wishes Fine Fragrance Mist',NULL,85.000,'* What it smells like: a sweet, heart-warming celebration.\r\n<br>\r\n* Fragrance notes: pink prosecco, sparkling quince, crystal peonies, gilded amber and amaretto crème','Spray',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3435,'Victoria\'s Secret Bare Vanilla Shimmer Lotion',NULL,85.000,'Victoria\'s Secret Bare Vanilla Lotion is a fresh oriental body mist featuring fruit notes, apple blossom and vanilla. Warm, comforting like a second skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nTop notes: Fruity accord <br>\r\nHeart notes: Apple blossom <br>\r\nBase notes: Vanilla <br>\r\nFamily: Amber','Use on body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3436,'No-Sebum Mineral Powder',NULL,65.000,'A multi-use sebum-absorbing and sebum-control mineral powder that absorbs excess oils to keep the skin smooth and matte. <br>\r\n֍ Double oil-control formula for a shine-free look <br>\r\nSilky pressed powder controls excess oil for a soft, natural-looking matte finish. <br>\r\n֍ With naturally derived Jeju Minerals and Mint <br>\r\nFormulated with Jeju minerals and mint to refresh the skin while maintaining the oil and moisture balance. <br>\r\n֍ Fixes makeup skin tones caused by excess sebum and oil <br>\r\nCorrects clumped up makeup and dull skintones caused by sebum and oil, leaving the skin bright all day long. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. Blotting paper: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nWhen fixing your makeup, dab on the oily T-zone and forehead with the puff as a blotting paper alternative to keep your skin matte and beautiful. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Makeup fixer: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nAfter applying foundation or cushion, place on the entire face as a finish power using a brush to improve the staying power of your makeup. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Dry shampoo: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nOn a busy day when you simply can&rsquo;t find the time to wash your hair or when it becomes greasy in the afternoon, apply lightly on the bangs or the crown area then shake off to remove the oil from your hair and to feel refreshed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Eye primer: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nBefore applying eye makeup, use on the eyelid and right below the eye to improve the blendability of color makeup while reducing smudging and creasing, which will help keep your makeup clean. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Matte lipstick: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nApply a moist lipstick then top it lightly with No-sebum Powder or Pact using a small brush to create lip makeup that feels dewy on the inside and looks matte on the outside. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n6. Body powder: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nApply on sweaty areas, such as the neck line, palms and soles, under the thighs, and inner sides of folded arms or legs, to keep the skin soft and refreshed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20221226_131247_(540_x_720_pixel)_20272.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221226_131247_(540_x_720_pixel)_20272.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_130141_(540_x_720_pixel)_86493.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_080900_(540_x_720_pixel)_37405.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_130222_(540_x_720_pixel)_77827.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3437,'No-Sebum Mineral Pact',NULL,75.000,'No-Sebum Mineral Pact is a replacement for oil-control paper that leaves the skin soft and matte. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n1. Features a double sebum-control system which controls the secretion of sebum to keep the skin soft and fresh all day long. <br>\r\n2. Contains Jeju minerals and mint ingredient that help control the skin\'s oil and moisture to keep it healthy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. In the last stage of your daily skincare routine, use powder puff to gently apply onto entire face or sebum concentrated areas &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. This product may also be used in the last stage of makeup or as desired throughout the day when shine becomes a concern &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20221226_140948_(540_x_720_pixel)_16100.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221226_140948_(540_x_720_pixel)_16100.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_141336_(540_x_720_pixel)_95384.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_141024_(540_x_720_pixel)_26647.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_141055_(540_x_720_pixel)_94690.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3438,'Bija Trouble Lotion',NULL,120.000,'This lightweight emulsion, formulated with bija seed oil, gives a fresh feel to skin with moisture but without the oily feel. <br>\r\n❁ Excellent skin improvement <br>\r\nThe formula contains Jeju bija oil, which features an exceptional skin improvement effect. <br>\r\n❁ Refreshing without feeling slippery <br>\r\nGood for oily skin, this lightweight lotion without any slippery sensation leaves skin moisturized. <br>\r\n❁ A refreshing lotion good for acne-prone skin <br>\r\nNoncomedogenic tested to be used safely on skin troubles. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply an appropriate amount over face and neck then gently smooth for better absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20221226_144131_(540_x_720_pixel)_42133.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221226_144131_(540_x_720_pixel)_42133.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_144201_(540_x_720_pixel)_88874.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_144230_(540_x_720_pixel)_20441.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_144251_(540_x_720_pixel)_31999.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3439,'Plastikos Suju Face Sheet Mask Puchu Puchu (1)',NULL,30.000,'Suju Face Pack Puchu Puchu is a sheet mask that promotes skin\'s elasticity and firmness. A wrinkle free complex—consisting of Lavender, Collagen and Eucalyptus—improves the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles for a lifted, youthful-looking appearance and smooth complexion. Jojoba oil, Adenosine and Rosemary are present to stabilize and keep your skin healthy and prevents skin aging <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','1. After cleansing, skin texture is arranged by skin.\r\n2. Pull out the sheet mask, spread it, and attach the sheet to fit your face shape.\r\n3. After taking a break for about 10 to 20 minutes, remove the sheet and gently tap the remaining essence on the skin.\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20221226_160714_(540_x_720_pixel)_25140.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221226_160714_(540_x_720_pixel)_25140.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_161029_(540_x_720_pixel)_92630.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_160731_(540_x_720_pixel)_19508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_160742_(540_x_720_pixel)_41141.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3440,'Holika Holika Heart Crush Glow Tint Air #BAE',NULL,65.000,'Heart Crush Glow Tint Air is formulated with different moisturizing and nourishing ingredients for healthy-looking lips. It is infused with pure color pigments that deliver vibrant and long-lasting colors. The Bullet Tip makes it easier to control the amount used for a light, airy effect.','1. Apply an appropriate amount onto lips with the flat surface &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Blend the edges with the tip','produits/IMG_20221227_001541_(540_x_720_pixel)_91436.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221227_001541_(540_x_720_pixel)_91436.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221227_001641_(540_x_720_pixel)_30672.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221227_001706_(540_x_720_pixel)_30300.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221227_002429_(540_x_720_pixel)_27079.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3441,'Holika Holika Velvet Blanket Tint Lip Tint #03 Pumpkin Mocha',NULL,65.000,'It is a tint for the lips with creamy texture gives a vivid color and silky touch to your lips. It has a  colored pigment with natural oil component that forms a moisture-protective, comfortable covering with a perfect fit.','Apply on the entire lips along the lip line or on the center of the lips in a tapping motion to express gradation','produits/IMG_20221226_170357_(540_x_720_pixel)_71671.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221226_170357_(540_x_720_pixel)_71671.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221227_002620_(540_x_720_pixel)_29730.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_170548_(540_x_720_pixel)_47047.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221226_170523_(540_x_720_pixel)_59088.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3442,'[BUY 2 GET 1 FREE] Intensive Eye Cream + Diamond Ampoule Sheet Mask (pack of 10) + Nourishing Moisture Cream',NULL,310.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with CQMONG (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br>\r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','The sheet mask: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After washing face, apply sheet mask on face. Pull the eye part of sheet up to just below the eyes, that part will be fully covered. (No need to attach additional Eye Patches)\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week\r\nThe eye cream: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nApply a suitable amount to eye areas and softly pat until absorbed. \r\nUse it day and/or night, daily\r\nThe cream: &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.','produits/IMG_20221228_140900_(540_x_720_pixel)_31730.jpg',NULL,20,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20221228_140900_(540_x_720_pixel)_31730.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221228_140918_(540_x_720_pixel)_68049.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20221228_140936_(540_x_720_pixel)_4