e the appearance of puffiness and fine lines <br>\r\n+ Ease facial muscle tension <br>\r\n+ Help facial oils and moisturizers to absorb better into the skin when massaged in with a Gua Sha Tool','Watch a video','produits/IMG_20230103_231127_(540_x_720_pixel)_34827.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230103_231127_(540_x_720_pixel)_34827.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230103_231223_(540_x_720_pixel)_43848.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230103_231422_(540_x_720_pixel)_60883.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230103_232601_(540_x_720_pixel)_93642.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3454,'Too faced peach perfect foundation warm nude',NULL,160.000,'Peach Perfect Foundation is infused with refreshing peach and sweet fig milk. <br>\r\nThis liquid foundation is designed using the exclusive Comfort Matte formula that provides 14-hour wear. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nWe\'re reinventing mattes with this foundation that delivers a smooth, photogenic finish in a comfortable, velvety, soft-focus texture. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n-Non -oily <br>\r\n-14-hour hold -Controls\r\nexcess sebum <br>\r\n-Photogenic <br>\r\n-Modular coverage <br>\r\n-Anti-transfer <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types.','Apply your foundation with your fingertips or with a sponge. Start at the center of the face and work down and out across the forehead','produits/IMG_20230105_113604_(540_x_720_pixel)_97745.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230105_113604_(540_x_720_pixel)_97745.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_113627_(540_x_720_pixel)_61113.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_113653_(540_x_720_pixel)_26229.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_113841_(540_x_720_pixel)_14284.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3455,'Plump &amp;amp;amp; Prime Face Plumping Primer Serum',NULL,240.000,'This face serum is an express plumping, firming and filling treatment. Prepare, fill and add volume to your skin for a firmer and lifted effect result thanks to this product. The skin is instantly plumped and hydrated and cheekbones and jawline seem lifted after three days.\r\n<br>\r\nA blend of plumping actives and a superstar peptide help reduce the look of fine lines and wrinkles. They improve texture and blur pores for smoother looking skin. The cheekbones appear fuller and the jawline reshaped. <br>\r\n♡ When used regularly, this base provides skin care <br>\r\n✔ Superstar peptide reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. <br>\r\n✔ The blend of actives plumps the skin with a blend of ingredients like St. John\'s Wort, Hydrolyzed Rice Extract and Vitamin C. <br>\r\n♡ The perfect base for applying makeup <br>\r\n✔ The exceptionally smooth texture of the serum makes it easy to apply makeup. <br>\r\n✔ Its light, milky formula instantly absorbs into the skin and gives it a natural glow. ','Apply in the morning before your make-up and in the evening when taking care of your skin. First shake the bottle and then apply the product twice a day for your skin to look more radiant.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nShake before use.\r\nApply two squirts of Plump &amp;amp;amp;amp; Prime to your clean fingertips and sweep the serum over your face and neck, massaging in from the center in an upward motion. Leave on for 2 minutes before applying other facial care products.','produits/IMG_20230105_125515_(540_x_720_pixel)_12001.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230105_125515_(540_x_720_pixel)_12001.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_125548_(540_x_720_pixel)_27341.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_125608_(540_x_720_pixel)_84913.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_113841_(540_x_720_pixel)_73052.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3456,'Plump And Prime Face Plumping Primer Serum',NULL,240.000,'This face serum is an express plumping, firming and filling treatment. Prepare, fill and add volume to your skin for a firmer and lifted effect result thanks to this product. The skin is instantly plumped and hydrated and cheekbones and jawline seem lifted after three days.\r\n<br>\r\nA blend of plumping actives and a superstar peptide help reduce the look of fine lines and wrinkles. They improve texture and blur pores for smoother looking skin. The cheekbones appear fuller and the jawline reshaped. <br>\r\n♡ When used regularly, this base provides skin care <br>\r\n✔ Superstar peptide reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. <br>\r\n✔ The blend of actives plumps the skin with a blend of ingredients like St. John\'s Wort, Hydrolyzed Rice Extract and Vitamin C. <br>\r\n♡ The perfect base for applying makeup <br>\r\n✔ The exceptionally smooth texture of the serum makes it easy to apply makeup. <br>\r\n✔ Its light, milky formula instantly absorbs into the skin and gives it a natural glow.','Apply in the morning before your make-up and in the evening when taking care of your skin. First shake the bottle and then apply the product twice a day for your skin to look more radiant.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nShake before use.\r\nApply two squirts of Plump &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; Prime to your clean fingertips and sweep the serum over your face and neck, massaging in from the center in an upward motion. Leave on for 2 minutes before applying other facial care products.','produits/IMG_20230105_125515_(540_x_720_pixel)_60638.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230105_125515_(540_x_720_pixel)_60638.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_144601_(540_x_720_pixel)_13877.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_125548_(540_x_720_pixel)_79044.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230105_125608_(540_x_720_pixel)_60506.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3457,'CQMONG Intensive Care set',NULL,287.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with CQMONG (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br>\r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','Intensive Eye Cream:\r\nApply a suitable amount to eye areas and softly pat until absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;BR&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nNourishing Moisture Cream:\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nDiamond Ampoule Sheet Mask:\r\n1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After washing face, apply sheet mask on face. Pull the eye part of sheet up to just below the eyes, that part will be fully covered. (No need to attach additional Eye Patches)\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20230129_010313_(540_x_720_pixel)_49384.jpg',NULL,16,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_010313_(540_x_720_pixel)_49384.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_010334_(540_x_720_pixel)_57362.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_010350_(540_x_720_pixel)_66098.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_010359_(540_x_720_pixel)_49456.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3458,'Basic Snail Skincare',NULL,220.000,'✵COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence:<br>\r\nThis essence protects the skin from moisture loss while keeping skin texture smooth. This contains 96% of Snail Secretion Filtrate which keeps your skin moisturized all day while bringing back skin’s vitality. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream: <br>\r\n\r\n94% of Snail Secretion Filtrate makes your skin nourished, hydrated, and healthy. The cream is safe for usage on the skin, consisting of excellent skin-activation components that treat irritated skin and improve uneven skin tone.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','❃ COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence\r\n\r\nIn the essence stage, take a proper amount of essence and gently pat on your face for absorption.\r\n\r\n❃ COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All in one Cream\r\n\r\nTake a proper amount of cream on your palm and gently pat on your face for absorption.','produits/0001176_cosrx-snail-moisture-combo-cosrx-yellow-combo_750_76094.jpeg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0001176_cosrx-snail-moisture-combo-cosrx-yellow-combo_750_76094.jpeg\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_224146_(540_x_720_pixel)_15083.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_224203_(540_x_720_pixel)_48573.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_224217_(540_x_720_pixel)_73736.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3459,'My Lash Serum',NULL,36.000,'My Lash Serum promotes strong and healthy lashes by preventing lashes from not falling from the roots. This clear, transparent formula contains Biotin, an essential component that supports hair health, which is also used in shampoo and supplements to strengthen hair. With a mascara brush as an applicator, this screw brush type delivers the serum to the lashes and roots thoroughly.','After your night skincare routine, apply and brush the serum from the lash roots towards the tips of your lashes. Be careful to avoud the content from entering your eyes.','produits/IMG_20230109_074755_(540_x_720_pixel)_31301.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230109_074755_(540_x_720_pixel)_31301.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074811_(540_x_720_pixel)_68045.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074841_(540_x_720_pixel)_84792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_075352_(540_x_720_pixel)_49574.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074755_(540_x_720_pixel)_81793.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074811_(540_x_720_pixel)_56940.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_074841_(540_x_720_pixel)_13857.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230109_075352_(540_x_720_pixel)_48533.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3460,'AHA BHA PHA 30 DAYS MIRACLE ACNE CLEAR FOAM',NULL,107.000,'AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Acne Clear Foam is an acne-clearing cleanser to help refine skin texture and control excessive oil. Formulated with AHA, BHA and PHA to remove dead skin cells and clear the pores, while Truecica™ calms the skin during cleansing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Dispense an appropriate amount of the cleanser, and rub your hands together to make a rich foam. Apply to face and massage gently. Rinse off with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20230116_013447_(540_x_720_pixel)_18333.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230116_013447_(540_x_720_pixel)_18333.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_013528_(540_x_720_pixel)_23638.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_013845_(540_x_720_pixel)_95741.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_013901_(540_x_720_pixel)_29943.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_014049_(540_x_720_pixel)_58781.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3461,'Honey And Milk Lip Oil',NULL,44.000,'The Apieu Honey & Milk Lip Oil is a lip oil infused with nourishing and moisturizing ingredients, including honey and milk to promote supple and resilient lips. Locks in moisture and deeply hydrates lips for a long-lasting plump and glossy look! Carries a faint milk scent to lift your mood. Great to use alone to make lips look naturally soft, or to top off a lip tint for a glossy effect.','Apply liberally onto lips as needed.','produits/IMG_20230119_221131_(540_x_720_pixel)_37175.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_221131_(540_x_720_pixel)_37175.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_221158_(540_x_720_pixel)_15625.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_221207_(540_x_720_pixel)_34828.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_221222_(540_x_720_pixel)_36745.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3462,'The Saem - Saemmul Essential Tint Lip Balm #RD01',NULL,36.000,'Packed with organic essential oils and natural ingredients, this tinted lip balm soothes and moisturizes chapped lips while giving them a natural-looking tint.','Apply an appropriate amount on lips whenever your lips feel dry.','produits/IMG_20230124_194510_(540_x_720_pixel)_69356.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230124_194510_(540_x_720_pixel)_69356.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230124_194528_(540_x_720_pixel)_49090.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230124_194546_(540_x_720_pixel)_70543.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230124_194721_(540_x_720_pixel)_29100.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3463,'The Saem - Saemmul Essential Tint Lip Balm #PK02',NULL,36.000,'Packed with organic essential oils and natural ingredients, this tinted lip balm soothes and moisturizes chapped lips while giving them a natural-looking tint.','Apply an appropriate amount on lips whenever your lips feel dry.','produits/IMG_20230124_194948_(540_x_720_pixel)_40318.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230124_194948_(540_x_720_pixel)_40318.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230124_195022_(540_x_720_pixel)_79882.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230124_195140_(540_x_720_pixel)_98710.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230124_195433_(540_x_720_pixel)_84886.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3464,'Clio Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion SPF50+ PA+++ 15g + Refill 15g #2.5 Ivory',NULL,151.000,'CLIO together with the meaning of the Greek original word “To Celebrate”, ‘CLIO’ aims t