roduits/IMG_20230115_234243_(540_x_720_pixel)_77862.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_234309_(540_x_720_pixel)_98868.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_234340_(540_x_720_pixel)_79826.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3481,'Miracle Holiday Retinol Intense Special Set',NULL,260.000,'Some By Mi Retinol Intense Reactivating Mask activates internal renewal processes, thereby smoothes, softens and improves skin elasticity, reducing the appearance of wrinkles, pigmentation and other age-related changes. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: \r\n<br>\r\nThis mask reduce signs of aging with its mild formula for sensitive skin.\r\nContains retinol, retinal and bakuchiol to help boost skin elasticity with low irritation. <br>\r\nMicro-fiber sheet perfectly fits the face to provide cream essence and moisture with 10 types of hyaluronic acid. <br>\r\nUses patented technology of Elastic-Liposome to deliver active ingredients into the deep skin layer. <br>\r\nCompleted skin irritation testing.','1. After cleansing and applying toner, apply a proper amount of serum onto the skin and gently pat to let absorb &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\n2. Apply a proper amount of eye cream on the skin around the eyes and lightly dab to let absorb &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\n3. Place the sheet mask onto the skin and leave it for 10-20 minutes then remove. Lightly pat to let remaining products absorb','produits/IMG_20230113_233332_(540_x_720_pixel)_64008.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230113_233332_(540_x_720_pixel)_64008.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230113_233349_(540_x_720_pixel)_49321.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230113_233406_(540_x_720_pixel)_76202.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230113_233458_(540_x_720_pixel)_47760.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3482,'Miracle Holiday Yuja Niacin Brightening Special Set',NULL,360.000,'This Miracle Holiday Yuja Niacin Brightening Special Set contains: <br>\r\n✧ Yuja Niacin Dark Spot Correcting Stick 10g <br>\r\n✧ Yuja Niacin 30 Days Blemish Care Serum 50ml <br>\r\n✧ Yuja Niacin Brightening Sleeping Mask 60ml <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Yuja Niacin Dark Spot Correcting Stick: <br>\r\n◎ A multi-tasking balm helps reduce the appearance of pigmentation and blemishes. <br>\r\n◎ Contains rich Citrus Extract and 8 types of Vitamin for excellent skin-brightening effect. <br>\r\n◎ EVE Vegan certified. <br>\r\n◎ Peptides infused also help combat premature aging signs and improve skin elasticity. <br>\r\n✓ Yuja Niacin 30 Days Blemish Care Serum: <br>\r\n◎ A serum containing Yuzu extract and niacinamide to diminish the appearance of blemishes in 30 days. <br>\r\n◎ Contains 82% of Korean Yuja Extract for brightening and moisturising. <br>\r\n◎ With 5% of Niacinamide to brighten up skin. <br>\r\n◎ Revitalises dull skin and ease off skin stress with 12 types of Vitamins. <br>\r\n◎ It lightweight texture let skin absorb easily and leaves skin without sticky feeling. <br>\r\n✓ Yuja Niacin Brightening Sleeping Mask: <br>\r\n◎ A sleeping mask that brightens and clarifies skin by replenishing vitamins, moisture, and energy overnight to give dull skin a radiance boost. <br>\r\n◎ A dual functional product: Whitening + Anti-wrinkle. <br>\r\n◎ Brightens and moisturises skin with 70% of Goheung Yuja Extract. <br>\r\n◎ Improves skin tone and brightens skin with Glutathione, Arbutin and Resmelin®. <br>\r\n◎ Hydrates skin with Aquaxyl and Fructan™ and vitalizes skin with 10 kinds of vitamins.','1. After cleansing and applying toner, apply a proper amount of serum onto the skin and gently pat to let absorb.\r\n\r\n2. Spin out a proper amount of correcting stick and apply directly onto troubled areas.\r\n\r\n3. Before sleeping, apply a proper amount of sleeping mask onto the skin and wash off the next morning.','produits/IMG_20230114_002045_(540_x_720_pixel)_45854.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230114_002045_(540_x_720_pixel)_45854.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230114_002110_(540_x_720_pixel)_40387.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230114_002232_(540_x_720_pixel)_79540.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230114_002301_(540_x_720_pixel)_30049.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3483,'Miracle Holiday Edition Miracle of Christmas',NULL,280.000,'SOME BY MI Christmas Special Edition featuring the following products: <br>\r\n✧ AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Toner 150ml <br>\r\n✧ Bye Bye Blackhead 30 Days Miracle Green Tea Tox Bubble Cleanser 120g <br>\r\n✧ AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Serum 14ml <br>\r\n✧ Super Matcha Pore Tightening Serum 14ml <br>\r\n✧ Yuja Niacin 30 Days Blemish Care Serum 14ml <br>\r\n✧Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Serum 14ml <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✓ AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Toner: <br>\r\n◎ Contains natural Tea Tree Extract to exfoliate for a healthier skin. <br>\r\n\r\n✓ Bye Bye Blackhead 30 Days Miracle Green Tea Tox Bubble Cleanser: <br>\r\n◎ Formulated with 240,000ppm of Green Tea Water, 16 tea extracts and 5,000ppm of naturally derived BHA to cleanse blackheads and whiteheads from pores for brighter skin. <br>\r\n\r\n✓ AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Serum: <br>\r\n◎ Contains 10,000ppm of Tea Tree Leaves Water helps for trouble and inflammation care.\r\n◎ It also contains 14.5% of Centella Asiatica Leaf Extracts for skin soothing care.\r\n◎ Soothes and moisturizes while minimizing pores. <br>\r\n✓ Yuja Niacin 30 Days Blemish Care Serum: <br>\r\n◎ A dual functional product: Whitening + Anti-wrinkle. <br>\r\n◎ Contains 82% of Korean Yuja Extract for brightening and moisturising. <br>\r\n◎ With 5% of Niacinamide to brighten up skin. <br>\r\n◎ Prevents the forming of melanin with Glutathione and Arbutin. <br>\r\n◎ Revitalises dull skin and ease off skin stress with 12 types of Vitamins. <br>\r\n◎ It lightweight texture let skin absorb easily and leaves skin without sticky feeling. <br>\r\n\r\n✓ Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Serum: <br>\r\n◎ A dual functional product: Whitening + Anti-wrinkle. <br>\r\n◎ Contains 890,000ppm of Snail Truecica™ which consists of Black Snail Extract and Truecica™. <br>\r\n◎ Helps for skin regeneration to repair skin damage with Black Snail Extract, can reapply for extra hydration. <br>\r\n◎ Soothes skin and reinforces skin barrier with Truecica™. <br>\r\n◎ Removes blemishes and scar with a non-sticky finish. <br>\r\n◎ Free of 20 harmful ingredients. Skin irritation test completed.','After cleansing and toning, layer one of the serums included that suits your current skin condition','produits/IMG_20230114_095852_(540_x_720_pixel)_79907.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230114_095852_(540_x_720_pixel)_79907.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230114_095916_(540_x_720_pixel)_50654.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230114_095941_(540_x_720_pixel)_24975.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230114_100007_(540_x_720_pixel)_51877.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3484,'Glow Deep Serum: Rice + Alpha-Arbutin',NULL,125.000,'This serum is designed for those with concerns about pigmentation and uneven skin tone. Containing 68% rice bran water and 2% alpha arbutin, it helps to improve skin tone to become brighter and healthier. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey ingredients <br>\r\n\r\n❁ Rice bran water 68% <br>\r\nRice has played a very important role as a staple food and skin care ingredient in Korean history. <br>\r\nIn the Joseon Dynasty, rice bran water was used like the toner of today, and was called Beauty Water, used for beautiful skin. Rice bran is rich in amino acids and minerals, helping to moisturize dry skin. <br>\r\n\r\n❁ Alpha-Arbutin 2% <br>\r\nAlpha-Arbutin works by inhibiting the tyrosinase activity that limits the melanin production in your skin. Additionally, it is also known to have a 10 times greater effect than regular Beta-Arbutin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','Apply 2-3 drops of serum onto the face. Pat gently to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20230115_123526_(540_x_720_pixel)_15092.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_123526_(540_x_720_pixel)_15092.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_123714_(540_x_720_pixel)_81732.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_123737_(540_x_720_pixel)_42910.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_123823_(540_x_720_pixel)_75379.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3485,'The Saem Eco Soul Lip Oil #02 Berry',NULL,44.000,'The Saem Eco Soul Lip Oil helps to provide long-lasting hydration to lips to combat dry, chapped lips.  \r\n<br>\r\n● Formulated with 95% naturally derived ingredients to nourish and moisturize lips <br>\r\n● Infused with 7 kinds of natural protector ingredients to strengthen skin barrier and improve moisture retention\r\nResults in plump and healthy lips.','Apply an appropriate amount evenly on lips whenever they feel dry','produits/IMG_20230115_130722_(540_x_720_pixel)_96476.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_130722_(540_x_720_pixel)_96476.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_125923_(540_x_720_pixel)_19661.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_130620_(540_x_720_pixel)_90151.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_130644_(540_x_720_pixel)_36728.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3486,'The Niacinamide 15 Serum',NULL,106.000,'Meet a total skin care serum for breakouts and blemishes. The Niacinamide 15 Serum from COSRX is a highly concentrated serum that combines the maximum concentration of niacinamide with optimal ratios of synergistic ingredients for total acne control. Lightweight and non-sticky, this serum will leave your skin radiant, smooth and soothed.  <br>\r\nFormulated with a pure and high concentration of niacinamide to help fade the look for dark spots and improves skin texture, zinc 1% to treat acne, breakouts and reduce sebum secretion, allantoin 1% to moisturize and soothe irritated skin, and acetylglucosamine 2% to exfoliate, smooth skin and refine texture. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n➢ Formulated without fragrance, parabens, sulfates, artificial colors, and mineral oil. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','After cleansing, during the serum phase, apply a few drops to the skin. Use fingertips to gently massage and absorb the serum, starting from the center of the face working towards the edges.','produits/IMG_20230115_133006_(540_x_720_pixel)_83115.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_133006_(540_x_720_pixel)_83115.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_133020_(540_x_720_pixel)_39353.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_133034_(540_x_720_pixel)_86043.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_133211_(540_x_720_pixel)_94129.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3487,'The Vitamin C 23 Serum',NULL,108.000,'Brighten, firm and combat dark spots with The Vitamin C 23 Serum by COSRX, a highly concentrated treatment that fades acne scars and brightens the complexion to revitalize dull and dry skin. Targets dull and rough skin, dark spots and scars, uneven skin texture and fine lines and wrinkles. <br>\r\n\r\nA high concentration of 23% Vitamin C fades acne scars and brightens the complexion by blocking the synthesis of melanin caused by UV exposure. Active and pure ascorbic acid works alongside tocotrienol to protect skin from environmental damage, sodium hyaluronate to maintain hydration, and allantoin to soothe and relieve irritation. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n➢ Formulated without fragrance, parabens, sulfates, artificial colors, and mineral oil.','After cleansing, during the serum phase, shake the bottle lightly once or twice from side to side and apply a few drops to the skin. Use fingertips to gently massage and absorb the serum, starting from the inside of the face working towards the edges','produits/IMG_20230115_134245_(540_x_720_pixel)_90955.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_134245_(540_x_720_pixel)_90955.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_134258_(540_x_720_pixel)_85686.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_134314_(540_x_720_pixel)_47948.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_134329_(540_x_720_pixel)_27772.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3488,'The Retinol 0.5 Oil',NULL,119.000,'Feel the benefits of Retinol without irritation with The Retinol 0.5 Oil by COSRX. This rich and silky night oil provides a healthy glow and hydrated skin. A gentle but concentrated .5% of pure retinol improves the appearance of fine lines, creases, and wrinkles and enhances elasticity. <br>\r\n\r\nThis serum is safe for all skin types, and best for skin accustomed to retinol but still experiencing progressive signs of aging such as loss of elasticity and dryness. It’s an intermediate-level retinol for those looking for a highly concentrated, youth booster.\r\n<br>\r\nVitamin A supports collagen production and skin cell turnover, squalene protects and moisturizes the skin, and vitamin E reduces visible signs of aging and skin damage. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n➢ Formulated without fragrance, parabens, sulfates, artificial colors, alcohol, mineral oil, and silicone.','During evening care, apply 1 to 2 drops to hand and tap with fingertips from inside out, let absorb. Limit initial use to three times per week; gradually increase frequency to every other night, use as tolerated.','produits/IMG_20230115_135611_(540_x_720_pixel)_79219.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_135611_(540_x_720_pixel)_79219.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_135627_(540_x_720_pixel)_74265.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_135645_(540_x_720_pixel)_69897.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_135659_(540_x_720_pixel)_64737.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3489,'THE SAEM Saemmul Perfect Volume Mascara',NULL,60.000,'This mascara has a highly pigmented carbon black formula that gives lashes an ultra-black and well-defined eye makeup look with just one swipe. <br>\r\nIt is resistant to sebum in the eye areas for a long-lasting eye makeup loom','1. Take a moderate amount for use by swiping the brush against the edge of the container &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Wiggle mascara wand in an upward zig zag motion from the roots to the tips of your lashes &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Position the wand vertically and coat every lash','produits/IMG_20230115_141040_(540_x_720_pixel)_67457.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_141040_(540_x_720_pixel)_67457.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_141108_(540_x_720_pixel)_71918.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_141232_(540_x_720_pixel)_54708.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_141336_(540_x_720_pixel)_88902.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3490,'Fixing Tint #Vanilla Cream',NULL,68.000,'Guaranteed to stay put on your lips all day without rubbing off on face masks, this lip tint comes in a matte yet non-drying formula and boasts a lightweight texture that adheres perfectly to lips\r\nApply and dry for 60 seconds, then you’re good to go!','For a bold look, apply a moderate amount along the edge of lips and then fill in the inner part &amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards','produits/IMG_20230115_142442_(540_x_720_pixel)_19024.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_142442_(540_x_720_pixel)_19024.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_142500_(540_x_720_pixel)_68148.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_142516_(540_x_720_pixel)_61518.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_142534_(540_x_720_pixel)_67306.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3491,'Fixing Tint #Rose Latte',NULL,68.000,'Guaranteed to stay put on your lips all day without rubbing off on face masks, this lip tint comes in a matte yet non-drying formula and boasts a lightweight texture that adheres perfectly to lips\r\nApply and dry for 60 seconds, then you’re good to go!','For a bold look, apply a moderate amount along the edge of lips and then fill in the inner part &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards','produits/IMG_20230115_143316_(540_x_720_pixel)_23902.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_143316_(540_x_720_pixel)_23902.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_143326_(540_x_720_pixel)_12332.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_143407_(540_x_720_pixel)_40336.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_143434_(540_x_720_pixel)_14242.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3492,'BTS |  Amorepacific Lip Sleeping Mask Lip And Pop Edition Set',NULL,150.000,'Celebrate BTS’ hit songs with special edition 3-piece BTS | Amorepacific Lip Sleeping Mask Lip & Pop Edition Set, feat. exclusive NEW Butter scent! <br>\r\nThis collectible lip trio includes three delicious scents inspired by BTS\' hit tracks: Butter, Permission to Dance, and Dynamite. Leave lips buttery smooth with NEW, exclusive Butter scent, dance the night away with the return of Peach Iced Tea, and see stars with best-selling Sweet Candy <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ Highlighted Ingredients:\r\n<br>\r\n- Berry Fruit Complex™: Rich in antioxidants to help reveal smooth and supple looking lips.\r\n<br>\r\n- Coconut Oil, Shea Butter, and Murumuru Seed Butter: Help nourish and deliver lasting moisture while you sleep.\r\n<br>\r\n- Vitamin C: Helps protect from external aggressors','1. Apply generously to the lips in the evening and leave on overnight \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. Gently wipe off any excess in the morning as needed','produits/s2639532-av-2-zoom_28056.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/s2639532-av-2-zoom_28056.jpg\", \"produits/s2639532-av-3-zoom_56699.jpg\", \"produits/s2639532-av-4-zoom_74533.jpg\", \"produits/s2639532-av-5-zoom_63318.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3493,'Laneige Water Sleeping Mask_EX 15 ml',NULL,25.000,'LANEIGE Water Sleeping Mask is an overnight, moisture-recharging gel mask that quickly absorbs while you sleep to deeply hydrate skin. Recharge dehydrated skin overnight. This innovative mask is formulated with highly concentrated Hydro Ionised Mineral Water to deliver intense doses of moisture to stressed, parched skin. Calming Sleepscent™, infused with orange flower, rose, and sandalwood, relaxes and comforts while apricot and evening primrose extracts brighten and purify fatigued skin. <br>\r\nWake up to soft, glowing skin <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive ','Apply evenly across face. Leave treatment overnight and rinse off in the morning. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n**Use once or twice a week.','produits/IMG_20230115_154607_(540_x_720_pixel)_80956.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230115_154607_(540_x_720_pixel)_80956.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_154615_(540_x_720_pixel)_58373.jpg\", \"produits/20201207_final_Water-Sleeping-Mask-EX_thumbnail05_71330.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230115_154705_(540_x_720_pixel)_66812.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3494,'JM Solution Disney Collection Vital Vita C Mask',NULL,20.000,'JM Solution Disney Collection Vital Vita C Mask is infused with antioxidants and Vitamin C to help brighten dark spots and blemishes while giving tired-looking skin a glowy complexion. This sheet mask is also vegan certified.','After washing, prepare skin with toner. Apply sheet mask evenly on your face. Remove the mask sheet after 10-20 minutes later and gently pat the remaining essence.','produits/IMG_20230119_213403_(540_x_720_pixel)_72076.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_213403_(540_x_720_pixel)_72076.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_213424_(540_x_720_pixel)_58642.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_213453_(540_x_720_pixel)_48008.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3495,'JM Solution Disney Collection Vital Retinol Mask',NULL,20.000,'JM Solution Disney Collection Vital Retinol Mask is an intensive, vitamin-enriched treatment that improves the look of skinʼs firmness and tone while minimizing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. This saturated custom mask adheres to the face for targeted treatment and visible results.','After washing, prepare skin with toner. Apply sheet mask evenly on your face. Remove the mask sheet after 10-20 minutes later and gently pat the remaining essence.','produits/IMG_20230119_214709_(540_x_720_pixel)_60962.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_214709_(540_x_720_pixel)_60962.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_214753_(540_x_720_pixel)_87480.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_214738_(540_x_720_pixel)_25928.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3496,'JM Solution Disney Collection Selfie Vital Rosehip Mask',NULL,20.000,'Say cheers to our delightfully relaxing  Facial Sheet Mask. JM Solution Disney Collection Selfie Vital Rosehip Mask is infused with rose extract to deeply hydrate, tighten and smooth dry skin, vitalize the skin and leave it looking restored, radiant and glowing','After washing, prepare skin with toner. Apply sheet mask evenly on your face. Remove the mask sheet after 10-20 minutes later and gently pat the remaining essence.','produits/IMG_20230119_213128_(540_x_720_pixel)_11606.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_213128_(540_x_720_pixel)_11606.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_213135_(540_x_720_pixel)_56112.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_213149_(540_x_720_pixel)_15642.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3497,'JM Solution Disney Collection Selfie Barrier Tea Tree Mask',NULL,20.000,'JM Solution Disney Collection Selfie Barrier Tea Tree Mask is a refreshing sheet mask that leaves the skin clean, purified and clear. Made of 100% cellulose sheet that effectively delivers essence into the skin, the active ingredients in these masks have been slowly extracted through the cold brew squeeze method to keep the fresh ingredients\' nutrients intact.','After washing, prepare skin with toner. Apply sheet mask evenly on your face. Remove the mask sheet after 10-20 minutes later and gently pat the remaining essence.','produits/IMG_20230119_215907_(540_x_720_pixel)_49884.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230119_215907_(540_x_720_pixel)_49884.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_215927_(540_x_720_pixel)_42873.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230119_215949_(540_x_720_pixel)_93160.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3498,'JM Solution Disney Collection Nourishing Perilla Frutescens Mask',NULL,20.000,'Intensely nourish your skin with JM Solution Disney Collection Nourishing Perilla Frutescens Mask! It soothes, repairs and provides powerful antioxidant protection for mature and aging skin.','After washing, prepare skin with toner. Apply sheet mask evenly on your face. Remove the mask sheet after 10-20 minutes later and gently pat the remaining essence.','pro