 Tangerine and vitamin-infused formula that delivers an instantly more radiant, hydrated glow) <br>\r\n2. Using an enclosed spatula, place the Retinol patches on the skin (Pure vitamin A, Retinol stimulates the metabolism, working to improve skin structure and elasticity, reduce wrinkles) <br>\r\n3. Apply the CQMONG Nourishing Moisture Cream all over face and neck and Press to help absorption ( dual functions with anti-wrinkles and whitening) <br>\r\n4. Apply the face blur (provides multi-filtering effects to instantly give smooth skin while minimising pore and protecting the skin from sun rays) <br>\r\n5. Put on you Fixing Tint <br>\r\n6. The face mask can be applied anytime as a boost in your skincare routine <br>\r\nFollow the steps and get the look NOW! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types including sensitive skin','Apply on face and neck','produits/IMG_20230116_145632_(540_x_720_pixel)_90008.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230116_145632_(540_x_720_pixel)_90008.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_145646_(540_x_720_pixel)_23110.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_145706_(540_x_720_pixel)_85135.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_145718_(540_x_720_pixel)_98496.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_145726_(540_x_720_pixel)_52734.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230116_145811_(540_x_720_pixel)_93867.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3502,'Hyaluronic Acid Duo',NULL,234.000,'* Hyaluronic Acid Hydra Power Essence: <br>\r\nJust get dewy skin from deep skin layers!  <br>\r\nContains high purity of natural hydrating Sodium Hyaluronate(hyaluronic acid), make the skin softer and moisturized, leaving bumpy and dry skin silky smooth. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n* Hyaluronic Acid Intensive Cream: <br>\r\nPerfectly help to moisturize and nourish your skin deeply! <br>\r\nThis intensely hydrating cream boosts moisture content in your skin and seals it inside, protecting your skin from further loss of hydration while balancing your skin water and oil conten