n anti-ageing booster that rejuvenates your skin by preventing the formation of wrinkles and reducing their appearance. It target wrinkles, hydrates, soothes irritation and redness, brightens and strengthens skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n* Anti-wrinkle with Retinol: <br>\r\nPure vitamin A, Retinol stimulates the metabolism, working to improve skin structure and elasticity, reduce wrinkles.','Put on face','produits/IMG_20230125_235436_(540_x_720_pixel)_25075.png',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230125_235436_(540_x_720_pixel)_25075.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_235443_(540_x_720_pixel)_29971.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_235455_(540_x_720_pixel)_58162.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230125_235508_(540_x_720_pixel)_61808.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3505,'3 Fixing Tint (Vintage Red + Ginger Milk Tea + Midnight Mauve)',NULL,204.000,'1. Weightless & Easy Fixation <br>\r\nThe high-moisture matte formula delivers light and comfy feeling on the lips <br>\r\n2. Transfer-Proof Fixation <br>\r\n60 seconds after application, Zero TRANSFER! <br>\r\n3. Moist Fixation <br>\r\nNew Hydro-Matte Texture that fixates and colors the lips with moist finish','Apply on mouth','produits/IMG_20230126_000614_(540_x_720_pixel)_84572.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230126_000614_(540_x_720_pixel)_84572.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_000632_(540_x_720_pixel)_84911.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_000641_(540_x_720_pixel)_76463.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_000648_(540_x_720_pixel)_51269.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3506,'3 Fixing Tint (Blending Rose + Smoky Cherry + Salmon Brick)',NULL,204.000,'1. Weightless & Easy Fixation <br> The high-moisture matte formula delivers light and comfy feeling on the lips <br> 2. Transfer-Proof Fixation <br> 60 seconds after application, Zero TRANSFER! <br> 3. Moist Fixation <br> New Hydro-Matte Texture that fixates and colors the lips with moist finish','Put on lips','produits/IMG_20230126_004103_(540_x_720_pixel)_81671.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230126_004103_(540_x_720_pixel)_81671.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_004125_(540_x_720_pixel)_43283.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_004133_(540_x_720_pixel)_87808.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_004146_(540_x_720_pixel)_41398.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_004154_(540_x_720_pixel)_89901.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_004202_(540_x_720_pixel)_46440.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3507,'Miracle Foam + Miracle Toner + Miracle Serum Set',NULL,297.000,'This set gives exceptional Korean skincare experience to you for acne problems, rough skin surface, dull skin tone, or Messy blackhead.','Use on face','produits/IMG_20230126_001729_(540_x_720_pixel)_61525.png',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230126_001729_(540_x_720_pixel)_61525.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_001740_(540_x_720_pixel)_84439.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_001747_(540_x_720_pixel)_58210.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230126_001755_(540_x_720_pixel)_43696.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3508,'K-SECRET Calamine Brightening Duo',NULL,111.000,'Total solution for Oily & Combination skin\r\n<br>\r\n# Tightening PORES \r\n<br>\r\n# Removing BLACKHEAD\r\n<br>\r\n# Calming ACNE <br>\r\n<br>\r\nHave you worried about enlarged pores, reoccurring acne, excess sebum, cakey makeup, blackhead, and dead skin cells? And you do not want to use any strong chemical ingredients? This will be suitable for you. Natural pink powder Calamine contains, This set will blossom your skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n[Serum] Camaline derma secret serum contained real Calamine 20,000ppm will brighten up your dull skin and protect the skin from strong UV, external irritaion. This serum will improve your skin barrier healthier.\r\n<br>\r\n[Mask (1)]\r\nSecret mask helps to calm sensitive skin and brighten the skin while deeply hydrationg. This mask will protect your skin from extermal irritation.','[Serum]\r\n1. Wash your face with cleansing product\r\n\r\n2. Soak a cotton pad with toner then gently swipe it over your face\r\n\r\n3.Apply two or three drops of serum to your face.Then evenly spread and massage it\r\n\r\n[Mask]\r\n1. After cleansing, smooth skin by using toner\r\n2. Place the sheet mask over eyes, nose and mouth area first, then gently spread over face.\r\n3. After 10-20 minutes, remove the mask sheet from your face then gently pat your face fpr absorbing the remained essence','produits/IMG_20230129_013045_(540_x_720_pixel)_89968.jpg',NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_013045_(540_x_720_pixel)_89968.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_013058_(540_x_720_pixel)_54191.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_013108_(540_x_720_pixel)_80647.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_013115_(540_x_720_pixel)_53455.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3509,'Plastikos HIFU Lifting Cushion #23',NULL,220.000,'Plastikos - HIFU Lifting Cushion is the perfect blend of skincare and weightless coverage in one.\r\nNever messy or cakey, Plastikos Cushion is loaded with botanicals that hydrate, protect and brighten the skin for a naturally flawless finish that lasts all day while protecting the skin from UV rays. This unique Korean cushion technology pumps the content only when it’s pressed, keeping the product fresher longer. It provides a lightweight yet excellent coverage for a flawless complexion and Conceals the appearance of pores, blemishes and imperfections while staying put for long. Besides, it is infused with oil-absorbing powder to leave your complexion shine-free with a silky-soft and semi-matte finish. This compact also has a refill. <br>\r\nAvailable in two beautiful shades <br>\r\n#21Whitening <br>\r\n#23Natural <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n➤ Brand new medical beauty products <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Breakthrough technology enhances the V-Lift <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Instant lifting and continuous improvement of contour powder <br>\r\n \r\n➤ Tighten pores, moisturize, lifting, tighten, rejuvenate <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Sunscreen SFP50 <br>\r\n\r\n➤ Strong makeup holding power: color will not leave on the surgical mask <br>\r\n\r\n➤ High concealing power:  Perfectly cover pores, fine lines and other skin imperfections <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','At the end of your skincare routine, press the sponge on the built-in puff to soak up a desired amount of the content and apply over the face using a tapping motion. After each use, be sure to keep the compact closed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nTo insert the refill, flip the product over and push the bottom out with both thumbs. Carefully align and press in the refill.','produits/IMG_20230129_021128_(540_x_720_pixel)_50546.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_021128_(540_x_720_pixel)_50546.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021145_(540_x_720_pixel)_47880.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021201_(540_x_720_pixel)_36742.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021211_(540_x_720_pixel)_18480.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021223_(540_x_720_pixel)_82011.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_021255_(540_x_720_pixel)_37532.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3510,'K-SECRET Calamine Daily Duo',NULL,99.000,'Total solution for Oily & Combination skin\r\n<br>\r\n# Tightening PORES\r\n<br>\r\n# Removing BLACKHEAD\r\n<br>\r\n# Calming ACNE <br>\r\n<br>\r\nHave you worried about enlarged pores, reoccurring acne, excess sebum, cakey makeup, blackhead, and dead skin cells? And you do not want to use any strong chemical ingredients? This will be suitable for you. Natural pink powder Calamine contains, This set will blossom your skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n[Toner] Calamine Toner Upgraded, for more powerful effects\