 your skin from UV rays! <br>\r\n<br>\r\n[Collagen Vita Secret Multi Balm] <br>\r\n* Infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation, this skin-nourishing balm stick boasts potent anti-aging benefits for sagging skin. Rich in 5 peptides and panthenol, the balm is also formulated to promote strong skin barrier, reduce wrinkles and fine lines, and improve skin elasticity and hydration to achieve supple, radiant skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n[Hyaluronic Acid Secret Sun Balm] <br>\r\n* Hyaluronic Acid Secret Sun Balm is formulated with 5 types of peptides that provides intense hydration. It aslo contains panthenol for long lasting moisture and 5 peptides that stimulate collagen and improve skin elasticity.','At the last step of skincare, apply gently onto the face.','produits/IMG_20230129_164933_(540_x_720_pixel)_38647.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_164933_(540_x_720_pixel)_38647.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_164947_(540_x_720_pixel)_37861.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_165225_(540_x_720_pixel)_94860.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_165233_(540_x_720_pixel)_85733.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_165241_(540_x_720_pixel)_13126.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3514,'[SET] Fixing Tint 5-Color',NULL,340.000,'This set contains: <br>\r\n- Fixing Tint #1 Analog Rose <br>\r\n-Fixing Tint #2 Vintage Red <br>\r\n-Fixing Tint #3 Mellow Peach pie <br>\r\n-Fixing Tint #4 Ginger Milktea <br>\r\n-Fixing Tint #5 Midnight Mauve <br>\r\n-> Hydrating tint that stains less on your mask with a lightweight matte finish','Put on lips','produits/IMG_20230129_174239_(540_x_720_pixel)_92642.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_174239_(540_x_720_pixel)_92642.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_174256_(540_x_720_pixel)_93111.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_174307_(540_x_720_pixel)_68127.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_174318_(540_x_720_pixel)_20901.jpg\"