191655_(540_x_720_pixel)_90226.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3517,'[Buy 4 and Get1 for free] Acne Pimple Master Patch',NULL,160.000,'Hailed by Korean skin care fans as a holy grail product for acne treatment, COSRX Acne Pimple Master Patches protect pimples from secondary infections and further swelling. Available in various sizes, the hydrocolloid acne patch covers the affected area and absorbs excess sebum for easy and effective blemish control. This spot treatment speeds up the healing process of the pimple and helps prevent acne scars. <br>\r\nIt can even stay on through showering and can be applied under makeup! <br>\r\nWith three differently sized patches in a pack, you can choose which one will cover your bases. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Cleanse the area around the problem spot. Select a bigger size patch than the problem spot and attach the patch to the spot.','produits/IMG_20230129_194656_(540_x_720_pixel)_65996.png',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_194656_(540_x_720_pixel)_65996.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_194710_(540_x_720_pixel)_19379.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_194721_(540_x_720_pixel)_72973.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_194734_(540_x_720_pixel)_66109.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3518,'30 Days Miracle Starter Kit + Bye Bye Blackhead Bubble Cleanser Duo',NULL,257.000,'K-Beauty lovers\' holy grail! AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Starter Kit + Bye Bye Blackhead Bubble Cleanser Duo for acne + blackhead care. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n- AHA/BHA/PHA 30 Days Miracle Starter Kit: <br>\r\nAHA: Removes impurities and dry flakes from skin surface.\r\n<br>\r\nBHA: Exfoliates pores, removing clogged impurities and sebum.\r\n<br>\r\nPHA: Stops losing moisture from skin, dissolving dead skin cell\r\n<br>\r\n- Bye Bye Blackhead Bubble Cleanser: <br>\r\nContains 16 tea ingredients and natural BHA\r\n<br>\r\nBye Bye Blackhead 30Days Miracle Green Tea-Tox Bubble Cleanser of Some By Mi','-Bye Bye Blackhead Bubble Cleanser\r\n\r\n1. Spread it over your face evenly.\r\n\r\n2. when the bubbles appear, rub your face using your hands\r\n\r\n3. Rince your face with warm water\r\n\r\n-AHA BHA PHA  30 Days Miracle Starter Kit\r\n\r\nSTEP 1. Miracle  Soap\r\n\r\n-Roll massage your cheeks.\r\n\r\n-Massage your nose up and down.\r\n\r\n-Roll massage your forehead below the hairline.\r\n\r\n-Carefully massage near your eyes and mouth.\r\nSTEP 2 .Miracle  Toner\r\n\r\n-After cleansing in the morning and evening, take an appropriate amount on a cotton swab, wipe it off along with the texture of the skin, and let it absorb lightly.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3.Miracle serum\r\n\r\n-Apply Toner to prep the skin. Use pipette to release serum on cheek and forehead.  Softly spread for absorption.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4: Miracle Cream\r\n\r\nGently apply and absorb cream on your skin using fingertips.','produits/0003984_some-by-mi-aha-bha-pha-30-days-miracle-starter-kit-bye-bye-blackhead-bubble-cleanser-duo_16990.png',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/0003984_some-by-mi-aha-bha-pha-30-days-miracle-starter-kit-bye-bye-blackhead-bubble-cleanser-duo_16990.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_201750_(540_x_720_pixel)_46992.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_201804_(540_x_720_pixel)_11102.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_201812_(540_x_720_pixel)_66818.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_201855_(540_x_720_pixel)_75085.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3519,'SOME BY MI Kit Trio',NULL,360.000,'SOME BY MI Kit Trio Set is an ultimate skincare kit set made by SOME BY MI, the K-Beauty trendsetter making remarkable skincare products from natural ingredients.\r\n<br>\r\nIncluded items\r\n<br>\r\n-AHA/BHA/PHA 30 Days Miracle Starter Kit <br>\r\n-Snail Truecica Miracle Starter Kit <br>\r\n-Yuja Niacin 30 Days Brightening Starter Kit\r\n','dddd','produits/IMG_20230129_213340_(540_x_720_pixel)_47062.png',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_213340_(540_x_720_pixel)_47062.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_214240_(540_x_720_pixel)_51773.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_214256_(540_x_720_pixel)_31368.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_214348_(540_x_720_pixel)_81003.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3520,'3 Essential Tint Lip Balm',NULL,120.000,'Packed with organic essential oils and natural ingredients, Saemmul Essential Tint Lip Balm  soothes and moisturises chapped lips while giving them a natural-looking tint.','Adheres to lips lightly to create moisturizing luster without stickiness.\r\nApply a moderate amount from inside to outside lips gently.','produits/IMG_20230129_215450_(540_x_720_pixel)_70572.png',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230129_215450_(540_x_720_pixel)_70572.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_215508_(540_x_720_pixel)_79116.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_215521_(540_x_720_pixel)_65970.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230129_215534_(540_x_720_pixel)_87023.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3521,'Retinol Intense Reactivating Serum',NULL,119.000,'This serum is infused with retinol, retinal and bakuchiol to boost skin elasticity and reduce signs of aging. It is created with patented elastic-liposome technology to deliver active ingredients deep into skin. The gentle formula gives a non-sticky, moisturizing finish without any irritation. Recommended for sensitive skin. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n- this serum helps reduce signs of aging with its mild formula for sensitive skin. <br>\r\n- contains retinol, retinal and bakuchiol to help boost skin elasticity with low irritation. <br>\r\n- utilize patented technology of elastic-liposome to deliver active ingredients into the deep skin layer. <br>\r\n- gives a non-sticky and moisturizing finish. <br>\r\n- completed skin irritation testing and passed the vegan test.','Put on face','produits/IMG_20230201_195658_(540_x_720_pixel)_37812.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230201_195658_(540_x_720_pixel)_37812.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_195719_(540_x_720_pixel)_88311.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_195838_(540_x_720_pixel)_60956.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_195856_(540_x_720_pixel)_87670.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_195923_(540_x_720_pixel)_38166.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3522,'Retinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream',NULL,115.000,'Retinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream is an anti-ageing eye cream to help improve dark circles and fine lines, with visible results in just two weeks. The star ingredients, Retinal and Retinol prevent and improve the look of wrinkles, while Niacinamide helps with dark circles while preventing pigmentation and providing brightening care. Panthenol and Hyaluronic acid are also present to keep skin hydrated, while Truecica™, Glacial water and Water Lily gives a soothing and refreshing finish. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCan also be used on other areas such as forehead, lips or neck where you might have any concerns with loose or sagging skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types.','At the last step of your nighttime routine, take an adequate amount and gently pat onto your eye area, or areas where you are concerned about wrinkles. Remember to follow up with sunscreen the next morning. Can be used daily.\r\n\r\nPlease avoid using this product together with any laser treatments or exfoliating product.\r\n\r\nNOTE: You may experience redness or scaly skin when using for the first time. This is a natural process of skin turnover.','produits/IMG_20230201_213746_(540_x_720_pixel)_95605.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230201_213746_(540_x_720_pixel)_95605.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_213800_(540_x_720_pixel)_87228.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_213819_(540_x_720_pixel)_46774.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_213915_(540_x_720_pixel)_68595.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_213928_(540_x_720_pixel)_95655.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:40','2025-03-01 21:03:40',0,NULL),(3523,'Retinol Intense Reactivating Mask',NULL,25.000,'Some By Mi Retinol Intense Reactivating Mask activates internal renewal processes, thereby smoothes, softens and improves skin elasticity, reducing the appearance of wrinkles, pigmentation and other age-related changes. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: \r\n<br>\r\n- This mask reduce signs of aging with its mild formula for sensitive skin. <br>\r\n- Contains retinol, retinal and bakuchiol to help boost skin elasticity with low irritation. <br>\r\n- Micro-fiber sheet perfectly fits the face to provide cream essence and moisture with 10 types of hyaluronic acid. <br>\r\n- Uses patented technology of Elastic-Liposome to deliver active ingredients into the deep skin layer. <br>\r\n- Completed skin irritation testing.','After washing the face, refine your skin texture with toner, and then place the mask sheet on the face.\r\nAfter 10-20 minutes, remove the mask sheet and gently pat the remaining essence for absorption.\r\nFinish with moisturizer.','produits/IMG_20230201_214418_(540_x_720_pixel)_70664.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230201_214418_(540_x_720_pixel)_70664.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_214534_(540_x_720_pixel)_97128.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_214609_(540_x_720_pixel)_15398.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_214630_(540_x_720_pixel)_44197.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3524,'Yuja Niacin Brightening Sleeping Mask',NULL,130.000,'Yuja Niacin 30 Days Miracle Brightening Sleeping Mask is a 2-in-1 sleeping mask that brightens and moisturises skin while you sleep. Enriched with 70% yuja (citron) extract, which contains 3 times more Vitamin C than a lemon, to recharge and brighten for glowing skin. Niacinamide, arbutin and glutathione helps even out your skin tone, while 10 types of vitamins nourish and soothe your skin while you sleep.','Apply onto face at the last step of your night skincare routine, avoiding the eye and lip areas. Evenly spread all over your face. Wash your face the next morning','produits/IMG_20230201_215550_(540_x_720_pixel)_91247.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230201_215550_(540_x_720_pixel)_91247.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_215606_(540_x_720_pixel)_24036.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_215737_(540_x_720_pixel)_36389.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_215840_(540_x_720_pixel)_86619.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230201_215902_(540_x_720_pixel)_92494.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3525,'2 Snow White Cream',NULL,179.000,'The Secret Key Snow White Cream is a tone-up cream that helps brighten the skin instantly. The star ingredient, niacinamide, helps improve dull complexion while fighting redness and dark spots. This cream can also be used as a hydrating makeup base that acts as a shield to protect the skin from harmful elements of makeup. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ All in one cream <br>\r\nIt leaves the skin hydrated and radiant from inside to outside. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ All in one base cream <br>\r\nit is enough without the need for BB cream, makeup base, or moisturizer <br>\r\n<br>\r\n✵ Contains Niacinamide <br>\r\nNiacinamide is a whitening ingredient certified by Koreas Ministry of Food and Drug Safety, that gives the skin REAL whitening care from whithin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nTHOSE WHO <br>\r\n☞ have dark skin and dull complexions <br>\r\n☞ have excessive sebum <br>\r\n☞ have oily skin and constantly need to retouch their makeup <br>\r\n☞ have enlarged pores that can not be covered even by makeup <br>\r\n☞want all in one makeup base <br>\r\nSnow White Cream is the right choice!!!!!!! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Take a moderate amount and apply evenly to your skin\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230208_215217_(540_x_720_pixel)_71626.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230208_215217_(540_x_720_pixel)_71626.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_215311_(540_x_720_pixel)_53179.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_215406_(540_x_720_pixel)_29124.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_215433_(540_x_720_pixel)_15579.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_215457_(540_x_720_pixel)_59102.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3526,'Zero Sebum Duo',NULL,140.000,'This amazing duo controls sebum production, minimizes pores, and makes skin look clear and matte without clumps. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Combination, Oily, Sensitive','T-zone Base:\r\nBefore applying primer, gently apply a moderate amount of product on the excessive sebum areas such as T-zone\r\n\r\nZero Sebum Powder:\r\nAfter applying skin care or makeup, dab the product on areas with excess oil &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\nFOR GREASY HAIR: Apply it on roots and shake off residue for fresher-looking hair &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n\r\nUSE AS EYE PRIMER: Apply this powder on your eyelids for your eye makeup to stay without smudging','produits/IMG_20230208_221308_(540_x_720_pixel)_70848.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230208_221308_(540_x_720_pixel)_70848.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_221322_(540_x_720_pixel)_87546.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_221348_(540_x_720_pixel)_78268.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_221358_(540_x_720_pixel)_71849.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_221410_(540_x_720_pixel)_97999.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3527,'Propolis B5 Glow Barrier Calming Duo',NULL,244.000,'Starring propolis, royal jelly, honey, 24K gold, Vitamin B5, patented ingredient Truecica, ceramide and hyaluronic acid, this duo balances skin sebum levels, calms and fortifies skin to prevent breakouts and promote a healthy complexion. <br> \r\nIt helps with skin irritation, dehydration and tiredness to calm the skin and make it glowy. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Propolis B5 Serum:\r\nAfter using toner, apply an appropriate amount and spread gently across the entire face. Pat lightly until absorbed &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily\r\n\r\nPropolis B5 Cream:\r\nTake an appropriate amount and spread evenly onto the skin. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230208_222428_(540_x_720_pixel)_12442.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230208_222428_(540_x_720_pixel)_12442.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222439_(540_x_720_pixel)_49226.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222449_(540_x_720_pixel)_76780.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222501_(540_x_720_pixel)_23780.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222628_(540_x_720_pixel)_92466.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230208_222727_(540_x_720_pixel)_79195.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3528,'My Real Squeeze Mask [Tea Tree]',NULL,15.000,'Daily sheet mask with Tea Tree Oil helps with the appearance of skin problems while keeping skin moisturized and clean. Eco-friendly Eucalyptus fiber mask has easy on/off tabs and allows the concentrate to more thoroughly absorb on skin. What’s your skin craving? It can change from day to day. That’s why sheet masks have been a Korean skin care go-to for years—the portable packets of goodness can be customized to any shifting daily needs. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 20ml','After cleansing, use toner to help refine skin\'\'s texture. Unfold mask and place on face, avoiding eye and lip areas. Leave on for 10-20 minutes. Discard mask and gently pat excess for full absorption.','produits/IMG_20230422_184734_(540_x_720_pixel)_86062.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_184734_(540_x_720_pixel)_86062.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_184746_(540_x_720_pixel)_19710.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_184758_(540_x_720_pixel)_74746.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_184716_(540_x_720_pixel)_24765.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3529,'2 Diamond Ampoule Sheet Mask Pack (10)',NULL,180.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with One Pack (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br> \r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination,  Oily, Sensitive','1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After washing face, apply sheet mask on face. Pull the eye part of sheet up to just below the eyes, that part will be fully covered. (No need to attach additional Eye Patches)\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20230210_175438_(540_x_720_pixel)_63422.png',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230210_175438_(540_x_720_pixel)_63422.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_175459_(540_x_720_pixel)_89807.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_175527_(540_x_720_pixel)_81930.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_175544_(540_x_720_pixel)_49676.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3530,'2 Face Blur Smoothing',NULL,300.000,'This liquid primer instantly smooths complexion and creates a flawless base for your makeup while also protecting skin from free radicals with fitted SPF. The Smoothing version is fitted with Baby Pixel powder, Cover Powder and Airy Skin powder for a bright, pinkish finish that minimizes pores. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n● A lightweight makeup base that covers skin flaws, smooths and brightens your complexion with UV protection. <br>\r\n● It helps brighten the skin, reduce wrinkles and block UV rays with SPF33 PA++. <br>\r\n● Baby Pixel Powder and Cover Powder helps smooth your skin and minimizes the appearance of pores. <br>\r\n● Airy Skin Powder maintains a radiant and refined skin texture with a shimmery coral base. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Before face makeup, apply an appropriate amount on face and spread evenly &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230210_180139_(540_x_720_pixel)_98576.jpg',NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230210_180139_(540_x_720_pixel)_98576.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_180218_(540_x_720_pixel)_39724.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_180241_(540_x_720_pixel)_27757.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_180405_(540_x_720_pixel)_70332.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3531,'2 Fixing Tint Bar (#03 Milk Caramel + 05 Mauve Pink)',NULL,136.000,'This matte lipstick promises smudge-free results that lasts up to six hours. It offers rich color payoff with a few simple swipes, while its hydrating formula sits comfortably on lips. It is available in different warm, vibrant shades that glides smoothly onto lips without caking or smudging and adheres closely to lips for a comfortable, long-lasting finish.','Apply directly onto lips for your desired lip look','produits/IMG_20230210_200640_(540_x_720_pixel)_65843.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230210_200640_(540_x_720_pixel)_65843.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_200658_(540_x_720_pixel)_48777.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_200721_(540_x_720_pixel)_23916.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_200740_(540_x_720_pixel)_37909.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3532,'Jeju Orchid Trio',NULL,415.000,'Target the first signs of aging with this multitasking moisturizer!\r\nIt quenches skin with hydration and nourishment while supporting a look of firmness elasticity and tone. It’s made with an antioxidant rich orchid from Jeju Island South Korea making it highly effective in diminishing visible signs of aging <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Jeju Orchid Eye Cream:\r\nApply sparingly to entire eye area with fingertips\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night\r\n\r\nJeju Orchid Enriched Cream:\r\nApply all over the face and neck and press to help with absorption &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily\r\n\r\nJeju Orchid Sleeping Mask:\r\nAt the last stage of evening skin care, apply onto the entire face, avoiding the eye and lip area. Gently massage for better absorption. Leave on overnight and rinse with water in the morning. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it day and/or night, daily','produits/IMG_20230210_202644_(540_x_720_pixel)_25160.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230210_202644_(540_x_720_pixel)_25160.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_214156_(540_x_720_pixel)_26365.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_214206_(540_x_720_pixel)_54918.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230210_214214_(540_x_720_pixel)_91416.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3533,'MISSHA M Perfect Cover BB Cream #31 Golden Beige',NULL,84.000,'Originally developed as a salve for patients after laser treatment, BB Cream’s soothing and regenerative properties were adapted for cosmetics to improve skin while providing coverage. The M Perfect Cover BB Cream is Missha’s most popular product with over 30 million sold worldwide. Combining cosmetics with skincare, this product promotes natural-looking coverage while providing sun protection, treating dark spots, and preventing wrinkles.','Apply on face',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3534,'Truecica Aqua Calming Sun Cream',NULL,105.000,'Effectively fend off UV rays while soothing skin with this lightweight sunscreen fitted with broad-spectrum SPF50+ protection. The reef-friendly formula contains skin-soothers like cica, aloe vera leaf extract and white water lily extract, and it won’t leave a white cast. This dermatologically-tested sunscreen a summer must-have for those with sensitive skin.','Put on face','produits/IMG_20230301_195626_(540_x_720_pixel)_98530.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230301_195626_(540_x_720_pixel)_98530.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230301_195648_(540_x_720_pixel)_93679.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230301_195755_(540_x_720_pixel)_62130.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230301_195817_(540_x_720_pixel)_56525.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3535,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #12 Apple',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color','produits/IMG_20230303_190459_(540_x_720_pixel)_81422.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230303_190459_(540_x_720_pixel)_81422.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_190524_(540_x_720_pixel)_54979.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_190534_(540_x_720_pixel)_10123.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_190603_(540_x_720_pixel)_98789.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3536,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #04 Grapefruit Mousse',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3537,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #02 Strawberry',NULL,55.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color','produits/IMG_20230304_135212_(540_x_720_pixel)_85967.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230304_135212_(540_x_720_pixel)_85967.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_194212_(540_x_720_pixel)_68430.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_194237_(540_x_720_pixel)_79397.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230303_194254_(540_x_720_pixel)_98099.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3538,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #07 Dark Cherry',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight formula, and delivers a lovely powdery matte finish moisturizing and nourishing the lips','Outline lips with applicator tip. Fill in lips with high pigment color','produits/IMG_20230304_140528_(540_x_720_pixel)_59897.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230304_140528_(540_x_720_pixel)_59897.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230304_140552_(540_x_720_pixel)_90714.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230304_140613_(540_x_720_pixel)_99607.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230304_140632_(540_x_720_pixel)_82521.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3539,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Gel Cleanser',NULL,86.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Gel Cleanser is a gentle water based face cleanser contains 6 types of hyaluronic acids of different molecular weight/size for effective hydration on various skin layers from deep to surface for gently daily face cleansing. <br>\r\n✓ 6 HYALURONIC ACIDS of different molecular size/weight for effective hydration in all skin layers from deeper to surface. It provides long-lasting and concentrated hydration to the skin.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Allantoin & Various natural plant extracts for instant soothing.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Alcohol-Free / Oil-Free perfect for daily morning & evening use.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Micro bubbles actively work to cleanse skin from impurities in a mild delicate way. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 120 ml\r\n','1. Apply an appropriate amount on hands and gently massage on wet skin.\r\n\r\n2. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.\r\n\r\n3. Daily use for both morning and night skincare routine.\r\nTIP: Perfect as 2nd step in double-cleansing','produits/IMG_20230306_150055_(540_x_720_pixel)_41615.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230306_150055_(540_x_720_pixel)_41615.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_150103_(540_x_720_pixel)_79691.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_150118_(540_x_720_pixel)_56036.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_150136_(540_x_720_pixel)_60141.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3540,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Toner',NULL,86.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Toner is an instant Skin Soothing with Water Balance Restore toner that contains 6 types of hyaluronic acids of different molecular weight/size for effective hydration on various skin layers from deep to surface. <br>\r\n✓ 6 HYALURONIC ACIDS of different molecular size/weight for effective hydration in all skin layers from deeper to surface. It provides long-lasting & concentrated hydration to the skin.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Panthenol, Allantoin & Various natural plant extracts for instant soothing and water-oil balancing after cleansing.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Alcohol-Free / Oil-Free perfect for daily morning & evening use.\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Light texture quickly and easily absorbs into skin refreshing it and preparing for next skincare step. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 150 ml','1. After cleansing apply an appropriate amount on desired area (face and neck recommended).\r\n\r\n2. Evenly spread and gently massage for absorption.\r\n\r\n3. For convenient appliation may be used with cotton pads.\r\nTIP:\r\n\r\n1. TONER + cotton pad = Hydrating mask pack\r\n2. TONER + mist bottle = daily use mist','produits/IMG_20230306_153132_(540_x_720_pixel)_51454.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230306_153132_(540_x_720_pixel)_51454.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_153140_(540_x_720_pixel)_35098.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_153154_(540_x_720_pixel)_53386.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230306_153207_(540_x_720_pixel)_87441.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3541,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Soothing Cream',NULL,98.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Soothing Cream is a refreshing soothing cream that offers moisture to your skin with a non-sticky finish. This cream includes 8 kinds of Hyaluronic Acid that can be quickly absorbed to provide intensive moisture to your skin. It strengthens the skin barrier to prevent moisture loss and it is formulated for people with dehydrated yet oily skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 80 ml','At the last step of your skincare routine, dispense a proper amount of the cream and gently massage it into your skin.\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.','produits/IMG_20230307_024451_(540_x_720_pixel)_24572.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230307_024451_(540_x_720_pixel)_24572.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_024516_(540_x_720_pixel)_73330.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_024536_(540_x_720_pixel)_67814.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230307_024558_(540_x_720_pixel)_80950.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3542,'HANBANG SERUM DISCOVERY KIT',NULL,140.000,'The \"Hanbang discovery kit\" was created for those who want to find out which of the four BOJ serums is best for their skin.\r\n<br>\r\nThis is a 10ml mini size set with 4 types of serums so that you can choose to use or layer them according to your skin type or skin issues. <br>\r\nExperience a wonderful journey to find the right product for you before taking the plunge on a full-size bottle!\r\n<br>\r\nWhat are inside?\r\n<br>\r\nCalming Serum : Green Tea + Panthenol (10ml / 0.33fl.oz.) <br>\r\nGlow Serum : Propolis + Niacinamide (10ml / 0.33fl.oz.) <br>\r\nGlow Deep Serum : Rice + Alpha-Arbutin (10ml / 0.33fl.oz.) <br>\r\nRevive Serum : Ginseng + Snail Mucin (10ml / 0.33fl.oz.)','Apply 2-3 drops of serum onto the skin and pat gently to help absorption','produits/IMG_20230307_023243_(540_x_720_pixel)_12647.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230307_023243_(540_x_720_pixel)_12647.jpg\", \"produi