 daily.\r\n\r\nNourishing Moisture Cream:\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nDiamond Ampoule Sheet Mask:\r\n1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After washing face, apply sheet mask on face. Pull the eye part of sheet up to just below the eyes, that part will be fully covered. (No need to attach additional Eye Patches)\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20231007_183900_(540_x_720_pixel)_87306.jpg',NULL,20,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231007_183900_(540_x_720_pixel)_87306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_183916_(540_x_720_pixel)_13805.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_184314_(540_x_720_pixel)_35791.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_184716_(540_x_720_pixel)_83157.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3545,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Mask',NULL,16.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Mask is a mask sheet enriched with Hyaluronic Acid to intensively moisturize your skin. It forms a moisture barrier to keep your skin hydrated and prevent moisture loss and replenishes moisture in deep skin layers with 7 Hyaluronic Acids Complex.\r\nIt gently soothes your skin for a smooth and soft touch. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 25 g','1. Place the mask sheet on your face and let it rest for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\n2. Gently remove the mask sheet. Lightly pat to absorb the remaining essence.','produits/IMG_20230308_102628_(540_x_720_pixel)_46977.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230308_102628_(540_x_720_pixel)_46977.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230308_102327_(540_x_720_pixel)_10061.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230308_102346_(540_x_720_pixel)_83495.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230308_102403_(540_x_720_pixel)_63701.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3546,'Moistfull Collagen Intense Sheet Mask',NULL,20.000,'Inner moisture mask made of thin soft micro fiber sheet containing small molecular Super Collagen™ water and peptide provides abundant moisture and nourishment through close adherence to skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n','Put on face','produits/IMG_20230422_200422_(540_x_720_pixel)_43952.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_200422_(540_x_720_pixel)_43952.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_200501_(540_x_720_pixel)_36057.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_200522_(540_x_720_pixel)_83947.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_200533_(540_x_720_pixel)_58050.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3547,'My Real Squeeze Mask [Rice]',NULL,15.000,'Creamy sheet mask made from 100% biodegradable Eucalyptus fibers is soaked in the nourishing ingredients found in Rice for clearer, more translucent-looking skin.','Hfj','produits/IMG_20230422_182533_(540_x_720_pixel)_45822.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_182533_(540_x_720_pixel)_45822.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_182549_(540_x_720_pixel)_32653.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_182601_(540_x_720_pixel)_43699.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_182626_(540_x_720_pixel)_10101.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3548,'My Real Squeeze Mask EX [Lime]',NULL,15.000,'This refreshing-water type mask is enriched with moisture from fresh limes, leaves the skin bright and transparent. <br>\r\n❃ Jeju green complex X Squeezed lime = Transparency & Brightening! <br>\r\nIt’s filled with Jeju green complex (green tea, tangerine, cactus, camellia leaves & orchid) and squeezed lime make the skin transparent and bright. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n❃ Additional whitening functions! <br>\r\nAdditional whitening function addresses your concerns about skin tone.','1. After cleansing, use toner to refine skin texture.\r\n2. Unfold and place the mask on the face, avoiding eye and lip area.\r\n3. Leave on for 10-20 minutes.\r\n4. Remove the mask and gently pat the remaining content for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20230422_191335_(540_x_720_pixel)_84516.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_191335_(540_x_720_pixel)_84516.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_191358_(540_x_720_pixel)_91696.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_191416_(540_x_720_pixel)_44096.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_191431_(540_x_720_pixel)_57441.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3549,'My Real Squeeze Mask [Green Tea]',NULL,15.000,'This refreshing-water type mask is enriched with fresh moisture from delicately fragrant green tea, keeps dry skin moisturized. It’s filled with Jeju green complex (green tea, tangerine, cactus, camellia leaves & orchid) and squeezed green tea provide the skin with a hydrating and soothing effect. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 20 ml','1. After cleansing, use toner to refine skin texture.\r\n2. Unfold and place the mask on the face, avoiding eye and lip area.\r\n3. Leave on for 10-20 minutes.\r\n4. Remove the mask and gently pat the remaining content for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20230422_194424_(540_x_720_pixel)_56042.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_194424_(540_x_720_pixel)_56042.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_194439_(540_x_720_pixel)_15508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_194756_(540_x_720_pixel)_11888.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_194806_(540_x_720_pixel)_40269.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3550,'Moistfull Collagen Emulsion',NULL,135.000,'Etude House Moistfull Collagen Emulsion is a hydrating lotion that provides deep moisture for hours with moisture-rich Super Collagen™ water. It contains 14% Super collagen water, 6% Baobab water that turns dull and rough skin into dewy and bright skin by leaving skin moisturized. This concentrated and textured facial treatment steeps skin in rich moisture to improve skin health and moisture level. <br>\r\nFortified with baobab tree extract and collagen, skin is treated to advanced moisturization with a dramatic improvement in texture and tone in as little as a few days of use. Best used with the rest of the Moistfull Collagen line. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nRecommended for dry and combination skin types.','After using skin softener, take an appropriate amount into hand, and gently spread over the face.','produits/IMG_20230422_225732_(540_x_720_pixel)_58992.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_225732_(540_x_720_pixel)_58992.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_225743_(540_x_720_pixel)_47893.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_225931_(540_x_720_pixel)_91360.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_230231_(540_x_720_pixel)_54046.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3551,'Snail (Smoothening and Firming) sheet mask',NULL,15.000,'This Snail sheet mask is a water-type essence that absorbs into your skin mildly but brings powerful moisturization. This mask provides abundant moisture to dry, hot skin with its ingredient of abundant aloe that makes skin comfortable and healthy by relieving skin of external stimuli and stress.','1. Apply toner to skin after cleansing.\r\n2. Remove mask from pouch and apply to face, placing mask to fit eye and lip area. \r\n3. Remove mask after 10~15 minutes and lightly massage remaining solution into skin with hands.','produits/IMG_20230422_234750_(540_x_720_pixel)_94403.jpg',NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230422_234750_(540_x_720_pixel)_94403.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_234815_(540_x_720_pixel)_72295.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_234832_(540_x_720_pixel)_24678.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230422_234858_(540_x_720_pixel)_18186.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3552,'Tea Tree (Refreshing and Soothing) sheet mask',NULL,15.000,'This mask sheet contains Tea Tree Extract (Melaleuca Alternifolia Leaf Extract) has soothing properties to provide a fresh, clean complexion. The daily low-irritant mask made a breathable 0.2mm air sheet effectively delivers 7-free essence to your skin.','1. Apply toner to skin after cleansing.\r\n2. Remove mask from pouch and apply to face, placing mask to fit eye and lip area.\r\n3. Remove mask after 10~15 minutes and lightly massage remaining solution into skin with hands.','produits/IMG_20230423_002442_(540_x_720_pixel)_28908.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_002442_(540_x_720_pixel)_28908.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_002459_(540_x_720_pixel)_33762.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_002513_(540_x_720_pixel)_67492.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_002522_(540_x_720_pixel)_35721.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3553,'Kill Cover Ampoule Cushion SPF50+ PA+++ 15g + Refill 15g #4 Ginger',NULL,185.000,'Your flawless skin elegantly shines with ampoule-enriched luster. Perfect coverage with excellent staying power and moisturization.\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓High-density moisture\r\n<br>\r\n✓Perfect coverage\r\n<br>\r\n✓excellent staying power and moisturization','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20230423_005304_(540_x_720_pixel)_34825.jpg',NULL,9,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_005304_(540_x_720_pixel)_34825.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_005451_(540_x_720_pixel)_46712.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_005504_(540_x_720_pixel)_61324.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_005522_(540_x_720_pixel)_62343.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3554,'Kill Cover Fixer Cushion SPF50+ PA+++ 15g + Refill 15g #5 Sand',NULL,185.000,'A transfer-proof cushion foundation without smudging even under a mask\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✓ Fixes makeup strongly & doesn\'t feel stuffy at all\r\n<br>\r\n✓Strong against oil by using oil cutting powder\r\n<br>\r\n✓ Never smudges off & lasts perfectly without rubbing off','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20230423_010114_(540_x_720_pixel)_82634.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_010114_(540_x_720_pixel)_82634.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010128_(540_x_720_pixel)_17054.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010150_(540_x_720_pixel)_22826.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010210_(540_x_720_pixel)_90269.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010225_(540_x_720_pixel)_37099.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010244_(540_x_720_pixel)_18423.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_010313_(540_x_720_pixel)_19210.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3555,'Ginseng Essence Water',NULL,102.000,'Ginseng is a vital herbal ingredient that has been used for a long time for our body and skin health in Korean history. <br>\r\nGinseng essence water contains 80% of ginseng water and focuses on the benefits of ginseng itself, giving sufficient moisture and nutrition to the skin. It fills moisture and nutrition firmly to help keep your skin moisturized for a long period of time. <br>\r\nGinseng root water 63% + Ginseng complex <br>\r\nIn Donguibogam, a Korean herbal medicine book, ginseng was used as an important oriental medicine and recorded as Shincho, meaning herb from the gods. Hwang Jini known as the most beautiful woman in the Joseon Dynasty, used a ginseng decoction as a bath water. <br>\r\nThe rich saponin contained in ginseng helps to quickly supply moisture to the skin and maintain it deep inside the skin for a long time to help create healthy skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nNiacinamide 2% <br>\r\nNiacinamide is helpful in controlling sebum secretion and maintaining the oil and moisture balance of the skin.','After cleansing, pour a few drops into your hands and pat gently onto the face','produits/IMG_20230423_153447_(540_x_720_pixel)_71479.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_153447_(540_x_720_pixel)_71479.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_153424_(540_x_720_pixel)_67468.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_153509_(540_x_720_pixel)_35184.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_153525_(540_x_720_pixel)_87834.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3556,'Benetint Liquid Lip Blush and Cheek Tint',NULL,95.000,'This iconic rose-tinted lip stain was created for an exotic dancer in the 1970s and has since soared to cult-fave status. Our doe foot applicator glides right on lips & blends over cheeks for a gorgeous look in seconds. The kiss-proof color lasts for hours, making it loved by celebs, makeup artists and gals around the world.','-Glide onto lips and layer to build intensity.\r\n-For ombre lips, dab on the inner part of lips and blend outward with fingertip. Dot and blend quickly onto cheeks for a long-lasting flush.\r\n-Beauty tip: Layer your two favorite tints to make your own custom color for lips or cheeks. Or wear under your favorite lipstick or gloss.','produits/IMG_20230423_154545_(540_x_720_pixel)_96677.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_154545_(540_x_720_pixel)_96677.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_154556_(540_x_720_pixel)_43459.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_154701_(540_x_720_pixel)_61752.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_154651_(540_x_720_pixel)_99137.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3557,'Lovetint Cheek and Lip Stain',NULL,95.000,'Our fiery-red lip and cheek stain is the most passionate flush you can get from a bottle. Our precise lip applicator glides right on for a gorgeous look in seconds. Apply on lips and cheeks for kiss-proof, long-lasting vibrant color you\'re sure to love!','Glide onto lips, layering to build intensity. Dot and blend quickly onto cheeks.\r\nFor full lips, outline, then fill in. Layer to build intensity.','produits/IMG_20230423_155831_(540_x_720_pixel)_57005.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_155831_(540_x_720_pixel)_57005.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_155849_(540_x_720_pixel)_59288.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_155911_(540_x_720_pixel)_62900.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_155919_(540_x_720_pixel)_66008.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3558,'Chachatint Cheek and Lip Stain',NULL,95.000,'This sheer stain beautifully blushes lips & cheeks with a mango hue. Our precise lip applicator glides right on lips & cheeks for a deliciously vibrant look that lasts for hours.','Complete your colorful spring outfits with a glow of coral on your cheeks and lips!\r\n1. Smile! This is the best solution to bring out your cheekbones and know exactly where to apply three small strokes of chachatint.\r\n2. Dab onto lips and blend with fingertips.\r\n3. Apply an additional layer of the liquid blush on the cheeks and / or lips for an even more intense color.\r\nFor as even color as possible, dab chachatint in small strokes on your foundation brush and blend into each cheek, one at a time.','produits/IMG_20230423_172127_(540_x_720_pixel)_86251.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_172127_(540_x_720_pixel)_86251.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_172141_(540_x_720_pixel)_63901.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_172155_(540_x_720_pixel)_38784.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_172209_(540_x_720_pixel)_75708.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3559,'JAYJUN - Green Tea Eye Gel Patch',NULL,120.000,'It is a hydrogel that soothes irritated skin with green tea powder and it also protects and strengthens delicate skin around the eyes. <br>\r\n❃ Soothing formula invigorating hydrogel eye patch with green tea leaf powder. <br>\r\n❃ Provides a moist and refreshing feeling without stickiness. <br>\r\n❃ It nourishes the delicate skin and rejuvenates the tired skin from the outside environment. <br>\r\n❃ Easily attaches to intensively moisturize skin trouble areas.','After cleansing, refine skin texture with toner.\r\nApply on to under eye area.\r\nLet patch set for 20-30 mins.\r\nPat over.','produits/IMG_20230423_222445_(540_x_720_pixel)_63428.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_222445_(540_x_720_pixel)_63428.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_222523_(540_x_720_pixel)_10344.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_222644_(540_x_720_pixel)_88215.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_222927_(540_x_720_pixel)_82961.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3560,'Tara- Onion Remedy Follicle-Stimulating Concentrate',NULL,185.000,'A powerful concentrate designed to stimulate the scalp for stronger hair growth. It works by boosting microcirculation towards the follicles, increasing their supply of oxygen and nutrients while accelerating the rate at which they produce hair during the growth cycle. Combined with an optimal dose of peptides, it soothes and strengthens the scalp to reduce shedding and helps thinning hair grow back stronger and fuller.','After towel drying, apply one pipette-full of serum along the hairline and the part, finishing with the sides and the back. Massage into the scalp using circular motions as you work through each section. This is a leave-in product, style your hair normally.','produits/IMG_20230423_224828_(540_x_720_pixel)_30043.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_224828_(540_x_720_pixel)_30043.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_224839_(540_x_720_pixel)_78638.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_224902_(540_x_720_pixel)_42393.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_224918_(540_x_720_pixel)_54747.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3561,'Tara - Purify Deep Cleansing Clay Mask',NULL,132.000,'A combination of natural clays and nutrient-rich ingredients that cleanse and rebalance the skin. Our formula gently draws up impurities from deep within the pores while exfoliating the surface to remove cell buildup and excess oil, leaving skin feeling softer, smoother and less prone to breakouts.','Apply a thin and consistent layer onto your freshly cleansed skin and let it sit for 10 minutes until the mask starts to dry. To remove, gently loosen with a warm, wet towel first and then rinse off with warm water. Do not scrub. Use once a week or whenever your skin feels clogged and dull. Follow with our Radiance Vitamin C serum and Glow oil for a natural fresh-faced look.','produits/IMG_20230424_002131_(540_x_720_pixel)_15503.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230424_002131_(540_x_720_pixel)_15503.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230424_002336_(540_x_720_pixel)_48305.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230424_002416_(540_x_720_pixel)_51776.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230424_002443_(540_x_720_pixel)_25014.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3562,'JM SOLUTION Active Pink Snail Brightening Mask',NULL,20.000,'– It’s an intensively brightening Mask that works to moisturize the skin and fight dullness for a clearer, glowing skin tone\r\n\r\n– The soft and lightweight Sheet fits perfectly along your facial lines for effective moisture and nutrients transfer\r\n\r\n– The Snail Secretion Filtrate and Vitamin B12 ingredients seep deep into the skin layers for a revitalized. luscious complexion\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nIt helps:\r\n\r\n– Skin dryness\r\n\r\n– Promotes a bright skin tone\r\n\r\n– Uneven skin texture','After cleaning the face, aplly the mask for 10-20 minutes. Take off the mask and gently pat the remaining essence onto the skin.','produits/IMG_20230423_230911_(540_x_720_pixel)_32815.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230423_230911_(540_x_720_pixel)_32815.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_231004_(540_x_720_pixel)_84645.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_230933_(540_x_720_pixel)_76321.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230423_230948_(540_x_720_pixel)_97565.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3563,'BLACK TEA YOUTH ENHANCING AMPOULE',NULL,140.000,'The Innisfree Black Tea Youth Enhancing Ampoule provides intensive anti-ageing care to relieve signs of skin fatigue after a long, tiring day and boosts the skin\'s vitality and radiance as if you\'d had a good night\'s sleep! Reset Concentrate™, a powerful antioxidant and anti-ageing compound extracted from 80% fermented Black Tea that has been infused in mineral water for twelve hours at 80 Celsius degrees, helps address the look of fatigued and tired-looking skin. Boost elasticity and radiance with this gentle yet powerful ampoule! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types, recommended for tired and dull skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSizes: 30ml','For daytime:\r\n\r\nApply 3-5 drops of product on the face and pat gently for better absorption.\r\n\r\nFor nighttime:\r\n\r\nSTEP 1: Gently apply 2~3 drops on the entire face starting from the cheeks to the forehead, nose, mouth area, and neck.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2: Apply once more by tapping lightly on dryness-prone areas.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3: Apply 1~2 drops on the entire face then gently press with your palms to finish.','produits/IMG_20230511_145334_(540_x_720_pixel)_13208.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230511_145334_(540_x_720_pixel)_13208.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_145542_(540_x_720_pixel)_26152.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_145416_(540_x_720_pixel)_11825.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_145526_(540_x_720_pixel)_29971.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3564,'Ginseng Essence Water 40 ml',NULL,45.000,'Ginseng is a vital herbal ingredient that has been used for a long time for our body and skin health in Korean history. <br>\r\nGinseng essence water contains 80% of ginseng water and focuses on the benefits of ginseng itself, giving sufficient moisture and nutrition to the skin. It fills moisture and nutrition firmly to help keep your skin moisturized for a long period of time. <br>\r\nGinseng root water 63% + Ginseng complex <br>\r\nIn Donguibogam, a Korean herbal medicine book, ginseng was used as an important oriental medicine and recorded as Shincho, meaning herb from the gods. Hwang Jini known as the most beautiful woman in the Joseon Dynasty, used a ginseng decoction as a bath water. <br>\r\nThe rich saponin contained in ginseng helps to quickly supply moisture to the skin and maintain it deep inside the skin for a long time to help create healthy skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nNiacinamide 2% <br>\r\nNiacinamide is helpful in controlling sebum secretion and maintaining the oil and moisture balance of the skin.','After cleansing, pour a few drops into your hands and pat gently onto the face','produits/IMG_20230511_224641_(540_x_720_pixel)_32723.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230511_224641_(540_x_720_pixel)_32723.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_224700_(540_x_720_pixel)_17984.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_224819_(540_x_720_pixel)_65787.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_224839_(540_x_720_pixel)_42403.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3565,'Mack Andy Brightening Lazy Person Face Cream',NULL,105.000,'It\'s a unique makeup-skincare hybrid that helps to instantly colour-correct and brighten the complexion. It gives an instant brightening effect and even skin tone for a soft and glowing skin.','Hdjdn hi','produits/IMG_20230517_130819_(540_x_720_pixel)_86581.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230517_130819_(540_x_720_pixel)_86581.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_130841_(540_x_720_pixel)_16600.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_130905_(540_x_720_pixel)_16568.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_130922_(540_x_720_pixel)_52103.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3566,'Revive Serum : Ginseng + Snail Mucin',NULL,106.000,'This serum is made for skin that has lost its vitality.\r\nIt contains Ginseng, which has been used as an important herbal ingredient for a long time, and 3%  snail secretion filtrate, which creates the best synergy for skin elasticity.','Jcj','produits/IMG_20230511_225515_(540_x_720_pixel)_90068.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230511_225515_(540_x_720_pixel)_90068.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_225546_(540_x_720_pixel)_84003.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_225558_(540_x_720_pixel)_83927.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230511_225611_(540_x_720_pixel)_56624.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3567,'Mack Andy Radiant Tone-up Cream',NULL,105.000,'A body cream that gives an instant brightening effect and even skin tone for a soft and glowing skin.\r\n<br>\r\n1.Instant Healthy Bright\r\n<br>\r\nEnriched with Niacinamide and Tranexamic Acid, it helps brighten and even out skin tone. <br>\r\n2.Soft and Smooth Skin\r\n<br>\r\nThe light, non-sticky cream texture leaves skin feeling softer. <br>\r\n3. Floral & Fruity Aroma\r\n<br>\r\nCombination of floral and fruity aroma that gives a fresh sensation to the skin.','Apply it evenly on hands and body in the morning or at night after taking shower','produits/IMG_20230517_134420_(540_x_720_pixel)_68061.jpg',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230517_134420_(540_x_720_pixel)_68061.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_134456_(540_x_720_pixel)_20148.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230517_134518_(540_x_720_pixel)_78882.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3568,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #13 RASPBERRY MOUSSE',NULL,55.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweig