y sun stick developed with influencer and cosmetic chemist, Ramón @glowbyramon! This matte formula doesn\'t get clumpy and doesn\'t feel sticky or greasy even when reapplied several times over makeup. Sebum-control silica powder regulates sebum to increase adherence and provides a matte and smooth finish without clumping, while mugwort, cica and green tea extracts moisturise, nourish, smoothen and soothe skin.\r\n\r\nSuitable for \r\n\r\nall skin types, especially recommended for oily skin with active sebum secretion.\r\n\r\nSize: 18g','Apply to areas that need sun protection, such as the face and body.\r\nReapply every 2-3 hours.','produits/IMG_20230711_023530_(540_x_720_pixel)_85654.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230711_023530_(540_x_720_pixel)_85654.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_023601_(540_x_720_pixel)_74861.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_023619_(540_x_720_pixel)_29132.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230711_023637_(540_x_720_pixel)_12960.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3571,'Beta Panthenol Repair Gel Cleanser',NULL,91.000,'Formulated with SOME BY MI’s patented Beta-Panthenol™ (a blend of D-panthenol and beta-sitosterol), this cleanser effectively rids skin of dirt and impurities while leaving a soothed and hydrated finish. Enriched with probiotics, the pH-balanced cleanser further boosts skin resilience. Formula is free of parabens and lauryl sulfate. It’s dermatologically tested to be suitable for sensitive and acne-prone skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n- This cleanser helps balance the pH level inside the skin and strengthen skin barriers with its exclusive complex Beta-Panthenol™. <br>\r\n- Free from 20 kinds of harmful ingredients and completed the non-comedogenic test. <br>\r\n- Helps control oil and excess sebum on the skin.\r\nHelps protect and improve skin barriers.','1. Dispense and lather a proper amount onto wet hands to form foam.\r\n\r\n2. Massage the foam onto the skin gently and rinse 