skin-friendly sunscreen is packed with ten types of vitamin and hyaluronic acid to nourish and replenish moisture, while offering SPF50+ PA++++ sun protection. The antioxidant-rich sunscreen provides skin brightening and soothing effects. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\nA clinical tested effective UV blocking with broad spectrum SPF50+ PA++++. <br>\r\nWith 10 vitamins and hyaluronic acid that soothes and moisturizes skin. <br>\r\nWith tone-up effect and high in adhesiveness.\r\nCompleted eye irritation test, suitable for sensitive skin.','At the last step of skin care routine, evenly spread a proper amount over areas frequently exposed to sun.','produits/IMG_20230611_104549_(540_x_720_pixel)_91557.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230611_104549_(540_x_720_pixel)_91557.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_104902_(540_x_720_pixel)_94461.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_104917_(540_x_720_pixel)_76769.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230611_104954_(540_x_720_pixel)_48530.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3575,'Victoria\'s Secret Temptation Lotion',NULL,85.000,'Victoria’s Secret Temptation body lotion is a luxurious and alluring soft lotion that will leave you feeling confident and irresistible. Our body splash is infused with a blend of fresh juicy apples with a desert flower touch.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nTop notes: Fruity accord\r\n<br>\r\nHeart notes: Flower (Saguaro), Apple\r\n<br>\r\nBase notes: Vanilla, Musk','Use on body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3576,'Victoria\'s Secret Love Fine Fragrance Lotion',NULL,65.000,'The Victoria\'s Secret Love Fine Fragrance Lotion is a luxurious body care product that combines the moisturizing benefits of a lotion with the captivating scent of the popular Love fragrance. Its blend of blush blooms and boyfriend tees creates a romantic and inviting aroma that lingers on the skin. The lotion is designed to nourish and hydrate the skin, leaving it feeling soft and smooth. It absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue, making it ideal for everyday use. To enhance the fragrance experience, it can be layered with the matching Love Eau de Parfum or Fine Fragrance Mist.','Spray on your body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3577,'Fine Fragrance Whipped Body Scrub',NULL,60.000,'Exfoliate your skin in your favorite fragrance. Our gentle exfoliating formula with Sugar and Shea Butter polishes skin so it feels and soft and smooth. Playful and feminine, Tease is a delicious mix of petally florals wrapped in warmth.\r\nTip: For a long-lasting fragrance experience, pair with matching Eau de Parfum or Fine Fragrance Mist.\r\n• Fragrance type: Warm Gourmand\r\n• Notes: white gardenia, Anjou pear, black vanilla\r\n• Fluffy, fragrant whipped texture\r\n• 171.5 ml/5.8 fl oz.\r\n• Domestic','Use on body',NULL,NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3578,'Victoria\'s Secret Dream Angel Fragrance Lotion',NULL,130.000,'Victoria\'s Secret Dream Angel Fine Fragrance Lotion is a luxurious body care product designed to hydrate and nourish your skin while leaving a captivating scent. This lotion features the iconic Dream Angel fragrance, known for its alluring blend of fruity notes, creamy vanilla, and a touch of woody warmth.\r\nIts formula is crafted to provide deep moisturization without feeling greasy, leaving your skin feeling soft and silky. The Dream Angel scent is long-lasting, ensuring you\'ll enjoy its enchanting aroma throughout the day. Pair it with the matching Dream Angel Eau de Parfum or Fragrance Mist for an even more intense fragrance experience.\r\n','Use on body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3579,'Victoria\'s Secret Water Lily Sea Salt Body Wash',NULL,65.000,'A new kind of daily body ritual. Moisturize as you cleanse with this creamy Shea Butter-infused formula. Skin feels more hydrated after just one wash. Renew with the scent of Water Lily & Sea Salt. Part of the Natural Beauty Body Care Collection, inspired by nature for soft, healthy-feeling skin. Scents plus benefits. Luxurious, efficacious formulas. Botanical inspiration, daily transformation. Fragrance Style: Floral Fresh To maximize your scent benefit','Use on body',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3580,'Victoria\'s Secret Lavender And Vanilla Relax Pack',NULL,510.000,'A new beauty ritual for your body. Awaken your senses with our refreshing mist. Spray from head to toe and enjoy a scent that will put a smile on your face.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTreat yourself to a moment of relaxation with Lavender & Vanilla. A pure moment of relaxation.\r\n\r\nPart of the Natural Beauty body care collection inspired by nature for soft, radiant skin. The marriage of flavors and benefits. Sumptuous and highly effective formulas. Plant inspiration, day-to-day transformation.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nFragrance type\r\nFruity Floral\r\n<br>\r\nNotes\r\nLavender & Vanilla. Botanical inspiration. Blissful comfort.','Adgh',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3581,'Beauty of Joseon Revive eye serum : Ginseng + Retinal',NULL,135.000,'When we lack the protein that imparts elasticity to the dermal layer of the skin, collagen and hyaluronic acid decrease, which causes wrinkles. We created an eye serum that helps to improve wrinkles on the sensitive skin around the eyes by combining ginseng extract and retinal. <br>\r\n <br>\r\nFrom the very beginning, we knew we wanted ginseng as the base ingredient for the eye serum because there are multiple studies showing that ginseng is effective in improving wrinkles due to containing abundant amounts of saponins. Ginseng is a well-known herbal ingredient with excellent efficacy.  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nVitamin A was, without a doubt, the number one ingredient we wanted to combine with ginseng.\r\nThere are two types of vitamin A used as cosmetic ingredients, retinol and retinal. Our most important task was to achieve ingredient stability and reduce skin irritation at the same time.  <br>\r\n2% (active ingredient 0.02%) of retinal stabilized in the form of liposomes was blended into the formula so that customers can experience retinal for themselves.','Use on eyes','produits/IMG_20230619_001827_(540_x_720_pixel)_67069.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230619_001827_(540_x_720_pixel)_67069.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230619_001554_(540_x_720_pixel)_61899.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230619_001616_(540_x_720_pixel)_28305.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230619_001757_(540_x_720_pixel)_94826.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3582,'Green Tea Routine 4 Steps Care Set',NULL,309.000,'Green tea has been recognized for centuries for its numerous health benefits, and it\'s no surprise that it\'s also a popular ingredient in skincare products. The catechins and antioxidants found in green tea help protect the skin against damage from environmental stressors and reduce inflammation. Green tea also has antimicrobial properties, making it an effective ingredient for combating acne. <br>\r\nThis routine with green tea can provide a range of benefits, from reducing puffiness and dark circles around the eyes to hydrating and soothing the skin. With its natural and gentle properties, green tea is a fantastic addition to any skincare routine.','Gjkl',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3583,'peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #06 Plum Update: A cool-tone plum pink',NULL,65.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.','produits/IMG_20230706_180304_(540_x_720_pixel)_14648.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230706_180304_(540_x_720_pixel)_14648.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_180413_(540_x_720_pixel)_16509.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_180439_(540_x_720_pixel)_80843.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_180500_(540_x_720_pixel)_92118.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3584,'Glow Fixing Tint #1 Pure Coral',NULL,68.000,'A glossy version of ETUDE’s bestselling Fixing Tint, the Glow Fixing Tint comes in a lightweight texture that sits comfortably on lips with a luscious, dewy finish. It’s enriched with over 30% moisturizing ingredients and plant-based oils to keep your pout free of dry flakes and wrinkles. The sheer formula is buildable so you can create both gradated and bold lip looks.','Glides on lips directly to create look.\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards.','produits/IMG_20230704_100924_(540_x_720_pixel)_35449.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230704_100924_(540_x_720_pixel)_35449.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_100939_(540_x_720_pixel)_70470.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_101153_(540_x_720_pixel)_40307.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_101213_(540_x_720_pixel)_66678.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3585,'Glow Fixing Tint #2 Mellow Pink',NULL,68.000,'A glossy version of ETUDE’s bestselling Fixing Tint, the Glow Fixing Tint comes in a lightweight texture that sits comfortably on lips with a luscious, dewy finish. It’s enriched with over 30% moisturizing ingredients and plant-based oils to keep your pout free of dry flakes and wrinkles. The sheer formula is buildable so you can create both gradated and bold lip looks.','Glides on lips directly to create look.\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards.','produits/IMG_20230704_120837_(540_x_720_pixel)_72810.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230704_120837_(540_x_720_pixel)_72810.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_102524_(540_x_720_pixel)_94919.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_102544_(540_x_720_pixel)_19644.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230704_102555_(540_x_720_pixel)_27079.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3586,'Glow Fixing Tint #4 Chilling Red',NULL,68.000,'A glossy version of ETUDE’s bestselling Fixing Tint, the Glow Fixing Tint comes in a lightweight texture that sits comfortably on lips with a luscious, dewy finish. It’s enriched with over 30% moisturizing ingredients and plant-based oils to keep your pout free of dry flakes and wrinkles. The sheer formula is buildable so you can create both gradated and bold lip looks.','Glides on lips directly to create look.\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards.','produits/IMG_20230705_160015_(708_x_1000_pixel)_45610.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230705_160015_(708_x_1000_pixel)_45610.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230705_160429_(540_x_720_pixel)_97410.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230705_160451_(540_x_720_pixel)_48241.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230705_160504_(540_x_720_pixel)_11635.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3587,'Glow Fixing Tint #5 Mauvement',NULL,68.000,'A glossy version of ETUDE’s bestselling Fixing Tint, the Glow Fixing Tint comes in a lightweight texture that sits comfortably on lips with a luscious, dewy finish. It’s enriched with over 30% moisturizing ingredients and plant-based oils to keep your pout free of dry flakes and wrinkles. The sheer formula is buildable so you can create both gradated and bold lip looks.','Glides on lips directly to create look.\r\nFor a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards.','produits/IMG_20230706_021457_(540_x_720_pixel)_28154.jpg',NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230706_021457_(540_x_720_pixel)_28154.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_021515_(540_x_720_pixel)_16122.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_021523_(540_x_720_pixel)_74695.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230706_021533_(540_x_720_pixel)_95818.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3588,'Ginseng Moist Sun Serum (SPF 50+ PA++++)',NULL,111.000,'This nourishing serum features SPF 50+ PA++++ to protect skin against harmful UV rays. Infused with 30% ginseng extract, the anti-aging formula enhances skin elasticity and keeps skin hydrated. Formulated with 2% niacinamide to brighten skin for a glowing appearance. The lightweight texture adheres well onto the skin without a sticky after-feel.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n✽ A nourishing serum that protects your skin against UV rays with SPF50+ PA++++. <br>\r\n✽ Infused with 30% Ginseng Extract delivers intensive anti-aging power to boost skin elasticity and keep your skin hydrated and smooth. <br>\r\n✽ Formulated with 2% Niacinamide to maintain the oil-water balance of your skin while removing dead skin cells and impurities, creating a glowing and youthful-looking complexion. <br>\r\n✽ Effectively reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. <br>\r\n✽ Lightweight texture promotes rapid absorption without any sticky feeling.','Pump a generous amount and apply to areas of exposed skin.\r\nReapply every 2-3 hours.\r\n\r\n*Due to the nature of the formula, makeup may be removed if reapplying an excessive amount over makeup.','produits/IMG_20230707_133153_(540_x_720_pixel)_21896.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230707_133153_(540_x_720_pixel)_21896.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230707_133205_(540_x_720_pixel)_90247.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230707_133233_(540_x_720_pixel)_14647.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230707_133254_(540_x_720_pixel)_81262.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3589,'KAHI - Wrinkle Bounce Multi Balm',NULL,210.000,'Looking for the viral Korean stick balm that keeps appearing in Korean dramas? You\'re on the right page! The KAHI Wrinkle Bounce Multi Balm is a multipurpose collagen-infused stick balm that helps reduce wrinkles while giving your skin a beautiful glow with just a single swipe! This balm helps form a moisture barrier for long-lasting hydration, boosting the lasting power of makeup. Can be applied all over your face, as a lip balm or even on your hair! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nInfused with Salmon Complex such as Salmon Collagen and Sodium DNA, which increases the synthesis of collagen to restore skin elasticity effectively. Other than boosting hydration and elasticity, it also helps minimise the look of pores and increases skin radiance. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types.','As a moisturising stick: Apply it evenly on dry areas to keep your skin moisturised\r\nAs a lip balm: Apply it on dry lips to keep your lips moisturised\r\nAs a radiant-boosting balm: Apply it once to instantly make your skin naturally radiant\r\nFor haircare: Apply it on split ends of hair for damage care\r\n\r\nTIP: Temperature changes around the balm can cause &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot;sweating&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;quot; or water droplets to appear on the surface of the balm. The product is still safe to use.','produits/IMG_20230708_203011_(540_x_720_pixel)_79444.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230708_203011_(540_x_720_pixel)_79444.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_203121_(540_x_720_pixel)_32817.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_203139_(540_x_720_pixel)_40322.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_203323_(540_x_720_pixel)_72434.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3590,'AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum',NULL,125.000,'The AXIS-Y Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum is a niacinamide-based serum that corrects dark spots and improves uneven skin tone. With the help of plant-derived Squalane, this serum retains moisture to keep your skin glowing and healthy wherever you go.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types, especially acne-prone or sensitive skin.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nsizes: 50ml','Apply a small amount to entire face or problem areas. Pat until completely absorbed.','produits/IMG_20230708_205736_(540_x_720_pixel)_31086.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230708_205736_(540_x_720_pixel)_31086.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_210524_(540_x_720_pixel)_93276.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_210540_(540_x_720_pixel)_14928.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230708_210555_(540_x_720_pixel)_65455.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3591,'Isntree - Hyaluronic Acid Watery Sun Gel Twin PackSPF50+ PA++++',NULL,176.000,'The Hyaluronic Acid Watery Sun Gel is a moisturising gel-type sunscreen from Korean brand ISNTREE that feels lightweight and refreshing on the skin\r\n\r\nThis SPF 50+ chemical sunscreen is enriched with 8 types of hyaluronic acid, each with a different molecular size to ensure deep and long-lasting hydration. Also infused with a soothing blend of Centella, Anti-oxidant rich Purslane, and heart-leaf extract. \r\n\r\nDesigned for all skin types and concerns, this gel is free from fragrances and leaves no white cast. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDesigned for all skin types and concerns, this gel is free from fragrances and leaves no white cast.','Shake gently before use.\r\nAfter applying your usual morning skincare routine, finish off with a small amount of sunscreen. Smooth over your face ensuring the application is even, and pat to aid absorption. Reapply throughout the day as needed.','produits/IMG_20230709_093301_(540_x_720_pixel)_94710.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230709_093301_(540_x_720_pixel)_94710.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_093320_(540_x_720_pixel)_86964.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_093337_(540_x_720_pixel)_45201.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_093354_(540_x_720_pixel)_86054.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3592,'Skin1004 - Madagascar Centella Air-Fit Suncream Plus',NULL,99.000,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Air-Fit Suncream Plus SPF50+++  is designed for sensitive skin and rosacea skin not only for its Mineral-based UV filters of SPF50+ PA++++ protection, but also its ability to simultaneously brighten the skin and reduces visible rednesss (a comon rosacea skin condition) with niacinamide. This sunscreen can be worn all year long without feeling heavy or leaving a white cast.\r\n\r\nWHAT IT IS:\r\nA non-nano physical sunscreen that blocks UV rays, while simultaneously brightening the skin. This sunscreen can be worn all year long without feeling heavy or leaving a white cast.\r\n\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\r\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Effectively soothes the skin.\r\nNiacinamide: Helps control the appearance of redness.','As the last step of your skincare routine, apply evenly to areas exposed to UV rays.','produits/IMG_20230709_095346_(540_x_720_pixel)_46317.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230709_095346_(540_x_720_pixel)_46317.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_095400_(540_x_720_pixel)_79018.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_095410_(540_x_720_pixel)_54551.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230709_095428_(540_x_720_pixel)_60454.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3593,'PERIPERA - Double Longwear Cover Concealer',NULL,50.000,'The Peripera Double Longwear Cover is a gentle-on-skin concealer that adheres well on skin and provides a lightweight finish that lasts all day. Contains Double Powder mixed with different particles to conceal dark circles, blemishes, dark spots and other skin imperfections. \r\n\r\nClinically tested for skin irritation, suitable even for sensitive skin.\r\n\r\nAvailable in 2 shades\r\n01 <br>\r\n03','