nd soothes with peptides and hydrolyzed elastin. Enriched with brightening essence, the sun cushion leaves skin glowing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n* Composed of blue and white essences to provide UV protection and skin care at the same time\r\nBrightens, moisturizes and firms skin that is sagging and fatigued due to summer heat <br>\r\n* Its light texture leaves a natural finish with no white cast. <br>','At the last step of your skin care routine, apply a thin layer onto your entire face with the enclosed puff and pat gently to aid absorption.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3610,'A\'PIEU - Honey and Milk Lip Scrub',NULL,25.000,'Milk protein extracts and Vitamin E acetate in this lip scrub help to firm, moisturize and protect skin as the scrub gently removes dead skin cells, leaving your lips soft and smooth.','A lip scrub that exfoliates, nourishes, and moisturizes lips with honey and milk.\r\nHydrates dry lips, and removes dead skin cells leaving your lips soft and smooth.\r\nHow to use: 1. Apply an appropriate amount onto lips.\r\n2. Gently massage 2-3 minutes and rinse with water.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3611,'Abib Quick Sunstick Protection Bar SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,117.000,'The Abib Quick Sunstick Protection Bar is a convenient sun protection stick that effortlessly glides over the skin without leaving a sticky residue or a white cast. Acacia Peptide and Ceramide strengthens skin barrier against external aggressors. Can be repeatedly applied onto skin post-makeup for continued protection.','As the last step to your daytime skincare routine, apply directly to the face after moisturising.','produits/IMG_20230723_182442_(540_x_720_pixel)_14261.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230723_182442_(540_x_720_pixel)_14261.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230723_182526_(540_x_720_pixel)_14700.jpg\