4410_(540_x_720_pixel)_50051.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230724_144410_(540_x_720_pixel)_50051.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_144425_(540_x_720_pixel)_24034.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_144513_(540_x_720_pixel)_49851.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_170145_(540_x_720_pixel)_63552.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_170244_(540_x_720_pixel)_90485.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_170253_(540_x_720_pixel)_20987.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230724_170436_(540_x_720_pixel)_16324.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3614,'peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #04 Pink Youth',NULL,65.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3615,'A.H.C - Natural Perfection Double Shield Sun Stick',NULL,107.000,'Keep skin safe and protected with this sunscreen stick fitted with SPF50+ PA++++ and formulated with the brand&rsquo;s UV IR BLOCK&trade; technology to simultaneously block out UV rays and heat from the sun. It contains various skin care ingredients (including bamboo extract, glacier water and cotton seed extract) to soothe, smooth and hydrate skin. Sun stick glides on smoothly and leaves a comfortable and natural finish. Dermatologically tested formula is safe for sensitive skin. \r\nBenefits:\r\nOffers powerful sun protection against UV rays with its SPF50+ PA++++ broad spectrum.\r\nPatented UV IR BLOCK&trade; effectively blocks out UV rays and near-Infrared Ray (sun heat) at the same time.\r\nPhyto Protect Complex (Opuntia Ficus-Indica Stem Extract, Cotton Seed Extract) helps protect and soothe irritated skin agaist external aggressors with comforts.\r\n5 kinds of natural water including deep sea water, glacier water and carbonated water deliver ample refreshing moisture for dewy skin.\r\nSchizandra Chinensis Fruit Extract and Bambusa Vulgaris Extract help control skin hear and condition skin for healthy express.\r\nDermotologically tested, mild formula infused with naturally derived ingredient, suitable for all family members.','1. Open the cap and turn the dial at bottom to release a small amount of product (5mm).\r\n2. Evenly apply to areas that are vulnerable to UV rays.',NULL,NULL,8,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3616,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule Kit',NULL,240.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule Kit (Mini 4 Ampoules) contains 4 of the brands best selling ampoules to target your many different skin concerns! This set includes:\r\n\r\nSKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule (30ml): A lightweight soothing ampoule that helps hydrate, calm and restore imbalance in the skin with 100% Centella Asiatica extract.\r\nSKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh Ampoule (30ml): Contains Pink Himalayan Salt enriched with clarifying minerals to clear pores of impurities while minimising enlarged pores.\r\nSKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Capsule Ampoule (30ml): A brightening ampoule with patented ingredient MadeWhite™ and niacinamide to provide you with clear and bright skin.\r\nSKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tea-Trica Relief Ampoule (30ml): The perfect SOS treatment for acne prone skin. Packed with highly soothing ingredients focused on calming the skin, this non-comedogenic formula treats inflammation and irritation.','1. Drop an appropriate amount onto the skin and evenly apply.\r\n2. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20230805_215356_(540_x_720_pixel)_37058.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230805_215356_(540_x_720_pixel)_37058.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230805_220005_(540_x_720_pixel)_72593.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230805_215714_(540_x_720_pixel)_16211.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230805_220054_(540_x_720_pixel)_47119.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3617,'A.H.C - Natural Perfection Double Shield Sun Stick',NULL,107.000,'Keep skin safe and protected with this chemical and mineral sunscreen stick fitted with SPF50+ PA++++ and formulated with the brand’s UV IR BLOCK™ technology to simultaneously block out UV rays and heat from the sun. It contains various skin care ingredients (including bamboo extract, glacier water and cotton seed extract) to soothe, smooth and hydrate skin. Sun stick glides on smoothly and leaves a comfortable and natural finish. Dermatologically tested formula is safe for sensitive skin.','1. Open the cap and turn the dial at bottom to release a small amount of product (5mm).\r\n2. Evenly apply to areas that are vulnerable to UV rays.','produits/IMG_20230807_222253_(540_x_720_pixel)_50259.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230807_222253_(540_x_720_pixel)_50259.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_222342_(540_x_720_pixel)_20270.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_222408_(540_x_720_pixel)_57368.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_222435_(540_x_720_pixel)_29392.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3618,'UNLEASHIA - Shaper Pomade Eyebrow Fixer',NULL,60.000,'The secret to bold and dramatic brows, this eyebrow pomade delivers rich color and sharp definition with just a few simple strokes. Formulated with UNLEASHIA’s patented Hard and Soft Fixing technology, this eyebrow fixer offers a strong hold while allowing you to create a soft, natural-looking finish. This product is additionally infused with rice extract, soybean seed extract and glycerin for steady hydration. To use, apply product onto brows using the spoolie end of the applicator before brushing up. For more precise styling, use the dual-ended brush.','Use the applicator to brush and fix your eyebrows. Use the dual-ended brush to style your brows as desired.','produits/IMG_20230807_233024_(540_x_720_pixel)_22010.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230807_233024_(540_x_720_pixel)_22010.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_233052_(540_x_720_pixel)_68953.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_233137_(540_x_720_pixel)_39717.png\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_233147_(540_x_720_pixel)_70601.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3619,'Baby Silky Hand Mask Sheet',NULL,25.000,'The key ingredients in this hand mask include shea butter, honey, and milk protein, which work together to deeply hydrate and nourish the skin. Shea butter is rich in fatty acids and vitamins, which help to protect and repair the skin\'s natural barrier. Honey is a natural humectant that helps to retain moisture, while milk protein is rich in amino acids and vitamins, which help to promote healthy skin.\r\n\r\nThe hand mask sheet is enriched with papaya fruit extract, that contains natural enzymes called papain and chymopapain, which help to exfoliate and brighten the skin. These enzymes can help to remove dead skin cells, revealing a brighter and more even skin tone. Papaya extract also contains antioxidants and vitamins, such as vitamin C, which help to protect the skin from damage and promote collagen production, resulting in firmer and smoother skin.\r\n\r\nThe gloves are made of a soft, comfortable material that conforms to your hands for maximum effectiveness.','Wash and dry your hands thoroughly.\r\nOpen the package and remove the gloves.\r\nPut your hands into the gloves and secure them around your wrists using the adhesive strip.\r\nLeave the gloves on for 15-20 minutes to allow the essence to soak into your skin.\r\nRemove the gloves and massage any remaining essence into your skin. Do not rinse your hands after using the hand mask.\r\nUse the hand mask 1-2 times per week or as needed. Disposable mask should not be reused - dispose of the used mask after use.','produits/IMG_20230807_235129_(540_x_720_pixel)_19679.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230807_235129_(540_x_720_pixel)_19679.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_235445_(540_x_720_pixel)_25646.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_235325_(540_x_720_pixel)_54534.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230807_235352_(540_x_720_pixel)_33135.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3620,'CENTELLA TRAVEL KIT',NULL,185.000,'WHAT IT IS:\r\nThe Ultimate 5 travel-size skincare set that includes all the products in the Madagascar Centella Line.\r\n\r\nSet Includes :\r\n-Centella Ampoule Foam 20ml\r\n-Centella Toning Toner 30ml\r\n-Centella Ampoule 30ml\r\n-Centella Soothing Cream 30ml\r\n-Centella Light Cleansing Oil 30ml\r\n\r\n\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\r\nCentella Asiatica Extract: Soothes and replenishes skin hydration level.','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption','produits/IMG_20230808_000050_(540_x_720_pixel)_38915.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230808_000050_(540_x_720_pixel)_38915.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230808_000059_(540_x_720_pixel)_56345.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230808_000114_(540_x_720_pixel)_36001.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230808_000200_(540_x_720_pixel)_10252.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3621,'BLESSED MOON - Fluffy Lip Tint',NULL,62.000,'Highly moisturizing lip tint boasts a smooth formula that glides effortlessly on lips, delivering a lightweight texture and vivid pigmentation. Formulated with extracts from mango seed, cotton seed, camellia oil, avocado oil, Vitamin E and Shine Essential Oil Complex to nourish and hydrate lips.','Apply the lip tint to bare lips for a sheer wash of color.','produits/IMG_20230809_134441_(540_x_720_pixel)_88727.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230809_134441_(540_x_720_pixel)_88727.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230809_134455_(540_x_720_pixel)_85720.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230809_134558_(540_x_720_pixel)_77449.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230809_134657_(540_x_720_pixel)_99128.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3622,'SKIN 1004 - Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Water-Fit Sun Serum Twin Pack',NULL,187.000,'Fitted with SPF50+ PA++++, this organic sunscreen is made with a golden ratio of hyaluronic acid and centella asiatica extract to soothe and hydrate skin without leaving a white cast. Additional ingredients of arugula leaf, green tea and broccoli extracts provide antioxidant benefits and help to improve underlying skin conditions. Fast-absorbing formula in a cream-like texture leaves your skin plump and glowing. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\r\nHyalu-Cica Formula: Our unique combination of Centella Asiatica Extract and Hyaluronic Acids simultaneously heals and hydrates the skin.','Use at the last step of your morning skin care routine.\r\nTake an appropriate amount and apply evenly onto areas likely to be exposed ofto sunlight.','produits/IMG_20230814_100121_(540_x_720_pixel)_56072.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230814_100121_(540_x_720_pixel)_56072.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_100142_(540_x_720_pixel)_96714.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_100215_(540_x_720_pixel)_78057.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_100201_(540_x_720_pixel)_11391.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3623,'Isntree - Hyaluronic Acid Watery Sun Gel SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,110.000,'The Hyaluronic Acid Watery Sun Gel is a moisturising gel-type sunscreen from Korean brand ISNTREE that feels lightweight and refreshing on the skin\r\n\r\nThis SPF 50+ chemical sunscreen is enriched with 8 types of hyaluronic acid, each with a different molecular size to ensure deep and long-lasting hydration. Also infused with a soothing blend of Centella, Anti-oxidant rich Purslane, and heart-leaf extract. \r\n\r\nDesigned for all skin types and concerns, this gel is free from fragrances and leaves no white cast. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDesigned for all skin types and concerns, this gel is free from fragrances and leaves no white cast.','Shake gently before use.\r\nAfter applying your usual morning skincare routine, finish off with a small amount of sunscreen. Smooth over your face ensuring the application is even, and pat to aid absorption. Reapply throughout the day as needed.','produits/IMG_20230814_101008_(540_x_720_pixel)_81649.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230814_101008_(540_x_720_pixel)_81649.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_101043_(540_x_720_pixel)_22557.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_101248_(540_x_720_pixel)_96164.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230814_101311_(540_x_720_pixel)_39284.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3624,'A\'PIEU - Pure Block Tone-Up Sun Base SPF50+ PA+++ 50ml',NULL,85.000,'A sister brand of MISSHA, A\'PIEU offers high-performance makeup and skin care products created for women. Keep harmful UV rays at bay with this chemical and physical sun block offering SPF50+ PA+++ sun protection. Cream-type formula contains papaya extract and grapefruit extract to prevent sebum build-up and help make makeup last longer. Enriched with brightening agent niacinamide and coming in a slightly pink-tinted color, sun block provides a tone-up effect for radiant results. Non-sticky product spreads easily and leaves no residue on skin.','1. Used at the last step of skincare.\r\n2. Gently spread over your face.\r\n3. Reapply as needed when you spend a lot of time outdoors.','produits/IMG_20230826_230133_(540_x_720_pixel)_15959.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230826_230133_(540_x_720_pixel)_15959.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230826_230231_(540_x_720_pixel)_84639.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230826_230552_(540_x_720_pixel)_68996.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230826_230616_(540_x_720_pixel)_95113.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3625,'HOLIKA HOLIKA - Water Vibe Tint 02 Gulp',NULL,68.000,'Highly pigmented lip tint is enriched with fruit ingredients including blueberry, yuzu and peach extracts to add juiciness and shine to lips. The waterproof and smudge-free formula glides on lips smoothly and stays put all day. ','Glides on lips directly to create look','produits/IMG_20240107_182537_(540_x_720_pixel)_18880.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240107_182537_(540_x_720_pixel)_18880.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_182600_(540_x_720_pixel)_44336.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_182611_(540_x_720_pixel)_75116.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240107_182637_(540_x_720_pixel)_55565.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3626,'Collagen Age Defender Set',NULL,625.000,'Collagen Day Cream not only hydrates the skin but also helps with wrinkle care and UV protection at once.  It combines skincare with UV protection. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING. It is formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Vita Secret Multi Balm is infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation.  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Ampoule is an anti-aging booster that rejuvenates your skin by preventing the formation of wrinkles and reducing their appearance. It target wrinkles, hydrates, soothes irritation and redness, brightens and strengthens skin.','First, use the Collagen Ampoule after cleansing and tonning the face and then apply the balm and last but not least the day cream.\r\nat night, use the ampoule and then the balm. Lastly, put on the sleeping mask before going to bed.','produits/IMG_20230905_174643_(540_x_720_pixel)_18589.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230905_174643_(540_x_720_pixel)_18589.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_175053_(540_x_720_pixel)_31360.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_175226_(540_x_720_pixel)_94993.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_175317_(540_x_720_pixel)_25272.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3627,'Daily Collagen Trio',NULL,483.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING. It is formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Vita Secret Multi Balm is infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation.  <br>\r\n <br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Ampoule is an anti-aging booster that rejuvenates your skin by preventing the formation of wrinkles and reducing their appearance. It target wrinkles, hydrates, soothes irritation and redness, brightens and strengthens skin.','Use the ampoule and balm in the morning\r\nUse the sleeping mask at night',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3628,'Collagen Age Defender Trio',NULL,474.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Day Cream not only hydrates the skin but also helps with wrinkle care and UV protection at once.  It combines skincare with UV protection. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING. It is formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Vita Secret Multi Balm is infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation.  <br>','Use the balm and day cream in the morning\r\nUse the sleeping mask at night',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3629,'Collagen Age Defender Duo',NULL,266.000,'Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask is a TIME ERASER OF AGING. It is formulated with a variety of high Quality ingredients such as Collagen, Vitamin Complex, Adenosine, Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid that will make your skin firmer and brighter. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Vita Secret Multi Balm is infused with Pure vitamin C 150, 000ppm and Hydrolyzed Collagen to improve the skin elasticity and reduce pigmentation.  <br>','Use the balm anytime, anywhere.\r\nUse the sleeping mask at night one to three times a week',NULL,NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3630,'Collagen Age Defender Day and Night Duo',NULL,282.000,'Restore your skin\'s youthful radiance with the Ksecret Collagen Age Defender Duo. This powerful combination of our Collagen Boosting Secret Day Cream and Collagen Boosting Secret Sleeping Mask works harmoniously to rejuvenate and revitalize your complexion. <br>\r\nThe Day Cream provides essential hydration and protection, while the Sleeping Mask deeply nourishes and repairs skin as you sleep. Together, they help to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, improve skin elasticity, and promote a healthy, glowing complexion. <br>\r\nExperience the transformative power of collagen as you unveil a younger-looking you. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey Benefits: <br>\r\n<br>\r\n * Reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles <br>\r\n * Improves skin elasticity and firmness <br>\r\n * Deeply hydrates and nourishes the skin <br>\r\n * Promotes a radiant and youthful complexion <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive.','In the morning, at the last step of your skincare routine apply the day cream.\r\nAt night, in the last step of your skincare routine apply the sleeping mask.','produits/IMG_20230905_194415_(540_x_720_pixel)_51580.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20230905_194415_(540_x_720_pixel)_51580.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_194445_(540_x_720_pixel)_23005.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_194603_(540_x_720_pixel)_59259.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20230905_195147_(540_x_720_pixel)_62578.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3631,'CQMONG Intensive Care Trio',NULL,296.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with CQMONG (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy.\r\n<br>\r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Intensive Eye Cream:\r\nApply a suitable amount to eye areas and softly pat until absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;BR&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nNourishing Moisture Cream:\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nDiamond Ampoule Sheet Mask:\r\n1. Wash off fine dust and some dead skin with a cleanser. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n2. After washing face, apply sheet mask on face. Pull the eye part of sheet up to just below the eyes, that part will be fully covered. (No need to attach additional Eye Patches)\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n3. Attach the mask pack for about 10 ~ 20 minutes. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n4. Slowly remove the mask.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\n5. Apply the remaining essence of the removed sheet to face more and tap face lightly until fully absorbed.\r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nVery little Sticky, Persistence of Moisture, Brilliance / Directly putting on Make-up without washing right after using mask. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, 2-3 times a week','produits/IMG_20231006_182223_(540_x_720_pixel)_67162.jpg',NULL,15,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231006_182223_(540_x_720_pixel)_67162.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_182238_(540_x_720_pixel)_57119.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_182303_(540_x_720_pixel)_62117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_182500_(540_x_720_pixel)_92567.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3632,'V10 Hyal Hydra Capsule Sunscreen',NULL,89.000,'V10 Hyal Hydra Capsule Sunscreen by Some by Mi is your ultimate sun protection and hydration solution\r\n\r\nThis sunscreen is infused with hyaluronic acid capsules that release upon application, delivering deep hydration to your skin. With SPF 50+ PA++++, it offers superior protection against harmful UVA and UVB rays, shielding your skin from sun damage and premature aging. Its lightweight, non-greasy formula absorbs quickly, leaving a smooth and matte finish. Suitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nKeep your skin moisturized and protected with V10 Hyal Hydra Capsule Sunscreen by Some by Mi. Enjoy a nourished and guarded complexion all day long.','At the last step of skin care routine, evenly spread a proper amount over areas frequently exposed to sun.','produits/IMG_20231006_202218_(540_x_720_pixel)_54096.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231006_202218_(540_x_720_pixel)_54096.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_215207_(540_x_720_pixel)_81472.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_215314_(540_x_720_pixel)_30033.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_215357_(540_x_720_pixel)_99804.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3633,'Soon Jung 2x Barrier Intensive Cream',NULL,108.000,'Soon Jung 2x Barrier Intensive Cream is a soothing and moisturising cream that helps strengthen your skin barrier and resistance. Formulated with 93% naturally derived ingredients, this highly moisturising cream uses panthenol, madecassoside, sunflower seed oil and shea butter to restore the oil and water balance of the skin, while repairing damage. With its simple, hypoallergenic formula that is free of potential irritants like synthetic fragrance, mineral oil or parabens, this moisturiser is perfect for all skin types, especially babes with sensitive skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: all skin types\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 ml','Use as the last step of your skin care, dispense a pearl-sized amount onto the back of your hand, and apply the moisturiser on your face. Gently pat to help with absorption.','produits/IMG_20231006_223514_(540_x_720_pixel)_93208.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231006_223514_(540_x_720_pixel)_93208.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_223535_(540_x_720_pixel)_59514.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_223552_(540_x_720_pixel)_28401.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231006_224005_(540_x_720_pixel)_30145.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3634,'CQMONG Intensive Care Duo',NULL,185.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with CQMONG (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br>\r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n\r\nApply an appropriate amount evenly to the skin. \r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.','Nourishing Moisture Cream:\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions.','produits/IMG_20231007_183826_(540_x_720_pixel)_69774.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231007_183826_(540_x_720_pixel)_69774.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_183900_(540_x_720_pixel)_65476.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_183840_(540_x_720_pixel)_58644.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_183916_(540_x_720_pixel)_30527.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3635,'CQMONG Moisturizing and Brightening Duo',NULL,197.000,'Comprehensive Efficacy with CQMONG (Elasticity , Vitality , Moisture, Brilliance, Nutrition, Clear skin, Skin Soothing) : The diamond powder helps the skin to look luminous and glossy. <br>\r\nTake care of your skin every day from now on. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive','Apply a suitable amount to eye areas and softly pat until absorbed. &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;BR&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.\r\n\r\nGently massage the cream into your skin using small, upward, circular motions. \r\n&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;lt;br&amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;gt;\r\nUse it morning and/or night, daily.','produits/IMG_20231007_184218_(540_x_720_pixel)_47133.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231007_184218_(540_x_720_pixel)_47133.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_184314_(540_x_720_pixel)_91666.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_183840_(540_x_720_pixel)_92218.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231007_183916_(540_x_720_pixel)_34598.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3636,'The Hyaluronic Acid 3 Serum',NULL,125.000,'COSRX\'s The Hyaluronic Acid 3 Serum is a highly concentrated 3% hyaluronic acid serum that hydrates, plumps, soothes and supports the skin\'s moisture barrier. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits <br>\r\nInfuses hydration <br>\r\nStrengthens skin barrier <br>\r\nRetains moisture <br>\r\nPlumps skin <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey Ingredients <br>\r\nHyaluronic Acid : Recharges the skin with hydration alleviating dryness and restoring the skin\'s moisture balance <br>\r\nNMF (Amino acid complex) : Improves skin barrier protecting against dryness and dehydration <br>\r\nCeramide : Protects the skin from external stressors','After cleansing, during the serum phase, apply a few drops to the skin. Use fingertips to gently massage and absorb the serum, starting from the center of the face working towards the edges. Can be used morning and/or evening.','produits/IMG_20231012_224947_(540_x_720_pixel)_22461.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231012_224947_(540_x_720_pixel)_22461.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231012_225002_(540_x_720_pixel)_16204.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231012_225012_(540_x_720_pixel)_77817.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231012_225022_(540_x_720_pixel)_37928.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3637,'Collagen Boosting Secret Sun Lotion',NULL,142.000,'Shield your skin from the sun\'s harmful rays with Ksecret\'s collagen-infused sun lotion. This innovative formula offers broad-spectrum SPF 50+ PA++++ protection, safeguarding your skin from UVA and UVB damage. Beyond sun protection, the lotion is enriched with collagen to hydrate and plump the skin, reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. Its lightweight, non-greasy texture absorbs quickly, leaving a smooth, dewy finish. Experience the perfect blend of suncare and skincare with this all-in-one daily essential. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combinaison, Oily, Sensitive. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 60 ml\r\n ','Apply a generous amount of the product on the face and other areas needed 30 minutes prior to being exposed to sunlight.','produits/IMG_20231012_230057_(540_x_720_pixel)_30430.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231012_230057_(540_x_720_pixel)_30430.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231012_230108_(540_x_720_pixel)_86456.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231012_230123_(540_x_720_pixel)_79319.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231012_230132_(540_x_720_pixel)_50440.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3638,'Daily Basics Trio',NULL,175.000,'A\'PIEU - Pure Block Tone-Up Sun Base SPF50+ PA+++ 50ml: <br>\r\nKeep harmful UV rays at bay with this chemical and physical sun block offering SPF50+ PA+++ sun protection. Cream-type formula contains papaya extract and grapefruit extract to prevent sebum build-up and help make makeup last longer. Enriched with brightening agent niacinamide and coming in a slightly pink-tinted color, sun block provides a tone-up effect for radiant results. Non-sticky product spreads easily and leaves no residue on skin.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nMISSHA - 3D Mascara: <br>\r\nThis 3D Mascara glams up lashes while providing a prolonged curl. The lightweight and smudge-proof formula adheres well to lashes without clumping. The thin triangular spoolie coats each lash for a voluminous finish. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCQMONG Diamond Ampoule Sheet Mask: <br>\r\nA total of 65 ingredients in one sheet: Diamond Powder (20 ppm), Ampoule concentrate supply (Hyaluronic Acid, Collagen, Peptide, Adenosine, Niacinamide, etc.), Extracts of Plants & Grains, etc. Diamond Ampoule Sheet Mask makes your Skin elastic, vital, moistured, brilliant, soothed, and clear.','apply on face',NULL,NULL,8,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3639,'Kaine Soothing Duo',NULL,215.000,'Kombu Balancing Ampoule Toner: <br>\r\nKAINE\'s Kombu Balancing Ampoule Toner contains over 60% fermented kombucha, plus 1% panthenol, beta-glucan and allantoin to help prep and hydrate skin for the routine that follows. The mild formulation provides a skin-soothing effect that relieves irritation and sensitivity, making this toner recommended for all skin types. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nGreen Fit Pro Sun SPF 50+ Sunscreen:\r\nThis vegan sunscreen uses chemical and mineral filters to provide SPF 50+ PA++++ sun protection. The sweat-resistant formula is infused with panthenol, hyaluronic acid and bambusa vulgaris water to hydrate and soothe irritated skin. Enriched with thymus vulgaris extract and chlorella vulgaris extract, hybrid sunscreen in a milky lotion texture provides a slight cooling effect.','apply on face',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3640,'Honey and milk lip oil Duo',NULL,80.000,'1- Milk protein extracts and Vitamin E acetate in this lip scrub help to firm, moisturize and protect skin as the scrub gently removes dead skin cells, leaving your lips soft and smooth. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n2- The Apieu Honey & Milk Lip Oil is a lip oil infused with nourishing and moisturizing ingredients, including honey and milk to promote supple and resilient lips. Locks in moisture and deeply hydrates lips for a long-lasting plump and glossy look! Carries a faint milk scent to lift your mood. Great to use alone to make lips look naturally soft, or to top off a lip tint for a glossy effect.','Lip',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3641,'Devil\'s Plumper Duo',NULL,117.000,'With the help of tingling sensations and a bit “fiery” feeling, this duo makes the lips fuller, adds volume, and increases circulation.','Lips',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3642,'Dear Darling Oil Tint #1 Real Cherry',NULL,68.000,'Indulge your lips with Etude Dear Darling Oil Tint. This isn\'t just a lip color; it\'s a juicy burst of hydration and shine. Infused with nourishing oils, this non-sticky tint leaves your lips feeling soft and looking luscious. Choose from a vibrant range of shades for a playful pop of color that lasts.','Glides on lips directly','produits/IMG_20240719_153953_(540_x_720_pixel)_42686.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240719_153953_(540_x_720_pixel)_42686.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240719_154002_(540_x_720_pixel)_84891.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240719_154050_(540_x_720_pixel)_31538.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240719_154126_(540_x_720_pixel)_83731.jpg\", \"produits/dear_darling_oil_tint_01_real_cherry_530x@2x_29360.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3643,'Peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #12 Warm Gorithm (Peritage)',NULL,68.000,'A pure glossy tint with fresh mood colours! Dazzling water glow texture that moisturises the lips, stays fresh and clear even after several coats. Once the watery gloss spreads, the Triple Layer Glow Mechanism creates a glowing, plumped look on the lips. Formulated to glide on softly and adhere tightly while preventing product build up for long-lasting colour. Non-sticky texture for a pure and fresh glossy tint.','Glides on lips directly to create look.','produits/IMG_20231108_235210_(540_x_720_pixel)_42587.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231108_235210_(540_x_720_pixel)_42587.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231108_235233_(540_x_720_pixel)_69964.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231108_235442_(540_x_720_pixel)_64108.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231109_000022_(540_x_720_pixel)_79480.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3644,'SKIN 1004 - Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil',NULL,128.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Light Cleansing Oil is an all-in-one, non-irritating cleanser that removes all traces of makeup effortlessly. This cleanser uses an oil-type Centella asiatica extract that is unique to the brand in order to reap its soothing benefits, while micelle particles absorb skin impurities while moisturising skin. Six kinds of botanical oils help prevent skin irritation, while taking care of blackheads and sebum.\r\n\r\nThis cleansing oil removes makeup residue and purifies pores with its water-light texture that leaves a refreshing finish on skin. Suitable for all skin types','On dry hands, take an appropriate amount of the product and massage over dry face. Add some water to emulsify and massage into your skin gently until the oil becomes milky. Wash it off with lukewarm water','produits/IMG_20231109_002808_(540_x_720_pixel)_78945.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231109_002808_(540_x_720_pixel)_78945.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231109_002826_(540_x_720_pixel)_87514.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231109_002840_(540_x_720_pixel)_45020.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231109_002859_(540_x_720_pixel)_58956.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3645,'Laneige Lip Sleeping Mask [Berry]',NULL,65.000,'Laneige\'s best-selling Lip Sleeping Mask EX (Berry) returns with an upgraded formulation that helps dissolve dead skin cells, moisturise, smooth and plump your lips overnight. The sweet and fruity scent of this berry mask is relaxing, and will remind you of real berries. Laneige\'s Moisture Wrap™ technology features a hyaluronic acid network that forms a moisturising film to lock in active ingredients and retain moisture through the night. Berry Mix Complex™, which is rich in antioxidants and Vitamin C also helps exfoliate dead skin cells for smoother lips. The nourishing combination of Coconut Oil, Shea Butter and Murumuru Seed Butter work together to deliver lasting hydration and moisture while you sleep!','-Apply generously to the lips in the evening and leave on overnight.\r\n-Gently wipe off excess in the morning as needed.','produits/IMG_20231111_174818_(540_x_720_pixel)_53091.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231111_174818_(540_x_720_pixel)_53091.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231111_174911_(540_x_720_pixel)_13986.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231111_175036_(540_x_720_pixel)_53276.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231111_175143_(540_x_720_pixel)_95641.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3646,'Laneige - Lip Sleeping Mask (Apple Lime)',NULL,65.000,'The LANEIGE Lip Sleeping Mask is a leave-on lip mask that soothes and moisturises for smoother, more supple lips. The scent of freshly harvested apple lime also adds to the overall relaxation effect of this mask. Sometimes a lip balm is not enough and no matter how much you apply, your lips will still look dry and chapped. Enter the renewed Laneige Lip Sleeping Mask, made with Moisture Wrap™, which forms a moisturising protective film to lock in moisture and active ingredients, and Berry Mix Complex™, which is rich in antioxidants and Vitamin C to protect your lips and gently exfoliate dry flakes. A generous layer of this soothing mask at bedtime helps reduce flakiness so you can wake up to lips that feel refreshed, supple, and soft to the touch.','Apply a generous layer to your lips in the evening before going to sleep with the spatula. The next morning, wipe your lips with a tissue or cotton pad to remove all dead skin cells and skin.','produits/IMG_20231111_230612_(540_x_720_pixel)_51304.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231111_230612_(540_x_720_pixel)_51304.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231111_230752_(540_x_720_pixel)_23341.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231111_230700_(540_x_720_pixel)_89899.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231111_230908_(540_x_720_pixel)_98474.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3647,'Laneige - Lip Sleeping Mask (Grapefruit)',NULL,65.000,'Laneige\'s best-selling Lip Sleeping Mask EX (Grapefruit) returns with an upgraded formulation that helps dissolve dead skin cells, moisturise, smooth and plump your lips overnight. The sweet citrus scent of this grapefruit mask helps promote a good night\'s sleep. Laneige\'s Moisture Wrap™ technology features a hyaluronic acid network that forms a moisturising film to lock in active ingredients and retain moisture through the night. Berry Mix Complex™, which is rich in antioxidants and Vitamin C also helps exfoliate dead skin cells for smoother lips the next morning.','Simply apply the mask before bedtime to help replenish the lips as you sleep. Complete with applicator.','produits/IMG_20231112_005233_(540_x_720_pixel)_96598.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231112_005233_(540_x_720_pixel)_96598.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_005517_(540_x_720_pixel)_65022.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_005533_(540_x_720_pixel)_12350.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231111_230908_(540_x_720_pixel)_98393.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3648,'Laneige - Lip Sleeping Mask ( Choco Mint)',NULL,65.000,'Laneige\'s best-selling Lip Sleeping Mask EX (Mint Choco) returns with an upgraded formulation that helps dissolve dead skin cells, moisturise, smooth and plump your lips overnight. The fresh and sweet scent of this mint choco mask leaves your lips feeling comforted and refreshed. Laneige\'s Moisture Wrap™ technology features a hyaluronic acid network that forms a moisturising film to lock in active ingredients and retain moisture through the night. Berry Mix Complex™, which is rich in antioxidants and Vitamin C also helps exfoliate dead skin cells for smoother lips the next morning.','STEP 1: Before going to bed, apply a liberal amount with the spatula.\r\n※ Effect: Melts stubborn dead skin cells and provides abundant moisture to skin during nighttime.\r\nSTEP 2: The next morning, gently wipe skin clean with tissue or cotton pad.\r\n※ Effect: Makes the lips smooth and elastic by removing dead skin cells.','produits/IMG_20231112_105752_(540_x_720_pixel)_15909.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231112_105752_(540_x_720_pixel)_15909.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_105817_(540_x_720_pixel)_63992.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_105850_(540_x_720_pixel)_18327.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_105956_(540_x_720_pixel)_39101.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3649,'Advanced Snail Radiance Dual Essence',NULL,179.000,'The  COSRX Advanced Snail Radiance Dual Essence is a unique essence with a dual formula to boost skin elasticity and radiance at the same time. Enriched with 74.3% Triple Snail Complex to deeply hydrate and increase skin elasticity, while 5% niacinamide brightens the skin. With its dual airless system, the two essences are stored separately to ensure that they come out fresh with every pump. This highly concentrated yet lightweight essence provides a 2-in-1 solution without leaving behind any sticky residue.','After cleansing and toning, pump an appropriate amount and mix the two essences. Apply gently on the face and pat using fingertips to aid absorption. Follow up with your moisturiser.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Pump the essence out slowly by pressing the middle part of the cap. If the bottle is leaning to either side, essences of different volumes can be dispensed.','produits/IMG_20231112_195944_(540_x_720_pixel)_88530.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231112_195944_(540_x_720_pixel)_88530.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_200032_(540_x_720_pixel)_61624.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_200157_(540_x_720_pixel)_89198.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_200223_(540_x_720_pixel)_88826.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_200113_(540_x_720_pixel)_93030.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231112_200239_(540_x_720_pixel)_35476.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3650,'Big Cover Skin Fit Concealer PRO #Neutral Beige',NULL,60.000,'Liquid concealer comes in different shades to fit a range of skin tones from warm to neutral and cool. Formula adheres well to skin to create an even skin tone for the rest of your makeup. It adheres well to create even skin tone and long-lasting clean finish.','Apply on desired areas after applying makeup base, foundation or BB cream. Gently blend and tap with fingers to set in','produits/IMG_20231114_234332_(540_x_720_pixel)_62265.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231114_234332_(540_x_720_pixel)_62265.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231114_234358_(540_x_720_pixel)_41285.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231114_234411_(540_x_720_pixel)_25035.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231114_234521_(540_x_720_pixel)_30063.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3651,'Retinol Intense Trial Kit',NULL,83.000,'Retinol beginner daily trial kit, Super mild retinol for sensitive skin.  <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSOME BY MI Retinol Intense Advanced Tripe Action Eye Cream is a nighttime eye cream formulated to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles while firming and brightening your most fragile skin. This intense brightening eye cream contains Niacinamide, Retinol and Tranexamic Acid to visibly brighten dark eye circles and support natural collagen. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis serum is infused with retinol, retinal and bakuchiol to boost skin elasticity and reduce signs of aging. It\'s created with patented elastic-liposome technology to deliver active ingredients deep into skin. The gentle formula gives a non-sticky, moisturizing finish without any irritation. Recommended for sensitive skin.','[First 1-2 weeks]\r\n\r\nOnce a day, use a small amount in the evening\r\nOnce every 2 days if your skin is very sensitive\r\nUse with enough moisture care\r\n[After 3 weeks of use] \r\n\r\nAfter skin adaptation, you can increase the number of times and the amount you use. \r\n\r\nCAUTIONS BEFORE USE\r\n\r\nIn case of sensitive skin, you may experience redness or scaly skin when using for the first time. However, it is a natural process of skin turnover. (We recommend you use a generous amount of calming cream.)\r\nAs retinol is sensitive to light and heat, it is recommended to use the product in the evening and when using it during the day, always use sunscreen after applying retinol.\r\nDuring the period of using the product, remember to use sunscreen the next morning.\r\nBefore using, make sure to apply basic skincare items such as toner, serum, and cream.\r\n(✓) Avoid use it on these occasions\r\n\r\nAvoid using the product together with any laser treatment or beauty appliances\r\nAvoid using chemical, physical exfoliating product\r\n\r\n[Retinol Intense Serum]\r\n\r\nAfter cleansing, in the serum step, take an appropriate amount and gently spread over the entire face. Tap lightly to absorb.\r\n\r\n[Retinol Intense Eye Cream]\r\n\r\nAfter face wash at night, at the last step of skincare, apply an appropriate amount to the skin around the eyes and apply by lightly the area where you are concerned about wrinkles.','produits/IMG_20231115_000352_(540_x_720_pixel)_15080.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231115_000352_(540_x_720_pixel)_15080.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_000519_(540_x_720_pixel)_39257.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_000558_(540_x_720_pixel)_60490.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_000631_(540_x_720_pixel)_84123.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_000754_(540_x_720_pixel)_18631.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3652,'SKIN1004 - Madagascar Centella Poremizing Deep Cleansing Foam',NULL,110.000,'WHAT IT IS:<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis all in one facial cleanser, infused with Hymalayan Pink salt, is a deeply exfoliating cleanser. The sticky and creamy textured paste turns into a rich foam to wash off dirt, sebum in the pores and sunscreen leftovers on your face. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS: <br>\r\n<br>\r\n* Himalayan Pink Salt: <br> Helps deeply cleanse waste from pores.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n* Papain: <br> This protein-degrading enzyme derived from papaya fruit helps exfoliate old dead skin cells to make your skin smooth and silky.','Apply an appropriate amount onto wet palms and rub together to create foam. Gently massage the face and rinse with lukewarm water. Rinse thoroughly.','produits/IMG_20231115_121957_(540_x_720_pixel)_39677.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231115_121957_(540_x_720_pixel)_39677.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_121937_(540_x_720_pixel)_51019.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_122007_(540_x_720_pixel)_98604.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_122258_(540_x_720_pixel)_63303.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3653,'Skin1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Clear Toner',NULL,135.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Clear Toner is a gentle exfoliating toner that removes excess sebum and dead skin cells for clearer and smoother skin. Enriched with mineral-rich Pink Himalayan Salt and 4-HA Complex (containing AHA, BHA, PHA and LHA) to help unclog pores and minimise the look of enlarged pores, while Cica Extract provides calming and hydrating benefits.','After cleansing, dispense an appropriate amount on a cotton pad or your hands. Apply all over the skin and gently pat to allow absorption.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Use no more than three times a week if you are new to chemical exfoliants, and always apply sunscreen afterwards if you use this product during the day.','produits/IMG_20231115_165546_(540_x_720_pixel)_45701.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231115_165546_(540_x_720_pixel)_45701.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_165608_(540_x_720_pixel)_31081.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_165621_(540_x_720_pixel)_25849.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231115_165648_(540_x_720_pixel)_43306.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3654,'Skin1004 - Poremizing Fresh Ampoule',NULL,160.000,'Struggle with enlarged pores? This serum will be your new best friend. The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Poremizing Fresh Ampoule is especially designed for oily skin and minimising the appearance of large pores due to excessive sebum secretion. Featuring Himalayan Pink Salt which is rich in minerals to help remove dead skin cells and pore wastes while reviving skin. Additionally enriched with Peptide-9 Complex and Madagascar-sourced Cica Extract for hydrating and anti-ageing benefits.\r\n\r\nSize: 100ml','Use after cleansing and toning. Use the dropper to apply a few drops to the skin and gently pat to absorb.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3655,'AHA, BHA, PHA 30 Days Miracle Cleansing Bar',NULL,43.000,'The SOME BY MI AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Cleansing Bar is an exfoliating cleansing soap that leaves your skin clearer and more moisturised. Formulated with 10,000ppm tea tree extract, 2% niacinamide and three different types of acids (AHA, BHA and PHA), this soap helps treat acne, brighten, exfoliate and clear away impurities from the pores.','Lather up with water and massage onto face or other body parts with blemishes. Rinse off with lukewarm water. Continue with toner and the rest of your skin care routine.','produits/IMG_20231116_161143_(540_x_720_pixel)_33059.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231116_161143_(540_x_720_pixel)_33059.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231116_161321_(540_x_720_pixel)_10668.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231116_161548_(540_x_720_pixel)_85990.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231116_161531_(540_x_720_pixel)_21119.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3656,'A\'PIEU - Honey And Milk Lip Sleeping Pack',NULL,32.000,'Nourish and moisturise lips overnight with the A\'PIEU Honey And Milk Lip Sleeping Pack! Honey and milk protein extracts form a moisture barrier on the lips, keeping them healthy and smooth. Apply at bedtime to dry, cracked lips and wake up to soft, hydrated lips overnight! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 6.7g','Before going to bed at night, apply an adequate amount on the lips using the built-in spatula. The next morning, gently wipe the lips clean with tissue or cotton pad.','produits/IMG_20231117_215453_(540_x_720_pixel)_65643.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231117_215453_(540_x_720_pixel)_65643.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231117_215438_(540_x_720_pixel)_35870.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231117_215519_(540_x_720_pixel)_29878.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231117_215538_(540_x_720_pixel)_83691.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3657,'SKIN 1004 - Madagascar Centella Poremizing Quick Clay Stick Mask',NULL,95.000,'WHAT IT IS: <br>\r\nClay stick that quickly and conveniently cleans clogged skin and removes sebum and impurities from pores without irritation, resulting in clean and refreshed skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nKEY INGREDIENTS: <br>\r\nWith its powerful sebum absorption ability, this product contains 5 types of clay, including white mud and 18% of kaolin. It adheres closely to the skin, eliminating excess sebum that clogs the pores, causing the skin to appear smoother and more refined.','1. After washing, apply it to the face, avoiding the eyes and mouth areas.\r\n2. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water after 3 to 5 minutes.','produits/IMG_20231117_220226_(540_x_720_pixel)_71564.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231117_220226_(540_x_720_pixel)_71564.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231117_220237_(540_x_720_pixel)_53585.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231117_220252_(540_x_720_pixel)_50791.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231117_220427_(540_x_720_pixel)_92757.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3658,'Fixing Tint Shine #Retro Brown',NULL,68.000,'Part of ETUDE’s Retro Y2K Makeup Special Edition, this high-shine version of the brand’s iconic Fixing Tint radiates throwback vibes while being comfy on skin. Moisturizing ingredients like raspberry leaf extract and glycerin keep your pout plump and juiced-up all day long. This 90s-style brown shade is perfect for complementing a glam-grunge look.','1. For a bold look, apply a moderate amount along the edge of lips and then fill in the inner part.\r\n2. For a gradated effect, gently apply from the inner lips and move outwards.','produits/IMG_20231122_211134_(540_x_720_pixel)_52060.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231122_211134_(540_x_720_pixel)_52060.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_211450_(540_x_720_pixel)_96482.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_211513_(540_x_720_pixel)_81393.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_211526_(540_x_720_pixel)_54002.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3659,'Yuja Niacin Dark Spot Correcting Stick',NULL,130.000,'The Some By Mi Yuja Niacin Dark Spot Correcting Stick is a multi-tasking balm that helps reduce the appearance of pigmentation and blemishes. Infused with 37% yuja extract, 8 types of vitamin and niacinamide to brighten skin and reduce blemishes. Featuring licorice extract, peptides and tea tree, this formula also provides soothing, anti-ageing and elasticity-improving benefits.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nVolume: 10g','Directly apply to the desired areas at the last step of your basic skincare routine. Can also be applied after makeup throughout the day.','produits/IMG_20231122_222346_(540_x_720_pixel)_23015.png',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231122_222346_(540_x_720_pixel)_23015.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_222411_(540_x_720_pixel)_61897.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_222609_(540_x_720_pixel)_54187.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_222655_(540_x_720_pixel)_83844.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3660,'Laneige - Lip Sleeping Mask (Apple Lime)',NULL,69.000,'The LANEIGE Lip Sleeping Mask is a leave-on lip mask that soothes and moisturises for smoother, more supple lips. The scent of freshly harvested apple lime also adds to the overall relaxation effect of this mask. Sometimes a lip balm is not enough and no matter how much you apply, your lips will still look dry and chapped. Enter the renewed Laneige Lip Sleeping Mask, made with Moisture Wrap™, which forms a moisturising protective film to lock in moisture and active ingredients, and Berry Mix Complex™, which is rich in antioxidants and Vitamin C to protect your lips and gently exfoliate dry flakes. A generous layer of this soothing mask at bedtime helps reduce flakiness so you can wake up to lips that feel refreshed, supple, and soft to the touch.\r\n\r\nVolume : 20 g','As the last step of your skin care routine, apply generously and leave on overnight. Gently wipe off remains next morning','produits/IMG_20231122_231152_(540_x_720_pixel)_79679.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231122_231152_(540_x_720_pixel)_79679.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_231221_(540_x_720_pixel)_18674.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_231245_(540_x_720_pixel)_98095.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_231417_(540_x_720_pixel)_78742.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3661,'Peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint #13 Berry Pretty (Peritage)',NULL,68.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth outwards toward corners of mouth.','produits/IMG_20231122_233911_(540_x_720_pixel)_82931.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231122_233911_(540_x_720_pixel)_82931.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_233934_(540_x_720_pixel)_83593.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_233958_(540_x_720_pixel)_90162.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231122_234024_(540_x_720_pixel)_22473.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3662,'Peripera - Ink Mood Glowy Tint  #14 Follow Rose (Peritage)',NULL,68.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth outwards toward corners of mouth.','produits/IMG_20231123_103102_(540_x_720_pixel)_99887.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_103102_(540_x_720_pixel)_99887.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_103230_(540_x_720_pixel)_57827.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_103240_(540_x_720_pixel)_51430.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_103407_(540_x_720_pixel)_84859.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3663,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Cloudy Mist',NULL,120.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Cloudy Mist is an ultra fine mist spray that helps replenish moisture and prevent fine lines for dewy glowing skin throughout the day. Formulated with the golden ratio of Centella Asiatica Extract and Hyaluronic Acid to soothe and replenish the skin\'s hydration level. Also contains Camellia Sinensis (Green Tea) Leaf Water, which is packed with antioxidants to repair and protect skin.\r\n\r\nVolume : 120ml','Spray the product 20-30 cm from face and allow to air dry or pat with fingertips.','produits/IMG_20231123_193046_(540_x_720_pixel)_24140.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_193046_(540_x_720_pixel)_24140.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_193115_(540_x_720_pixel)_64252.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_193130_(540_x_720_pixel)_31469.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_193218_(540_x_720_pixel)_91628.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_193230_(540_x_720_pixel)_76278.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3664,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner',NULL,150.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Toning Toner is a gentle exfoliating toner that can be used daily to help exfoliate dead skin cells and is suitable for sensitive skin. It contains 84% centella asiatica extract and PHA to gently exfoliate and soothe for fresh and supple skin.\r\n\r\nVolume : 210ml','Apply an appropriate amount to either a cotton pad or directly to the palm and gently pat onto the skin.','produits/IMG_20231123_201717_(540_x_720_pixel)_35393.png',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_201717_(540_x_720_pixel)_35393.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_201735_(540_x_720_pixel)_27343.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_201751_(540_x_720_pixel)_61510.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_201808_(540_x_720_pixel)_50655.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3665,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Cream',NULL,111.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Cream is a lightweight daily moisturiser to help calm, hydrate and nourish skin damaged by harmful external environments. Enriched with fresh Centella Asiatica Extract from the untouched nature of Madagascar to soothe and restore skin water-oil balance, while Squalene fortifies skin protective barrier. The soft and non-sticky provides long-lasting moisture to skin.','Apply proper amount on face and pat gently with both palms for absorption. Use as last step of skincare routine','produits/IMG_20231123_203826_(540_x_720_pixel)_24404.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_203826_(540_x_720_pixel)_24404.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_203855_(540_x_720_pixel)_80029.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_203909_(540_x_720_pixel)_23089.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_203923_(540_x_720_pixel)_66888.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3666,'SKIN10004 Madagascar Centella Soothing Cream',NULL,111.000,'The SKIN10004 Madagascar Centella Soothing Cream is a calming cream to help repair skin barrier while boosting hydration levels. Enriched with 72% Centella Asiatica Extract sourced from Madagascar to soothe and hydrate, while a combination of ceramides, fatty acids and cholestrol nourish and fortify the skin barrier. The formula gel-like texture glides on smoothly and offers a cooling sensation to sensitive skin.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nVolume: 75ml','Apply appropriate amount on face and pat gently with both palms for absorption. Use it as the last step of skincare routine.','produits/IMG_20231123_210120_(540_x_720_pixel)_77060.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_210120_(540_x_720_pixel)_77060.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_210131_(540_x_720_pixel)_66998.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_210201_(540_x_720_pixel)_59333.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_210216_(540_x_720_pixel)_17762.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3667,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Quick Calming Pad',NULL,135.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Quick Calming Pad contains pre-saturated pads soaked in rich essence that offers deep hydration while gently exfoliating dead skin cells. Features 49% Centella Asiatica Extract and Panthenol, this calming pad soothes irritation and acne flare-ups, while Sodium Hyaluronic keeps skin moisturised all day.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nSize: 70 pads','After cleansing, wipe a pad over the face. Or, place the pads for 3 - 5 mins on any areas of concern. Gently pat in excess essence to allow absorption.','produits/IMG_20231123_212822_(540_x_720_pixel)_31059.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_212822_(540_x_720_pixel)_31059.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_212837_(540_x_720_pixel)_15641.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_212858_(540_x_720_pixel)_22441.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_212911_(540_x_720_pixel)_10700.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3668,'SKIN1004 Zombie Beauty Pumpkin Pack',NULL,130.000,'The SKIN1004 Zombie Beauty Pumpkin Pack is a moisturising leave-on mask designed for dehydrated, sagging skin. Formulated with 61% Pumpkin Extract to deeply hydrate and soothe tired, stressed skin, while Honey Extract, Royal Jelly Extract and Propolis Extract improve skin texture for a smoother complexion. This gel-type mask also contains Green Tea Powder and Green Tea Oil to balance and revitalise, leaving your skin plump, smooth and healthy.\r\n\r\nSize: 4g x 16pcs','Using the brush provided, apply an even layer of mask over your face and neck. Allow to absorb by lightly tapping it. The mask does not need to be washed off.','produits/IMG_20231123_215116_(540_x_720_pixel)_61652.jpg',NULL,0,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_215116_(540_x_720_pixel)_61652.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_215210_(540_x_720_pixel)_88826.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_215223_(540_x_720_pixel)_53825.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_215236_(540_x_720_pixel)_95296.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3669,'SKIN1004 Zombie Beauty Bloody Peel',NULL,130.000,'The SKIN1004 Zombie Beauty Bloody Peel is a wash-off peeling ampoule that contains 17% AHA to exfoliate dead skin cells and improve skin\'s texture for smoother, brighter skin. Formulated with a golden ratio of AHA + BHA, this peeling ampoule aids in the removal of dead skin cells, controls excess sebum and smooths skin texture, while Vitamin C brightens dull skin tone. This peel also features red food from nature, such as Tomatoes, Red Beets, Paprika and Berry Complex that revitalises and calms skin quickly and effectively.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, but NOT suitable for sensitive and easily irritated skin.\r\n\r\nSize: 30ml','Use the dispenser to drop an appropriate amount and apply evenly to the face, avoiding the eye and mouth area. Leave on for 1 minute, then rinse with lukewarm water to remove any remaining product. Recommended to use only 1-2 times a week.','produits/IMG_20231123_220130_(540_x_720_pixel)_19985.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_220130_(540_x_720_pixel)_19985.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_220149_(540_x_720_pixel)_87627.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_220201_(540_x_720_pixel)_46778.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_220337_(540_x_720_pixel)_38009.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3670,'Skin1004 Witch Pack',NULL,130.000,'Skin1004 Zombie Beauty Witch Pack is a creamy green tea mud mask, a soothing pore care product. Do you suffer from damn skin with dryness, redness, irritation, blackheads and more? It’s time to escape this nightmare. This mask will eliminate all skin problems and wash away your worries. It contains green tea leaf water (71%), green tea powder, green tea extract and green tea oil. Enjoy a fresh but soothing cleansing effect. The green mud dries on the face and leaves a cooling effect, but does not irritate the skin like other existing mud masks. Inorganic powders such as kaolin and bentonite gently cover every corner of your face for a soothing effect. Whenever your skin feels dry, rough, irritated and hot, just apply it to eliminate all these skin problems. After a deep cleansing with a mud mask, you can feel that the skin is soft and smooth.','After opening, apply the mud mask with a brush or hand. Apply evenly all over the face except around the eyes and mouth. After 10-15 minutes, rinse thoroughly with warm water.','produits/IMG_20231123_221810_(540_x_720_pixel)_48498.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_221810_(540_x_720_pixel)_48498.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_221944_(540_x_720_pixel)_11637.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_222019_(540_x_720_pixel)_30685.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_222039_(540_x_720_pixel)_89818.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3671,'SKIN 1004 - ZOMBIE BEAUTY Mummy Pack And Activator Kit',NULL,140.000,'Reverse signs of aging with this rinse-off mask enriched with plant-based ingredients like black truffle extract, blackberry extract and black bean extract to revitalize and rejuvenate skin. Amped up by pore-tightening and skin-purifying ingredients such as albumen (egg white) and charcoal powder, the mask effectively firms skin and smooths skin texture for a youthful-looking appearance.','1. Mix the Mummy Pack Powder and the Activator with the brush provided.\r\n2. Apply to the entire face area, wash off after 10-15 minutes.','produits/IMG_20231123_223001_(540_x_720_pixel)_36057.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_223001_(540_x_720_pixel)_36057.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_223020_(540_x_720_pixel)_87298.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_223201_(540_x_720_pixel)_57356.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_223213_(540_x_720_pixel)_43186.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3672,'SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Boosting Toner',NULL,135.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Tone Brightening Boosting Toner is a watery, hydrating toner that sinks in deeply to provide soft, bright and supple skin. Patented ingredient MadeWhite™ extracted from Madagascan Centella Asiatica provides skin brightening benefits, while extracts of Papaya and Apple gently remove dead skin cells. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 210ml','Apply an appropriate amount to either a cotton pad or directly to the palm and gently pat onto the skin.','produits/IMG_20231123_231656_(540_x_720_pixel)_82627.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231123_231656_(540_x_720_pixel)_82627.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_231710_(540_x_720_pixel)_58454.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_231806_(540_x_720_pixel)_98026.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231123_231831_(540_x_720_pixel)_34251.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3673,'K-SECRET Ampoule Kit',NULL,314.000,'Hyaluronic Acid Secret Ampoule is a highly-concentrated serum infused hyaluronic acid to hydrate, plump, soothe and support the skin\'s moisture barrier. This lightweight ampoule absorbs quickly into skin, and is perfect for babes with dry, rough, dehydrated or flaky skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCollagen Boosting Secret Ampoule is an anti-ageing booster that rejuvenates your skin by preventing the formation of wrinkles and reducing their appearance. It target wrinkles, hydrates, soothes irritation and redness, brightens and strengthens skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nReal Vita C Ampoule is a gentle yet effective serum to help restore skin\'s youthful glow and minimise the appearance of hyperpigmentation and wrinkles. It is Formulated to rejuvenate the skin and reduce the look of acne scars/ pigmentation for a clearer skin tone and firmer, healthier skin.','Use on face','produits/IMG_20231126_142232_(540_x_720_pixel)_28401.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231126_142232_(540_x_720_pixel)_28401.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231126_142122_(540_x_720_pixel)_63768.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231126_142206_(540_x_720_pixel)_47611.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231126_142212_(540_x_720_pixel)_53730.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3674,'Victoria\'s Secret Cucumber and Green Tea Cream Body Wash with Shea Butter',NULL,65.000,'A new kind of daily body ritual. Moisturize as you cleanse with this creamy Shea Butter-infused formula.;Skin feels more hydrated after just one;wash. Part of the;Natural Beauty Body Care Collection, inspired by nature for soft, healthy skin.;Artisanal scent pairings to suit every need.;Luxurious, efficacious formulas.;Botanical inspiration, daily transformation. To maximize your scent benefit, pair with matching Natural Beauty Fragrance Mist, Body Lotion, Exfoliating Body Scrub and Hydrating Body Lotion. 236ml/8 fl oz Domestic.','Hdujd',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3675,'Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner',NULL,111.000,'The ANUA Heartleaf 77% Soothing Toner is the top ranking toner in Korea that was awarded 1st place in the 2022 Olive Young awards. With a high 77%\r\nconcentration of Heartleaf Extract, the hottest ingredient in Korea, it helps to calm irritations, alleviate acne, balance natural oil and moisture levels, as well as deeply hydrate with Panthenol. The toner also gently exfoliates dead skin cells of the skin with Sugarcane Extract or a smoother complexion and trengthens the skin barrier with\r\nCentella Asiatica. Perfect for healing overall redness, acne, eczema and rosacea.\r\nThis toner has a non-comedogenic formula perfect for acne-prone and sensitive skin types. However, this vegan and paraben-free toner is suitable for all skin types!','After cleansing, apply a moderate amount over the face and pat lightly for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20231208_212334_(540_x_720_pixel)_94682.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231208_212334_(540_x_720_pixel)_94682.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231208_212346_(540_x_720_pixel)_77223.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231208_212432_(540_x_720_pixel)_58932.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231208_212441_(540_x_720_pixel)_49829.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231208_212503_(540_x_720_pixel)_79004.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3676,'Heartleaf 77% Soothing Sheet Mask',NULL,25.000,'Derived from microfiber material, Heartleaf 77% soothing sheet mask moisturizes and soothes skin with mild ingredients like heartleaf extract.\r\n\r\nIt maximizes skin’s moisture retention and prevents damage from external irritation.\r\n\r\nHeartleaf extract (houttuynia cordata) is a mild ingredient that soothes the skin and helps prevent problems like excessive sebum, inflammation, and aging. Anua only use heartleaf ingredients grown and harvested in Korea.\r\nOur microfiber sheets are light and soft while tightly seal to your face, allowing skin to absorb the product in short amount of time.\r\nWithout any irritating substance, skin feels clarified, skin tone appears even, and feels hydrated regardless of skin type.','After cleansing, place the mask sheet on the face avoiding lip and eye areas and leave on for 15-20 minutes.\r\n\r\nOur microfiber mask is light and soft on the skin, which could be used as daily skincare routine.\r\n\r\nYou may apply the excess product in the face mask bag all over your face and skin.','produits/IMG_20231208_213425_(540_x_720_pixel)_89620.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231208_213425_(540_x_720_pixel)_89620.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231208_213441_(540_x_720_pixel)_62128.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231208_213449_(540_x_720_pixel)_85580.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231208_213535_(540_x_720_pixel)_60021.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3677,'Pore Clearing Calming Clay Mask',NULL,130.000,'A calming clay mask formulated with a gentle duo of AHA and PHA, to help promote softer, smoother skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nInfused with the soothing benefits of madecassoside and hydrating Jeju carbonated spring water, this creamy clay mask is mild enough for daily-use, even suitable for sensitive skin!\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: All skin types, including sensitive skin','After cleansing, apply onto a dry face (either focusing on the T-zone, or whole of the face), avoiding the eye and lip area. Wait 3-5 minutes before rinsing off with lukewarm water, using gentle circular motions for a skin-softening effect. Follow with your usual skincare routine.\r\n\r\nThis gentle formula is suitable for daily-use and on all skin types, including those with troubled and/or sensitive skin.','produits/IMG_20231213_011202_(540_x_720_pixel)_99048.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231213_011202_(540_x_720_pixel)_99048.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231213_011217_(540_x_720_pixel)_76230.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231213_011228_(540_x_720_pixel)_22783.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231213_011253_(540_x_720_pixel)_90614.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3678,'Laneige - Lip Sleeping Mask [Berry]',NULL,130.000,'Laneige\'s best-selling Lip Sleeping Mask EX (Berry) returns with an upgraded formulation that helps dissolve dead skin cells, moisturise, smooth and plump your lips overnight. The sweet and fruity scent of this berry mask is relaxing, and will remind you of real berries. Laneige\'s Moisture Wrap™ technology features a hyaluronic acid network that forms a moisturising film to lock in active ingredients and retain moisture through the night. Berry Mix Complex™, which is rich in antioxidants and Vitamin C also helps exfoliate dead skin cells for smoother lips. The nourishing combination of Coconut Oil, Shea Butter and Murumuru Seed Butter work together to deliver lasting hydration and moisture while you sleep!','Apply generously and leave on overnight.\r\nGently wipe off residue the next morning.','produits/IMG_20231213_013825_(540_x_720_pixel)_74722.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231213_013825_(540_x_720_pixel)_74722.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231213_013834_(540_x_720_pixel)_16782.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231213_013847_(540_x_720_pixel)_31658.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231213_013900_(540_x_720_pixel)_71777.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3679,'Apricot Blossom Peeling Gel',NULL,111.000,'This is a gommage type exfoliator, enriched with 19% Prunus Mume Flower Water and 8% plant-based Cellulose. It aims to alleviate skin concerns linked to uneven texture and excessive sebum production. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nGommage texture <br>\r\nThis product minimizes skin discomfort with its gommage texture. Massaging the plant-derived cellulose onto your skin delicately sloughs away dead skin cells and other impurities. It is versatile enough for both face and body use. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nMoisturization <br>\r\nEnriched with 19% prunus mume water and 8% plant-derived cellulose, this formula helps make the skin texture soft and leaves your skin feeling intensely hydrated. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nKey ingredients <br>\r\n<br>\r\nPrunus mume flower water 19% <br>\r\nPrunus mume flower, the plum blossom, contains polyphenols and flavonoids to help make the skin clear and moist. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nPlant-derived cellulose 8%\r\nThe cellulose extracted from cotton gently exfoliates dead skin cells and impurities in the process of clumping in a circular shape on the skin.','Apply an appropriate amount to cleansed face.\r\nMassage product into skin to remove dead skin and dirt. Avoid the eye and mouth area.\r\nRinse off with lukewarm water.\r\nUse 1-2x a week.','produits/IMG_20231224_163218_(540_x_720_pixel)_99214.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231224_163218_(540_x_720_pixel)_99214.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_163450_(540_x_720_pixel)_75565.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_163238_(540_x_720_pixel)_26390.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_163326_(540_x_720_pixel)_49823.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3680,'Centella Ampoule',NULL,136.000,'The SKIN1004 Madagascar Centella Ampoule helps to rejuvenate skin thanks to its soothing and softening properties. Formulated with 100% of high-quality Centella Asiatica Extract, this deeply nourishing ampoule provides the skin with hydration, helps to balance oil levels and leaves skin feeling smooth and supple all day long.','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20231224_165252_(540_x_720_pixel)_69579.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231224_165252_(540_x_720_pixel)_69579.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_165922_(540_x_720_pixel)_15931.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_165515_(540_x_720_pixel)_35689.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_165527_(540_x_720_pixel)_66074.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3681,'Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil',NULL,111.000,'The Anua Heartleaf Pore Control Cleansing Oil is a gentle, non-comedogenic formula that effectively rids skin of impurities while leaving a refreshed and hydrated finish. Featuring mild plant-based oils (including Jojoba, Olive Fruit and Grape Seed oils) and Heartleaf extract, this lightweight cleanser safely removes blackheads, makeup and sebum without clogging pores.\r\n\r\nSuitable on all skin types, even for acne-prone skin.','Take an appropriate amount of oil onto dry hands.\r\n\r\n2. Gently massage dry face, focusing on areas with clogged pores.\r\n\r\n3. Add a little water to emulsify while massaging.\r\n\r\n4. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20231224_171607_(540_x_720_pixel)_81366.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231224_171607_(540_x_720_pixel)_81366.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_171642_(540_x_720_pixel)_40434.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_193036_(540_x_720_pixel)_91427.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_193046_(540_x_720_pixel)_97478.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3682,'Heartleaf Quercetinol Pore Deep Cleansing Foam',NULL,119.000,'The Anua Heartleaf Quercetinol Pore Deep Cleansing Foam gently exfoliates skin and unclogs pores for a deep cleanse. Formulated with finely ground Heartleaf Powder to soothe redness and breakouts, together with Quercetinol, extracted from Heartleaf, to calm inflammation and sensitive skin. The grainy formula is also infused with patented Anti-Sebum P to get rid of excess sebum, while Salicylic Acid provides pore care and anti-acne benefits.\r\n\r\nRecommended for oily to combination skin types, including acne-prone skin.','Take an appropriate amount and lather up. Massage the whole face gently and rinse off thoroughly.','produits/IMG_20231224_194201_(540_x_720_pixel)_19440.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231224_194201_(540_x_720_pixel)_19440.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_194217_(540_x_720_pixel)_90717.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_194232_(540_x_720_pixel)_27455.png\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_194341_(540_x_720_pixel)_90681.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3683,'COSRX ACNE HERO KIT MILD (4-STEP)',NULL,150.000,'The COSRX Acne Hero Kit Mild 4-Step is perfect for combination skin with occasional acne or breakouts. This kit contains: <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCOSRX AC Collection Calming Foam Cleanser (20ml): <br>\r\nA gentle daily foam cleanser to freshen and moisturise skin while fighting acne breakouts. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCOSRX AC Collection Calming Liquid Mild (30ml): <br>\r\nA refreshing toner that helps calm acne and reduce redness or skin irritation. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCOSRX AC Collection Ultimate Spot Cream (5g): <br>\r\nAn intensive spot treatment to help soothe and reduce blemishes. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCOSRX AC Collection Lightweight Soothing Moisturizer (20ml): <br>\r\nA lightweight, non-greasy moisturiser to hydrate and soothe acne-prone skin.','AC Collection Calming Foam Cleanser\r\n\r\nSqueeze a proper amount onto your hand.\r\nGently foam up and massage on wet skin.\r\nRinse with water.\r\nAC Collection Calming Liquid Mild\r\n\r\nSoak the cotton pads and gently sweep over face avoiding the eye area.\r\nGently pat to help with absorption.\r\nAC Collection Ultimate Spot Cream\r\n\r\nRemove white taping of the lid.\r\nTurn the lid tightly to the right to poke a hole on the tip of the tube.\r\nSqueeze the tube to use. Apply an appropriate amount to the affected areas.\r\nAC Collection Lightweight Soothing Moisturizer\r\n\r\nApply a proper amount evenly onto face and pat it gently for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20231224_210240_(540_x_720_pixel)_81498.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20231224_210240_(540_x_720_pixel)_81498.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_210420_(540_x_720_pixel)_88358.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_210719_(540_x_720_pixel)_97227.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20231224_210825_(540_x_720_pixel)_68959.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3684,'Retinol 0.1 Duo',NULL,275.000,'This serum is infused with retinol, retinal and bakuchiol to boost skin elasticity and reduce signs of aging. It is created with patented elastic-liposome technology to deliver active ingredients deep into skin. The gentle formula gives a non-sticky, moisturizing finish without any irritation. Recommended for sensitive skin. \r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n- this serum helps reduce signs of aging with its mild formula for sensitive skin. <br>\r\n- contains retinol, retinal and bakuchiol to help boost skin elasticity with low irritation. <br>\r\n- utilize patented technology of elastic-liposome to deliver active ingredients into the deep skin layer. <br>\r\n- gives a non-sticky and moisturizing finish. <br>\r\n- completed skin irritation testing and passed the vegan test. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nRetinol Intense Advanced Triple Action Eye Cream is an anti-ageing eye cream to help improve dark circles and fine lines, with visible results in just two weeks. The star ingredients, Retinal and Retinol prevent and improve the look of wrinkles, while Niacinamide helps with dark circles while preventing pigmentation and providing brightening care. Panthenol and Hyaluronic acid are also present to keep skin hydrated, while Truecica™, Glacial water and Water Lily gives a soothing and refreshing finish. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nCan also be used on other areas such as forehead, lips or neck where you might have any concerns with loose or sagging skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSuitable for all skin types.','Poi','produits/IMG_20240102_092213_(540_x_720_pixel)_40097.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240102_092213_(540_x_720_pixel)_40097.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_092223_(540_x_720_pixel)_90997.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_092405_(540_x_720_pixel)_97573.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_092236_(540_x_720_pixel)_91051.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_092414_(540_x_720_pixel)_76670.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3685,'SEOUL 1988 Serum : Retinal Liposome 2% + Black Ginseng',NULL,104.000,'❅ An anti-aging serum enriched with 2% Rentinal liposome and Black ginseng to promote a youthful, radiant complexion, while addressing skin texture, hydration, and the reduction of wrinkles. <br>\r\n❅ Retinal liposome helps to prevent skin aging, such as fine lines, wrinkles, uneven skin tone and skin texture. <br>\r\n❅ Black ginseng extract offers antioxidant benefits for skin protection. <br>\r\n❅ Free of common allergens, harsh alchohols, fragrances, oils, parabens, sulfates, silicones, and artificial colors. <br>\r\n❅ Wrinkle care in smooth texture with quick absorption. <br>\r\n❅ Dermatologist tested for skin irritation. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin Type: Normal, Combination, Oily <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 30 ml\r\n','After cleansing and toning before bed, apply a pea-sized amount to the skin as part of your nighttime skincare routine.\r\n2. Gently massage the entire face until fully absorbed, then apply a moisturizer for optimal skin hydration and nourishment.','produits/IMG_20240102_091026_(540_x_720_pixel)_85667.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240102_091026_(540_x_720_pixel)_85667.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_091042_(540_x_720_pixel)_47730.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_091110_(540_x_720_pixel)_29360.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_091053_(540_x_720_pixel)_14470.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3686,'SEOUL 1988 Essence: Snail Mucin 97% +Rice',NULL,120.000,'❅ A skin repairing essence enriched with 97% snail mucin and rice to enhance skin texture and achieve achieve a brighter, more radiant complexion. <br>\r\n❅ Contains snail secretion filtrate, known for its skin-texturing, soothing, and hydrating properties, as well as its ability to promote skin brightening and elasticity. <br>\r\n❅ Formulated with rice ferment filtrate, a powerful ingredient that helps brighten and improve skin texture, while providing deep hydration for a radiant and smoother complexion. <br>\r\n❅ Lightweight hydration with quick absorption. <br>\r\n❅ Dermatologist tested for skin irritation. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 100 ml\r\n','After cleansing and toning, apply a moderate amount of the essence on entire face and neck.\r\n2. Gently pat until fully absorbed into the skin.','produits/IMG_20240731_090816_(540_x_720_pixel)_51955.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240731_090816_(540_x_720_pixel)_51955.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090851_(540_x_720_pixel)_81561.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090925_(540_x_720_pixel)_89439.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090955_(540_x_720_pixel)_33077.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3687,'Dear Klairs - Skincare Trial Kit',NULL,150.000,'Testing? Traveling? Want to try bestsellers?\r\n\r\nOur skincare trial kit will have your skin sorted in a flash. This trial kit is recommended to those meeting Dear, Klairs for the first time. As a product where you can try a mild and moisturizing skincare routine with a cleanser duo, toner, and moisturizer, you can enjoy high-quality skincare from cleansing to moisturizing. The kit consists of products that can be used regardless of gender and skin type.','Dispense an appropriate amount of cleansing oil on dry palms and cleanse the skin by gently massaging in a rolling motion. Then Rinse off with warm water.\r\n2) Then dispense an appropriate amount of the gentle black facial cleanser onto wet palms.\r\n3) Lather the foam by rubbing in circular motions then thoroughly cleanse your face. Rinse with lukewarm water.\r\n4) Gently pat the toner on a dry face using the heat of the palm to promote full absorption.\r\n5) Lock in the nutrients with this soothing cream.','produits/IMG_20240102_163659_(540_x_720_pixel)_41752.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240102_163659_(540_x_720_pixel)_41752.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_163709_(540_x_720_pixel)_99421.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_163757_(540_x_720_pixel)_75146.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_163850_(540_x_720_pixel)_50604.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3688,'Jelly Ko Gelato Glaze Lip Mask',NULL,75.000,'Are You Ready for This Jelly? Say hello to Jelly Ko Gelato Glaze Lip Mask! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nGet your glaze on with our deliciously hydrating lip mask. Lysine and 8 essential amino acids support healthy skin, while decadent oils and butter give your lips a plump sheen. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nFor best results, Gelato Glaze can be used: <br>\r\n1- to hydrate, plump and smooth lips <br>\r\n2- before makeup to ensure makeup glides on<br>\r\n3- mixed in with your favourite colour cosmetics to create a sheer, glossy look in multiple colours; <br>\r\n4- instead of lipstick - your lips, but better! <br>\r\n5- overnight as a lip sleeping mask.  ','Apply on lips','produits/IMG_20240102_165519_(540_x_720_pixel)_73566.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240102_165519_(540_x_720_pixel)_73566.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_165537_(540_x_720_pixel)_50757.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_165556_(540_x_720_pixel)_10996.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_165608_(540_x_720_pixel)_91619.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:03:41',0,NULL),(3689,'COMMONLABS - Vitamin C Brightening Sun Serum',NULL,130.000,'✓ A revolutionary multi-sun serum that offers simultaneous UV protection and care for blemishes, containing various Vitamin-related Extracts and pure vitamin C. <br>\r\n✓ Provides a light and refreshing finish without stickiness, similar to a basic serum, and once absorbed into the skin, it leaves it moisturized with a subtle, radiant glow. <br>\r\n✓ Mild formula that has completed a skin irritation test, ensuring safe use for even sensitive and delicate skin.','Apply evenly to areas prone to sun exposure as the final step in your skincare routine.','produits/IMG_20240102_171626_(540_x_720_pixel)_39977.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240102_171626_(540_x_720_pixel)_39977.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_171634_(540_x_720_pixel)_60426.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_171652_(540_x_720_pixel)_81643.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240102_171708_(540_x_720_pixel)_21595.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:41','2025-03-01 21:0