ly designed for sensitive skin. It is enriched with beta-glucan, jojoba oil and ceramides that work to strengthen the skin\'s protective barrier, strengthen dry and irritated skin, and at the same time improve the skin\'s natural cell-building capacity. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nRecommended for all skin types, especially for sensitive skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSize: 80 ml','Apply after washing all over the face and neck, either alone or after toner and serum.','produits/IMG_20240212_084044_(540_x_720_pixel)_88321.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240212_084044_(540_x_720_pixel)_88321.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240212_083758_(540_x_720_pixel)_63774.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240212_083810_(540_x_720_pixel)_13745.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240212_084132_(540_x_720_pixel)_45962.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3734,'Hydrating Lip Balm (Panda) - We Bare Bears Collection',NULL,45.000,'This super-rich balm penetrates & seals in moisture to give extreme hydration for extremely dry & chapped lips.','Put on lips','produits/IMG_20240216_234738_(540_x_720_pixel)_38483.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240216_234738_(540_x_720_pixel)_38483.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240216_234849_(540_x_720_pixel)_89713.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240216_234911_(540_x_720_pixel)_93456.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240216_234923_(540_x_720_pixel)_15545.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3735,'Nourishing Hydrating Lip Mask (Honey)',NULL,45.000,'A symphony of hydration for lips! This lip balm features a honey lip balm to moisturize and a honey lip mask to lock in hydration. Lock in nourishment with the leave-on honey lip mask to restore and condition lips overnight. It moisturizes extra-dry lips and repairs the look of damaged lips overnight. In the morning, apply honey lip balm to intensely nourish your pout for a visibly healthier look.','Put on lips','produits/IMG_20240216_235640_(540_x_720_pixel)_65635.jpg',NULL,10,NU