,0,NULL),(3739,'Shining Watery Lip Gloss (Strawberry Glaze)',NULL,45.000,'High shine pearlescent lip gloss, the candy color brings you back to childhood! Can be used directly on skin or apply a coat on lip stick to make cute and charming lips! Nourishing and hydrating.','Put on lips','produits/IMG_20240217_004800_(540_x_720_pixel)_24196.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240217_004800_(540_x_720_pixel)_24196.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240217_004814_(540_x_720_pixel)_41958.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240217_004822_(540_x_720_pixel)_45128.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240217_004828_(540_x_720_pixel)_55831.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3740,'Cucumber Portable Peel Off Mask',NULL,15.000,'The Cucumber Peel-Off Mask offers a range of benefits for your skin. Cucumbers are known for their cooling and hydrating properties, helping to soothe and rejuvenate your skin. The mask helps to tighten pores, leaving your skin looking refreshed and revitalized. It also helps to remove impurities and excess oil, promoting a clearer complexion and smoother skin texture.\r\nIndulge in the soothing and hydrating properties of our Cucumber Peel-Off Mask. Formulated with the essence of fresh cucumbers, this mask is designed to address your health concerns while providing numerous benefits for your skin.','1. After washing your face, apply the mask evenly, keep away from eyes, brows and mouth area. 2. Wait about 20-30 minutes till the mask get totally dry (not sticky when you touch it). 3. Pull the mask off from chin up, then rinse your face with water.',NULL,NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3741,'Black Charcoal Portable Peel Off Mask',NULL,15.000,'A charcoal peel-off mask that extracts skin impurities and tighten pores for deep clean, polished skin. Charcoal Extract is a supreme ingredient that naturally attracts impurities and excess oil, and effortlessly rids them from skin.','1. After washing your face, apply the mask evenly, keep away from eyes, brows and mouth area. 2. Wait about 20-30 minutes till the mask get totally dry (not sticky when you touch it). 3. Pull the mask off from chin up, then rinse your face with water.',NULL,NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3742,'Scalp Massager Shampoo Brush',NULL,45.000,'It was created as a game changer for shampooing, which perfectly replaces the finger operation and allows you to enjoy the head spa during the hair and scalp cleansing process.\r\n100% Food-grade Silicone Teeth: Really hygienic and safe. Gentle spikes effectively scrub the scalp without scratching, which are flexible enough to move through the hair without tangling or pulling. Tourmaline contained activates cells and increases blood flow.\r\nErgonomic Design: The mouse-like handle fits your palm perfectly, non-slip grooves ensure a stable grip even in the shower. The concave brush surface formed by 25 tips fits the scalp for maximum working area.\r\nSimple Hair &amp; Scalp Care Routine: In daily hair washing, it thoroughly removes the flakes and build-up from the scalp and spreads hair care products deeply, leaving your hair cleaner and fresher. Gentle massage on dry or wet hair to invigorate your scalp. It helps in removing dandruff and promote hair growth.','Use on hair',NULL,NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3743,'Sparkling Star Series High Elasticity Shampoo Brush',NULL,45.000,'This shampoo brush is suitable for all hair types and can be used with your favorite shampoo or conditioner to thoroughly cleanse and revitalize your scalp while providing a relaxing and enjoyable experience.','On hair',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3744,'Michael Kors Mirella Medium Tote Bag',NULL,1485.000,'Crafted from a luxurious blend of cotton and leather, th