,NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240405_162229_(540_x_720_pixel)_35634.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_162309_(540_x_720_pixel)_46776.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_162411_(540_x_720_pixel)_77173.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240405_162423_(540_x_720_pixel)_55889.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3782,'MISSHA M Perfect Cover BB Cream 27 SPF 42 PA+++',NULL,105.000,'Combine skincare and makeup in one easy step for flawless skin with M Perfect Cover BB Cream SPF 42 PA+++. M Perfect is a BB cream that offers medium to high coverage, all while keeping makeup light and providing UV protection with lasting moisture.\r\n\r\nThe lightweight BB cream brightens, evens, soothes, and covers discoloration and imperfections of the skin. Recommended for all skin types.\r\n\r\nNo.27 Honey beige for medium/tan skin','Prepare your skin using M BB Boomer primer. Pump an appropriate amount of product onto fingertips or a makeup sponge. Gently blend on to skin and layer depending on desired coverage.','produits/IMG_20240406_100412_(540_x_720_pixel)_46391.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240406_100412_(540_x_720_pixel)_46391.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240406_100541_(540_x_720_pixel)_80225.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240406_100558_(540_x_720_pixel)_64200.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240406_100714_(540_x_720_pixel)_96334.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3783,'SKINFOOD - Tomato Jelly Tint Lip #04 Milk Tomato',NULL,38.000,'Lightweight and refreshing lip tint comes in a long-lasting gel formulation that glides on smoothly, leaving the perfect shade of sheer and rosy color on your lips. Tomato extract and rosewater work to nourish and moisturize, helping lips stay soft and supple with a lovely, dewy glow. Tint can be used on its own or applied on top of lipstick to customize your lip color.','Apply a moderate amount to the center of lips and gently spread outwards.','produits/IMG_20240408_100006_(540_x_720_pixel)_98375.jpg',NULL,