tea tree leaf and honeysuckle extracts. Other active ingredients like niacinamide boost skin radiance. Hypoallergenic formula is vegan and reef-friendly.','After basic skincare, apply a thin layer of the sunscreen to your entire face.','produits/IMG_20240421_172021_(540_x_720_pixel)_22968.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240421_172021_(540_x_720_pixel)_22968.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240421_171402_(540_x_720_pixel)_67870.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240421_172452_(540_x_720_pixel)_41813.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240421_171421_(540_x_720_pixel)_14577.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3788,'Torriden - Cellmazing Firming Cream',NULL,125.000,'Torriden CELLMAZING Firming Cream is a rich nourishing cream that cares for skin elasticity and enlarged pores. Featuring Torriden\'s unique 5D Complex Low Molecular Collagen that gives you tighter and smoother skin, while Peptide, Amino Acids, and 10D Hyaluronic Acid ingredients offer effective elasticity care. The firm texture provides moisturising benefits without stickiness. \r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, even sensitive skin, doesn\'t cause irritation or breakouts.\r\n\r\nVolume: 60ml','Apply a generous amount of cream to the areas that need firming including the face and neck.\r\n\r\nTIP: Put a thick layer of the content on your face as sleeping pack or use together with a gel mask for better results of firming care.','produits/IMG_20240422_081812_(540_x_720_pixel)_12557.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240422_081812_(540_x_720_pixel)_12557.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240422_081820_(540_x_720_pixel)_80792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240422_081849_(540_x_720_pixel)_76312.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240422_082007_(540_x_720_pixel)_69949.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3789,'Torriden - DIVE-IN Low Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Serum',NULL,106.000,'Torriden DIVE-IN Low molecule Hyaluronic acid Serum is a serum that deeply moisturizes t