d dark spots. Packed with vitamin C-rich yuja (citron) extract to recharge, brighten and hydrate. Niacinamide, Platolwhite-C, arbutin and glutathione help even out your skin tone, while 4 types of vitamins revitalise and soothe your skin for a fresh and dewy complexion. This sheet mask is also vegan-certified.','1. After cleansing, place the mask on the face correctly, avoiding eye and lip area.\r\n2. Leave on for 10-20 minutes then remove it. Pat gently until the remaining essence is fully absorbed','produits/IMG_20240428_202119_(540_x_720_pixel)_97269.jpg',NULL,3,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240428_202119_(540_x_720_pixel)_97269.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_202133_(540_x_720_pixel)_46570.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_202149_(540_x_720_pixel)_92840.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_202207_(540_x_720_pixel)_41847.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3792,'PERIPERA Ink Mood Glowy Tint #02 Coral Influencer',NULL,54.000,'Get ready to flaunt a long-lasting, watercolor lip tint that adds a dazzling shine to your lips all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint is perfect for creating a glassy lip look while providing a moisturizing effect. You can enjoy a superb color payoff without any sticky after-feel. This multitasking formula is infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, which helps to smooth the texture and relieve dry, chapped lips while adding a stunning hint of color to your lips.','Apply directly on lips with the attached applicator.','produits/IMG_20240428_203746_(540_x_720_pixel)_51544.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240428_203746_(540_x_720_pixel)_51544.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_203801_(540_x_720_pixel)_79641.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_203814_(540_x_720_pixel)_53226.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_203825_(540_x_720_pixel)_58461.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3793,'FOCALLURE - Plumpmax Lip Gloss #13 Garnet',NULL,40.000,'The Plumpmax® Shiny Lip Glosses contain natural ingredients; Coconut extract, Jojoba seed oil, Mint extract, Antioxidants and Vitamin E, and has nourishing and therapeutic effect on the lips, i.e., UVA/UVB defense, long-lasting moisture, repair of damaged cells etc.','To do','produits/IMG_20240428_212141_(540_x_720_pixel)_74887.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240428_212141_(540_x_720_pixel)_74887.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_212226_(540_x_720_pixel)_62092.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_212237_(540_x_720_pixel)_70803.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240428_212539_(540_x_720_pixel)_39251.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3794,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Shampoo',NULL,102.000,'Combat hair loss with this nourishing shampoo formulated with 11 types of peptides to moisturize scalp, cica to soothe irritations as well as menthol for a cooling touch. Also contains PHA to thoroughly remove dead skin cells, impurities and excess sebum from scalp.\r\n\r\nBenefits:\r\nIt can help alleviate hair loss symptoms.\r\nFormulated with 11 types of peptides, provides moisture and nutrients to scalp.\r\nNourishes scalp with Biotin and proteins from bean, wheat and corn, to help achieve healthy hair.\r\nCalms down and offers regenerative effect to irritated scalp with CICA.\r\nContains Menthol to delivers fresh cooling feeling to scalp.\r\nIts dense & rich foam minimises scalp irritation.\r\nInfused with PHA to absorb dead skin cells, impurities and sebum to create a clean scalp environment.','Wet the hair and scalp completely with lukewarm water.\r\n2. Lather up proper amount of shampoo and apply it to hair &amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp;amp; scalp, massage for a while.\r\n3. Rinse off with lukewarm water thoroughly.','produits/IMG_20240430_135410_(540_x_720_pixel)_56405.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240430_135410_(540_x_720_pixel)_56405.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_135446_(540_x_720_pixel)_54229.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_135521_(540_x_720_pixel)_20242.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_135539_(540_x_720_pixel)_43098.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3795,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Treatment',NULL,85.000,'Achieve soft, untangled hair in three minutes with this anti-hair-loss scalp treatment! The product contains cica, peptide and black complex to nourish scalp and prevent hair loss. Formulated without silicone and sulfate ingredients to ensure safety.\r\n\r\nIt can help alleviate hair loss symptoms.\r\nNo silicon nor sulfate are contained, no need to worry about skin-troubles and pore clogging issue.\r\nFormulated with Cica, Peptide and Black Complex to nourish hair, strengthen scalp and hair root to prevent hair loss.\r\nProvides a rich amount of moisture and nutrients to hair roots and hair to create a shiny-glowing hair without any tangles.','1. Wet the hair and scalp with lukewarm water.\r\n2. Apply a proper amount and massage all over the scalp and hair.\r\n3. Rinse off with lukewarm water after 2-3 minutes.','produits/IMG_20240430_151857_(540_x_720_pixel)_16154.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240430_151857_(540_x_720_pixel)_16154.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_151907_(540_x_720_pixel)_93229.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_151928_(540_x_720_pixel)_75460.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240430_152024_(540_x_720_pixel)_28670.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3796,'Green Plum Refreshing Cleanser',NULL,91.000,'Green Plum Refreshing Cleanser is a low-pH gel-type cleanser containing oriental herbal ingredients to protect your skin natural skin barrier while cleansing. Green plum water helps keep the skin moist and gently exfoliates dead skin cells, while mungbean strengthens the skin barrier to help maintain healthy skin. Rice bran is also present to help brighten dull skin, while soothing any sensitivities.','Apply an appropriate amount of water to your wet hands and gently massage your face. Wash it off with lukewarm water','produits/IMG_20240503_115037_(540_x_720_pixel)_46971.jpg',NULL,107,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_115037_(540_x_720_pixel)_46971.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_115103_(540_x_720_pixel)_72606.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_115121_(540_x_720_pixel)_47173.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_115505_(540_x_720_pixel)_84680.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3797,'The Vitamin C 13 Serum',NULL,125.000,'Use everyday like a daily vitamin for your skin! \r\n\r\nA gentle vitamin C serum that is suitable on sensitive skin to use daily! Regular use will fade blemishes, dark spots and freckles and improve overall tone.\r\n\r\nBENEFITS\r\n\r\n\r\n• Daily brightening care\r\n• Fades blemishies, dark spots and freckles\r\n• Improves overall tone\r\n• Refines skin texture\r\n• Reduces size of pores\r\n\r\n\r\nTARGETS\r\n\r\n\r\n• those that want to use vitamin c everyday\r\n• uneven skin tone  \r\n• Dark spots, pigmentation and freckles\r\n• Fine lines and wrinkles\r\n• Rough skin texture','Cleanse your skin and put a toner. Then apply few drops of serum to the skin. User fingertips to gently massage and absorb the serum, starting from the inside of the face working towards the edges','produits/IMG_20240503_152103_(540_x_720_pixel)_29725.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_152103_(540_x_720_pixel)_29725.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152119_(540_x_720_pixel)_74846.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152137_(540_x_720_pixel)_56433.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152153_(540_x_720_pixel)_95339.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152146_(540_x_720_pixel)_35700.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3798,'Dynasty Cream',NULL,119.000,'Dynasty Cream is a brightening and anti-ageing cream made with natural hanbang (traditional Korean herbal medicine) ingredients for a healthier complexion. This newly reformulated formula contains revitalising ginseng and brightening rice water to help firm, smooth and moisturise the skin, while honey extract, squalane and ceramide strengthen and protect the skin barrier.','Apply proper amount of this cream on your face at the last stage of your skincare routine. Pat with your fingers to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240503_152816_(540_x_720_pixel)_20555.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_152816_(540_x_720_pixel)_20555.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152822_(540_x_720_pixel)_44301.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152837_(540_x_720_pixel)_36474.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_152856_(540_x_720_pixel)_56558.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3799,'Light On Serum : Centella + Vita C',NULL,130.000,'Light On Serum Centella + Vita C is a gentle brightening serum to help with uneven skin tone and reduce the appearance of dark spots, blemishes and pigmentation. Enriched with 10% 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, a Vitamin C derivative with high stability and low irritation, to deliver brightening benefits and even skin tone, while 68% Centella Asiatica Extract soothe skin from daily irritation and external aggressors while providing intensive moisture to keep skin hydrated. This cream has a lightweight and refreshing texture that absorbs into skin without any greasiness or stickiness. Comes in an airless pump container to maintain the efficacy of the product and increase its stability.','Pump an appropriate amount of serum and apply it evenly over the entire treatment area after smoothing out the skin texture with toner.','produits/IMG_20240503_154144_(540_x_720_pixel)_44571.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_154144_(540_x_720_pixel)_44571.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_154150_(540_x_720_pixel)_35032.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_154255_(540_x_720_pixel)_76168.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_154309_(540_x_720_pixel)_14312.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3800,'Centella Ampoule',NULL,102.000,'Centella Ampoule is a lightweight soothing ampoule that helps hydrate, calm and restore imbalance in the skin. Infused with 100% Centella Asiatica extract from Madagascar to repair damaged skin while regulating its water-oil balance.\r\n\r\nVolume: 55 ml','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20240503_155614_(540_x_720_pixel)_17060.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_155614_(540_x_720_pixel)_17060.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_155702_(540_x_720_pixel)_32420.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_155626_(540_x_720_pixel)_37925.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_155719_(540_x_720_pixel)_20202.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3801,'AXIS-Y - Cera Heart My Type Duo Cream',NULL,111.000,'Use the blue gel-cream on the oily T-zone and apply the white cream to the rest of the face and neck. The blue, light moisturizing cream can also be used in the morning and the white, nourishing cream in the evening.','The Axis-y Cera-Heart My Type Duo Cream is a face cream specially designed for the changing moisture needs of the skin and gives it a healthy, well-groomed glow. Ideal for combination skin: Use the blue gel-like cream on the oily T-zone and the white cream on the rest of the face. The lighter gel cream can also be used in the morning and the nourishing cream in the evening. Blue provides a noticeable hydration boost with glycerin, hyaluronic acid, centella asiatica and postbiotics. White, on the other hand, provides nourishing care and strengthens the skin barrier with ceramides, shea butter and macadamia oil. Never have to decide again - with the Duo Creme your skin has everything it needs!','produits/IMG_20240503_160207_(540_x_720_pixel)_59961.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_160207_(540_x_720_pixel)_59961.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_160213_(540_x_720_pixel)_17789.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_160227_(540_x_720_pixel)_51995.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_160319_(540_x_720_pixel)_47329.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3802,'AXIS-Y - Mugwort Pore Clarifying Wash Off Pack',NULL,102.000,'The AXIS-Y Mugwort Pore Clarifying Wash Off Pack has a base of 61% Mugwort extract to clear impurities in the pores, soothe inflamed and irritated skin, and gently exfoliate dead skin to reveal a bright and healthy complexion.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types. Perfect for calming \"maskne\" or acne caused by wearing masks!\r\n\r\nsize: 100ml','Use the provided spatula to scoop an adequate amount onto a clean, dry face.\r\n2. Apply an even layer to face, avoiding the immediate eye area and mouth.\r\n3. Allow to dry and harden for approximately 15 minutes and rinse off with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240503_161728_(540_x_720_pixel)_67231.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_161728_(540_x_720_pixel)_67231.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_161746_(540_x_720_pixel)_22091.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_161841_(540_x_720_pixel)_21410.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_161852_(540_x_720_pixel)_56295.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3803,'AXIS-Y - PHA Resurfacing Glow Peel',NULL,130.000,'The PHA Resurfacing Glow Peel by AXIS-Y cleanses deep into the pores and gently exfoliates the skin to restore radiance. With extracts from five different fruits and vegetables, the peel clears the skin right from the first application. Extracts obtained from cucumber, papaya and Centella asiatica provide valuable nutrients to make tired or dull skin glow again. The peel has the advantage that further care products can be absorbed more easily.\r\n\r\nThe peel can be used as accompanying care for acne.','After cleansing, apply a thick, even layer to dry skin.\r\nLeave it on for 10 - 15 minutes.\r\nThen rinse with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240503_162826_(540_x_720_pixel)_85904.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_162826_(540_x_720_pixel)_85904.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_162618_(540_x_720_pixel)_27696.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_162604_(540_x_720_pixel)_19293.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_162935_(540_x_720_pixel)_30172.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3804,'AXIS-Y - Daily Purifying Treatment Toner',NULL,105.000,'Refreshing facial toner with exfoliating properties.\r\n\r\nThe Daily Purifying Treatment Toner by AXIS-Y ensures the thorough removal of dirt and impurities that have settled deep in the pores. The skin remains balanced and is even gently exfoliated thanks AHA and PHA. Dead skin cells and layers of sebum dissolve, making your complexion look visibly clearer and more even. Centella asiatica, which has moisturising and regenerating properties, is also included. The toner is perfect for oily and blemish-prone skin and can be used as an accompanying treatment for acne.','After cleansing, sprinkle the toner on a cotton pad.\r\nThen gently rub the soaked cotton pad over the face, avoiding the eye area and areas affected by skin irritation.','produits/IMG_20240503_163453_(540_x_720_pixel)_26585.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_163453_(540_x_720_pixel)_26585.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_163501_(540_x_720_pixel)_29516.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_163511_(540_x_720_pixel)_20532.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_163613_(540_x_720_pixel)_16699.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3805,'ma:nyo - Pure Cleansing Oil',NULL,132.000,'Are you looking for a way to give your skin a gentle yet thorough cleanse? The ma:nyo Pure Cleansing Oil deep cleansing oil has an amazing texture which makes makeup and impurities melt away while restoring the natural moisture levels and pH balance of your skin. It also removes blackheads and whiteheads without clogging your pores. \r\n\r\nCharacteristics:\r\n\r\nmakes blackheads melt away and unclogs pores\r\neliminates makeup and impurities\r\nremoves 99.74% of pollution and dust from the surface of the skin \r\nrebalances the pH level\r\nnourishes the skin\r\nsuitable for all skin types, including acne-prone skin','Use circular motions to massage the ma:nyo Pure cleansing oil gently into the skin until all makeup and impurities are removed. Continue with circular motions around your nose and other areas where blackheads are visible. Add water and massage until the oil turns milky, then rinse with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240503_165040_(540_x_720_pixel)_88607.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_165040_(540_x_720_pixel)_88607.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_165020_(540_x_720_pixel)_79840.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_165048_(540_x_720_pixel)_12256.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_165154_(540_x_720_pixel)_20608.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3806,'Kojie San Skin Lightening Kojic Acid Soap',NULL,30.000,'Kojie San original kojic acid lightening soap is a blend of effective whitening ingredients, nourishing coconut oil, and a fresh orange fragrance. Kojic acid was discovered during the processing of rice for Japanese wines. The naturally derived ingredients in this soap have been proven to safely and quickly reveal even skin by reducing the appearance of dark spots, discolouration, and other imperfections.','Lather soap and apply to treatment areas. Leave the soap on for up to 30 seconds. Apply once per day and increase to twice a day if well tolerated. If dryness occurs follow with a moisturizing cream.','produits/IMG_20240503_172725_(540_x_720_pixel)_23185.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_172725_(540_x_720_pixel)_23185.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_173001_(540_x_720_pixel)_93109.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_173033_(540_x_720_pixel)_92017.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_173604_(540_x_720_pixel)_92591.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3807,'Dos Lunas - Whitening, Moisturizing, and Nourishing Spray',NULL,84.000,'Moisturizing and whitening skin tone (waterproof), can be sprayed onto the skin surface, used for sensitive areas, it gives you bright skin and soft and smooth skin.','Shake well before use Apply an appropriate amount of mist on the face and body at a distance of 20 cm from the face, please avoid contact with eyes','produits/IMG_20240503_174519_(540_x_720_pixel)_35263.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240503_174519_(540_x_720_pixel)_35263.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_174532_(540_x_720_pixel)_67440.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_174640_(540_x_720_pixel)_94692.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240503_174659_(540_x_720_pixel)_53733.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3808,'Victoria&rsquo;s Secret Croc Textured Bag Black',NULL,620.000,'New Olive Leather Purse with Matching Coin/Card Wallet 15&quot; long 10&quot; tall 5&quot; wide\r\n\r\n3 inside pockets 1 with zipper\r\n1 outside pocket with zipper','Hbn',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3809,'Victoria\'s Bag AM/PM Beauty Bag Duo',NULL,176.000,'Double the glam. This signature stripe duo fits everything you could ever need. Together or separate, the clear exterior to helps you quickly find what you’re looking for.\r\n\r\nExterior bag fits: Shower and hair essentials\r\nInterior pouch fits: Makeup and more\r\nZip closures on both bags\r\nMeasures: 9.8\"L x 3.3\"D x 6.3\"H\r\nImported nylon & PVC','Hjh',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3810,'VICTORIA\'S SECRET  Velvet Wristlet',NULL,113.000,'The gift of chic. This pouch is the perfect size for all your glam essentials and also wears as a wristlet. In a luxe red velvet finish.\r\n\r\nFits: Eau de Parfum, full-size body care and beauty essentials\r\n9.6”L x 3.3”D x 6.7”H\r\nImported velvet and polyurethane','Hdj',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3811,'VICTORIA\'S SECRET Large Wallet with Zip Orchid Blush',NULL,198.000,'A classic essential. In our signature V-Quilt finish with V-Monogram Hardware, this sleek continental wallet features a wrap-around zip and plenty of interior pockets to keep you organized. \r\n\r\nFits: 12 cards, full length bills, change, cell phone\r\n12 interior card slots\r\n1 zip compartment\r\n2 full length bill pockets\r\n7L x 1W 4H\r\nImported polyurethane','Jfj',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3812,'Victoria Secret ID Wallet Burgundy',NULL,100.000,'Burgundy Woven Front with Gold &amp; Black &quot;V&quot; Logo!\r\nBack has ID Window framed in Burgundy Color.\r\nSnap Opening has Two Credit Card Pockets on Each Side, with a Goldtone Curb Chain &amp; Thick Key Ring! Beautiful!','Hxhe',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3813,'Japanese Cherry Blossom gift set',NULL,250.000,'What it smells like: the fragrance equivalent of your little black dress—beautiful, timeless and beloved.\r\n\r\nFragrance notes: Japanese cherry blossom, Asian pear, fresh mimosa petals, white jasmine and blushing sandalwood.','Xjj',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3814,'Airy Sun Cream SPF 50+ PA++++',NULL,94.000,'Anua Airy Sun Cream is a gentle physical sun cream that protects the skin from UV rays. Formulated with calming ingredients including Centella Asiatica Extract, Houttuynia Cordata Extract, Tea Tree Extract and Artemisia Capillaris Extract to help soothe sensitive and irritated skin. The watery cream texture keeps the skin refreshed and moisturised under sunlight without white cast.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.','Take a moderate amount and apply evenly over the face.','produits/IMG_20240504_145742_(540_x_720_pixel)_18267.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240504_145742_(540_x_720_pixel)_18267.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_145659_(540_x_720_pixel)_54901.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_145823_(540_x_720_pixel)_14144.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_145903_(540_x_720_pixel)_45237.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3815,'Madagascar Centella Tea-Trica Spot Cover Patch',NULL,32.000,'Madagascar Centella Tea-Trica Spot Cover Patch are acne spot patches that improve the healing of pimples to minimizing picking and popping blemishes, which may cause inflammation and scarring. The slim and clear patches are barely noticeable while adhering tightly to the skin, making it suitable for everyday use. Hydrocolloid sheets trap moisture, absorb exudates, and dry out pimples to promote healing without scarring. They also act as barriers to prevent infection and contamination, promoting natural healing without irritation.','Apply to patch over the pimple and press for 2-3 seconds to secure. \r\nRecommended to reapply daily.','produits/IMG_20240504_150506_(540_x_720_pixel)_83904.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240504_150506_(540_x_720_pixel)_83904.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_150528_(540_x_720_pixel)_56909.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_150547_(540_x_720_pixel)_29536.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_150807_(540_x_720_pixel)_47384.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3816,'FOCALLURE - Plumpmax Lip Gloss #04 Apyrite',NULL,38.000,'The Plumpmax® Shiny Lip Glosses contain natural ingredients; Coconut extract, Jojoba seed oil, Mint extract, Antioxidants and Vitamin E, and has nourishing and therapeutic effect on the lips, i.e., UVA/UVB defense, long-lasting moisture, repair of damaged cells etc.','Use the built-in brush head for applying evenly on the lips. Apply it overnight before sleeping as an effective lip care alternative. You can also use it as a lip primer by prepping your lips with it before applying any other lip products. For a glossier lips look, apply it on bare lips or overlay as topcoat over your lipstick for an instant fuller, plumper dewy-glossy finish.','produits/IMG_20240504_163054_(540_x_720_pixel)_36106.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240504_163054_(540_x_720_pixel)_36106.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240504_163126_(540_x_720_pixel)_44566.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240120_002845_(540_x_720_pixel)_21134_90956.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240120_002905_(540_x_720_pixel)_21013_79376.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3817,'I\'M FROM MUGWORT ESSENCE mini',NULL,45.000,'Mugwort Essence is made with 100% concentrated extract of top quality mugwort from Ganghwa County in Korea to calm and soothe irritated, red or troubled skin. Rich in minerals and vitamins, Korean mugwort is known for its ability to restore youthful skin, and its amazing calming and detoxifying properties. The result is soothed skin that feels more refreshed and renewed.\r\n\r\nVolume : 30 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply an adequate amount to the entire face, evenly distributing. For days when your skin is feeling extra dry, soak about 3 cotton pads with the Mugwort Essence and leave the pad on your skin for about 5 minutes.','produits/IMG_20240506_145221_(540_x_720_pixel)_50193.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240506_145221_(540_x_720_pixel)_50193.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240506_145237_(540_x_720_pixel)_77093.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240506_145309_(540_x_720_pixel)_88248.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240506_150547_(540_x_720_pixel)_33462.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3818,'BY WISHTREND - Green Tea &amp;amp; Enzyme Powder Wash',NULL,150.000,'Green Tea &amp;amp; Enzyme Powder Wash is a low-pH cleanser and gentle scrub packed with Green Tea Powder to effectively cleanse, exfoliate and soothe skin. Papain Enzyme, Coconut-derived Surfactant and Baking Soda gently melt away blackheads, impurities and dead skin cells for brighter and smoother skin.\r\n\r\nSuitable for anyone struggling with oiliness or uneven skin texture.','1) Dispense an appropriate amount on wet hands and work into a lather using warm water.\r\n2) Place the foam over the face, cleanse in a gentle massaging motion and rinse off with water.',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3819,'Klairs Supple Preparation Facial Toner',NULL,45.000,'This miniature toner is perfect for travel! This facial toner gives immediate relief to severely dry skin. Its gel-like consistency seeps into skin to hydrate the skin. Consistent use results in more smooth and plump skin. Amino acids help to refresh the skin from any excess dirt and sebum as well as helping to restore the pH of your skin post cleansing.','1) After cleansing, gently pat the toner on dry face using the heat of the palm to promote full absorption.\r\n2) We recommend multiple applications on dry areas.','produits/IMG_20240507_182851_(540_x_720_pixel)_18547.png',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240507_182851_(540_x_720_pixel)_18547.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240507_182907_(540_x_720_pixel)_69139.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240507_182917_(540_x_720_pixel)_63495.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240507_182929_(540_x_720_pixel)_21755.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3820,'Kara Beauty - ROMANCE- LIQUID ROUGE Matte Lipstick',NULL,45.000,'Our matte liquid lipsticks are absolute must-haves. This buildable formula goes a long way and sits comfortably on the lips without creasing or cracking! Now available in a range of both nude and bold shades to suit any skin tone.\r\n\r\nShade bright red','apply this lipstick to your lips','produits/IMG_20240728_125953_(540_x_720_pixel)_60517.jpg',NULL,2,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240728_125953_(540_x_720_pixel)_60517.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240728_130023_(540_x_720_pixel)_43576.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240728_130103_(540_x_720_pixel)_68108.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240728_130110_(540_x_720_pixel)_11526.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3821,'TIRTIR - Mask Fit Red Cushion #21N Ivory',NULL,148.000,'The TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is a high-performance Korean beauty product designed to provide long-lasting coverage and a natural, semi-matte finish. It features a formula that offers up to 72 hours of flawless coverage, effectively concealing blemishes, redness, and dark spots. Enriched with hydrating ingredients like Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract and Propolis Extract, it nourishes and moisturizes the skin while providing SPF40 PA++ protection against UV rays. Its buildable coverage ensures a lightweight feel on the skin, making it suitable for all-day wear and ideal for sensitive skin types. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 18g','Apply a moderate amount of the product using the included puff, tapping it evenly across the entire face.','produits/IMG_20240607_004612_(540_x_720_pixel)_19342.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240607_004612_(540_x_720_pixel)_19342.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_004629_(540_x_720_pixel)_84281.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_004719_(540_x_720_pixel)_24261.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_005302_(540_x_720_pixel)_26931.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3822,'TIRTIR - Mask Fit Red Cushion #23N Sand',NULL,148.000,'The TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is a high-performance Korean beauty product designed to provide long-lasting coverage and a natural, semi-matte finish. It features a formula that offers up to 72 hours of flawless coverage, effectively concealing blemishes, redness, and dark spots. Enriched with hydrating ingredients like Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract and Propolis Extract, it nourishes and moisturizes the skin while providing SPF40 PA++ protection against UV rays. Its buildable coverage ensures a lightweight feel on the skin, making it suitable for all-day wear and ideal for sensitive skin types. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 18g','Apply a moderate amount of the product using the included puff, tapping it evenly across the entire face.','produits/IMG_20240607_004612_(540_x_720_pixel)_63969.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240607_004612_(540_x_720_pixel)_63969.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_004629_(540_x_720_pixel)_97664.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_004719_(540_x_720_pixel)_92173.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240607_005302_(540_x_720_pixel)_66943.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3823,'The 6 Peptide Skin Booster Serum',NULL,136.000,'Cosrx Peptide 6 Serum is a rejuvenating skincare product formulated to target signs of aging and promote a youthful complexion. Enriched with a potent blend of six different peptides, this serum helps to stimulate collagen production, improve skin elasticity, and reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. Its lightweight, fast-absorbing texture makes it suitable for all skin types, providing deep hydration without feeling greasy. Regular use of Cosrx Peptide 6 Serum results in firmer, smoother, and more radiant skin.','After cleansing you may use this serum as the first step of skin care. Spread the serum on the entire face and you may apply several times to amplify the effect of the next serum or ampoule.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3824,'All About Snail Kit',NULL,128.000,'The COSRX All About Snail Kit is a comprehensive four-step skincare regimen designed to rejuvenate and hydrate the skin using the powerful benefits of snail mucin. The kit includes:\r\n\r\n1. **COSRX Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser (20ml / 0.67 fl. oz)**: This gentle gel cleanser effectively removes impurities while preserving the skin natural moisture balance, leaving it clean and refreshed.\r\n2. **COSRX Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence (30ml / 1.01 fl. oz)**: A lightweight essence that deeply hydrates and repairs the skin, promoting a smooth and radiant complexion.\r\n3. **COSRX Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream (5ml / 0.16 fl. oz)**: Formulated for the delicate eye area, this cream targets fine lines, dark circles, and puffiness, providing a youthful and refreshed appearance.\r\n4. **COSRX Advanced Snail 92 All In One Cream (20g / 0.70 oz)**: A rich moisturizer that provides intense hydration, improves skin texture, and helps repair damage for a healthier complexion.\r\n\r\nTogether, these products create a synergistic skincare routine that addresses multiple skin concerns, including cleansing, hydration, repair, and anti-aging.','/STEP 1. Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser/\r\nGently massage the cleanser on wet skin. Rinse thoroughly with tepid water.\r\n\r\n\r\n/STEP 2. Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence/\r\nApply a proper amount evenly, avoiding the eye area.\r\n\r\n\r\n/STEP 3. Advanced Snail Peptide Eye Cream/\r\nApply a proper amount around the eye area. Gently pat with fingertips for fast absorption.\r\n\r\n\r\n/STEP 4. Advanced Snail 92 All In One Cream/\r\nApply a proper amount evenly, avoiding the eye area.',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3825,'Ultra-Light Invisible Sunscreen SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,89.000,'A moisturising sunscreen with SPF50+ PA++++ with an ultra-thin consistency, and a transparent formula that is absorbed quickly without leaving white spots. This weightless, transparent formula is quickly absorbed into the skin, providing a natural finish that complements all skin types and skin tones. Thanks to its unique composition, Ultra-Light Invisible Sunscreen can be effortlessly incorporated into any lifestyle and daily routine, and never feels sticky on the skin. This makes it easy to apply sunscreen as part of your daily skincare routine without discomfort. The combination of the key ingredient of aloe and witch hazel provides effective light and heat therapy. Adds rich moisture to irritated skin and has a mild soothing effect on sensitive skin. Contains the specially formulated ingredient vitamin E and replenishes moisture with Hyaluronic acid to quench the thirst of dehydrated skin.\r\nSmooths wrinkles, provides sun protection and soothes irritated skin with Allantoin to keep your skin healthy.','Use as the final step in your skincare routine every morning. Apply a generous amount to the face 30 minutes before sun exposure for optimal results. Massage well and lightly pat the skin until everything is absorbed. Avoid the eye and mouth area. Reapply throughout the day as needed, especially during prolonged sun exposure.','produits/IMG_20240608_163845_(540_x_720_pixel)_77511.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240608_163845_(540_x_720_pixel)_77511.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_164316_(540_x_720_pixel)_13449.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_164325_(540_x_720_pixel)_82967.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_164412_(540_x_720_pixel)_38295.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3826,'Aloe 54.2 Aqua Tone-up Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++',NULL,94.000,'Aloe 54.2 Aqua Tone-Up Sunscreen is a lightweight sunscreen that protects skin while providing a very natural, tone-up effect. Features 54.2% Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Water to boost moisture and soothe skin irritation and sunburn. Vitamin B12 (Cyanocobalamin) and Vitamin B3 (Niacinamide) help protect and prevent skin damage and barrier disruption, while helping to prevent pigmentation. This cream has a lightweight and non-greasy texture that absorbs quickly into the skin, providing a soft, non-greasy appearance all day. Its pink colour gives the skin a glowing, tone-up effect and goes well under makeup.','Apply generously at least 15 minutes before sun exposure.\r\nReapply at least every 2 hours.\r\n*Can be used alone or under makeup.','produits/IMG_20240608_165050_(540_x_720_pixel)_65769.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240608_165050_(540_x_720_pixel)_65769.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_165102_(540_x_720_pixel)_35002.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_165142_(540_x_720_pixel)_67086.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_165211_(540_x_720_pixel)_81204.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_165218_(540_x_720_pixel)_93888.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3827,'Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Serum',NULL,112.000,'Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Serum is a rejuvenating serum that contains a powerful cocktail of brightening ingredients. Formulated with Galactomyces, Vitamin C and niacinamide, this brightening serum helps fight dullness, hyperpigmentation and uneven skin tone.','After cleansing and toning, apply the serum all over your skin and tap to help with absorption.','produits/IMG_20240608_170519_(540_x_720_pixel)_25047.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240608_170519_(540_x_720_pixel)_25047.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_170607_(540_x_720_pixel)_72529.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_170911_(540_x_720_pixel)_13289.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240608_171114_(540_x_720_pixel)_81952.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3828,'Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule',NULL,150.000,'Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica First Ampoule is a hydrating ampoule that quickly boosts moisture and preps the skin to absorb the next steps of your skincare routine. Formulated with Hyalu-Cica (a unique complex made from Hyaluronic Acid and Centella Asiatica) that calms skin irritation and deeply hydrates skin. Various plant-based ingredients including Damask Rose Water, Pear Extract and Birch Juice provide additional soothing and moisturising benefits. Can be used right after cleansing for optimal results.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types\r\n\r\nVolume : 100ml','Use immediately after cleansing as the first step of your routine. Apply 1-2 drops to the skin and pat to absorb.','produits/IMG_20240610_090142_(540_x_720_pixel)_63623.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240610_090142_(540_x_720_pixel)_63623.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_090202_(540_x_720_pixel)_37397.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_090221_(540_x_720_pixel)_85050.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_090238_(540_x_720_pixel)_82799.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3829,'Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Silky-Fit Sun Stick',NULL,91.000,'Madagascar Centella Hyalu-Cica Silky-Fit Sun Stick is a sun stick that harnesses the moisturising and healing powers of Cica Extract and Hyaluronic Acid to keep skin hydration levels high while providing broad-spectrum sun protection. Also enriched with antioxidant-rich plant-based ingredients to help promote healthy skin. This organic sunscreen stick glides on smoothly for a natural, silky soft finish without a white cast.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nVolume: 20g','As the last step of your skincare routine, apply evenly to areas exposed to UV rays. Reapply every 2-3 hours for more protection.','produits/IMG_20240610_091255_(540_x_720_pixel)_37552.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240610_091255_(540_x_720_pixel)_37552.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_091309_(540_x_720_pixel)_26887.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_091341_(540_x_720_pixel)_33771.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_091352_(540_x_720_pixel)_14649.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3830,'Heartleaf Succinic Moisture Cleansing Foam',NULL,140.000,'Anua Heartleaf Succinic Moisture Cleansing Foam is a gel-type cleanser that gently removes sebum and dead skin cells to keep skin fresh and clear. Formulated with Heartleaf Extract and Protease to soothe breakouts and gently remove dead skin cells for clearer skin. It also contains BHA and Succinic Acid to unclog pores and regulate sebum production. This pH-balanced formula is boosted with Ceramide NP and Panthenol to keep skin moisturised post-cleanse.\r\n\r\nRecommended for sensitive and acne-prone skin.\r\n\r\nVolume: 150ml','Disseminate an appropriate amount on face after lathering up. Massage the whole face gently and off afterwards.','produits/IMG_20240610_093507_(540_x_720_pixel)_48898.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240610_093507_(540_x_720_pixel)_48898.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_093607_(540_x_720_pixel)_91550.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_093641_(540_x_720_pixel)_75358.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240610_093651_(540_x_720_pixel)_47365.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3831,'Teresia - Marine Collagen Brightening Tone-up Cream',NULL,105.000,'Get ready to achieve that bright and youthful glow with Tone Up Cream! Say goodbye to dull and tired-looking skin with this soft cream-type tone-up cream that\'s perfect for creating a natural, healthy-looking complexion.\r\nFormulated with a powerful blend of brightening ingredients like Broussonetia Kazinoki Root Extract, Morus Alba Bark Extract, and Camellia Japonica Leaf Extract, this Korean skincare staple will help you achieve that radiant glow you\'ve been dreaming of. Whether you\'re heading out for a long day of outdoor activities or simply want to keep your skin looking its best, Tone Up Cream has got you covered.\r\nOur collagen-rich formula works to keep your skin looking healthy and youthful, while the added benefits of Niacinamide and Acetyl Glucosamine help to even out your skin tone and reduce the appearance of dark spots.\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Add Tone Up Cream to your daily skincare routine and get ready to say hello to brighter, more toned-up skin!','At the last stage of skin care, take an appropriate amount on your hand, apply it gently to the desired area such as the face and neck, and pat it lightly.',NULL,NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3832,'CLIO - Kill Cover High Glow Cushion Set (+Refill) 03 linen',NULL,156.000,