ildable formula allows for versatile coverage, easily blendable or layerable according to your preferences.','1. Take a moderate amount of product using the included puff.\r\n2. Using gentle tapping motions, apply an even layer to the entire face.','produits/IMG_20240618_184854_(540_x_720_pixel)_58199.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_184854_(540_x_720_pixel)_58199.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_182737_(540_x_720_pixel)_78100.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_182940_(540_x_720_pixel)_76056.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_183113_(540_x_720_pixel)_28016.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3834,'CLIO - Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion SPF50+ PA+++ (Padding Case) 02',NULL,189.000,'CLIO’s cult-favorite Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion now comes in a special edition padding case! The cushion foundation effectively blurs enlarged pores and blemishes for a smooth and even-toned finish. The lightweight yet long-wearing formula adheres well to skin without caking. Comes with a curved puff designed for application on hard-to-reach areas.','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use it after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20240618_205339_(540_x_720_pixel)_10871.jpg',NULL,4,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_205339_(540_x_720_pixel)_10871.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205520_(540_x_720_pixel)_19240.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205531_(540_x_720_pixel)_98369.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205431_(540_x_720_pixel)_70411.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205654_(540_x_720_pixel)_92961.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205713_(540_x_720_pixel)_93087.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_205722_(540_x_720_pixel)_14632.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3835,'TIRTIR - Milk Skin Toner',NULL,130.000,'The TIRTIR Milk Skin Toner is a highly-concentrated milky toner that provides deep, long-lasting hydration for glowing, healthy and radiant skin. Infused with complexion-brightening ingredients such as Rice Bran Extracts and Niacinamide, as well as Cica and Witch Hazel to soothe and hydrate skin.\r\n\r\nDermatologically tested and suitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nSize: 150ml','After cleansing, apply an appropriate amount to the skin and pat in to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240618_221620_(540_x_720_pixel)_43775.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_221620_(540_x_720_pixel)_43775.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_221656_(540_x_720_pixel)_56819.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_221808_(540_x_720_pixel)_82490.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_222037_(540_x_720_pixel)_86098.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3836,'Heartleaf Pore Clay Pack',NULL,105.000,'Anua Heartleaf Pore Clay Pack is a gentle pore-care clay mask formulated with Bentonite and Kaolin to unclog pores and exfoliate skin for a smooth finish. Enriched with Houttuynia Cordata Extract and Quercetin to offer anti-oxidising and anti-inflammatory effects, while reducing redness and restoring skin barrier. Further contains Hyaluronic Acid, Soluble Collagen and Protease to facilitate keratin softening while offering plumping and firming effects. This clay mask has a cream-like texture with a refreshing Eucalyptus scent.\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types.\r\n\r\nSize: 100ml','1. After washing your face, apply the content to the entire face except eye and mouth areas.\r\n2. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water after 3-5 minutes.\r\n3. Use 1-2 times a week depending on your skin condition.','produits/IMG_20240618_223929_(540_x_720_pixel)_27146.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_223929_(540_x_720_pixel)_27146.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_223804_(540_x_720_pixel)_54865.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_224006_(540_x_720_pixel)_46431.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_224030_(540_x_720_pixel)_26248.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3837,'Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint #09 Nude to Heart',NULL,68.000,'Express yourself with a long-lasting, watercolour lip tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth outwards toward corners of mouth.','produits/IMG_20240618_224825_(540_x_720_pixel)_26314.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_224825_(540_x_720_pixel)_26314.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_225002_(540_x_720_pixel)_57326.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_224946_(540_x_720_pixel)_57399.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_225017_(540_x_720_pixel)_70867.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_225013_(540_x_720_pixel)_40042.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3838,'MEDI-PEEL - Peptide 9 Volume All In One Essence Pro',NULL,179.000,'The Pro is a more extensive version than its previous, with more concentrated and effective ingredients to combats signs of aging and reding the appearance of fine lines Easily absorbed by skin with its fine bubble, leaving skin hydrated and firm. Skin irritation test completed, suitable for sensitive skin. make it shorter like before\r\n\r\nAn anti-aging essence with 9 peptides, 4 Hyaluronic Acids, and Lactobacillus Ferment.\r\nCombats signs of aging, reducing fine lines with concentrated and effective ingredients.\r\nQuickly absorbed with fine bubbles, leaving skin hydrated and firm.\r\nSkin irritation tested, suitable for sensitive skin.','After toner, apply 1-2 pumps of the content on your face and pat lightly to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240618_231352_(540_x_720_pixel)_53089.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_231352_(540_x_720_pixel)_53089.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_232524_(540_x_720_pixel)_83063.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_231405_(540_x_720_pixel)_34814.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_231358_(540_x_720_pixel)_37856.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3839,'MIXSOON - Bean Essence',NULL,130.000,'This multi-award-winning Bean Essence is MIXSOON\'s best-seller and star product. It helps improve skin texture and refine pores by gently exfoliating dead skin cells away from the surface, revealing brighter and glowing skin.   \r\n\r\nIt is packed with high-quality nutrients such as Soybean Extract and Pomegranate Extract to hydrate and nourish the skin. The antioxidants also strengthen the skin, while maintaining the skin\'s natural moisture and oil levels, helping to reduce excess sebum production. With additional anti-ageing benefits, this essence will leave your complexion dewy and moisturised! <br>\r\n\r\nThe texture is viscous, similar to snail mucin or \"natto\". This is a fantastic alternative to the Cosrx Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Essence.','1. Use after cleansing and toning\r\n\r\n2. Either apply on your palm and pat gently and spread for absorption to use an essence\r\n\r\n3. To use as an exfoliator 2-3 times a week, apply a generous amount and massage in to see dead skin cells come off. Remove with a wet cotton pad','produits/IMG_20240618_233248_(540_x_720_pixel)_94612.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240618_233248_(540_x_720_pixel)_94612.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_233312_(540_x_720_pixel)_59327.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_233342_(540_x_720_pixel)_44004.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_233406_(540_x_720_pixel)_70087.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240618_233417_(540_x_720_pixel)_58016.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3840,'Kill Cover The New Founwear Cushion Set (+Refill) Peach Edition',NULL,151.000,'Weightless Coverage, All-Day Wear\r\nIntroducing the NEW KILL COVER Founwear Cushion, a revolutionary foundation that delivers flawless, weightless coverage that lasts all day. This innovative formula provides:\r\n * Up to 24 hours of wear without caking or fading.\r\n * Buildable, natural-looking coverage for a radiant complexion.\r\n * Lightweight, water-based formula that feels comfortable on your skin.\r\n * SPF 50+ PA+++ for broad-spectrum sun protection.\r\n * Triple-action benefits:  Sunscreen, whitening, and wrinkle improvement.\r\n * Customized curved puff for a smooth, even application.\r\nAvailable in shade 4 Ginger','Apply by pressing the puff into the sponge and pat the puff onto the face. Please use it after removing the film. Please close the lid fully after use.','produits/IMG_20240625_170817_(540_x_720_pixel)_93443.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240625_170817_(540_x_720_pixel)_93443.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240625_170913_(540_x_720_pixel)_94692.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240625_171223_(540_x_720_pixel)_88548.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240625_171216_(540_x_720_pixel)_13207.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240625_171522_(540_x_720_pixel)_22409.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3841,'BIODANCE Bio-Collagen Real Deep Mask Sheet 1P',NULL,35.000,'With over 1 million sales, this is BIODANCE’s best-selling product that is sold at a rate of one every 2 seconds. BIODANCE Bio-Collagen Real Deep Mask is a bottle of highly concentrated ampoule that allows the skin to absorb every last drop of the ampoule.\r\n\r\nThe highly concentrated ampoule 34g is not soaked into the sheet, but hardened as a hydrogel mask pack, and as the skin absorbs the active ingredients, it becomes more transparent.\r\n\r\nA skin portal care solution product that improves moisture, pores, and elasticity with just one sheet of mask.\r\n\r\nThis product received the EWG Green grade, 19 controversial ingredients FREE, Hwahae 20 harmful ingredients FREE, MFDS announced 25 allergy-inducing ingredients FREE, and skin irritation tested.','1. After cleansing, soothe the skin texture with a hydrating toner.\r\n2. Take out the mask and place it along the face shape.\r\n3. Once the mask turns transparent, remove it. (up to 3-4 hours)\r\n4. Finish with a moisturizer, as needed.\r\n\r\n[Sleeping Mask]\r\n1. After cleansing, apply the ampoule or cream that enhances the content absorption.\r\n2. Take out the mask and place it along the face shape.\r\n3. Keep the mask overnight and remove on the next day.','produits/IMG_20240711_170604_(540_x_720_pixel)_65244.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240711_170604_(540_x_720_pixel)_65244.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170736_(540_x_720_pixel)_50481.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170813_(540_x_720_pixel)_29117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170829_(540_x_720_pixel)_52433.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3842,'BIODANCE Bio-Collagen Real Deep Mask Sheet Box',NULL,126.000,'With over 1 million sales, this is BIODANCE’s best-selling product that is sold at a rate of one every 2 seconds. BIODANCE Bio-Collagen Real Deep Mask is a bottle of highly concentrated ampoule that allows the skin to absorb every last drop of the ampoule.\r\n\r\nThe highly concentrated ampoule 34g is not soaked into the sheet, but hardened as a hydrogel mask pack, and as the skin absorbs the active ingredients, it becomes more transparent.\r\n\r\nA skin portal care solution product that improves moisture, pores, and elasticity with just one sheet of mask.\r\n\r\nThis product received the EWG Green grade, 19 controversial ingredients FREE, Hwahae 20 harmful ingredients FREE, MFDS announced 25 allergy-inducing ingredients FREE, and skin irritation tested.','1. After cleansing, soothe the skin texture with a hydrating toner.\r\n2. Take out the mask and place it along the face shape.\r\n3. Once the mask turns transparent, remove it. (up to 3-4 hours)\r\n4. Finish with a moisturizer, as needed.\r\n\r\n[Sleeping Mask]\r\n1. After cleansing, apply the ampoule or cream that enhances the content absorption.\r\n2. Take out the mask and place it along the face shape.\r\n3. Keep the mask overnight and remove on the next day.','produits/IMG_20240711_170604_(540_x_720_pixel)_27216.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240711_170604_(540_x_720_pixel)_27216.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_171232_(540_x_720_pixel)_80942.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170736_(540_x_720_pixel)_94746.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170813_(540_x_720_pixel)_66282.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240711_170829_(540_x_720_pixel)_23220.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3843,'Round Lab - Birch Moisturizing Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++',NULL,117.000,'The Round Lab Birch Moisturizing Sunscreen SPF 50+ PA++++ is a popular and award-winning Korean sunscreen known for its hydrating and lightweight formula. Packed with birch sap and hyaluronic acid, it offers broad-spectrum UVA/UVB protection and is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.','* Apply liberally to your face and neck as the last step of your skincare routine at least 15 minutes before sun exposure.\r\n * Don\'t forget to apply sunscreen to other exposed areas like your arms, legs, and ears.\r\n * Reapply every two hours, especially after swimming or sweating.','produits/IMG_20240712_184419_(540_x_720_pixel)_63189.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240712_184419_(540_x_720_pixel)_63189.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_184537_(540_x_720_pixel)_50652.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_184653_(540_x_720_pixel)_35046.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_184733_(540_x_720_pixel)_87821.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3844,'Round Lab - Birch Juice Moisturizing Sun Stick',NULL,117.000,'This moisturizing chemical sun stick offers broad spectrum SPF 50+ PA++++ protection for comprehensive sun defense. Enriched with birch tree sap, aloe, kelp, and other botanical extracts, it hydrates, soothes, and cools the skin. Niacinamide, adenosine, and 12 types of peptides provide additional brightening and anti-aging benefits. The easy-to-reapply stick glides on smoothly, adheres well, and leaves no greasy residue.','Twist the bottom part of the product to elevate content. Swipe across skin to apply.','produits/IMG_20240712_223753_(540_x_720_pixel)_66853.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240712_223753_(540_x_720_pixel)_66853.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_223834_(540_x_720_pixel)_44085.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_223851_(540_x_720_pixel)_66092.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240712_225024_(540_x_720_pixel)_96694.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3845,'Karseell Argan Oil Hair Treatment Shampoo',NULL,130.000,'Transform your hair from dry and damaged to luxuriously smooth and radiant with Karseell Argan Oil Shampoo. This nourishing formula, infused with precious Moroccan argan oil, gently cleanses and deeply conditions your hair in one luxurious step. Rich in vitamin E and fatty acids, argan oil helps repair split ends, tame frizz, and boost shine. Karseell Argan Oil Shampoo is perfect for all hair types, leaving your hair feeling soft, manageable, and irresistibly healthy.','* Wet your hair thoroughly with warm water. This helps prepare your hair for cleansing and ensures the shampoo lathers well.\r\n * Apply a generous amount of shampoo to your scalp and hair. The amount you\'ll need will depend on your hair length and thickness. Start with a coin-sized amount for medium-length hair and adjust as needed.\r\n * Gently massage the shampoo into your scalp using your fingertips. Create a lather as you massage, focusing on cleansing your scalp.\r\n * Work the lather down to the ends of your hair. This helps distribute the shampoo\'s conditioning benefits throughout your hair.\r\n * Rinse the shampoo out completely with clean water. Ensure all the shampoo is rinsed away to avoid any residue buildup.\r\n * Follow with conditioner if desired. Conditioner helps replenish moisture and detangle your hair, leaving it soft and manageable.','produits/IMG_20240713_102708_(540_x_720_pixel)_33523.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_102708_(540_x_720_pixel)_33523.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_102755_(540_x_720_pixel)_15293.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_104016_(540_x_720_pixel)_49933.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_104032_(540_x_720_pixel)_95058.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_104104_(540_x_720_pixel)_66527.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3846,'Karseell Conditioner Argan Oil Organic Herbal Essence Deep Repair Treatment',NULL,130.000,'Karseell Conditioner Argan Oil Organic Herbal Essence Deep Repair Treatment is a hair conditioner that is formulated to repair and nourish dry, damaged hair. It contains argan oil, which is rich in vitamin E and helps to repair split ends, moisturize hair, and protect it from UV damage. The conditioner also contains other natural ingredients, such as macadamia oil, tea tree oil, chamomile oil, aloe vera, and algae extracts, which work together to nourish and strengthen hair.\r\nThis conditioner is ideal for all hair types, including straight, curly, and color-treated hair. It can help to reduce frizz and flyaways, and it can also help to enhance curls and add bounce to voluminous hair.','* Wash your hair with shampoo and rinse thoroughly.\r\n * Apply the deep conditioner to your hair, focusing on the ends.\r\n * Comb through your hair to distribute the conditioner evenly.\r\n * Leave the conditioner on your hair for 20-30 minutes, or as directed by the product label.\r\n * Rinse the conditioner out of your hair with warm water.','produits/IMG_20240713_145408_(540_x_720_pixel)_98288.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_145408_(540_x_720_pixel)_98288.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_145503_(540_x_720_pixel)_81095.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_145711_(540_x_720_pixel)_36356.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_145739_(540_x_720_pixel)_15008.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3847,'Karseell Collagen Hair Treatment Deep Repair Conditioning Argan Oil Collagen Hair Mask Essence',NULL,180.000,'Infuse your hair with deep hydration and luxurious shine with Karseell hair mask! This potent formula is more than just your average conditioner – it\'s a transformative treatment for dry, damaged hair. Here\'s why you\'ll love it:\r\n * Intense Moisture: Packed with collagen, argan oil, and maca essence, this mask deeply hydrates and nourishes your hair, leaving it feeling silky smooth and touchably soft.\r\n * Say Goodbye to Frizz: Tame unruly strands and flyaways with the powerful conditioning properties of Karseell mask. Experience manageable, frizz-free hair that\'s easier to style and detangle.\r\n * Visible Shine Boost: Breathe new life into dull, lackluster hair. Karseell mask helps restore your hair\'s natural shine and vibrancy, giving you healthy-looking locks that radiate confidence.\r\n * Suitable for All Hair Types: Whether you have straight, curly, color-treated, or chemically processed hair, Karseell mask is formulated to work wonders on your unique hair type.','* Wash your hair with shampoo and skip the conditioner.\r\n * Towel-dry your hair to remove excess water.\r\n * Apply a generous amount of the mask to your hair, focusing on the mid-lengths and ends.\r\n * Leave the mask on for 10-20 minutes. You can use a shower cap to trap heat and enhance absorption.\r\n * Rinse the mask out thoroughly with clean water.','produits/IMG_20240713_184631_(540_x_720_pixel)_71577.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_184631_(540_x_720_pixel)_71577.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_185125_(540_x_720_pixel)_75513.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_185256_(540_x_720_pixel)_10079.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_185012_(540_x_720_pixel)_40385.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_184912_(540_x_720_pixel)_99419.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3848,'Karseell Moroccan Argan Oil',NULL,120.000,'Karseell hair oil is a Moroccan argan oil treatment designed to nourish and repair dry, damaged hair. It\'s rich in vitamin E, which helps to strengthen hair and make it shinier and healthier. The oil is also lightweight and easily absorbed, so it won\'t weigh your hair down. Karseell hair oil can also be used on skin and nails for a touch of hydration and rejuvenation.','* Deep conditioning: Apply a few drops to your hair before shampooing, focusing on the ends. Leave it on for 20-30 minutes for a nourishing treatment.\r\n * Daily shine booster: Apply a small amount to damp or dry hair, concentrating on the mid-lengths and ends. This will tame frizz and add shine without weighing your hair down.\r\n * Hair mask: Mix a few drops of argan oil with your favorite hair mask for an extra boost of hydration.','produits/IMG_20240713_190849_(540_x_720_pixel)_91650.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_190849_(540_x_720_pixel)_91650.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_190928_(540_x_720_pixel)_85037.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_191016_(540_x_720_pixel)_62242.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_191411_(540_x_720_pixel)_41419.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_191525_(540_x_720_pixel)_21564.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3849,'TOCOBO - Vita Tone Up Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,117.000,'The TOCOBO Vita Tone Up Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++ is a sunscreen that offers sun protection while evening skin tone and texture. It contains ingredients like niacinamide and vitamin B12 to brighten skin, hyaluronic acid for hydration, and Hippophae Rhamnoides Water for skin soothing. This all-in-one formula protects your skin from sun damage while leaving it looking radiant. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 50 ml','Apply adequate amount at the last step of basic skin care\r\nApply 30 minutes before going out in the sun.\r\nReapply every two hours for the perfect sun protection during the outdoor activity.','produits/IMG_20240713_234252_(540_x_720_pixel)_50088.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240713_234252_(540_x_720_pixel)_50088.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_234408_(540_x_720_pixel)_38991.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_234522_(540_x_720_pixel)_63594.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_234556_(540_x_720_pixel)_45159.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240713_234659_(540_x_720_pixel)_29075.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3850,'Ground Rice and Honey Glow Mask',NULL,140.000,'This all-in-one wash-off mask combines the benefits of Korean rice wine extract, rice hull powder, and honey to deliver a radiant complexion. Upcycled makgeolli lees, a byproduct of traditional Korean rice wine, brightens and hydrates, while rice hull powder gently exfoliates. Honey soothes inflammation and provides deep moisture, making this mask suitable for all skin types, including those with acne. Kaolin clay absorbs excess oil to purify pores, leaving your skin feeling refreshed and balanced.\r\n\r\nSkin type: Dry, normal, combination, oily, sensitive\r\n\r\nVolume: 150 ml','* Cleanse your face and pat it dry.\r\n * Apply a generous amount of the mask evenly to your face, avoiding the eye and mouth area.\r\n * Leave the mask on for 15-20 minutes.\r\n * Gently massage the mask into your skin with lukewarm water to rinse it off completely.\r\n * Pat your face dry and follow up with your usual moisturizer.','produits/IMG_20240714_145507_(540_x_720_pixel)_30801.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_145507_(540_x_720_pixel)_30801.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_145638_(540_x_720_pixel)_88201.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_145858_(540_x_720_pixel)_70805.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_150224_(540_x_720_pixel)_58004.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_150420_(540_x_720_pixel)_59077.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_150530_(540_x_720_pixel)_46114.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3851,'A\'PIEU - Honey and Milk Lip Oil Mint',NULL,55.000,'A\'pieu\'s Honey and Milk Mint Lip Oil combines natural ingredients to nourish and protect your lips. Honey, a natural humectant, locks in moisture, while milk protein extract provides a nourishing layer to soften and smooth lips. The mint adds a refreshing tingle and scent, and the blend of oils ensures a lightweight, non-sticky application that leaves a healthy gloss.','1. Gently apply a layer on lips with the curved applicator.\r\n2. Reapply on troubled areas by tapping with the tip of the applicator.\r\n3. Alternatively, apply after lip tint.','produits/IMG_20240714_191032_(540_x_720_pixel)_50923.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_191032_(540_x_720_pixel)_50923.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_191102_(540_x_720_pixel)_86019.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_191118_(540_x_720_pixel)_45306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_191149_(540_x_720_pixel)_52108.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3852,'A\'PIEU - Honey and Milk Lip Oil Peach',NULL,55.000,'The A\'pieu honey and milk lip oil locks in the moisture and protects the lips from drying out. Honey forms a moisture barrier while milk protein extract smoothes the lips. The lightweight texture glides onto the lips, leaving a healthy shine.','Apply onto lips as necessary.','produits/IMG_20240714_201357_(540_x_720_pixel)_28260.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_201357_(540_x_720_pixel)_28260.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_200624_(540_x_720_pixel)_31088.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_200716_(540_x_720_pixel)_41439.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_200819_(540_x_720_pixel)_69325.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3853,'Glow Replenishing Rice Milk',NULL,130.000,'✓ Refreshing, Non-Greasy Finish\r\n\r\n✓ All Skin Types, All Seasons\r\n\r\n✓ Creates a Moisture Barrier\r\n‎\r\n\r\nThis rice toner modernizes the traditional rice bran water used in the Joseon Dynasty. Packed with nutrients, rice extract, and rice amino acids, it deeply hydrates and smooths dry, rough skin. Its dual-layer formula provides a refreshing, non-greasy finish while controlling sebum and soothing sensitive skin.','Skin Prep for Glass Skin: Soak cotton pads with Rice Milk and place them on your face for 5 minutes. Remove the pads and gently pat to aid absorption.\r\nSebum Control: Pour a generous amount of Rice Milk onto a cotton pad and gently swipe across your face from the center outward. Finish with another layer and move onto your next skincare routine.','produits/IMG_20240714_203014_(540_x_720_pixel)_16337.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_203014_(540_x_720_pixel)_16337.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_203119_(540_x_720_pixel)_68659.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_203134_(540_x_720_pixel)_21780.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_203146_(540_x_720_pixel)_93890.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_203227_(540_x_720_pixel)_73352.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3854,'Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum',NULL,140.000,'The Anua Niacinamide 10% + TXA 4% Dark Spot Correcting Serum is a Korean skincare product designed to address hyperpigmentation and achieve a brighter, more even skin tone. Here\'s a quick breakdown of its key features:\r\n * Key Ingredients: 10% Niacinamide, 4% Tranexamic Acid, 2% Alpha Arbutin\r\n * Benefits: Targets dark spots and hyperpigmentation, brightens skin tone, lightweight texture\r\n * Skin Types: Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin','1. Apply a few drops to affected areas and gradually increase the usage period accordingly.\r\n2. Use in the morning and at night before oil and moisturizer.\r\n3. Can be used daily but discontinue if irritation occurs.\r\n4. When used in the morning, be certain to wear sun protection with SPF30 or higher.','produits/IMG_20240714_203927_(540_x_720_pixel)_47242.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240714_203927_(540_x_720_pixel)_47242.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204012_(540_x_720_pixel)_32088.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204129_(540_x_720_pixel)_65692.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240714_204138_(540_x_720_pixel)_73181.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222431_(540_x_720_pixel)_26211.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222531_(540_x_720_pixel)_49532.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222734_(540_x_720_pixel)_90221.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222949_(540_x_720_pixel)_90772.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_222838_(540_x_720_pixel)_20865.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3855,'JUMISO - Snail Mucin 95% + Peptide Essence',NULL,150.000,'Jumiso\'s Snail Mucin 95% + Peptide Essence is a Korean skincare powerhouse that combines the best of both worlds: hydration and anti-aging. The star ingredient, snail mucin, delivers deep hydration to quench your skin\'s thirst, leaving it feeling refreshed and plump. But that\'s not all! This essence also boasts five types of peptides, which work together to stimulate collagen production. This translates to firmer, smoother skin with less noticeable fine lines and wrinkles. The lightweight, fragrance-free formula is gentle enough for even sensitive and acne-prone skin, making it a great choice for all skin types.','After cleansing and toner, apply it evenly in the face, in the morning and evening','produits/IMG_20240715_003011_(540_x_720_pixel)_34422.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240715_003011_(540_x_720_pixel)_34422.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_003233_(540_x_720_pixel)_61220.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_003256_(540_x_720_pixel)_12019.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_003348_(540_x_720_pixel)_65219.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3856,'TIRTIR - Mask Fit Red Cushion #21W Natural Ivory',NULL,148.000,'The TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is a high-performance Korean beauty product designed to provide long-lasting coverage and a natural, semi-matte finish. It features a formula that offers up to 72 hours of flawless coverage, effectively concealing blemishes, redness, and dark spots. Enriched with hydrating ingredients like Hibiscus Sabdariffa Flower Extract and Propolis Extract, it nourishes and moisturizes the skin while providing SPF40 PA++ protection against UV rays. Its buildable coverage ensures a lightweight feel on the skin, making it suitable for all-day wear and ideal for sensitive skin types.','After your skincare routine, apply the appropriate amount of foundation to the sponge/puff and gently pat all over your face.\r\nBuild up with several thin layers instead of one thick layer for a more even and natural tone.\r\nClose the packaging after use to prevent the product from drying out.','produits/IMG_20240715_092001_(540_x_720_pixel)_47539.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240715_092001_(540_x_720_pixel)_47539.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_092011_(540_x_720_pixel)_37560.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_092103_(540_x_720_pixel)_56380.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240715_092228_(540_x_720_pixel)_53056.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3857,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream',NULL,94.000,'Heartleaf Silky Moisture Sun Cream is a lightweight organic sunscreen that provides soothing and hydrating benefits. Featuring Houttuynia Cordata Extract to calm your skin and provide care for sensitive skin, while Panthenol locks water inside your skin and helps with calming. Also boasting a sebum-controlling effect, the formula sits well under foundation and prolongs makeup wear.','1. Apply it at the last stage of skincare routine 15 minutes before heading out.\r\n2. Apply an approximate size of a finger twice to three times.\r\n3. The soft and moisturizing texture allows you to apply at any time.','produits/IMG_20240715_194914_(540_x_720_pixel)_4