tint that shines and dazzles all day long! The Peripera Ink Mood Glowy Tint helps create a glassy lip look while offering a moisturising effect, long-lasting adherence and superb colour payoff that won\'t leave a sticky after-feel. Infused with Lily and Witch Hazel Extracts, this multitasking formula smooths texture and relieves dry, chapped lips while delivering a stunning hint of colour.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth outwards toward corners of mouth.','produits/IMG_20240721_231247_(540_x_720_pixel)_26140.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240721_231247_(540_x_720_pixel)_26140.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_231320_(540_x_720_pixel)_47732.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_231401_(540_x_720_pixel)_40016.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_231426_(540_x_720_pixel)_20325.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3900,'I\'m From - Rice Serum',NULL,145.000,'I’M FROM Rice Serum is a brightening and hydrating serum that provides instant glow and long-lasting nourishment. Containing 73% Rice Germ Fermented Extract, which retains more than 65% of the nutritional value in a grain of rice, this serum is rich in vitamin B and powerful antioxidants to boost collagen production and improve skin elasticity. Use this serum together with the I\'m From Rice Cream to double the benefits!','After cleansing and toning, dispense an appropriate amount of the serum and apply it over your face evenly. Continue with the I\'m From Rice Cream or your moisturiser once it&rsquo;s fully absorbed','produits/IMG_20240721_232448_(540_x_720_pixel)_28210.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240721_232448_(540_x_720_pixel)_28210.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232524_(540_x_720_pixel)_28767.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232536_(540_x_720_pixel)_36382.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232548_(540_x_720_pixel)_48279.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232554_(540_x_720_pixel)_64439.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_232600_(540_x_720_pixel)_66011.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3901,'Shiseido - Fino Premium Touch Hair Mask',NULL,150.000,'A hair mask designed to repair dry and damaged hair due to coloring, perming, sun and environmental factors, Shiseido\'s Fino Premium Touch Hair Mask is formulated with royal jelly EX, PCA (para-chloroamphetamine) and Lipidure EX to moisturize, strengthen, nourish and transform hair into a healthier state from roots to tips. Seven essences help boost moisture penetration and control, plus add gloss, body and lasting color. Apply on shampooed, towel-dried hair and leave on for several minutes. Rinse thoroughly.','After shampoo, lightly drain off.\r\nRinse well after letting the appropriate amount (about 2 teaspoons for semi-long) around the damaged part of the hair.\r\nEven if it is immediately rinsed, it has enough effect.\r\nIt demonstrates high effect, recommend using 1 or 2 times a week.\r\nRemarks: Manufacturing date is marked on product.','produits/IMG_20240721_233522_(540_x_720_pixel)_39556.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240721_233522_(540_x_720_pixel)_39556.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_233547_(540_x_720_pixel)_46508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_233620_(540_x_720_pixel)_23661.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_233657_(540_x_720_pixel)_60358.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3902,'Shiseido Fino Premium Touch Hair Oil',NULL,130.000,'Shiseido Fino Premium Touch Hair Oil is a hair treatment oil that intensively repairs damaged hair. If you\'ve tried the famous Shiseido Fino Premium Touch Hair mask, then this hair oil is a great follow up treatment to keep your hair feeling even healthier and shiner.\r\n\r\nIf your hair is dry or prone to damage from harsh weather conditions, UV rays, or treatments such as coloring, highlights, or perms, the Fino Premium Touch Hair Oil by Shiseido can help to repair your hair and smoothen its texture.\r\n\r\nThe Fino hair oil intensively repairs even the slightest damage, helping your hair to become more healthy and feel smooth.\r\n\r\nThe hair oil itself has a light finish that is not too sticky, and will not leave your hair feeling greasy in the slightest. It also has a refreshing floral scent.','Apply to semi-dry or dry hair.\r\n\r\nStart with a small amount, and apply the hair oil to the ends of your semi-dry or dry hair. For long hair, it is recommended to use one full pump of product.\r\n\r\nYou can use Fino hair oil at anytime during the morning, day, or night.','produits/IMG_20240721_234200_(540_x_720_pixel)_10309.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240721_234200_(540_x_720_pixel)_10309.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_234231_(540_x_720_pixel)_84386.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_234300_(540_x_720_pixel)_75285.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_234331_(540_x_720_pixel)_63340.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3903,'KAINE - Green Fit Pro Sun',NULL,117.000,'This vegan sunscreen uses chemical and mineral filters to provide SPF 50+ PA++++ sun protection. The formula is infused with panthenol, hyaluronic acid and bambusa vulgaris water to hydrate and soothe irritated skin. Enriched with thymus vulgaris extract and chlorella vulgaris extract, sunscreen in a lotion texture provides a slight cooling effect.','Evenly spread a proper amount over areas frequently exposed to sun.','produits/IMG_20240721_235013_(540_x_720_pixel)_77310.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240721_235013_(540_x_720_pixel)_77310.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_235007_(540_x_720_pixel)_89841.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_235046_(540_x_720_pixel)_95530.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240721_235157_(540_x_720_pixel)_75621.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3904,'SAEMMUL Mousse Candy Tint #11 Tomato',NULL,44.000,'A sweet candy-like tint with yummy scents of freshly squeezed juice. It is long-lasting, has a lightweight fo