L),(3911,'PINKFLASH Multi Face Palette #03 Caramel Toffee',NULL,60.000,'Discover endless possibilities with our multi-purpose face palette. Designed for effortless beauty, this compact contains everything you need to create stunning eye looks, sculpt your cheekbones, and add a radiant glow. The velvety-soft, lightweight powder glides on seamlessly, leaving a flawless finish without irritating your skin. Infused with rich pigments, each shade delivers bold color in a single stroke.\r\nWith ten versatile colors to choose from, you can mix and match to achieve any look you desire. From subtle daytime makeup to dramatic evening glam, the possibilities are endless. Embrace the convenience and creativity of this zero-waste formula and enjoy a different makeup masterpiece every day.','Apply on face','produits/IMG_20240722_013055_(540_x_720_pixel)_54456.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_013055_(540_x_720_pixel)_54456.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_013112_(540_x_720_pixel)_98309.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_013236_(540_x_720_pixel)_80585.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_012201_(540_x_720_pixel)_69983.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3912,'PINKFLASH - Pro Touch Eyeshadow Palette- #03 Strawberry Donuts',NULL,60.000,'Indulge your sweet tooth with the Pinkflash Pro Touch Eyeshadow Palette in Strawberry Donuts. This palette features a delicious mix of warm pinks, soft browns, and shimmering accents, perfect for creating endless eye looks. The highly pigmented, blendable formula ensures smooth application and long-lasting wear. Whether you prefer a soft, romantic look or a bold, glamorous statement, this cruelty-free palette has everything you need.','Apply on eyes','produits/IMG_20240722_014410_(540_x_720_pixel)_44306.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_014410_(540_x_720_pixel)_44306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_014444_(540_x_720_pixel)_73722.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_014541_(540_x_720_pixel)_36771.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_014517_(540_x_720_pixel)_33769.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3913,'Over Glowy Tint #02 Peach Forest OF HEALING',NULL,54.000,'Experience the ultimate lip look with the Over Glowy Tint. This innovative formula combines the best of a lip gloss and a lip tint, providing a long-lasting, high-shine finish. The lightweight, non-sticky texture feels comfortable on the lips, while the vibrant colors add a touch of glamour to any look.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth out-wards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000001172_67388.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001172_67388.jpg\", \"produits/1000001173_27663.jpg\", \"produits/1000001174_81494.jpg\", \"produits/1000001175_71806.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3914,'Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser',NULL,93.000,'Advanced Snail Mucin Gel Cleanser is a specially formulated gel cleanser enriched with snail mucin to hydrate and protect the skin. Supercharged with 10,000ppm of snail secretion filtrate to deliver a powerful regenerative and hydrating effect, this ultra-gentle cleanser effectively removes impurities without stripping the skin, protecting its barrier while moisturising, restoring and healing for a smooth complexion.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the stretchy, elastic texture of snail mucin as it effectively works its way into hard-to-reach areas of your face, lifting away all impurities for an impeccable cleanse while creating the smoothest lather possible to minimise stimulation. A definite must-have for snail mucin lovers!\r\n\r\nSuitable for all skin types, perfect for those with sensitive skin prone to irritation or redness.','Wet your face and lather a pea sized amount of cleanser between your palms. Massage the foam into your skin from forehead to jaw. Rinse thoroughly with warm water.','produits/IMG_20240722_020610_(540_x_720_pixel)_78997.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240722_020610_(540_x_720_pixel)_78997.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_020637_(540_x_720_pixel)_27374.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_020706_(540_x_720_pixel)_88566.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240722_020719_(540_x_720_pixel)_79620.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3915,'Advanced Snail Hydrogel Eye Patch',NULL,130.000,'Advanced Snail Hydrogel Eye Patch is a depuffing and tone up patch infused with the brand best selling snail essence to visibly hydrate, plump and brighten the delicate eye area. Immersed in COSRX all time best selling Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence and skin brightening ingredient niacinamide, leaving your skin plumper and brighter with every application.\r\n\r\nThis hydrogel patch is made with a honeycomb pattern sheet to perfectly hug your skin, infusing it with a rich essence that penetrates deeply without moving or falling off. Whether it is to brighten up fragile skin around dull, tired looking eyes, diminish fine lines around the lips or neglected foreheads, this patch works anywhere!\r\n\r\nHighly recommended for those who have been looking for a high concentration snail essence for intensive care. Suitable for all skin types.','Simply place the Snail Hydrogel Eye Patch on any areas of concern and leave it on for 5-20 minutes a day. Whether it\'s while drying your hair, or just before doing your makeup, you can work this product into your everyday routine easily. \r\n\r\nTIP: Leave in the refrigerator before applying it around your eyes, mouth, and forehead to combat morning puffiness and dryness in one easy step!','produits/IMG_20240723_005757_(540_x_720_pixel)_40830.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240723_005757_(540_x_720_pixel)_40830.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240723_005624_(540_x_720_pixel)_38147.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240723_005653_(540_x_720_pixel)_88366.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240723_005721_(540_x_720_pixel)_70638.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3916,'Mary and May Tranexamic Acid + Glutathione Eye Cream',NULL,135.000,'Mary and May Tranexamic Acid + Glutathione Eye Cream is an intensive care cream for dark circles, blemishes and dark spots. Enriched with 1,000ppm Tranexamic Acid and Glutathione to improve the look of under-eye dark circles and freckles for a more refined, brighter-looking eye area. This functional eye cream supresses the formation of melanin, which leads to dark circles and blemishes, and removes free radicals to intensively brighten dull skin tone around the eyes, and care for areas where blemishes are troubles. Experience brighter, spot-free skin in just 2 weeks!\r\n\r\nFormulated with EWG verified green grade ingredients only.','Take an appropriate amount of this product and apply evenly to the skin around the eyes and areas where blemishes or dark spots are a concern.','produits/IMG_20240726_145041_(540_x_720_pixel)_58049.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240726_145041_(540_x_720_pixel)_58049.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240726_145107_(540_x_720_pixel)_86752.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240726_145157_(540_x_720_pixel)_72945.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_162854_(540_x_720_pixel)_96705.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3917,'Torriden DIVE-IN Watery Moisture Sun',NULL,111.000,'Torriden DIVE-IN Watery Moisture Sun Cream is an organic sun cream to protect skin while leaving a hydrating finish. Infused with Hyaluronic Acid, Jojoba Seed Oil and Aloe Barbadensis Flower Extract, this sun cream not only protects your skin, but also soothes and moisturises it. The combination of Panthenol and Allantoin further enhances the moisturising effects, leaving your skin feeling soft and supple. The lightweight texture gently adheres to skin without leaving a sticky after-feel.','In the final step of your skin care routine, apply an appropriate amount evenly to your face.','produits/IMG_20240727_192701_(540_x_720_pixel)_95401.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_192701_(540_x_720_pixel)_95401.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_193032_(540_x_720_pixel)_94075.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_192952_(540_x_720_pixel)_68873.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_193230_(540_x_720_pixel)_61913.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3918,'Mary and May Vegan Peptide Bakuchiol Sun Stick',NULL,109.000,'Mary and May Vegan Peptide Bakuchiol Sun Stick is a convenient stick-type sunscreen packed with powerful anti-ageing benefits for the skin. Bakuchiol, a plant-based alternative to retinol, fights inflammation, Peptides promote collagen synthesis, while Tocopherol softens fine lines. Boasting a soft, silky texture and infused with sebum-absorbing powder, this sun stick keeps skin cool and dry through multiple touch-ups.','Apply on face and neck at the last stage of your skincare routine. Reapply whenever needed.','produits/IMG_20240727_194010_(540_x_720_pixel)_85238.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_194010_(540_x_720_pixel)_85238.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_194052_(540_x_720_pixel)_61390.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_194123_(540_x_720_pixel)_90583.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_194245_(540_x_720_pixel)_89681.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3919,'medicube - Collagen Lifting Mask',NULL,20.000,'This anti-aging sheet mask is formulated with Triple Collagen Complex containing hydrolyzed collagen, soluble collagen and atelo collagen to replenish dehydrated skin with moisture and restore skin’s elasticity. Allantoin in the formula plumps up skin for a radiant and youthful-looking finish. Suitable for sensitive skin.','1. After cleansing, place the mask sheet on face.\r\n2. Leave it on for at least 10 minutes and remove it.\r\n4. Gently pat the remaining essence on face to aid absorption.','produits/IMG_20240727_214225_(540_x_720_pixel)_55779.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_214225_(540_x_720_pixel)_55779.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_214250_(540_x_720_pixel)_94853.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_214257_(540_x_720_pixel)_26843.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_214325_(540_x_720_pixel)_59168.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3920,'Rosemary Mint Hair Strengthening Edge Gel',NULL,38.000,'Your edges can be delicate. Shape and smooth them how you like while infusing them with strength and important nutrients with Mielle Organics’ Rosemary Mint Strengthening Edge Gel! With biotin and natural ingredients such as coconut and babassu seed oil, this edge gel offers you the hold you need along with the nourishment your hair has been craving. You’ll love how it feels – and the great rosemary mint scent – and your hair will love you back for using an edge gel with healthy hold in mind.\r\n\r\nKey Benefits:\r\n\r\nProvides intense shine and hydration\r\nSupports healthy edges \r\nInfused with biotin','Apply gel to edges and smooth with fingertips or brush for desired hold.','produits/IMG_20240727_221612_(540_x_720_pixel)_63670.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_221612_(540_x_720_pixel)_63670.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_221728_(540_x_720_pixel)_36563.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_221901_(540_x_720_pixel)_33634.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_221927_(540_x_720_pixel)_38373.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:42','2025-03-01 21:03:42',0,NULL),(3921,'Bija Trouble Cleansing Foam',NULL,107.000,'Innisfree\'s Bija Trouble Cleansing Foam is a targeted skincare solution designed to combat acne-prone and oily skin. Its star ingredient, bija seed oil, renowned for its anti-inflammatory properties, works in harmony with salicylic acid to unclog pores and exfoliate dead skin cells. This dynamic duo effectively reduces excess sebum, preventing future breakouts while soothing irritated skin. The addition of rose crysta provides a cooling sensation, enhancing the overall calming effect. This gentle yet powerful cleanser creates a rich lather that thoroughly removes impurities without stripping the skin, leaving it refreshed, purified, and balanced.','Squeeze a pea-sized amount from the tube and lather with water, gently massaging on the face in circular motions, before rinsing off thoroughly.','produits/IMG_20240727_223836_(540_x_720_pixel)_10612.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_223836_(540_x_720_pixel)_10612.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_223931_(540_x_720_pixel)_89935.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_224000_(540_x_720_pixel)_47321.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_224032_(540_x_720_pixel)_32509.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3922,'Intensive Long-lasting Sunscreen EX SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,125.000,'Innisfree\'s Intensive Long-Lasting Sunscreen EX offers broad-spectrum protection with an impressive SPF 50+ PA++++ rating. Designed for combination to oily skin, this lightweight, water-resistant formula provides long-lasting defense against harmful UVA and UVB rays. Enriched with soothing ingredients like witch hazel, sunflower seed oil, and green tea extract, it hydrates and protects without leaving a greasy residue. Perfect for outdoor activities, this vegan and reef-friendly sunscreen ensures your skin stays shielded and comfortable all day long.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume : 60 ml','Use at the last step of your skincare routine before makeup. Take a dime sized amount and spread evenly onto face, gently patting for absorption.','produits/IMG_20240727_231440_(540_x_720_pixel)_67651.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_231440_(540_x_720_pixel)_67651.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_231517_(540_x_720_pixel)_80279.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_231539_(540_x_720_pixel)_98508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_231707_(540_x_720_pixel)_16124.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3923,'Heartleaf 70 Intense Calming Cream',NULL,130.000,'Restore your skin\'s barrier with potent ingredients like Ceramides and Panthenol. Infused with 70% Heartleaf Extract, known for its soothing and calming effects, this daily facial moisturizer is suitable for all skin types, especially sensitive and dry skin. Its lightweight texture ensures immediate hydration and rapid absorption.','Apply a moderate amount evenly over the face and pat lightly for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20240727_234119_(540_x_720_pixel)_23099.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240727_234119_(540_x_720_pixel)_23099.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_234127_(540_x_720_pixel)_76021.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_234136_(540_x_720_pixel)_74279.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240727_234251_(540_x_720_pixel)_17733.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3924,'Michael Kors Reed Large Tote Bag',NULL,1350.000,'Elevate your everyday style with the Michael Kors Reed Large Tote Bag. This spacious and sophisticated tote is crafted from a luxurious blend of leather and features a chic, neutral color palette with a contrasting snake-embossed trim. The iconic MK logo hardware adds a touch of luxury, while the belted detail offers a stylish accent. With multiple compartments and pockets, this bag is both functional and fashionable.\r\nProduct Features:\r\n * Crafted from a blend of leather\r\n * Spacious interior with multiple compartments and pockets\r\n * Chic, neutral color palette with a contrasting snake-embossed trim\r\n * Iconic MK logo hardware\r\n * Removable shoulder strap for versatile carrying options\r\n * Belted detail for a stylish accent\r\nDimensions:\r\n * Width: 16.5 inches\r\n * Height: 12 inches\r\n * Depth: 5.5 inches\r\nCare Instructions:\r\n * Wipe clean with a damp cloth\r\n * Spot clean only\r\n * Do not machine wash or dry clean\r\nAdditional Notes:\r\n * The Reed Large Tote Bag is available in a variety of colors and materials.\r\n * This bag is perfect for carrying your essentials to work, school, or a night out.\r\n * The removable shoulder strap allows you to carry the bag as a tote or a crossbody.','Care Instructions:\r\n * Wipe clean with a damp cloth\r\n * Spot clean only\r\n * Do not machine wash or dry clean',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3925,'Karseell Professional Keratin Treatment',NULL,298.000,'Experience the transformative power of Karseell Professional Keratin Treatment, a luxurious blend of keratin, collagen, and biotin that will leave your hair smoother, straighter, and healthier than ever before.\r\nBenefits:\r\n * Deeply repairs damaged hair: Infused with keratin, the building block of hair, this treatment penetrates deep into the hair shaft to mend split ends and restore strength.\r\n * Reduces frizz and flyaways: Say goodbye to unruly hair! Collagen and biotin work together to smooth the hair cuticle, leaving it incredibly soft and manageable.\r\n * Provides long-lasting results: Enjoy up to 3 months of salon-quality straightness and shine with this powerful formula.\r\n * Adds incredible shine: Your hair will radiate with a healthy, lustrous glow after just one use.','* Shampoo hair twice with a clarifying shampoo to remove any product buildup.\r\n * Towel-dry hair to about 80% dryness.\r\n * Apply the Karseell Professional Keratin Treatment evenly from roots to ends.\r\n * Blow-dry hair completely.\r\n * Flat iron hair in thin sections using a high heat setting (400-450&deg;F).\r\n * Wait 48 hours before washing or styling your hair.','produits/IMG_20240730_192346_(540_x_720_pixel)_16498.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_192346_(540_x_720_pixel)_16498.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_192420_(540_x_720_pixel)_82622.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_200646_(540_x_720_pixel)_95517.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_200723_(540_x_720_pixel)_50117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_200615_(540_x_720_pixel)_71081.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3926,'Karseell BNC Collagen Treatment with Argan',NULL,195.000,'Restore your hair\'s vitality with Karseell BNC Collagen Treatment. This luxurious formula is enriched with collagen and argan oil to deeply nourish and repair even the most damaged hair. <br>\r\nExperience the transformative power as it revives your hair, leaving it irresistibly soft, smooth, and radiant. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nBenefits: <br>\r\n ‎‧₊˚✧Intense hydration✧˚₊ <br>\r\nQuenches thirsty hair, restoring its natural moisture balance. <br>\r\n₊˚✧Damage Repair✧˚₊\r\n<br>\r\nMends split ends, reduces breakage, and strengthens hair fibers. <br>\r\n ₊˚✧Vibrant Shine✧˚₊ <br>\r\nUnveils a healthy, lustrous glow, enhancing your hair\'s natural beauty. <br>\r\n₊˚✧ Suppleness and Smoothness‎✧˚₊ <br>\r\nTames frizz and flyaways, leaving hair effortlessly manageable.','Apply a generous amount to damp hair, focusing on the ends. Leave in for a few minutes, then rinse thoroughly. For optimal results, use regularly.','produits/IMG_20240730_201658_(540_x_720_pixel)_68384.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_201658_(540_x_720_pixel)_68384.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_201732_(540_x_720_pixel)_70639.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_201751_(540_x_720_pixel)_66495.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_201828_(540_x_720_pixel)_95230.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3927,'NUMBUZIN - No.5 Vitamin Concentrated Serum',NULL,130.000,'NUMBUZIN No.5 Vitamin Concentrated Serum is an intensive brightening ampoule that reduces the appearance of hyperpigmentation or dark spots. A collection of powerful brightening ingredients, including Glutathione, Alpha Lipoic Acid, Vitamin C, Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, Alpha-Arbutin and Bisabolol help fade away dark spots and leave the skin clear and bright, while Panthenol soothes and keeps skin hydrated.','After cleansing and toning, take 3-5 drops of the serum and gently spread it over your entire face.','produits/IMG_20240730_220607_(540_x_720_pixel)_88892.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_220607_(540_x_720_pixel)_88892.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_221100_(540_x_720_pixel)_63477.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_221151_(540_x_720_pixel)_66936.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_221229_(540_x_720_pixel)_27933.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3928,'lilybyred - Luv Beam Cheek Balm Smash It!',NULL,45.000,'Part of lilybyred’s new tennis-inspired Smash It! Collection, this special edition of the brand’s Luv Beam Cheek Balm gives the brand’s iconic cream blush a spring-ready makeover. Reworking the signature balm-like formula in a dusty rose shade, the cheek product can be blended out for a natural-looking flush or built up for bolder effects.','Take a moderate amount of blush with your fingertip or makeup puff, and gently apply and blend onto cheeks.','produits/IMG_20240730_223350_(540_x_720_pixel)_33080.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_223350_(540_x_720_pixel)_33080.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_223416_(540_x_720_pixel)_86743.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_223443_(540_x_720_pixel)_94721.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_223510_(540_x_720_pixel)_45287.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3929,'AHA BHA PHA 30 Days Miracle Travel Kit',NULL,106.000,'Take the guesswork out of treating your acne with this 30-Days Miracle Travel Kit! This power-packed trio includes Some By Mi’s best-selling toner, serum, and cream that utilizes the exfoliating powers of chemical exfoliants and calming effects of tea tree and Centella to soothe inflammation and redness while keeping your skin smooth and radiant! Whether you’re a newcomer to skincare or need a routine that does the work, this is something to try!','Cl no in','produits/IMG_20240730_223941_(540_x_720_pixel)_65547.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240730_223941_(540_x_720_pixel)_65547.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_224049_(540_x_720_pixel)_67181.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_224126_(540_x_720_pixel)_45036.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240730_224158_(540_x_720_pixel)_83660.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3930,'TOCOBO - Cica Cooling Sun Stick SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,109.000,'Containing Low-Molecular-Weight Fermented Cica Complex, 10-Layer Hyaluronic Acid, and Cornmint Powder: This non-sticky, moisturizing multi-balm type cooling soothing sun stick helps soothe and moisturize the skin.\r\n\r\n Key Benefits:\r\n\r\nRapid Skin Soothing and Moisture Replenishment: Low-molecular Fermented Cica, Multi-Hyaluronic Acid, and Aloe Extract rapidly soothe the skin and replenish moisture.\r\n3 Seconds Heat Soothing: Quickly reduces skin temperature and soothes irritated skin with a cooling sensation.\r\nNon-Comedogenic Multi-Skincare Sunscreen: Soothes moisture, manages sebum, and oil simultaneously.\r\nHypoallergenic Formulation: Safe for use on sensitive and acne-prone skin that is difficult to choose sun care.\r\nSay NO to the Prejudice That Sun Sticks Are Matte!: Moisturizing and refreshing multi-balm type sun stick.','At the last stage of skin care, apply lightly on area exposed to sun. Carry it around and apply frequently that need sun protection.','produits/IMG_20240731_090129_(540_x_720_pixel)_36306.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240731_090129_(540_x_720_pixel)_36306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090207_(540_x_720_pixel)_14368.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090327_(540_x_720_pixel)_68080.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240731_090239_(540_x_720_pixel)_88200.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3931,'Ksecret Seoul 1988 Cleansing Oil',NULL,99.000,'Discover the magic of Ksecret Seoul 1988 Cleansing Oil! Melt away a day worth of makeup, sunscreen, and impurities with this luxurious oil cleanser. Infused with soothing Pine Cica and skin-balancing Probiotics, it transforms your skincare routine into a pampering ritual. Experience a deep, pore-purifying cleanse that leaves your skin soft, refreshed, and ready to glow. Say goodbye to clogged pores and hello to a clearer, more radiant complexion. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nIndulge your skin with Ksecret Seoul 1988 Cleansing Oil - your passport to flawless skin starts here! <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: All skin types, specially recommended for Sensitive & Acne-prone skin. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 200 ml','Apply an appropriate amount on dry skin and gently massage.\r\nAdd water and massage skin to emulsify.\r\nRinse with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240818_183318_(540_x_720_pixel)_71460.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240818_183318_(540_x_720_pixel)_71460.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_183634_(540_x_720_pixel)_31002.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_191912_(540_x_720_pixel)_48406.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_192159_(540_x_720_pixel)_23884.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3932,'Seoul 1988 Cleansing Foam',NULL,109.000,'Ksecret Seoul 1988 Cleansing Foam is a purifying formula enriched with pine cica complex and probiotics to gently yet effectively cleanse the skin. Pine cica complex soothes irritation and promotes skin repair, while probiotics balance the skin microbiome. This cleansing foam also includes salicylic acid to unclog pores and prevent breakouts, leaving skin refreshed, purified, and ready for subsequent skincare steps. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: all skin types including sensitive skin\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 150 ml <br>','* Lather: Gently massage the foam into wet skin using circular motions to create a rich lather.\r\n * Cleanse: Focus on areas with makeup or impurities.\r\n * Rinse: Thoroughly rinse your face with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240818_223701_(540_x_720_pixel)_37948.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240818_223701_(540_x_720_pixel)_37948.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_223932_(540_x_720_pixel)_19147.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_223942_(540_x_720_pixel)_28978.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_224153_(540_x_720_pixel)_28876.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240818_224226_(540_x_720_pixel)_46613.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3933,'Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Set: A Revitalizing Trio',NULL,342.000,'Revitalize your skin with the Beauty of Joseon Ginseng Set. Harnessing ginseng\'s power, this trio hydrates, firms, and brightens for a youthful glow. &amp;lt;br&amp;gt;\r\n1. Ginseng Essence:\r\n * Hydration and nourishment: This essence is packed with ginseng extract to deeply hydrate and nourish the skin.\r\n * Improved skin texture: Regular use can help refine pores and enhance skin\'s overall texture.\r\n * Brightening effect: Ginseng is known for its brightening properties, helping to give your skin a radiant glow.\r\n2. Ginseng Eye Cream:\r\n * Targets under-eye concerns: This delicate formula addresses puffiness, dark circles, and fine lines around the eye area.\r\n * Antioxidant protection: Ginseng\'s antioxidants help shield the sensitive eye area from environmental damage.\r\n * Hydration boost: Provides essential moisture to keep the under-eye area hydrated and plump.\r\n3. Ginseng Serum:\r\n * Concentrated ginseng goodness: This serum delivers a potent dose of ginseng extract for maximum benefits.\r\n * Anti-aging effects: Helps reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n * Skin firming: Improves skin elasticity and firmness for a more youthful complexion.','Typically, you would apply the products in the following order:\r\n * Ginseng Essence: After cleansing and toning, gently pat the essence into your skin.\r\n * Ginseng Eye Cream: Gently dab the eye cream around the orbital bone.\r\n * Ginseng Serum: Apply a few drops to your face and neck, massaging gently until absorbed.','produits/IMG_20240819_000148_(540_x_720_pixel)_57283.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_000148_(540_x_720_pixel)_57283.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_000127_(540_x_720_pixel)_75686.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_000213_(540_x_720_pixel)_31416.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3934,'Anua Rice 7 Ceramide Hydrating Barrier Serum',NULL,150.000,'Discover the secret to a luminous, hydrated complexion. Anua\'s Rice and Ceramide Serum is a transformative elixir that replenishes your skin\'s natural moisture barrier while illuminating your complexion. Infused with the power of rice extract, renowned for its brightening and soothing properties, this serum gently exfoliates, revealing a smoother, more even skin tone.\r\nCeramides, the skin\'s essential building blocks, work harmoniously to lock in hydration, preventing moisture loss and restoring suppleness. Experience the difference as your skin becomes visibly plumped, reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.','Apply an appropriate amount on face and neck and gently pat to facilitate absorption.','produits/IMG_20240819_003846_(540_x_720_pixel)_63595.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_003846_(540_x_720_pixel)_63595.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_003923_(540_x_720_pixel)_52303.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_004342_(540_x_720_pixel)_28152.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_004416_(540_x_720_pixel)_25189.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_004425_(540_x_720_pixel)_34762.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3935,'Torriden\'s Dive-In Low Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Skin Booster',NULL,150.000,'Torriden\'s Dive-In Low Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Skin Booster is a hydrating powerhouse that deeply replenishes moisture into the skin. Formulated with five types of hyaluronic acid, this lightweight essence penetrates multiple skin layers to deliver intense hydration, resulting in a plump, supple, and radiant complexion. Enriched with ceramides, it also helps strengthen the skin\'s barrier, preventing moisture loss and soothing irritation. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.','Dispense a generous amount onto hands or cotton pads. Gently wipe and pat lightly for absorption.','produits/IMG_20240819_090925_(540_x_720_pixel)_17194.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_090925_(540_x_720_pixel)_17194.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_090956_(540_x_720_pixel)_16522.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_091012_(540_x_720_pixel)_76408.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_091027_(540_x_720_pixel)_54387.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3936,'Torriden - Dive-In Low Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Soothing Cream',NULL,135.000,'Dive-In Low Molecular Hyaluronic Acid Soothing Cream is a lightweight, gel-type moisturizer designed to deeply hydrate and soothe sensitive skin. Its 5D Hyaluronic Acid complex delivers intense moisture while trehalose and panthenol help lock it in. The cooling, non-sticky formula absorbs quickly, leaving skin refreshed, plump, and protected from moisture loss. Suitable for even the most delicate skin.','Apply a thick layer of product on the desired areas as sleeping pack for intensive moisturizing and soothing care.','produits/IMG_20240819_091934_(540_x_720_pixel)_18704.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_091934_(540_x_720_pixel)_18704.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_091951_(540_x_720_pixel)_27012.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_092154_(540_x_720_pixel)_30655.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_092213_(540_x_720_pixel)_67696.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3937,'Anua Rice Enzyme Brightening Cleansing Powder',NULL,140.000,'Anua Rice Enzyme Brightening Cleansing Powder is a versatile skincare product designed to illuminate and refine your complexion. This gentle powder transforms into a foaming cleanser or a purifying mask, effectively removing impurities while brightening and evening skin tone. Enriched with rice water, arbutin, and papain, it gently exfoliates, reduces dark spots, and hydrates the skin. Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive, this powder helps achieve a radiant and smoother appearance.','* Cleansing Powder: Mix a small amount of powder with water to create a foam. Massage gently onto wet face, then rinse thoroughly.\r\n * Wash-Off Mask: Mix a larger amount of powder with water to create a paste. Apply to face, leave on for 5-10 minutes, then rinse off.','produits/IMG_20240819_171328_(540_x_720_pixel)_17830.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_171328_(540_x_720_pixel)_17830.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_171357_(540_x_720_pixel)_26085.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_172525_(540_x_720_pixel)_68717.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_171424_(540_x_720_pixel)_43050.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_172726_(540_x_720_pixel)_17043.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3938,'Anua Rice 70 Glow Milky Toner',NULL,159.000,'Anua Rice 70 Glow Milky Toner is a lightweight milky toner enriched with Rice Bran Water and Niacinamide to brighten uneven dull skin tone, while balancing sebum production, promoting a clear and radiant complexion. It is formulated with Ceramide AP and NP to soothe irritated skin, while preventing moisture loss and reinforcing skin barrier. This toner contains Sodium Hyaluronate and Betaine to further amplify soothing and moisturizing effects for sensitive skin, while reducing inflammation. This toner has a milky texture that delivers deep hydration to skin with a non-sticky and refreshing finish. It is fragrance-free and suitable for all skin types.','Dispense a moderate amount on a cotton pad or simply pat with your fingertips all over face.','produits/IMG_20240819_173044_(540_x_720_pixel)_67739.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240819_173044_(540_x_720_pixel)_67739.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_173121_(540_x_720_pixel)_95468.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_173155_(540_x_720_pixel)_25529.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240819_173205_(540_x_720_pixel)_33934.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3939,'Round Lab - Birch Juice Moisturizing Tone Up Sunscreen',NULL,117.000,'Round Lab\'s Birch Juice Moisturizing Tone Up Sunscreen is a must-have for those seeking a radiant, sun-protected complexion. Its lightweight, watery formula absorbs effortlessly, leaving a soft, natural glow. With SPF 50+ PA++++ and a hint of pink tint, it offers both broad-spectrum protection and a subtle brightening effect. Enriched with nourishing ingredients like birch juice, hyaluronic acid, and panthenol, this sunscreen not only shields your skin from harmful UV rays but also hydrates and soothes. Perfect for all skin types, it\'s the ideal choice for a healthy, glowing complexion.','Apply a moderate amount on skin at the last stage of basic skincare.','produits/IMG_20240826_210038_(540_x_720_pixel)_13090.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_210038_(540_x_720_pixel)_13090.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_205435_(540_x_720_pixel)_78346.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_210148_(540_x_720_pixel)_23054.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_210230_(540_x_720_pixel)_70617.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3940,'thank you farmer - sun project water sun cream',NULL,110.000,'Thank You Farmer\'s Sun Project Water Sun Cream is a refreshing and hydrating sunscreen that provides broad-spectrum protection against harmful UV rays. Its lightweight, water-based formula absorbs quickly, leaving no greasy residue, while the gentle ingredients soothe and nourish your skin. Enriched with soothing aloe vera and hyaluronic acid, this sun cream not only shields your skin from the sun but also helps to maintain its hydration and elasticity. Enjoy a dewy, radiant complexion and worry-free sun protection with Thank You Farmer\'s Sun Project Water Sun Cream.','Apply as last step in AM routine to dry skin. Smooth across face &amp;amp;amp; neck, allow to dry down onto skin before applying make-up or additional steps. Top up throughout the day as needed.','produits/IMG_20240826_213011_(540_x_720_pixel)_37207.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_213011_(540_x_720_pixel)_37207.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_213215_(540_x_720_pixel)_83792.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_213609_(540_x_720_pixel)_80399.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_213652_(540_x_720_pixel)_83297.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3941,'VT Reedle Shot 700 Essence',NULL,250.000,'Experience the transformative power of microneedling, without the needles. VT Reedle Shot 700 Essence is a groundbreaking skincare innovation that delivers a potent blend of active ingredients deep into your skin, revealing a more youthful, radiant complexion. Its potent blend of hyaluronic acid and centella asiatica delivers intense hydration and soothing relief, while promoting a smoother, more radiant complexion.','* Cleanse: Start with a clean, dry face.\r\n * Apply: Dispense a few drops onto your fingertips.\r\n * Massage: Gently massage the essence into your skin, focusing on areas that need improvement.\r\n * Absorb: Allow the essence to fully absorb before applying any other skincare products.\r\nNote: For optimal results, use VT Reedle Shot 700 Essence consistently as part of your daily skincare routine.','produits/IMG_20240824_114558_(540_x_720_pixel)_35156.png',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240824_114558_(540_x_720_pixel)_35156.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240824_114622_(540_x_720_pixel)_31644.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240824_114636_(540_x_720_pixel)_82297.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240824_114944_(540_x_720_pixel)_39157.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240824_115034_(540_x_720_pixel)_19827.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3942,'Thank You Farmer Sun Project Silky Calming Sun Stick SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,105.000,'Thank You Farmer Sun Project Silky Calming Sun Stick SPF50+ PA++++ is a lightweight and portable sun protection stick that provides broad-spectrum protection against UVA and UVB rays. Its creamy texture glides smoothly onto the skin, leaving a non-greasy, matte finish. Formulated with natural ingredients, this sun stick offers high-level sun protection while soothing and hydrating the skin.','Turn the dial at the bottom of the container to raise the content to a suitable amount. Apply the product evenly to areas that require sun protection (face or body).','produits/IMG_20240826_221703_(540_x_720_pixel)_94125.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_221703_(540_x_720_pixel)_94125.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_221719_(540_x_720_pixel)_11073.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_221802_(540_x_720_pixel)_82789.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_221841_(540_x_720_pixel)_85549.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3943,'Sun Project Shimmer Sun Essence SPF30 PA++',NULL,125.000,'The Sun Project Shimmer Sun Essence is a multi-functional sunscreen that combines protection, radiance, and hydration. With its SPF30 PA++ formula, shimmering finish, and lightweight texture, it\'s ideal for those seeking a suncare product that not only protects but also enhances their natural beauty.','1. Used at the last step of skincare.\r\n2. Gently spread over the vulnerable areas to sun rays which are face, neck, arms, and legs.\r\n3. Reapply as needed when you spend a lot of time outdoors.','produits/IMG_20240826_222827_(540_x_720_pixel)_81013.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_222827_(540_x_720_pixel)_81013.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_222905_(540_x_720_pixel)_64182.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_222937_(540_x_720_pixel)_13778.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_223020_(540_x_720_pixel)_19027.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3944,'Thank You Farmer Sun Project Skin Relief Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,110.000,'A non-mineral sun cream with a fresh moisturizing texture that goes on easy, does not feel greasy and leaves no pilling or white cast effect. The non-comedogenic formula contains soothing ingredients like Eggplant Extract, Centella Asiatica and Japanese Goldthread and is suitable for all skin types including sensitive and acne prone skin. \r\n\r\nRated SPF 50+ PA+++, the Sun Project Skin Relief Sun Cream helps calm and hydrate your skin and soothes photosensitive skin as it delivers maximum protection against the damaging effects of UV exposure.','Apply as last step in AM routine to dry skin. Smooth across face &amp;amp;amp; neck, allow to dry down onto skin before applying make-up or additional steps. Top up throughout the day as needed.','produits/IMG_20240826_223423_(540_x_720_pixel)_64508.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240826_223423_(540_x_720_pixel)_64508.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_223510_(540_x_720_pixel)_49328.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_223500_(540_x_720_pixel)_59471.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240826_223637_(540_x_720_pixel)_61040.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3945,'Beta Panthenol Repair Starter Kit',NULL,128.000,'Discover the transformative power of the SOME BY MI Beta Panthenol Repair Starter Kit. This hydrating set, enriched with the exclusive Beta-Panthenol™ complex, is designed to soothe and revitalize your skin. Experience the gentle cleansing of the Gel Cleanser, the nourishing Toner, the deeply moisturizing Serum, and the hydrating Repair Cream. Perfect for those seeking to repair damaged skin and restore a healthy, glowing complexion.','* Cleansing: Gently massage a small amount of the Beta Panthenol Repair Gel Cleanser onto damp skin. Rinse thoroughly with warm water.\r\n * Toning: Apply a few drops of the Beta Panthenol Repair Toner to your face using a cotton pad or your fingertips. Gently pat into the skin.\r\n * Seruming: Dispense a few drops of the Beta Panthenol Repair Serum onto your fingertips. Apply evenly to your face and neck.\r\n * Moisturizing: Finish by applying a generous amount of the Beta Panthenol Repair Cream to your face and neck. Massage gently until fully absorbed.\r\nNote: For optimal results, use the kit consistently as part of your daily skincare routine. Patch test on a small area of skin before full application to ensure you have no allergies or sensitivities.','produits/IMG_20240908_212412_(540_x_720_pixel)_77245.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_212412_(540_x_720_pixel)_77245.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_212529_(540_x_720_pixel)_43749.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_212606_(540_x_720_pixel)_26694.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_212656_(540_x_720_pixel)_23098.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3946,'Centella Air Fit Light Sunscreen',NULL,89.000,'Experience the lightweight and refreshing sensation of the Skin1004 Air Fit Light Sunscreen. This non-greasy formula provides broad-spectrum SPF30/PA++++ protection against harmful UV rays, while soothing and brightening your skin. Enriched with Centella Asiatica extract, known for its healing and anti inflammatory properties, this sunscreen helps calm irritation and promote skin regeneration. Its lightweight texture absorbs quickly, leaving a matte finish that will not clog pores. Perfect for daily use and ideal for sensitive skin.','Spread enough cream to cover the face, neck and d&eacute;collet&eacute;, and massage until absorbed, about thirty minutes before exposure to the sun. Reapply the cream regularly throughout the day.','produits/IMG_20240908_215327_(540_x_720_pixel)_91719.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_215327_(540_x_720_pixel)_91719.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_215403_(540_x_720_pixel)_31411.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_215455_(540_x_720_pixel)_93900.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_215525_(540_x_720_pixel)_90270.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3947,'Madagascar Centella Ampoule Foam',NULL,110.000,'Madagascar Centella Ampoule Foam is a rich, foaming cleanser with the ideal pH level of 5 effectively remove makeup and impurities without stripping the skin. Packed with Centella Asiatica Extract to soothe and replenish skin hydration levels, while 4 naturally-sourced surfactants provide a deep cleanse and soft, easily-lathered foam.','Apply an appropriate amount onto wet palms and rub together to create foam. Gently massage the face and rinse with lukewarm water','produits/IMG_20240908_224738_(540_x_720_pixel)_24907.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_224738_(540_x_720_pixel)_24907.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_224844_(540_x_720_pixel)_81359.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_221926_(540_x_720_pixel)_74271.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_222007_(540_x_720_pixel)_54238.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3948,'Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule',NULL,102.000,'Madagascar Centella Probio-Cica Intensive Ampoule is a nourishing all-in-one ampoule that replenishes, soothes, softens and rejuvenates the skin. Centella Asiatica extract effectively soothes the skin, while vegan ProBio-Cica (Centella fermented with TECA) provides care for weak and sensitive skin barriers. Panthenol, Betaine and Allantoin in the formula provide plumping touches for smooth and hydrated skin. This highly-concentrated ampoule seeps deep into the skin, leaving it supple all day long.','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20240908_232223_(540_x_720_pixel)_82733.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_232223_(540_x_720_pixel)_82733.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_232559_(540_x_720_pixel)_37394.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_232311_(540_x_720_pixel)_23001.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_232345_(540_x_720_pixel)_38542.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3949,'8 Hyaluronic Acid Hydrating Gentle Foaming Cleanser',NULL,115.000,'ANUA Hyaluronic Acid Cleansing Foam\r\nExperience the hydrating power of the ANUA Hyaluronic Acid Cleansing Foam. This gentle yet effective cleanser is formulated with 8 types of hyaluronic acid to deeply cleanse pores without stripping the skin. Infused with panthenol and zinc PCA, it helps soothe and hydrate, leaving your skin feeling refreshed and nourished. Ideal for all skin types, especially those seeking a moisture-boosting cleansing experience.','1. Lathers the content into rich foam and gently massage your face with your palm.\r\n2. Rinse it off thoroughly with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240908_233950_(540_x_720_pixel)_58897.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240908_233950_(540_x_720_pixel)_58897.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_234204_(540_x_720_pixel)_44178.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_234057_(540_x_720_pixel)_12546.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240908_234133_(540_x_720_pixel)_82174.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3950,'VT Reedle Shot 300',NULL,240.000,'VT Reedle Shot 300 is a popular skincare product that utilizes microneedle technology to deliver potent ingredients deep into the skin. Its unique formulation, featuring hyaluronic acid and centella asiatica, helps to improve skin texture, enhance ingredient absorption, and hydrate and soothe the skin. This innovative product is known for its ability to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, improve skin elasticity, and brighten the complexion.','During night skincare routine, after washing your face, spread proper amount evenly and massage until absorbed.\r\nReedle shot 300 can be used every 3 days, but do not use with reedle shot 100 and 700 at the same time.\r\nDo not use with a device and after receiving cosmetic procedures, stop use when irritation occurs.','produits/IMG_20240909_000636_(540_x_720_pixel)_10083.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240909_000636_(540_x_720_pixel)_10083.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_000652_(540_x_720_pixel)_48716.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_000725_(540_x_720_pixel)_60076.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_000823_(540_x_720_pixel)_41288.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3951,'Fino Shampoo',NULL,130.000,'Fino Premium Touch Shampoo is a luxurious hair care product designed to revitalize damaged hair. With its blend of nourishing ingredients like royal jelly extract and PCA, it provides deep hydration, strengthens strands, and repairs cuticles. Ideal for dry, brittle, or color-treated hair, this shampoo offers a gentle cleanse while delivering exceptional results, leaving locks silky, smooth, and healthy.','Fully wet hair and scalp. Create a lather and massage well into the scalp to deep cleanse. Apply as needed. Rinse well.\r\n\r\nRecommended to be used 1-2 times a week. Gentle enough for everyday use.','produits/IMG_20240909_002028_(540_x_720_pixel)_55949.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240909_002028_(540_x_720_pixel)_55949.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_001956_(540_x_720_pixel)_47308.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_002200_(540_x_720_pixel)_89996.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_002106_(540_x_720_pixel)_81773.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3952,'A\'pieu Pure Block Daily Sun Cream',NULL,85.000,'A\'pieu Pure Block Daily Sun Cream is a lightweight, non-greasy sunscreen that provides broad-spectrum protection against harmful UV rays. It\'s formulated with a blend of physical and chemical filters to shield your skin from sun damage and premature aging. The lightweight texture absorbs quickly without leaving a white cast, making it ideal for everyday use. Enriched with soothing ingredients like aloe vera and watermelon extract, this sunscreen helps hydrate and soothe the skin while protecting it from the sun.','Use as last step of your skin care routine. Take an appropriate amount and gently spread over face. Pat to absorb.\r\nGently spread over areas vulnerable to sun exposure, including the neck, arms and legs.\r\nReapply as needed if you\'re spending a long time under the sun.','produits/IMG_20240909_003648_(540_x_720_pixel)_81209.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240909_003648_(540_x_720_pixel)_81209.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_004101_(540_x_720_pixel)_46921.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_004127_(540_x_720_pixel)_87983.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240909_003751_(540_x_720_pixel)_43963.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3953,'AHA BHA PHA Miracle Truecica Clear Pad',NULL,111.000,'AHA BHA PHA Miracle Truecica Clear Pad is a dual-sided pad that is infused with a blend of naturally-derived exfoliating acids, including AHAs, BHAs, and PHAs. These acids help to exfoliate the skin, remove dead skin cells, and reduce sebum production. The pads also contain Truecica, a plant extract that has soothing and anti-inflammatory properties.\r\nOverall, the AHA BHA PHA Miracle Truecica Clear Pad is a well-reviewed product that is said to be effective at exfoliating the skin and reducing breakouts. It is also gentle enough for sensitive skin.','After cleansing, leave the pad on the skin for 5 to 10 minutes. Gently pat in the remaining essence.','produits/IMG_20240914_210032_(540_x_720_pixel)_40118.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240914_210032_(540_x_720_pixel)_40118.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_210059_(540_x_720_pixel)_93520.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_210110_(540_x_720_pixel)_19155.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_210240_(540_x_720_pixel)_59536.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3954,'Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask',NULL,119.000,'Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask: A Natural Solution for Clear Skin\r\nThe Beauty of Joseon Red Bean Refreshing Pore Mask is a popular skincare product that utilizes the natural exfoliating properties of red bean extract to purify and refine pores. This gentle mask is designed to help reduce the appearance of large pores, clear away acne-causing debris, and improve overall skin texture.\r\nKey Benefits:\r\n * Gentle Exfoliation: Red bean extract acts as a natural exfoliant, removing dead skin cells and unclogging pores.\r\n * Pore Minimization: Helps reduce the appearance of large pores, leaving skin looking smoother and more refined.\r\n * Sebum Control: Absorbs excess sebum, preventing clogged pores and breakouts.\r\n * Refreshing Sensation: Provides a cooling and soothing effect on the skin.\r\n * Natural Ingredients: Formulated with natural ingredients, making it suitable for sensitive skin.','After cleansing, apply evenly on a dry face. After 5-10 minutes, gently massage with lukewarm water and rinse off.','produits/IMG_20240914_212923_(540_x_720_pixel)_48452.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240914_212923_(540_x_720_pixel)_48452.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_212950_(540_x_720_pixel)_32436.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_213044_(540_x_720_pixel)_98712.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_213124_(540_x_720_pixel)_47106.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3955,'Mielle Pomegranate and Honey Detangling Shampoo',NULL,130.000,'Tackle wash day with a Type 4 hair product made just for you. Mielle’s Pomegranate & Honey Moisturizing and Detangling Shampoo uses fresh ingredients like honey and babassu oil to lift dirt and oil from your hair while preserving much needed moisture. This shampoo works into a luxurious lather and has an amazing scent. Nothing works better at loosening tangles and adding slip. Follow up with our Detangling Conditioner, moisturize with our Leave-In Conditioner, and get creative with your choice of Pomegranate & Honey hair styling products. This sulfate-free shampoo is an absolute must for your healthy hair collection.','Apply a generous amount onto hands and massage into wet hair and scalp until it lathers. Gently finger-comb to pre-detangle. Rinse with warm water. Repeat as necessary. Follow with our Pomegranate &amp;amp;amp;amp; Honey Moisturizing and Detangling Conditioner.','produits/IMG_20240914_223220_(540_x_720_pixel)_12574.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240914_223220_(540_x_720_pixel)_12574.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_223233_(540_x_720_pixel)_24257.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_223317_(540_x_720_pixel)_61648.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_223356_(540_x_720_pixel)_77872.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3956,'Pomegranate and Honey Detangling Conditioner',NULL,130.000,'A Prime + Define™ styling system formulated for thick, curly hair resulting in intense hydration and silkiness. Mielle Organics Pomegranate & Honey Moisturizing and Detangling Conditioner provides this and more. This conditioner locks in moisture, strengthens thick curly hair, prevents breakage and split ends, and gives your hair an overall smooth, silky texture. Pair it with Mielle’s other thoughtfully made Type 4 hair products for a perfect hair care routine from start to finish. Add our Pomegranate & Honey Leave-In Conditioner to your order to prime wet hair for styling and create a defined finish. Your hair will thank you over and over again!','Apply the conditioner to wet hair, distributing along the length, from root to tip. Gently detangle the hair with a detangling brush or wide-toothed comb. Leave for 10-15 minutes, then rinse.','produits/IMG_20240914_225907_(540_x_720_pixel)_66729.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240914_225907_(540_x_720_pixel)_66729.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_225944_(540_x_720_pixel)_62536.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_230022_(540_x_720_pixel)_31138.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240914_223233_(540_x_720_pixel)_45650.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3957,'Snow White Spot Gel',NULL,130.000,'Snow White Spot Gel is a radiant remedy for dark spots, a skincare elixir that transforms dull skin into a luminous canvas. Its potent blend of brightening ingredients, such as niacinamide and arbutin, gently fades away blemishes, revealing a complexion that glows with youthful vitality. With consistent use, this luxurious gel unveils a more even, radiant skin tone, leaving you feeling confident and refreshed.','After your skin is clean and dry, apply a small amount of the gel directly to the dark spots or areas you want to lighten.','produits/IMG_20240915_001606_(540_x_720_pixel)_63812.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_001606_(540_x_720_pixel)_63812.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_001633_(540_x_720_pixel)_26172.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_001710_(540_x_720_pixel)_68633.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_001721_(540_x_720_pixel)_71994.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_001812_(540_x_720_pixel)_47271.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3958,'Dos Lunas Whitening, Moisturizing, and Nourishing Spray Blue',NULL,84.000,'Introducing our revolutionary Hydrating and Brightening Skin Mist. This innovative formula is designed to revitalize and enhance your complexion, leaving it radiant, soft, and smooth. Infused with a blend of nourishing ingredients, this lightweight, waterproof mist provides deep hydration while instantly brightening your skin tone.\r\nIdeal for sensitive areas, our gentle formula is free from harsh chemicals and irritants, making it suitable for even the most delicate skin. With just a few sprays, you can experience the transformative power of this exceptional product.','Shake well before use, Apply an appropriate amount Spray on the face and body 20 cm away from the face, please avoid contact with eyes.','produits/IMG_20240915_002259_(540_x_720_pixel)_99026.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_002259_(540_x_720_pixel)_99026.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_003527_(540_x_720_pixel)_53411.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_002359_(540_x_720_pixel)_56738.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_002413_(540_x_720_pixel)_53351.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3959,'Saemmul Perfect Curling Mascara',NULL,75.000,'The Saemmul Perfect Curling Mascara is a popular choice among beauty enthusiasts due to its impressive curling capabilities and affordable price. Known for its ability to lift and define lashes without smudging or fading, this mascara offers a great balance of volume and definition. While the formula can be a bit thick, it\'s generally considered a reliable and budget-friendly option for those seeking to enhance their lashes.','After using an eyelash primer, apply the mascara to your eyelashes from the roots in a zigzag motion.','produits/IMG_20240915_010430_(540_x_720_pixel)_33674.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_010430_(540_x_720_pixel)_33674.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_010747_(540_x_720_pixel)_78585.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_010804_(540_x_720_pixel)_56347.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_010809_(540_x_720_pixel)_81980.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3960,'Mixsoon Bean Cream',NULL,130.000,'Mixsoon Bean Cream is an intensively hydrating cream formulated with highly concentrated fermented soybean extract to nourish skin and maintain skin\'s oil-moisture levels. Also contains fermented pomegranate to smooth out bumpy skin texture for a more even, soft complexion, fermented barley to rejuvenate skin and fermented pear that is rich in vitamins C and E. With a dense and firm texture to keep skin moisturised for a long time.','After cleansing and toning, apply cream all over your face.','produits/IMG_20240915_152350_(540_x_720_pixel)_66564.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_152350_(540_x_720_pixel)_66564.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_152453_(540_x_720_pixel)_15557.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_152825_(540_x_720_pixel)_11131.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_153058_(540_x_720_pixel)_11179.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3961,'CICA Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,110.000,'The Vegan Cica Soothing Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++ is designed to provide comprehensive sun protection while soothing and hydrating irritated skin. Enriched with 10,000 ppm of Cica Complex, derived from seven key ingredients obtained through fermentation, this sun cream quickly calms skin damaged by UV rays. It also features hyaluronic acid and inositol, which deeply hydrate the skin, ensuring it stays moisturized and healthy.\r\n\r\nThis sun cream absorbs lightly like a moisturizing cream, leaving the skin smooth and hydrated without a sticky residue or white cast. Offering powerful sun protection with SPF50+ PA++++, it effectively shields the skin from harmful UV rays. Additionally, it boasts triple functionality, including UV protection, wrinkle improvement, and skin whitening, thanks to the inclusion of niacinamide and adenosine.\r\n\r\nCertified vegan and cruelty-free, the Vegan Cica Soothing Sun Cream is formulated without animal-derived ingredients and has not been tested on animals. It has undergone skin irritation testing to ensure it is safe for sensitive skin and is free from ingredients harmful to marine ecosystems. This makes it an excellent choice for those seeking effective, multi-functional sun protection that is gentle on the skin and the environment.','1. In the last step of skin care, take an appropriate amount of this product and spread evenly on the skin.\r\n2. It is recommended to apply thickly on areas highly exposed to UV rays.','produits/IMG_20240915_164021_(540_x_720_pixel)_82915.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_164021_(540_x_720_pixel)_82915.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_164033_(540_x_720_pixel)_95007.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_164239_(540_x_720_pixel)_89077.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_164351_(540_x_720_pixel)_29413.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3962,'MARY and MAY Hyaluronics Serum',NULL,130.000,'The MARY and MAY Hyaluronics Serum is a serum formulated with small molecular structure of hyaluronic acid that penetrates the skin between skin cells and moisturize from within. Effectively replenishes hydration with hyaluronic acid that holds 1000 times of its weight in water, leaving plump and supple skin. The hyaluronic acid helps to hold moisture to the skin\'s surface by preventing evaporation, retaining hydrated skin.','Take a proper amount using the dropper.\r\nGently massage on skin following the skin\'s texture.\r\nReapply on the dry eye area.','produits/IMG_20240915_170206_(540_x_720_pixel)_61105.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_170206_(540_x_720_pixel)_61105.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_170247_(540_x_720_pixel)_89989.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_170327_(540_x_720_pixel)_11617.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_170403_(540_x_720_pixel)_73083.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3963,'MARY and MAY Niacinamide + Chaenomeles Sinensis Serum',NULL,130.000,'MARY & MAY Niacinamide + Chaenomeles Sinensis Serum is face serum formulated with Niacinamide and Chaenomeles Sinensis Extract to brighten up dull and unbalanced skin. Contains 2% Niacinamide to lighten skin by inhibiting the transfer of melanosomes and regulate sebum production for balanced skin and enriched with 93% Chaenomeles Sinensis Fruit Extract that is rich in Vitamin C and Flavonoids for smooth and radiant skin appearance.','Take a proper amount using the dropper.\r\nGently massage on skin following the skin\'s texture.','produits/IMG_20240915_171310_(540_x_720_pixel)_77731.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_171310_(540_x_720_pixel)_77731.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_171321_(540_x_720_pixel)_95590.png\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_171420_(540_x_720_pixel)_68609.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_171545_(540_x_720_pixel)_87573.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3964,'MARY and MAY Marine Collagen Serum',NULL,130.000,'MARY and MAY Marine Collagen Serum is filled with 95% low-molecular marine collagen to reduce wrinkles without leaving a greasy feel. It adheres to the brand’s clean beauty concept by keeping ingredients to a minimum and refraining from animal testing. Delivers a boost of collagen to the skin to restore firm skin and refine visible wrinkles without feeling greasy. Addressing the symptoms of aging skin and hydrates parched skin. Formulated with EWG verified green grade ingredients.','Take a proper amount using the dropper.\r\nGently massage on skin following the skin\'s texture.','produits/IMG_20240915_172614_(540_x_720_pixel)_62826.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_172614_(540_x_720_pixel)_62826.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_172939_(540_x_720_pixel)_66215.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_173008_(540_x_720_pixel)_29859.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_173111_(540_x_720_pixel)_85735.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3965,'Jadayel - Anti Hair Loss oil',NULL,128.000,'Discover with it the secret of shiny, healthy hair strands and forget about hair loss. It is a mixture of the most exceptional natural oils and nourishing and effective materials. It works to strengthen the foundation of your hair, nourishes the roots, removes the specter of hair loss, and solves various problems such as breakage and dryness. It is a promise of softness, strength and shine.','Discover with it the secret of shiny, healthy hair strands and forget about hair loss. It is a mixture of the most exceptional natural oils and nourishing and effective materials. It works to strengthen the foundation of your hair, nourishes the roots, removes the specter of hair loss, and solves various problems such as breakage and dryness. It is a promise of softness, strength and shine.','produits/IMG_20240915_182127_(540_x_720_pixel)_34175.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_182127_(540_x_720_pixel)_34175.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_184457_(540_x_720_pixel)_47234.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_184535_(540_x_720_pixel)_83025.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_184608_(540_x_720_pixel)_56970.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3966,'Jadayel - Hair Tonic oil',NULL,128.000,'This unique blend is produced with the special active oils like olive, patchouli, coconut, almonds, mustard and bay leaves, and more than 30 natural herbs that will nourish the roots and the ends of your hair giving it a healthy shine and vivacity.','Jadayel - Hair Tonic','produits/IMG_20240915_192138_(540_x_720_pixel)_76837.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_192138_(540_x_720_pixel)_76837.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_192206_(540_x_720_pixel)_24117.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_192251_(540_x_720_pixel)_94860.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_192302_(540_x_720_pixel)_17870.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3967,'Jadayel Anti Dandruff &amp;amp;amp;amp; Conditioner',NULL,128.000,'This unique blend from Abdul Samad Al Qurashi effectively conquers dandruff with its powerful ingredient, selenium sulfide. Combined with sesame oil, coconut oil, olive oil, ginger oil, and over 30 natural herbs, it adds softness and enriches your hair with active nutrients.','Apply the oil on hair and massage the scalp by hand for two minutes to allow the oil reaching the roots of the hair. Leave it for one hour before washing it. Use twice a week','produits/IMG_20240915_195929_(540_x_720_pixel)_73633.jpg',NULL,1,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240915_195929_(540_x_720_pixel)_73633.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_195954_(540_x_720_pixel)_47337.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_200019_(540_x_720_pixel)_58340.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240915_200047_(540_x_720_pixel)_73388.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3968,'Mary and May Vegan Calendula Peptide Ageless Sleeping Mask',NULL,130.000,'Revitalize your skin overnight with the MARY & MAY Calendula Peptide Ageless Sleeping Mask. This vegan, clinically tested gel mask is infused with 2,200ppm of calendula extract, 25 types of peptides, and cica extract to soothe inflammation, repair damage, and calm irritation while you sleep. \r\n\r\nEnhanced with hyaluronic acid for deep hydration and Guaiazulene from chamomile to reduce redness, it leaves your skin plump, radiant, and nourished by morning. Perfect for sensitive skin, this lightweight, EWG-verified formula adheres smoothly, delivering powerful active ingredients to rejuvenate your complexion as you rest.','At the last step of skin care in the evening, take an appropriate amount and apply on the face, avoiding the eye and mouth areas. \r\nGently rinse your face the next morning with lukewarm water.','produits/IMG_20240916_122731_(540_x_720_pixel)_99123.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20240916_122731_(540_x_720_pixel)_99123.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240916_122804_(540_x_720_pixel)_14220.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240916_122859_(540_x_720_pixel)_89401.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240916_123322_(540_x_720_pixel)_69985.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20240916_123328_(540_x_720_pixel)_81029.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3969,'Luminous Duo',NULL,130.000,'Introducing the K-SECRET Whitening and Brightening Duo: Your Path to Radiant Skin <br>\r\n<br>\r\nOur powerful duo, featuring the K-SECRET Real Vita C Ampoule and Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Bar, is designed to revitalize your skin. Packed with essential vitamins and hydrolyzed collagen, these products work together to reduce dark spots, minimize wrinkles, and promote a radiant, youthful complexion. Experience the transformative power of K-SECRET and unlock your skin\'s natural beauty.','* Cleanse your face with the K-SECRET Vita Collagen Secret Whitening Bar.\r\n * Pat your face dry.\r\n * Apply a few drops of the K-SECRET Real Vita C Ampoule to your face and neck.\r\n * Massage gently until absorbed.\r\n * Use daily for best results.',NULL,NULL,6,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3970,'KSECRET - SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean',NULL,106.000,'Discover the Fountain of Youth for Your Eyes <br>\r\n<br>\r\nIntroducing SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean, a revolutionary anti-aging and brightening eye cream that rejuvenates your delicate skin. With a potent blend of Retinal Liposome, Bakuchiol, Vitamins C and E, peptides, and soothing herbal extracts, this luxurious formula targets wrinkles, dark circles, and uneven skin tone, revealing a more youthful, radiant complexion. Experience the transformative power of SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream : Retinal Liposome 4% + Fermented Bean and unlock the secret to timeless beauty. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 30 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply a moderate amount to the skin evenly and gently pat it for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20241010_005317_(540_x_720_pixel)_82259.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_005317_(540_x_720_pixel)_82259.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_005350_(540_x_720_pixel)_98777.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_005418_(540_x_720_pixel)_26758.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_005454_(540_x_720_pixel)_26760.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_010540_(540_x_720_pixel)_99208.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_010630_(540_x_720_pixel)_59189.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011417_(540_x_720_pixel)_39658.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011427_(540_x_720_pixel)_47059.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011434_(540_x_720_pixel)_45855.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011442_(540_x_720_pixel)_57305.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3971,'KSECRET - SEOUL 1988 Cream : Retinal Liposome 1% + Fermented Rice',NULL,132.000,'Unleash the Power of Youthful Skin with Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream <br>\r\n<br>\r\nExperience a transformative journey to radiant, youthful skin with Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream, a luxurious anti-aging and brightening cream. Formulated with a potent blend of cutting-edge ingredients, this innovative product targets wrinkles, dark circles, and uneven skin tone, revealing a more vibrant, youthful complexion. <br>\r\nAt the heart of Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream lies Retinal Liposome, a revolutionary retinol delivery system that penetrates deeply into your skin to stimulate collagen production and reduce the appearance of fine lines. Bakuchiol, a gentle yet effective alternative to retinol, works synergistically with Vitamins C and E to brighten dark circles, hyperpigmentation, and uneven skin tone. <br>\r\nA trio of peptides further enhances collagen synthesis, resulting in firmer, smoother skin and a reduction in wrinkles. To soothe and calm irritated skin, Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream is infused with five soothing herbal root extracts and Lactobacillus/Panax Ginseng Root Ferment Filtrate, providing antioxidant protection and promoting a healthy, balanced complexion.\r\nThe smooth, creamy texture of Seoul 1988 Retinal Cream absorbs quickly, providing lasting moisture without stickiness and leaving a silky-smooth finish. With regular use, you\'ll experience a visible improvement in your skin\'s texture, tone, and overall appearance.  <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 50 ml','After cleansing and toning, apply a moderate amount to the skin evenly and gently pat it for better absorption.','produits/IMG_20241010_011417_(540_x_720_pixel)_82306.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_011417_(540_x_720_pixel)_82306.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011427_(540_x_720_pixel)_87923.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011434_(540_x_720_pixel)_20236.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_011442_(540_x_720_pixel)_82014.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3972,'The Retinol 0.3 Cream',NULL,123.000,'0.3% pure retinol with three times the strength\r\n\r\nExperience the full power of retinol with a concentration three times higher than that of The Retinol 0.1 Cream. This formula optimally stabilizes the high retinol content. Recommended for those already familiar with retinol products, this mid-strength retinol cream helps achieve smooth skin, improves texture, enhances elasticity, and reduces wrinkles. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Normal, Combination, Oily\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 20 ml','WEEK 1~2 \r\n\r\n\r\n&bull; Frequency : use 3 times a week at night\r\n&bull; How to Use : start with 0.3 of cream to concerned areas. Gradually increase frequency and areas of application.\r\n\r\n\r\nWEEK 3~ \r\n\r\n\r\n&bull; Frequency : may apply every other day at night\r\n&bull; How to use : apply pea-sized amount and may spread over entire face\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* To maintain the freshness of retinol ingredients, avoid storing in high temperatures and direct sunlight.\r\n* Since this product can increase sensitivity to sunlight, use sunscreen while using the product.\r\n* Do not pair with any scrub, peeling or exfoliating product as it can irritate the skin.','produits/IMG_20241010_013530_(540_x_720_pixel)_93133.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_013530_(540_x_720_pixel)_93133.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013627_(540_x_720_pixel)_28912.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013654_(540_x_720_pixel)_10390.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013724_(540_x_720_pixel)_63000.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013753_(540_x_720_pixel)_68190.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_013817_(540_x_720_pixel)_70530.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3973,'Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic',NULL,135.000,'Restore Your Hair\'s Vitality with Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic\r\nExperience a transformative haircare solution designed to combat hair loss and revitalize your scalp. Our innovative formula, enriched with CICA, peptides, Black Complex, and Biotin, nourishes and strengthens your hair follicles, promoting healthy hair growth. Free from harmful ingredients and dermatologically tested, Cica Peptide Anti Hair Loss Derma Scalp Tonic is the gentle yet effective solution for revitalizing your hair.','1. Shake well before using. Divide the sections with fingers and spray the tonic onto scalp.\r\n2. Massage the scalp afterwards for a better absorption.','produits/IMG_20241010_015014_(540_x_720_pixel)_98916.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_015014_(540_x_720_pixel)_98916.png\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_015057_(540_x_720_pixel)_11442.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_015121_(540_x_720_pixel)_94867.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_015153_(540_x_720_pixel)_89153.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3974,'Tone Brightening Capsule Ampoule',NULL,150.000,'Discover the transformative power of Skin 1004 Tone Brightening Capsule Ampoule, a concentrated serum designed to illuminate your skin. Packed with potent ingredients, including Centella Asiatica Extract, Niacinamide, Tranexamic Acid, 3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid, and Madecassoside, this ampoule effectively targets dullness, uneven skin tone, and hyperpigmentation, revealing a brighter, more radiant complexion while calming the skin.\r\nExperience the power of concentrated skincare and unlock the secret to a luminous glow. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nSkin type: Dry, Normal, Combination, Oily, Sensitive.\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 100 ml','Drop an appropriate amount and evenly apply to the skin. Pat to promote absorption.','produits/IMG_20241010_020938_(540_x_720_pixel)_21302.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_020938_(540_x_720_pixel)_21302.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_020607_(540_x_720_pixel)_41061.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_020848_(540_x_720_pixel)_53975.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_020924_(540_x_720_pixel)_88900.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3975,'Smart Scalp Massager',NULL,75.000,'Smart Scalp Massager\r\nIndulge in a luxurious scalp massage at home with our innovative Smart Scalp Massager.\r\nDesigned to mimic the soothing touch of human fingers, this advanced device provides a deep, relaxing massage that promotes hair health and relieves stress.\r\nKey Features:\r\n * Deep Tissue Massage: Our unique massage heads penetrate deep into the scalp, stimulating blood flow and promoting hair growth.\r\n * Relieves Tension: Experience instant relaxation as the massager eases away tension and stress.\r\n * Improves Hair Health: Increased blood circulation nourishes hair follicles, promoting thicker, healthier hair.\r\n * Wireless and Portable: Enjoy a massage anytime, anywhere with its cordless design.\r\n * Adjustable Intensity: Customize your massage experience with multiple intensity settings.','To use the Smart Scalp Massager, simply turn it on, adjust the intensity, and gently move it in circular motions across your scalp. Enjoy a relaxing and rejuvenating massage!','produits/IMG_20241010_194112_(540_x_720_pixel)_97920.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_194112_(540_x_720_pixel)_97920.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_194136_(540_x_720_pixel)_65470.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_194222_(540_x_720_pixel)_11715.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_194320_(540_x_720_pixel)_95902.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3976,'Perfect Hanbang Sun Trio',NULL,298.000,'Embrace comprehensive sun protection with the Perfect Hanbang Sun Trio, a curated set featuring three of Beauty of Joseon\'s signature sun care products. Each formula is designed to protect your skin from damaging UV rays while offering a variety of skincare benefits rooted in the Hanbang tradition (traditional Korean herbal medicine).\r\n\r\nWhat is inside?\r\n1. Relief Sun : Rice + Probiotics (SPF50+ PA++++)\r\n   - Relief Sun is an organic sunscreen with a lightweight, creamy texture. It leaves a non-sticky, moist finish even with repeated applications. Infused with 30% rice extract and grain-fermented extracts, it hydrates and nourishes the skin.\r\n\r\n2. Matte Sun Stick : Mugwort+Camelia (SPF 50+ PA++++)\r\n   - Matte Sun Stick provides seamless, non-sticky protection. Even with multiple applications over makeup, it remains smooth, regulating sebum for a matte finish. Infused with artemisia capillaris and green tea, it ensures skin stays moisturized and smooth.\r\n3. Ginseng Moist Sun Serum (SPF 50+ PA++++)\r\n   - UV rays can age and damage our skin. Sunscreen use is crucial, but many skip it due to its typical drawbacks like oily texture and white cast. With our Ginseng Moist Sun Serum, enriched with ginseng, its unique, non-greasy formula nourishes the skin, fights aging, and provides comprehensive UV protection.','Use on face','produits/IMG_20241010_203057_(540_x_720_pixel)_19747.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241010_203057_(540_x_720_pixel)_19747.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_203143_(540_x_720_pixel)_43190.png\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_203231_(540_x_720_pixel)_53748.png\", \"produits/IMG_20241010_203356_(540_x_720_pixel)_25898.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3977,'SHISEIDO - Fino Premium Touch Conditioner',NULL,130.000,'Fino Premium Touch Conditioner is a deep-conditioning treatment designed to revitalize damaged hair. Infused with royal jelly extract, PCA, and Lipidure EX, it moisturizes, strengthens, and repairs hair from within. Ideal for dry, brittle, or chemically treated hair, this conditioner penetrates deep into the hair shaft to restore its natural shine, softness, and manageability. With its rich formula and pleasant fragrance, Fino Premium Touch leaves hair feeling healthy, hydrated, and effortlessly beautiful. <br>\r\n<br>\r\nVolume: 550 ml','After washing your hair with shampoo, please take an appropriate amount of conditioner.\r\nApply evenly to the middle and ends of hair and massage gently.\r\nRinse thoroughly with warm water.','produits/IMG_20241011_095630_(540_x_720_pixel)_49849.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241011_095630_(540_x_720_pixel)_49849.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_095642_(540_x_720_pixel)_83461.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_095652_(540_x_720_pixel)_95081.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_095700_(540_x_720_pixel)_70647.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3978,'Secret Key - Snow White Milky Lotion',NULL,130.000,'The Snow White Milky Pack is a luxurious skincare treatment designed to brighten, even out, and hydrate your skin. Infused with a potent blend of natural ingredients, this creamy lotion works to reduce the appearance of dark spots, hyperpigmentation, and dullness, leaving you with a glowing, luminous complexion.','After cleansing, apply at the initial stages of your skin care routine. Gently pat to absorb.\r\nTip: Snow White Milky Lotion can be used on your arms, legs and body - anywhere that requires a whitening effect.','produits/IMG_20241011_194352_(540_x_720_pixel)_35142.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241011_194352_(540_x_720_pixel)_35142.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_194457_(540_x_720_pixel)_36378.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_194552_(540_x_720_pixel)_71642.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_194618_(540_x_720_pixel)_46521.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3979,'MARY AND MAY - Vegan Primer Glow Sun Cream SPF50+ PA++++',NULL,110.000,'Transform your skin with the powerful fusion of natural ingredients in the Vegan Primer Glow Sun Cream. This multi-tasking cream delivers deep hydration, brightens the complexion, and provides essential sun protection, making it the ultimate skincare solution for a radiant, healthy glow. Enriched with fermented kombucha and pomegranate extract, this lightweight, vegan-friendly cream works wonders on all skin types to visibly enhance skin texture and tone.','1. In the last step of skin care, take an appropriate amount of this product and spread evenly on the skin.\r\n\r\n2. It is recommended to apply thickly on areas highly exposed to UV rays.','produits/IMG_20241011_221227_(540_x_720_pixel)_53959.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241011_221227_(540_x_720_pixel)_53959.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_221316_(540_x_720_pixel)_80325.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_221351_(540_x_720_pixel)_55482.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_221934_(540_x_720_pixel)_47022.jpg\", \"produits/IMG_20241011_221424_(540_x_720_pixel)_79968.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3980,'I\'M FROM  Rice Sunscreen',NULL,117.000,'I’M FROM Rice Sunscreen is a mineral sunscreen that contains 41% Goami Rice Extracts from Yeoju, South Korea which can help remove skin impurities for a softer and smoother skin texture and brighter complexion.\r\n\r\nRice Sunscreen has completed the SPF testing on human skin with the result of SPF 50+ PA++++. Contains Non-nano Zinc Oxide that can block both UVA and UVB and is less likely to penetrate human skin, and does not contain Oxybenzone and Octinoxate which is harmful to the coral and marine ecosystem. A sunscreen that not only protects skin from UV rays but at the same time also has excellent effects in soothing and calming the skin irritated by UV radiation.\r\n\r\nAs a 100% mineral base sunscreen, it has a moist and silky texture that lightly coats and quickly blends into the skin without leaving any stickiness. This product also has a pleasant scent, recommended for those who prefer fragrant skincare products.\r\n\r\nVolume: 50 ml','After your daytime moisturizer, use a sufficient amount and spread gently on the face, and body parts easily exposed to sunlight. Add another coat to areas more vulnerable to UV rays such as the forehead and nose. For outdoor activities, reapply every 4 hours to block UV rays more effectively.','produits/IMG_20241011_223254_(540_x_720_pixel)_