-8 to deliver deep hydration, soothe the skin, and boost collagen production.\r\nHere are some of the key benefits of TIRTIR SOS Serum:\r\n * Deep hydration: Polyglutamic acid (PGA) is a powerful humectant that can hold up to 10 times more water than hyaluronic acid. This helps to hydrate your skin deeply and keep it plump and supple.\r\n * Soothing and calming: Witch hazel and chamomile have anti-inflammatory properties that can help to soothe irritated skin and reduce redness.\r\n * Boost collagen production: Acetyl Hexapeptide-8 is a peptide that helps to stimulate collagen production, which can help to improve skin elasticity and reduce the appearance of wrinkles.','Apply an appropriate amount evenly onto face and pat gently for better absorption.\r\nNotice: Please note that the expiry','produits/1000000723_70534.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000723_70534.jpg\", \"produits/1000000724_53000.jpg\", \"produits/1000000725_75313.jpg\", \"produits/1000000726_92409.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3987,'MEDI-PEEL - Red Lacto Collagen Wrapping Mask',NULL,150.000,'MEDI-PEEL Red Lacto Collagen Wrapping Mask is a popular Korean skincare product designed to address various skin concerns, particularly those related to aging and pore visibility. It\'s known for its ability to:\r\n * Lift and minimize pores: The collagen wrapping helps to tighten and reduce the appearance of enlarged pores.\r\n * Enhance skin elasticity: The collagen content promotes skin firmness and reduces the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\n * Hydrate the skin: The mask provides deep hydration, leaving the skin feeling soft and supple.\r\n * Brighten the complexion: It helps to improve skin radiance and a youthful glow.','1. After washing your face, apply an appropriate amount to the entire face, excluding the eyes and mouth, as the final step in skin care.\r\n2. After drying sufficiently to form a transparent film, remove from the edge or thoroughly rinse with warm water.','produits/1000000738_84527.png',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000738_84527.png\", \"produits/1000000739_47888.png\", \"produits/1000000740_78416.png\", \"produits/1000000741_70427.jpg\", \"produits/1000000742_96497.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3988,'Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Toner',NULL,102.000,'The Galactomyces Pure Vitamin C Glow Toner by SOME BY MI is a popular Korean skincare product that combines the benefits of galactomyces ferment filtrate and vitamin C to brighten, hydrate, and smooth the skin.\r\nKey Ingredients and Benefits:\r\n * Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate (88%): This fermented ingredient helps to exfoliate dead skin cells, improve skin texture, and brighten the complexion.\r\n * Vitamin C (1%): This powerful antioxidant helps to reduce hyperpigmentation, boost collagen production, and protect the skin from environmental damage.\r\n * Niacinamide: This ingredient helps to reduce redness, improve skin tone, and strengthen the skin barrier.','After cleansing, apply all over face and gently tap for absorption.','produits/1000000751_44753.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000000751_44753.jpg\", \"produits/1000000750_89348.jpg\", \"produits/1000000752_29224.jpg\", \"produits/1000000753_20586.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(3989,'Lacto Soy Low pH Morning Cleansing B',NULL,65.000,'Lacto Soy Low pH Morning Cleansing Bar is a gentle, fragrance-free, non-comedogenic and moisturizing Korean low pH bar soap cleanser for all skin types, including sensitive skin.\r\nIt is formulated with Lacto Soy, a fermented soybean extract that helps to gently remove impurities and dead skin cells, while also restoring the skin\'s natural pH balance. It is also enriched with Hydrolyzed Soy Protein Extract and 3 types of vegetable oil to moisturize the skin.\r\nThe bar produces a rich and fine lather that provides a mild yet 