rated throughout the day. Say goodbye to dryness and hello to soft, supple lips.\r\nLightweight Texture: The lightweight, water-based formula glides on effortlessly, providing a smooth, comfortable feel without any stickiness. It offers a natural-looking sheen that enhances your lip color without overwhelming it.\r\nVibrant Color: Available in a range of stunning shades, this lip tint delivers rich, vibrant color with a single application. The buildable formula allows you to customize the intensity to suit your desired look.\r\nLong-Lasting Wear: Despite its dewy finish, the tint offers long-lasting color that stays vibrant throughout the day. Enjoy a fresh look from morning to night with minimal touch-ups.','Apply a moderate amount on the lips with the applicator included.','produits/1000001214_41647.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001214_41647.jpg\", \"produits/1000001215_12799.jpg\", \"produits/1000001216_41004.jpg\", \"produits/1000001217_38492.jpg\", \"produits/1000001218_33898.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4002,'Macqueen - Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint #03 Peach Dew',NULL,58.000,'Achieve the ultimate in lip hydration and luminous color with Macqueen Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint. This luxurious lip tint is designed to provide a fresh, dewy finish while delivering intense moisture and vibrant color for a perfectly polished look.\r\n\r\nKey Features of the Macqueen Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint:\r\n\r\nDewy Finish: The innovative formula imparts a beautiful, dewy glow to your lips, giving them a fresh, radiant appearance. Enjoy a hydrated, plump look that enhances your natural beauty.\r\nHydrating Formula: Enriched with moisturizing ingredients, the Dewy Water Glow Lip Tint keeps your lips nourished and hydrated throughout the day. Say goodbye to dryness and hello to soft, supple lips.\r\nLightweight Texture: The lightweight, water-based formula glides on effortlessly, providing a smooth, comfortable feel without any