ngle application. The buildable formula allows you to customize the intensity to suit your desired look.\r\nLong-Lasting Wear: Despite its dewy finish, the tint offers long-lasting color that stays vibrant throughout the day. Enjoy a fresh look from morning to night with minimal touch-ups.','Apply a moderate amount on the lips with the applicator included.','produits/1000001229_85192.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001229_85192.jpg\", \"produits/1000001230_27006.jpg\", \"produits/1000001224_11579.jpg\", \"produits/1000001217_25394.jpg\", \"produits/1000001218_38545.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4004,'peripera ink velvet lip tint #01 good brick',NULL,54.000,'Fall in love with your lips all over again. Peripera Ink the Velvet Lip Tint is the perfect way to add a touch of glamour to your everyday look.\r\n * Long-lasting: The formula is designed to stay on your lips for hours without fading or smudging.\r\n * High-pigmented: The intense color payoff allows for a bold lip look with just one swipe.\r\n * Velvety matte finish: The unique texture creates a soft, blurred effect on the lips, minimizing the appearance of fine lines.','Apply directly to lips. Start in the center of lips and smooth out-wards toward corners of mouth.','produits/1000001240_81022.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001240_81022.jpg\", \"produits/1000001241_42198.png\", \"produits/1000001242_44074.jpg\", \"produits/1000001243_13428.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4005,'Lacto Soy Sebum &amp;amp;amp;amp; Blackhead Cleansing Oil',NULL,125.000,'Lacto Soy Sebum Blackhead Cleansing Oil is a gentle yet effective cleansing oil that helps remove blackheads and excess sebum. It is formulated with Lacto Soy, a blend of soy milk ferment filtrate and lactobacillus, which helps to detoxify the skin and boost moisture levels. The oil also contains vegetable oils and the brand patented Anti Sebum P, which helps to control oil production and improve pore condition.\r\nThis cleansing oil is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. It is also vegan and free of 28 potentially irritating ingredients.\r\nBenefits:\r\n Helps remove blackheads and excess sebum\r\n Detoxifies the skin\r\n Boosts moisture levels\r\n Controls oil production\r\n Improves pore condition\r\n Gentle and effective\r\n Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin\r\n Vegan and free of 28 potentially irritating ingredients','1. Shake for 4-5 times before use.\r\n2. Dispense an appropriate amount on hands and massage all over the face.\r\n3. After thorougly cleansing, rinse off with lukewarm water.','produits/1000001251_60682.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001251_60682.jpg\", \"produits/1000001253_89080.jpg\", \"produits/1000001254_26253.jpg\", \"produits/1000001255_30427.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4006,'VT - Reedle Shot 100 2 Step Mask',NULL,35.000,'VT\'s Reedle Shot 100 2 Step Mask is a two-step skincare routine designed to hydrate and soothe the skin. The first step contains CICA Reedle, a technology that mimics microneedling to deliver low-molecular active ingredients deep into the skin. The second step is a mask that locks in moisture and enhances the effectiveness of the first step.\r\nHere are some of the benefits of the VT Reedle Shot 100 2 Step Mask:\r\n * Hydrates and soothes the skin\r\n * Improves skin texture\r\n * Minimizes the appearance of pores\r\n * Suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin','1. After washing your face in the evening, apply an appropriate amount of STEP 1 Reddle Shot to your face and spread it over your face.\r\n2. After STEP 1 Reedle Shot is absorbed, STEP 2 Open the Reedle Shot Mask and attach it to the skin.\r\n3. After resting for about 10 to 20 minutes, remove the mask sheet and lightly tap the remaining essence on the skin to absorb it.','produits/1000001266_30512.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001266_30512.jpg\", \"produits/1000001267_44490.jpg\", \"produits/1000001268_31349.jpg\", \"produits/1000001269_31396.png\", \"produits/1000001272_44115.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4007,'VT - Reedle Shot All In One 3 Step Mask',NULL,35.000,'The VT Reedle Shot All-In-One 3 Step Mask is a popular Korean skincare product that promises to hydrate and revitalize your skin. It consists of three steps:\r\nStep 1: Reedle Shot 300\r\nThis essence is formulated with hyaluronic acid and amino acids to hydrate and plump the skin. It also contains VT\'s patented CICA REEDLE&trade; technology, which uses micro-needles to help ingredients penetrate deeper into the skin.\r\nStep 2: Reedle Shot Mask\r\nThis sheet mask is infused with peptides, panthenol, and hyaluronic acid to further hydrate and soothe the skin. It also helps to reduce the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles.\r\nStep 3: Reedle Shot Cream\r\nThis cream locks in moisture and helps to repair the skin barrier. It also contains CICA REEDLE&trade; technology to help ingredients penetrate deeper into the skin.\r\nOverall, the VT Reedle Shot All-In-One 3 Step Mask is a great option for those looking to hydrate and revitalize their skin. It is gentle enough for daily use and can be used on all skin types.\r\nHere are some additional things to keep in mind:\r\n * The mask may cause a slight tingling sensation due to the CICA REEDLE&trade; technology. This is normal and should go away after a few minutes.\r\n * It is important to follow the instructions on the packaging carefully.\r\n * Be sure to use sunscreen during the day, as the mask may make your skin more sensitive to the sun.','1. Apply an appropriate amount of Reedle Shot 300 to the face after washing. Massage the formula across the face.\r\n2. After Reedle Shot 300 is fully absorbed, fix the sheet mask onto the face. Remove the mask after 10-20 minutes, lightly tapping the remaining essence into the skin.\r\n3. Apply an appropriate amount of the Reedle Shot Lifting Cream on the skin.','produits/1000001279_82884.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001279_82884.jpg\", \"produits/1000001280_37983.jpg\", \"produits/1000001281_32066.jpg\", \"produits/1000001282_36117.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4008,'Abib Hydration Gel Water Tube',NULL,140.000,'Quench your skin\'s thirst with Abib\'s Hydration Gel Water Tube. This lightweight, oil-free gel moisturizer delivers intense hydration without leaving a greasy residue. Perfect for oily and combination skin, it locks in moisture, leaving your skin soft, supple, and dewy.\r\nKey Benefits:\r\n * Lightweight and non-greasy\r\n * Intense hydration\r\n * Oil-free\r\n * Suitable for oily and combination skin\r\n * Dewy finish','1. Take a moderate amount and apply to the entire face.\r\n2. Gently pat for better absorption.','produits/1000001289_11227.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001289_11227.jpg\", \"produits/1000001290_66325.jpg\", \"produits/1000001291_19139.jpg\", \"produits/1000001292_26381.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4009,'haruharu wonder - Black Rice Moisture 5.5 Soft Cleansing Gel',NULL,120.000,'Haruharu Wonder Black Rice Moisture 5.5 Soft Cleansing Gel\r\nA gentle, hydrating cleanse for radiant skin.\r\nThis pH-balanced gel cleanser, infused with fermented black rice extract, gently removes impurities without stripping your skin\'s natural moisture barrier. Its soft, foamy texture leaves your skin feeling refreshed, hydrated, and nourished.\r\nKey benefits:\r\n * Gentle cleansing: Removes impurities without irritation\r\n * Hydrating formula: Keeps skin moisturized\r\n * Soothes and calms: Reduces redness and inflammation\r\n * Brightens skin: Promotes a radiant complexion\r\nPerfect for:\r\n * All skin types, especially sensitive and dry skin\r\nExperience the transformative power of fermented black rice with Haruharu Wonder\'s gentle and effective cleanser.','1. Take a moderate amount and lather up.\r\n2. Massage the face gently with rich foam and rinse off thoroughly with lukewarm water.','produits/1000001302_35993.jpg',NULL,5,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001302_35993.jpg\", \"produits/1000001305_19890.png\", \"produits/1000001304_80337.jpg\", \"produits/1000001303_97231.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4010,'Full fit Propolis Light Ampoule',NULL,111.000,'Give your skin a radiant boost with the COSRX Full Fit Propolis Light Ampoule. This lightweight, hydrating formula is packed with propolis extract, a natural bee product known for its soothing and nourishing properties.\r\nBenefits:\r\n * Deep Hydration: Quenches thirsty skin for a plump, dewy complexion.\r\n * Soothing Relief: Calms redness and irritation, leaving skin feeling comforted.\r\n * Radiant Glow: Promotes a healthy, luminous complexion.\r\n * Lightweight Texture: Absorbs quickly without leaving a greasy residue.','Apply evenly after cleansing and toning step. Gently massage and pat over entire face for quick absorption and proceed to moisturizer step','produits/1000001316_57730.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001316_57730.jpg\", \"produits/1000001317_96598.jpg\", \"produits/1000001318_10084.jpg\", \"produits/1000001319_28713.jpg\", \"produits/1000001320_27656.jpg\", \"produits/1000001321_76077.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4011,'Pure Fit Cica Cleanser',NULL,110.000,'The Pure Fit Cica Cleanser is formulated with a high concentration of Centella Asiatica extract, also known as cica, which is known for its soothing and healing properties. This makes it a great option for those with irritated or inflamed skin.\r\nThe cleanser has a creamy texture that lathers into a gentle foam. It effectively removes dirt, oil, and makeup without stripping the skin of its natural moisture. Many users appreciate its mildness and how it leaves their skin feeling clean and refreshed without any tightness or dryness.\r\nSome of the key benefits of the Pure Fit Cica Cleanser include:\r\n  Soothing and calming: The high concentration of cica helps to reduce redness and irritation.\r\n  Gentle cleansing: The creamy formula is gentle on the skin and does not disrupt the skin natural barrier.\r\n  Hydrating: The cleanser helps to maintain the skin moisture balance.\r\n Non comedogenic: It will not clog pores.','Gently massage the cleanser onto damp skin.\r\nRinse thoroughly with warm water.','produits/1000001331_20785.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/1000001331_20785.jpg\", \"produits/1000001332_22893.jpg\", \"produits/1000001333_32745.jpg\", \"produits/1000001334_75729.png\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4012,'Glow Getter Essentials',NULL,500.000,'Elevate your beauty routine with this curated collection of must-have products. From nourishing your skin to enhancing your features, this bundle has it all.\r\nThis set includes: \r\n* K-secret Collagen Vita Secret Multi Balm\r\n* Cqmong Diamond Ampoule Mask\r\n* A\'pieu Pure Block Daily Sun Cream\r\n* Pinkflash Face Palette\r\n* Etude dear darling Oil Tint 06','CLSC hh','produits/IMG_20241129_133919_(540_x_720_pixel)_71772.jpg',NULL,7,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241129_133919_(540_x_720_pixel)_71772.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL),(4013,'Seoul 1988 Full skincare Routine',NULL,445.000,'K-Secret Seoul 1988 Bundle: Elevate Your Skincare Routine\r\nIndulge in the luxurious and transformative power of K-Secret Seoul 1988\'s skincare essentials with this curated bundle. Experience the perfect synergy of natural ingredients and innovative technology, meticulously crafted to address a spectrum of skin concerns and unveil a radiant complexion.\r\nBundle Includes:\r\n * SEOUL 1988 Essence: Infused with snail mucin and rice ferment filtrate, this essence provides deep hydration, soothes irritation, and preps your skin for optimal absorption of the following products.\r\n * SEOUL 1988 Serum: Enriched with retinal liposome and black ginseng extract, this serum targets wrinkles, pigmentation, and uneven skin tone, promoting a visibly firmer and brighter complexion.\r\n * SEOUL 1988 Eye Cream: This lightweight yet potent eye cream combats puffiness, dark circles, and fine lines around the delicate eye area, leaving you with a refreshed and rejuvenated look.\r\n * SEOUL 1988 Sleeping Mask: Deliver a surge of hydration and nourishment while you sleep, replenishing moisture and promoting a plump, radiant complexion upon waking.\r\nBenefits:\r\n * Hydration: Deeply moisturizes and replenishes skin for a supple and plump appearance.\r\n * Wrinkle Reduction: Minimizes the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles for a youthful complexion.\r\n * Brightening: Fades pigmentation and uneven skin tone for a more radiant complexion.\r\n * Protection: Protects against environmental stressors and harmful UV rays.\r\n * Renewal: Promotes cell turnover for a smoother, more refined skin texture.\r\nWhy Choose K-Secret Seoul 1988 Bundle:\r\n * Natural Ingredients: Formulated with a blend of natural extracts, botanicals, and peptides that work in harmony with your skin.\r\n * Clinically Proven: Backed by scientific research to ensure efficacy and safety.\r\n * Cruelty-Free: Committed to ethical practices and does not test on animals.\r\nElevate your skincare routine with the K-Secret Seoul 1988 Bundle and unlock the secret to a flawless, radiant complexion.','Vjb','produits/IMG_20241129_144357_(540_x_720_pixel)_67576.jpg',NULL,10,NULL,'indisponible',NULL,'[\"produits/IMG_20241129_144357_(540_x_720_pixel)_67576.jpg\"]',0,NULL,'2025-03-01 21:03:43','2025-03-01 21:03:43',0,NULL);
